window.SECTOR_NARR={"801010":{"legs":{"2012-01-06":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR by 50bps effective December 5, 2011 (first easing since 2008) and again in February and May 2012, releasing over RMB 750bn of liquidity into a growth-slowing economy. SHCOMP surged +11.4% from its late-2011 trough as cyclicals led defensives by 4.4pp, with Metals +34.5% and Chemicals +25.8% at the vanguard. Agriculture ranked #5/16 (+25.0%), performing as pure index beta in a broadly rising market with no sector-specific catalyst beyond the general PBOC easing backdrop.","body_zh":"人民银行于2011年12月5日起下调存款准备金率50bp（2008年来首次），并于2012年2月、5月相继下调，累计释放逾7500亿元流动性。上证指数从2011年底低位反弹+11.4%，周期股跑赢防御股4.4个百分点，有色金属+34.5%、化工+25.8%领跑。农林牧渔排名第5/16（+25.0%），纯属指数Beta跟涨，无板块特定催化剂。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts","broad beta rally","cyclicals led","liquidity easing","index beta"],"drivers_zh":["降准宽松","宽基Beta行情","周期股领涨","流动性释放","指数Beta"],"title":"PBOC RRR cuts spark cyclical beta rally","title_zh":"人行降准带动周期股宽基反弹"},"2012-03-19":{"body":"Q1 2012 GDP growth slowed to 8.1% (lowest since 2009) and China's export engine stalled amid eurozone crisis contagion. SHCOMP fell -18.7% through December 2012 in a sustained risk-off rotation: defensives (-16.7%) led cyclicals (-22.0%) as Real Estate and Pharma outperformed. Agriculture fell -30.1% and ranked #13/16, roughly in line with the broad market, with no sector-specific catalyst; the sector tracked the index as pure beta in an indiscriminate growth-scare selloff.","body_zh":"2012年一季度GDP增速放缓至8.1%（2009年以来最低），欧债危机蔓延致出口承压。上证指数至2012年12月下跌-18.7%，防御股（-16.7%）跑赢周期股（-22.0%），地产、医药相对抗跌。农林牧渔下跌-30.1%，排名第13/16，主要为指数Beta拖累，无板块特定利空。","drivers":["China growth slowdown","eurozone contagion","risk-off rotation","defensives led","index beta selloff"],"drivers_zh":["中国增长放缓","欧债危机蔓延","避险轮动","防御股相对抗跌","指数Beta下跌"],"title":"China growth scare; risk-off selloff","title_zh":"中国增长放缓，避险下跌"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"The Politburo signalled fiscal stimulus in late November 2012 and No.1 Document 2013 rural land reform headlines (issued January 31, 2013) added sector colour, triggering SHCOMP +19.8% into March 2013 in a growth-style tape (growth led value by 21pp). Electronics +42.5% and Pharma +41.3% topped the leaderboard. Agriculture ranked #6/16 (+32.5%), participating as strong index beta in the broad rally, with the 2013 No.1 Document rural land confirmation providing marginal sector-specific support.","body_zh":"2012年11月末政治局释放财政刺激信号，2013年一号文件（1月31日发布，强调农地确权）为板块提供边际主题支撑，上证指数至2013年3月反弹+19.8%，呈成长风格行情（成长跑赢价值21个百分点）。电子+42.5%、医药+41.3%居前。农林牧渔排名第6/16（+32.5%），以指数Beta为主，一号文件农地改革政策为辅。","drivers":["fiscal stimulus signal","No.1 Document 2013 rural reform","growth style led","index beta rally","PBOC easing expectations"],"drivers_zh":["财政刺激信号","2013年一号文件农地改革","成长风格领涨","指数Beta","人行宽松预期"],"title":"Policy stimulus wave; growth-style tape","title_zh":"政策刺激浪潮，成长风格行情"},"2013-03-06":{"body":"China confirmed its first human H7N9 avian influenza cases in March 2013, with 130 lab-confirmed cases and 40+ deaths by June; live poultry markets across eastern provinces were shuttered and poultry stocks plunged. Simultaneously, SHCOMP fell -16.3% on a credit crunch (June 2013 SHIBOR spike to 13%) that crushed cyclicals (-19.4%) while leaving defensives relatively intact (-7.4% average). Agriculture ranked #13/16 (-19.0%), suffering dual damage from both the disease-driven demand collapse and the market-wide liquidity squeeze.","body_zh":"2013年3月中国确认首批H7N9禽流感人感染病例，6月初累计确诊逾130例、死亡逾40例，多地活禽市场关闭，家禽类股暴跌。与此同时，6月银行间流动性危机（SHIBOR一度飙升至13%）导致上证指数下跌-16.3%，周期股（-19.4%）大幅跑输防御股（-7.4%）。农林牧渔排名第13/16（-19.0%），遭受禽流感需求冲击与市场流动性双重打击。","drivers":["H7N9 avian flu outbreak","SHIBOR credit crunch","poultry demand collapse","risk-off rotation","cyclicals lagged"],"drivers_zh":["H7N9禽流感","银行间流动性危机","家禽需求骤降","避险轮动","周期股承压"],"title":"H7N9 avian flu + credit crunch double blow","title_zh":"H7N9禽流感叠加银行间信贷危机双重打击"},"2013-07-09":{"body":"H7N9 fears subsided by mid-2013 as no sustained human-to-human transmission was confirmed, allowing poultry demand and livestock prices to recover sharply. PBOC eased interbank conditions after the June credit crunch, SHCOMP rose +13.9%, and cyclicals led in a broad risk-on tape. Agriculture ranked #1/16 (+37.8%) — the outright Shenwan leader — as pork and poultry prices rebounded from H7N9-depressed lows, additionally supported by hog-cycle supply tightening from reduced 2013 restocking after the disease scare.","body_zh":"2013年中H7N9恐慌消退（无持续人传人证据），家禽需求及畜产品价格大幅回升。人民银行缓和银行间市场紧张局面，上证指数上涨+13.9%，周期股领涨，市场情绪全面回暖。农林牧渔排名第1/16（+37.8%），成为申万行业绝对龙头，受益于猪肉及禽类价格从H7N9冲击低位强势反弹，叠加2013年下半年生猪供给偏紧的周期基本面支撑。","drivers":["H7N9 fear subsidence","poultry price rebound","hog cycle supply tightening","PBOC interbank easing","sector-specific leadership"],"drivers_zh":["H7N9恐慌消退","禽类价格回升","生猪周期供给偏紧","人行银行间宽松","板块特定领涨"],"title":"H7N9 fear subsides; livestock rebound leads","title_zh":"H7N9恐慌消退，畜牧反弹领涨"},"2013-12-09":{"body":"SHCOMP fell -10.5% from December 2013 through April 2014 as the market rotated violently from growth to value: Banks and Services held near flat while recent rally leaders — Computers (-16.7%), Media (-17.2%), Agriculture (-19.4%) — collapsed. Agriculture ranked dead-last at #28/28, giving back its H7N9-rebound gains. CBRC Circular 8 (December 2013) and State Council Document 107 (January 2014) cracked down on trust products, withdrawing liquidity from small-cap growth names that had led the prior rally.","body_zh":"2013年12月至2014年4月，上证指数下跌-10.5%，市场由成长急剧轮向价值：银行、综合类近乎持平，而电脑（-16.7%）、传媒（-17.2%）与农林牧渔（-19.4%）等此前领涨板块领跌，农林牧渔排名末位（#28/28），回吐H7N9反弹超额收益。银监会2013年12月8号文与2014年1月国务院107号文整治信托产品，引发中小盘成长股流动性收缩。","drivers":["CBRC shadow banking curbs","Document 107 trust crackdown","growth-to-value rotation","sector mean reversion","small-cap liquidity withdrawal"],"drivers_zh":["银监会影子银行整治","107号文信托产品限制","成长转价值轮动","板块均值回归","小盘股流动性收缩"],"title":"Shadow banking curbs; sector gives back gains","title_zh":"影子银行整治，板块回吐涨幅"},"2014-04-28":{"body":"China's margin-financing bull market launched in earnest from mid-2014: outstanding margin loans exploded from RMB 400bn (June 2014) to over RMB 2.2tn by June 2015 as the PBOC cut benchmark rates five times and RRR multiple times. SHCOMP surged +157.9%. Agriculture rose +208%, ranking #15/28 — solidly mid-pack — as the broad liquidity flood lifted all sectors; Computers +327.5% and Construction +282.2% led. No.1 Document 2015 food safety headlines provided marginal sector colour but Agriculture was not the leadership theme.","body_zh":"2014年中起，融资融券牛市全面展开：融资余额从2014年6月约4000亿元飙升至2015年6月逾2.2万亿元，期间人民银行五次降息并多次降准。上证指数上涨+157.9%。农林牧渔上涨+208%，排名第15/28居中游——广泛流动性泛滥带动全行业上涨，计算机+327.5%、建筑+282.2%更为亮眼。2015年一号文件食品安全政策提供边际主题支撑，但非板块领涨核心。","drivers":["margin financing bubble","PBOC rate and RRR cuts","broad liquidity flood","index beta rally","No.1 Document food security"],"drivers_zh":["融资融券泡沫","降息降准","流动性泛滥宽基Beta","指数Beta","一号文件食品安全"],"title":"Leveraged bull market; agriculture mid-pack","title_zh":"融资融券牛市，农业中游参与"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"The CSRC crackdown on umbrella-trust shadow-margin accounts in June 2015 triggered forced deleveraging: SHCOMP lost -32.1% in under four weeks. Defensives (Banks -10.6%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-43.0%) in the risk-off collapse. Agriculture fell -43.5% and ranked #18/28 — in line with cyclicals — as high-beta small/mid-cap names that benefited most from margin-bubble inflows suffered the most severe forced-sale liquidations.","body_zh":"2015年6月证监会整治伞形信托保证金账户，引发A股强制去杠杆：上证指数不到四周内暴跌-32.1%。防御股（银行-10.6%）大幅跑赢周期股（-43.0%）。农林牧渔下跌-43.5%，排名第18/28，与周期股同步——此前融资牛市中高弹性的中小市值标的在去杠杆中遭受最大冲击，纯属强制平仓性质，无板块特定利空。","drivers":["CSRC margin crackdown","umbrella trust deleveraging","forced margin-call selling","flight to safety banks","broad crash"],"drivers_zh":["证监会整治伞形信托","强制去杠杆","融资平仓抛售","避险银行股","市场整体暴跌"],"title":"Leveraged unwind crash; forced selling","title_zh":"杠杆解除崩跌，强制平仓"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Beginning July 6-8, 2015, China's National Team (CSF + Central Huijin) deployed over USD 200bn to buy A-shares across 1,000+ stocks, triggering SHCOMP recovery of +13.9% through August 17. Cyclicals rebounded hardest (+37.1% vs defensives +16.8%). Agriculture ranked #3/28 (+46.5%) — a strong outperformer — as beaten-down livestock and agri-input stocks snapped back from panic lows, aided by Beijing's July rural reform pledges and NDRC corn-price floor signals.","body_zh":"2015年7月6-8日，国家队（中国证券金融公司、中央汇金）动用逾2000亿美元买入逾千只A股，上证指数反弹+13.9%至8月17日。周期股弹幅最大（+37.1%，防御股仅+16.8%），农林牧渔排名第3/28（+46.5%），大幅跑赢市场——畜牧及农资股从恐慌低位强势反弹，叠加北京7月农村改革承诺及发改委玉米价格托底信号。","drivers":["National Team intervention","CSF Huijin large-scale buying","cyclical oversold snap-back","agri policy support signals","broad relief rally"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市","证金汇金大规模买入","周期股超跌反弹","农业政策支撑信号","宽基救市反弹"],"title":"National team rescue; cyclicals snap back","title_zh":"国家队救市，周期股超跌反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC surprised markets with a ~2% CNY devaluation fix, reigniting capital outflow fears and triggering a second market collapse. SHCOMP lost -24.8% in under a month (August 24 Black Monday saw SHCOMP -8.5% intraday). Agriculture ranked #26/28 (-35.4%), severely underperforming both defensives (-20.6%) and cyclicals (-32.9%), as its sharp prior recovery made it a high-beta selloff target while Banks (-3.5%) were the sole relative safe-haven.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行意外将人民币中间价下调逾2%，引发资本外流恐慌与第二轮市场崩跌。上证指数不到一个月暴跌-24.8%（8月24日黑色星期一单日跌幅-8.5%）。农林牧渔排名第26/28（-35.4%），大幅跑输防御股（-20.6%）与周期股（-32.9%）——前期强势反弹使其成为高弹性抛售靶标；银行（-3.5%）成为市场仅有的相对避风港。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock Aug 11 2015","PBOC surprise devaluation fix","capital outflow fears","high-beta selldown","flight to banks"],"drivers_zh":["人民币8.11贬值冲击","人行意外汇改","资本外流恐慌","高弹性板块抛售","避险银行股"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock; second crash wave","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击，第二轮崩跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"The PBOC cut benchmark rates to 4.35% on October 23, 2015 (fifth cut in a year) and simultaneously cut RRR by 50bps, stabilising sentiment as National Team support continued. SHCOMP recovered +21.5% through December 22 in a growth-style tape (growth beat value by 16.9pp): Computers +63.8% and Electronics +53.1% led. Agriculture ranked #12/28 (+44.2%), a solid mid-table gain, with Q4 2015 environmental-policy-driven hog farm closures tightening pig supply providing marginal sector support.","body_zh":"人民银行于2015年10月23日下调基准利率至4.35%（年内第五次）并同步降准50bp，国家队持续托市，市场情绪趋稳。上证指数至12月22日回升+21.5%，成长风格大幅跑赢价值16.9个百分点，计算机+63.8%、电子+53.1%领涨。农林牧渔排名第12/28（+44.2%），中游表现——2015年四季度环保政策驱动猪场去产能，生猪供给收紧支撑猪价提供边际板块支撑。","drivers":["PBOC rate and RRR cuts Oct 2015","National Team continued support","growth style tape","hog supply tightening environmental policy","broad stabilization rally"],"drivers_zh":["人行10月降息降准","国家队持续托市","成长风格行情","环保收紧生猪供给","市场企稳反弹"],"title":"Rate cuts stabilize; tech/growth tape rebounds","title_zh":"降息企稳，科技/成长风格反弹"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"China introduced an index circuit-breaker on January 4, 2016 — it triggered immediately and again on January 7, causing SHCOMP to crash -27.3% in under five weeks before bottoming January 28. Defensives led in relative terms (Banks -17.1%, Food & Bev -25.4%) while growth stocks and cyclicals collapsed further (Computers -35.9%). Agriculture ranked #6/28 (-29.2%), broadly in line with defensives, as consumer staples attributes provided a modest relative buffer versus pure cyclicals in the panic selloff.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日，A股熔断机制首日即触发，1月7日再次触发，上证指数不到五周跌幅达-27.3%，1月28日见底。防御股相对抗跌（银行-17.1%、食品饮料-25.4%），计算机等成长股（-35.9%）领跌。农林牧渔排名第6/28（-29.2%），与防御股表现接近，优于周期股——食品消费属性在避险环境下提供了一定相对缓冲。","drivers":["circuit-breaker panic Jan 2016","January 2016 market crash","flight to safety","defensives outperformed relatively","forced selling small-caps"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月熔断恐慌","1月市场暴跌","避险轮动","防御股相对抗跌","小盘股强制抛售"],"title":"Circuit-breaker panic; risk-off crash","title_zh":"熔断恐慌，避险崩跌"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"Post-circuit-breaker stabilisation was anchored by the PBOC's February 2016 RRR cut (50bps) and G20 Shanghai Accord signalling coordinated easing (February 26). Supply-side structural reform lifted Construction +50.9% and Metals +49.9% to the top. Agriculture ranked #15/28 (+28.0%), broadly tracking the index (+23.4%), additionally buoyed by an autonomous tailwind: China's live-hog prices hit a near-decade high around 22 RMB/kg in May 2016, reflecting sustained supply reduction from environmental-policy farm closures since 2014.","body_zh":"人民银行于2016年2月降准50bp，G20上海峰会（2月26日）协调宽松承诺稳定市场预期，供给侧结构性改革去产能推动建筑+50.9%、金属+49.9%领涨。农林牧渔排名第15/28（+28.0%），基本跟随指数（+23.4%），并额外获自身基本面顺风支撑：2014年以来环保政策驱动猪场关停，供给持续收紧，2016年5月生猪均价创近十年高位约22元/公斤。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Feb 2016","G20 Shanghai Accord coordinated easing","supply-side reform construction metals","hog price 10-year high","value style led"],"drivers_zh":["2016年2月降准","G20上海协议宽松","供改建筑金属领涨","生猪价格十年高位","价值风格主导"],"title":"RRR cut plus supply reform; hog cycle boosts","title_zh":"降准加供改，生猪周期助力"},"2016-11-28":{"body":"China entered a prolonged deleveraging cycle from late 2016: PBOC tightened interbank conditions, the 10-year CGB yield climbed from 2.7% to 4.0% by October 2017, and regulatory assault on WMPs and entrusted loans crushed mid-cap growth stocks. SHCOMP fell -24.1% over nearly two years; Food & Bev (+24.4%) was the solitary winner on quality refuge demand while cyclicals (-32.3%) and growth names collapsed. Agriculture fell -40.7% (ranked #26/28), suffering both the bear-market beta drag and the sector-specific headwind of the hog price downcycle: live-hog prices peaked in May 2016 and entered a multi-year oversupply decline as industrial-scale farms expanded into the 2016 high-price window.","body_zh":"2016年末中国进入持续去杠杆周期：人民银行收紧银行间流动性，10年期国债收益率从2.7%升至2017年10月的4.0%，监管层大力整治理财产品与委托贷款，中盘成长股遭重创。上证指数近两年累计下跌-24.1%，食品饮料（+24.4%）成为孤独赢家，周期股（-32.3%）及成长股惨烈下跌。农林牧渔下跌-40.7%（排名第26/28），同时承受熊市系统Beta拖累与板块特定逆风——生猪价格于2016年5月见顶后进入多年过剩下行，规模化农场在高猪价窗口大规模扩产，加剧了后续供给过剩。","drivers":["PBOC interbank tightening","bond yield spike to 4pct","WMP and entrusted loan regulation","hog price downcycle oversupply","quality rotation to Food and Bev"],"drivers_zh":["人行银行间收紧","债券收益率升至4%","理财委贷监管整治","生猪周期下行过剩","质量轮动至食品饮料"],"title":"Deleveraging bear; defensives only refuge","title_zh":"去杠杆熊市，防御股为唯一避风港"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"African Swine Fever (ASF) entered China in August 2018 and by mid-2019 had wiped out over 40% of China's hog inventory — nearly one-fifth of global pig stock. Pork prices more than doubled by November 2019, lifting CPI to 3.8% YoY (highest since 2012). PBOC cut RRR five times over this period and SHCOMP rallied +28.8% as trade war tensions eased after the G20 Osaka summit (June 2019). Agriculture ranked #1/28 (+82.5%), leading all Shenwan sectors by a massive margin on the most powerful sector-specific catalyst of the decade.","body_zh":"2018年8月非洲猪瘟（ASF）传入中国，至2019年中期已消灭逾40%的中国生猪存栏（约占全球猪存总量的五分之一）。猪肉价格至2019年11月翻逾一倍，CPI同比升至3.8%（2012年来最高）。人民银行五次降准，G20大阪峰会（2019年6月）后贸易战紧张缓和，上证指数上涨+28.8%。农林牧渔排名第1/28（+82.5%），以压倒性优势领跑申万各行业，堪称本十年最强板块特定催化剂驱动行情。","drivers":["African Swine Fever supply shock","hog inventory minus 40pct","pork price doubling CPI spike","PBOC RRR cuts","US-China trade de-escalation"],"drivers_zh":["非洲猪瘟供给冲击","生猪存栏暴减40%","猪价翻倍推高CPI","多次降准宽松","中美贸易摩擦缓和"],"title":"ASF pork shock; Agriculture leads all sectors","title_zh":"非洲猪瘟冲击，农林牧渔领跑全板块"},"2019-04-24":{"body":"Trump raised tariffs from 10% to 25% on USD 200bn of Chinese goods in May 2019, causing SHCOMP to fall -8.5% in a flight-to-safety rotation (defensives outperformed: Food & Bev +10.6% vs cyclicals -14.2%). Agriculture fell -18.3% and ranked #25/28, underperforming the broad selloff, as the initial ASF-driven surge had been widely priced in and early evidence of feed-cost inflation from soybean/corn tariff disruption was compressing prospective farming margins.","body_zh":"2019年5月，美国将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%升至25%，上证指数下跌-8.5%，避险轮动明显（食品饮料+10.6%跑赢周期股-14.2%）。农林牧渔下跌-18.3%，排名第25/28，弱于大盘——此前ASF行情已被市场广泛消化，叠加进口大豆/玉米受阻引发饲料成本通胀预期压缩养殖利润，投资者转向纯防御标的。","drivers":["US tariff escalation May 2019","trade war risk-off","ASF rally fully priced","feed-cost inflation soybean corn","defensives outperformed"],"drivers_zh":["美国5月关税升级","贸易战避险情绪","ASF涨幅充分消化","豆粕玉米进口受阻饲料通胀","防御股相对跑赢"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation; ASF story priced in","title_zh":"贸易战再升级，ASF逻辑消化"},"2019-09-26":{"body":"China's October 2019 CPI hit 3.8% YoY — the highest in nearly eight years — driven entirely by pork prices that more than doubled year-on-year as ASF-driven herd depletion peaked. SHCOMP was essentially flat (+0.3%) with cyclicals and defensives both near zero, yet Agriculture surged +20.9% and ranked #1/28 by a massive margin — second-place Light Mfg gained only 4.2%. This was a pure sector-specific commodity price event: live-hog spot prices at record highs, farming companies (Muyuan, Wen's) posted multi-year earnings beats, and futures curves pointed to elevated prices through 2020.","body_zh":"中国2019年10月CPI同比上涨3.8%（近八年最高），完全由猪肉价格同比翻逾一倍驱动（ASF致存栏去化达峰）。上证指数几乎持平（+0.3%），周期与防御板块均无明显方向，而农林牧渔独自暴涨+20.9%，排名第1/28——第二名轻工制造仅+4.2%。这是纯粹的板块特定事件：现货生猪价格创历史高位，牧原、温氏等养殖龙头盈利大幅超预期，期货曲线显示高价格将延续至2020年。","drivers":["ASF-driven pork CPI 3.8pct","live-hog spot prices at record high","sector-specific earnings surge","flat SHCOMP backdrop","pure livestock supply shock"],"drivers_zh":["ASF推动猪肉CPI同比3.8%","生猪现货价格历史高位","板块特定盈利暴增预期","指数持平背景下独立上涨","纯生猪供给冲击"],"title":"ASF pork CPI peak; Agriculture soars alone","title_zh":"ASF猪价CPI高峰，农业独自起舞"},"2019-10-30":{"body":"Wuhan's December 2019 - January 2020 COVID-19 outbreak (initially an unexplained pneumonia cluster) triggered animal-to-human transmission fears that disproportionately hit poultry and livestock stocks. A-shares re-opened post-Chinese New Year on February 3, 2020 with a gap-down; SHCOMP fell -6.6% as tech/growth (Electronics +15.7%) outperformed on remote-work themes while Agriculture ranked dead-last at #28/28 (-22.1%), far exceeding the index loss — live poultry market closures and Spring Festival logistics disruptions compounded the ASF-era supply chain fragilities.","body_zh":"2019年12月至2020年1月，武汉新冠疫情（初期报告为原因不明肺炎）引发动物传人恐慌，家禽及畜牧类股受到过度冲击。A股春节后2月3日开盘大幅低开，上证指数下跌-6.6%；电子（+15.7%）等成长板块借助远程办公/科技主题相对跑赢，农林牧渔排名末位（#28/28，-22.1%），跌幅远超市场——活禽市场关停与物流中断加剧了ASF时代的供应链脆弱性。","drivers":["COVID-19 Wuhan outbreak","animal-transmission fears","live poultry market closures","logistics disruption Spring Festival","tech and growth sectors outperformed"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫情武汉暴发","动物传播恐慌","活禽市场关停","春节物流中断","成长科技板块跑赢"],"title":"COVID outbreak fear crushes livestock stocks","title_zh":"新冠疫情恐慌重创畜牧类股"},"2020-02-03":{"body":"China's post-COVID recovery drove SHCOMP +23.3% through August 2020 in a growth-tilt tape (growth led by 13.8pp). Two sector-specific tailwinds pushed Agriculture to #3/28 (+66.3%): (1) the 2020 Yangtze River floods (June-July), affecting 40% of grain-producing provinces, triggered urgent Beijing food-security and seed self-sufficiency policy responses; (2) ASF-cycle peak profits at hog farms — Muyuan, Wen's and New Hope posted record H1 2020 earnings, sustaining analyst upgrades through mid-year.","body_zh":"疫情后，人民银行降息降准、财政大力刺激，上证指数至2020年8月上涨+23.3%，成长风格领涨（超额+13.8pp）。两大板块特定顺风推动农林牧渔跻身前三（#3/28，+66.3%）：（1）2020年长江流域洪灾（6-7月）波及40%粮食主产省份，推动北京强化种子/粮食自给政策响应；（2）ASF周期高峰期牧原、温氏、新希望等养殖龙头盈利创纪录，上半年盈利预测持续上调。","drivers":["COVID recovery stimulus","2020 Yangtze floods food security policy","ASF-cycle peak farming profits","grain seed self-sufficiency push","consumer recovery narrative"],"drivers_zh":["疫后财政货币刺激","2020年洪灾粮食安全政策","ASF周期盈利高峰","种业粮食自给政策","消费复苏叙事"],"title":"COVID recovery plus food security; top-3 leader","title_zh":"疫后复苏叠加粮食安全，跻身前三"},"2020-08-24":{"body":"As ASF herd rebuilding accelerated, pig prices peaked and the market rotated sharply toward cyclical recovery plays (Appliances +18.8%, Autos +18.5%, Power Eqp +13.2%) while SHCOMP fell modestly (-1.4%). Agriculture ranked dead-last at #28/28 (-22.9%) — the absolute worst Shenwan performer — as the hog-price supercycle narrative reversed: live-hog prices declined from peak levels, earnings-revision momentum turned sharply negative, and global reflation flows rotated entirely into old-economy cyclicals.","body_zh":"随着生猪复产加速，猪价于2020年三季度见顶，市场大幅轮向周期复苏逻辑（家电+18.8%、汽车+18.5%、电力设备+13.2%），上证指数小幅回落（-1.4%）。农林牧渔排名末位（#28/28，-22.9%），成为申万行业中绝对最弱板块——生猪超级周期叙事逆转，现货猪价从高位回落，养殖龙头盈利预测由正转负，全球再通胀交易将资金彻底转向旧经济周期股。","drivers":["hog price peak and reversal","ASF herd rebuilding supply flood","cyclical rotation global reflation","farming earnings revisions negative","sector-specific bear turn"],"drivers_zh":["猪价见顶逆转","生猪复产供给洪峰","全球再通胀周期轮动","养殖盈利预测下调","板块特定熊市转折"],"title":"Hog price peaks; rotation to cyclicals crushes","title_zh":"猪价见顶，轮向周期股重创农业"},"2020-11-12":{"body":"Pfizer's November 9, 2020 vaccine announcement and Biden election triggered a global reflation trade. SHCOMP climbed +9.1% through February 2021 in a value-tilt tape (value led growth by 9pp): Services +44.8% and Metals +44.0% topped, driven by commodity and infrastructure restocking. Agriculture ranked #4/28 (+23.8%) — a notable outperformer — partly as technical recovery from its August trough and partly as the hog-cycle stabilised with corn/grain import demand from rebuilding farms remaining elevated.","body_zh":"辉瑞公司2020年11月9日公布疫苗有效性数据，拜登当选，全球再通胀交易启动。上证指数至2021年2月上涨+9.1%，价值风格领涨（价值跑赢成长9pp），消费服务+44.8%、金属+44.0%领跑，商品/基建补库驱动明显。农林牧渔排名第4/28（+23.8%），超额表现——部分为8月低位技术性修复，部分源于生猪周期企稳：复产养殖场玉米/粮食进口需求维持高位。","drivers":["vaccine global reflation trade","global commodity cycle","post-COVID food normalization","grain import demand elevated","value style rotation"],"drivers_zh":["疫苗全球再通胀交易","全球商品周期","疫后食品体系正常化","粮食进口需求高位","价值风格轮动"],"title":"Vaccine reflation; agri outperforms on beta","title_zh":"疫苗再通胀交易，农业跑赢Beta"},"2021-02-22":{"body":"China's hog herd rebuilt faster than expected: by June 2021 live-hog prices had collapsed nearly 65% YTD as industrial-scale farms flooded the market after aggressive 2020 capacity expansion. SHCOMP fell only modestly (-7.7%), but Agriculture was the outright worst Shenwan performer at #28/28 (-33.4%) — a massive underperformance — as hog-farm earnings cratered with prices falling below full-cost lines (~14-15 RMB/kg). Power Equipment (+18.9%) and Steel (+16.3%) led on new-energy and infrastructure themes, creating maximum divergence from Agriculture.","body_zh":"中国生猪复产速度超出预期：2020年规模化产能大幅扩张，2021年上半年现货猪价年内累计暴跌近65%。上证指数仅小幅下跌（-7.7%），但农林牧渔以-33.4%排名申万末位（#28/28），超额损失巨大——猪价跌破完全成本线（约14-15元/公斤），大型养殖龙头盈利深度崩塌。电力设备（+18.9%）与钢铁（+16.3%）借助新能源/基建主题领涨，与农业形成历史性背离。","drivers":["hog oversupply glut 2021","live-hog price minus 65pct YTD","industrial farm over-expansion 2020","farming earnings below cost line","new-energy green themes dominated"],"drivers_zh":["2021年生猪过剩","猪价年内暴跌65%","2020年规模化产能过度扩张","养殖亏损跌破成本线","新能源绿色主题主导"],"title":"Hog glut collapse; worst Shenwan performer","title_zh":"生猪过剩崩跌，申万最弱板块"},"2021-07-28":{"body":"After H1 2021 price collapse, pig herd liquidation began cutting supply: hog prices stabilised and tentatively recovered in H2 2021. Beijing's grain/food security push intensified (July 2021 Henan floods added urgency; 2022 No.1 Document focused on seed revitalization). SHCOMP rose +6.9% through January 2022 in a low-beta tape. Agriculture ranked #1/31 (+28.5%) — the outright Shenwan leader by a clear margin over Utilities (+24.8%) in second — benefiting from hog price recovery, food security policy catalysts, and seed revitalization investment themes.","body_zh":"2021年上半年猪价崩跌后，生猪去产能逐步启动，下半年猪价企稳回升。北京强化粮食安全部署（2021年7月河南洪灾催生紧迫性；2022年一号文件聚焦种业振兴）。上证指数至2022年1月上涨+6.9%，市场低波动运行。农林牧渔排名第1/31（+28.5%），大幅领跑申万所有行业（第二位公用事业仅+24.8%）——受益于猪价回升、粮食安全政策催化及种业振兴投资主题。","drivers":["hog price recovery H2 2021","2022 No.1 Document seed revitalization","Henan floods food security urgency","grain food security policy push","sector-specific leadership"],"drivers_zh":["2021年下半年猪价回升","2022年一号文件种业振兴","河南洪灾粮食安全紧迫性","粮食安全政策强化","板块特定领涨"],"title":"Hog stabilizes plus grain security; leads all","title_zh":"猪价企稳叠加粮食安全，领涨全行业"},"2022-01-10":{"body":"The US Fed signalled rapid rate hikes from January 2022, triggering a global tech/growth selloff. SHCOMP fell -19.7% by April 26 as Russia's February 24 invasion of Ukraine added commodity shock (energy and wheat prices surged) and geopolitical uncertainty. Coal (+5.3%) and Banks (-6.9%) led as value dominated; Computers (-35.6%) and Electronics (-38.6%) bore the brunt. Agriculture ranked #11/31 (-18.5%), near the index, as Ukraine grain-supply disruption lifted global grain prices and created marginal offset to the market-wide selloff.","body_zh":"2022年1月美联储释放快速加息信号，全球科技/成长股遭抛售。俄罗斯2月24日入侵乌克兰叠加大宗商品冲击（能源/小麦价格飙升），上证指数至4月26日下跌-19.7%。煤炭（+5.3%）与银行（-6.9%）在价值风格主导下相对抗跌，电脑（-35.6%）与电子（-38.6%）跌幅最深。农林牧渔排名第11/31（-18.5%），接近指数水平——乌克兰战争推高全球粮价，提供边际正向对冲。","drivers":["Fed rate hike signal Jan 2022","Russia-Ukraine war Feb 2022","commodity shock wheat energy","value style dominance","growth tech selloff"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2022年1月加息信号","2022年2月俄乌战争","粮食能源大宗商品冲击","价值风格主导","成长科技抛售"],"title":"Fed tightening plus Russia-Ukraine; value tilt","title_zh":"美联储加息叠加俄乌战争，价值风格主导"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Shanghai's strict COVID lockdown ended in June 2022 and the State Council issued a 33-point economic support package (May 31), triggering SHCOMP recovery of +14.8% through July 11. Growth themes (Power Eqp +52.7%, Autos +43.3%) dominated the EV/new-energy policy-accelerated snapback. Agriculture ranked #9/31 (+21.1%) — solid mid-pack — as the broad relief rally lifted all sectors; Russia-Ukraine conflict continued to support elevated grain prices providing marginal sector tailwind.","body_zh":"上海严格封控于2022年6月结束，国务院5月31日发布33条稳经济一揽子政策，上证指数至7月11日反弹+14.8%。电力设备（+52.7%）、汽车（+43.3%）借助新能源政策加速领跑反弹。农林牧渔排名第9/31（+21.1%），中游表现——解封反弹带动全行业普涨；俄乌冲突持续使粮价高位运行，为板块提供边际支撑。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown end June 2022","33-point State Council package","EV new-energy policy acceleration","broad relief rally","grain prices elevated Ukraine"],"drivers_zh":["2022年6月上海解封","国务院33条稳经济","新能源政策加速","宽基解封反弹","乌克兰致粮价高企"],"title":"Post-lockdown relief rally; agri mid-pack","title_zh":"解封后宽基反弹，农业中游参与"},"2022-07-11":{"body":"China entered a prolonged multi-sector bear from July 2022 through February 2024 as the property crisis deepened (Country Garden default September 2023, Evergrande Hong Kong liquidation order January 2024), deflation took hold (CPI turned negative in July 2023), and global rate tightening kept risk-off sentiment elevated. SHCOMP fell -18.5%; defensives (Coal +0.6%, Telecoms -1.6%, Banks -7.1%) were the only relative refuge. Agriculture ranked #25/31 (-38.2%), severely underperforming, suffering both systematic bear-market beta and a sector-specific second hog overcapacity cycle that kept farm earnings deeply negative through 2023.","body_zh":"2022年7月至2024年2月，地产危机加剧（碧桂园2023年9月违约、恒大2024年1月香港清盘令），通缩态势形成（2023年7月CPI转负），全球加息保持避险情绪压制，上证指数下跌-18.5%，防御股（煤炭+0.6%、通信-1.6%、银行-7.1%）相对抗跌。农林牧渔排名第25/31（-38.2%），严重跑输——同时承受系统性熊市Beta与板块特定逆风：生猪市场进入第二次深度过剩周期，养殖龙头2023年全年持续亏损。","drivers":["hog market second overcapacity cycle","property crisis Evergrande Country Garden","deflation CPI negative 2023","pig farm sector deep losses","defensives-only sanctuary"],"drivers_zh":["生猪市场二次过剩周期","地产危机恒大碧桂园","2023年通缩CPI转负","养殖龙头深度亏损","仅防御板块相对抗跌"],"title":"Property crisis plus hog glut prolonged bear","title_zh":"地产危机叠加生猪过剩，持续熊市"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"On February 5-6, 2024, Central Huijin pledged to expand ETF holdings and the PBOC cut RRR by 50bps (effective February 5), providing a market floor after the CSI 300 hit multi-year lows. SHCOMP surged +17.4% through May 2024 in a broad risk-on rally (cyclicals led +23.8%). Agriculture ranked #12/31 (+22.7%), tracking the index recovery as a mid-table participant — Metals +44.9%, Chemicals +32.7%, Defence +32.4% led while Agriculture participated without sector-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2024年2月5-6日，中央汇金宣布扩大ETF持仓，人民银行同步降准50bp（2月5日生效），为触及多年低位的沪深300提供政策底。上证指数至5月上涨+17.4%，宽基风险偏好回升（周期股+23.8%领跑）。农林牧渔排名第12/31（+22.7%），基本跟随指数修复，金属+44.9%、化工+32.7%、国防+32.4%领涨，农林牧渔为中游跟随，无板块特定催化剂。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF expansion Feb 2024","PBOC 50bp RRR cut Feb 5 2024","national team market floor","broad cyclical rebound","index beta mid-table"],"drivers_zh":["汇金2024年2月扩大ETF增持","人行2024年2月5日降准50bp","国家队政策底","宽基周期股反弹","指数Beta中游跟随"],"title":"National Team floor plus RRR cut; broad rebound","title_zh":"国家队托底叠加降准，宽基反弹"},"2024-05-20":{"body":"SHCOMP pulled back -14.3% from May through September 2024 as consumer deflation persisted (PPI remained negative, pork retail prices sank to fresh multi-year lows), US chip sanctions intensified geopolitical drag, and the property sector recovery stalled. Brokers (-7.3%) and Banks (-9.3%) held up relatively while consumer and agricultural sectors lagged. Agriculture ranked #27/31 (-27.9%), one of the weakest Shenwan performers, as the hog price downcycle entered its third year with mid-2024 live-hog prices at 7-year lows and listed farms reporting deep H1 2024 losses.","body_zh":"2024年5月至9月，消费通缩延续（PPI持续为负、猪肉零售价创多年新低），美国芯片制裁地缘政治拖累加剧，地产复苏停滞，上证指数回落-14.3%。券商（-7.3%）与银行（-9.3%）相对抗跌，消费/农业板块落后。农林牧渔排名第27/31（-27.9%），申万行业中表现最弱之一——生猪价格下行周期延续第三年，2024年中猪价跌至7年低位，上市养殖企业2024年上半年深度亏损。","drivers":["persistent pork deflation","hog prices 7-year low mid-2024","consumer deflation CPI PPI negative","listed farming deep losses","US chip sanctions geopolitics"],"drivers_zh":["猪肉持续通缩","生猪价格2024年中7年低位","消费通缩CPI/PPI为负","上市养殖深度亏损","美国芯片制裁地缘政治"],"title":"Deflation plus hog glut drags sector lower","title_zh":"通缩叠加生猪过剩，板块继续拖累"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a comprehensive stimulus package: 50bp RRR cut, 20bp policy rate cut, RMB 500bn equity swap facility for nonbank institutions, and RMB 300bn share-buyback relending. A Politburo meeting on September 26 pledged further fiscal support. SHCOMP surged +42.1% through September 2025. Agriculture ranked #19/31 (+49.7%), tracking the broad re-rating as a mid-pack participant — AI/tech growth narratives (Electronics, Telecoms) dominated the tape while hog prices only partially stabilised from 2024 lows.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人民银行行长潘功胜宣布综合性宽松一揽子（924政策）：降准50bp、政策利率下调20bp、5000亿元股票互换便利及3000亿元股票回购再贷款。9月26日政治局经济会议进一步承诺财政支持。上证指数至2025年9月上涨+42.1%。农林牧渔排名第19/31（+49.7%），跟随宽基市场重估参与中游反弹——AI/科技成长叙事（电子、通信）主导全场，猪价从2024年低位仅局部企稳。","drivers":["924 PBOC bazooka stimulus Sep 24 2024","RRR rate cuts plus swap facility","broad market re-rating","AI tech growth narrative dominates","hog price tentative stabilization"],"drivers_zh":["924人行一揽子刺激2024年9月","降准降息加互换便利","宽基市场重估","AI科技成长叙事主导","猪价初步企稳"],"title":"924 bazooka lifts market; agri mid-pack","title_zh":"924一揽子刺激提振市场，农业中游"},"2025-09-15":{"body":"From September 2025 the market shifted into a pure AI/tech growth rotation: Telecoms +109.0% and Electronics +89.1% surged on DeepSeek-era AI infrastructure investment themes while SHCOMP rose +6.7% with cyclicals leading (+7.7% vs defensives -13.7%). Agriculture ranked #30/31 (-30.8%), the second-worst Shenwan sector, as hog prices hit fresh lows in mid-2026 with listed farms (Muyuan, Wen's, New Hope) reporting per-head losses of 280-400 RMB, and no sector-specific policy catalyst emerged to compete with the dominant AI narrative.","body_zh":"2025年9月起，市场进入纯粹的AI/科技成长轮动：通信+109.0%、电子+89.1%因DeepSeek时代AI基础设施投资主题大涨，上证指数+6.7%，周期股（+7.7%）略微跑赢防御股（-13.7%）。农林牧渔排名第30/31（-30.8%），申万倒数第二——生猪价格2026年中跌至新低，牧原、温氏、新希望等养殖龙头每头亏损280-400元，无板块特定催化剂能与主导全场的AI叙事竞争。","drivers":["AI tech growth rotation DeepSeek theme","hog prices multi-year new lows 2026","listed farms deep losses persisting","cyclicals beat defensives in risk-on","sector structurally abandoned"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek AI科技成长轮动","生猪价格2026年创多年新低","上市养殖龙头持续深亏","风险偏好回升周期跑赢防御","板块资金结构性撤离"],"title":"AI growth rotation strands agriculture","title_zh":"AI成长轮动使农业彻底出局"}},"now":"Agriculture is at a confirmed trough, ranked #29/31 Shenwan sectors (-26.3% this leg) while SHCOMP posts only +1.6%. The current tape is a pure growth/tech rotation — Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, Bldg Mat +48.1% lead by an 18.2pp growth premium — and Agriculture is a structural laggard: hog prices remain near multi-year lows with industry overcapacity still roughly 3 million breeding sows above the authorities' target, and no sector-specific policy catalyst has emerged. Cyclicals (+0.3%) barely beat defensives (-12.1%), confirming a narrow liquidity-driven theme rather than broad reflation. Agriculture sits in the abandoned quadrant: neither a growth theme nor a commodity/rate beneficiary in the current regime; a turn requires either a hog price recovery or a broad policy pivot combining PBOC easing and a food-security-focused No.1 Document.","now_zh":"农林牧渔确认处于底部阶段，申万行业排名倒数第三（#29/31，本轮-26.3%），上证指数仅微涨1.6%。当前市场为纯粹的成长/科技主题轮动——电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%、建材+48.1%领涨，成长溢价达18.2个百分点——农林牧渔为结构性落后者：生猪价格仍处低位，行业能繁母猪存栏超官方警戒线约300万头，缺乏板块特定催化剂。周期股（+0.3%）仅微超防御股（-12.1%），印证当前为流动性驱动的窄基行情而非广谱再通胀。农林牧渔被市场边缘化，既非成长主题也非利率/商品受益方；转机需待生猪价格实质性回升或宏观政策全面转向。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801030":{"legs":{"2012-01-05":{"body":"The PBOC cut the reserve requirement ratio (RRR) 50bp in November 2011 — the first easing since 2008 — as China's growth decelerated and manufacturing PMI hovered near 49. The liquidity pivot triggered a broad cyclical rebound that lasted through mid-March 2012: SHCOMP surged 14.3% and Chemicals ranked #3/16, with cyclicals outpacing defensives by 7.9pp. Industrial chemical names rebounded from deeply oversold levels as improving credit conditions supported raw-material demand expectations and early margin-trading account expansion amplified moves in higher-beta sectors.","body_zh":"2011年11月，央行下调存款准备金率50bp（2008年以来首次），标志货币政策转向，此时制造业PMI徘徊在49附近。流动性宽松触发大范围周期股反弹：上证综指涨14.3%，基础化工排名第3/16，周期股跑赢防御股近8个百分点。化工股从超跌水平大幅反弹，信用条件改善支撑了工业原料需求预期，而融资融券账户的扩张亦放大了高弹性行业的涨幅。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut","post-tightening liquidity pivot","cyclical PMI trough","risk-on rotation","margin account expansion"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准","货币政策由紧转松","制造业PMI触底","风险偏好回升","融资融券扩张"],"title":"PBOC RRR Cuts Ignite Cyclical Relief Rally","title_zh":"央行降准点燃周期股解放行情"},"2012-03-13":{"body":"As the rebound in early 2012 faded, disappointing Chinese economic data — GDP growth slowing to 7.6% in Q2 2012, the weakest reading since 2001 — renewed fears of a hard landing. SHCOMP fell 20.2% from March to December 2012, and Chemicals dropped 30.7%, ranking #13/16 as defensives (Real Estate, Pharma, Utilities) led the relative safety trade with losses of only around 10-16%. The selloff was a pure macro bear-rotation: overcapacity in basic chemicals, weak downstream demand from construction and auto sectors, and the lingering European sovereign debt crisis kept industrial sentiment depressed.","body_zh":"2012年初的反弹消退后，中国经济数据持续疲软——2012年二季度GDP增速降至7.6%，创2001年以来最低——市场对经济硬着陆的担忧重燃。上证综指从3月跌至12月，累跌20.2%，基础化工跌30.7%，排名第13/16。防御性行业（地产、医药、公用事业）以较小跌幅相对领先，化工板块受制于产能过剩、建筑及汽车等下游需求疲软以及欧债危机拖累，整体表现落后。","drivers":["China GDP deceleration","hard landing fears","industrial overcapacity","European sovereign debt crisis","risk-off rotation to defensives"],"drivers_zh":["中国GDP增速放缓","硬着陆担忧","化工产能过剩","欧债危机拖累","风险规避转向防御"],"title":"China Growth Slowdown Triggers Risk-Off Selloff","title_zh":"中国经济增速下滑引发风险规避抛售"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"From December 2012 to June 2015, China ran its biggest equity bubble since 2007. The PBOC shifted to a sustained easing cycle (six rate cuts and multiple RRR reductions from late 2014 to mid-2015), margin financing outstanding exploded from CNY 340bn to CNY 2.7 trillion, and CSRC rule changes in 2013 further widened access to leveraged accounts. SHCOMP rose 163.6%, and while Chemicals gained 250.7%, it ranked only #14/28 as growth/tech names (Light Mfg, Electronics, Conglomerates) powered ahead on leverage flows. The chemical sector benefited mostly from broad market beta plus a mid-cycle PPI recovery in specialty chemicals tied to new-materials policy themes.","body_zh":"2012年12月至2015年6月，中国上演了2007年以来最大的股市泡沫。央行从2014年底启动持续降息降准周期（六次降息、多次降准），融资余额从3400亿元膨胀至2.7万亿元，证监会2013年放开融资融券账户资质限制进一步助力杠杆扩张。上证综指上涨163.6%，基础化工涨幅250.7%，但因电子、轻工、综合等成长赛道更受杠杆资金青睐，化工仅排名第14/28。板块主要受益于大市Beta及新材料政策催生的专用化学品中期PPI修复行情。","drivers":["PBOC multi-year easing cycle","margin leverage explosion","broad A-share bubble","new-materials policy theme","index beta"],"drivers_zh":["央行多年宽松周期","融资融券杠杆激增","A股全面泡沫化","新材料政策主题","大盘贝塔效应"],"title":"Margin-Leverage Bull Market Lifts All Cyclicals","title_zh":"杠杆牛市推动化工随大盘全线上涨"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the SHCOMP peaked above 5,100 and regulators moved to restrict margin lending by fintech platforms. Forced deleveraging cascaded through overleveraged retail accounts, triggering the worst crash since 2008: SHCOMP fell 32.1% in under four weeks, with defensives (Banks -10.6%) far outperforming cyclicals (-43.0%). Chemicals fell 42.4%, ranking #16/28 as the most leveraged, highest-beta cyclical names suffered the steepest margin-call-driven unwinding. The crackdown on umbrella trust products and off-exchange financing amplified the velocity of the decline.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，上证综指触顶5100点上方，随后监管层限制互联网平台配资。强制去杠杆在高杠杆散户账户中形成踩踏，引发2008年以来最严峻的崩盘：上证综指不到四周内跌32.1%，防御性行业（银行跌10.6%）大幅跑赢周期股（周期股平均跌43.0%）。基础化工跌42.4%，排名第16/28，高弹性周期股遭遇最惨烈的强平抛售。伞形信托及场外配资的整顿进一步加速了下跌节奏。","drivers":["margin deleveraging crash","CSRC margin restriction","forced margin calls","bubble collapse","risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["融资盘强制去杠杆","证监会限制配资","强平抛售踩踏","泡沫崩溃","风险规避"],"title":"Margin Collapse Crashes the Bubble","title_zh":"配资崩盘引发泡沫破裂急跌"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Beijing deployed the National Team (a consortium of state brokers and funds) purchasing an estimated CNY 1.6 trillion in shares from July 2015, while trading in over half of listed stocks was suspended to stem the bleeding. SHCOMP rebounded 13.9% from its trough on July 8, and cyclicals led the bounce by 20pp over defensives as the highest-beta names snapped back most sharply. Chemicals gained 29.3% but only ranked #14/28 — coal and defense sectors (which had fallen most) bounced harder, confirming this was a broad beta catch-up trade not a chemicals-specific theme.","body_zh":"北京启动\"国家队\"护盘（包括中金公司、证金公司等），动用约1.6万亿元资金买入股票，并暂停逾半数上市公司交易。上证综指从7月8日低点反弹13.9%，高弹性周期股领涨，相对防御股超额表现达20pp。基础化工反弹29.3%，但仅排名第14/28——煤炭、军工等此前跌幅更大的行业反弹更猛，显示这是高弹性补涨行情而非化工专属主题。","drivers":["National Team buying","state-sponsored market rescue","short-selling ban","high-beta snapback","forced suspension of trading"],"drivers_zh":["国家队护盘买入","国家主导救市措施","暂停卖空","高弹性品种急弹","上市公司停牌潮"],"title":"Government Rescue Triggers Dead-Cat Bounce","title_zh":"国家队护盘引发死猫反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC devalued the RMB by approximately 1.9% in a single day — the largest one-day move in two decades — signalling to markets that China's economy was weaker than official data suggested. Global risk-off ensued; on August 24 SHCOMP fell another 8.5%. Over the full leg SHCOMP lost 24.8%, with defensives (Banks -3.5%) dramatically outperforming cyclicals (-32.9%). Chemicals fell 33.4%, ranking #17/28, as RMB weakness raised costs for imported raw materials while the demand outlook collapsed with the weakening macro.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行单日将人民币汇率中间价下调约1.9%，创二十年来最大单日贬值幅度，令市场意识到经济疲软程度远超官方数据。全球风险规避情绪蔓延，8月24日\"黑色星期一\"上证综指再跌8.5%。整个下跌阶段上证综指累跌24.8%，防御性行业（银行仅跌3.5%）大幅跑赢周期股（跌32.9%）。基础化工跌33.4%，排名第17/28，人民币贬值推升进口原料成本，同时宏观需求前景恶化进一步压制行业表现。","drivers":["RMB devaluation shock","China hard-landing fear","global risk-off","import cost pressure","flight to defensives"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","中国硬着陆恐慌","全球风险规避","进口原料成本上升","防御性资产避险"],"title":"RMB Devaluation Shock Triggers Black Monday","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击引发黑色星期一"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After the dual crashes of June-August 2015, the PBOC resumed easing aggressively: it cut rates to 4.35% in October 2015 (its sixth cut in twelve months) and cut RRR to 17.5%, its fourth reduction of the year. The combination of policy stimulus and pent-up speculative demand drove a 20.7% SHCOMP rally. Crucially, growth outperformed value by 16pp, with Computers, Electronics, and Telecoms leading; Chemicals gained 46.6% (ranked #7/28), riding the liquidity wave with some support from Internet Plus and new-materials subsectors, though the recovery reflected a return to risk appetite rather than any fundamental demand improvement for bulk chemicals.","body_zh":"经历6-8月双重崩盘后，央行大力重启宽松：2015年10月降息至4.35%（十二个月内第六次），年内第四次降准至17.5%。政策刺激与积压的投机需求共同推动上证综指上涨20.7%。成长股领涨（超越价值股16pp），计算机、电子、通信位居榜首；基础化工上涨46.6%，排名第7/28，受益于\"互联网+\"及新材料细分赛道的流动性溢出，但这更多是风险偏好回暖而非大宗化工需求基本面的改善。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts to 4.35%","fourth RRR cut of 2015","liquidity-driven growth-stock rally","Internet Plus policy theme","risk appetite return"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息至4.35%","2015年第四次降准","流动性驱动成长股行情","互联网+政策主题","风险偏好回升"],"title":"PBOC Easing Resumes; Growth Stocks Lead Recovery","title_zh":"央行重启宽松推动成长股领涨复苏"},"2015-12-25":{"body":"China's newly introduced circuit-breaker mechanism took effect January 4, 2016 and immediately backfired: two circuit-breaker triggers in the first week of January caused panic selling as investors rushed to exit before trading was suspended. The PBOC also set the RMB fixing 0.5% lower, stoking fears of competitive devaluation. SHCOMP fell 26.8% in barely five weeks, with defensives (-25.3%) outperforming cyclicals (-30.0%). Chemicals dropped 31.6%, ranking #20/28, amplified by the sector's high beta and heavy retail-investor ownership, even as the cause was a macro-wide liquidity shock rather than a chemicals-specific event.","body_zh":"中国新引入的熔断机制（CSI 300跌7%触发全天停市）于2016年1月4日首次启动，随即出现反效果：一周内两度触发熔断，投资者恐慌性抢先出逃反而加速市场下跌。央行同步将人民币汇率中间价下调0.5%，引发竞争性贬值担忧。上证综指在不到五周内暴跌26.8%，防御性行业（跌25.3%）再次跑赢周期股（跌30%）。基础化工跌31.6%，排名第20/28，高Beta属性和大量散户持仓放大了下行幅度。","drivers":["circuit-breaker mechanism failure","RMB devaluation fear","panic selling","retail investor crowding","high beta amplification"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制失效","人民币贬值恐慌","恐慌性抛售","散户持仓集中","高贝塔放大效应"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Crash Amplifies RMB Fear","title_zh":"熔断机制崩溃叠加人民币贬值恐慌"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"President Xi formally launched China's supply-side structural reform in early 2016, targeting excess capacity in coal, steel, and upstream materials including chemicals. By mid-2016 forced capacity closures drove China's PPI from a deflationary -5.9% (early 2016) to +1.5% by September, a 7pp swing that directly lifted chemical sector pricing power. SHCOMP gained 22.3% and the leadership was value-cyclical (Metals +49%, Bldg Mat +49%, Construction +44%), with value outperforming growth by 6.7pp. Chemicals ranked #6/28 (+38.1%), consistent with a genuine commodity-reflation cycle rather than liquidity-driven growth rotation.","body_zh":"2016年初，习近平正式推进供给侧结构性改革，重点压减煤炭、钢铁及化工等上游行业产能。至2016年9月，受强制去产能驱动，中国PPI从-5.9%（2016年初）升至+1.5%，7pp的修复直接提升了化工行业定价能力。上证综指上涨22.3%，价值/周期品领涨（金属+49%、建材+49%、建工+44%），价值股跑赢成长股6.7pp。基础化工排名第6/28（+38.1%），反映的是实质性大宗商品通胀修复而非流动性驱动的成长行情。","drivers":["supply-side reform capacity cuts","PPI deflation-to-inflation swing","commodity reflation","value-cyclical rotation","PBOC RRR cuts"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革去产能","PPI由通缩转通胀","大宗商品价格修复","价值/周期股轮动","央行降准"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform and PPI Reflation Rally","title_zh":"供给侧改革推动PPI通胀修复行情"},"2016-11-22":{"body":"From late 2016 through end-2018, Beijing executed a comprehensive financial deleveraging campaign: overall bank-asset growth fell from 15.7% (2016) to 6.8% (2018) and shadow-banking channels were dismantled. The trade war escalation from March 2018 (US Section 301 tariffs on Chinese goods worth $60bn) compounded the credit squeeze. SHCOMP fell 24.1% and defensives dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-15.6% vs -31.2%), with Food & Beverage the sole gainer (+15.9%). Chemicals dropped 37.9%, ranking #15/28, hurt by both the credit crunch for energy-intensive capital-heavy issuers and downstream export demand disruption.","body_zh":"2016年底至2018年底，北京推进全面金融去杠杆：银行资产增速从15.7%（2016年）降至6.8%（2018年），影子银行渠道遭到拆解。2018年3月美国对华启动301条款关税（涵盖600亿美元商品）使信用收紧雪上加霜。上证综指累跌24.1%，防御股大幅跑赢周期股（-15.6% vs -31.2%），食品饮料是唯一正收益行业（+15.9%）。基础化工跌37.9%，排名第15/28，受制于信用收紧对资本密集型企业的冲击，以及出口导向下游需求受贸易战直接干扰。","drivers":["deleveraging campaign","shadow banking crackdown","US Section 301 tariffs","credit crunch for cyclicals","trade war escalation"],"drivers_zh":["金融去杠杆","影子银行整治","美国301条款关税","周期股信用收紧","中美贸易战升级"],"title":"Deleveraging Campaign and Trade War Kill Cyclicals","title_zh":"去杠杆政策叠加贸易战压垮周期股"},"2019-01-03":{"body":"After the December 2018 G20 Buenos Aires meeting ceasefire between Xi and Trump, markets priced a re-engagement in trade negotiations. Simultaneously, the PBOC cut RRR twice in January 2019 and shifted its policy stance toward accommodative. SHCOMP surged 31.7% in just over three months in a broad-based rally where Chemicals ranked #5/28 (+49.7%). Chemical stocks that had been severely de-rated through 2018 attracted relief buying alongside growth-style leaders (Agriculture, Computers, Building Materials), recovering on both extreme prior undervaluation and improving credit conditions.","body_zh":"2018年12月G20布宜诺斯艾利斯峰会习特会谈停火后，市场开始定价中美贸易谈判重启预期。与此同时，央行于2019年1月两次降准，并将货币政策立场由\"稳健\"转向偏松。上证综指在三个多月内涨31.7%，基础化工排名第5/28（+49.7%）——经历2018年严重杀估值后，化工股获大量估值修复买盘。农业、计算机、建材领涨，整体呈流动性驱动成长风格，化工因前期超跌而弹性更大。","drivers":["US-China trade truce optimism","PBOC RRR cuts x2 in Jan 2019","policy stance pivot","valuation rebound from extreme undervaluation","broad liquidity rally"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易停战乐观预期","2019年1月两次降准","货币政策立场转松","超跌估值修复","流动性驱动普涨"],"title":"Trade Truce Hope and PBOC Easing Drive Recovery","title_zh":"贸易停战乐观叠加央行宽松推动复苏"},"2019-04-08":{"body":"Negotiations collapsed in May 2019 when the US raised tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, and by August threatened tariffs on the remaining $300bn. Chemicals was among the single worst A-share performers in this leg (ranked #27/28 at -26.7% vs SHCOMP -14.5%), far underperforming the defensive rotation (Food & Bev +1.4%, Coal flat). Chemical companies faced a perfect storm: US tariffs targeted specialty chemical exports, downstream auto and electronics demand collapsed, and the sector carried high leverage from the 2018-2019 issuance cycle that made refinancing costly as credit conditions tightened.","body_zh":"2019年5月，中美谈判破裂，美国将对华2000亿美元商品关税从10%上调至25%，并于8月威胁对剩余3000亿美元商品加税。基础化工成为A股本轮跌幅最大的行业之一（排名第27/28，跌26.7%，而上证综指仅跌14.5%），大幅落后防御股（食品饮料+1.4%、煤炭平盘）。化工面临多重打击：关税直接冲击专用化学品出口，汽车与电子等下游需求骤降，加之行业高杠杆使信用收紧环境下再融资成本大幅上升。","drivers":["US 10%-to-25% tariff hike on $200bn goods","trade war re-escalation","downstream auto/electronics demand collapse","high sector leverage","risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美国对华2000亿美元商品加税至25%","贸易战重新升级","汽车/电子下游需求骤降","行业高杠杆","风险规避"],"title":"Trade War Re-Escalation Hits Chemicals as Worst Laggard","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级令化工成最大跌幅行业"},"2019-08-09":{"body":"From August 2019 to September 2021, Chemicals returned 146.0%, ranking #3/28 and far outpacing SHCOMP's +31.8% — an extraordinary relative outperformance that was structural, not merely beta. The primary driver was China's accelerating EV supply chain: lithium carbonate and hydroxide, fluorochemicals (electrolyte solvents), PVDF (battery binders), and NMP (cathode processing) all fall under Shenwan Chemicals. NEV sales in China grew from approximately 1.2mn (2019) to 3.5mn (2021), driving upstream chemical demand 40-60% annually in key subsectors. After the Phase-1 trade deal (January 2020) and three PBOC RRR cuts in 2020 for COVID relief, liquidity also supported re-rating. Power Equipment led at +219.5% (also EV-driven), confirming the new-energy supply chain as the dominant cycle theme.","body_zh":"2019年8月至2021年9月，基础化工累涨146.0%，排名第3/28，远超上证综指的31.8%——这种极度超额表现具有结构性驱动。核心催化剂是中国新能源汽车产业链的加速放量：碳酸锂/氢氧化锂、含氟电解质溶剂、PVDF粘结剂、NMP溶剂均归属于申万基础化工。中国新能源汽车销量从2019年约120万辆升至2021年约350万辆，驱动关键化工子赛道年增长40-60%。2020年1月中美第一阶段贸易协议落地，加之央行三次降准应对疫情，流动性宽松进一步助推估值扩张。电力设备板块以+219.5%领涨，同属新能源产业链，印证这是本轮周期的主导主题。","drivers":["China NEV supply chain acceleration","lithium/fluorochemical/PVDF demand surge","PBOC COVID easing (3 RRR cuts 2020)","Phase-1 US-China trade deal","new-energy policy (Made in China 2025)"],"drivers_zh":["中国新能源汽车产业链提速","锂盐/氟化工/PVDF需求爆发","央行疫情应对三次降准","中美第一阶段贸易协议","新能源政策（中国制造2025）"],"title":"New Energy Materials Boom Propels Chemicals to Top 3","title_zh":"新能源材料需求爆发推动化工跻身前三"},"2021-09-15":{"body":"China's dual-carbon policy (carbon peak by 2030, neutrality by 2060) led to sweeping energy-consumption curbs from September-November 2021: Zhejiang, Jiangsu, and Guangdong provinces ordered energy-intensive chemical plants to halt or reduce operations, directly damaging production and margins. Simultaneously, the broader tech/growth regulatory crackdown (anti-monopoly, after-school tutoring ban, gaming curbs) triggered a risk-off derating across high-multiple sectors including battery-materials chemicals whose P/E ratios had expanded to 60-80x. SHCOMP fell 21.1% and Chemicals was #29/31 (-37.1%), among the three worst sectors, facing both operational disruption and multiple compression. Defensives (Coal +6.7%, Agriculture +1.2%) led as energy and food security themes dominated.","body_zh":"中国\"双碳\"目标（2030年前达峰、2060年前中和）推动2021年9-11月大范围限电限产：浙江、江苏、广东等省份强制能耗密集型化工企业停产或限产，直接重创生产和利润。与此同时，科技/成长股监管整治（反垄断、教培整顿、游戏限制）引发高估值板块风险折价，锂电材料化工股的市盈率从60-80倍区间大幅压缩。上证综指跌21.1%，基础化工排名第29/31（跌37.1%），属于跌幅最惨的三个行业之一，同时遭遇运营中断与估值压缩双重打击。煤炭（+6.7%）、农业（+1.2%）等能源与粮食安全主题的防御行业领先。","drivers":["dual-carbon energy curtailments","chemical plant shutdowns (Zhejiang/Jiangsu)","tech/growth regulatory crackdown","high-multiple derating","flight to energy-security defensives"],"drivers_zh":["双碳限电限产政策","浙江/江苏化工厂停产","科技/成长股监管整治","高估值压缩","能源安全防御股避险"],"title":"Energy Curbs and Regulatory Crackdown Punish Chemicals","title_zh":"限电政策与监管整治重创化工板块"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Shanghai's two-month lockdown ended June 1, 2022, and anticipation of reopening drove a sharp rebound from the April 26 market trough. SHCOMP gained 17.9% and cyclicals led over defensives by 8pp, with Power Equipment (+55.9%) and Autos (+44.4%) topping — both EV-supply-chain themes. Chemicals ranked #5/31 (+34.2%), supported by aggressive NEV restocking as battery manufacturers rebuilt inventories post-lockdown and lithium carbonate prices were still near their historical peak. State Council pledges in May (CNY 33-point infrastructure package) provided additional macro tailwind without resolving the underlying property-sector stress.","body_zh":"上海两个月封控于2022年6月1日解除，重开预期推动市场从4月26日低点强劲反弹。上证综指涨17.9%，周期股跑赢防御股约8pp，电力设备（+55.9%）、汽车（+44.4%）领涨，均与新能源汽车产业链密切相关。基础化工排名第5/31（+34.2%），受益于解封后电池厂积极补库以及碳酸锂价格仍处高位。国务院5月出台33项稳增长措施（重点为基建）提供额外宏观支撑，但未能从根本上缓解房地产信用压力。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown end/reopening","NEV battery restocking","lithium prices at peak","State Council infrastructure stimulus","EV supply chain recovery"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封重开","新能源电池厂补库","碳酸锂价格处于高位","国务院33项稳增长措施","新能源产业链复苏"],"title":"Post-Lockdown Reopening Rebound and NEV Restocking","title_zh":"解封后复苏与新能源补库推动反弹"},"2022-07-05":{"body":"From July 2022 to February 2024, Chemicals fell 45.5%, ranking #29/31 — one of the three worst Shenwan sectors in a prolonged 19-month bear leg. Three forces drove this: (1) China's property sector entered a full-blown credit crisis after Evergrande's default, with construction-chemicals demand collapsing; (2) the global rate shock (Fed hiked 525bp from March 2022 to July 2023) compressed multiples on high-P/E new-energy chemical names; (3) massive lithium supply additions — Australian spodumene and Chinese lepidolite capacity expanded sharply — began converting the 2021-22 supply deficit into structural oversupply, driving lithium carbonate prices from CNY 597,000/t (Nov 2022) to below CNY 100,000/t by end-2023. Defensives (Telecoms -1.3%, Banks -8.9%) dramatically outperformed.","body_zh":"2022年7月至2024年2月，基础化工累跌45.5%，排名第29/31，是申万行业中跌幅最大的三个之一，历时19个月的漫长熊市。三大驱动力叠加：（1）继恒大违约后，中国房地产行业陷入全面信用危机，建筑类化工需求崩塌；（2）美联储暴力加息（2022年3月至2023年7月累计525bp）大幅压缩新能源化工高估值股的市盈率；（3）澳大利亚锂辉石及中国锂云母大量新增产能投放，将2021-22年的供应缺口逐步转为结构性过剩，碳酸锂价格从2022年11月的59.7万元/吨暴跌至2023年底的10万元以下。防御性行业（通信-1.3%、银行-8.9%）大幅跑赢。","drivers":["property sector credit crisis","global rate shock (Fed +525bp)","lithium structural oversupply","bulk chemical demand collapse","high-multiple derating on NEV chemicals"],"drivers_zh":["房地产信用危机","全球加息冲击（美联储加息525bp）","锂供给结构性过剩","大宗化工需求崩塌","新能源化工高估值压缩"],"title":"Property Crisis and Lithium Oversupply Collapse Chemicals","title_zh":"地产危机叠加锂供过于求令化工持续熊市"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The PBOC cut the 5-year Loan Prime Rate by 25bp on February 20, 2024 — its largest-ever single cut — and lowered RRR by 50bp effective February 5, the largest RRR reduction since 2021. This followed the mid-January 2024 market sell-off driven by property distress and deflation fears (CPI at -0.8% in January 2024). SHCOMP gained 16.5% and Chemicals ranked #2/31 (+34.5%), its highest relative ranking in years, with bulk chemical PPI beginning to stabilize and downstream restocking from autos, home appliances, and industrial sectors providing demand support. The rotation was squarely commodity-cyclical, with Metals (+37.5%) leading.","body_zh":"2024年2月20日，央行将5年期LPR下调25bp（史上最大单次降幅），并于2月5日起降准50bp（2021年以来最大幅度）。此前1月下旬市场受地产困境与通缩担忧（2024年1月CPI同比-0.8%）重压。上证综指上涨16.5%，基础化工排名第2/31（+34.5%），为多年来最高相对排名，显示实质性重估迹象：大宗化工PPI开始企稳，汽车、家电、工业品下游补库提供需求支撑。金属（+37.5%）领涨，风格轮动明确转向商品/周期。","drivers":["PBOC 25bp LPR cut (record)","50bp RRR cut Feb 2024","PPI stabilization","downstream industrial restocking","commodity-cyclical rotation"],"drivers_zh":["央行史上最大单次LPR降息25bp","2024年2月降准50bp","PPI企稳","下游工业补库","商品/周期股风格轮动"],"title":"PBOC Record LPR Cut Triggers Commodity Revaluation","title_zh":"史上最大LPR降息触发商品板块重估"},"2024-05-07":{"body":"The February-May 2024 commodity rally exhausted itself as evidence mounted that China's economic recovery remained structurally weak: property completions fell more than 20% year-on-year, CPI stayed near zero, and chemical company profits in the first half of 2024 fell 7.7% y/y. SHCOMP fell 14.1% in a broadly based decline (defensives -16.3%, cyclicals -19.2%), and Chemicals ranked #28/31 (-24.8%), confirming sector-specific profit concern layered over the macro selloff. Food & Beverage and Beauty consumer names also suffered, pointing to general domestic-demand disappointment rather than a chemicals-specific trigger.","body_zh":"2024年2-5月的商品反弹随着经济复苏疲弱的证据积累而告终：房地产竣工同比跌超20%，CPI持续接近零值，化工类上市公司2024年上半年利润同比下降7.7%。上证综指跌14.1%，基础化工排名第28/31（跌24.8%），在宏观下行之上叠加了行业自身的盈利担忧。食品饮料、美妆等消费行业同步重挫，指向整体内需不足而非化工板块个别因素。","drivers":["macro recovery disappointment","property completions -20% y/y","chemical profits -7.7% H1 2024","CPI near zero deflation risk","broad domestic demand weakness"],"drivers_zh":["宏观复苏不及预期","房地产竣工同比跌超20%","2024年上半年化工利润同比降7.7%","CPI接近零的通缩风险","内需全面疲弱"],"title":"Macro Disappointment Deflates Commodity Recovery","title_zh":"宏观修复不及预期令商品回暖行情夭折"},"2024-09-13":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a sweeping stimulus package: a 20bp policy rate cut, 50bp RRR cut (freeing approximately CNY 1 trillion), two new equity-market support facilities (Securities, Fund and Insurance Swap Facility and CNY 300bn buyback lending facility), and targeted property support. This bazooka drove the largest A-share rally since 2014: SHCOMP rose 54.7% from mid-September 2024 to March 2026. Chemicals ranked #8/31 (+94.8%) — solid mid-to-upper performance behind Metals (+191.6%), Conglomerates (+182.4%), and Telecoms (+176.8%), with cyclicals beating defensives by 55pp. The sector benefited from broad beta and improving PPI expectations as the stimulus package targeted supply chain stabilization and manufacturing investment.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子宽松措施：降息20bp、降准50bp（释放约1万亿元流动性）、推出证券基金保险互换便利（SFISF）及3000亿元股票回购再贷款两项新工具，并出台房地产定向支持政策。这轮\"大招\"引发了2014年以来最强劲的A股行情：上证综指从2024年9月中旬涨至2026年3月累涨54.7%。基础化工排名第8/31（+94.8%），表现稳健但居于中上，落后于金属（+191.6%）、综合（+182.4%）和通信（+176.8%），周期股跑赢防御股超55pp。板块既受益于大市Beta，也因刺激政策聚焦供应链稳定和制造业投资而带来PPI改善预期。","drivers":["PBOC 20bp rate cut + 50bp RRR cut Sep 2024","equity market support facilities","property sector stabilization","PPI recovery expectations","broad cyclical re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月降息20bp+降准50bp","股市支持工具落地","房地产企稳预期","PPI修复预期","周期股全面重估"],"title":"Beijing Bazooka Stimulus Triggers Cyclical Surge","title_zh":"北京大招刺激触发周期股大幅反弹"}},"now":"Chemicals (基础化工) is at a Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, sitting at cycle-position 22.5 with RS rank 6/31 on a trailing window where the sector returned +9.1% against a SHCOMP up only +1.6%. The tape is a pronounced growth-vs-value bifurcation: Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Building Materials (+48.1%) lead in a liquidity/AI-hardware-theme rally, while cyclicals as a group are barely positive (+0.3% avg) against defensives at -12.1%. Chemicals trails the growth leaders widely; sector re-leadership will likely require a PPI or commodity-price inflection, a broad-based macro stimulus second wave, or a growth-to-value rotation catalyst. The sector is above its 200-day moving average and a 96th-percentile return-window reading suggests the multi-year bottoming process is mature, but timing the next major rally leg depends on evidence of industrial-cycle turning.","now_zh":"基础化工目前处于筑底阶段（周期位置22.5，RS排名6/31），本窗口涨幅+9.1%，而同期上证综指仅涨1.6%。当前行情以AI与科技硬件主题驱动为主：电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）、建材（+48.1%）领涨，成长股相对价值股溢价高达18.2pp，化工板块在周期股中处于中游。板块若要重回申万行业前五，仍有赖于PPI上行、大宗商品价格企稳或市场风格从成长向价值切换。板块已站上200日均线，收益率窗口百分位达96%，显示底部成熟，但启动新一轮主升浪仍需工业周期见底的明确信号。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801040":{"legs":{"2011-12-22":{"body":"After the PBOC delivered two consecutive RRR cuts in November and December 2011 — the first reductions since 2008 — the SHCOMP rebounded +12.1% through end-February 2012, lifting Steel +19.4% to rank 4th of 16 Shenwan industries. The rotation was textbook cyclical-value: Metals (+26.7%), Appliances (+21.5%), and Real Estate (+19.8%) led while defensives such as Pharma (+0.9%) and Food & Bev (+4.8%) badly lagged. Beijing had simultaneously pushed a large batch of NDRC-approved infrastructure projects in late 2011, lifting forward demand expectations for construction steel and fuelling the value/cyclical catch-up trade.","body_zh":"中国人民银行于2011年11月、12月连续两次下调存款准备金率（2008年以来首次），推动上证综指在2012年2月底前反弹12.1%，带动钢铁板块上涨19.4%，在16个申万行业中排名第4。轮动逻辑为典型周期价值补涨：有色金属（+26.7%）、家电（+21.5%）、房地产（+19.8%）领涨，医药（+0.9%）、食品饮料（+4.8%）等防御板块大幅落后。与此同时，国家发改委集中批复一批基础设施项目，提振建筑用钢需求预期，进一步强化价值/周期补涨逻辑。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut easing cycle","NDRC infrastructure approval batch","cyclical-value rotation","broad SHCOMP beta lift"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准宽松周期","国家发改委批量基建审批","周期价值轮动","上证综指整体贝塔提振"],"title":"PBOC RRR cuts spark cyclical-value rally","title_zh":"央行降准点燃周期价值行情"},"2012-02-28":{"body":"China's GDP growth decelerated toward a multi-year low in 2012 as domestic credit conditions remained tight post-2011 tightening and European sovereign debt crisis headwinds weighed on exports. The SHCOMP fell -19.5% through November 2012 in a broad flight-to-safety rotation where defensives (Pharma -6.4%, defensives avg -11.2%) outpaced cyclicals (avg -22.5%). Steel fell -26.8%, ranking 13th of 16, punished by slowing infrastructure approvals, falling iron ore demand, and persistent margin compression from global rebar oversupply. Beijing's reluctance to launch large-scale stimulus early in 2012 prolonged the drawdown.","body_zh":"2012年中国GDP增速放缓至多年低点，国内信贷条件在2011年收紧周期后仍偏紧，叠加欧债危机拖累出口。上证综指在11月前下跌19.5%，呈现典型的防御轮动：防御板块（医药-6.4%，均值-11.2%）跑赢周期板块（均值-22.5%）。钢铁下跌26.8%，在16个行业中排名第13，受累于基建审批放缓、铁矿石需求下滑及全球螺纹钢供过于求导致的持续利润率压缩，政府迟迟未出台大规模刺激方案进一步延长了跌势。","drivers":["GDP growth deceleration","European debt crisis export headwind","credit tightening overhang","infrastructure approval slowdown","global rebar oversupply"],"drivers_zh":["GDP增速放缓至多年低点","欧债危机拖累出口","信贷收紧遗留效应","基建审批放缓","全球螺纹钢供过于求"],"title":"Growth slowdown triggers risk-off cyclical selloff","title_zh":"增长放缓引发周期板块风险出清"},"2012-11-28":{"body":"Following the November 2012 18th Party Congress which confirmed Xi Jinping's leadership transition, the SHCOMP surged +23.3% in a broad cyclical-led beta rally through February 2013. Beijing had accelerated NDRC infrastructure approvals in September 2012 — including a large batch of rail and urban projects — providing concrete demand support. Steel rose +18.7% but ranked only 15th of 16, lagging badly versus Chemicals (+30.9%), Real Estate (+29.8%), and Conglom (+29.1%), reflecting that overcapacity in the sector meant it could not translate demand optimism into earnings upgrades. The leg was largely macro beta, not steel fundamentals.","body_zh":"2012年11月党的十八大正式确认习近平接班，上证综指在2013年2月前大涨23.3%，呈现周期主导的普涨行情。北京于2012年9月集中加速批复国家发改委基建项目，涵盖大批铁路与城市工程，提供实质性需求支撑。钢铁上涨18.7%，但在16个行业中仅列第15位，大幅跑输化工（+30.9%）、房地产（+29.8%）和综合板块（+29.1%），折射出行业产能过剩使其无法将需求乐观情绪转化为盈利上修。本轮行情以宏观贝塔驱动为主，而非钢铁自身基本面改善。","drivers":["18th Party Congress leadership confirmation","NDRC infrastructure approval acceleration","broad SHCOMP beta rally","political risk premium compression"],"drivers_zh":["十八大领导层确认","国家发改委基建批复加速","上证综指普涨贝塔","政治风险溢价收缩"],"title":"Xi leadership transition, NDRC stimulus re-ignites market","title_zh":"习近平接班确认，国家发改委刺激重燃行情"},"2013-02-08":{"body":"In June 2013, the PBOC deliberately withheld liquidity, sending the Shanghai interbank overnight rate (Shibor) to a record 30% on June 20 — the 2013 Chinese banking liquidity crisis — as Beijing moved to rein in shadow banking and wealth management products. The SHCOMP fell -19.5% and cyclicals collapsed (-22.9% avg vs defensives -2.8%), with growth tech (Electronics +11.0%, Pharma +4.8%) the sole refuge and growth beating value by 35.9pp. Steel fell -28.7%, ranking 15th of 16 — among the second-worst alongside Metals (-34.3%) — as slowing fixed-asset investment and massive structural overcapacity compounded the macro tightening shock. President Xi flagged overcapacity, shadow banking, and local government debt as core risks in late 2013.","body_zh":"2013年6月，央行主动收紧流动性，上海银行间隔夜利率（Shibor）于6月20日飙升至创纪录的30%，引发史称\"钱荒\"的银行间流动性危机，意在遏制影子银行和理财产品扩张。上证综指下跌19.5%，周期板块集体重挫（均值-22.9%，远逊防御板块-2.8%），仅成长科技（电子+11.0%、医药+4.8%）独善其身，成长跑赢价值35.9个百分点。钢铁下跌28.7%，在16个行业中排名第15，与有色金属（-34.3%）同为本轮杀跌最惨烈板块之一，宏观收紧叠加固定资产投资放缓和结构性产能过剩。2013年下半年习近平公开点名产能过剩、影子银行和地方政府债务为核心风险。","drivers":["June 2013 Shibor spike to 30% (cash crunch)","PBOC shadow banking crackdown","structural steel overcapacity","FAI slowdown","growth-vs-value rotation to tech"],"drivers_zh":["2013年6月Shibor飙升30%（钱荒）","央行整治影子银行","钢铁行业结构性产能过剩","固定资产投资放缓","成长/科技风格切换"],"title":"June 2013 credit crunch, overcapacity drag devastates Steel","title_zh":"2013年6月钱荒与产能过剩重创钢铁"},"2013-07-08":{"body":"From July 2013 through June 2015, China experienced its most explosive bull market since 2007 as retail margin financing ballooned from near zero to over CNY 2 trillion by mid-2015 and the SHCOMP surged +158.5% to a June 2015 peak above 5,100. Steel gained +271.9%, ranking 7th of 28 industries, as the levered risk-on tide lifted all cyclicals (avg +213.4%); Transport (+321%), Textiles (+320%), and Light Mfg (+303%) led while Banks (+91%) and Food & Bev (+88%) lagged. Although Steel's structural overcapacity was unresolved, the margin-leveraged retail frenzy treated it as a cheap high-beta play on China's reflation story, with off-balance-sheet umbrella-trust leverage reaching multiples of equity at the peak.","body_zh":"2013年7月至2015年6月，中国经历了2007年以来最波澜壮阔的牛市——散户融资余额从接近零飙升至超2万亿元人民币，上证综指暴涨158.5%至5,100点以上高峰。钢铁板块上涨271.9%，在28个行业中排名第7，杠杆资金推动的风险偏好全面抬升使周期股整体大涨（均值+213.4%）；交通运输（+321%）、纺织服装（+320%）、轻工制造（+303%）领涨，银行（+91%）和食品饮料（+88%）垫底。尽管钢铁结构性产能过剩问题未解，但融资杠杆下的散户将其视为中国再通胀叙事中的低价高弹性品种，伞形信托等场外杠杆在高点达到本金的数倍。","drivers":["retail margin financing surge","SHCOMP 158% broad beta bull","high-beta low-price cyclical appeal","reflation narrative","umbrella trust leverage"],"drivers_zh":["散户融资余额激增","上证综指158%大牛市贝塔","低价高弹性周期板块吸引力","再通胀叙事","伞形信托高杠杆"],"title":"Leverage-fuelled bull market: Steel rides 271% monster leg","title_zh":"融资融券杠杆牛市：钢铁随大势暴涨271%"},"2015-06-15":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the China Securities Regulatory Commission issued draft rules restricting shadow-financed margin accounts (umbrella trusts) and capping brokerage margin lending, triggering forced deleveraging and a catastrophic cascade. The SHCOMP fell -30.7% in three weeks, and Steel fell -35.5%, ranking 4th-worst of 28 sectors. Defensives (Banks -7.7%, defensives avg -28.9%) outperformed cyclicals (avg -42.6%) in a pure fire-sale deleveraging: Coal -57.9%, Defense -51.3%, Retail -46.5%. The government launched multiple emergency interventions including a CSF (China Securities Finance) stabilization fund, a ban on major-shareholder selling, and an IPO suspension, but these only temporarily arrested the fall.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，中国证监会发布草案规定，限制伞形信托等场外配资账户并对券商两融杠杆设限，强制去杠杆引发踩踏式崩盘。上证综指在三周内暴跌30.7%，钢铁下跌35.5%，在28个行业中排名第4差。防御板块（银行-7.7%，均值-28.9%）跑赢周期板块（均值-42.6%），呈现典型的强制平仓抛售特征：煤炭-57.9%、国防军工-51.3%、商贸零售-46.5%。政府相继出台证金公司平准资金、大股东减持禁令、IPO暂停等应急措施，但仅短暂遏制了跌势。","drivers":["CSRC shadow-margin crackdown (June 12 2015)","forced deleveraging cascade","umbrella trust unwind","broad market fire sale","government emergency interventions"],"drivers_zh":["证监会清查场外配资（2015年6月12日）","强制去杠杆踩踏","伞形信托平仓","市场整体抛售","政府紧急救市"],"title":"CSRC margin crackdown triggers leveraged crash","title_zh":"证监会清查杠杆触发踩踏式崩盘"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Following the government's multi-pronged rescue — CSF stabilization fund, IPO halt, ban on major-shareholder selling — the SHCOMP bounced +13.9% from the July 8 low through August 17. Coal surged +104.4%, Defense +78.0%, and Agriculture +46.5%, while Steel (+22.4%) ranked only 21st of 28, badly lagging the recovery. The bounce was concentrated in the most-oversold names with high state ownership (defense, coal), not in overcapacity industries like Steel. Cyclicals (avg +37.1%) outpaced defensives (+16.8%) in this reflexive relief rally.","body_zh":"政府推出证金平准基金、暂停IPO、禁止大股东减持等多项救市举措后，上证综指从7月8日低点至8月17日反弹13.9%。煤炭暴涨104.4%、国防军工+78.0%、农林牧渔+46.5%，而钢铁（+22.4%）在28个行业中仅列第21位，大幅落后于反弹。本次反弹集中于超跌且国资属性强的品种（国防、煤炭），产能过剩行业（如钢铁）无缘领涨。周期板块（均值+37.1%）跑赢防御板块（+16.8%），符合超跌后的技术性修复特征。","drivers":["government rescue stabilization fund","oversold technical rebound","high-state-ownership defense/coal preference","IPO halt sentiment boost","cyclical relief rotation"],"drivers_zh":["政府平准资金救市","超跌技术性反弹","国资属性强的国防/煤炭溢价","暂停IPO提振情绪","周期板块超跌修复"],"title":"Government rescue bounce: coal and defense lead, Steel lags","title_zh":"政府救市反弹：煤炭国防领涨，钢铁跑输"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC shocked markets with a surprise ~1.9% CNY devaluation and shift to a new fixing mechanism, sparking capital outflow fears and a global risk-off selloff. The SHCOMP lost -32.7% between August 2015 and February 2016, and Steel collapsed -49.4%, ranking 27th of 28 (second-worst). Banks (-11.8%, defensives avg -26.3%) led defensives while cyclicals averaged -37.3%. Steel's extreme underperformance reflected compounding pressures: the devaluation amplified overcapacity concerns, iron ore prices fell below USD 40/t for the first time since 2009, and Chinese steel mills' profitability was near zero. Coal (-47.1%) was the only comparable laggard.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，中国人民银行宣布人民币汇率中间价报价机制改革，人民币单日贬值约1.9%，引发资本外流恐慌与全球风险资产抛售。上证综指在2015年8月至2016年2月间下跌32.7%，钢铁板块暴跌49.4%，在28个行业中排名第27（倒数第二）。银行（-11.8%，防御均值-26.3%）领跌防御板块，周期板块均值-37.3%。钢铁极端跑输折射多重压力叠加：汇改加剧产能过剩担忧，铁矿石价格跌破40美元/吨（2009年以来首次），国内钢厂盈利能力接近零。煤炭（-47.1%）是唯一可比的垫底板块。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock Aug 11 2015","capital outflow fears","iron ore below USD 40/t","steel mill profitability collapse","SHCOMP -32.7% bear leg"],"drivers_zh":["2015年8月11日人民币汇改冲击","资本外流恐慌","铁矿石价格跌破40美元/吨","钢厂盈利能力崩溃","上证综指-32.7%熊市段"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock, growth scare crushes Steel again","title_zh":"人民币汇改冲击与增长恐慌再度重创钢铁"},"2016-02-01":{"body":"In early 2016 Beijing launched the Supply-Side Structural Reforms, targeting 45 million tonnes of annual steel capacity cuts and enforcing the 276-working-day restriction (down from 330 days) for coal mines, which cascaded into commodity input repricing. By October 2016 the 45-million-tonne steel target had been exceeded, with roughly 65 million tonnes of capacity closed. The SHCOMP gained +29.7% through February 2018 and Steel surged +67.7% — ranking 3rd of 28 — as the capacity-cut regime combined with a real estate and infrastructure demand rebound and a dollar-driven commodity reflation cycle squeezed supply against recovering demand. Value massively outperformed growth by 37.4pp, the strongest style tilt in the dataset.","body_zh":"2016年初北京启动供给侧结构性改革，目标年度削减4500万吨钢铁产能，并对煤矿实施276工作日限产令（由330天下调），带动大宗商品原料价格重定价。2016年10月钢铁4500万吨目标提前超额完成，实际去产能约6500万吨。上证综指在2018年2月前累计上涨29.7%，钢铁板块暴涨67.7%，在28个行业中排名第3。去产能政策叠加地产与基建需求回暖，以及美元驱动的大宗商品通胀周期，形成供需双向收紧格局。价值风格大幅跑赢成长37.4个百分点，为数据区间内最强的风格偏离。","drivers":["supply-side reform 45Mt capacity cut target","276 working-day coal restriction","real estate/infrastructure demand rebound","commodity reflation cycle","value vs growth 37.4pp style tilt"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革4500万吨去产能目标","煤矿276工作日限产","地产/基建需求回暖","大宗商品再通胀周期","价值跑赢成长37.4个百分点"],"title":"Supply-side reform and 276-day rule drive two-year steel surge","title_zh":"供给侧改革与276天工作日政策驱动钢铁两年大涨"},"2018-02-05":{"body":"The Trump administration imposed 25% Section 232 tariffs on steel imports (proclaimed March 8, 2018, effective June 1, 2018), directly hitting Chinese mills; in 2018 Section 301 tariffs escalated further across hundreds of billions in Chinese goods. The SHCOMP fell -29.3% through January 2019, with Steel declining -38.9%, ranking 27th of 28 — among the worst alongside Metals (-39.4%) and Media (-37.3%). Defensives led (-25.3% avg vs cyclicals -30.1%), confirming a classic flight-to-safety rotation. The combination of tariff shock, fading supply-side reform tailwind, and an environmental inspection campaign that disrupted Hebei steel mills further weighed on the sector.","body_zh":"特朗普政府对全球钢铁进口征收25%的第232条款关税（2018年3月8日宣布、6月1日生效），直接冲击中国钢厂；同年第301条款关税进一步升级，覆盖数千亿美元中国商品。上证综指在2019年1月前下跌29.3%，钢铁板块下跌38.9%，在28个行业中排名第27，与有色金属（-39.4%）和传媒（-37.3%）同为最差。防御板块领跌（均值-25.3%，优于周期-30.1%），为典型的避险轮动。关税冲击、供给侧改革红利消退以及环保督察打乱河北钢厂生产节奏，三重压力叠加重创板块。","drivers":["Section 232 steel tariffs 25% (effective June 2018)","Section 301 tariff escalation","supply-side reform tailwind fading","Hebei environmental inspection disruption","SHCOMP -29.3% risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["第232条款钢铁25%关税（2018年6月生效）","第301条款关税升级","供给侧改革红利消退","河北环保督察干扰生产","上证综指-29.3%避险行情"],"title":"US trade war tariffs and growth scare hammer cyclicals","title_zh":"中美贸易战关税与增长恐慌重创周期板块"},"2019-01-02":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR by 100bp in January 2019 and had introduced the TMLF (Targeted Medium-Term Lending Facility) in December 2018 to ease SME credit. The SHCOMP surged +31.6% from January through early April 2019, aided by growing optimism over a US-China Phase One trade deal and Beijing's re-acceleration of infrastructure and special-bond issuance. Steel gained +35.4%, ranking 17th of 28 — a market-average performance — as Agriculture (+58.2%), Computers (+55.2%) and Bldg Mat (+50.8%) led the broad beta lift. Steel's mid-rank showing reflects that the rally was macro-driven easing beta, not steel-specific re-rating.","body_zh":"央行于2019年1月实施降准100bp，并已于2018年12月推出定向中期借贷便利（TMLF）工具，定向疏导中小企业信贷。上证综指在1月至4月初大涨31.6%，中美一阶段贸易协议预期升温及北京加速基建与专项债发行亦提供助力。钢铁上涨35.4%，在28个行业中排名第17，居中游，农林牧渔（+58.2%）、计算机（+55.2%）和建材（+50.8%）领涨，反映本轮行情为宏观宽松驱动的普涨贝塔，而非钢铁板块独立重评估。","drivers":["PBOC 100bp RRR cut January 2019","TMLF SME credit easing","Phase One trade deal optimism","infrastructure and special bond acceleration","broad SHCOMP beta rally"],"drivers_zh":["2019年1月央行降准100bp","定向中期借贷便利（TMLF）定向宽信用","一阶段贸易协议预期升温","基建与专项债提速","上证综指普涨贝塔"],"title":"PBOC easing and Phase-One trade truce lift all boats","title_zh":"央行宽松与贸易战停火推动全面反弹"},"2019-04-08":{"body":"From April 2019 to February 2020, the US-China trade war re-escalated sharply as Phase One negotiations stalled and May 2019 saw US tariffs jump to 25% on an additional USD 200bn of Chinese goods. The SHCOMP fell -15.4%, but Steel collapsed -37.7% — dead last of 28 industries — as Electronics (+24.7%) and Pharma (+2.0%) surged in a growth-style flight-to-safety rotation (growth beat value by 11.7pp). By February 2020 COVID-19 had shuttered Chinese factories and construction sites, compounding the demand destruction. Steel's position as the weakest sector reflected both its high beta to the real economy and structural overcapacity with zero pricing power.","body_zh":"2019年4月至2020年2月，中美贸易战谈判陷入僵局，2019年5月美方将对华2000亿美元商品关税提高至25%，局势急剧恶化。上证综指下跌15.4%，而钢铁板块暴跌37.7%，在28个行业中垫底，电子（+24.7%）和医药（+2.0%）则在成长风格避险轮动中大幅走强（成长跑赢价值11.7个百分点）。2020年2月新冠疫情导致国内工厂与工地全面停工，进一步加剧需求破坏。钢铁成为最弱板块，折射其对实体经济的高贝塔属性与结构性产能过剩下的零定价权。","drivers":["US tariff escalation to 25% on USD 200bn May 2019","Phase One stall risk-off","COVID-19 demand destruction February 2020","growth vs value flight-to-safety +11.7pp","structural overcapacity zero pricing power"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月美对华2000亿商品关税提至25%","一阶段谈判停滞引发避险","新冠疫情2020年2月需求破坏","成长风格避险轮动跑赢价值11.7pp","结构性产能过剩，定价权缺失"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation and COVID shock sink Steel to worst","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级与新冠冲击将钢铁打入垫底"},"2020-02-03":{"body":"China's infrastructure-heavy post-COVID stimulus drove a massive steel demand surge: crude steel output hit a record 1.065 billion tonnes in 2020, the first nation to exceed one billion tonnes. From February 2020 through September 2021 the SHCOMP gained +34.5% and Steel surged +132.0%, ranking 3rd of 28 industries behind Power Equipment (+180.4%) and Metals (+146.2%). In September 2020, Xi Jinping announced China's dual-carbon goals (peak emissions 2030, carbon neutral 2060), triggering output-restriction policies from mid-2021: 2021 crude steel production fell ~2.8% year-on-year, the first decline in years, injecting a powerful supply-side scarcity premium into prices. Value outperformed growth by 10.5pp, a cyclical-value tape driven by commodity inflation.","body_zh":"中国疫后以基建为核心的刺激政策带动钢铁需求大幅上升：2020年粗钢产量创历史新高达10.65亿吨，成为首个突破十亿吨的国家。2020年2月至2021年9月，上证综指上涨34.5%，钢铁板块大涨132.0%，在28个行业中排名第3，仅次于电力设备（+180.4%）和有色金属（+146.2%）。2020年9月习近平宣布双碳目标（2030年碳达峰、2060年碳中和），2021年年中起出台产量限制政策，2021年粗钢产量同比下降约2.8%，为多年来首次，为价格注入强劲的供给侧稀缺溢价。价值跑赢成长10.5个百分点，呈现大宗商品通胀驱动的周期价值行情。","drivers":["post-COVID infrastructure demand surge","crude steel 2020 record 1.065Bt output","dual-carbon announcement Sep 2020","2021 output cut policy supply squeeze","commodity inflation value cycle"],"drivers_zh":["疫后基建需求爆发","2020年粗钢产量创历史纪录10.65亿吨","2020年9月双碳目标公告","2021年产量限制政策收紧供给","大宗商品通胀周期价值行情"],"title":"Post-COVID infra boom and dual-carbon scarcity drive 132% surge","title_zh":"疫后基建热潮与双碳减产稀缺性驱动钢铁暴涨132%"},"2021-09-09":{"body":"From September 2021 through April 2022, China's property sector entered freefall — Evergrande defaulted in late 2021 and new housing starts fell sharply — destroying a large share of the construction-driven domestic steel demand. The dual-carbon output restrictions had already cut production, but with demand collapsing faster, steel prices plummeted. The SHCOMP fell -21.8%, and Steel was the single worst performer in the universe at -44.8% (31st of 31), while Coal (+6.7%) was the only Shenwan sector to gain. Defensives (-15.2% avg) significantly outpaced cyclicals (-23.9%), a classic risk-off flight-to-safety with a value bias.","body_zh":"2021年9月至2022年4月，中国房地产行业急速下行——恒大于2021年下半年正式违约，新开工面积大幅下降——导致大量建筑驱动的国内用钢需求遭受重创。双碳产量限制政策已使供给收缩，但需求崩塌速度更快，钢价急剧下跌。上证综指下跌21.8%，钢铁板块以-44.8%成为31个申万行业中最差的单一板块，而煤炭（+6.7%）成为唯一上涨的行业。防御板块（均值-15.2%）大幅跑赢周期板块（-23.9%），呈现经典的避险轮动与价值倾向。","drivers":["Evergrande default 2021 property crisis","housing starts collapse demand destruction","dual-carbon output restriction overshooting","steel price collapse","SHCOMP -21.8% risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["恒大2021年违约触发地产危机","新开工面积崩塌需求破坏","双碳减产政策超调","钢价急速下跌","上证综指-21.8%避险行情"],"title":"Dual-carbon output cuts into property crisis: Steel worst of all","title_zh":"双碳减产遭遇地产危机：钢铁沦为垫底"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"The April 26, 2022 low followed the Shanghai COVID lockdown that began in late March, which shuttered factories and depressed steel demand. From late April through July 5 the SHCOMP gained +17.9% as cities reopened and Beijing pledged additional infrastructure stimulus and liquidity injections. Steel rose +18.9%, ranking 16th of 31 — exactly at the midpoint — as Power Equipment (+55.9%), Autos (+44.4%), and Metals (+41.5%) led the growth-tilted recovery (growth +6.8pp vs value). Steel underperformed because reopening optimism was concentrated in NEV supply chains and green energy, not construction materials; property demand recovery remained muted despite the reopening.","body_zh":"2022年4月26日低点是上海3月底起封城管控所引发的，停工停产导致钢铁需求深度萎缩。4月底至7月5日上证综指反弹17.9%，各地陆续解封，北京同步承诺加大基建刺激与流动性投入。钢铁上涨18.9%，在31个行业中排名第16位，恰处中游——电力设备（+55.9%）、汽车（+44.4%）、有色金属（+41.5%）领涨，反映本轮复苏以成长风格为主（成长跑赢价值6.8个百分点）。钢铁跑输是因为重开预期集中于新能源车供应链与清洁能源，而非建材；解封后房地产需求复苏依然疲弱。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown lifting reopening","NEV and green energy recovery leadership","PBOC liquidity injection","infrastructure pledge","property recovery still muted"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封经济重开","新能源车与绿色能源领涨","央行流动性投放","基建刺激承诺","地产需求复苏依然疲弱"],"title":"Shanghai lockdown trough: reopening bounce, Steel mid-tier","title_zh":"上海封控筑底：重开经济反弹，钢铁表现居中"},"2022-07-05":{"body":"From July through October 2022, the Fed's most aggressive rate-hike cycle since the 1980s (75bp hikes in June, July, September, and November) sparked a global risk-off episode. China's domestic growth disappointed as property defaults spread and mortgage boycotts erupted in July 2022. The SHCOMP fell -15.0%, with Steel declining -21.4% and ranking 27th of 31. Notably defensives slightly LAGGED cyclicals (-19.1% vs -17.1%) — this was not a clean flight-to-safety but a growth-and-security style tape (growth +9.5pp vs value): Defense (+1.6%), Conglom (+0.9%), and Computers (+0.5%) gained, while commodity cyclicals Bldg Mat (-29.6%) and Metals (-22.4%) led the selloff. Steel's underperformance was driven by both global risk-off and continued domestic property demand destruction.","body_zh":"2022年7月至10月，美联储执行1980年代以来最激进的加息周期（6月、7月、9月、11月各加息75bp），引发全球性风险资产抛售。国内方面，地产违约持续蔓延，2022年7月业主停贷断供风潮爆发。上证综指下跌15.0%，钢铁下跌21.4%，在31个行业中排名第27。值得注意的是，本轮防御板块略微跑输周期板块（-19.1%对比-17.1%），并非纯粹避险，而是成长+安全风格主导（成长跑赢价值9.5个百分点）：国防军工（+1.6%）、综合（+0.9%）、计算机（+0.5%）逆市上涨，建材（-29.6%）和有色金属（-22.4%）领跌大宗商品板块。钢铁跑输源于全球避险与国内地产需求持续恶化的双重压制。","drivers":["Fed 75bp hike cycle global risk-off","China mortgage boycott July 2022","property default contagion","global demand slowdown","growth-and-security style shift"],"drivers_zh":["美联储75bp加息引发全球避险","2022年7月停贷断供风潮","地产违约蔓延","全球需求放缓","成长+安全风格切换"],"title":"Global rate shock and China growth fears resume selloff","title_zh":"全球加息冲击与中国增长忧虑重启跌势"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"On October 31, 2022, the market hit its lows at the end of the 20th Party Congress, then rallied as signals of zero-COVID policy relaxation multiplied: in November Xi began signaling gradual relaxation, and by early December China pivoted away from key COVID restrictions. The SHCOMP gained +15.0% through March 2023, with Food & Bev (+37.5%), Media (+34.6%), and Bldg Mat (+30.4%) leading — predominantly consumer reopen plays rather than industrial demand. Steel gained +20.4%, ranking 12th of 31, a near-market-average result, as reopening expectations boosted construction sentiment but were not yet backed by actual property demand recovery.","body_zh":"2022年10月31日，二十大结束之际市场触底，随后随着清零政策松动信号不断增多而反弹：11月习近平开始释放逐步放开信号，12月初中国正式退出大多数防控措施。上证综指在2023年3月前上涨15.0%，食品饮料（+37.5%）、传媒（+34.6%）、建材（+30.4%）领涨，以消费复苏主线为主，而非工业需求驱动。钢铁上涨20.4%，排名第12，接近市场平均水平，重开预期提振建筑情绪，但实际地产需求复苏尚未兑现。","drivers":["zero-COVID exit signals Nov-Dec 2022","20th Party Congress conclusion sentiment shift","consumer reopening trades (Food/Media)","construction sentiment boost","property demand recovery still unconfirmed"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11月至12月清零退出信号","二十大结束情绪切换","消费复苏交易（食品/传媒）","建筑情绪提振","地产需求复苏尚未确认"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit signals and reopening rally","title_zh":"清零政策退出信号与重开行情"},"2023-03-03":{"body":"From March 2023 through February 2024, China's post-COVID recovery consistently underperformed expectations. Property investment continued to contract sharply and domestic steel demand fell further. China's 2023 steel exports surged 36.2% year-on-year to 90.3 million tonnes, reflecting a flood of cheap, displaced supply into global markets as domestic prices deflated. The SHCOMP fell -18.8%, and Steel fell -28.9%, ranking 14th of 31 — a mid-table selloff in a broad deflationary bear market. Defensives (Coal +0.8%, Banks -3.3%, defensives avg -18.4%) outperformed cyclicals (avg -27.6%), and value beat growth by 8.6pp, a flight-to-safety regime.","body_zh":"2023年3月至2024年2月，中国经济重开后持续低于预期。地产投资持续大幅收缩，国内钢铁需求进一步萎缩。2023年中国钢材出口量同比增长36.2%至9030万吨，低价过剩产能被迫涌入全球市场，国内钢价持续走低。上证综指下跌18.8%，钢铁下跌28.9%，在31个行业中排名第14，在广泛通缩熊市中呈现中位数跌幅。防御板块（煤炭+0.8%、银行-3.3%，均值-18.4%）跑赢周期板块（均值-27.6%），价值风格跑赢成长8.6个百分点，呈现典型避险行情。","drivers":["post-COVID recovery disappointment","property investment contraction","steel export surge +36% YoY 2023","domestic deflation","broad deflationary bear market"],"drivers_zh":["疫后重开预期落空","地产投资收缩","2023年钢材出口同比增长36%","国内通货紧缩","广泛通缩熊市"],"title":"Post-reopen disappointment, deflation, and oversupply bear","title_zh":"重开预期落空、通缩与供应过剩压制钢铁"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The February 2024 low followed extreme pessimism about China's growth trajectory. In early 2024, the State Council launched a large-scale equipment-upgrading and consumer trade-in program, supported by ultra-long special government bonds, which raised forward steel demand expectations in manufacturing. The SHCOMP gained +13.4% through April 2024, and Steel rose +19.1%, ranking 10th of 31 — a respectable mid-upper showing. Metals (+40.0%), Autos (+27.8%), and Telecoms (+25.4%) led cyclicals, while Steel benefited from the industrial demand narrative even though property continued to contract. Risk-on cyclical rotation dominated (cyclicals avg +18.5% vs defensives +9.4%).","body_zh":"2024年2月低点形成于市场对中国增长路径极度悲观之际。2024年初国务院推出大规模设备更新与消费品以旧换新行动计划，并以超长期特别国债提供支持，提振制造业用钢需求预期。上证综指在4月前上涨13.4%，钢铁上涨19.1%，在31个行业中排名第10，表现可圈可点。有色金属（+40.0%）、汽车（+27.8%）、通信（+25.4%）领涨，钢铁受益于工业需求叙事，尽管地产仍在收缩。风险偏好周期轮动主导行情（周期均值+18.5%，远超防御+9.4%）。","drivers":["State Council equipment-upgrade & trade-in program","industrial steel demand narrative","cyclical risk-on rotation","SHCOMP +13.4% broad rally","manufacturing capex optimism"],"drivers_zh":["国务院设备更新与以旧换新计划","工业用钢需求叙事","周期板块风险偏好轮动","上证综指+13.4%普涨","制造业资本开支乐观情绪"],"title":"NPC equipment-upgrade stimulus triggers cyclical relief rally","title_zh":"设备更新刺激政策引发周期板块修复行情"},"2024-04-19":{"body":"From April through September 2024, iron ore prices fell over 20%, among the worst-performing industrial commodities of the year. China's property sector — accounting for a large share of domestic steel consumption — remained mired in contraction with no meaningful recovery despite stimulus pledges. A steel export surge (2024 exports hit an all-time high above 110 million tonnes) triggered anti-dumping investigations across Southeast Asia, the EU and other regions, threatening the export safety valve. The SHCOMP fell -11.4% and Steel collapsed -24.6%, ranking dead last (31st of 31), with Brokers (+0.5%) and Real Estate (-3.9%) relatively leading in a risk-averse, policy-anticipation tape. Steel's extreme underperformance reflected its dual vulnerability: no domestic demand recovery and no export pricing power.","body_zh":"2024年4月至9月，铁矿石价格下跌逾20%，为全年表现最差的工业大宗商品之一。占国内钢铁消费较大份额的房地产行业在多番刺激承诺下仍未有效复苏。钢材出口激增（2024年出口创历史新高，超1.1亿吨）在东南亚、欧盟等地引发大范围反倾销调查，出口渠道面临收窄压力。上证综指下跌11.4%，钢铁板块暴跌24.6%，在31个行业中排名倒数第一，券商（+0.5%）和房地产（-3.9%）相对领先，市场整体呈现避险+政策预期交织的观望格局。钢铁的极端跑输折射其双重困境：国内需求无法复苏，出口也无定价权。","drivers":["iron ore -20% 2024 weak commodity","property sector demand stagnant","anti-dumping investigations Southeast Asia/EU","export pricing power collapse","Steel ranked last 31/31"],"drivers_zh":["铁矿石2024年下跌逾20%","地产行业需求持续萎缩","东南亚/欧盟反倾销调查升温","出口定价权崩溃","钢铁在31个行业中垫底"],"title":"Iron ore collapse, anti-dumping duties, property glut: Steel worst","title_zh":"铁矿石价格崩塌、反倾销税升级与地产积压：钢铁垫底"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a landmark stimulus package: a 50bp RRR reduction (releasing ~CNY 1 trillion liquidity), a 20bp cut to the 7-day repo rate, a CNY 500bn securities/fund/insurer swap facility, and an initial CNY 300bn refinancing facility for stock buybacks. The CSI 300 posted its biggest single-day gain since 2020, and the SHCOMP surged +53.9% through March 2026. Steel rose +89.5%, ranking 12th of 31, as the broad cyclical beta trade dominated (cyclicals avg +76.8% vs defensives +23.0%) and growth outpaced value by 44.4pp. Despite structural steel demand headwinds, the sector re-rated on the stimulus narrative and improving social-financing data.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，中国人民银行行长潘功胜宣布重磅刺激一揽子方案：存款准备金率下调50bp（释放约1万亿元流动性）、7天逆回购利率下调20bp、5000亿元证券基金保险互换便利及首期3000亿元股票回购增持再贷款。沪深300单日涨幅创2020年以来最大，上证综指在2026年3月前累计上涨53.9%。钢铁上涨89.5%，在31个行业中排名第12，宏观周期贝塔行情主导（周期均值+76.8%，远超防御+23.0%），成长跑赢价值44.4个百分点。尽管钢铁需求结构性压力未解，板块仍受益于刺激政策叙事与社会融资数据改善而大幅重估。","drivers":["PBOC Sep 24 2024 bazooka (50bp RRR + 20bp repo cut + ~CNY 1tr liquidity)","CNY 500bn swap facility","SHCOMP +53.9% broad bull","cyclical beta re-rating","growth vs value 44.4pp tilt"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日一揽子政策（降准50bp+逆回购降息20bp+释放约万亿流动性）","5000亿互换便利","上证综指+53.9%大涨","周期贝塔重估","成长跑赢价值44.4个百分点"],"title":"PBOC September 924 bazooka ignites 89% steel cyclical surge","title_zh":"央行九月\"一揽子\"924政策点火，钢铁暴涨89%"},"2026-03-02":{"body":"From March 2026 the SHCOMP fell -3.7% but Steel crashed -31.6%, dead last of 31 sectors, as capital rotated sharply into Electronics (+58.1%) and Telecoms (+56.0%) riding Beijing's AI dominance push and the domestic-chip investment wave. US tariff barriers on Chinese steel intensified — the Trump administration re-strengthened and expanded Section 232 metals tariffs in 2026 — and a global anti-dumping enforcement surge squeezed the export safety valve. Domestic property remained in its fifth year of contraction with no construction-demand recovery. With growth outpacing value by 19.1pp, the tape punished old-economy commodity cyclicals — especially Steel — and rewarded tech infrastructure.","body_zh":"2026年3月起，上证综指下跌3.7%，而钢铁板块重挫31.6%，在31个行业中排名倒数第一，资金大举流入借力北京AI主导战略与国产芯片投资浪潮的电子（+58.1%）和通信（+56.0%）。美国对华钢铁关税壁垒强化——特朗普政府2026年重新加码并扩大232条款金属关税——与全球反倾销执法收紧共同压缩出口空间。国内房地产进入下行第五年，建筑用钢需求复苏遥遥无期。成长风格跑赢价值19.1个百分点，市场持续惩罚旧经济大宗商品周期股，尤其是钢铁板块。","drivers":["Beijing AI strategy tech capital rotation","US Section 232 metals tariffs re-strengthened 2026","global anti-dumping enforcement on Chinese steel","property sector fifth year contraction","growth vs value 19.1pp growth dominance"],"drivers_zh":["北京AI战略引发科技资金轮动","美国2026年重新加码232条款金属关税","全球反倾销执法收紧","地产行业下行第五年","成长跑赢价值19.1个百分点"],"title":"AI tech rotation and trade war squeeze: Steel worst again","title_zh":"AI科技轮动与贸易战施压：钢铁再度垫底"}},"now":"Steel (801040) is in a confirmed Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, down -19.6% over the current window and ranked 27th out of 31 Shenwan industries, deep in the laggard bucket. The tape is a growth-rotated risk-on rally: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) are dominating as Beijing's AI/tech five-year plan directs capital into new productive forces, while cyclicals broadly flat-line (+0.3% avg vs defensives -12.1%) and Steel is squeezed by four simultaneous headwinds: a property sector now in its fifth year of contraction, record export volumes facing escalating anti-dumping duties in the EU and Southeast Asia, intensifying US tariff barriers on Chinese steel (Section 232 metals tariffs were re-strengthened in 2026), and capital fleeing old-economy names into AI infrastructure. The sector sits at 0.3x of its cycle range, below its 200-day moving average, with no buy signal, yet the bottoming label and low cycle position suggest the risk/reward is beginning to shift.","now_zh":"钢铁（801040）截至2026年6月底处于确认的\"筑底\"阶段，当前窗口累计下跌19.6%，在申万31个行业中排名第27位，深陷落后板块。当前市场呈现成长风格主导的风险偏好行情：电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）借北京AI/科技五年规划之势领涨，周期股整体表现平淡（均值+0.3%，对比防御板块-12.1%），而钢铁同时承受四重压力——房地产行业进入下行周期第五年、出口量创历史新高但欧盟与东南亚反倾销税持续升级、对美出口面临关税壁垒强化（2026年美国重新加码232条款金属关税），以及资金加速从旧经济流向AI基础设施赛道。该板块处于周期区间的0.3倍分位，低于200日均线，尚无买入信号，但筑底标签与低位周期分位显示赔率正在改善。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801050":{"legs":{"2012-01-05":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR twice in late 2011 (Nov 30 and Dec 5), injecting ~800bn CNY of liquidity and reversing a two-year tightening cycle. By early 2012, infrastructure-driven copper restocking and stabilization of LME copper around $7,500/t catalyzed a broad cyclical recovery. Nonferrous Metals ranked #1/16 (+40.9%) far ahead of the SHCOMP (+14.0%), with cyclicals dominating defensives (25.3% vs 17.4%) — the move was genuine sector outperformance, not pure beta.","body_zh":"人民银行2011年11月30日及12月5日两次下调存款准备金率，合计释放逾8000亿元流动性，逆转两年紧缩周期。2012年初，基建需求驱动铜锌补库，LME铜价稳于7500美元/吨附近。有色金属板块以+40.9%登顶申万16个一级行业之首，远超上证综指+14.0%，周期股整体跑赢防御股（25.3% vs 17.4%），属真实行业超额而非纯贝塔驱动。","drivers":["PBOC RRR easing","infrastructure restocking","copper price stabilization","cyclical rotation"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准放流动性","基建铜锌补库","LME铜价企稳","周期板块轮动"],"title":"PBOC RRR cuts spark cyclical rebound","title_zh":"央行降准驱动有色强势反弹"},"2012-05-08":{"body":"After the May 2012 peak, China's PMI deteriorated (HSBC flash PMI fell to 48.7 in May) and global recession fears intensified, driving LME copper from ~$8,300/t to ~$7,000/t by Q3. Nonferrous Metals ranked #14/16 (-29.2%) — worst in the cyclical cohort — while defensives like Pharma (-9.3%) and Utilities (-14.2%) held up far better as SHCOMP fell -20.0%. The move reflected a classic flight-to-safety rotation within a broad risk-off tape, not sector-specific news.","body_zh":"5月高点后，汇丰制造业PMI跌至48.7的收缩区间，全球衰退忧虑升温，LME铜价从约8300美元/吨跌至7000美元/吨附近。有色金属排名第14/16（-29.2%），是周期类跌幅最深板块；防御性医药（-9.3%）、公用事业（-14.2%）大幅跑赢，上证综指下跌20.0%。典型的风险规避轮动，非板块个体因素所致。","drivers":["PMI deterioration","global recession fears","copper price drop","risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["PMI持续下行","全球衰退预期","铜价大幅下跌","避险轮动"],"title":"China slowdown hits cyclicals hardest","title_zh":"中国经济放缓周期股跌幅最深"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"The Xi Jinping leadership transition (18th Party Congress, Nov 8, 2012) reignited expectations of a new round of infrastructure and urbanization stimulus, sending SHCOMP up 24.1% in just two months. Nonferrous Metals gained 26.0% but ranked only 9th/16 — the rally was primarily an index beta lift rather than sector-specific outperformance, with Chemicals (+33.8%) and Pharma (+31.1%) leading. Growth outpaced value by 5.5pp, suggesting a broad liquidity-driven rather than commodity-led move.","body_zh":"2012年11月党的十八大顺利完成权力交接，市场对新一轮基建与城镇化刺激政策形成强烈预期，上证综指两个月内暴涨24.1%。有色金属上涨26.0%但仅排名第9/16，化工（+33.8%）、医药（+31.1%）居前，成长/价值溢价5.5pp，本轮反弹以市场整体贝塔修复为主，非有色商品主导。","drivers":["leadership transition stimulus expectations","urbanization theme","index beta","liquidity injection"],"drivers_zh":["政治换届刺激预期","城镇化主题","市场贝塔修复","流动性宽松"],"title":"New leadership stimulus expectations rally","title_zh":"新领导层刺激预期驱动反弹"},"2013-02-08":{"body":"China's June 2013 interbank liquidity crisis (overnight SHIBOR spiked to 13.44% on June 20 as PBOC withheld repo operations to restrain shadow banking) triggered a brutal credit crunch across cyclical sectors. Combined with the Bernanke taper signal (June 19) and a sharp drop in copper demand expectations, Nonferrous Metals ranked dead last #16/16 (-34.3%) while defensives (Electronics +11.0%, Pharma +4.8%) strongly outperformed. Growth beat value by a massive 35.9pp as investors rotated to defensive growth quality names.","body_zh":"2013年6月20日，银行间隔夜SHIBOR飙至13.44%，人民银行主动收紧流动性以遏制影子银行扩张，叠加美联储主席伯南克6月19日发出Taper信号，市场陷入双重信用冲击。有色金属垫底（第16/16，-34.3%），防御性成长股（电子+11.0%、医药+4.8%）大幅跑赢，成长/价值溢价高达35.9pp，资金转向高质量防御成长。","drivers":["SHIBOR spike/credit crunch","PBOC shadow-banking squeeze","Bernanke taper signal","copper demand slump"],"drivers_zh":["SHIBOR暴涨/信用收缩","央行整顿影子银行","美联储Taper预期冲击","铜需求预期恶化"],"title":"SHIBOR shock and credit crunch crush metals","title_zh":"SHIBOR飙升信用收缩重创有色"},"2013-07-08":{"body":"After the June 2013 credit crunch trough, the State Council announced targeted mini-stimulus measures in July (railway spending, tax relief for small firms) and the PBOC confirmed it would maintain adequate liquidity. LME copper rebounded from ~$6,600/t to ~$7,200/t. Nonferrous Metals gained 20.3%, ranking 6th/16 — cyclicals broadly outpaced defensives (20.4% vs 6.3%) with SHCOMP +14.5%, suggesting this was a broad risk-on beta recovery rather than metals-specific strength.","body_zh":"2013年7月，国务院宣布定向微刺激（铁路投资、小微企业减税），人民银行确认维持充裕流动性，LME铜价从约6600美元/吨反弹至7200美元/吨。有色金属上涨20.3%，排名第6/16，周期股整体跑赢防御股（20.4% vs 6.3%），上证综指+14.5%，属信用危机后整体风险偏好修复，非有色板块独立行情。","drivers":["State Council mini-stimulus","PBOC liquidity assurance","copper price bounce","risk-on recovery"],"drivers_zh":["国务院定向微刺激","央行流动性承诺","铜价阶段反弹","风险偏好修复"],"title":"Mini-stimulus and copper restocking bounce","title_zh":"定向刺激+铜价反弹引发修复行情"},"2013-09-11":{"body":"From September 2013, new property restriction policies (State Council 'National Five Rules' implementation) and rising credit costs weighed on China's construction-driven metal demand. Nonferrous Metals fell -20.5%, ranking #15/16, as the market rotated sharply into growth/tech themes — defensives outpaced cyclicals (-4.2% vs -15.8%), and Electronics (+4.8%) and Appliances (+15.3%) led the Shenwan universe while SHCOMP fell -11.2%. The growth/value spread widened 19.4pp, confirming a structural style shift away from commodities.","body_zh":"2013年9月，'国五条'细则落地叠加信贷成本上升，压制建筑类金属需求预期。有色金属下跌20.5%，排名第15/16，市场明显向成长/科技切换——防御股跑赢周期股（-4.2% vs -15.8%），电子（+4.8%）、家电（+15.3%）居前，上证综指-11.2%，成长/价值溢价扩至19.4pp，资金系统性远离商品板块。","drivers":["property restriction policies","credit cost rises","growth/tech rotation","risk-off selloff"],"drivers_zh":["楼市调控政策收紧","融资成本攀升","科技成长板块轮动","风险规避抛售"],"title":"Property curbs and growth rotation hurt metals","title_zh":"楼市调控与成长轮动打压有色"},"2014-01-20":{"body":"From January 2014 through June 2015, the PBOC began a formal easing cycle (five rate cuts between Nov 2014 and Aug 2015, two RRR cuts), and margin-financed retail speculation drove SHCOMP up 159.5%. Nonferrous Metals gained 167.8% — above the index but ranked only #21/28 as Steel (+257.7%), Transport (+259.5%), and Textiles (+262.6%) captured more of the cyclical rotation. The move was primarily a beta lift in a leverage-driven broad bull market rather than a commodity-fundamentals story.","body_zh":"2014年1月至2015年6月，人民银行开启正式宽松周期（五次降息、两次降准），融资融券余额快速扩张，上证综指暴涨159.5%。有色金属上涨167.8%，但仅排名第21/28，钢铁（+257.7%）、交运（+259.5%）、纺织（+262.6%）涨幅更大。本轮行情本质是杠杆驱动的全市场贝塔扩张，并非铜铝商品基本面改善。","drivers":["PBOC rate/RRR cutting cycle","margin financing leverage","retail speculation","broad bull market beta"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准宽松周期","融资融券杠杆扩张","散户投机盛行","全市场贝塔驱动"],"title":"Margin-fueled A-share bull lifts all cyclicals","title_zh":"杠杆牛市驱动有色同步上涨"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the CSRC released draft rules tightening shadow-financed margin accounts, triggering a cascade of forced deleveraging as margin accounts hit their leverage limits. Within four weeks, SHCOMP fell -32.1% and Nonferrous Metals plunged -46.3%, ranking #25/28. Defensives (Banks -10.6%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-43.0%), with the value/defensive tilt of 6.0pp reflecting institutional flight to lower-beta names. The Government launched rescue measures by July 4-6 (halting IPOs, suspending stock-selling restrictions on major funds) but these took weeks to stabilize.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会发布场外配资清理规定草案，触发大规模强制去杠杆。上证综指四周内暴跌32.1%，有色金属重挫46.3%，排名第25/28。银行（-10.6%）等防御板块远跑赢周期股（-43.0%），价值/防御风格溢价6.0pp，机构资金全面转向低贝塔品种。政府7月4-6日启动救市（暂停IPO、限售等），但市场稳定需数周之久。","drivers":["CSRC margin regulation shock","forced deleveraging cascade","risk-off crash","bubble burst"],"drivers_zh":["证监会场外配资监管冲击","强制去杠杆连锁反应","全市场风险规避崩盘","流动性泡沫破裂"],"title":"Leverage-bubble burst triggers mass selloff","title_zh":"杠杆泡沫破裂引发有色崩盘"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"The Chinese government's emergency stabilization measures — halting IPOs, allowing pension funds and the 'National Team' (China Securities Finance Corporation) to purchase stocks, and PBOC rate cuts — triggered a powerful short-covering and position rebuilding rally. Nonferrous Metals gained 31.3%, ranking 10th/28, while Coal (+104.4%) and Defense (+78.0%) led on relief buying. Cyclicals outperformed defensives (37.1% vs 16.8%) as SHCOMP recovered 13.9%, a pure government-intervention-driven bounce rather than fundamental improvement.","body_zh":"政府出台紧急稳市措施：暂停IPO、允许养老金与中国证券金融公司（'国家队'）入市购股、人民银行降息。有色金属上涨31.3%，排名第10/28，煤炭（+104.4%）、国防（+78.0%）领涨。周期股跑赢防御股（37.1% vs 16.8%），上证综指反弹13.9%，纯属政府干预驱动的反弹，基本面并未实质改善。","drivers":["government rescue package","National Team buying","short-covering","PBOC rate cuts"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市托底","证金公司大规模买入","空头回补","央行降息配合"],"title":"Government rescue triggers short-cover bounce","title_zh":"国家队救市引发空头回补反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC unexpectedly devalued the CNY by ~1.9% in a single day (the largest single-day move since 1994), triggering global capital flight fears and a commodity rout. 'Black Monday' on August 24 saw SHCOMP fall 8.5% intraday. Nonferrous Metals fell -34.0%, ranking #22/28, while Banks (-3.5%) held up best as defensives outperformed cyclicals (-20.6% vs -32.9%). This was the classic risk-off/FX-shock rotation pattern, with metals bearing the brunt of foreign demand uncertainty.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行突然将人民币贬值约1.9%（1994年以来单日最大贬幅），引发全球资本外流恐慌与大宗商品暴跌。8月24日'黑色星期一'上证综指盘中跌逾8.5%。有色金属下跌34.0%，排名第22/28，银行（-3.5%）等防御板块远跑赢周期股（-20.6% vs -32.9%），为典型的汇率冲击下的风险规避轮动。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock","capital flight fears","commodity rout","FX-driven risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["人民币突然大幅贬值","资本外流恐慌","大宗商品暴跌","汇率冲击引发风险规避"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock triggers second crash","title_zh":"人民币突然贬值引发二次冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"From mid-September to December 2015, the PBOC continued cutting (6th rate cut on Oct 23 to 4.35%, 5th RRR cut on Oct 23 to 17.5%), injecting liquidity and underpinning a growth/tech-led recovery. SHCOMP gained 21.5% but Nonferrous Metals (+41.5%, #14/28) underperformed Computers (+63.8%), Electronics (+53.1%), and Telecoms (+51.6%), as investors rotated to 'Internet Plus' and 'Made in China 2025' tech themes rather than commodity plays. Growth beat value by 16.9pp, confirming the style bias.","body_zh":"2015年9月至12月，人民银行持续宽松（10月23日第六次降息至4.35%、第五次降准至17.5%），流动性注入支撑市场回暖，但轮动主线转向'互联网+'与'中国制造2025'科技主题。计算机（+63.8%）、电子（+53.1%）、通信（+51.6%）领涨，有色金属（+41.5%）仅排名第14/28。成长/价值溢价16.9pp，确认风格偏向科技成长而非大宗商品。","drivers":["PBOC rate/RRR cuts","tech/growth style leadership","Internet Plus policy theme","liquidity rebound"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准持续宽松","科技成长板块主导","'互联网+'政策主题","流动性驱动修复"],"title":"Liquidity rebound with growth-sector leadership","title_zh":"流动性反弹但成长板块主导轮动"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"China's January 4-7, 2016 circuit breaker debacle (market halted after 15-minute, 7% drop on both days) amplified the early-year selloff that began in late December 2015. Concurrent PBOC daily yuan fixings were weakening the CNY, rekindling August devaluation fears. Nonferrous Metals fell -32.8%, ranking #23/28, as the broad market sold off (SHCOMP -27.3%) with defensives (Banks -17.1%) outperforming cyclicals (-30.9%). The circuit breaker mechanism was scrapped on January 8 after accelerating panic selling.","body_zh":"2016年1月4-7日，熔断机制两度在15分钟内触发7%停盘线，制度设计缺陷反而加速恐慌性抛售，叠加人民币中间价持续走弱重燃贬值预期。有色金属下跌32.8%，排名第23/28，上证综指重挫27.3%，防御性银行（-17.1%）跑赢周期股（-30.9%）。熔断机制于1月8日紧急叫停。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic","CNY fixing weakness","devaluation fears","broad risk-off crash"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制触发市场恐慌","人民币中间价持续走弱","贬值预期重燃","全市场风险规避抛售"],"title":"Circuit breaker panic, yuan fixing pressure","title_zh":"熔断机制恐慌与人民币贬值双重冲击"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"China's 2016 Supply-Side Structural Reform (SSSR) — officially launched with State Council documents in February 2016 — targeted capacity cuts in steel and aluminum (PBOC also cut RRR on Feb 29). LME copper and SHFE aluminum rallied on supply constraint hopes, and Nonferrous Metals ranked #1/28 (+53.2%) over a six-month span, outperforming dramatically even as SHCOMP rose only 15.3%. The supply-reform narrative specifically benefited copper and aluminum miners, not just the index. Food & Bev (+41.4%) and Electronics (+33.6%) were the next-best performers.","body_zh":"2016年2月国务院正式颁布供给侧结构性改革方案，明确钢铁、铝等行业去产能目标，同日人民银行亦下调存款准备金率。LME铜与沪铝因供给收缩预期大涨，有色金属板块以+53.2%登顶申万28个行业之首，上证综指同期仅涨15.3%。本轮行情属供给侧逻辑驱动的独立超额，非市场贝塔。","drivers":["supply-side structural reform","aluminum/copper capacity cuts","PBOC RRR cut Feb 2016","commodity reflation"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革正式启动","铝铜产能去化预期","人民银行2016年2月降准","大宗商品再通胀"],"title":"Supply-side reform launches metals as top leader","title_zh":"供给侧结构性改革推升有色登顶"},"2016-07-13":{"body":"After the supply-reform rally peak in July 2016, Nonferrous Metals entered an 11-month correction (-21.3%, #25/28) as markets repriced the pace of capacity cuts and copper demand disappointed amid a tepid property market. Critically, the Shenwan tape rotated sharply to value/defensives — Appliances (+19.7%), Construction (+15.2%), and Bldg Mat (+10.5%) led — while growth stocks (Computers -24.3%, Defense -25.2%, Media -26.6%) also fell, reflecting a pure value-defensive rotation. Growth/value spread was -17.6pp (value led by 17.6pp), leaving commodity-growth plays stranded.","body_zh":"供给侧改革行情于2016年7月触顶后，有色金属进入长达11个月的调整（-21.3%，排名第25/28）。市场重新评估去产能节奏，铜需求在楼市温和背景下不及预期。申万行业轮动明显偏向价值/防御——家电（+19.7%）、建筑（+15.2%）、建材（+10.5%）领涨，价值/成长溢价高达17.6pp，大宗商品成长股遭冷落。","drivers":["supply-reform pace disappointment","value/defensive rotation","copper demand softness","growth-to-value style shift"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革节奏低于预期","价值/防御板块轮动","铜需求疲软","成长转价值风格切换"],"title":"Post-reform fatigue, tech/value rotation headwind","title_zh":"改革红利兑现后周期股进入调整"},"2017-06-01":{"body":"From June to September 2017, China's SSSR moved from announcement to enforcement — Shandong province alone shut down 3.21 million t/yr of illegal aluminum capacity at end-July, with Weiqiao and Xinfa groups reporting completion in early August. LME aluminum surged ~30% and copper rallied ~20% in the period. Nonferrous Metals ranked #1/28 (+50.6%), far ahead of Steel (+34.9%) and Chemicals (+18.2%), in a tight 3-month window where cyclicals beat defensives (16.0% vs 6.3%) against a SHCOMP +9.1% backdrop.","body_zh":"2017年6月至9月，供给侧改革从政策部署转入执法阶段——山东省7月底强制关停321万吨/年违规铝产能，魏桥集团、信发集团8月初完成整改。LME铝价同期涨约30%，铜价涨约20%。有色金属以+50.6%强势登顶申万28个行业之首，遥遥领先钢铁（+34.9%），周期股跑赢防御股（16.0% vs 6.3%），为供给驱动的真实板块超额行情。","drivers":["aluminum capacity enforcement closures","LME aluminum/copper surge","Shandong illegal smelter shutdown","global reflation"],"drivers_zh":["铝业产能强制关停落地","LME铝铜价格飙涨","山东违规铝厂停产","全球再通胀交易"],"title":"Supply-cut execution and global reflation peak","title_zh":"产能关停落地叠加全球再通胀推升有色"},"2017-09-13":{"body":"From September 2017 through October 2018, Nonferrous Metals collapsed -51.4% (ranked #27/28), the worst sustained drawdown in the dataset. Three overlapping shocks drove this: (1) China's domestic deleveraging campaign (financial regulation tightening across shadow banking, asset management, WMP products, launched in late 2017); (2) the US-China trade war — Section 232 aluminum/steel tariffs announced March 2018, followed by 25% tariffs on $34bn of Chinese goods (June 6, 2018), with Beijing retaliating and escalating; (3) LME copper fell from ~$7,200/t to ~$5,700/t. Defensives (Food & Bev +2.7%, Coal flat) strongly outperformed as SHCOMP fell -26.5%.","body_zh":"2017年9月至2018年10月，有色金属暴跌51.4%（排名第27/28），为数据集中最深持续跌幅。三重冲击叠加：①国内金融去杠杆（2017年底启动影子银行、资管、理财严监管）；②中美贸易战升级（2018年3月Section 232铝钢关税、6月对340亿美元中国商品征25%关税，中方反制）；③LME铜价从约7200跌至5700美元/吨。食品饮料（+2.7%）、煤炭（持平）等防御板块逆势跑赢，上证综指跌幅26.5%。","drivers":["US-China trade war escalation","Section 232 tariffs","domestic deleveraging campaign","copper price collapse"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易战关税升级","232条款铝钢关税制裁","国内金融去杠杆监管收紧","铜价大幅下跌"],"title":"US-China trade war and deleveraging crush sector","title_zh":"贸易战与去杠杆双重冲击引发深度下跌"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"After October 2018's SHCOMP trough (lowest since early 2014), Beijing executed a sharp policy pivot: the Oct 19 'Five Arrows' speech by PBOC, CBIRC, CSRC and NDRC chiefs pledged equity market support; the Politburo on Oct 31 signaled tax cuts and domestic demand support. Nonferrous Metals gained 40.6% (ranked 14th/28) over the subsequent six months, underperforming Agriculture (+74.9%) and tech/growth plays (Computers +60.3%) that benefited most from trade-truce and domestic demand narrative. SHCOMP +30.5%, growth beat value by 15.4pp.","body_zh":"2018年10月18日前后，上证综指触及阶段性低点，北京随即大力度政策转向：10月19日央行、银保监、证监、发改四部门'一行两会'联合表态托市；10月31日政治局会议释放减税与内需支撑信号。有色金属随后六个月上涨40.6%（第14/28），跑输农业（+74.9%）和科技成长（计算机+60.3%），上证综指+30.5%，成长/价值溢价15.4pp，本轮以政策驱动的风险偏好修复为主。","drivers":["policy pivot 'Five Arrows'","trade truce optimism","PBOC easing re-start","domestic demand stimulus"],"drivers_zh":["'五箭齐发'政策急转向","中美贸易停火乐观预期","人民银行重启宽松","国内需求刺激预期"],"title":"Policy pivot and Phase One deal hope rally","title_zh":"政策转向与贸易谈判预期驱动反弹"},"2019-04-08":{"body":"After the Phase One optimism peaked in April 2019, the US-China trade war re-escalated sharply: on May 10, 2019, the US raised tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, and China retaliated in kind. Copper fell on fears of slowed global industrial activity. Nonferrous Metals fell -23.1% (ranked #24/28) as defensives held up far better (Food & Bev +17.1%, Electronics +10.6% — partly on tech substitution themes). SHCOMP fell -10.9% with defensives virtually flat (-0.1%), a clear flight-to-safety rotation.","body_zh":"2019年5月10日，美国将对2000亿美元中国商品加征关税从10%提高至25%，中方随即对等报复，贸易战急剧升温。铜价因全球工业活动放缓预期而承压。有色金属下跌23.1%（第24/28），食品饮料（+17.1%）、电子（+10.6%，受科技替代主题支撑）大幅跑赢，防御股整体接近持平（-0.1%），上证综指跌10.9%，典型避险轮动。","drivers":["US tariff escalation May 2019","trade war re-intensification","copper demand fears","defensive rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月美方大幅提高关税","贸易战再度急剧升级","铜需求预期恶化","防御性板块轮动"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation deflates industrial metals","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级打压工业金属"},"2019-11-15":{"body":"From November 2019, optimism around the Phase One US-China trade deal signing (ultimately signed Jan 15, 2020) and early EV/new-energy themes (China NEV sales recovering and battery metal demand) lifted risk appetite. Nonferrous Metals gained 27.8% (ranked 4th/28), with growth themes (Electronics +44.3%, Computers +34.2%, Power Eqp +30.6%) also surging. The SHCOMP rose only 5.1%, meaning Nonferrous outperformed substantially in absolute terms, riding both macro relief and early energy-transition metal narratives.","body_zh":"2019年11月起，中美第一阶段贸易协议签署预期（最终2020年1月15日落地）提振风险偏好，叠加中国新能源汽车销售回暖、电池金属需求主题升温。有色金属上涨27.8%（第4/28），电子（+44.3%）、计算机（+34.2%）、电力设备（+30.6%）同步领涨，上证综指仅涨5.1%，有色在贝塔之上实现明显超额，同时受益于宏观缓和与能源转型金属双重叙事。","drivers":["Phase One deal optimism","NEV/battery metal demand","trade truce relief","growth + commodity confluence"],"drivers_zh":["中美第一阶段协议签署预期","新能源汽车/电池金属需求主题","贸易摩擦缓和利好","宏观改善与商品需求共振"],"title":"Phase One signing hopes and EV metal demand lift","title_zh":"第一阶段协议签署预期与新能源金属需求共振"},"2020-02-21":{"body":"As COVID-19 spread beyond China in late February 2020, the WHO declared a pandemic risk and global industrial activity forecasts collapsed. LME copper fell from ~$5,800/t (Feb 21) to ~$4,600/t by March 23 — a 21% drop. Nonferrous Metals fell -21.6% (ranked #27/28 — second worst only to Electronics), while 'defensive' Coal (0%) and Bldg Mat (-1.0%) held up on domestic supply resilience. SHCOMP fell -12.5% with a relatively undifferentiated selloff, but Nonferrous underperformed on both demand-shock (global factory shutdowns) and China-specific copper fabrication disruption.","body_zh":"2020年2月下旬新冠疫情蔓延至海外，世卫组织宣布全球大流行风险，全球工业活动预期骤降。LME铜价从5800美元/吨（2月21日）跌至4600美元/吨（3月23日）。有色金属下跌21.6%（第27/28位），煤炭（0%）、建材（-1.0%）凭借国内供给韧性相对抗跌，上证综指跌12.5%，有色金属因全球工厂停摆与国内铜加工企业停产双重冲击，跌幅大幅跑输大盘。","drivers":["COVID-19 pandemic demand shock","global industrial activity collapse","copper price crash","supply chain disruption"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫情全球大流行需求冲击","全球工业活动预期骤降","铜价大幅下跌","供应链中断"],"title":"COVID-19 global demand shock tanks metals","title_zh":"新冠疫情全球需求冲击拖累有色"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"From the March 2020 COVID trough, a near 12-month, +98.8% rally ensued — the second-largest in the dataset. Three reinforcing drivers: (1) China's V-shaped recovery and infrastructure/green stimulus (the 14th Five-Year Plan energy transition focus, NEV subsidies extended, solar/wind buildout); (2) global central bank liquidity flood (Fed cut to 0%, unlimited QE March 23) underpinning commodity reflation; (3) copper was a direct beneficiary of EV and solar panel demand, LME copper doubled from $4,600/t to over $9,000/t by Feb 2021. Nonferrous ranked #4/28 (+98.8%), trailing only consumer/services plays (Services +173.5%, Food & Bev +124.6%).","body_zh":"2020年3月COVID谷底至2021年2月，有色金属大涨98.8%（数据集内第二大涨幅）。三大驱动共振：①中国V型复苏及绿色基建刺激（十四五能源转型部署、新能源汽车补贴延续、光伏风电装机提速）；②全球央行超级宽松（美联储3月23日降息至零、无限量QE）托举大宗商品；③LME铜价从4600美元/吨飙至逾9000美元/吨，新能源汽车及光伏带动铜需求激增。有色金属排名第4/28，仅次于消费/服务类板块。","drivers":["China green stimulus/NEV policy","14th Five-Year Plan energy transition","global QE commodity reflation","copper/lithium EV demand surge"],"drivers_zh":["中国绿色基建新能源政策","十四五能源转型规划落地","全球量化宽松大宗商品再通胀","铜锂新能源汽车需求激增"],"title":"Green stimulus and copper supercycle kick-off","title_zh":"绿色新基建与全球宽松开启铜超级周期"},"2021-02-22":{"body":"The US 10-year Treasury yield spiked from 1.1% to 1.6% in February-March 2021 (reaching 1.77% by end-March), triggering a global repricing of rate-sensitive assets. China's SHCOMP fell -7.6% as liquidity expectations tightened. Critically, Nonferrous Metals ranked dead last #28/28 (-21.7%) — the worst performer across all 28 Shenwan industries in this brief 30-day period — while Utilities (+13.6%) and Construction (+2.9%) proved defensive. This reflected an extreme mean-reversion from the sector's top-ranked position just days earlier, amplified by overcrowded long positioning.","body_zh":"2021年2-3月，美国10年期国债收益率从1.1%飙至1.77%，全球风险资产重新定价。上证综指下跌7.6%，有色金属以-21.7%位居申万28个行业垫底（第28/28），公用事业（+13.6%）、建筑（+2.9%）凭防御属性相对抗跌。这与数天前有色金属排名行业第一形成剧烈反差，本质为超拥挤多头仓位快速平仓引发的极端均值回归，并非行业基本面恶化。","drivers":["US rates shock","Treasury yield spike","mean-reversion from overcrowded longs","risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美债收益率快速飙升","全球利率冲击","超拥挤多头仓位平仓","风险规避轮动"],"title":"US rates shock triggers commodity rotation out","title_zh":"美债收益率冲击引发有色均值回归"},"2021-03-24":{"body":"From March to September 2021, Nonferrous Metals surged 77.7% to rank #1/28 — the strongest absolute outperformance in the entire dataset over a comparable timeframe. LME copper hit a then-record $10,720/t in May 2021. Drivers: China's 2060 carbon-neutrality target (Sept 2020) was being operationalized through solar/wind buildout and EV mandates; global infrastructure spending expectations (US IIJA bill negotiations); and post-COVID industrial restocking globally. Steel (+65.6%) and Power Eqp (+55.5%) were co-leaders confirming the energy-transition/capex supercycle thesis. Defensives averaged -0.5% vs cyclicals +26.8%.","body_zh":"2021年3月至9月，有色金属大涨77.7%，以第1/28登顶申万全行业，为数据集内同等时间窗口最强超额表现。LME铜2021年5月创历史新高10720美元/吨。驱动因素：2020年9月提出的碳中和2060目标进入落实阶段（光伏风电装机+新能源汽车强制令）；美国基础设施法案谈判推动全球资本开支预期；全球工业后疫情补库。钢铁（+65.6%）、电力设备（+55.5%）共同领涨，印证能源转型/资本开支超级周期逻辑。","drivers":["carbon neutrality capex supercycle","LME copper record $10,720/t","solar/wind/EV demand surge","global infrastructure spending"],"drivers_zh":["碳中和目标驱动资本开支超级周期","LME铜价创历史新高","光伏风电新能源汽车需求爆发","全球基础设施投资预期"],"title":"Carbon neutrality and copper supercycle peak","title_zh":"碳中和叠加铜超级周期推升有色创历史最强涨幅"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"Nonferrous Metals fell -41.6% from September 2021 to April 2022 — one of the worst drawdowns in the dataset — driven by three concurrent shocks: (1) Zero-COVID lockdowns (culminating in the March-June 2022 Shanghai lockdown) destroyed domestic industrial demand, with copper fabricator sales falling 20-30%; (2) The Evergrande/property sector crisis (Evergrande defaulted September 2021) slashed construction-related metal demand; (3) Global Fed rate-hike cycle commenced March 2022, strengthening USD and depressing commodity prices. Coal (+6.7%) and Agriculture (-0.2%) were the only relative safe havens, confirming defensive rotation; Metals ranked #30/31.","body_zh":"2021年9月至2022年4月，有色金属下跌41.6%（第30/31），为数据集内最惨烈跌幅之一。三重冲击叠加：①清零政策（2022年3-6月上海大封控）摧毁国内工业需求，铜加工厂销量同比下滑20-30%；②恒大信用危机（2021年9月违约）大幅压制建筑用金属需求；③美联储2022年3月启动加息周期，美元走强压制大宗商品价格。煤炭（+6.7%）、农业（-0.2%）成为相对避风港，有色金属排名第30/31。","drivers":["Zero-COVID lockdowns","Evergrande property crisis","Fed rate hike cycle","USD strength commodity pressure"],"drivers_zh":["新冠清零政策封控冲击","恒大违约地产危机","美联储加息周期启动","美元走强压制大宗商品"],"title":"Zero-COVID, property crisis and rate shock crush sector","title_zh":"清零政策、地产危机与美联储加息三重压制"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"After the April 2022 SHCOMP trough, China's gradual re-opening from the Shanghai lockdown (June 1, 2022), accompanied by State Council stimulus pledges (May 25: 33-point package targeting infrastructure and consumption), sparked a relief rally. Nonferrous Metals gained 41.5% (ranked #3/31), co-leading with Power Eqp (+55.9%) and Autos (+44.4%) — the growth-cyclical trifecta — as SHCOMP rebounded 17.9%. Growth beat value by 6.8pp; cyclicals outpaced defensives (23.3% vs 15.0%), confirming this was a broad risk-on recovery bounce anchored by the lockdown-exit catalyst.","body_zh":"2022年4月大盘触底后，上海6月1日有序复工复产，叠加国务院5月25日推出33项一揽子稳增长措施（聚焦基建与消费），市场大幅反弹。有色金属上涨41.5%（第3/31），与电力设备（+55.9%）、汽车（+44.4%）共同领涨成长周期三角，上证综指反弹17.9%，成长/价值溢价6.8pp，周期股跑赢防御股（23.3% vs 15.0%），为典型的解封复工驱动全面风险偏好回升。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown exit","33-point State Council stimulus","infrastructure spending pledges","cyclical recovery bounce"],"drivers_zh":["上海封控解除复工复产","国务院33项一揽子稳增长","基础设施投资提速承诺","周期性复苏反弹"],"title":"Shanghai reopening and growth recovery bounce","title_zh":"上海复工与国务院一揽子刺激推动反弹"},"2022-07-05":{"body":"From July to October 2022, aggressive Fed rate hikes (75bps in June, July, September, November) sent LME copper from ~$9,000/t to $7,200/t as recession fears mounted globally. Nonferrous Metals fell -22.4% (ranked #29/31) — among the worst performers — while Defense (+1.6%), Conglom (+0.9%), and Computers (+0.5%) led on defense-spending themes and tech substitution. The growth tilt (9.5pp growth over value) reflects the defensive-tech rotation rather than industrial metal exposure. SHCOMP fell -15.0%.","body_zh":"2022年7月至10月，美联储连续四次加息75基点，全球衰退恐慌加剧，LME铜从约9000美元/吨跌至7200美元/吨。有色金属下跌22.4%（第29/31），国防（+1.6%）、综合（+0.9%）、计算机（+0.5%）等板块凭防御与科技替代主题相对抗跌，成长/价值溢价9.5pp反映防御科技轮动，上证综指下跌15.0%。","drivers":["Fed 75bps rate hikes","global recession fears","LME copper crash to $7,200/t","risk-off growth/defensive rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美联储连续75基点激进加息","全球衰退风险预期","LME铜价跌至7200美元/吨","风险规避防御科技轮动"],"title":"Global recession fears and LME copper crash","title_zh":"美联储激进加息与全球衰退恐慌重创有色"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"The November 2022 reversal was driven by accelerating speculation that China would abandon Zero-COVID, confirmed by the announcement of the '20 Measures' easing COVID rules (Nov 11) and ultimately full policy exit (Dec 7, 2022). SHCOMP rose 13.5% and Nonferrous Metals gained 19.4% (ranked 10th/31) — a mid-table performance reflecting the broad nature of the re-opening bounce. Food & Bev (+36.4%), Brokers (+27.2%), and Bldg Mat (+27.0%) were the biggest beneficiaries. The sector performed as a broad beta play rather than outright commodity leadership.","body_zh":"2022年11月起，市场快速押注中国放弃清零政策，11月11日'二十条'措施落地并于12月7日全面退出清零，上证综指上涨13.5%。有色金属上涨19.4%（第10/31），表现居中，食品饮料（+36.4%）、券商（+27.2%）、建材（+27.0%）受益最大。本轮行情为广谱复苏贝塔，非有色金属专项行情。","drivers":["Zero-COVID '20 Measures' easing","COVID exit speculation","broad re-opening beta","property/consumer relief hopes"],"drivers_zh":["'二十条'清零政策松绑","疫情退出政策预期升温","复苏广谱贝塔反弹","地产/消费复苏预期"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit hopes lift broad market","title_zh":"清零政策退出预期驱动大盘普涨"},"2023-02-01":{"body":"From February 2023 to February 2024, Nonferrous Metals fell -36.5% (ranked #23/31) in a protracted bear driven by: (1) China's property market deflation deepening — new home prices declined for 16+ consecutive months, gutting construction-related copper/aluminum demand; (2) Consumer-price deflation (CPI negative in May 2023) signaling demand weakness; (3) The post-re-opening recovery proved tepid rather than the expected V-shape. Defensives (Coal +4.2%, Banks -4.3%, Appliances -7.7%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-26.6%), confirming deep flight-to-safety. Growth/value spread was -6.7pp (value led), reinforcing the defensive rotation.","body_zh":"2023年2月至2024年2月，有色金属下跌36.5%（第23/31），经历近一年漫长熊市，主因：①楼市通缩持续深化（新房价格连续16个月环比下跌），建筑类铜铝需求骤降；②消费物价通缩（2023年5月CPI同比转负）反映内需疲软；③疫情后复苏远弱于预期的V型反弹。防御股（煤炭+4.2%、银行-4.3%、家电-7.7%）远跑赢周期股（-26.6%），成长/价值溢价-6.7pp（价值股领先），深度避险轮动特征显著。","drivers":["property market deflation","CPI deflation demand weakness","tepid re-opening disappointment","defensive/value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["楼市价格持续下跌通缩","CPI转负内需疲软","复苏预期大幅落空","防御/价值板块轮动"],"title":"Property deflation and capex slowdown bear market","title_zh":"地产通缩与需求疲软驱动长达一年的熊市"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"Nonferrous Metals surged 44.9% from February to May 2024, ranked #1/31 — driven by a rare confluence of AI infrastructure copper demand (data center buildout driving copper consumption estimates 18-26% CAGR) and safe-haven gold buying (PBOC officially resumed gold purchases, with gold up 15%+ in the period). LME copper hit $10,000/t for the first time since 2022. Cyclicals outperformed defensives (23.8% vs 15.0%) with SHCOMP +17.4%, but Metals outperformed even that — a sector-specific commodity leadership move amplified by the AI/gold narrative confluence.","body_zh":"2024年2月至5月，有色金属上涨44.9%，以第1/31再度登顶。驱动因素：AI数据中心建设爆发（每兆瓦算力需铜约27-33吨，推动铜需求CAGR预测18-26%）叠加黄金避险需求（人民银行官方恢复增持黄金，黄金同期涨逾15%）。LME铜价重返10000美元/吨。有色金属在周期股跑赢防御股（23.8% vs 15.0%）的大背景下实现更强超额，为AI叙事与黄金安全资产双重逻辑共振的板块专属行情。","drivers":["AI data center copper demand","PBOC gold buying resumption","LME copper hits $10,000/t","commodity supercycle narrative"],"drivers_zh":["AI数据中心铜需求激增","人民银行恢复增持黄金","LME铜价重返10000美元/吨","大宗商品超级周期叙事"],"title":"AI copper demand and gold safe-haven rally","title_zh":"AI铜需求与黄金避险共振推升有色创新高"},"2024-05-20":{"body":"After the May 2024 commodity peak, copper fell from ~$11,000/t to ~$8,800/t by July 2024 as economic data from China disappointed — property investment fell 10%+ YoY and copper fabrication demand weakened. Nonferrous Metals fell -25.7% (ranked #28/31) while Utilities (-7.4%), Brokers (-7.7%), and Electronics (-7.7%) held up best. Defensives (-14.6%) outperformed cyclicals (-20.5%) with SHCOMP -13.7% in a flight-to-safety rotation. The sector was not able to sustain the May 2024 AI/copper confluence at elevated valuations.","body_zh":"2024年5月大宗商品触顶后，LME铜从约11000美元/吨跌至8800美元/吨附近（7月），中国房地产投资同比降幅超10%，铜加工需求走弱。有色金属下跌25.7%（第28/31），公用事业（-7.4%）、券商（-7.7%）、电子（-7.7%）等相对抗跌，防御股（-14.6%）跑赢周期股（-20.5%），上证综指-13.7%，典型的高估值后需求落空引发的避险轮动。","drivers":["copper price reversion from peak","China property investment decline","demand disappointment","defensive flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["铜价高位大幅回调","中国房地产投资持续下滑","需求低于预期失望","防御性板块避险轮动"],"title":"Peak copper fatigue and defensive rotation","title_zh":"铜价高位疲软与避险轮动引发回调"},"2024-09-09":{"body":"From September 9, 2024 to January 29, 2026 — a 16-month, +202.1% mega-rally — Nonferrous Metals ranked #1/31 by a massive margin, driven by a historic confluence: (1) the PBOC's September 24, 2024 'stimulus bazooka' (rate cuts, RRR cut, mortgage support, equity market stabilization fund — CSI300 +16% in the subsequent week); (2) copper reaching a record $13,387/t by January 2026 on AI data center buildout demand; (3) gold surging to $5,000+/oz driven by PBOC gold accumulation (16-month buying streak from November 2024), de-dollarization flows, and Chinese retail speculator participation; (4) lithium battery and rare earth supply security themes. Cyclicals averaged +69.8% vs defensives +20.3%, with SHCOMP +51.9% and growth beat value by 46.4pp.","body_zh":"2024年9月至2026年1月，有色金属16个月累计上涨202.1%，以第1/31傲视群雄，为数据集内最大历史涨幅。四大历史性驱动共振：①2024年9月24日人民银行'一揽子'超强宽松（降息、降准、房贷支持、股市稳定基金，沪深300随后一周暴涨16%）；②LME铜2026年1月刷新历史纪录13387美元/吨（AI数据中心建设需铜每兆瓦27-33吨）；③黄金突破5000美元/盎司（央行持续16个月增持、去美元化资金流、国内散户大举涌入期货市场）；④锂电与稀土供应安全主题。周期股均值+69.8% vs防御股+20.3%，上证综指+51.9%，成长/价值溢价46.4pp。","drivers":["PBOC September 2024 stimulus bazooka","copper record $13,387/t AI demand","gold $5,000/oz PBOC accumulation","rare earth/lithium supply security"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行2024年9月超强一揽子刺激","LME铜创历史纪录AI需求驱动","黄金突破5000美元央行增持+去美元化","稀土锂电供应安全主题升温"],"title":"PBOC stimulus bazooka and AI/gold supercycle","title_zh":"央行放水+AI铜超级周期+黄金破五千美元三重共振"},"2026-01-29":{"body":"The January 2026 peak was a classic speculative blow-off: Chinese retail investors and equity funds had piled into copper ($13,387/t Jan 6 record) and gold ($5,595/oz) futures in a momentum frenzy. The reversal was triggered by USD strengthening (hawkish Kevin Warsh nomination to replace Powell) and Chinese profit-taking that cascaded, with silver falling 26% in a single session (largest single-day drop on record). Nonferrous Metals fell -28.0% (ranked dead last #31/31) while Coal (+14.3%), Utilities (+6.5%), and Power Eqp (+4.3%) led defensively. Defensives (-3.6%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-8.0%) with SHCOMP -8.3%.","body_zh":"2026年1月高点是典型的投机性高潮：国内散户与权益基金大举涌入铜（1月6日创纪录13387美元/吨）和黄金（5595美元/盎司）期货，形成动量狂热。反转导火索为美元走强（特朗普提名鹰派的沃什接任鲍威尔引发货币政策预期转向）及中国投资者集中获利了结形成踩踏——白银单日暴跌26%（史上最大单日跌幅）。有色金属以-28.0%垫底（第31/31），煤炭（+14.3%）、公用事业（+6.5%）、电力设备（+4.3%）领涨，防御股（-3.6%）大幅跑赢周期股（-8.0%），上证综指-8.3%。","drivers":["speculative bubble unwinding","Chinese retail profit-taking cascade","USD hawkish pivot (Warsh nomination)","tariff fears amplification"],"drivers_zh":["投机性泡沫崩溃与踩踏","国内散户集中获利了结","美元鹰派转向（沃什提名）冲击","关税升级恐慌放大跌幅"],"title":"Speculative blow-off reversal and tariff shock","title_zh":"投机性高潮反转与关税冲击引发暴跌"},"2026-03-23":{"body":"From late March to May 11, 2026, a tariff truce and AI infrastructure re-rating catalyzed a recovery in growth-cyclical names. Nonferrous Metals gained 21.9% (ranked 5th/31) as copper and aluminum bounced on the US-China tariff rollback narrative (tariffs cut from 57% to 47% in the period) and resumed AI data center spending. However, leadership was firmly in Electronics (+41.4%) and Telecoms (+38.8%), with growth beating value by 13.2pp and SHCOMP +10.8%, suggesting Nonferrous rode the broad risk-on recovery but did not set the leadership agenda.","body_zh":"2026年3月底至5月11日，中美关税暂停谈判（关税从57%下调至47%）叠加AI基础设施投资重启，成长周期类板块启动修复。有色金属上涨21.9%（第5/31），铜铝价格随关税缓和与数据中心建设恢复而反弹，但主导权在电子（+41.4%）和通信（+38.8%），成长/价值溢价13.2pp，上证综指+10.8%，有色金属属跟随广谱风险偏好回升的反弹，并非本轮行情领涨板块。","drivers":["US-China tariff rollback","AI data center spending resumption","copper/aluminum price recovery","growth-led risk-on recovery"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税暂停谈判利好","AI数据中心建设重启","铜铝价格企稳回升","成长主导的风险偏好回升"],"title":"US-China tariff pause and tech-led recovery","title_zh":"中美关税暂停与科技主导的复苏反弹"}},"now":"Nonferrous Metals (801050) is in a Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, sitting at just 12.3% of its historical percentile rank and below its 200-day moving average. The current window shows the sector ranked 10th/31 with a near-flat -0.5% return while SHCOMP gained +1.6%, underperforming a mildly bullish tape dominated by Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Bldg Mat (+48.1%) in an AI/liquidity-driven market where growth beat value by 18.2pp. Cyclicals averaged +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%, confirming risk-on conditions, yet Nonferrous Metals is not participating in the leadership rotation. The sector sits in a post-blow-off cooling phase after the January 2026 speculative peak — copper hit a record $13,387/t and gold broke $5,000/oz, driven by Chinese retail speculators piling into commodity futures — followed by the sharpest selloff since 2022. With an 81.3% historical return-win rate at trough positioning, asymmetric upside exists if PBOC easing and infrastructure capex re-accelerate copper/aluminum demand, but near-term leadership remains firmly in Electronics/Tech and the sector must reclaim its 200-day moving average to confirm trend resumption.","now_zh":"有色金属（801050）截至2026年6月底处于\"筑底\"阶段，历史分位数仅12.3%，价格跌破200日均线。当前窗口内，板块在全市场31个一级行业中排名第10，绝对回报接近持平（-0.5%），而上证综指同期上涨1.6%，跑输大盘。当前行情由AI/流动性主题主导——电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）领涨，成长/价值风格溢价高达18.2个百分点。周期股整体均值+0.3%优于防御股-12.1%，显示风险偏好尚可，但有色金属未能跟涨。板块正处于2026年1月投机性高点后的冷却阶段——铜价创历史纪录13387美元/吨、黄金破5000美元/盎司（主要由国内散户期货投机推动），随后经历近年最深度回调。当前历史胜率高达81.3%，若央行降准降息与基建发力重新提振铜铝需求，不对称上行空间可观；但短线领涨权仍在科技成长板块，有色须重返200日均线方可确认趋势回归。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801080":{"legs":{"2012-01-05":{"body":"After the PBOC November 2011 RRR cut of 50 bps (first monetary easing in three years), a broad cyclical recovery trade lifted A-shares through early 2012 with SHCOMP +14.3%. Electronics ranked #2/16 at +30.3%, alongside Metals (+37.1%) and Chemicals (+29%) — a market-wide beta re-rating, not a sector-specific catalyst. Cyclicals outperformed defensives (+25.1% vs +17.2%) with a modest growth style tilt (+5.5 pp), consistent with early-cycle equity re-pricing after peak monetary tightening.","body_zh":"2011年11月央行下调存款准备金率50个基点（三年来首次宽松），带动A股于2012年初开启周期性修复行情，上证综指上涨14.3%。电子行业排名第2/16，涨幅30.3%，与有色金属（+37.1%）、化工（+29%）同步——属于大盘贝塔行情而非板块特定催化剂。周期股跑赢防御股（+25.1% vs +17.2%），成长略微领先（+5.5pp），符合货币紧缩顶部过后的早周期股票重新定价特征。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Nov-2011","early-cycle re-rating","cyclical beta","growth style tilt"],"drivers_zh":["央行2011年11月降准","早周期重新定价","周期贝塔","成长风格"],"title":"PBOC easing cyclical beta bounce","title_zh":"央行降准触发周期性贝塔反弹"},"2012-03-13":{"body":"After the January-March rally exhausted itself, A-shares fell into a nine-month bear leg as China GDP growth decelerated from ~9% toward 7.5% and European sovereign debt concerns lingered. SHCOMP fell 20.2% and Electronics dropped 30.6%, ranking #12/16. Defensives outperformed cyclicals (-16.7% vs -23.8%), confirming a risk-off flight-to-safety rotation. Banks, Pharma, and Real Estate held up best while high-beta growth names including Electronics bore the brunt.","body_zh":"1-3月反弹力竭后，A股进入长达9个月的熊市，中国GDP增速从约9%放缓至7.5%目标，欧债危机阴霾持续。上证综指下跌20.2%，电子行业跌30.6%，排名第12/16。防御股跑赢周期股（-16.7% vs -23.8%），确认为风险规避、资金避险的轮动格局。银行、医药、房地产等低贝塔防御板块表现相对抗跌，而包括电子在内的高贝塔成长板块承压最重。","drivers":["China GDP deceleration","European sovereign risk","risk-off flight to safety","cyclicals underperform"],"drivers_zh":["中国GDP增速放缓","欧债风险","风险规避避险","周期股跑输"],"title":"China macro slowdown risk-off selloff","title_zh":"中国宏观下行引发风险规避抛售"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"The SHCOMP bottomed in early December 2012 and embarked on its largest bull market since 2008, ultimately rising 163.6% to June 2015. Electronics surged 376.9% — the #2 performer among 28 sectors — powered by three reinforcing forces: PBOC multi-round easing (RRR and LPR cuts across 2014-15), explosive margin lending growth (broker-financed debt quintupled from CNY 0.4 trillion in June 2014 to CNY 2.2 trillion by mid-2015), and Beijing's 2014 National IC Fund (~USD 21 bn) and May 2015 Made in China 2025 blueprint explicitly targeting semiconductors. Leveraged retail traders concentrated bets in Electronics, Semiconductors, and Telecoms — producing a 2.6-year compound rally that ended only when CSRC announced margin-account crackdown rules on 12 June 2015.","body_zh":"上证综指于2012年12月初见底，随后开启自2008年以来最大的牛市行情，至2015年6月累计涨幅163.6%。电子行业暴涨376.9%，在28个行业中排名第2，由三股合力驱动：央行多轮宽松（2014-15年多次降准降息）、融资融券爆发式增长（融资余额从2014年6月0.4万亿元膨胀至2015年中期2.2万亿元），以及2014年国家集成电路产业投资基金（大基金，约210亿美元）和2015年5月中国制造2025战略明确指向半导体与电子行业。高杠杆散户集中押注于电子、半导体、通信等最高贝塔成长标的，形成长达2.6年的复利行情，直至2015年6月12日证监会宣布收紧融资融券规则方告终结。","drivers":["PBOC multi-round easing 2014-15","margin lending explosion","National IC Fund / Made in China 2025","retail leverage concentration"],"drivers_zh":["央行2014-15年多轮宽松","融资融券爆发","国家集成电路大基金/中国制造2025","散户杠杆集中"],"title":"Margin-fueled tech/growth mega bull run","title_zh":"融资杠杆驱动科技成长超级牛市"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On 12 June 2015, the CSRC released draft rules banning new shadow-financed margin accounts and strengthening oversight of brokerage leverage. A month-long crash began the next trading session: SHCOMP fell 32.1% and Electronics dropped 41.5% (#14/28), slightly better than the worst performers (Defense -52%, Coal -59.1%) but far worse than defensive sectors. Defensives led at -30.4% vs cyclicals -43.0%, confirming forced margin-call deleveraging across the most-leveraged growth segments. High concentration of margin debt in Electronics and Telecoms made them disproportionate sell targets.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会发布草案拟禁止新开伞形信托融资账户并强化杠杆监管，次日开盘即触发长达一个月的暴跌：上证综指下跌32.1%，电子行业下跌41.5%（排名第14/28），略优于军工（-52%）和煤炭（-59.1%），但远差于防御板块。防御股跌幅（-30.4%）明显小于周期股（-43.0%），确认行情为杠杆强制平仓引发的去杠杆行情。电子和通信此前融资余额最高，成为抛售的主要目标。","drivers":["CSRC margin crackdown Jun-12 2015","forced margin call deleveraging","shadow financing ban","growth/leverage unwind"],"drivers_zh":["证监会2015年6月12日收紧两融","强制平仓去杠杆","伞形信托禁令","成长/杠杆瓦解"],"title":"Margin crackdown triggers crash","title_zh":"证监会收紧融资融券引发闪崩"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"From 6 July 2015, the Chinese government aggressively purchased A-shares through state funds and brokerages, suspended IPOs, and banned major shareholders from selling. The SHCOMP bounced 17.6% and Electronics gained 27.5%, but ranked only #16/28 in this leg. Cyclicals led strongly (+33.7% vs defensives +18.6%) and Coal (+101.5%) and Defense (+65.1%) dominated — reflecting a crude buy-the-crash rotation into the most beaten-down names rather than electronics-specific buying. Electronics participated via beta, not leadership.","body_zh":"2015年7月6日起，中国政府通过国家队和券商大规模买入A股，同时暂停IPO并禁止主要股东减持。上证综指反弹17.6%，电子行业上涨27.5%，但仅排名第16/28。周期股强势领涨（+33.7% vs防御股+18.6%），煤炭（+101.5%）和军工（+65.1%）居首——反映的是对超跌板块的轮动，而非电子板块的特定买入。电子行业以贝塔形式参与反弹，并非领涨。","drivers":["state equity rescue Jul-6 2015","IPO suspension","forced short-cover bounce","cyclical rebound beta"],"drivers_zh":["国家队2015年7月6日救市","暂停IPO","空头回补强制反弹","周期贝塔反弹"],"title":"State rescue bounce, cyclicals led","title_zh":"国家队救市反弹，周期板块领涨"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"The government rescue lost momentum by late July and a second wave of selling hit in August. SHCOMP dropped 27.1% and Electronics fell 35.6% (#25/28). The PBOC surprise CNY devaluation on 11 August 2015 (1.9% against USD in a single day, the largest since 1994) amplified the sell-off by raising capital outflow fears. Defensives held better (-22.6% vs cyclicals -31.1%) and value led over growth, consistent with flight to safety.","body_zh":"7月底国家队救市动力渐弱，8月二次暴跌来袭。上证综指下跌27.1%，电子行业下跌35.6%（排名第25/28），位于最弱行列。2015年8月11日央行突然将人民币兑美元中间价一次性下调1.9%（1994年以来最大单日贬值），引发资本外流担忧并加剧抛售。防御股跌幅（-22.6%）明显小于周期股（-31.1%），价值风格领先，符合资金避险特征。","drivers":["PBOC yuan devaluation Aug-11 2015","capital outflow fears","second margin-unwind wave","flight to safety"],"drivers_zh":["央行2015年8月11日汇改贬值","资本外流担忧","第二轮去杠杆抛售","资金避险"],"title":"Second wave crash, yuan devaluation shock","title_zh":"第二波暴跌，人民币贬值冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After mid-September 2015 stabilization (PBOC closed the CNY/CNH basis via FX intervention, state purchases continued), A-shares rebounded with SHCOMP +18.9%. Electronics rallied 54.3% — #2/28 — alongside Computers (+63.3%) and Telecoms (+52.5%) in a concentrated growth/tech rotation. Cyclicals beat defensives (+31.5% vs +20.9%) and the growth-value gap was +18.1 pp, consistent with post-crisis normalization where beaten-down high-beta tech names mean-reverted most aggressively. Made in China 2025 policy interest provided a fundamental narrative for the recovery.","body_zh":"2015年9月中旬市场企稳（央行通过外汇干预收窄在岸/离岸人民币价差，国家队持续买入），A股回暖，上证综指上涨18.9%。电子行业大涨54.3%，排名第2/28，与计算机（+63.3%）、通信（+52.5%）共同构成集中的成长/科技轮动。周期股跑赢防御股（+31.5% vs +20.9%），成长跑赢价值18.1个百分点，符合危机后正常化过程中超跌高贝塔科技股的快速均值回归特征。中国制造2025政策预期亦提供了基本面支撑叙事。","drivers":["PBOC FX stabilization Sep-2015","post-crisis mean reversion","growth/tech bounce","Made in China 2025 narrative"],"drivers_zh":["央行2015年9月汇率干预企稳","危机后均值回归","成长/科技反弹","中国制造2025政策叙事"],"title":"Tech/growth recovery on stabilization","title_zh":"市场企稳后科技成长领涨修复"},"2015-12-30":{"body":"On 4 January 2016, China's new circuit-breaker mechanism triggered on its first day; on 7 January it was suspended after a 30-minute trading session — the shortest in market history. Simultaneously, the PBOC set the yuan reference rate 0.5% lower on 7 January, and offshore CNH rates spiked as the PBOC squeezed short-sellers. SHCOMP fell 25.7% and Electronics dropped 32.6% (#23/28). Defensives (Banks -16.1%, Food & Bev -23%) outperformed cyclicals (-29.5%), confirming panic de-risking, not sector-specific pressure.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日，中国新设的熔断机制在首日即触发；1月7日因仅开盘30分钟即宣告暂停（历史最短交易日）。与此同时，央行1月7日将人民币中间价下调0.5%，离岸人民币利率因央行逼空而急剧飙升。上证综指下跌25.7%，电子行业下跌32.6%（排名第23/28）。银行（-16.1%）、食品饮料（-23%）等防御板块跑赢周期股（-29.5%），确认为恐慌性去风险行情，并非板块特定压力。","drivers":["circuit-breaker malfunction Jan-4/7 2016","yuan reference rate cut Jan-7","offshore CNH squeeze","panic de-risking"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月4/7日熔断机制失灵","1月7日人民币中间价下调","离岸人民币逼空","恐慌性去风险"],"title":"Circuit breaker panic, yuan offshore squeeze","title_zh":"熔断机制恐慌与离岸人民币逼空"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"A-shares stabilized after the circuit-breaker was scrapped (7 January 2016) and the PBOC eased again. China supply-side structural reforms, announced in late 2015, drove a PPI reflation cycle in 2016-17 that boosted industrial profitability and sparked a premium in quality consumer and industrial names (white horse stocks). SHCOMP gained 29.8% over this 22-month leg and Electronics ranked #3/28 (+64.1%), but crucially defensives (+46%) outperformed cyclicals (+33.1%) and the style tilt was VALUE-led (-18.2 pp for growth), with Food & Bev (+113.3%) and Appliances (+91.5%) topping the table. Electronics absolute gain came via IC Fund investment rather than liquidity excess.","body_zh":"熔断机制于2016年1月7日废除后A股趋稳，央行再度宽松。中国2015年底宣布的供给侧结构性改革在2016-17年推动了一轮PPI再通胀周期，工业利润改善，催生对高质量消费与工业标的的白马股溢价。上证综指在这轮长达22个月的行情中上涨29.8%，电子排名第3/28（+64.1%），但关键在于防御股（+46%）跑赢周期股（+33.1%），风格以价值为主（成长-18.2pp），食品饮料（+113.3%）和家电（+91.5%）居首。电子的绝对涨幅来自集成电路大基金驱动，而非流动性泡沫。","drivers":["supply-side reform PPI reflation","white horse quality premium","PBOC re-easing Jan-2016","IC Big Fund tech investment"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革PPI再通胀","白马股质量溢价","央行2016年1月再宽松","国家集成电路大基金"],"title":"Supply-side reform recovery, value led","title_zh":"供给侧改革复苏，价值风格主导"},"2017-11-13":{"body":"China National Financial Work Conference (July 2017) triggered an aggressive financial deleveraging campaign: the 10-year bond yield climbed to 3.93% by late October 2017 — near a three-year high — as PBOC tightened interbank liquidity. SHCOMP fell only 2.2% but Electronics crashed 26.1% (worst of 28 sectors), while Banks surged +15.7% and Real Estate +8.4%. This was a pure sector-specific value/growth rotation: high-multiple tech/electronics re-rated lower as risk-free rates rose, and capital rotated into financials and old-economy value names — a classic duration unwind.","body_zh":"2017年7月全国金融工作会议后，中国启动强力金融去杠杆：10年期国债收益率于10月底攀升至3.93%（接近三年高位），央行收紧同业流动性。上证综指仅跌2.2%，但电子行业暴跌26.1%，为28个行业中最弱。银行大涨15.7%，房地产涨8.4%——这是纯粹的价值/成长板块轮动：无风险利率上升引发高估值科技/电子估值压缩，资金转向金融和传统价值股，典型的久期拆解行情。","drivers":["PBOC financial deleveraging 2017","bond yield spike to 3.93%","high-multiple tech derating","value rotation to banks"],"drivers_zh":["央行2017年金融去杠杆","10年债收益率飙升至3.93%","高估值科技股压缩","轮动至银行价值股"],"title":"Deleveraging/bond shock derated tech","title_zh":"去杠杆冲击债市致科技股估值压缩"},"2018-02-06":{"body":"A brief but sharp tech-specific rally followed the November 2017-February 2018 value rotation. SHCOMP was flat (-1.3%) yet Electronics surged 20.6% (#2/28) alongside Computers (+24.6%) and Telecoms (+17.5%). Banks fell 9.6% and Real Estate -4.5% — a near-perfect reverse of the prior leg. Growth outperformed value by 14.4 pp. The catalyst was domestic tech optimism ahead of China 5G spectrum allocation timeline and continued IC fund investments, with markets betting the deleveraging overshoot had corrected. The rally lasted only five weeks before ZTE sanctions and trade-war fears broke the move.","body_zh":"2017年11月至2018年2月价值轮动结束后，出现短暂而强劲的科技特定行情。上证综指几乎持平（-1.3%），但电子暴涨20.6%（排名第2/28），与计算机（+24.6%）、通信（+17.5%）同步。银行跌9.6%，房地产跌4.5%——与上一段行情方向几乎完全相反。成长跑赢价值14.4pp。催化剂为国内科技乐观情绪（5G频谱分配时间表临近、集成电路大基金持续投入），市场押注去杠杆超调已修正。但仅五周后，中兴制裁和贸易战担忧打断了这波行情。","drivers":["tech theme rebound","5G spectrum allocation optimism","growth vs value mean reversion","IC fund investment"],"drivers_zh":["科技主题反弹","5G频谱分配预期","成长vs价值均值回归","大基金持续投入"],"title":"Tech theme rally, SHCOMP flat","title_zh":"科技主题行情，大盘横盘"},"2018-03-12":{"body":"The US-China trade war erupted in March 2018: the Trump administration announced Section 301 tariffs (25% on $50 bn of Chinese goods including semiconductor ICs) and on 16 April the US Department of Commerce banned ZTE from buying US components. Electronics fell 44.6% — worst of 28 sectors — while the SHCOMP fell 25.9%. Defensives outperformed cyclicals (-25.7% vs -29.7%) and value led growth; Coal (0%) and Banks (-18.6%) held best. Electronics hardware supply-chain dependence on US components made it the primary structural casualty of the supply-chain fragmentation shock.","body_zh":"中美贸易战于2018年3月爆发：特朗普政府宣布对500亿美元中国商品（含半导体集成电路）征收25%关税，4月16日商务部对中兴实施禁令禁止购买美国元器件。电子行业下跌44.6%，为28个行业中最弱，上证综指跌25.9%。防御股跑赢周期股（-25.7% vs -29.7%），价值领先成长；煤炭（0%）和银行（-18.6%）相对抗跌。电子行业硬件供应链对美国元器件的高度依赖，使其成为供应链碎片化冲击的最大结构性受害者。","drivers":["US Section 301 tariffs Mar-2018","ZTE component ban Apr-2018","supply chain fragmentation","US tech export controls"],"drivers_zh":["美国2018年3月301条款关税","中兴4月禁令","供应链碎片化","美国科技出口管制"],"title":"US-China trade war destroys Electronics","title_zh":"中美贸易战重创电子行业"},"2019-01-03":{"body":"The G20 Buenos Aires trade truce (1 December 2018) between Trump and Xi provided the catalyst for a sharp relief rally. SHCOMP gained 24.2% and Electronics surged 51.4% (#3/28). The growth-value gap was +19.7 pp and Computers (+58%) led. The STAR Market announcement (approved March 2019, launched July 2019) supercharged domestic semiconductor capital formation expectations, while 5G commercial license approvals (June 2019) created a visible demand cycle for domestic chips, smartphones, and RF components. Domestic substitution narratives accelerated as ZTE/Huawei supply-chain risks made localization an existential priority.","body_zh":"2018年12月1日G20布宜诺斯艾利斯中美贸易战休战协议成为强力催化剂，A股大幅反弹。上证综指上涨24.2%，电子行业飙升51.4%（排名第3/28）。成长跑赢价值19.7pp，计算机（+58%）领涨。科创板宣布（2019年3月获批，7月开板）极大提振了国内半导体融资预期，同年6月5G商用牌照发放进一步创造了国产芯片、智能手机、射频元器件的可见需求周期。中兴/华为供应链风险推动国产替代成为战略优先级，相关叙事加速发酵。","drivers":["G20 trade truce Dec-1 2018","STAR Market announcement Mar-2019","5G license approval Jun-2019","semiconductor localization narrative"],"drivers_zh":["G20贸易战休战2018年12月1日","科创板2019年3月获批","5G牌照2019年6月发放","半导体国产化叙事"],"title":"Trade truce + 5G localization rally","title_zh":"贸易战休战叠加5G国产化行情"},"2019-03-12":{"body":"On 5 May 2019, Trump tweeted tariff escalation to 25% on $200 bn of Chinese goods (effective 10 May), breaking the trade-truce. SHCOMP fell 7.6% but Electronics tumbled 21.4% (worst alongside Computers at -21.4%), while Food & Bev gained +12.9%. Defensives drastically outperformed cyclicals (-2.8% vs -10.0%) and value led growth by 10.8 pp — a textbook flight-to-safety rotation disproportionately punishing the most trade-war-exposed, US-component-dependent sector.","body_zh":"2019年5月5日，特朗普发推宣布将对2000亿美元中国商品加征关税至25%（5月10日生效），打破贸易休战。上证综指跌7.6%，但电子行业暴跌21.4%（与计算机并列最差），而食品饮料涨12.9%。防御股大幅跑赢周期股（-2.8% vs -10%），价值领先成长10.8pp——标准的避险轮动，对贸易战敞口最大、美国元器件依赖度最高的电子板块惩罚最重。","drivers":["Trump tariff tweet May-5 2019","tariff escalation to 25% on $200bn","tech/trade-war beta selloff","flight to safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2019年5月5日推文关税升级","对2000亿美元商品加税至25%","科技/贸易战贝塔抛售","避险轮动"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation, tech punished","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级，科技股再受重创"},"2019-06-06":{"body":"From June 2019 to February 2020, Electronics was the undisputed market leader, surging 108.7% — #1/28 and over 2x the next best sector (Computers +58.2%). SHCOMP gained only 6.6%, confirming a sector-specific structural re-rating, not market beta. Key dated catalysts: STAR Market opened 22 July 2019 (enabling high-multiple listings for domestic chip firms), 5G commercial licenses issued June 2019, Huawei Kirin 990 chipset launch September 2019 demonstrating domestic 5G SoC capability, and the Phase 1 US-China trade deal December 2019 lifting immediate supply-chain fears. The growth-value gap reached +40.2 pp.","body_zh":"2019年6月至2020年2月，电子行业成为无可争议的市场领涨板块，大涨108.7%，排名第1/28，涨幅超过第二名计算机（+58.2%）的两倍。上证综指仅涨6.6%，确认这是板块特定的结构性重估，而非大盘贝塔。关键催化剂：科创板2019年7月22日开板（为国产芯片企业提供高估值上市通道）、5G商用牌照2019年6月发放、华为麒麟990于2019年9月发布（展示国产5G SoC能力）、2019年12月中美第一阶段贸易协议签署缓解供应链担忧。成长跑赢价值达+40.2pp。","drivers":["STAR Market launch Jul-22 2019","5G commercial licenses Jun-2019","Huawei Kirin 990 Sep-2019","Phase 1 US-China trade deal Dec-2019"],"drivers_zh":["科创板2019年7月22日开板","5G商用牌照2019年6月发放","华为麒麟990 2019年9月发布","中美第一阶段协议2019年12月"],"title":"5G + STAR Market: Electronics decade-best","title_zh":"5G+科创板驱动十年最强电子行情"},"2020-02-25":{"body":"From late February 2020, COVID-19 spread outside China and global risk assets repriced. SHCOMP fell 8.7% but Electronics crashed 31.8% — dead last among 28 sectors — while Agriculture gained +5.6% and Construction +2.2%. Defensives massively outperformed cyclicals (-3.4% vs -7.5%) and value led growth by 12.1 pp. Electronics had entered the period as the prior 8-month leg leader at peak valuations, making it the most sentiment-extended name in the market and most vulnerable to forced unwind. Wuhan shutdowns also created direct supply-chain disruption for component manufacturers.","body_zh":"2020年2月下旬，新冠疫情在中国境外蔓延，全球风险资产重新定价。上证综指跌8.7%，但电子行业暴跌31.8%，在28个行业中垫底，而农林牧渔涨5.6%，建筑业涨2.2%。防御股大幅跑赢周期股（-3.4% vs -7.5%），价值领先成长12.1pp。电子行业在此前8个月成为全市场第一，估值最高、情绪最为亢奋，因此在资金撤离时最为脆弱。同时，武汉停工对元器件供应链造成直接冲击。","drivers":["COVID-19 global spread Feb-2020","flight to safety from peak-valuation sector","supply chain Wuhan disruption","forced unwind of crowded leader"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫情2020年2月全球蔓延","高估值龙头遭避险资金撤离","武汉停工供应链冲击","拥挤龙头被动出清"],"title":"COVID-19 panic: Electronics worst sector","title_zh":"新冠疫情恐慌：电子成最弱行业"},"2020-03-31":{"body":"PBOC cut the LPR in April 2020 (1yr to 3.85%, 5yr to 4.65%) and unleashed broad fiscal stimulus. SHCOMP gained 31.7% over this 10-month leg but Electronics gained only 58.6% (#9/28), well below Services (+135.1%) and Power Equipment (+118%). This was a post-COVID reflation trade where new-energy (EVs, solar), consumer services, and food & beverage captured the lion's share of growth rotation — the first leg where Electronics meaningfully underperformed the growth cohort despite growth leading value by +10.2 pp. Leadership was shifting toward dual-circulation domestic consumption and green energy themes.","body_zh":"央行于2020年4月下调LPR（1年期至3.85%，5年期至4.65%），并推出大规模财政刺激。上证综指在这10个月行情中上涨31.7%，但电子行业仅涨58.6%（排名第9/28），远低于休闲服务（+135.1%）和电力设备（+118%）。这是一波后疫情再通胀行情，新能源（电动车、光伏）、消费服务和食品饮料占据了成长轮动的主体。这是电子行业在成长行情中首次显著跑输成长组合（成长仍领先价值10.2pp），领涨主线转向双循环内需消费和绿色能源主题。","drivers":["PBOC LPR cuts Apr-2020","fiscal COVID stimulus","new energy EV/solar thematic rotation","dual circulation domestic demand"],"drivers_zh":["央行2020年4月降LPR","财政抗疫刺激","新能源/电动车/光伏主题轮动","双循环内需战略"],"title":"PBOC stimulus recovery, new-energy leads","title_zh":"央行刺激驱动修复，新能源领涨"},"2021-01-21":{"body":"From late January 2021, A-shares rotated sharply away from growth. SHCOMP fell only 7.1% but Electronics dropped 19.4% (#27/28), while Services gained +14% and Utilities +10.4%. The style tilt was VALUE-led by 11.1 pp. The driver: surging commodity prices (iron ore, copper, coal) in early 2021 lifted PPI and cyclical earnings expectations, rotating capital to industrial materials and financials. Simultaneously, rising US Treasury yields (10yr reached 1.7% by March 2021) increased discount rates for high-multiple growth stocks globally, compressing China tech valuations.","body_zh":"2021年1月下旬，A股出现剧烈的价值轮动。上证综指仅跌7.1%，但电子行业下跌19.4%（排名第27/28），而休闲服务涨14%、公用事业涨10.4%。价值风格领先成长11.1pp。驱动因素：2021年初铁矿石、铜、煤炭等大宗商品价格飙升推动PPI走高，工业周期品盈利预期提升，资金轮动至工业材料和金融板块。与此同时，美国10年期国债收益率上升至2021年3月的1.7%，提高了全球高估值成长股的折现率，压缩了中国科技股估值。","drivers":["commodity PPI surge early 2021","US 10yr yield rising to 1.7%","value/cyclical rotation","high-multiple tech discount rate compression"],"drivers_zh":["2021年初大宗商品PPI飙升","美债10年收益率上行至1.7%","价值/周期轮动","高估值科技折现率压缩"],"title":"PPI surge rotates to value; tech de-rates","title_zh":"PPI上行推动价值轮动，科技股估值压缩"},"2021-03-25":{"body":"Over nine months from March to December 2021, SHCOMP rose 8.9% with growth leading value +17.3 pp. But leadership was Power Equipment (+75.1%), Metals (+49.7%), and Defense (+37.6%), while Electronics gained only 31.7% (#6/31). China carbon neutrality by 2060 pledge and surging EV sales (BYD, CATL quarterly records) drove capital overwhelmingly into the clean-energy supply chain. Electronics benefited modestly from 5G infrastructure spend and IC localization investment but was structurally overshadowed by the new-energy mega-theme.","body_zh":"2021年3月至12月的9个月间，上证综指上涨8.9%，成长领先价值17.3pp。但领涨板块为电力设备（+75.1%）、有色金属（+49.7%）和国防军工（+37.6%），电子行业仅涨31.7%（排名第6/31），勉强跟上成长板块涨幅。中国2060碳中和承诺和新能源汽车销量屡创季度新高（比亚迪、宁德时代）驱动资金大举涌入清洁能源产业链。电子行业受益于5G基础设施投入和国产芯片主题，但结构上被新能源超级主题所遮蔽。","drivers":["carbon neutrality EV supercycle 2021","CATL/BYD record sales","5G infrastructure buildout","clean energy thematic dominance"],"drivers_zh":["碳中和新能源超级周期2021","宁德时代/比亚迪销量创纪录","5G基础设施建设","新能源主题主导"],"title":"New energy boom; Electronics mid-pack","title_zh":"新能源景气爆发，电子居中游"},"2021-12-14":{"body":"From December 2021 to April 2022, Electronics fell 42.6% — worst of 31 sectors — while SHCOMP fell 21.2% and Coal gained 9.2%. The dual shock: (1) China regulatory crackdown (antitrust, data, algorithm laws active from late 2021) raised risk premia across the tech sector; (2) the US CHIPS Act (signed August 2022) and BIS entity-list expansions froze semiconductor capex projections; (3) Shanghai two-month COVID lockdown (April-May 2022) directly halted chip fabrication at SMIC and suppliers. Value dominated growth by 17.5 pp with Coal and Banks as the only winners.","body_zh":"2021年12月至2022年4月，电子行业下跌42.6%，为31个行业中最弱，上证综指跌21.2%，而煤炭行业实际上涨9.2%。双重冲击：（1）中国监管整顿（反垄断、数据、算法法规于2021年底相继落地）拉升科技板块风险溢价；（2）美国芯片法案（2022年8月签署）及BIS实体清单扩容冻结了半导体资本开支预期；（3）上海两个月封控（2022年4月-5月）直接中断了中芯国际及供应商的芯片制造和元器件供应。价值风格领先成长17.5pp，煤炭和银行成为仅有的正收益板块。","drivers":["China tech regulatory crackdown 2021-22","US CHIPS Act Aug-2022 BIS restrictions","Shanghai COVID lockdown Apr-2022","value rotation to energy/commodities"],"drivers_zh":["中国科技监管整顿2021-22","美国芯片法案2022年8月及BIS管制","上海2022年4月封控","价值轮动至能源/大宗商品"],"title":"Regulatory crackdown + US chip export controls","title_zh":"监管整顿叠加美国芯片出口管制"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"After reaching an April 2022 trough, A-shares rebounded as the PBOC cut the 5-year LPR by a record 15 bps in May 2022 and expectations grew that zero-COVID would eventually exit. SHCOMP gained 13.5% and Electronics surged 38.7% (#5/31), with Power Equipment (+62.5%), Autos (+50.5%), and Defense (+45.6%) leading. Cyclicals dominated defensives (+20.1% vs +6.4%) and growth gained 17.1 pp over value. The rally was a combined monetary easing and policy normalization trade, with tech and new-energy names recovering from heavily oversold conditions. The August 2022 BIS semiconductor export control expansion then re-capped the upside.","body_zh":"2022年4月触底后，A股随央行于5月将5年期LPR大幅下调15个基点（历史记录）及市场对清零政策退出预期升温而反弹。上证综指涨13.5%，电子行业大涨38.7%（排名第5/31），电力设备（+62.5%）、汽车（+50.5%）、国防军工（+45.6%）领涨。周期股主导防御股（+20.1% vs +6.4%），成长领先价值17.1pp。行情为货币宽松+政策正常化预期的组合驱动，科技和新能源从严重超卖中修复。但2022年8月BIS半导体出口管制扩容再度压制了上行空间。","drivers":["PBOC 5yr LPR cut 15bps May-2022","zero-COVID exit expectations","monetary easing re-rating","oversold bounce in growth"],"drivers_zh":["央行2022年5月5年期LPR降15bp","清零政策退出预期","货币宽松重估","成长超卖反弹"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit expectations + PBOC easing","title_zh":"清零政策退出预期叠加央行宽松驱动反弹"},"2022-08-18":{"body":"The 9 August 2022 US CHIPS and Science Act signing (restricting Chinese semiconductor expansion) and subsequent October 2022 BIS expanded export controls on advanced chips and chip-making equipment created an existential overhang for China semiconductor ambitions. Electronics fell 26.6% (worst of 31 sectors) while Coal gained +4.7% and Banks -1.9% — stark value/defensives outperformance. The global macro backdrop (Fed hiking 75 bps at consecutive meetings) also weighed on high-multiple growth globally. SHCOMP fell 9.1% but Electronics 26.6% decline reflected the structural damage to capex outlooks from the new chip embargo.","body_zh":"2022年8月9日美国芯片与科学法案签署（限制中国半导体扩张）以及随后2022年10月BIS扩大对先进芯片和设备的出口管制，为中国半导体产业前景制造了结构性阴云。电子行业下跌26.6%，为31个行业中最弱，而煤炭涨4.7%，银行仅跌1.9%——价值/防御板块强势跑赢。全球宏观背景（美联储连续75bp加息）也对全球高估值成长股形成压制。上证综指跌9.1%，但电子26.6%的跌幅反映了芯片禁运对资本开支前景的结构性损伤。","drivers":["US CHIPS Act signed Aug-9 2022","BIS Oct-2022 advanced chip export ban","Fed 75bp consecutive hikes","structural capex outlook damage"],"drivers_zh":["美国芯片法案2022年8月9日签署","BIS 2022年10月先进芯片出口禁令","美联储连续75bp加息","资本开支前景结构性受损"],"title":"CHIPS Act + US export controls resume selloff","title_zh":"芯片法案出台，美国出口管制升级，价值重掌主导"},"2022-10-11":{"body":"China bottomed on 31 October 2022 with the first hints of COVID reopening, and then on 30 November 2022 OpenAI launched ChatGPT, igniting global AI enthusiasm that translated immediately into China AI stock surges. Over six months, SHCOMP gained 11.2% and Electronics rallied 31.8% (#4/31) in a strong growth rotation (+26.1 pp growth-value gap). Computers (+65.3%) and Media (+56.8%) led as ChatGPT-adjacent names surged; Telecoms (+40.2%) followed. Electronics benefited from AI chip inference demand and continued domestic substitution investment as US controls tightened.","body_zh":"2022年10月底中国清零退出初现曙光，10月31日触底；2022年11月30日OpenAI发布ChatGPT，引发全球AI热情并迅速传导至中国AI股的爆发性上涨。上证综指在6个月内涨11.2%，电子行业涨31.8%（排名第4/31），成长-价值差距高达+26.1pp。计算机（+65.3%）和传媒（+56.8%）领涨，通信（+40.2%）紧随。电子受益于AI芯片推理需求及随着美国管制收紧而持续深化的国产替代投入。","drivers":["ChatGPT launch Nov-30 2022","China COVID reopening late 2022","AI inference chip demand","domestic substitution acceleration"],"drivers_zh":["ChatGPT 2022年11月30日发布","中国清零政策2022年底退出","AI推理芯片需求","国产替代加速"],"title":"ChatGPT/AI wave + COVID exit rerating","title_zh":"ChatGPT/AI浪潮叠加清零退出驱动重估"},"2023-04-06":{"body":"China post-COVID recovery proved weaker than expected: youth unemployment hit record highs (above 21% by June 2023), the property sector remained in structural contraction, and deflation deepened (CPI negative in July 2023, the first in two years; GDP deflator negative for three consecutive quarters, worst since 1998). SHCOMP fell 18.4% and Electronics dropped 38.1% (#26/31). Defensives led (-15.5%) over cyclicals (-24%) and value led growth by 16.9 pp, with Coal (+7.5%) and Banks (+0.8%) as the only positive sectors. Strong USD and massive foreign-investor exodus compounded the selloff.","body_zh":"中国清零后的复苏远弱于预期：2023年6月青年失业率超过21%的历史高位，房地产持续结构性收缩，通缩深化（2023年7月CPI转负，为两年来首次；GDP平减指数连续三个季度为负，为1998年以来最严重）。上证综指跌18.4%，电子行业跌38.1%（排名第26/31）。防御股（-15.5%）跑赢周期股（-24%），价值领先成长16.9pp，煤炭（+7.5%）和银行（+0.8%）是仅有的正收益板块。美元走强和外资大规模撤退进一步加剧了抛售。","drivers":["China post-COVID macro disappointment","property sector structural contraction","deflation CPI negative Jul-2023","USD strength foreign investor exodus"],"drivers_zh":["中国清零后宏观复苏不及预期","房地产板块结构性收缩","2023年7月CPI转负通缩","美元强势外资大规模撤离"],"title":"Post-reopening macro disappointment selloff","title_zh":"重开后宏观数据不及预期引发抛售"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"Central Huijin announced on 5 February 2024 it would expand ETF purchases (buying an estimated USD 45.5 bn of A-shares in Q1 2024), marking the trough. The September 24 2024 PBOC mega-stimulus (50 bps RRR cut, 20 bps LPR cut, CNY 800 bn stock-market support facility) turbocharged the recovery into year-end. Then on 20 January 2025, DeepSeek released its R1 reasoning model — demonstrating AI reasoning capabilities matching OpenAI o1 at a fraction of the compute cost — triggering a 28.5% surge in the Hang Seng Tech Index in weeks. Electronics ranked #1/31 (+90.9%) over the full 12-month leg; SHCOMP gained 25.1% with a massive growth-over-value gap of +38.7 pp.","body_zh":"2024年2月5日，中央汇金宣布扩大ETF买入规模（2024年一季度估计买入A股455亿美元），标志着底部确立。2024年9月24日央行超级刺激（降准50bp、降LPR 20bp、8000亿元股市支持工具）进一步加速年末修复行情。随后2025年1月20日DeepSeek发布R1推理模型——以极低算力成本实现与OpenAI o1比肩的推理能力——在数周内推动恒生科技指数上涨28.5%。电子行业在整段12个月行情中排名第1/31（+90.9%）；上证综指上涨25.1%，成长-价值差距高达+38.7pp。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF buying Feb-5 2024","PBOC Sep-24 2024 mega stimulus","DeepSeek R1 release Jan-20 2025","AI semiconductor localization re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金2024年2月5日扩大ETF买入","央行2024年9月24日超级刺激","DeepSeek R1 2025年1月20日发布","AI半导体国产化重估"],"title":"National team trough + DeepSeek AI rerating","title_zh":"国家队护盘触底叠加DeepSeek AI重估"},"2025-02-26":{"body":"On 2 April 2025, President Trump announced Liberation Day tariffs — a 34% duty on Chinese imports on top of existing 20%, which China matched with retaliatory 34% tariffs. By 9 April Trump escalated further to a baseline 104% on Chinese goods. SHCOMP fell 6.9% and Electronics dropped 23% (#29/31), alongside Telecoms (-23.4%) and Computers (-23.9%) — the three most US-supply-chain-dependent sectors. Defensives (Agriculture +10.1%, Food & Bev +4.3%, Banks +0.8%) held strongly, confirming a textbook flight-to-safety rotation. The leg lasted only six weeks from the February peak to the April 8 trough.","body_zh":"2025年4月2日，特朗普宣布解放日关税——对中国进口商品额外加征34%关税（叠加原有20%），中国以34%对等反制。4月9日特朗普进一步将中国商品基准关税推至104%。上证综指跌6.9%，电子行业跌23%（排名第29/31），与通信（-23.4%）和计算机（-23.9%）并列最弱——三者均为对美供应链依赖度最高的板块。农林牧渔（+10.1%）、食品饮料（+4.3%）、银行（+0.8%）强势抗跌，确认为标准的避险轮动。从2月高点到4月8日低点仅历时六周。","drivers":["Trump Liberation Day 34% tariff Apr-2 2025","China retaliatory 34% tariff","escalation to 104% Apr-9 2025","flight to safety from supply-chain-exposed tech"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2025年4月2日解放日34%关税","中国对等34%反制关税","4月9日升至104%","避险撤离供应链依赖科技板块"],"title":"Trump Liberation Day tariff shock selloff","title_zh":"特朗普解放日关税冲击引发抛售"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"Following the April 8 trough, the May 12 2025 US-China 90-day tariff truce (US tariffs reduced from 145% to 30%, China from 125% to 10%) removed the acute tariff-shock overhang. The sustained structural driver was domestic AI chip self-sufficiency: Huawei Ascend 910C in production, Cambricon achieving profitability in 2025, Biren launching a HK IPO, and in April 2026 DeepSeek V4 released natively optimized for Huawei chips — confirming a closed-loop domestic AI-chip ecosystem. SHCOMP gained 31% and Electronics surged 200.5% (#2/31), second only to Telecoms (+294.2%). Growth-value gap reached +72.5 pp — the widest in the 14-year history — and defensives averaged -3.8% while cyclicals gained 35.5%.","body_zh":"2025年4月8日触底后，5月12日中美达成90天关税休战（美方关税从145%降至30%，中方从125%降至10%），解除了关税冲击的急性压力。但持续的结构性驱动来自国产AI芯片自主可控：华为昇腾910C量产、寒武纪2025年扭亏为盈、壁仞启动港股IPO；2026年4月DeepSeek V4发布时原生适配华为芯片，确认了国内AI芯片闭环生态系统的形成。上证综指涨31%，电子行业暴涨200.5%（排名第2/31），仅次于通信（+294.2%）。成长-价值差距高达+72.5pp——为14年历史最高——防御股均值-3.8%而周期股涨35.5%，为本板块历史上最显著的风险偏好/成长分化。","drivers":["US-China 90-day tariff truce May-12 2025","Huawei Ascend 910C production","DeepSeek V4 Huawei-chip integration Apr-2026","AI chip self-sufficiency closed-loop"],"drivers_zh":["中美2025年5月12日90天关税休战","华为昇腾910C量产","DeepSeek V4 2026年4月适配华为芯片","AI芯片国产自主闭环形成"],"title":"AI chip self-sufficiency mega-rally","title_zh":"AI芯片自主可控驱动的超级行情"}},"now":"Electronics (SW 801080) is at Phase Topping with a cycle-position score of 96.2 after a 200.5% rally from the April 2025 trough. The sector ranks #1/31 in the current leg (+75.5% this leg), leading all Shenwan industries by a wide margin. Growth is outperforming value by 18.2 pp and cyclicals are beating defensives, confirming a liquidity/theme-driven tape. The dominant drivers are domestic AI semiconductor localization (Huawei Ascend, Cambricon, Biren IPO pipeline), DeepSeek efficiency breakthrough validating China AI chip stack, and the post-US-China tariff truce (May 2025 90-day pause reducing tariffs from 145% to 30%) restoring export visibility. With position at 96.2 and a topping signal, risk/reward has shifted asymmetrically: comparable prior peaks (Jun-2015, Feb-2020, Feb-2025) each triggered 23-42% drawdowns within weeks.","now_zh":"电子板块（申万801080）当前处于见顶阶段，周期位置得分高达96.2，自2025年4月低点以来累计涨幅达200.5%，在31个申万一级行业中排名第一（本阶段涨幅75.5%）。成长跑赢价值18.2个百分点，周期板块跑赢防御板块，格局为纯流动性/主题驱动。核心催化剂：国产AI芯片替代加速（华为昇腾、寒武纪、壁仞IPO管线）、DeepSeek技术突破验证国产算力栈可行性、中美关税休战（2025年5月90天暂停，关税从145%降至30%）恢复出口能见度。96.2的高位叠加见顶信号意味着风险收益已严重不对称——历史上类似极端领涨时刻（2015年6月、2020年2月、2025年2月）均在数周内出现23%-42%的快速回撤。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801110":{"legs":{"2011-12-15":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR by 50bp on December 5, 2011 -- its first easing move since 2008 -- as CPI fell from its August-2011 peak of 6.5%, signalling the end of a two-year tightening cycle and unlocking a broad cyclicals rally. SHCOMP gained +11.9% and Home Appliances ranked #1 of 16 Shenwan industries with a +30.3% surge, co-leading with Metals (+26.3%) and Real Estate (+21.6%), confirming a risk-on credit-cycle-trough rotation. The sector benefited additionally from latent demand as China's energy-saving appliance subsidy program (jie neng hui min) reached its end-2011 expiry, prompting consumer front-running. Cyclicals outperformed defensives by 12.2pp (17.8% vs 5.6%), confirming this was a macro-driven beta trade rather than sector-specific re-rating.","body_zh":"2011年12月5日，人民银行时隔三年首次下调存款准备金率50个基点，因居民消费价格指数已从2011年8月的6.5%高点回落，标志着两年紧缩周期终结，触发周期股全面反弹。上证综指上涨+11.9%，家用电器在16个申万行业中领涨，大涨+30.3%，与有色金属（+26.3%）和房地产（+21.6%）共同领涨，确认这是一轮风险偏好修复、信用周期见底的轮动。板块还受益于节能惠民补贴政策于2011年底到期前的抢购效应。周期股跑赢防御股12.2个百分点（17.8% vs 5.6%），确认本轮上涨为宏观驱动的贝塔行情。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut cycle","CPI peak / tightening pivot","Risk-on beta rally","Energy-saving subsidy expiry pull-forward","Real estate co-leadership"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行降准周期","CPI见顶/货币政策转向","风险偏好修复贝塔行情","节能补贴到期抢购效应","房地产板块共同领涨"],"title":"PBOC Easing Lifts Cyclicals from Trough","title_zh":"人民银行降准启动周期股触底反弹"},"2012-03-09":{"body":"After the Q1-2012 cyclical bounce peaked, A-shares reversed as renewed European sovereign debt fears and slowing China export data eroded risk appetite through mid-2012; SHCOMP fell -15.9%. Home Appliances dropped -21.0% and ranked 12th of 16 industries, broadly in line with the cyclicals complex (cyclicals avg -18.9% vs defensives avg -5.0%), reflecting pure macro risk-off beta rather than sector-specific deterioration. Pharma (+1.4%), Services (-4.8%), and Food & Bev (-7.0%) led as defensives rotated into favor. The new energy-saving subsidy program launched in June 2012 arrived too late to cushion the first part of this selloff.","body_zh":"2012年一季度周期反弹见顶后，A股随欧洲主权债务危机忧虑再起及中国出口数据放缓而逆转，上证综指下跌-15.9%。家用电器下跌-21.0%，在16个申万行业中排名第12，与周期股整体（平均-18.9%，防御股平均-5.0%）基本持平，属于纯粹的宏观风险规避贝塔回撤，而非板块基本面恶化。医药（+1.4%）、服务业（-4.8%）及食品饮料（-7.0%）领涨，防御属性凸显。2012年6月新推出的节能惠民补贴来得过晚，未能阻止本轮回调。","drivers":["Euro sovereign debt contagion","China export slowdown","Risk-off defensives rotation","Cyclicals beta selloff","SHCOMP broad down-leg"],"drivers_zh":["欧洲主权债务危机蔓延","中国出口数据放缓","防御股风险规避轮动","周期股贝塔回撤","上证综指整体下跌"],"title":"Euro Crisis Contagion Triggers Risk-Off","title_zh":"欧债危机蔓延触发风险规避"},"2012-08-30":{"body":"China's longest A-share bull market of the era ran from August 2012 through June 2015, fuelled by two overlapping engines: (1) a sustained credit-and-monetary easing cycle (multiple RRR and rate cuts through 2014-15) that pumped liquidity into equities; and (2) from late 2014, an explosion of margin lending as brokerages expanded margin books and shadow-banking umbrella trust products arrived, pushing SHCOMP from ~2,000 to 5,166 points (+151.7%). Home Appliances surged +287.6%, ranking 4th of 28 industries, driven by the dual tailwind of booming real estate (new home starts surged, lifting white-goods demand) and the margin-fuelled broad re-rating of cyclical consumer stocks. Light Mfg (+330.5%) and Electronics (+293.8%) led, confirming a growth/cyclicals-tilted, leverage-amplified bull where Appliances captured disproportionate upside versus its earnings growth.","body_zh":"2012年8月至2015年6月是该时代最长的A股牛市，由两大引擎叠加驱动：（1）持续的信用与货币宽松周期（2014-15年多次降准降息）将流动性源源注入股市；（2）自2014年底起，券商融资融券规模急剧扩张，伞型信托等影子银行产品涌入，推动上证综指从约2000点涨至5166点（+151.7%）。家用电器大涨+287.6%，在28个申万行业中排名第4，受益于房地产繁荣（新房开工激增，白电需求旺盛）及杠杆资金推动的周期消费股整体重估。轻工（+330.5%）和电子（+293.8%）领涨，印证这是一轮以成长/周期为主、杠杆放大的牛市，家电涨幅远超其盈利增长。","drivers":["Monetary easing / RRR + rate cuts","Margin trading explosion","Real estate boom lifting white-goods demand","Broad A-share bull market beta","Shadow banking leverage inflows"],"drivers_zh":["货币宽松/降准降息","融资融券规模爆发","房地产繁荣带动白电需求","A股牛市整体贝塔","影子银行杠杆资金流入"],"title":"Bull Market and Property Boom: Mega Rally","title_zh":"大牛市与地产繁荣：超级涨幅"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"The A-share bubble burst on June 12, 2015 when the CSRC began tightening margin lending rules; the Shanghai Composite fell -32.1% in 26 days as leveraged positions were force-sold. Home Appliances dropped -36.4%, ranking 5th-least-impacted of 28 sectors (defensives held relatively better at -30.4% vs cyclicals avg -43.0%), as banks (-10.6%) and defensives cushioned on relative flight to safety. Coal (-59.1%), Defense (-52.0%), and Retail (-47.5%) bore the worst losses. The selloff was indiscriminate forced deleveraging, not driven by fundamentals in any single sector.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，中国证监会开始收紧融资融券规则，A股泡沫破裂，上证综指在26天内暴跌-32.1%，融资盘遭强制平仓。家用电器下跌-36.4%，在28个行业中跌幅居中（防御股相对抗跌，均值-30.4%，周期股均值-43.0%），银行（-10.6%）和防御类相对避险。煤炭（-59.1%）、国防（-52.0%）及零售（-47.5%）跌幅最惨。本轮下跌是无差别去杠杆平仓，并非任何板块基本面恶化所致。","drivers":["CSRC margin lending tightening","Forced margin call deleveraging","Bubble valuation collapse","SHCOMP peak-to-crash beta","Flight to defensives / banks relatively protected"],"drivers_zh":["证监会收紧融资融券","融资盘强制平仓去杠杆","泡沫估值崩塌","上证综指见顶暴跌贝塔","资金相对流向防御品种/银行"],"title":"Margin Unwind Crashes Bubble Peak","title_zh":"去杠杆平仓崩塌泡沫顶部"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"On July 5-8, 2015, the Chinese government launched a massive market rescue: the PBOC lent ~$42 billion to state brokers to buy shares, the CSRC halted new IPOs, and roughly 50% of listed stocks suspended trading. This triggered a powerful but short-lived 17.6% SHCOMP rebound. Home Appliances gained +22.2% but ranked only 21st of 28, well below the market rate: cyclicals (avg +33.7%) strongly outperformed defensives (+18.6%), with Coal (+101.5%) and Defense (+65.1%) leading on heavy government fund buying. Appliances underperformed relative to the rescue bid, with Banks (-1.2%) and Brokers (+9.9%) also lagging as confidence remained fragile.","body_zh":"2015年7月5至8日，中国政府启动大规模救市：人民银行向国有券商提供约420亿美元资金用于购股，证监会暂停新股发行，约50%上市公司停牌。这引发上证综指强劲但短暂的反弹+17.6%。家用电器上涨+22.2%，但在28个行业中仅排名第21，低于市场整体：周期股（平均+33.7%）大幅跑赢防御股（+18.6%），煤炭（+101.5%）和国防（+65.1%）因国家队买入领涨。家电因居于风险属性中间地带而相对跑输，银行（-1.2%）和券商（+9.9%）也落后，市场信心依然脆弱。","drivers":["Government market rescue (state broker buying)","IPO suspension","PBOC emergency liquidity","Short-covering / forced-buy rebound","Selective cyclicals beta"],"drivers_zh":["政府救市（国有券商买盘）","暂停IPO","人民银行应急流动性支持","空头回补/强制买入反弹","部分周期股贝塔修复"],"title":"State Rescue Rally: Short-Lived Rebound","title_zh":"国家队救市：昙花一现的反弹"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"The rescue rally failed as concerns mounted about the sustainability of government support. On August 11, 2015, the PBOC unexpectedly devalued the yuan by 1.9% (the largest single-day move in decades), triggering a second global risk-off wave and another -27.1% SHCOMP leg down through September 15. Home Appliances fell -31.6%, ranking 16th of 28 -- in line with the broad market but worse than the defensive average (-22.6% defensives vs -31.1% cyclicals). Banks held best (-12.5%) and Computers (-40.0%) and Coal (-45.3%) suffered most; Appliances tracked the cyclicals complex given its discretionary demand sensitivity and residual leverage unwinding.","body_zh":"救市反弹昙花一现，市场对政府救市持续性疑虑加剧。2015年8月11日，人民银行出人意料地将人民币一次性贬值1.9%（数十年来最大单日贬值幅度），引发新一轮全球风险规避，上证综指至9月15日再跌-27.1%。家用电器下跌-31.6%，在28个行业中排名第16，与大盘整体走势相符，但差于防御股平均（防御-22.6%，周期-31.1%）。银行（-12.5%）相对抗跌，计算机（-40.0%）和煤炭（-45.3%）跌幅最大；家电因消费弹性属性及残余杠杆持续去化，跟随周期股整体下行。","drivers":["Yuan devaluation (Aug 11) shock","Second wave of margin unwinding","Global risk-off contagion","SHCOMP second crash leg","Cyclicals selloff beta"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值（8月11日）冲击","第二轮去杠杆浪潮","全球风险规避蔓延","上证综指二次探底","周期股贝塔下跌"],"title":"Second Crash Wave: Yuan Devaluation Shock","title_zh":"第二波暴跌：人民币贬值冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"A multi-pronged policy stabilisation drove a +21.0% SHCOMP recovery into December 2015: the PBOC cut the 1-year lending rate by 25bp in October 2015 (the sixth cut in a year) and kept liquidity ample, while the government launched a real-estate easing package relaxing mortgage down-payments in lower-tier cities. Home Appliances gained +39.4%, ranking 14th of 28 -- in line with SHCOMP but below the growth leaders: Computers (+60.3%) and Electronics (+51.1%) dominated on the internet-plus reform narrative, while Real Estate (+49.9%) benefited from mortgage easing. Cyclicals led defensives by 9.9pp (32.5% vs 22.6%), growth led value by 15.3pp, confirming this was a liquidity/growth-themed bounce with Appliances participating via market beta.","body_zh":"多重政策稳定举措推动上证综指至2015年12月反弹+21.0%：人民银行于2015年10月再次降息25个基点（年内第六次），保持充裕流动性；政府推出房地产宽松组合拳，下调三四线城市首付比例。家用电器上涨+39.4%，在28个行业中排名第14，与大盘同步但低于成长领涨方向：计算机（+60.3%）和电子（+51.1%）在互联网+改革叙事推动下领涨，房地产（+49.9%）受益于按揭宽松。周期股跑赢防御股9.9个百分点（32.5% vs 22.6%），成长跑赢价值15.3个百分点，确认本轮为流动性/成长主题反弹，家电通过市场贝塔参与其中。","drivers":["PBOC rate cut (October 2015)","Real estate mortgage down-payment easing","Internet+ reform narrative (tech leadership)","Post-crash liquidity recovery","Growth/cyclicals style beta"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行降息（2015年10月）","房地产首付比例下调宽松","互联网+改革叙事（科技领涨）","股灾后流动性修复","成长/周期风格贝塔"],"title":"Policy Stabilisation: Growth-Led Recovery","title_zh":"政策稳定：成长主导的修复"},"2015-12-23":{"body":"January 2016 brought a second severe dislocation: China's newly introduced circuit-breaker mechanism twice triggered market-wide trading halts in the first four trading days of 2016, amplifying panic selling; the CSRC suspended the mechanism on January 7. Simultaneously, the yuan fell to a 5-year low versus the USD, and capital outflows accelerated. SHCOMP fell -26.1% by end-February 2016. Home Appliances declined -26.2%, ranking 6th best (least bad) of 28, as value stocks -- Banks (-16.4%) and Food & Bev (-23.0%) -- held better than growth/theme names (Computers -35.0%, Media -34.5%). This was a value-relative defensive episode: cyclicals averaged -28.4% vs defensives -24.6%, with growth-to-value spread at -5pp.","body_zh":"2016年1月，市场再次剧烈动荡：熔断机制在开年头四个交易日内两度触发全场暂停，放大了恐慌性抛售，证监会于1月7日叫停该机制。与此同时，人民币兑美元跌至五年新低，资本外流加速。上证综指至2016年2月底下跌-26.1%。家用电器下跌-26.2%，在28个行业中排名第6（跌幅相对较小），价值股——银行（-16.4%）、食品饮料（-23.0%）——比成长/主题股（计算机-35.0%、传媒-34.5%）更为抗跌。这是一轮价值相对防御的行情：周期股平均-28.4%，防御股平均-24.6%，成长价值利差约为-5个百分点。","drivers":["Circuit-breaker panic (Jan 2016)","CNY devaluation fears / capital outflows","Broad market de-rating","Value-relative outperformance vs growth","SHCOMP second major down-leg"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制恐慌（2016年1月）","人民币贬值忧虑/资本外流","大盘整体估值压缩","价值股相对成长股跑赢","上证综指第二轮大幅下行"],"title":"Circuit-Breaker Failure and CNY Fears","title_zh":"熔断机制失败与人民币贬值忧虑"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"China's most significant post-GFC structural upcycle for home appliances began after the February 2016 trough, driven by the greatest urban residential property boom since 2009: tier-1 city home prices surged 27-34% YoY by September 2016, pulling through massive white-goods demand. Simultaneously, a broad supply-side-reform narrative lifted value stocks (SHCOMP +31.9%, value beating growth by 27pp), and Midea, Haier, and Gree delivered consecutive quarters of revenue and earnings beats through 2017. Home Appliances ranked #2 of 28 with a +112.4% gain over 23 months, second only to Food & Bev (+128.6%), confirming a sustained earnings-quality re-rating, not just beta. Defensives (+51.3%) dramatically outpaced cyclicals (+29.3%), marking this as a rare quality-earnings cycle where Appliances co-led with consumer staples.","body_zh":"2016年2月触底后，家用电器启动了危机后最重要的结构性上行周期，核心驱动为2009年以来最强劲的城市住宅地产繁荣：2016年9月，一线城市房价同比涨幅达27-34%，白电（空调、洗衣机、冰箱）需求随之大幅攀升。与此同时，供给侧结构性改革叙事拉动价值股走牛（上证综指+31.9%，价值跑赢成长27个百分点），美的、海尔、格力在2017年持续实现营收和利润超预期。家用电器以+112.4%的涨幅在28个行业中排名第2，仅次于食品饮料（+128.6%），确认这是一轮持续盈利质量重估，而非单纯贝塔。防御股（+51.3%）大幅跑赢周期股（+29.3%），标志这是一轮罕见的质量盈利周期，家电与消费主导齐头并进。","drivers":["Tier-1 city property boom (2016-17)","White-goods demand surge from completions","Supply-side reform / value re-rating","Midea/Haier/Gree earnings beats","Quality-consumer co-leadership with Food & Bev"],"drivers_zh":["一线城市地产繁荣（2016-17年）","楼盘竣工带动白电需求激增","供给侧改革/价值股重估","美的/海尔/格力业绩持续超预期","与食品饮料共同领涨优质消费主线"],"title":"Property Upcycle Drives Sector Outperformance","title_zh":"地产上行周期驱动板块超额表现"},"2018-01-23":{"body":"The January 2018 peak coincided with the SHCOMP peak as US tariff risk mounted: the Trump administration approved a 4-year tariff-rate quota on washing machines in January 2018, the first direct appliance-sector tariff. Through October 2018, escalating 25% tariffs on $250bn of Chinese goods (effective July-August 2018) and broader trade war fears crushed exporter stocks. SHCOMP fell -28.3% and Appliances fell -41.0%, ranking 25th of 28 -- a pronounced underperformer as it carried both domestic cyclicality (real estate was rolling over post-peak) and export revenue exposure (Haier's GE Appliances acquisition made it particularly US-exposed). Value stocks held marginally better (Coal 0.0%, Banks -19.1%), but the move was broad market-down.","body_zh":"2018年1月家用电器见顶，与上证综指触及约3550点高点同步，此时美国关税风险日益升温：特朗普政府于2018年1月批准对洗衣机实施为期4年的关税配额，这是直接针对家电行业的首个关税措施。2018年7-8月起，美国对2500亿美元中国商品加征25%关税（持续升级），叠加贸易战整体担忧，出口商股价遭重创。上证综指下跌-28.3%，家用电器重挫-41.0%，在28个行业中排名第25——既受国内周期下行（地产见顶回落）拖累，又承受出口收入压力（海尔收购GEA后对美敞口尤为突出）。价值股相对抗跌（煤炭0.0%、银行-19.1%），但整体为全面杀跌行情。","drivers":["US-China trade war tariff escalation","Washing machine tariff (Jan 2018)","Real estate demand rollover post-peak","Haier/GEA US export exposure","SHCOMP broad bear market"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易战关税升级","洗衣机关税（2018年1月）","地产需求见顶回落","海尔/GEA美国出口敞口","上证综指整体熊市"],"title":"Trade War Tariffs Crush Export Outlook","title_zh":"贸易战关税重创出口前景"},"2018-10-29":{"body":"The A-share trough in late October 2018 was followed by a powerful 28.7% SHCOMP recovery into April 2019, driven by the December 2018 G20 Osaka 90-day trade truce between Trump and Xi, multiple PBOC RRR cuts (50bp in January 2019, further in April 2019), and a January 2019 credit impulse (TSF surged in Jan-Feb 2019). Home Appliances ranked #3 of 28 with a +59.6% gain, co-leading with Agriculture (+67.3%) and Food & Bev (+64.1%) as the growth tape led defensives by 17.3pp. The sector's outperformance was driven by relief on trade-war tariff risk, strong 2018 earnings delivery from Midea and Haier, and positioning unwind as the most-hated export-exposed consumer names reversed sharply.","body_zh":"2018年10月底A股触底后，上证综指至2019年4月大幅反弹+28.7%，核心驱动为：2018年12月G20大阪中美90天贸易休战、人民银行多次降准（2019年1月降50个基点、4月再降）及2019年1月信贷脉冲激增（1-2月社融大幅放量）。家用电器大涨+59.6%，在28个行业中排名第3，与农林牧渔（+67.3%）、食品饮料（+64.1%）共同领涨，成长风格跑赢防御股17.3个百分点。板块超额表现源于贸易关税风险缓解、美的和海尔2018年业绩强劲交付，以及此前遭大幅减持的出口敞口消费股快速修复。","drivers":["G20 trade truce (Dec 2018)","PBOC RRR cuts (Jan 2019)","Credit impulse / TSF surge","Trade-war relief on export names","Earnings quality / Midea-Haier beat"],"drivers_zh":["G20贸易休战（2018年12月）","人民银行降准（2019年1月）","信贷脉冲/社融激增","贸易战风险缓解带动出口股修复","业绩质量/美的海尔超预期"],"title":"Trade Truce Hope and PBOC Easing Drive Rebound","title_zh":"贸易休战希望与人民银行宽松推动反弹"},"2019-04-19":{"body":"After the April 2019 peak, the US-China trade war re-escalated: on May 5, 2019, Trump announced tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods would rise from 10% to 25% effective May 10; on August 23, China retaliated with tariffs on $75bn of US goods and Trump threatened 30% tariffs on the existing $250bn. SHCOMP fell -15.2% by August 9. Home Appliances declined -18.3%, ranking 13th of 28 (in line with cyclicals avg -18.9% vs defensives -9.8%), reflecting broad macro risk-off beta. Coal (0.0%), Food & Bev (-1.0%), and Agriculture (-6.1%) held as defensive havens; the sector's moderate underperformance vs the index reflected its export-tariff sensitivity.","body_zh":"2019年4月见顶后，中美贸易战再度升级：5月5日特朗普宣布将对2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%提至25%（5月10日生效）；8月23日中国宣布对750亿美元美国商品加征报复性关税，特朗普随即威胁对现有2500亿美元商品征收30%关税。上证综指至8月9日下跌-15.2%。家用电器下跌-18.3%，在28个行业中排名第13（与周期股均值-18.9%基本持平，防御股均值-9.8%），属于宏观风险规避贝塔回撤。煤炭（0.0%）、食品饮料（-1.0%）和农林牧渔（-6.1%）较为抗跌；家电相对指数的适度跑输反映其出口关税敏感性。","drivers":["US tariff hike to 25% (May 10, 2019)","China retaliatory tariffs (Aug 23)","Trade war re-escalation shock","Risk-off defensives rotation","Cyclicals beta selloff"],"drivers_zh":["美国关税升至25%（2019年5月10日）","中国报复性关税（8月23日）","贸易战再度升级冲击","风险规避防御股轮动","周期股贝塔回撤"],"title":"Trade War Re-escalation Triggers Selloff","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级触发回调"},"2019-08-09":{"body":"From August 2019 through January 2020, A-shares recovered on two catalysts: (1) the October 11, 2019 announcement of a preliminary US-China Phase One trade deal framework (China agreed to buy $40-50bn in US agricultural goods; US delayed the October 15 tariff hike); (2) a global technology rally driven by 5G rollout expectations and semiconductor demand. SHCOMP gained +12.3% and the growth style dominated (Electronics +51.8%, Media +36.3%, Computers +34.6%). Home Appliances gained +28.4% and ranked 5th of 28, outpacing the index on trade-war-relief and embedded real estate recovery demand; the sector benefited from its quality earnings profile even as the growth tape dominated thematically.","body_zh":"2019年8月至2020年1月，A股在两大催化剂推动下反弹：（1）2019年10月11日中美宣布初步第一阶段贸易协议框架（中国承诺采购400-500亿美元美国农产品，美国推迟10月15日关税上调）；（2）5G网络建设预期及半导体需求拉动全球科技股行情。上证综指上涨+12.3%，成长风格主导（电子+51.8%、传媒+36.3%、计算机+34.6%）。家用电器上涨+28.4%，在28个行业中排名第5，受益于贸易战风险缓解及地产回暖带动的内嵌需求修复；板块凭借优质盈利属性在成长风格主导的市场环境中仍跑赢大盘。","drivers":["US-China Phase One deal (Oct 11, 2019)","Trade war tariff risk reduction","5G rollout / tech rally beta","Real estate demand recovery support","Quality earnings re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["中美第一阶段贸易协议（2019年10月11日）","贸易战关税风险降低","5G建设/科技行情贝塔","地产需求回暖支撑","优质盈利重估"],"title":"Phase-One Deal Hopes and 5G Tech Rally","title_zh":"第一阶段协议希望与5G科技行情"},"2020-01-13":{"body":"The January 13 peak coincided with pre-Lunar New Year confidence highs; from late January, COVID-19 lockdowns in Wuhan and across major manufacturing hubs caused a collapse in both supply and demand. China GDP fell -6.8% YoY in Q1 2020 and offline retail spending fell over 60% in the weeks following lockdown. SHCOMP fell -14.6% but Home Appliances dropped -22.9%, ranking dead last (28th of 28) -- the sector bore a disproportionate hit because: (1) factories in Guangdong/Jiangsu/Zhejiang suspended production until late February; (2) property renovation activity collapsed; (3) retail showrooms closed; and (4) export logistics seized up. Telecoms (+3.0%), Coal (0.0%), and Pharma (-1.8%) held as defensive havens in a stay-at-home/healthcare narrative.","body_zh":"2020年1月13日见顶，恰为春节前信心高点；1月底起，武汉及主要制造业中心的新冠封控导致供需双端骤然坍塌。2020年一季度GDP同比下跌-6.8%，封控后数周线下零售骤降超60%。上证综指下跌-14.6%，但家用电器暴跌-22.9%，在28个行业中排名垫底（第28位）——板块遭受不成比例的冲击：（1）广东/江苏/浙江工厂停产至2月下旬；（2）房屋装修活动骤停；（3）线下卖场关门歇业；（4）出口物流陷入停滞。通信（+3.0%）、煤炭（0.0%）和医药（-1.8%）在居家/医疗叙事下相对抗跌。","drivers":["COVID-19 Wuhan lockdown (Jan 2020)","Factory shutdowns / supply chain seizure","Property renovation collapse","Retail store closures","Sector-specific demand destruction (worst performer)"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫情武汉封城（2020年1月）","工厂停产/供应链中断","房屋装修活动骤停","线下零售门店关闭","板块需求骤然消失（垫底表现）"],"title":"COVID-19 Shock: Worst Shenwan Performer","title_zh":"新冠疫情冲击：申万最差表现"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"From the March 2020 trough, China's swift factory restart and the global pandemic-driven stay-at-home equipment boom turbocharged appliance exports: as Western consumers spent stimulus on home upgrades, Chinese white-goods exports surged (shipments grew 38-50% YoY in H2 2020). Domestically, property sales rebounded strongly from H2 2020, and pent-up renovation demand released. SHCOMP gained +35.3% and Home Appliances surged +71.4%, ranking 6th of 28, driven by earnings beats at Midea (2020 revenue ~$40bn) and Haier. Defensives led the style (Services +139.7%, Food & Bev +127.2% topped), while Appliances benefited from its hybrid consumer-cyclical/quality profile within a broad index surge.","body_zh":"2020年3月触底后，中国工厂迅速复工，叠加全球疫情催生的居家升级需求热潮，白电出口量大幅攀升：西方消费者将补贴资金用于家居改善，中国白电出口在2020年下半年同比增长38-50%。国内方面，房产销售自2020年下半年大幅反弹，积压的装修需求集中释放。上证综指上涨+35.3%，家用电器大涨+71.4%，在28个行业中排名第6，受益于美的（2020年营收约400亿美元）和海尔的业绩超预期。防御型消费股主导风格（家庭服务+139.7%、食品饮料+127.2%领涨），家电凭借兼具消费周期与质量属性的混合特征分享涨幅。","drivers":["Global stay-at-home appliance export boom","China factory restart / supply chain recovery","Domestic property sales rebound (H2 2020)","Pent-up renovation demand release","Midea/Haier revenue and earnings beats"],"drivers_zh":["全球居家升级带动出口热潮","中国工厂复工/供应链修复","国内房产销售反弹（2020年下半年）","积压装修需求集中释放","美的/海尔营收与业绩超预期"],"title":"Global Re-opening Boom: Export and Property Recovery","title_zh":"全球重开热潮：出口与地产复苏"},"2021-01-13":{"body":"Home Appliances peaked in January 2021 as Midea hit its all-time high (~108 CNY per share) and entered a prolonged 15-month selloff that was the sector's worst relative performance on record: -44.6%, ranking dead last (31st of 31). Three reinforcing headwinds converged: (1) Evergrande's debt crisis escalated through mid-2021, triggering a property sector collapse that gutted completion-linked appliance demand (property sales fell 20-30% YoY by Q3 2021); (2) raw material cost inflation (copper, steel) squeezed margins; (3) the market rotated sharply from consumer-quality growth names to value (Coal +6.7%, Construction +4.1%, Utilities +3.5% led), with growth trailing value by 17.4pp. Zero-COVID lockdowns in 2022 then further destroyed demand and supply.","body_zh":"2021年1月，随着美的股价触及历史高位（约108元/股），家用电器见顶，随后进入长达15个月的最差相对表现回撤期：下跌-44.6%，在31个行业中排名垫底（第31位）。三重利空叠加：（1）恒大债务危机于2021年中全面爆发，引发地产板块崩塌，竣工交付相关白电需求被腰斩（2021年三季度房产销售同比下降20-30%）；（2）铜、钢等原材料成本通胀大幅压缩利润率；（3）市场风格从2020年的消费质量成长龙头急速切换至价值板块（煤炭+6.7%、建筑+4.1%、公用事业+3.5%领涨），成长跑输价值17.4个百分点。2022年动态清零管控下的封控进一步重创需求与供给。","drivers":["Evergrande property crisis (2021)","Property completions collapse / appliance demand destruction","Raw material cost inflation (copper, steel)","Growth-to-value rotation (extreme)","Zero-COVID lockdown demand shock"],"drivers_zh":["恒大债务危机（2021年）","楼盘竣工骤降/白电需求毁灭","原材料成本通胀（铜、钢）","成长至价值极端风格切换","动态清零封控需求冲击"],"title":"Evergrande Crisis and Value Rotation Crush","title_zh":"恒大危机与风格切换重创板块"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"China's A-share market bottomed on April 26, 2022 (SHCOMP ~2,863) following the worst Shanghai lockdown (March-June 2022); a two-month relief rally ensued as authorities signalled June 1 reopening targets. SHCOMP gained +17.7% into June 30. Home Appliances recovered +22.3%, ranking 9th of 31, roughly in line with the broad cyclicals bounce (cyclicals avg +22.2%). New-energy vehicles (Autos +46.0%) and Power Equipment (+54.1%) dominated on policy-push tailwinds, while the Appliances recovery was moderate: property still suppressed, and no new demand catalyst beyond reopening expectation. This was a short-covering relief bounce rather than a fundamental re-rating.","body_zh":"2022年4月26日，上证综指（约2863点）在上海最严封控（3-6月）的最低点触底，随后当局发出6月1日解封目标，两个月的解脱性反弹随即展开。上证综指至6月30日上涨+17.7%。家用电器反弹+22.3%，在31个行业中排名第9，与周期股整体反弹（均值+22.2%）大体一致。新能源汽车（整车+46.0%）和电力设备（+54.1%）在政策推动下领涨，家电反弹力度居中：地产压制仍在，除解封预期外无新增需求催化剂。这是一次空头回补的解脱性反弹，而非基本面重估。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown end signal (Jun 1 target)","SHCOMP oversold relief bounce","Short-covering cyclicals rebound","New-energy policy stimulus (EV/power equipment)","Reopening sentiment"],"drivers_zh":["上海封控解除信号（6月1日目标）","上证综指超跌反弹","空头回补周期股反弹","新能源政策刺激（新能源车/电力设备）","重开经济信心修复"],"title":"Shanghai Lockdown Lifts; Relief Rally","title_zh":"上海解封信号引发解脱性反弹"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"The June 2022 mini-peak gave way to a new selloff as property distress deepened: Evergrande missed offshore bond payments; mortgage boycotts spread to 200+ projects in August 2022; new home sales fell 30%+ YoY. Zero-COVID policy returned aggressively in autumn (multiple city lockdowns). SHCOMP fell -14.9% to end-October 2022. Home Appliances dropped -22.6%, ranking 29th of 31 -- a severe underperformer even against the weak market. Defense (+3.4%), Conglom (-0.1%), and Computers (-0.8%) led on government-spending and tech self-sufficiency themes. Growth led value by 8.1pp, punishing the property/consumer-recovery narrative that had underpinned Appliances bulls.","body_zh":"2022年6月短暂见顶后，随着地产困境加剧，市场再度下行：恒大出现离岸债违约；2022年8月停贷潮蔓延至逾200个楼盘；新房销售同比下降超30%。秋季动态清零政策再度强化执行（多城封控）。上证综指至2022年10月底下跌-14.9%。家用电器重挫-22.6%，在31个行业中排名第29，严重跑输疲弱大盘。国防（+3.4%）、综合（-0.1%）和计算机（-0.8%）凭借政府支出及科技自主主题领涨。成长跑赢价值8.1个百分点，彻底打压了此前支撑家电多头的地产/消费复苏叙事。","drivers":["Evergrande offshore bond default / mortgage boycotts","New home sales collapse (YoY -30%+)","Zero-COVID autumn resurgence","Government-spending / defense / tech self-sufficiency rotation","Property-linked consumer demand destruction"],"drivers_zh":["恒大离岸债违约/停贷潮爆发","新房销售骤跌（同比-30%+）","秋季动态清零再度收紧","政府支出/国防/科技自主轮动","地产关联消费需求毁灭"],"title":"Property Distress and Zero-COVID Relapse","title_zh":"地产困境与动态清零回潮"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"The October 31, 2022 trough marked a multi-factor inflection: Xi's party congress ended (Oct 22) and gradually signalled zero-COVID relaxation (December 7 dismantling of the policy), and A-shares pivoted to value/dividend quality as growth stocks faced earnings downgrades. From end-October 2022 through May 2024 (18 months), SHCOMP gained only +8.8% but Home Appliances surged +48.7%, ranking #1 of 31 Shenwan industries. Three forces drove the outperformance: (1) value/dividend re-rating as institutional money rotated from hypergrowth to quality income (Midea ~70% payout ratio, Haier ~48% payout); (2) zero-COVID exit restored demand with consumer spending recovery through 2023; (3) the wider market anticipated supply stimulus for property completions. Real Estate (-23.6%) and Power Equipment (-30.5%) lagged, confirming a sustained value-over-growth rotation where Appliances claimed the top rank.","body_zh":"2022年10月31日触底标志着多重因素拐点：习近平党代会闭幕（10月22日），逐步释放动态清零放开信号（12月7日正式解除），A股风格切换至价值/红利质量方向，成长股盈利遭下修。从2022年10月底至2024年5月（约18个月），上证综指仅累计上涨+8.8%，而家用电器大涨+48.7%，在31个申万行业中排名第1。三大力量驱动超额表现：（1）机构资金从高增长切换至优质收益的价值/红利重估（美的分红支付率约70%、海尔约48%）；（2）动态清零放开后消费支出贯穿2023年逐步修复；（3）市场预期地产竣工端供给侧刺激政策。房地产（-23.6%）和电力设备（-30.5%）垫底，确认持续性价值跑赢成长轮动中家电摘得桂冠。","drivers":["Zero-COVID exit (Dec 2022) demand recovery","Value/dividend quality rotation (Midea ~70% payout, Haier ~48%)","Industry consolidation: Midea/Haier/Gree record profits","Property completion support anticipated","Growth-stock earnings downgrades shift flows to quality"],"drivers_zh":["动态清零放开（2022年12月）需求修复","价值/红利质量轮动（美的分红率约70%、海尔约48%）","行业集中度提升，美的/海尔/格力利润创新高","预期地产竣工端刺激政策","成长股盈利下修带动资金流向优质板块"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit and Dividend Quality: #1 Sector","title_zh":"动态清零放开与红利质量：板块冠军"},"2024-05-13":{"body":"After topping in May 2024, Home Appliances fell -21.1% through July 25, ranking 28th of 31 -- a pronounced underperformer even as SHCOMP fell only -8.3%. The rotation driver was a shift in market leadership from value/dividend (which had led for 18 months) toward defensives (Utilities +1.2%, Electronics +0.5%, Banks -1.8% relatively held), while cyclical consumer discretionary names bore the brunt. The yi jiu huan xin trade-in subsidy was not yet launched (arriving July-August 2024), leaving the sector without a near-term demand catalyst. Defensives (-8.8%) outperformed cyclicals (-13.6%) in a flight-to-safety setting, and Appliances, as the prior cycle's star performer, suffered from concentrated profit-taking and mean-reversion pressure.","body_zh":"2024年5月见顶后，家用电器至7月25日下跌-21.1%，在31个行业中排名第28——尽管上证综指仅下跌-8.3%，但家电严重跑输。驱动因素为市场风格从领涨18个月的价值/红利切换为防御成长方向（公用事业+1.2%、电子+0.5%、银行-1.8%相对抗跌），周期性可选消费股首当其冲。以旧换新补贴尚未推出（2024年7-8月才落地），板块缺乏近期需求催化剂。防御股（-8.8%）在避险情绪下跑赢周期股（-13.6%），家电作为上一轮周期明星板块遭受获利了结和均值回归压力。","drivers":["Value-to-defensive growth style rotation","Trade-in subsidy absence / catalyst vacuum","Profit-taking from prior cycle outperformance","Flight-to-safety (defensives led)","SHCOMP moderate decline beta"],"drivers_zh":["价值风格向防御成长切换","以旧换新补贴尚未落地/催化剂缺位","前一轮周期超额收益获利了结","避险情绪（防御股领涨）","上证综指温和下跌贝塔"],"title":"Growth Rotation Leaves Value Sector Behind","title_zh":"成长风格切换使价值板块落后"},"2024-07-25":{"body":"From the July 2024 trough to January 2026, a massive A-share rally unfolded (SHCOMP +42.5%) triggered by China's September 24, 2024 stimulus package: PBOC cut the RRR by 50bp (releasing ~1 trillion yuan), cut the 7-day reverse repo rate to 1.5%, and the government expanded the yi jiu huan xin trade-in subsidy in August 2024 (15-20% of purchase price for 8 appliance categories), driving H2 2024 retail appliance sales up 20-39% YoY (Sep: +20.5%, Oct: +39.2%, Nov: +22.2%). Home Appliances gained +43.7%, but ranked only 20th of 31 in a growth/tech-dominated tape (Conglom +153.2%, Metals +141.3%, Telecoms +140.7% led; growth beat value by 50.3pp). The sector participated via broad beta and subsidy-supported fundamentals rather than as a cycle leader; its relative underperformance reflects growth-style domination that structurally disadvantages the dividend-quality value sector.","body_zh":"2024年7月底至2026年1月，A股随中国2024年9月24日一揽子刺激政策大幅走强（上证综指+42.5%）：人民银行降准50个基点（释放约1万亿元流动性），7天逆回购利率下调至1.5%；政府于2024年8月扩大以旧换新补贴范围（八类家电补贴15-20%），推动2024年下半年家电零售销售同比激增（9月+20.5%、10月+39.2%、11月+22.2%）。家用电器上涨+43.7%，但在成长/科技主导的市场中仅排名31个行业第20（综合+153.2%、有色金属+141.3%、通信+140.7%领涨；成长跑赢价值50.3个百分点）。板块主要通过大盘贝塔及补贴支撑的基本面参与本轮行情，而非引领板块；相对跑输反映成长风格主导从结构上压制红利质量价值板块。","drivers":["PBOC bazooka stimulus (Sept 24, 2024: RRR -50bp, rate cut)","Yi jiu huan xin subsidy expansion (Aug 2024)","Broad A-share beta (SHCOMP +42.5%)","H2 2024 retail appliance sales surge (+20-39% YoY)","Growth/tech style dominance (sector lagged leadership)"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行大招刺激（2024年9月24日：降准50bp、降息）","以旧换新补贴扩围（2024年8月）","A股大盘贝塔（上证综指+42.5%）","2024年下半年家电零售销售激增（同比+20-39%）","成长/科技风格主导（板块跑输领涨方向）"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka and Trade-In Subsidy Boom","title_zh":"人民银行大招与以旧换新补贴热潮"}},"now":"Home Appliances is in a Trough/Bottoming phase (pos: 9.0, rs_rank: 8/31, below its 200-day MA), returning -9.2% in the current window versus SHCOMP +1.6%. The current tape is a classic growth/tech rotation: Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, growth leading value by 18.2pp. Appliances sits 15th of 31 sectors, deep in the laggard bucket -- a property-linked, cash-generative, dividend-quality sector that receives no bid in a liquidity and AI-theme driven market. The sector is pressured by soft domestic demand (weak property completions, slower renovation activity) and US tariff headwinds on appliance exports, but is supported by the 2026 continuation of China's consumer-goods trade-in (yi jiu huan xin) subsidy scheme. The setup mirrors prior coiled-spring bottoms seen in late 2018 and late 2022 when growth-style dominance eventually faded; no leadership signal yet confirms that rotation has begun.","now_zh":"家用电器处于底部/筑底阶段（位置评分9.0，RS排名8/31，股价低于200日均线），当前窗口回报-9.2%，而上证综指上涨+1.6%。当前市场为典型的成长/科技行情：电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%，成长风格领先价值风格18.2个百分点。家电在31个申万行业中排名第15，深陷落后阵营——板块具有高地产关联度、价值属性及稳定现金流，在流动性驱动的AI科技行情中缺乏买盘。板块受内需疲软（楼盘竣工放缓、装修周期减弱）及出口关税压力拖累，但受2026年延续的以旧换新补贴政策支撑。当前格局与2018年底及2022年底的筑底形态相似，彼时成长风格最终消退触发价值轮动，但当前领涨信号尚未确认这一切换。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801120":{"legs":{"2011-08-12":{"body":"The August 5, 2011 S&P downgrade of US AAA credit and intensifying European sovereign debt fears around Italy and Spain hit A-shares broadly (SHCOMP -14.9%). Food & Beverage fell 25.5% but ranked 5th-best out of 16 Shenwan industries, outperforming deep cyclicals (Metals -33.4%, Electronics -33.7%). The PBoC had been tightening through H1 2011 and had not yet pivoted, so the downturn was global risk-off amplified by tight domestic liquidity. Utilities (-18.7%) and Transport (-22.5%) led defensively while value marginally outperformed growth by 5.5pp, consistent with global flight-to-quality.","body_zh":"2011年8月5日标普首次下调美国AAA信用评级，叠加欧债危机蔓延至意大利、西班牙，A股广泛受创（上证综指-14.9%）。食品饮料下跌25.5%，但在16个申万行业中排名第5，显著优于金属（-33.4%）、电子（-33.7%）等深度周期板块。央行上半年持续收紧货币政策尚未转向，整体是全球Risk-Off情绪叠加国内流动性偏紧的共振下行，防御色彩较浓但全行业普跌，价值风格边际占优。","drivers":["US credit downgrade Aug-5-2011","European sovereign debt crisis Italy/Spain","PBoC tightening not yet eased","global risk-off beta","defensive relative outperformance"],"drivers_zh":["美国AAA评级下调2011年8月5日","欧债危机意大利/西班牙","央行收紧周期尚未转向","全球风险规避","防御板块相对抗跌"],"title":"Global Risk-Off Beta; Sector Holds Relative Defense","title_zh":"全球Risk-Off贝塔下杀；板块相对防御"},"2012-01-16":{"body":"With SHCOMP essentially flat (-0.9%) but cyclicals averaging only +7.7% vs defensives +23.3%, this was a pure flight-to-safety rotation. Food & Beverage surged 33.8% to rank #1 of 16 sectors. The PBoC cut RRR twice (December 2011 and February 2012) signaling an easing pivot while European crisis fears kept investors defensively positioned. Baijiu stocks - Kweichow Moutai and Wuliangye - had strong earnings momentum from gift-buying demand not yet touched by anti-corruption (Xi Jinping formally took power November 2012). Premium liquor served as a quasi-store-of-value in a low-return equity environment, amplifying the defensive rotation.","body_zh":"上证综指近乎零涨幅（-0.9%），但周期股仅+7.7%而防御类平均+23.3%，呈现典型的防御避险轮动。食品饮料暴涨33.8%，在16个申万行业中排名第一。央行2011年12月及2012年2月两次降准，释放宽松信号；欧债危机持续压制风险偏好，资金涌入高质量消费类龙头。茅台、五粮液等白酒股礼赠需求景气度尚未受到反腐冲击（习近平2012年11月才正式接任），高端白酒在低回报市场中扮演类价值储藏功能。","drivers":["PBoC RRR cuts Dec-2011/Feb-2012 easing pivot","European crisis risk-off SHCOMP flat","baijiu gift demand pre-corruption intact","defensives +23% vs cyclicals +7%","premium liquor quasi-store-of-value"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准2011年12月/2012年2月宽松转向","欧债危机避险情绪大盘持平","白酒礼赠需求未受反腐冲击","防御+23%对比周期+7%","高端白酒类价值储藏属性"],"title":"Risk-Off Flight to Safety; Sector Leads Universe #1","title_zh":"避险资金涌入；板块领涨全市场第一"},"2012-07-13":{"body":"Food & Beverage collapsed 30.0% to rank dead last (#16 of 16) in a market that fell only 10.3%. The July 9, 2012 State Council prohibition on public sector purchasing of luxury alcoholic products was a direct demand shock to Moutai and Wuliangye whose core customers were government banquets and official gifting. This followed Premier Wen Jiabao's March 2012 announcement of controls on high-grade alcohol in public consumption. Real Estate held at -12.6% and Steel at -9.0%, both far outperforming food & bev, confirming this was a sector-specific political demand shock rather than a market-wide move.","body_zh":"食品饮料暴跌30.0%，在同期大盘仅下跌10.3%的背景下排名垫底（第16/16）。2012年7月9日国务院明令禁止公务接待采购高档烟酒，对茅台、五粮液的政务宴请核心客群造成直接冲击；此前2012年3月温家宝已宣布限制公务高档酒消费。房地产（-12.6%）和钢铁（-9.0%）均明显好于食饮，印证此次下跌是政策冲击型行业性下杀，而非大盘系统性风险。","drivers":["State Council luxury alcohol ban July-9-2012","Wen Jiabao public consumption curbs March 2012","government banquet demand destruction","sector-specific shock vs SHCOMP -10%","baijiu channel inventory build"],"drivers_zh":["国务院7月9日禁购高档烟酒","温家宝2012年3月公务消费限制","政务宴请需求断崖","行业特定政策冲击大盘仅跌10%","白酒渠道库存积压"],"title":"State Council Liquor Ban; Baijiu Absolute Dead Last","title_zh":"国务院禁购高档酒；白酒绝对垫底"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"SHCOMP rose 13.8% led overwhelmingly by growth themes (Electronics +72.9%, Pharma +59.9%, Retail +56.7%) with a massive 61.4pp growth-over-value gap. Food & Beverage gained only 19.7% (ranked 13th of 16), dragged by the December 4, 2012 Eight-Point Regulation - Xi Jinping formally banned alcohol at party and military functions immediately after the 18th Party Congress in November 2012. This caused baijiu industry growth to plummet from 27% in 2012 toward negative by 2014. F&B could not participate in the tech/growth wave because its core premium segment faced existential regulatory pressure.","body_zh":"上证综指上涨13.8%，但行情由成长主题主导（电子+72.9%、医药+59.9%、商贸+56.7%），成长跑赢价值61.4个百分点。食品饮料仅涨19.7%（行业第13/16），被反腐冲击拖累：2012年12月4日八项规定正式发布，配合11月十八大启动的反腐运动，党政军机关禁止公务宴请饮酒，白酒行业增速从2012年的27%骤降并最终转负。食饮无法参与科技/成长主线，其核心高端品类的需求遭受系统性政策压制。","drivers":["Eight-Point Regulation Dec-4-2012 alcohol ban","18th Party Congress anti-corruption launch Nov-2012","61pp growth-over-value gap tech led","baijiu government demand collapse","F&B unable to join growth rotation ranked 13th"],"drivers_zh":["2012年12月4日八项规定禁酒","十八大反腐运动启动2012年11月","科技领涨成长跑赢价值61pp","白酒政务需求崩塌","食饮无法参与成长轮动排名第13"],"title":"Growth Rally Led by Tech; F&B Lags Anti-Corruption Wave","title_zh":"科技领涨成长行情；食饮受反腐拖累落后"},"2013-10-21":{"body":"Food & Beverage fell 20.9% (ranked 27th of 28) against a SHCOMP decline of just 9.2%. Electronics (+3.2%) and Banks (+1.3%) were essentially flat - not a market-wide collapse but a severe sector de-rating. By 2013 baijiu industry profit growth was negative for the first time, channel inventory piled up as distributors destocked, and Kweichow Moutai's stock halved as its revenue fell for the first time in decades. Defensives as a group fell 9.7%, similar to cyclicals, indicating F&B underperformed even within defensives due to the unique political demand shock destroying the premium tier.","body_zh":"食品饮料下跌20.9%，在大盘仅跌9.2%的背景下排名27/28。电子（+3.2%）、银行（+1.3%）几乎持平，印证这并非系统性市场下跌而是行业特异性大幅杀估值。白酒行业2013年利润增长首次转负，渠道库存急剧积压，茅台股价腰斩、营收出现历史首次下滑。消费防御类整体跌9.7%，与周期股相近，但食饮跌幅远超，凸显政治性需求冲击的独特性——高端品类遭系统性摧毁，大众食品企业相对未受波及。","drivers":["baijiu 2013 first negative profit growth","Kweichow Moutai revenue decline first time in decades","anti-corruption distributor destocking channel bust","sector de-rating vs flat market","premium tier destroyed mass-market unscathed"],"drivers_zh":["白酒2013年利润首次负增长","茅台营收历史首次下滑","反腐导致经销商大规模去库存","大盘平稳行业特异性杀估值","高端品类遭系统性摧毁大众食品相对稳定"],"title":"Anti-Corruption Channel Bust; Sector Dead-Last Laggard","title_zh":"反腐渠道崩溃；板块大幅落后垫底"},"2014-06-19":{"body":"The 2014-2015 A-share bull market drove SHCOMP up 155.3%, fueled by six PBoC RRR and rate cuts (November 2014 to June 2015) and explosion in margin financing. Food & Beverage gained +117.2% but ranked 27th of 28, deeply lagging Computers (+292.2%), Construction (+282.2%), and Coal (+272.1%). Cyclicals averaged +222.1% vs defensives +142.5%. Baijiu was still in its post-corruption trough, unable to attract hot money chasing high-beta thematic plays. The sector gained on the broad tide but was the structural laggard of one of China's largest bull markets.","body_zh":"2014-2015年A股大牛市推动上证综指上涨155.3%，央行六次降准降息（2014年11月至2015年6月）叠加融资融券爆发式增长。食品饮料涨117.2%，在28个行业中仅排第27，远落后于计算机（+292.2%）、建筑（+282.2%）、煤炭（+272.1%）。周期平均+222.1%对比防御+142.5%。白酒仍处于反腐冲击后的底部复苏阶段，无法吸引追逐高弹性主题的热钱。板块绝对收益可观，但在本轮大牛市中结构性垫底。","drivers":["PBoC 6 RRR/rate cuts Nov-2014 to Jun-2015","margin financing boom","cyclical beta +222% vs defensives +142%","baijiu post-corruption recovery lag","SHCOMP +155% broad rising tide"],"drivers_zh":["央行6次降准降息2014-2015","融资融券爆发","周期高弹性+222%对比防御+142%","白酒反腐后复苏滞后","大盘+155%全面普涨"],"title":"Leverage-Fueled Bull; F&B Lags as Cyclicals Dominate","title_zh":"杠杆牛市；食饮受制于反腐后遗症落后"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015 the CSRC announced draft rules capping margin lending, bursting the leverage bubble. SHCOMP crashed 32.1% in four weeks as margin calls cascaded and 1,400+ companies suspended trading. Food & Beverage fell 32.6% but ranked 3rd-best of 28 sectors (trailing only Banks -10.6% and Brokers -30.0%), as consumer staples held up far better than high-beta cyclicals (Coal -59.1%, Defense -52.0%). Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 12.6pp and value beat growth by 6.0pp, confirming a pure deleveraging flush rather than sector-specific deterioration.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会宣布限制融资规模草案，直接刺破杠杆泡沫。上证综指四周内暴跌32.1%，超过1400家公司停牌，融资盘遭强制平仓。食品饮料下跌32.6%，但在28个行业中排名第3，防御属性明显优于高弹性周期板块（煤炭-59.1%、军工-52.0%）。防御类跑赢周期类12.6个百分点，价值跑赢成长6.0个百分点，确认这是去杠杆/避险情绪驱动的系统性下杀。","drivers":["CSRC margin lending cap June-12-2015","leverage bubble burst margin call cascade","1400+ companies trading suspended","defensives +12.6pp vs cyclicals","value over growth 6pp"],"drivers_zh":["证监会6月12日限制融资","杠杆泡沫破裂融资盘强制平仓","1400家以上公司停牌","防御类跑赢周期类12.6pp","价值跑赢成长6pp"],"title":"CSRC Margin Curb Triggers Crash; F&B Relatively Defensive","title_zh":"证监会限制两融引爆崩盘；食饮相对防御"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"After the crash trough, the government launched an unprecedented rescue: CSRC suspended IPOs, a ~1.2 trillion yuan stabilization fund was created, and institutions were directed to buy. SHCOMP rebounded 17.6% in two weeks. The bounce was led by oversold high-beta cyclicals: Coal +101.5%, Defense +65.1%, Agriculture +41.2% - names most crushed in the prior leg. Food & Beverage gained only 18.2% (ranked 26th of 28) as its shallower prior decline left less rebound potential. Banks fell -1.2%, confirming this was a speculative risk-on snap-back, not a defensive rotation.","body_zh":"2015年7月初政府启动史无前例的救市行动（证监会暂停IPO、组建约1.2万亿救市资金、引导机构护盘），上证综指两周内反弹17.6%。反弹以高弹性周期超跌股为主：煤炭+101.5%、军工+65.1%、农业+41.2%。食品饮料仅涨18.2%（排第26/28），因前期跌幅相对较浅而反弹空间有限。银行-1.2%亦印证这是投机性风险偏好快速修复而非防御轮动。","drivers":["CSRC IPO suspension July 2015 market rescue","1.2tn yuan stabilization fund","oversold cyclical snap-back Coal +101%","risk-on rebound beta leadership","F&B shallow prior decline limits upside"],"drivers_zh":["证监会暂停IPO救市2015年7月","1.2万亿护盘资金","超跌煤炭+101%周期股反弹","风险偏好修复Beta主导","食饮前期跌幅浅弹性不足"],"title":"State Rescue Bounce; Oversold Cyclicals Lead, F&B Lags","title_zh":"政府救市反弹；超跌周期领涨食饮落后"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"A second wave of A-share selling hit July 23 through September 15, 2015, as government support proved insufficient and global growth fears resurfaced with August 24 Black Monday (SHCOMP -8.5% in a day). SHCOMP fell 27.1%. Food & Beverage dropped only 22.0%, ranking 2nd-best behind Banks (-12.5%). Defensives averaged -22.6% vs cyclicals -31.1% (8.5pp outperformance). The PBoC's August 11 yuan devaluation (1.9% fix cut) hit import-dependent cyclicals harder than domestic consumer staples, cementing the sector's defensive role in market stress.","body_zh":"2015年7月下旬至9月中旬爆发A股第二轮下跌，政府救市力度不及预期，全球增长担忧重燃（8月24日黑色星期一上证综指单日-8.5%）。大盘整体下跌27.1%，食品饮料仅跌22.0%，排名第2（仅次于银行-12.5%）。防御类平均-22.6%对比周期类-31.1%（超额抗跌8.5个百分点）。8月11日央行将人民币中间价一次性下调1.9%，汇率冲击对进口依赖型周期板块打击更大，进一步强化了食饮的防御属性。","drivers":["second A-share crash wave Aug-Sep 2015","CNY devaluation Aug-11-2015 fix cut 1.9%","Black Monday Aug-24 SHCOMP -8.5%","defensives -22.6% vs cyclicals -31.1%","value over growth 5.8pp"],"drivers_zh":["A股第二轮下跌2015年8-9月","8月11日人民币中间价下调1.9%","黑色星期一8月24日上证-8.5%","防御-22.6%对比周期-31.1%","价值跑赢成长5.8pp"],"title":"Second Crash Wave; F&B Again Defensive Runner-Up","title_zh":"第二轮崩跌；食饮再次防御第二抗跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"The September-December 2015 stabilization rally (SHCOMP +21.5%) was led by tech/internet themes (Computers +63.8%, Electronics +53.1%, Telecoms +51.6%) with a 16.9pp growth-over-value gap. Food & Beverage gained 26.2% but ranked only 23rd of 28 sectors - it participated in the relief rally but could not match tech leadership. PBoC cut benchmark rates in October 2015 (-25bp) and reduced RRR (-50bp), boosting risk appetite broadly but disproportionately benefiting growth-thematic names over consumer staples.","body_zh":"2015年9月至12月大盘反弹21.5%，行情由科技互联网成长领涨（计算机+63.8%、电子+53.1%、通信+51.6%），成长跑赢价值16.9个百分点。食品饮料涨26.2%，但仅排第23/28，参与了反弹但无法跟上互联网/科技主线。央行2015年10月降息25bp并降准50bp，宽松流动性支持风险偏好回升，但成长板块受益更显著。","drivers":["PBoC rate cut Oct-2015 -25bp RRR -50bp","internet/tech growth 16.9pp lead","SHCOMP +21.5% broad stabilization rally","F&B mid-pack 23rd/28","growth re-asserts over value post-crash"],"drivers_zh":["央行2015年10月降息25bp降准50bp","互联网/科技成长领涨16.9pp","大盘+21.5%企稳反弹","食饮中游23/28","成长跑赢价值在崩盘后重新确立"],"title":"Post-Crash Stabilization; Tech Leads, F&B Mid-Pack","title_zh":"崩盘后企稳反弹；科技领涨食饮中游"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"The January 2016 circuit-breaker crisis (triggered January 4 and 7 when the new CSI-300 mechanism halted trading both days) was driven by: Caixin Manufacturing PMI sub-50 confirming slowing growth; RMB depreciation accelerating capital outflows; and the circuit-breaker itself paradoxically accelerating selling as investors rushed to exit before halts. SHCOMP fell 27.3% from the December 22 peak. Food & Beverage fell 25.4%, ranking 2nd-best behind Banks (-17.1%), while growth/tech names (Computers -35.9%, Conglomerate -36.8%) were crushed. Defensives beat cyclicals by 5.1pp confirming pure risk-off.","body_zh":"2016年1月熔断危机（1月4日及7日CSI 300两度触发-7%熔断），触发因素：财新制造业PMI跌破50确认增长放缓；人民币贬值压力加速资本外流；熔断机制反而加速抛售。上证综指从12月22日高点下跌27.3%。食品饮料下跌25.4%，排名第2（仅次于银行-17.1%），计算机（-35.9%）、综合（-36.8%）等成长板块跌幅惨重。防御类跑赢周期类5.1个百分点，确认纯粹的避险驱动。","drivers":["circuit-breaker meltdown Jan-4-7-2016","Caixin PMI sub-50 growth scare","RMB depreciation capital outflows","circuit-breaker paradox accelerates selling","defensive flight-to-safety vs growth collapse"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月4日-7日熔断危机","财新PMI跌破50增长恐慌","人民币贬值资本外流","熔断机制反向加速抛售悖论","防御避险成长板块崩溃"],"title":"Circuit-Breaker Meltdown; F&B 2nd-Most Defensive","title_zh":"熔断机制崩盘；食饮第二防御抗跌"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"Food & Beverage surged 137.7% from January 2016 to June 2018 to rank #1 of 28 sectors over 2.5 years, driven by: (1) the consumption upgrade (消费升级) structural megatrend as China's rapidly expanding middle class premiumized spending; (2) anti-corruption fears fading as baijiu adapted from government-gifting to commercial/retail channels, with Moutai implementing price hikes in 2017; (3) a value/defensive-led rotation (defensive +46.8% vs cyclicals +15.4%, a 31.4pp gap) while SHCOMP rose only 16.0% - confirming this was structural alpha rather than beta; (4) Appliances also led (+88.7%) on the same upgrade dynamic.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2016年1月至2018年6月累计大涨137.7%，在28个申万行业中排名第一，开启长达2.5年的超级行情。驱动因素：（1）消费升级结构性大趋势——中产阶级高速扩张、消费品质全面提升；（2）反腐影响边际消退——白酒品牌成功从政务消费向商务及零售礼赠渠道转型，茅台2017年推行提价；（3）价值/防御风格主导（防御+46.8%对比周期+15.4%，差距31.4pp），大盘仅涨16.0%，印证这是结构性Alpha而非市场Beta；（4）家电同期上涨+88.7%，共同受益于升级趋势。","drivers":["consumption upgrade (消费升级) megatrend","anti-corruption fear fade baijiu channel recovery","Moutai price hikes 2017 retail demand recovery","defensive +31.4pp over cyclicals SHCOMP +16%","middle-class expansion premiumization"],"drivers_zh":["消费升级大趋势","反腐影响消退白酒渠道转型","茅台2017年提价零售需求恢复","防御跑赢周期+31.4pp大盘仅+16%","中产扩张消费品质提升"],"title":"Consumption Upgrade Supercycle; 2.5-Year #1 Run","title_zh":"消费升级超级周期；2.5年全市场第一"},"2018-06-12":{"body":"Food & Beverage crashed 35.8% (ranked dead last #28 of 28) as the US-China trade war escalated: on June 15, 2018 the US imposed 25% tariffs on USD 34bn of Chinese goods (effective July 6), with China retaliating equivalently. SHCOMP fell 16.6% and value outperformed growth by 8.8pp. The collapse was disproportionate because F&B had become the most crowded institutional long after 2.5 years of outperformance - when risk appetite collapsed, funds loaded with Moutai (which peaked above 700 yuan) unwound aggressively. Kweichow Moutai lost roughly a quarter of its market value in October 2018 alone.","body_zh":"食品饮料暴跌35.8%，在28个申万行业中垫底。随着中美贸易战急剧升级——2018年6月15日美国宣布对340亿美元中国商品加征25%关税（7月6日生效），中国随即对等报复——上证综指下跌16.6%，价值跑赢成长8.8个百分点。此次下跌幅度严重失真：食饮经历2.5年超额收益后已成为最拥挤的机构多头——当风险偏好崩塌，大量机构在茅台（2018年高峰逾700元）上的重仓被迫快速减仓，茅台仅2018年10月一个月便蒸发约四分之一市值。","drivers":["US tariffs 25% USD34bn Jun-15-2018 effective Jul-6","China equivalent retaliation","crowded long unwind after 2.5yr outperformance","Moutai 700+ yuan position liquidation Oct-2018","SHCOMP -16.6% trade war risk collapse"],"drivers_zh":["美国6月15日加征25%关税7月6日生效","中国对等报复","2.5年超额收益后拥挤多头出清","茅台700元高位机构大规模减仓2018年10月","大盘-16.6%贸易战风险偏好崩塌"],"title":"Trade War Triggers Crowded-Long Unwind; Dead Last","title_zh":"贸易战触发拥挤多头出清；行业垫底"},"2018-10-30":{"body":"From late October 2018 through February 2021, Food & Beverage delivered 305.0% to rank #1 of 28 - the defining A-share trade of the era. Three sequential tailwinds: (1) 2019 recovery: PBOC easing and US-China Phase 1 trade truce signed December 2019 restored premium consumer confidence; (2) COVID-2020 liquidity flood: PBOC cut 1-year LPR to 3.85% in April 2020 and injected trillions, sending quality-growth investors into Moutai/Wuliangye as crisis-proof compounders while cyclicals collapsed; (3) 2020-2021 institutional re-rating: onshore and Stock Connect foreign funds designated Moutai, Wuliangye, and Haitian Flavoring as core assets (核心资产), creating self-reinforcing consensus positioning. Growth beat value by 39.4pp while SHCOMP gained 42.3%.","body_zh":"从2018年10月至2021年2月，食品饮料累计大涨305.0%，在28个申万行业中排名第一——这是这一时代A股最具决定性的核心资产行情，历时28个月。三段递进式顺风：（1）2019年修复：央行宽松叠加中美第一阶段贸易协议2019年12月签署；（2）2020年新冠流动性洪水：央行将1年期LPR降至2020年4月的3.85%并大规模注水，茅台、五粮液被视为穿越危机的复利型资产；（3）2020-2021年机构重塑估值体系：内外资共同将茅台、五粮液、海天味业定性为\"核心资产\"，形成自我强化的共识配置。成长跑赢价值39.4个百分点，大盘涨42.3%，Beta与巨大Alpha共振。","drivers":["COVID PBOC LPR 3.85% Apr-2020 liquidity flood","core asset (核心资产) institutional consensus","US-China Phase 1 trade truce Dec-2019","Stock Connect foreign buying Moutai/Wuliangye","quality-growth flight vs cyclical collapse"],"drivers_zh":["新冠央行LPR降至3.85%2020年4月流动性洪水","核心资产机构共识配置","中美第一阶段贸易协议2019年12月","沪深港通外资持续买入茅台/五粮液","周期股崩塌资金转向消费质量龙头"],"title":"Core Asset Supercycle: 28-Month +305% Mega-Rally","title_zh":"核心资产超级周期；28个月+305%巨型行情"},"2021-02-10":{"body":"Food & Beverage crashed 26.1% in less than a month (ranked dead last #28 of 28) while Steel +15.1%, Construction +7.5%, and Utilities +7.0% led. The trigger was global rate shock: US 10-year Treasury yields surged from ~1.0% in January 2021 to 1.75% by March 2021, violently repricing duration-sensitive growth/quality stocks worldwide. Moutai at approximately 2,600 yuan in February 2021 carried over 60x forward PE, making it acutely exposed. Value beat growth by 5.4pp and cyclicals outperformed defensives by 8.8pp with SHCOMP -8.1% - confirming a global-rates-driven style rotation, not a domestic fundamental shock.","body_zh":"食品饮料不足一个月暴跌26.1%，排名28/28垫底，而钢铁+15.1%、建筑+7.5%、公用事业+7.0%领涨。触发因素是全球利率冲击：美国10年期国债收益率从2021年1月约1.0%飙升至3月的1.75%，全球成长/质量股遭遇剧烈的久期重定价。茅台2021年2月股价约2600元，对应远期市盈率逾60倍，对全球利率重定价极度敏感。价值跑赢成长5.4个百分点，周期类跑赢防御8.8个百分点，大盘跌8.1%，印证这是全球利率驱动的风格轮动，而非国内基本面冲击。","drivers":["US 10-yr Treasury 1.0% to 1.75% Jan-Mar 2021","global growth/quality duration repricing","Moutai 60x+ forward PE extreme valuation","core asset consensus violent unwind","cyclicals +15% steel/construction vs F&B -26%"],"drivers_zh":["美债10年期从1.0%飙升至1.75%（2021年1-3月）","全球成长/质量股久期重定价","茅台远期PE超60倍极端估值","核心资产共识暴力瓦解","周期股+15%钢铁/建筑对比食饮-26%"],"title":"US Rate Shock; Core Asset Consensus Violently Unwinds","title_zh":"美债利率冲击；核心资产共识暴力瓦解"},"2021-03-09":{"body":"Food & Beverage rebounded 27.0% from the March 2021 trough to rank #1 of 28, as the global yield spike paused and investors returned to quality domestic consumer names. Defensives averaged +14.5% vs cyclicals +4.9% with SHCOMP +7.2% - a defensive-led quality rebound not a broad market move. Moutai's Q1-2021 earnings beat expectations, reassuring the market that a controlled yield rise would not break the long-run consumption story. Pharma (+21.2%) also recovered, consistent with a quality/growth restoration trade.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2021年3月低点反弹27.0%，在28个申万行业中重夺第一，因全球利率冲击暂缓，机构资金重回国内优质消费龙头。防御类平均+14.5%对比周期类+4.9%，大盘+7.2%，印证这是以防御/质量为主导的修复而非宽基行情。茅台一季报超预期，市场相信可控的利率上行不会动摇中国长期消费故事，机构资金迅速回流。医药（+21.2%）同步修复，与质量/成长风格恢复的逻辑一致。","drivers":["US Treasury yield surge pauses March 2021","Moutai Q1-2021 earnings beat reassurance","defensives +14.5% vs cyclicals +4.9%","institutional quality rotation return","SHCOMP +7.2% broad stabilization"],"drivers_zh":["美债利率上行暂缓2021年3月","茅台一季报超预期提振信心","防御+14.5%对比周期+4.9%","机构资金重回质量消费龙头","大盘+7.2%整体企稳"],"title":"Yield Shock Pauses; Quality Defensives Rebound to #1","title_zh":"利率冲击暂缓；质量防御反弹重夺第一"},"2021-06-07":{"body":"Food & Beverage was the worst performer (-28.5%, ranked #28 of 28) as a commodity supercycle rotation dominated: Metals +46.0%, Steel +40.2%, Power Equipment +39.3%. Surging global commodity prices (iron ore, copper) and China's credit recovery supported infrastructure/materials. Additionally in late August 2021, China's national market regulator held an industry symposium targeting baijiu producers, signaling concerns about overheated channel inventory and speculative price inflation in Moutai, causing a sharp selloff (Moutai -4%+ in a day on August 26). SHCOMP was essentially flat (-1.5%), confirming pure sector rotation.","body_zh":"食品饮料在此区间以-28.5%垫底（第28/28），原因是全球商品超级周期轮动主导市场：金属+46.0%、钢铁+40.2%、电力设备+39.3%。铁矿石、铜等大宗商品价格暴涨，中国信贷回暖支撑基建/材料。与此同时，2021年8月26日国家市场监管总局召开白酒行业座谈会，明确表态关注渠道库存过热和茅台股价投机性泡沫，引发监管恐慌性抛售（茅台单日跌幅超4%）。大盘几乎持平（-1.5%），印证这是纯粹的风格/行业轮动。","drivers":["commodity supercycle metals +46% steel +40%","global iron ore copper price surge","Aug-26-2021 baijiu regulator symposium crackdown signal","SHCOMP flat -1.5% pure sector rotation","overheated Moutai channel inventory speculative fear"],"drivers_zh":["商品超级周期金属+46%钢铁+40%","全球铁矿石铜价格飙升","2021年8月26日白酒监管座谈会发出整治信号","大盘持平-1.5%确认纯行业轮动","茅台渠道库存过热投机性担忧"],"title":"Commodity Supercycle Rotation; August Regulatory Scare","title_zh":"商品超级周期轮动；8月监管惊吓"},"2021-08-31":{"body":"Food & Beverage surged 28.0% (ranked #1 of 31) as the commodity/metal supercycle paused (Metals -13.5%, Steel -22.7%) and capital rotated back to quality consumer names. Growth beat value by 12.3pp while SHCOMP rose only 3.3% - confirming the outperformance was structural alpha. The August baijiu regulatory scare proved short-lived as no formal crackdown materialized; Moutai's H1-2021 results showed 11.7% revenue growth, reassuring investors. The symmetry of the rotation (metals led June-August then reversed violently August-December) reflects pure mean-reversion within Shenwan leadership.","body_zh":"食品饮料大涨28.0%（第1/31），因商品/金属超级周期告一段落（金属-13.5%、钢铁-22.7%），资金重新轮动至优质消费龙头。成长/防御跑赢价值12.3个百分点，大盘仅涨3.3%，确认食饮大幅超额收益为结构性Alpha。8月白酒监管惊吓事后证明是虚惊一场，茅台2021年中报显示营收增长11.7%，提振市场信心。轮动的对称性（金属6-8月领涨、8-12月急速反转）反映申万行业内纯粹的均值回归。","drivers":["commodity supercycle reversal metals -13% steel -22%","Aug-2021 baijiu regulatory scare proved transient","Moutai H1-2021 revenue +11.7% reassurance","growth 12.3pp over value SHCOMP +3.3%","mean-reversion from materials back to consumer quality"],"drivers_zh":["商品周期反转金属-13%钢铁-22%","8月白酒监管担忧证明是虚惊一场","茅台2021年中报营收+11.7%","成长跑赢价值12.3pp大盘+3.3%","资金从材料均值回归消费龙头"],"title":"Metals Reverse; F&B Rebounds to #1 of 31 Sectors","title_zh":"金属反转；食饮反弹重夺31个行业第一"},"2021-12-14":{"body":"Food & Beverage fell 27.2% (ranked dead last #31 of 31) from December 2021 to March 2022 as two shocks hit simultaneously: (1) The Fed's December 15, 2021 FOMC meeting signaled three rate hikes in 2022, triggering a global de-rating of high-PE quality/growth assets - Coal led at +25.6% and value beat growth by 11.3pp; (2) China's Evergrande/property crisis deepened (Evergrande failed to deliver a restructuring plan by end-2021), crushing consumer confidence and driving a flight to energy/coal. As one of the highest-PE sectors (Moutai still 50x+), F&B bore the full force of the value rotation.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2021年12月至2022年3月下跌27.2%，在31个申万行业中垫底（第31/31），原因是两大宏观冲击同步来袭：（1）美联储2021年12月15日FOMC会议预告2022年三次加息，全球高PE成长/质量资产遭系统性估值下调——煤炭领涨+25.6%，价值跑赢成长11.3个百分点；（2）中国恒大/房地产危机深化（恒大2021年底未能提交重组方案），严重打压消费信心，资金流向能源/煤炭等财政稳定代理资产。作为PE最高的板块之一（茅台仍在50倍以上），食饮承受了价值风格切换的全部压力。","drivers":["Fed FOMC Dec-15-2021 hawkish pivot 3 hikes 2022","Evergrande restructuring failure end-2021","global high-PE de-rating Coal +25.6%","value over growth 11.3pp tilt","consumer confidence crushed property crisis"],"drivers_zh":["美联储12月15日鹰派转向预告2022年三次加息","恒大2021年底重组失败","全球高PE杀估值煤炭+25.6%","价值跑赢成长11.3pp","房地产危机打压消费信心"],"title":"Fed Hawkish Pivot + Property Crisis; Dead Last Again","title_zh":"美联储鹰派转向+恒大危机；再度垫底"},"2022-03-29":{"body":"Food & Beverage surged 24.0% from late March to June 2022, ranking #1 tied with Autos. The catalyst was a policy pivot amid the Shanghai lockdown (which began April 1, 2022): the State Council announced pro-growth policies on May 25, 2022, and foreign investors deployed the China Put playbook via Stock Connect, buying Moutai and China Tourism Duty Free at lockdown-trough valuations. SHCOMP rose 6.1% and the recovery mix (Autos +24%, Beauty +19%) was a selective quality/consumer rebound rather than broad risk-on cyclical rotation, consistent with institutional repositioning in beaten-down domestic consumer leaders.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2022年3月底至6月大涨24.0%，与汽车并列第一。催化因素是上海封控（4月1日正式封城）背景下政策明显转向：国务院2022年5月25日宣布稳增长政策，外资投资者通过沪深港通执行\"中国看跌期权\"策略，大量买入茅台、中国中免等，将封控低点视为买入机会。大盘上涨6.1%，反弹结构（汽车+24%、美容+19%）呈现选择性优质消费修复而非宽基周期轮动，与机构资金重仓超跌国内消费龙头的逻辑一致。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown Apr-1-2022 China Put reposition","State Council pro-growth policy May-25-2022","Stock Connect foreign buying Moutai at lockdown trough","selective quality consumer recovery not broad cyclical","SHCOMP +6.1% modest broad support"],"drivers_zh":["上海封控4月1日中国看跌期权重新布局","国务院5月25日稳增长政策","沪深港通外资封控低点买入茅台","选择性优质消费修复非宽基周期轮动","大盘+6.1%温和支撑"],"title":"Shanghai Lockdown China Put; Foreign Buying Returns","title_zh":"上海封控中国看跌期权；外资回流买入"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"Food & Beverage fell 31.3% from July to October 2022 (ranked 30th of 31), as China's property crisis entered its acute phase: mortgage boycotts spread to 343 projects by September 2022, and the 20th Party Congress in October 2022 delivered no economic reopening signals. SHCOMP fell 14.9%. Growth led on a relative basis (growth beat value 8.1pp with Defense +3.4% and Computers -0.8% holding up), but F&B fell far harder than the defensive average because premium consumer names were most exposed to the demand-confidence collapse from property balance sheet destruction and zero-COVID uncertainty.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2022年7月至10月下跌31.3%，排名30/31，原因是中国房地产危机进入最急性阶段：2022年9月楼盘烂尾断供潮蔓延至343个项目，10月二十大召开期间未传递经济重启信号。大盘跌14.9%。成长防御性占优（成长跑赢价值8.1个百分点，国防+3.4%、计算机-0.8%相对抗跌），但食饮跌幅远超防御类均值——高端消费品对房产资产缩水引发的消费信心崩塌和持续零新冠不确定性敞口最大。","drivers":["mortgage boycott 343 projects Sep-2022","20th Party Congress Oct-2022 no reopening signal","zero-COVID demand confidence collapse","property balance sheet destruction household spending cut","premium consumer most exposed to confidence shock"],"drivers_zh":["烂尾楼断供潮343个项目2022年9月","二十大10月无重启信号","零新冠政策需求信心崩塌","房产缩水损伤居民资产负债表","高端消费对消费信心冲击敞口最大"],"title":"Property Crisis Depth + 20th Party Congress Uncertainty","title_zh":"房地产危机+二十大不确定性；消费信心崩塌"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"Food & Beverage surged 41.0% from October 2022 to February 2023 to rank #1 of 31 sectors in the zero-COVID exit/reopening rally. Zero-COVID was formally dismantled in December 2022 and SHCOMP rose 13.7%. Food & Beverage outperformed because premium baijiu and food service are direct beneficiaries of resumed social and commercial activity - restaurants reopening, banquets returning, gifting seasons restored. Bldg Materials (+30.8%) and Media (+34.4%) also led, consistent with a domestic recovery/reopening theme. Energy and defense lagged, confirming the rotation was into consumption recovery rather than value-cyclicals.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2022年10月至2023年2月大涨41.0%，在31个申万行业中排名第一，充分受益于零新冠政策退出/重开行情。2022年12月正式解除零新冠政策，大盘上涨13.7%。食品饮料领涨的逻辑在于高端白酒和餐饮服务是社交和商务活动恢复的最直接受益者——餐厅重开、宴请回归、礼赠旺季到来。建材（+30.8%）、传媒（+34.4%）同步领涨，均属国内经济复苏/重开主题。能源/军工落后，确认资金向消费复苏轮动。","drivers":["zero-COVID dismantled December 2022","social/commercial activity resumption banquets gifting","20th Party Congress completed policy clarity","SHCOMP +13.7% reopening surge","domestic consumption rotation vs energy/defense laggard"],"drivers_zh":["零新冠政策2022年12月正式解除","社交商务活动恢复宴请礼赠旺季","二十大闭幕政策不确定性消除","大盘+13.7%重开乐观情绪","资金轮动至国内消费复苏能源/军工落后"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit Rally; F&B Leads Reopening Recovery","title_zh":"零新冠政策退出行情；食饮领涨重开复苏"},"2023-02-20":{"body":"Food & Beverage fell 43.7% over 19 months to September 2024 (ranked 26th of 31) - the longest and deepest bear in the dataset. The compound driver was reopening disappointment: (1) consumer confidence failed to recover - youth unemployment hit 21.3% in June 2023 (historic record), property losses damaged household balance sheets, and precautionary savings stayed elevated; (2) CPI turned deflationary in H2 2023 through early 2024, directly compressing baijiu pricing power; (3) Moutai wholesale prices fell 20%+ from their 2023 peak as distributor inventory swelled; (4) Defensives (-21.3%) fared better than cyclicals (-28.1%) while SHCOMP fell 17.4%, consistent with a broad demand/deflation bear where non-cyclical income stocks (Telecoms +0.8%, Banks -0.3%) held best.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2023年2月至2024年9月下跌43.7%，排名26/31，是数据集中持续时间最长、跌幅最深的熊市区间，历时19个月。复合驱动因素：（1）重开后消费复苏令人失望——青年失业率2023年6月创历史新高21.3%，房价下跌损伤居民资产负债表，预防性储蓄居高不下；（2）CPI从2023年下半年至2024年初转为通缩，直接压缩白酒定价权；（3）茅台批价从2023年高点下跌超20%，经销商库存积压严重；（4）防御类（-21.3%）整体优于周期类（-28.1%），大盘下跌17.4%，与需求萎缩/通缩大熊市中非周期性收益型（电信+0.8%、银行-0.3%）相对抗跌一致。","drivers":["reopening disappointment weak consumer confidence","CPI deflation H2-2023 to early 2024","Moutai wholesale price -20%+ distributor inventory swelled","youth unemployment record 21.3% June-2023","property losses household balance sheet damage"],"drivers_zh":["重开后消费复苏令人失望","CPI通缩2023年下半年至2024年初","茅台批价跌超20%渠道库存积压","青年失业率2023年6月创历史新高21.3%","房价下跌损伤居民资产负债表"],"title":"Reopening Disappointment + Deflation; 19-Month Bear","title_zh":"重开失望+通缩；历史最长19个月熊市"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"Food & Beverage rallied 40.3% from September 18 to October 8, 2024 (ranked 9th of 31) in the broadest single-month A-share rally since 2008. The September 24, 2024 PBOC package announced: a 500bn yuan swap facility for non-bank institutions to buy equities, a 300bn yuan special relending program for buybacks, a 50bp RRR cut, 20bp LPR reduction, and housing down-payment relief. Beauty (+57.8%) and Computers (+57.4%) led as higher-beta recovery plays, while F&B at +40.3% ranked 9th as investors prioritized beaten-down high-beta cyclicals and tech laggards over consumer staples. SHCOMP surged 28.4% in pure beta-driven fashion.","body_zh":"食品饮料从2024年9月18日至10月8日上涨40.3%，在2008年以来最强的A股单月行情中排名第9（共31个行业）。9月24日央行一揽子超宽松政策：5000亿元非银互换便利、3000亿元特别再贷款支持回购增持、降准50bp、降息20bp，叠加降低存量房贷利率及首付比例。美妆（+57.8%）和计算机（+57.4%）等高弹性复苏赛道领涨，食饮+40.3%仅排第9——投资者优先追逐超跌高弹性周期和科技补涨，而非未完全超跌的消费主食。大盘+28.4%为纯粹Beta驱动行情。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24-2024 500bn swap + 300bn relending","50bp RRR + 20bp LPR + housing relief","broad beta rally SHCOMP +28.4%","high-beta Beauty/Computers led over F&B","F&B mid-pack 9th/31 partial recovery"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月24日5000亿互换+3000亿再贷款","降准50bp+降息20bp+房贷减负","大盘+28.4%全面Beta行情","高弹性美妆/计算机领涨优于消费主食","食饮中游第9/31仅部分修复"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Stimulus; F&B Mid-Pack in Broad Surge","title_zh":"央行火箭炮刺激；食饮中游参与宽基行情"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"From October 2024 through June 2026, Food & Beverage fell 34.7% while SHCOMP rose 15.4% - a devastating 50pp divergence. Telecoms (+207.2%), Electronics (+162.4%), and Conglom (+80.5%) dominated in a pure AI/tech thematic tape: growth beat value by 52.5pp and cyclicals beat defensives by 31.6pp. The compound bear drivers: (1) stimulus enthusiasm faded post-October 2024 as fiscal follow-through disappointed and baijiu wholesale prices continued falling; (2) May 2025 CCP revised frugality regulations renewed the official banquet ban, triggering another channel inventory wave; (3) Moutai Q1-2025 revenue growth slowed to 10.5% from 18.5% prior year, marking the end of double-digit growth; (4) DeepSeek AI moment (January 2025) catalyzed a structural shift of capital toward AI infrastructure plays.","body_zh":"从2024年10月至2026年6月，食品饮料下跌34.7%而上证综指上涨15.4%，相对大盘跑输超50个百分点。通信（+207.2%）、电子（+162.4%）、综合（+80.5%）以AI/科技主题主导市场，成长跑赢价值52.5个百分点，周期跑赢防御31.6个百分点。复合熊市压力：（1）2024年10月后财政跟进力度不及预期，刺激热情快速退潮，白酒批价持续走弱；（2）2025年5月中共中央修订厉行节约规定，重申禁宴禁酒，触发新一轮渠道去库存；（3）茅台2025年一季度营收增速从18.5%放缓至10.5%，双位数增长时代宣告终结；（4）2025年1月DeepSeek时刻催生资金向AI/基础设施主题的结构性迁移。","drivers":["DeepSeek AI structural capital rotation Jan-2025","May-2025 CCP revised frugality regulations renewed banquet ban","Moutai Q1-2025 growth 10.5% vs 18.5% deceleration","growth over value 52.5pp telecoms/electronics dominate","baijiu wholesale price deflation persistent channel inventory"],"drivers_zh":["2025年1月DeepSeek结构性资金轮动至AI","2025年5月中共中央修订廉洁规定重申禁宴禁酒","茅台2025年一季度增速10.5%对比18.5%","成长跑赢价值52.5pp电子/通信主导","白酒批价持续通缩渠道库存积压"],"title":"AI/DeepSeek Dominates; F&B Structural Laggard -35%","title_zh":"AI/DeepSeek主导市场；食饮结构性落后-35%"}},"now":"Food & Beverage is in the Trough/Bottoming phase (pos=0.0, below 200d MA, rs_rank 26/31), down 22% in the current leg as of 2026-06-26. The now_ctx is decisively risk-on and growth-led: Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, Bldg Mat +48.1% lead; cyclicals beat defensives by 12.4pp and growth beats value by 18.2pp with SHCOMP +1.6%. Food & Beverage is the archetypal laggard in this AI/DeepSeek infrastructure tape: capital rotates into hard-tech while consumer staples are stranded. The structural headwind is a renewed May-2025 austerity crackdown (CCP revised Regulations on Practicing Thrift, 21,000+ violations investigated in May 2025) that re-energized the ban on official banquets and gifting, hitting the baijiu channel hard with Moutai wholesale prices down 20%+ from their 2023 peaks and distributors carrying excess inventory. Until a domestic demand catalyst (LPR cuts, income-support fiscal package, or policy signal that anti-corruption pressure eases) triggers a rotation back toward defensives/value, the sector remains structurally sidelined.","now_zh":"食品饮料目前处于底部筑底阶段（位置0.0，股价低于200日均线，申万行业排名26/31），本轮区间跌幅约22%。当前市场为明显的风险偏好+成长风格主导：电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%、建材+48.1%领涨，周期成长较消费防御跑赢12.4个百分点，成长超越价值18.2个百分点，上证综指+1.6%。食饮在当前以AI/DeepSeek数据基础设施为核心的流动性主题行情中是典型落后板块，资金持续流向半导体、算力板块。结构性压制来自2025年5月中共中央修订《厉行节约、反对浪费》规定，重申禁宴禁酒、大量核查违规，直击次高端及高端白酒核心渠道。叠加居民消费降级、渠道库存过剩、批价持续下滑，须等待LPR降息、收入提振或消费刺激政策落地，才有望触发防御/价值风格切换。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801130":{"legs":{"2012-01-05":{"body":"The PBOC cut the reserve requirement ratio by 50bps in December 2011 and again in February 2012, releasing roughly 450bn yuan and stabilising growth expectations after GDP decelerated to ~8.1% in Q1 2012. The SHCOMP surged 14.3% and cyclicals (metals, electronics, chemicals) outran defensives by ~8pp. Textiles gained 23.6% (ranked 8/16) riding broad index beta: export-order books were rebuilding after the post-GFC lull and domestic cotton prices had rolled off their 2011 record highs, partially restoring yarn-to-fabric mill margins. The move was index-beta driven rather than sector-specific.","body_zh":"中国人民银行于2011年12月及2012年2月两度下调存款准备金率50个基点，共释放约4500亿元流动性，稳定了GDP增速回落至约8.1%背景下的增长预期。上证综指大涨14.3%，周期股领涨防御股约8个百分点。纺织服饰涨幅23.6%（排名8/16），主要受大盘贝塔驱动：外贸订单回暖，国内棉价从2011年历史高位回落，纱线/坯布环节利润率部分修复。本轮上涨为指数贝塔行情驱动，并非板块基本面主动领涨。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut","cyclical beta rally","cotton price deflation","export order recovery"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准","周期股贝塔反弹","棉价下行","出口订单回升"],"title":"PBOC RRR Cuts Lift Cyclicals","title_zh":"央行降准提振周期股"},"2012-03-13":{"body":"As Q1 2012 GDP printed at 8.1% (the weakest in three years), market expectations for a V-shaped recovery faded and SHCOMP fell 20.2% into December 2012. Defensives (Real Estate, Pharma) outperformed cyclicals by ~7pp in a classic flight-to-safety rotation. Textiles was the second-worst performer at -35.0% (ranked 15/16): the sector suffered a double hit from slowing European demand (China's top textile export market) following the eruption of the eurozone sovereign debt crisis, and squeezed margins as cotton prices corrected slower than finished-goods prices. The selloff was amplified by the prior cycle's over-extension.","body_zh":"2012年一季度GDP增速降至8.1%（三年来最低），市场对V型复苏的预期落空，上证综指跌至12月低点，累计下跌20.2%。防御板块（房地产、医药）在典型避险轮动中跑赢周期股约7个百分点。纺织服饰以-35.0%居于倒数第二（排名15/16）：一方面欧元区主权债务危机持续扩散，欧洲作为中国纺织品主要出口市场需求大幅萎缩；另一方面棉价下跌慢于成品价格，利润持续受压。此前一轮的过度上涨也加剧了回调幅度。","drivers":["GDP deceleration","eurozone crisis demand slump","flight-to-safety rotation","cotton/margin squeeze"],"drivers_zh":["GDP增速放缓","欧债危机出口需求萎缩","避险轮动","棉价/利润受压"],"title":"Growth Slowdown Hammers Consumer Exports","title_zh":"增速放缓重挫消费出口股"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"The 18th CCP National Congress (November 2012) installed Xi Jinping and announced the decisive role for markets, igniting a reform re-rating and growth-optimism rally. The SHCOMP rebounded 18.6%, led overwhelmingly by growth sectors: Electronics +67%, Pharma +47%, and the growth-minus-value spread reached +49pp. Textiles gained 29.4% (ranked 9/16) in line with the broad market uplift, supported by a recovery in retail consumption proxies and expectations that new urbanisation policies would expand domestic apparel demand. The sector was a market-beta participant, not a sector-specific leader.","body_zh":"2012年11月中共十八大召开，习近平就任总书记，大会宣示市场将发挥决定性作用，改革预期重新定价并引发增长乐观情绪。上证综指反弹18.6%，成长板块领涨：电子+67%、医药+47%，成长价值利差高达49个百分点。纺织服饰涨幅29.4%（排名9/16），随大市上行，并受益于零售消费改善预期及新型城镇化政策下内需扩张的预期。本轮上涨以大盘贝塔为主，并非板块主动领涨。","drivers":["18th CCP Congress reform optimism","growth re-rating","domestic consumption hopes","urbanisation policy"],"drivers_zh":["十八大改革预期","成长板块重新定价","内需消费复苏预期","新型城镇化政策"],"title":"New CCP Leadership Sparks Growth Re-Rating","title_zh":"十八大新领导层引发成长重估"},"2013-05-29":{"body":"On June 20, 2013, China's interbank overnight SHIBOR spiked to 30% intraday and closed at 13.44%, the most acute liquidity crunch since the 2008 GFC. The PBOC deliberately withheld liquidity to discipline credit expansion, causing a market-wide selloff of -15.7% on the SHCOMP. Defensives (Food & Bev, Pharma) fell only half as much as cyclicals in a clean flight-to-safety rotation. Textiles was the weakest performer, down -20.0% (ranked 14/16): high-beta small-cap apparel names were among the first to be liquidated in a margin-call cascade, and their thin operating margins made them acutely sensitive to any credit tightening.","body_zh":"2013年6月20日，中国银行间隔夜SHIBOR盘中一度飙升至30%，收盘报13.44%，为2008年金融危机以来最严峻的流动性危机。人民银行此前刻意收紧流动性以抑制信贷扩张，导致上证综指累计下跌15.7%。食品饮料、医药等防御板块跌幅仅约为周期股一半，呈现典型避险轮动特征，成长风格相对抗跌。纺织服饰以-20.0%垫底（排名14/16）：高贝塔小市值服饰股在爆仓抛售中首当其冲，其薄利润率使其对信用收紧尤为敏感。","drivers":["SHIBOR liquidity crunch","PBOC credit discipline","margin call cascade","flight to safety"],"drivers_zh":["SHIBOR流动性危机","央行信贷收紧","爆仓连锁抛售","避险轮动"],"title":"SHIBOR Spike Triggers Liquidity Crunch Selloff","title_zh":"SHIBOR危机触发流动性踩踏"},"2013-07-08":{"body":"From mid-2013 through June 2015, a state-media narrative championing a reform bull combined with the rollout of margin financing (outstanding margin loans rose from ~200bn yuan in mid-2013 to 2.27 trillion yuan by June 2015) to ignite the largest A-share bull market since 2007. The SHCOMP surged 163.8% and cyclicals outpaced defensives by 71pp. Textiles led all 28 Shenwan industries at +325.9%: levered retail money poured into small/mid-cap consumer names, and sportswear brands such as Anta and Li-Ning benefited from rising per-capita consumption and e-commerce channels. The near-vertical final phase from late 2014 into June 2015 was pure leveraged speculation.","body_zh":"2013年中至2015年6月，官方媒体大力宣扬改革牛叙事，同期融资融券余额从约2000亿元飙升至2.27万亿元，共同点燃了2007年以来最大的A股牛市。上证综指大涨163.8%，周期股跑赢防御股71个百分点。纺织服饰以+325.9%高居申万28个一级行业榜首：杠杆散户资金大量涌入中小盘消费股，安踏、李宁等运动品牌受益于人均消费能力提升及电商渠道扩张。2014年底至2015年6月的最后冲刺阶段，基本面已让位于纯粹的杠杆投机。","drivers":["margin lending bubble","reform-bull narrative","SHCOMP 163% index surge","retail speculation small-cap","per-capita consumption growth"],"drivers_zh":["融资融券泡沫","改革牛叙事","上证163%大牛市","散户爆炒中小盘","人均消费能力提升"],"title":"Margin-Fuelled Bull: Textiles Tops the Leaderboard","title_zh":"杠杆牛市：纺织服饰领跑全市场"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"After CSRC tightened margin-financing rules (restricted umbrella trusts in April 2015) the leveraged bubble burst on June 12, 2015. Over the following four weeks the SHCOMP fell -32.1%. Defensives (Banks -10.6%, Brokers -30%) fell far less than high-beta cyclicals (-43%) in a broad deleveraging rout. Textiles collapsed -45.6% (ranked 24/28): having been the top-performing sector in the prior two-year run, its small-cap, heavily-margined composition made it the most violent unwind target. Forced selling by margin accounts at brokers cascaded through the sector.","body_zh":"2015年4月证监会收紧伞形信托等场外配资规定后，杠杆泡沫于6月12日开始破裂，随后四周上证综指下跌32.1%。银行（-10.6%）、券商（-30%）等防御/金融板块跌幅远小于高贝塔周期股（-43%），呈现典型去杠杆抛售格局。纺织服饰暴跌45.6%（排名24/28）：此前两年牛市中涨幅居首，融资盘比例最高，因此也成为强平抛压最为集中的板块，爆仓连锁反应贯穿整个行业。","drivers":["CSRC margin rules tightened","leverage forced unwind","bubble burst","small-cap rout"],"drivers_zh":["证监会收紧融资融券","强平去杠杆","泡沫破裂","中小盘暴跌"],"title":"Leverage Unwind Crashes the Bubble","title_zh":"杠杆去化引爆泡沫崩盘"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Following the June crash, Chinese authorities launched an unprecedented rescue: the CSRC imposed a six-month ban on large shareholders (>5%) selling, the national team (China Securities Finance Corp plus state-owned insurers) deployed ~1.6 trillion yuan to buy shares, and the PBOC provided emergency repo lines to brokers. The SHCOMP rebounded 13.9% in five weeks and cyclicals surged 37% vs defensives 17%. Textiles recovered +43.5% (ranked 4/28), reverting from the most oversold level back toward pre-crash valuations. The rebound was policy-rescue beta, not fundamental.","body_zh":"6月股灾后，当局推出空前力度的救市行动：证监会对持股5%以上大股东实施六个月禁止减持令，国家队（中国证券金融公司及国有险资）动用约1.6万亿元资金入市购股，人民银行向券商提供紧急回购额度。上证综指五周内反弹13.9%，周期股大涨37%，防御股仅涨17%。纺织服饰大幅反弹+43.5%（排名4/28），从严重超跌位置快速修复至接近崩盘前估值水平，完全为政策救市贝塔驱动，基本面无明显改善。","drivers":["government national team buying","CSRC selling ban","policy-rescue beta","short-covering"],"drivers_zh":["国家队入市","证监会禁止减持","政策救市贝塔","空头回补"],"title":"Government Rescue Triggers V-Rebound","title_zh":"国家队救市推动V型反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC devalued the yuan by 1.9% in a single day — the largest daily move in decades — sparking capital outflow fears. SHCOMP fell -24.8% into mid-September, with defensives (Banks -3.5%) severely outperforming cyclicals (-32.9%) in a flight-to-safety rotation. Textiles fell -34.0% (ranked 23/28), having no natural CNY-devaluation hedge: raw-material imports priced in USD rose in yuan terms while export revenues were still largely negotiated in dollars, further squeezing margins. Small-cap consumer names were again hit hardest by the risk-off repricing.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行一次性将人民币贬值1.9%，创数十年来单日最大贬幅，引发资本外流恐慌。上证综指跌至9月中旬，累计下跌24.8%，银行等防御板块（-3.5%）大幅跑赢周期股（-32.9%），呈现典型避险格局。纺织服饰下跌34.0%（排名23/28）：棉花等原料进口以美元计价，人民币贬值后成本上升，而出口收入仍多以美元结算，双重挤压利润。中小盘消费股再次成为风险规避抛售的重灾区。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock Aug-2015","capital outflow fears","flight to safety","USD input cost squeeze"],"drivers_zh":["2015年8月人民币贬值冲击","资本外流恐慌","避险轮动","美元原料成本上涨"],"title":"CNY Devaluation Shock Routs High-Beta Names","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击高贝塔标的"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After the August shock, PBOC injected liquidity via reverse repos, CSRC maintained the large-shareholder lock-up, and the Fed's September 2015 no-hike decision relieved EM pressure. SHCOMP rebounded 18.9% into year-end, led by Computers (+63%), Electronics (+54%), and Telecoms (+53%) in a growth-style rotation with growth-minus-value spread at 18pp. Textiles gained 45.5% (ranked 9/28) — a partial catch-up from the August oversold trough, aided by e-commerce consumption narratives (Singles Day expectations). The rally had more sector-specific momentum than the July rescue bounce but remained primarily index beta.","body_zh":"8月冲击后，人民银行持续通过逆回购注入流动性，证监会维持大股东减持禁令，9月美联储按兵不动也缓解了新兴市场压力。上证综指年底前反弹18.9%，由计算机（+63%）、电子（+54%）、通信（+53%）等成长板块领涨，成长价值利差18个百分点。纺织服饰上涨45.5%（排名9/28），主要为8月超跌后的修复行情，同时受益于电商消费叙事（双十一预期）。本轮上涨具备一定板块动能，但整体仍以大盘贝塔为主。","drivers":["PBOC liquidity injection","Fed no-hike relief","growth/tech style rotation","e-commerce Singles Day narrative"],"drivers_zh":["央行逆回购注流动性","美联储不加息缓解压力","成长/科技风格轮动","电商双十一叙事"],"title":"Stabilisation Rally: Growth Tech Leads, Textiles Follows","title_zh":"稳定期反弹：成长科技领涨，纺织跟随"},"2015-12-30":{"body":"On January 4 and January 7, 2016, China's newly-installed circuit breaker halted trading twice in a week as the SHCOMP fell 7%+ on each day, ultimately crashing -25.7% by January 28. The PBOC set the yuan fix at its lowest level since March 2011, stoking capital outflow fears, and the circuit breaker itself amplified panic by creating a rush-to-exit-before-halt dynamic. Defensives (Banks, Food & Bev, Steel) led cyclicals by 5pp. Textiles fell -31.3% (ranked 21/28): high-beta consumer names were repriced alongside growth-style sectors as the CNY fix signalled a potentially weaker macroeconomic backdrop.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日和7日，中国新引入的熔断机制在一周内两度触发，上证综指单日跌幅均超7%，至1月28日累计下跌25.7%。人民银行将人民币中间价设于2011年3月以来最低位，加剧资本外流恐慌，熔断机制本身也因赶在停盘前出逃而放大恐慌抛售。银行、食品饮料、钢铁等防御板块跑赢周期股约5个百分点。纺织服饰下跌31.3%（排名21/28），高贝塔消费股随成长类板块一同遭到重估，反映市场对宏观经济走弱的担忧。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic mechanism","CNY fix at multi-year low","capital outflow fears","flight to safety"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制恐慌效应","人民币中间价创多年新低","资本外流恐慌","避险轮动"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Failure and Yuan Fix Crash","title_zh":"熔断机制失灵叠加人民币暴跌"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"After the circuit-breaker was scrapped (January 8, 2016) the PBOC cut the RRR by 50bps in February 2016, and Beijing launched its supply-side structural reform programme focused on cutting steel/coal overcapacity. Infrastructure and commodity sectors (Metals +49%, Building Materials +49%, Construction +44%) led a broad rally as value rotation overwhelmed growth. SHCOMP gained 22.3%. Textiles rose 32.5% (ranked 11/28): not a sector-specific driver; the sector rode index beta with modest help from a stronger yuan (reducing import costs) and recovering discretionary demand following the Jan-2016 correction.","body_zh":"2016年1月8日熔断机制被叫停后，人民银行2月再度降准50个基点，北京随即推出以去钢铁/煤炭产能为核心的供给侧结构性改革。基础设施及大宗商品板块（有色+49%、建材+49%、建筑+44%）引领市场反弹，价值风格全面压制成长风格，上证综指上涨22.3%。纺织服饰涨幅32.5%（排名11/28）：并无板块独立驱动因素，主要为大盘贝塔跟涨，人民币趋稳令进口原料成本小幅下降，以及1月急跌后消费品需求回暖，均提供了温和支撑。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Feb-2016","supply-side reform announcement","infrastructure/commodity rotation","value-style leadership"],"drivers_zh":["央行2016年2月降准","供给侧结构性改革发布","基建/大宗商品轮动","价值风格领涨"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform Rally: Infrastructure Leads","title_zh":"供给侧改革行情：基建板块领涨"},"2016-11-22":{"body":"The 22-month selloff from Nov-2016 to Oct-2018 was the product of two compounding shocks. First, Xi Jinping's financial deleveraging campaign (shadow banking crackdown from late 2016) raised the cost of the off-balance-sheet credit that had funded small-cap speculators; second, the US-China trade war (Trump's Section 301 investigation announced March 2018, first tariffs July 2018) imposed an existential export threat. The SHCOMP fell 23.5%. Defensives (Food & Bev +26%, Coal flat) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-31.7%) in the widest value-rotation spread of the 15-year sample at 19.9pp. Textiles was the worst sector, down -55.8% (ranked 26/28): the sector received every negative — deleveraging removed speculative buyers, trade war directly targeted textile/apparel export tariffs, and Xinjiang cotton sourcing scrutiny began adding reputational risk from late 2017.","body_zh":"2016年11月至2018年10月长达22个月的下跌，源于两轮叠加冲击。其一，习近平去杠杆运动（2016年底启动的影子银行整治）推高了此前支撑中小盘投机的表外信贷成本；其二，中美贸易战（特朗普2018年3月启动301调查、7月首批关税落地）对出口构成根本性威胁。上证综指下跌23.5%，食品饮料（+26%）等防御板块大幅跑赢周期股（-31.7%），价值风格领先幅度高达19.9个百分点，为本样本期最大。纺织服饰以-55.8%成为最差板块（排名26/28）：去杠杆清退投机买盘、贸易战直接针对纺织品关税、新疆棉花采购信誉风险自2017年底开始累积，三重负面因素同步叠加。","drivers":["deleveraging shadow banking crackdown","US-China trade war Section 301","value rotation extreme","Xinjiang cotton reputational risk"],"drivers_zh":["去杠杆整治影子银行","中美贸易战301条款","极端价值风格轮动","新疆棉花信誉风险"],"title":"Deleveraging + Trade War Double Bear","title_zh":"去杠杆+贸易战双重熊市"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR by 100bps effective January 4, 2019 — its largest single-step cut in years — to offset trade-war headwinds, and the G20 Trump-Xi dinner in Buenos Aires (December 2018) paused further tariff escalation. SHCOMP rebounded 30.4% and growth style led (+16.8pp). Textiles gained only 39.0% (ranked 19/28), a notably weak recovery: despite the general bounce, trade-war uncertainty kept export orders cautious and the sector's high leverage from prior years created a structural overhang. Agriculture (+72%), Conglom (+62%), and Telecoms (+59%) attracted far more speculative interest.","body_zh":"2019年1月4日人民银行实施近年来最大幅度的单次降准100个基点，对冲贸易战压力；2018年12月布宜诺斯艾利斯G20峰会特朗普-习近平会晤达成暂停加税协议。上证综指反弹30.4%，成长风格领先价值16.8个百分点。纺织服饰仅涨39.0%（排名19/28），反弹明显弱于大市：贸易战不确定性使出口订单仍趋保守，此前积累的高杠杆形成结构性压制。农业（+72%）、综合（+62%）、通信（+59%）等板块吸引了更多投机资金。","drivers":["PBOC 100bps RRR cut Jan-2019","G20 trade truce Dec-2018","SHCOMP 30% bear market bounce","growth style rotation"],"drivers_zh":["央行2019年1月降准100BP","G20贸易休战协议","上证30%熊市反弹","成长风格轮动"],"title":"Trade-Truce Hope and PBOC Easing Bounce","title_zh":"贸易休战预期与央行宽松推动反弹"},"2019-04-10":{"body":"May 2019 saw the US raise tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, reigniting the trade war and ending the rally. The SHCOMP declined 14.1% into February 2020. Defensives led (-7.3%) while cyclicals fell -20.0% — a flight-to-safety rotation. Electronics (+28%) stood out as a growth-within-defensive theme. Textiles fell -25.6% (ranked 24/28), combining: (1) direct tariff exposure on apparel-textile HS codes, (2) demand destruction fears for discretionary consumer spending, and (3) from January 2020, the first wave of COVID-19 lockdowns severing domestic retail traffic and export logistics. The COVID overlay that arrived at the end of this leg deepened the trough materially.","body_zh":"2019年5月美国将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%提高至25%，贸易战重燃，市场反弹终结。上证综指至2020年2月累计下跌14.1%，防御股（-7.3%）大幅跑赢周期股（-20.0%），呈现避险轮动。电子（+28%）以防御中的成长逻辑独秀。纺织服饰下跌25.6%（排名24/28），原因多重：（1）纺织服装HS税号直接承受关税冲击；（2）消费品可选需求遭受压制；（3）2020年1月起，新冠疫情首轮封控切断国内零售客流及出口物流。疫情叠加在本段末期大幅加深了低谷深度。","drivers":["US tariffs to 25% May-2019","trade war re-escalation","COVID-19 lockdown Jan-2020","flight to safety"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月美国加征25%关税","贸易战再度升级","新冠疫情封控2020年1月","避险轮动"],"title":"Trade War Resumes; COVID Compounds the Selloff","title_zh":"贸易战重燃叠加疫情加深跌幅"},"2020-02-04":{"body":"China contained the initial COVID-19 wave by late January/early February 2020, and markets re-opened after the extended Lunar New Year holiday on February 3 with the PBOC injecting 1.7 trillion yuan in reverse repos to calm the market. SHCOMP recovered 9.0% by early March. Textiles gained 22.7% (ranked 5/28) in one of its better relative performances: the market narrative shifted to China first back to work with textiles/PPE manufacturers highlighted as key re-opening beneficiaries. Agriculture (+31%) and Telecoms (+29%) led on defensive-growth themes. The bounce was brief: global COVID spread began to weigh on export order prospects within weeks.","body_zh":"中国于2020年1月底至2月初控制住首轮疫情，市场于延长假期后的2月3日重开，人民银行同日逆回购投放1.7万亿元提振信心。上证综指至3月初累计回升9.0%。纺织服饰上涨22.7%（排名5/28），为近年来表现较好的相对表现之一：市场叙事转向中国率先复工复产，纺织品/防疫物资生产商被视为核心受益标的。农业（+31%）与通信（+29%）以防御-成长混合逻辑领涨。然而反弹昙花一现，数周后全球疫情蔓延开始拖累出口订单前景。","drivers":["China COVID containment Feb-2020","PBOC 1.7trn yuan repo injection","PPE/textile re-opening narrative","market re-open beta"],"drivers_zh":["中国2月初控制新冠","央行1.7万亿逆回购","防疫物资/纺织复工叙事","市场重开贝塔"],"title":"Post-Lockdown Rebound Lifts Consumer Names","title_zh":"封控解除后消费股反弹"},"2020-03-06":{"body":"As COVID-19 spread to Europe and North America in March 2020, Chinese textile export orders collapsed: a March 25 survey showed 37% of firms had export orders cancelled and 26% saw orders fall below 50% of pre-virus levels. The SHCOMP fell 7.3% while Food & Bev (+10%) and Pharma (+2%) gained in a flight-to-staples rotation. Textiles ranked absolute last (#28/28), falling -20.3%: of all sectors, none was more directly exposed to the combined demand shock (retail closures across the US and EU) and supply disruption (factory shutdowns cutting PPE/fabric supply). The sector's export-revenue concentration in the US and Europe created the most acute vulnerability.","body_zh":"2020年3月新冠疫情席卷欧美，中国纺织品出口订单骤然崩塌：3月25日调查显示37%受访企业订单被取消，26%企业订单量不足疫前50%。上证综指下跌7.3%，食品饮料（+10%）、医药（+2%）等防御板块在避险轮动中逆势上涨。纺织服饰以-20.3%垫底全部28个申万行业（排名28/28）：全行业中无出其右，出口订单需求冲击（美欧零售全面关闭）与供给中断（工厂停产削减防疫物资/面料供应）双重打击叠加。对美欧出口收入的高度依赖使该板块承压最为严峻。","drivers":["global COVID export order collapse","US/EU retail lockdowns","supply chain disruption","flight to defensive staples"],"drivers_zh":["全球疫情出口订单崩塌","美欧零售封锁","供应链中断","避险转向必需消费"],"title":"Global COVID Demand Collapse Hammers Exports","title_zh":"全球疫情冲击出口订单骤崩"},"2020-05-22":{"body":"From May 2020, global supply chains gradually resumed and China's factory utilisation recovered to 90-95% by July 2020. A massive PBOC credit impulse (total social financing rose 28% YoY in 2020) drove a broad A-share bull market: SHCOMP gained 18.3%, led by Services (+69%) and Power Equipment (+52%) in a growth and domestic-consumption re-rating. Textiles recovered +20.1% (ranked 15/28), a mid-table performance: export recovery was real but slower than domestic consumption sectors, and the sector failed to capture the premium valuation re-rating awarded to tech and clean-energy names. The cotton price began rising sharply, setting up future margin pressure.","body_zh":"2020年5月起全球供应链逐步恢复，中国工厂开工率至7月回升至90%-95%。人民银行大规模信贷投放（2020年社会融资规模同比增28%）驱动A股牛市，上证综指上涨18.3%，由休闲服务（+69%）与电力设备（+52%）引领成长与内需板块重新定价。纺织服饰回升+20.1%（排名15/28），表现中游：出口复苏真实但慢于内需板块，且未能享受科技与新能源板块的溢价估值重构。棉价同期大幅走高，为后续利润压力埋下伏笔。","drivers":["PBOC credit impulse 2020","factory utilisation recovery","SHCOMP 18% bull market","cotton price rising"],"drivers_zh":["央行2020年信贷大规模投放","工厂开工率恢复","上证18%牛市","棉价上涨"],"title":"Recovery Rally: Liquidity Cycle Mid-Rider","title_zh":"复苏行情：纺织服饰中游跟随"},"2020-10-20":{"body":"From October 2020 through February 2021, the SHCOMP actually rose 6.1%, but this was a heavily concentrated rotation into value/financial/large-cap themes (Services +50%, Power Equipment +30%, Food & Bev +29%). Textiles fell -22.3% (ranked absolute last, 28/28) while the index rose: this is a sector-specific underperformance, not a market selloff. The drivers were: rising cotton prices squeezing margins, Xinjiang cotton sanction escalation (early 2021 US import ban announced), and a rotation out of mid/small-cap consumer cyclicals as institutional investors concentrated into core holdings. Textiles was the only major sector to deliver a double-digit loss while the index posted gains.","body_zh":"2020年10月至2021年2月，上证综指实际上涨6.1%，但行情高度集中于价值/金融/大市值领域（休闲服务+50%、电力设备+30%、食品饮料+29%）。纺织服饰下跌22.3%（排名倒数第一，28/28）——这是指数上涨背景下的纯板块性跑输，而非市场整体下跌。原因：棉价上涨压缩利润率；新疆棉花制裁升级（2021年初美国宣布进口禁令）；机构投资者集中持仓核心资产，中小盘消费周期股遭到减持。纺织服饰是唯一在指数正收益期间录得双位数跌幅的主要板块。","drivers":["cotton price surge 2020-21","Xinjiang cotton sanctions escalation","institutional rotation to core assets","sector-specific underperformance vs rising SHCOMP"],"drivers_zh":["2020-21年棉价飙升","新疆棉花制裁升级","机构资金集中抱团核心资产","板块跑输上涨中的指数"],"title":"Sector Rotation Leaves Textiles Stranded at Bottom","title_zh":"板块轮动令纺织服饰垫底"},"2021-02-08":{"body":"A global commodity reflation cycle erupted in H1 2021 as post-lockdown demand surged and supply chains remained tight. In China, the core-asset bubble in consumer defensives deflated (Food & Bev -33%, Services -16%) while Steel (+28%), Conglom (+27%), and Metals (+24%) surged in a classic reflation rotation. SHCOMP was essentially flat (-0.1%). Textiles gained +22.2% (ranked 4/28) — a notable outperformance in a flat market: apparel names with direct commodity exposure (polyester, cotton-yarn integrated mills) benefited as the market repriced their input costs downward after the Xinjiang-sanction peak news cycle faded, and sportswear brands showed resilient domestic H1 2021 orders from an accelerating consumption recovery.","body_zh":"2021年上半年，封控后需求激增叠加供应链持续紧张，全球大宗商品通胀周期爆发。A股核心资产泡沫破裂（食品饮料-33%、休闲服务-16%），钢铁（+28%）、综合（+27%）、有色（+24%）领涨，呈现典型的再通胀轮动格局；上证综指几近平盘（-0.1%）。纺织服饰上涨+22.2%（排名4/28），在平盘市场中实现显著超额表现：化纤/棉纱一体化纺织企业从大宗商品价格的预期走势变化中受益，新疆棉花制裁负面舆论高峰期过后市场重新定价，运动服品牌上半年国内订单同步显示消费复苏加速。","drivers":["commodity reflation H1-2021","core-asset bubble deflation","sportswear domestic demand recovery","Xinjiang noise fading"],"drivers_zh":["2021年上半年大宗商品通胀","核心资产泡沫破裂","运动服国内需求复苏","新疆舆论影响消退"],"title":"Commodity Reflation: Steel/Metals Cycle Pulls Textiles","title_zh":"大宗商品通胀再定价中超额收益"},"2021-07-14":{"body":"July 2021 marked the start of Xi's broad regulatory crackdown (tech, education, property, fintech) and simultaneous common prosperity redistribution rhetoric. The SHCOMP fell 18.0% through October 2022, but the defensive rotation was led by Coal (+15%), Defense (+6%), and Utilities (-1%) — energy/security themes — while consumer discretionary was abandoned. Textiles fell -28.0% (ranked 24/31): zero-COVID lockdowns in 2022 (most severely Shanghai's 2-month lockdown, April-May 2022) severed domestic retail channels, Xinjiang cotton UFLPA enforcement (signed June 2022) raised compliance costs on US-bound exports, and the sector's high retail-investor weighting made it vulnerable to the deleveraging that accompanied the property-sector crisis.","body_zh":"2021年7月习近平启动大规模监管整顿行动（科技、教育、地产、金融科技）并推出共同富裕再分配论述。上证综指至2022年10月累计下跌18.0%，但本轮防御轮动以煤炭（+15%）、国防（+6%）、公用事业（-1%）等能源/安全主题领衔，消费可选品遭到抛弃。纺织服饰下跌28.0%（排名24/31）：2022年零新冠政策封控（最严重为2022年4-5月上海长达2个月封城）切断国内零售渠道；2022年6月签署生效的维吾尔强迫劳动预防法（UFLPA）大幅提高对美出口合规成本；板块散户持仓比例较高，也使其在房地产危机引发的去杠杆浪潮中更为脆弱。","drivers":["regulatory crackdown common prosperity","zero-COVID 2022 lockdowns","UFLPA Xinjiang cotton enforcement","property crisis deleveraging"],"drivers_zh":["监管整顿与共同富裕","2022年零新冠封控","UFLPA维吾尔强迫劳动法执法","房地产危机去杠杆"],"title":"Regulatory Crackdown + Zero-COVID Crush Consumer","title_zh":"监管整顿+动态清零重压消费板块"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"The MSCI China index surged 51.7% from its Oct-31, 2022 trough to mid-January 2023 as China began dismantling zero-COVID restrictions in November 2022 and officially downgraded COVID-19 to Class B management on December 26, 2022. Food & Bev (+38%) and Media (+35%) led the consumer-reopening trade. SHCOMP gained 14.4%. Textiles rose 23.0% (ranked 8/31): the sector benefited from reopening optimism for domestic retail, and sportswear/athletic brand names rebounded on expectations of a consumer-spending revenge bounce. The rally was front-loaded into Nov-Dec 2022; actual consumption recovery took several months longer to materialise.","body_zh":"随着中国2022年11月开始拆除动态清零防控体系、12月26日正式将新冠管理降为乙类乙管，MSCI中国指数自2022年10月31日低点至2023年1月中旬大涨51.7%。食品饮料（+38%）和传媒（+35%）领涨消费复苏交易，上证综指上涨14.4%。纺织服饰上涨23.0%（排名8/31），受益于国内零售重开乐观情绪，运动服/运动品牌对报复性消费浪潮的预期驱动显著反弹。涨幅集中在2022年11-12月，实际消费复苏落地则滞后数月。","drivers":["zero-COVID dismantling Nov-2022","COVID downgrade to Class B Dec-2022","consumer revenge-spending expectation","reopening beta"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11月退出动态清零","12月新冠降为乙类管理","报复性消费预期","重开贝塔行情"],"title":"Zero-COVID Pivot and Reopening Relief","title_zh":"动态清零退出，重开预期推动反弹"},"2023-03-02":{"body":"China's post-COVID recovery disappointed profoundly: consumer prices entered deflation in July 2023 (-0.3% YoY), youth unemployment hit a record 20% in June 2023, and the property sector (still shrinking with new starts down 40%+ YoY) suppressed household wealth and spending confidence. SHCOMP fell 18.4%. Defensives (Coal +1%, Banks -2.5%) sharply outpaced cyclicals (-27.3%) in a value-flight trade. Textiles fell -24.3% (ranked 10/31), more moderate than the 2016-2018 disaster but still painful: weak consumer confidence hit apparel spending directly, and ongoing UFLPA compliance enforcement continued to shadow the export business.","body_zh":"中国后疫情复苏严重不及预期：2023年7月CPI同比转负（-0.3%），6月青年失业率攀升至历史峰值20%，房地产新开工面积同比降幅超40%，严重压制居民财富与消费信心。上证综指下跌18.4%，煤炭（+1%）、银行（-2.5%）等防御板块大幅跑赢周期股（-27.3%），呈现典型价值避险交易。纺织服饰下跌24.3%（排名10/31），较2016-2018年跌幅温和但仍构成重创：消费者信心低迷直接冲击服装支出，UFLPA执法持续为出口业务蒙上阴影。","drivers":["China deflation July-2023","property crisis wealth effect","record youth unemployment","UFLPA export compliance burden"],"drivers_zh":["2023年7月中国通缩","房地产危机财富效应","青年失业率历史峰值","UFLPA出口合规负担"],"title":"Deflation + Property Crisis Erodes Consumer Confidence","title_zh":"通缩与房地产危机侵蚀消费信心"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"Amid fears of a deflationary spiral and Chinese equities hitting near-decade lows, the national team (Central Huijin, large state funds) dramatically stepped up A-share purchases in February 2024, and the PBOC cut the five-year LPR by a record 25bps on February 20, 2024. SHCOMP bounced 13.6%, cyclicals led (+19.8% vs defensives +10.8%) and the growth style re-emerged. Textiles gained 20.2% (ranked 16/31) — a modest beta participation: Metals (+41%), Autos (+29%), and Telecoms (+28%) captured most of the speculative interest, leaving Textiles as a mid-table recovery name without specific catalysts.","body_zh":"2024年2月，中国股市跌至近十年低点，通缩螺旋担忧加剧，国家队（中央汇金、大型国有基金）大举增持A股，人民银行2月20日将五年期LPR降息25个基点（历史最大降幅）。上证综指反弹13.6%，周期股领涨（+19.8% vs 防御股+10.8%），成长风格重现。纺织服饰上涨20.2%（排名16/31），属温和贝塔参与：有色（+41%）、汽车（+29%）、通信（+28%）吸引了大部分投机资金，纺织服饰属于中游修复标的，缺乏独立催化剂。","drivers":["national team A-share buying Feb-2024","PBOC 25bps LPR cut Feb-2024","cyclical beta bounce","deflationary low reversion"],"drivers_zh":["国家队2024年2月大举增持","央行2024年2月LPR降息25BP","周期股贝塔反弹","通缩低位均值回归"],"title":"National Team Rescue Sparks Tactical Bounce","title_zh":"国家队救市引发战术性反弹"},"2024-04-03":{"body":"From April to September 2024 the SHCOMP fell 11.5% as geopolitical risk re-priced with a US election backdrop (both parties committed to further China tariffs) and domestic demand remained structurally weak (retail sales growth slowing to multi-year lows, property market still contracting). Defensives (Banks -1.8%, Brokers -2.3%, Utilities -6.6%) massively outperformed cyclicals (-18%) in the cleanest flight-to-safety leg of the 2023-2024 period. Textiles was the worst sector outside of Food & Bev at -26.1% (ranked 29/31): it absorbed the export-tariff fear premium directly, while weak domestic consumption provided no cushion.","body_zh":"2024年4月至9月，上证综指下跌11.5%。美国大选背景下地缘政治风险溢价重新定价（两党均承诺对华进一步加征关税），国内需求结构性疲软（零售销售增速降至多年新低，楼市持续收缩）。银行（-1.8%）、券商（-2.3%）、公用事业（-6.6%）等防御板块大幅跑赢周期股（-18%），为2023-2024年期间最典型的避险轮动。纺织服饰以-26.1%仅次于食品饮料，为最差板块之一（排名29/31）：直接承受出口关税风险溢价，国内消费疲软亦无法提供对冲缓冲。","drivers":["US election trade-war escalation risk","domestic demand structural weakness","flight to safety financials","export tariff fear premium"],"drivers_zh":["美国大选加征关税风险","国内需求结构性疲软","避险转向金融股","出口关税恐慌溢价"],"title":"Textiles Hits Cycle Low as Trade War Risk Mounts","title_zh":"贸易战风险升温令板块跌至周期底部"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024 the PBOC announced its largest combined stimulus package in years: a 500bn yuan swap facility for institutional equity purchases, a 300bn yuan special relending for share buybacks, plus a 50bps RRR cut. A Politburo meeting on September 26 signalled fiscal commitment. The CSI 300 jumped 16% in one week — its best since 2008. SHCOMP surged 51.7% through February 2026. Cyclicals crushed defensives (+66.3% vs +24.9%) and growth style dominated with a 51pp spread. Textiles gained 57.0% (ranked 18/31): a solid if below-average recovery — the liquidity flood lifted all boats but the sector lagged tech and telecoms (both up 100%+) because tariff risk and weak domestic consumption narratives capped re-rating.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人民银行宣布近年来最大力度一揽子刺激措施：5000亿元互换便利支持机构购股、3000亿元专项再贷款支持股票回购，并同步降准50基点；9月26日政治局会议进一步明确财政支持意愿。沪深300单周涨16%，为2008年以来最大单周涨幅，上证综指至2026年2月累计上涨51.7%。周期股大幅跑赢防御股（+66.3% vs +24.9%），成长风格领先价值51个百分点。纺织服饰上涨57.0%（排名18/31），涨幅尚可但低于整体平均：流动性大潮提振全面，但受关税风险与国内消费需求疲弱叙事限制，板块估值重构空间远不及科技、通信（均涨幅逾100%）。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-2024 swap facility 500bn","Politburo fiscal commitment Sep-2024","SHCOMP 52% bull market","growth/cyclical style dominant"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月5000亿互换便利","政治局9月财政承诺","上证52%牛市","成长/周期风格主导"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Ignites Mega-Rally","title_zh":"央行大规模刺激点燃巨幅反弹"}},"now":"Textiles & Apparel (801130) is in a Bottoming/Trough phase (pos=0.6) following a -57% drawdown from its Feb-2026 peak, ranked 17th of 31 Shenwan industries with a recent-window return of -11.1%. The now_ctx reveals a growth/tech-led tape (Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%) where cyclicals broadly beat defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%) on SHCOMP +1.6% — a risk-on but style-bifurcated rally that continues to leave consumer-discretionary/apparel names behind. Textiles is a double laggard: it underperforms both rallying cyclicals and falling defensives. The sector sits alongside Beauty and Retail — domestically-oriented consumer names structurally pressured by weak household income confidence, margin compression from yuan/cotton volatility, and persistent tariff risk on China's export-oriented mills. No buy signal is active (signal=null, below 200d MA), and rs_rank 14 with ret_win_pct of -33.6% confirms mean-reversion has not yet been endorsed by price leadership.","now_zh":"纺织服饰板块（801130）当前处于筑底/低谷阶段（pos=0.6），自2026年2月高点以来累计回撤57%，在申万31个一级行业中排名第17，近期窗口收益率为-11.1%。当前市场结构呈现成长/科技主导格局（电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%），周期股整体跑赢防御股（+0.3% vs -12.1%），上证综指微涨1.6%——属于风险偏好回升但风格高度分化的行情，消费可选/服装类个股持续被边缘化。纺织服饰呈现双重落后：既跑输上涨的周期股，也较防御股跌幅更大。板块与美容护理、商贸零售同属居民消费信心疲弱、棉价/汇率压缩利润、出口型工厂持续承受关税压力的结构性弱势领域。当前无买入信号（signal=null，股价位于200日均线下方），行业相对强弱排名第14、胜率窗口收益-33.6%，均显示均值回归行情尚未获得价格领导力确认。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801140":{"legs":{"2012-01-06":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR three times from late 2011 through early 2012 (cumulatively ~150bp), releasing approximately CNY450bn in liquidity after a prolonged 2010-2011 tightening cycle; CPI had fallen from its 2011 peak of 6.5% toward 3%, opening space for pro-growth policy. The SHCOMP surged 13.5% and cyclicals broadly outperformed defensives (23.9% vs 16.7%), a classic monetary-easing relief rally. Light Manufacturing ranked 6th/16 (+25.4%), matching the broad cyclical beta with no sector-specific catalyst -- the move was index-driven liquidity re-entry. Metals, Electronics, and Chemicals led.","body_zh":"中国人民银行于2011年末至2012年初三次下调存款准备金率（累计约150bp），在长达两年的紧缩周期后释放约4500亿元流动性；CPI已从2011年高点6.5%回落至3%附近，为宽松政策打开空间。上证综指大涨13.5%，周期股全面跑赢防御股（23.9% vs 16.7%），为典型货币宽松解套行情。轻工制造排名第6/16位（+25.4%），跟随宽基周期性反弹，不存在板块独立催化剂——涨幅为流动性驱动的指数贝塔。金属、电子、化工板块领涨。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts ~150bp","CPI decline opens easing room","broad beta rally","cyclicals outperform defensives"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准约150bp","CPI回落打开宽松空间","宽基贝塔反弹","周期股跑赢防御股"],"title":"PBOC Easing Sparks Broad Risk-On Bounce","title_zh":"央行降准释放流动性，宽松行情全面启动"},"2012-03-13":{"body":"China's GDP growth decelerated to ~7.5% in 2012 from 10%+ in prior years, with manufacturing PMI oscillating near contraction territory throughout the year. The SHCOMP fell -20.2%, and in a risk-off flight-to-safety rotation, defensives (Real Estate, Pharma, Utilities: -10% to -16%) materially outperformed cyclicals (-23.8%). Light Manufacturing was the worst consumer cyclical, ranked 14th/16 (-31.3%), behind even Textiles and Retail. The sector's high export sensitivity to slowing global demand (especially Europe amid the 2012 eurozone crisis) compounded the domestic growth disappointment.","body_zh":"2012年中国GDP增速从此前10%以上放缓至约7.5%，全年制造业PMI在荣枯线附近震荡。上证综指下跌20.2%，市场呈现防御股领跌、价值风格主导的避险格局：防御板块（地产、医药、公用事业：-10%至-16%）显著跑赢周期股（-23.8%）。轻工制造是消费周期板块中跌幅最深的行业，排名第14/16位（-31.3%），甚至弱于纺织和零售。该板块对放缓中的全球需求（尤其是2012年欧元区危机冲击下的欧洲需求）高度敏感，叠加国内经济增长不及预期，双重压制下跌幅显著扩大。","drivers":["GDP growth deceleration to 7.5%","eurozone crisis hits exports","risk-off flight-to-safety rotation","manufacturing PMI near contraction"],"drivers_zh":["GDP增速放缓至7.5%","欧债危机冲击出口","避险轮动","制造业PMI濒临收缩"],"title":"Growth Slowdown Bear; Light Mfg Deep Laggard","title_zh":"经济增速放缓熊市，轻工制造大幅落后"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"From December 2012 to June 2015 the SHCOMP gained 163.6%, the broadest multi-year A-share bull run since 2007, fuelled by PBOC easing (benchmark lending rate cut from 6% to 4.35% by Oct 2015), a quadrupling of margin finance (from ~CNY400bn to CNY2.2tr), and Xi Jinping post-2013 reform narrative (state-sector reform, capital-market opening, Internet Plus). Light Manufacturing ranked 1st/28 (+384%) over the full leg -- its small/mid-cap growth composition and consumer-goods angle proved ideal for the speculative, growth-factor tape. Electronics (+377%) and Conglomerates (+343%) were close peers, consistent with a liquidity-driven, growth-style-led bull.","body_zh":"2012年12月至2015年6月，上证综指累计大涨163.6%，为2007年以来最大规模多年牛市，由中国人民银行宽松政策（基准贷款利率至2015年10月降至4.35%）、融资余额四倍扩张（从约4000亿元增至2.2万亿元）以及习近平改革叙事（国企改革、资本市场开放、互联网加）共同驱动。轻工制造全程排名第1/28位（+384%），其中小盘成长属性与消费品定位完美契合投机性、成长因子主导的行情。电子（+377%）、综合（+343%）表现相近，印证了这是一轮流动性驱动、成长风格领涨的牛市。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts / RRR easing","margin finance quadruples to CNY2.2tr","Xi reform narrative (Internet Plus / SOE reform)","small/mid-cap growth premium"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息/降准","融资余额四倍扩张至2.2万亿元","习近平改革叙事（互联网加/国企改革）","中小盘成长溢价"],"title":"Bull Market Mega-Leg: Margin, Reform, Liquidity","title_zh":"杠杆牛市巨浪：融资盘、改革预期与流动性共振"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the CSRC released draft rules tightening shadow-margin financing regulations; a crash began the next trading day. The SHCOMP fell -32.1% in under four weeks as leveraged accounts (shadow margin exceeded CNY2tr) faced cascading margin calls. In the flight-to-safety rotation, Banks lost only -10.6% while cyclicals (including Light Manufacturing at -37.9%) bore the brunt. Light Manufacturing ranked 6th worst/28 but was mid-pack relative to the deepest losers (Coal -59%, Defense -52%), as most small-cap growth sectors were pulverized. The crash was mechanical -- leverage unwind, not earnings deterioration.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会发布收紧场外融资（伞形信托）监管规定草案，A股次日即开始崩盘。上证综指在不足四周内暴跌32.1%，融资账户（影子融资规模逾2万亿元）遭遇连环追保平仓。避险轮动中，银行仅下跌10.6%，而周期股（包括轻工制造-37.9%）首当其冲。轻工制造排名第6差/28，但相对跌幅最深的板块（煤炭-59%、国防-52%）处于中游，因中小盘成长股板块整体被碾压。本轮崩盘属于机械式去杠杆，而非业绩恶化驱动。","drivers":["CSRC shadow-margin rules (Jun 12, 2015)","forced margin-call deleveraging","flight to safety (banks outperform)","bubble unwind"],"drivers_zh":["证监会场外融资新规（2015年6月12日）","强制追保平仓去杠杆","避险（银行护盘）","泡沫瓦解"],"title":"Bubble Burst: CSRC Margin Rules, Forced Deleveraging","title_zh":"泡沫破裂：证监会收紧融资规则，强制去杠杆"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"By early July 2015, over 1,400 companies (more than 50% of listed stocks) had suspended trading to halt losses. Beijing orchestrated a rescue: the China Securities Finance Corporation (CSFC) received CNY1.3tr in state funding to buy blue chips; brokerages pledged CNY120bn in a joint stabilization fund; IPOs were halted; margin short-selling was restricted. The SHCOMP rebounded 13.9% and cyclicals led (37.1% vs defensives 16.8%). Light Manufacturing ranked 23rd/28 (+20%), a below-average bounce -- Coal (+104%) and Defense (+78%) surged on short-squeeze and value-catch-up dynamics, leaving consumer-growth names behind.","body_zh":"2015年7月初，逾1400家公司（占上市公司数量逾半）申请停牌以遏制跌势。北京启动救市：证金公司获1.3万亿元国家资金用于买入蓝筹股；各大券商联合出资约1200亿元设立稳定基金；新股发行暂停；融券卖空受限。上证综指反弹13.9%，周期股领涨（37.1% vs 防御股16.8%）。轻工制造排名第23/28位（+20%），反弹幅度低于平均水平——煤炭（+104%）和国防（+78%）因空头回补和价值补涨大幅飙升，消费成长类股相对落后。","drivers":["CSFC CNY1.3tr state rescue fund","IPO halt / short-selling restrictions","short-squeeze in coal and defense","policy backstop buying"],"drivers_zh":["证金公司1.3万亿元救市资金","暂停IPO/限制卖空","煤炭国防空头回补","政策托底买入"],"title":"State Rescue Bounce: CSFC Backstop Buying","title_zh":"国家救市反弹：证金公司托底买入"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC devalued the RMB by 1.86% -- its largest single-day move -- then a further 1.6% on August 12, totalling a ~3.5% devaluation. This shocked global markets (DJIA fell 531pts on Aug 21; the Black Monday selloff on Aug 24 wiped out global 2015 gains). The SHCOMP fell -24.8% in this leg, again a broad risk-off flight to safety: Banks lost only -3.5% while Light Manufacturing fell -26.2% (ranked 4th worst/28). The devaluation was especially damaging for light industrial exporters as it signaled demand weakness and raised fears of further CNY downside impacting import costs.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行将人民币汇率中间价单日下调1.86%——创有史以来最大单日调整幅度——并于8月12日再度下调1.6%，累计贬值约3.5%。此举震动全球市场（道指8月21日跌531点，8月24日黑色星期一抹去全球2015年以来全部涨幅）。上证综指本轮下跌24.8%，再次呈现全面避险格局：银行仅跌3.5%，而轻工制造下跌26.2%（排名第4差/28位）。贬值对轻工出口企业尤为不利，因其预示需求走弱，并引发市场对人民币进一步贬值推高进口成本的担忧。","drivers":["PBOC CNY devaluation Aug 11 (-1.86%)","global risk-off / Black Monday Aug 24","flight to safety (banks outperform)","export-demand / cost fears"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行8月11日人民币贬值（-1.86%）","全球避险/黑色星期一8月24日","资金避险（银行跑赢）","出口需求/成本恐慌"],"title":"CNY Devaluation Shock Triggers Second Crash","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击引发二次暴跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"From mid-September to end of 2015, the SHCOMP recovered 18.9%, driven by President Xi's announcement of supply-side structural reform in late 2015 and PBOC monetary easing (benchmark rate cut to 4.35% in October 2015, the fifth cut in a year). The leadership was strongly growth-tilted: Computers (+63%), Electronics (+54%), and Telecoms (+53%) led, consistent with the Internet Plus / Made-in-China 2025 narrative that powered the earlier bull. Light Manufacturing ranked 18th/28 (+35.6%), a below-index performance -- the recovery concentrated in tech growth, not old-economy consumer goods.","body_zh":"2015年9月中旬至年底，上证综指回升18.9%，由习近平2015年末正式提出供给侧结构性改革及央行货币宽松（10月将基准利率降至4.35%，为一年内第五次降息）驱动。行情领涨方向明确偏向成长风格：计算机（+63%）、电子（+54%）、通信（+53%）领涨，契合此前牛市互联网加、中国制造2025主线叙事。轻工制造排名第18/28位（+35.6%），低于指数涨幅——修复行情集中于科技成长，旧经济消费品板块反弹有限。","drivers":["supply-side structural reform announcement (late 2015)","PBOC benchmark rate cut Oct 2015 to 4.35%","Internet Plus / MIC 2025 growth narrative","tech growth leadership (Computers/Electronics/Telecoms)"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革发布（2015年末）","央行2015年10月降息至4.35%","互联网加/中国制造2025成长叙事","科技成长领涨（计算机/电子/通信）"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform Hopes Fuel Tech Growth Rally","title_zh":"供给侧改革预期推动科技成长反弹"},"2015-12-30":{"body":"China introduced a circuit-breaker mechanism effective January 4, 2016. The mechanism backfired catastrophically: on January 4 the 7% threshold was hit within 30 minutes, and on January 7 trading halted after just 33 minutes -- the shortest trading day in 25 years of A-share history. Regulators suspended the mechanism on January 7. Simultaneously, the PBOC set the CNY midpoint at a near-5-year low (USD/CNY 6.5646 on Jan 7), compounding panic. The SHCOMP fell -25.7%, defensives led (Banks -16.1% vs cyclicals -29.5%). Light Manufacturing ranked 25th/28 (-33.1%), particularly hard-hit as the growth/small-cap factor that had led the bull was violently reversed.","body_zh":"中国于2016年1月4日正式施行熔断机制，结果适得其反：1月4日开盘不到30分钟即触发7%熔断线，1月7日仅交易33分钟再度熔断，创A股25年史上最短交易日纪录。监管层于1月7日当日宣布暂停熔断机制。与此同时，人民银行将人民币中间价设于近5年低点（1月7日美元对人民币6.5646），加剧恐慌情绪。上证综指下跌25.7%，防御股领跌（银行-16.1% vs 周期股-29.5%）。轻工制造排名第25/28位（-33.1%），此前引领牛市的成长/小盘因子遭到猛烈反转，轻工板块深受其害。","drivers":["circuit-breaker panic (Jan 4/7, 2016)","CNY set at 5-year low (PBOC)","growth/small-cap factor reversal","flight to safety (banks outperform)"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制引发恐慌（2016年1月4/7日）","人民币5年低位（央行）","成长/小盘因子反转","资金避险（银行跑赢）"],"title":"Circuit-Breaker Chaos and CNY Pressure Selloff","title_zh":"熔断机制失灵叠加人民币承压引发急跌"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"From late January through November 2016 the SHCOMP recovered 23.4%, underpinned by a massive infrastructure push: China launched thousands of PPP (public-private partnership) projects in early 2016, and fiscal spending accelerated sharply. Construction (+51%), Metals (+50%), and Bldg Materials (+47%) led the Shenwan universe, a classic value/cyclical-infrastructure rotation with growth-vs-value tilt of -8.7pp (value led). Light Manufacturing ranked 10th/28 (+34.4%), comfortably above-index -- its mid-cap consumer composition benefited from the overall market recovery without being the primary beneficiary of the infrastructure theme.","body_zh":"2016年1月末至11月，上证综指累计回升23.4%，由规模庞大的基础设施刺激托底：2016年初中国推出数千个PPP（政府和社会资本合作）项目，财政支出大幅提速。建筑（+51%）、金属（+50%）、建材（+47%）领涨申万全行业，是典型的价值/周期/基建轮动行情（成长-价值利差为-8.7个百分点，价值领先）。轻工制造排名第10/28位（+34.4%），跑赢大盘——其中盘消费属性在整体市场修复中受益，但并非基建主题的核心受益方。","drivers":["PPP infrastructure wave (thousands of projects)","fiscal spending acceleration","value/cyclical rotation (construction/metals/bldg mat)","market recovery from circuit-breaker lows"],"drivers_zh":["PPP基础设施浪潮（数千个项目）","财政支出提速","价值/周期轮动（建筑/金属/建材）","上证综指从熔断低点修复"],"title":"PPP Infrastructure Stimulus Drives Cyclical Recovery","title_zh":"PPP基础设施刺激带动旧经济周期股修复"},"2016-11-28":{"body":"From November 2016 to October 2018, the SHCOMP lost -24.1% as Beijing launched an unprecedented financial deleveraging campaign (formalized via the People's Daily authoritative-person interview in May 2016) that tightened shadow-banking regulations and interbank liquidity, pushed up money-market rates, and restricted off-balance-sheet vehicles. Food & Bev (+24%), Coal (-2%), and Banks (-5%) were the only relative winners -- a flight to quality in a value-led tape (growth vs value: -18.8pp). Light Manufacturing ranked 25th/28 (-50.8%), among the deepest losers alongside Textiles (-55%) and Media (-60%), as its small/mid-cap, domestic-consumer profile was squeezed by tightening liquidity and slowing consumer confidence. The US-China trade war (tariffs initiated March 2018) delivered the final blow in H2 2018.","body_zh":"2016年11月至2018年10月，上证综指下跌24.1%，北京启动史无前例的金融去杠杆运动（2016年5月人民日报权威人士访谈为正式信号），严格整治影子银行和同业流动性，推高货币市场利率，限制表外融资工具。食品饮料（+24%）、煤炭（-2%）、银行（-5%）是唯一的相对赢家——价值主导风格下的抱团资产（成长-价值利差：-18.8个百分点）。轻工制造排名第25/28位（-50.8%），与纺织（-55%）、传媒（-60%）同属跌幅最深板块，其中小盘、内需消费属性在流动性紧缩和消费信心回落中首当其冲。2018年3月启动的中美贸易战关税在下半年给出终结一击。","drivers":["financial deleveraging campaign (2016-2018)","shadow-banking / interbank tightening","US-China tariffs initiated March 2018","value/defensive rotation (Food & Bev leads)"],"drivers_zh":["金融去杠杆运动（2016-2018年）","影子银行/同业流动性整治","中美贸易战关税（2018年3月启动）","价值/防御轮动（食品饮料领涨）"],"title":"Financial Deleveraging Bear; Value Rotates Defense","title_zh":"金融去杠杆熊市，价值防御风格主导"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"From October 2018 to April 2019 the SHCOMP surged 30.6% as the PBOC pivoted sharply: the RRR was cut multiple times in 2018-2019 (total ~250bp), LPR reform signaled structural rate reduction, and the government fast-tracked fiscal stimulus with VAT cuts effective April 2019. Critically, the US-China trade-war ceasefire announced at the G20 in Buenos Aires (December 1, 2018) shifted market sentiment dramatically. Growth/tech led (Computers +64%, Conglom +65%), with cyclicals outperforming (35.1% vs defensives 30.2%). Light Manufacturing ranked 10th/28 (+48.5%) -- a solid recovery but not a sector leader, consistent with post-crisis broad beta without a sector-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2018年10月至2019年4月，上证综指大涨30.6%，由人民银行大幅政策转向驱动：2018至2019年多次下调存款准备金率（合计约250bp），LPR改革释放结构性降息信号，政府加快财政刺激（4月起增值税下调生效）。更关键的是，2018年12月1日G20布宜诺斯艾利斯峰会上宣布的中美贸易战停火协议大幅提振市场情绪。成长/科技领涨（计算机+64%，综合+65%），周期股跑赢防御股（35.1% vs 30.2%）。轻工制造排名第10/28位（+48.5%）——修复扎实但并非领军板块，符合危机后宽基贝塔反弹而无板块独立催化剂的特征。","drivers":["PBOC RRR/LPR easing pivot (~250bp RRR cuts)","G20 trade ceasefire Buenos Aires Dec 1, 2018","VAT cut April 2019","growth/tech beta recovery"],"drivers_zh":["央行RRR/LPR宽松转向（合计降准约250bp）","G20贸易停火布宜诺斯艾利斯2018年12月1日","2019年4月增值税下调","成长/科技贝塔修复"],"title":"PBOC Pivot and G20 Trade Truce Drive Recovery","title_zh":"央行政策转向与G20贸易停火推动市场修复"},"2019-04-04":{"body":"The April-August 2019 selloff was triggered by Trump's May 10 tariff escalation (raising tariffs from 10% to 25% on USD200bn of Chinese goods), followed by the Huawei entity-list ban (May 16, 2019). The SHCOMP fell -14.5% and in a classic risk-off flight to safety, Food & Bev (+2.3%) and Coal (flat) sheltered while Light Manufacturing ranked 26th/28 (-26.0%) -- its export exposure to light consumer goods (furniture, paper, household items) made it one of the most direct tariff victims. The laggard rank of 26th/28 confirms this was sector-specific tariff damage, not merely broad market beta.","body_zh":"2019年4月至8月的下跌行情由特朗普5月10日关税升级（对2000亿美元中国商品加征关税从10%提至25%）以及5月16日华为列入实体清单触发。上证综指下跌14.5%，典型避险格局下食品饮料（+2.3%）和煤炭（基本持平）相对抗跌，而轻工制造排名第26/28位（-26.0%）——其出口敞口集中于轻工消费品（家具、纸品、家居用品），成为最直接的关税受害板块。排名26/28印证本轮下跌并非单纯的宽基贝塔，而是板块性关税冲击。","drivers":["Trump tariff hike to 25% on USD200bn (May 10, 2019)","Huawei entity-list ban (May 16, 2019)","export/tariff sensitivity of light consumer goods","flight to safety (Food & Bev outperforms)"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普关税升至25%（2019年5月10日）","华为实体清单（5月16日）","轻消费品出口/关税敏感性","资金避险（食品饮料跑赢）"],"title":"Trade War Escalation and Huawei Ban Hit Exporters","title_zh":"贸易战升级与华为禁令重创出口板块"},"2019-08-09":{"body":"From August 2019 to January 2022 the SHCOMP gained 29.5%, though leadership was strikingly narrow: Power Equipment (+200%), Chemicals (+108%), and Electronics (+106%) dominated as the green-energy/NEV revolution (subsidies extended 2020-2022) and post-COVID recovery trade concentrated capital. COVID initially hit in Q1 2020 but A-shares recovered sharply by mid-2020 on China's early containment success. The growth-vs-value tilt reached +31.9pp. Light Manufacturing ranked 14th/31 (+49.5%), roughly inline with the index -- a moderate beneficiary of COVID home-goods and packaging demand, but crowded out of the premium by the power-equipment and NEV mega-themes.","body_zh":"2019年8月至2022年1月，上证综指累计上涨29.5%，但领涨方向极度集中：电力设备（+200%）、化工（+108%）、电子（+106%）主导行情，绿色能源/新能源汽车革命（补贴延续至2020-2022年）与疫情后复苏交易汇集资金。新冠疫情于2020年Q1初发，但A股在中国率先实现防控成效后于2020年中期即急速修复。成长-价值利差达+31.9个百分点。轻工制造排名第14/31位（+49.5%），与指数基本持平——疫情期间居家消费需求（家居用品、包装需求）有所受益，但溢价空间被电力设备与新能源车超级主题占据。","drivers":["COVID recovery / home-goods demand uplift","green energy / NEV mega-boom (subsidies 2020-2022)","PBOC easing (2020 rate/RRR cuts)","growth-style dominates (+31.9pp vs value)"],"drivers_zh":["疫情后复苏/居家消费需求提振","绿色能源/新能源车爆发（补贴2020-2022年）","央行2020年降息降准","成长风格主导（跑赢价值+31.9pp）"],"title":"COVID Recovery and Green-Energy Boom; Mid-Pack","title_zh":"疫情复苏与绿色能源爆发，板块居中游"},"2022-01-10":{"body":"From January to April 2022, the SHCOMP fell -17.2% under three simultaneous headwinds: Beijing's tech regulatory crackdown (extending from the July 2021 Didi/education actions to sweeping data-security and antitrust measures), zero-COVID lockdowns (Shenzhen locked March 2022, Shanghai from late March), and the Russia-Ukraine commodity shock. The tape rotated sharply to value (value led growth by 14.2pp): Coal (+15.5%), Banks (-5%), Construction (-9.8%) led, while growth sectors (Computers -34%, Electronics -35%) and Light Manufacturing (-30.7%, ranked 26th/31) were crushed. Light Manufacturing's mid-cap consumer orientation was doubly vulnerable: supply chains disrupted by lockdowns, demand hit by consumer confidence collapse.","body_zh":"2022年1月至4月，上证综指在三重压力下下跌17.2%：北京科技监管整治持续发酵（从2021年7月滴滴/教育行业行动延伸至全面的数据安全和反垄断措施）、新冠清零严格封控（深圳2022年3月封城，上海3月底至6月封城），以及俄乌战争引发的大宗商品冲击。行情大幅向价值轮动（价值跑赢成长14.2个百分点）：煤炭（+15.5%）、银行（-5%）、建筑（-9.8%）领涨，成长板块（计算机-34%、电子-35%）与轻工制造（-30.7%，排名第26/31位）遭受重创。轻工制造中盘消费属性使其双重受压：供应链受封控冲击，消费信心大幅下滑又打击了需求端。","drivers":["zero-COVID lockdowns (Shenzhen/Shanghai 2022)","tech regulatory crackdown (data-security/antitrust)","Russia-Ukraine commodity shock","value rotation / coal+banks outperform"],"drivers_zh":["新冠清零封控（深圳/上海2022年）","科技监管整治（数据安全/反垄断）","俄乌战争大宗商品冲击","价值轮动/煤炭银行跑赢"],"title":"Zero-COVID Lockdowns and Tech Crackdown Selloff","title_zh":"新冠清零封控叠加科技监管重压致板块下挫"},"2022-04-28":{"body":"From April 2022 to March 2023 the SHCOMP recovered 11.3%, driven first by China's post-lockdown reopening cycle (Shanghai began reopening June 2022; full zero-COVID policy abandonment announced December 26, 2022), then by the ChatGPT-driven AI excitement beginning November 2022 that boosted domestic tech themes. Computers (+42%), Telecoms (+39%), and Machinery (+36%) led in a growth-tilted tape (+15.9pp). Light Manufacturing ranked 5th/31 (+29%), a strong above-index performance -- reopening lifted consumer-goods demand and supply-chain normalization, and the sector's domestic-consumption angle benefited disproportionately from the zero-COVID exit trade.","body_zh":"2022年4月至2023年3月，上证综指回升11.3%，先由中国疫情后重启周期（上海2022年6月开始解封，12月26日宣布全面退出清零政策）驱动，再由2022年11月ChatGPT引燃的AI热情提振国内科技主题。计算机（+42%）、通信（+39%）、机械（+36%）领涨，行情成长倾向显著（+15.9个百分点）。轻工制造排名第5/31位（+29%），显著跑赢大盘——重启提振消费品需求和供应链正常化，该板块的国内消费属性从清零退出行情中受益尤为突出。","drivers":["zero-COVID exit trade (Dec 2022 reopening)","consumer demand / supply-chain normalization","ChatGPT AI narrative (Nov 2022 launch)","growth-style recovery (+15.9pp)"],"drivers_zh":["清零退出行情（2022年12月重启）","消费需求/供应链正常化","ChatGPT AI叙事（2022年11月发布）","成长风格修复（+15.9pp）"],"title":"Reopening Relief and ChatGPT AI Wave Recovery","title_zh":"经济重启预期与ChatGPT AI浪潮驱动修复"},"2023-03-02":{"body":"From March 2023 to February 2024 the SHCOMP fell -18.4% as China's post-COVID reopening recovery disappointed: CPI turned deflationary by mid-2023 (hitting -0.3% in July 2023), consumer confidence remained suppressed by the ongoing property-sector crisis (Evergrande and Country Garden defaults in 2023), and foreign capital exodus intensified. Defensives led (Coal +1%, Banks -2.5%) vs cyclicals (-27.3%), a value tape (growth-vs-value: -8.9pp). Light Manufacturing ranked 22nd/31 (-36.5%), a significant underperformer -- its consumer-discretionary, domestic-demand orientation was directly exposed to the deflationary consumer slump and the property-wealth-effect collapse.","body_zh":"2023年3月至2024年2月，上证综指下跌18.4%，中国疫情后经济修复令市场失望：CPI于2023年中期陷入通缩（2023年7月触及-0.3%），消费信心持续受到持续房地产危机（恒大和碧桂园2023年违约）压制，外资出逃加剧。防御股领涨（煤炭+1%、银行-2.5%）vs 周期股（-27.3%），价值主导行情（成长-价值利差-8.9pp）。轻工制造排名第22/31位（-36.5%），显著跑输大盘——其消费可选、内需导向属性直接暴露于通缩性消费低迷和房地产财富效应崩塌之中。","drivers":["CPI deflation (Jul 2023: -0.3%)","property crisis (Evergrande/Country Garden defaults)","foreign capital outflows","consumer confidence collapse / value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["CPI通缩（2023年7月：-0.3%）","房地产危机（恒大/碧桂园违约）","外资持续流出","消费信心崩溃/价值轮动"],"title":"Post-Reopening Deflation and Property Crisis Bear","title_zh":"重启后通缩与房地产危机引发持续下跌"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 2024 the SHCOMP rebounded 16.7% after Central Huijin (China's sovereign wealth arm) injected CNY300bn+ into CSI 300 ETFs in Q1 2024, propping blue-chip valuations near 5-year lows; the National Team poured at least CNY41bn in Q1 via ETF purchases per public reports. New CSRC leadership announced shareholder-return reforms. Cyclicals led (Metals +39.7%, Chemicals +32%, Defense +30.8%), with the growth-vs-value tilt neutral at +3.8pp. Light Manufacturing ranked 6th/31 (+28.4%), a solid performer -- the metals/chemicals cyclical recovery with broad risk-on backdrop lifted consumer-goods manufacturing valuations from depressed levels.","body_zh":"2024年2月起，上证综指反弹16.7%，由中央汇金（中国主权财富基金投资平台）2024年Q1向沪深300ETF注资逾3000亿元托住蓝筹股估值（此前处于近5年低位）；据公开报道，国家队Q1通过ETF购买注入至少410亿美元。证监会新任领导层宣布股东回报改革。周期股领涨（金属+39.7%、化工+32%、国防+30.8%），成长-价值利差中性（+3.8个百分点）。轻工制造排名第6/31位（+28.4%），表现扎实——金属/化工周期性修复与整体风险偏好回暖提振了消费品制造业估值。","drivers":["Central Huijin CNY300bn+ ETF buying (Q1 2024)","CSRC shareholder-return / market-reform package","cyclical valuation recovery from 5-year lows","broad risk-on rebound"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金逾3000亿元ETF购买（2024年Q1）","证监会股东回报/市场改革方案","周期性估值从5年低位修复","风险偏好全面回暖"],"title":"National Team Rescue Lifts Cyclicals From Lows","title_zh":"国家队救市提振周期股从低位回升"},"2024-05-17":{"body":"From May to September 2024 the SHCOMP fell -13.8% as post-rescue confidence faded, consumer spending data missed expectations through summer, and deflationary pressures persisted (PPI remained deeply negative through mid-2024). Brokers (-7%), Utilities (-8.5%), and Banks (-9.7%) outperformed on defensive positioning. Light Manufacturing ranked dead last (31st/31, -28.7%) alongside Food & Bev (-28.6%) and Bldg Materials (-28.7%) -- an indiscriminate domestic-demand selloff where consumer discretionary and housing-linked names bore the heaviest losses. No sector-specific catalyst; the move was pure macro-demand pessimism.","body_zh":"2024年5月至9月，上证综指下跌13.8%，救市后信心再度消退，夏季消费支出数据持续低于预期，通缩压力未减（PPI至2024年中期仍深度负值）。券商（-7%）、公用事业（-8.5%）、银行（-9.7%）以防御性持仓相对抗跌。轻工制造排名垫底（第31/31位，-28.7%），与食品饮料（-28.6%）、建材（-28.7%）并列最弱——这是一轮不分化的内需下行抛售，消费可选与地产相关板块承压最重。本轮无板块独立催化剂，纯属宏观需求悲观情绪主导。","drivers":["persistent PPI deflation (2024)","consumer spending miss (summer 2024)","domestic-demand pessimism / confidence fade","post-rescue euphoria reversal"],"drivers_zh":["PPI持续通缩（2024年）","消费支出数据低于预期（2024年夏）","内需悲观情绪/信心消退","救市效果消退"],"title":"Consumer Demand Slump; Light Mfg Dead Last","title_zh":"消费需求持续走弱，轻工制造居末位"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a comprehensive stimulus package: 50bp RRR cut (freeing ~CNY1tr), 20bp LPR cut, a CNY500bn Securities-Fund-Insurance Swap Facility enabling non-bank institutions to buy equities, and a CNY300bn special relending program for listed-company buybacks. The Politburo followed on September 26 with fiscal pledges and property rescue language. The SHCOMP surged 27.4% in 11 weeks. Light Manufacturing ranked 7th/31 (+49%), consistent with broad cyclical beta recovery -- Retail (+73%), Computers (+73%), and Conglom (+66%) led this growth-and-reflationary rally.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，中国人民银行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子刺激方案：降准50bp（释放约1万亿元流动性）、LPR下调20bp、设立5000亿元证券基金保险公司互换便利（支持非银机构购买股票）、设立3000亿元上市公司股票回购再贷款专项工具。9月26日政治局会议进一步作出财政承诺和房地产救市表态。上证综指11周内大涨27.4%。轻工制造排名第7/31位（+49%），符合宽基周期贝塔修复特征——零售（+73%）、计算机（+73%）、综合（+66%）领涨这轮成长与再通胀并进的行情。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut + 20bp LPR cut (Sep 24, 2024)","CNY500bn equity swap facility","Politburo fiscal/property pledges (Sep 26, 2024)","broad cyclical beta rally"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准50bp+降息20bp（2024年9月24日）","5000亿元股票互换便利","政治局财政/房地产承诺（9月26日）","宽基周期贝塔反弹"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Stimulus Triggers Broad Beta Rally","title_zh":"央行火箭炮刺激触发宽基贝塔反弹"},"2024-12-12":{"body":"From December 2024 through April 2025 the SHCOMP fell -9.1% as Trump's November 2024 election victory triggered fears of sweeping new tariffs on China (he had pledged 60%+ on Chinese goods). The offshore CNY weakened over 3% vs the USD in Nov-Dec 2024, approaching multi-year lows. Banks (+2.2%), Agriculture (-1.1%), and Utilities (-7%) outperformed in a flight-to-safety rotation. Light Manufacturing ranked 29th/31 (-20.8%), a deep laggard -- its export-to-the-US orientation (furniture, household goods, paper) made it one of the most direct proxies for tariff-damage fears, compounded by the yuan depreciation signal. Actual 145% tariffs materialized in April 2025.","body_zh":"2024年12月至2025年4月，上证综指下跌9.1%，特朗普2024年11月大选胜利引发市场对中国大规模新关税的担忧（其曾承诺对中国商品征收60%以上关税）。2024年11月至12月离岸人民币对美元贬值逾3%，接近多年低位。银行（+2.2%）、农业（-1.1%）、公用事业（-7%）在避险轮动中相对抗跌。轻工制造排名第29/31位（-20.8%），大幅落后——其对美出口敞口（家具、家居用品、纸制品）使其成为关税冲击担忧的最直接代理板块，叠加人民币贬值信号双重压制。实际145%关税于2025年4月落地。","drivers":["Trump election tariff fear (60%+ China pledge)","CNY multi-year lows (offshore -3% Nov-Dec 2024)","flight to safety (banks/agriculture outperform)","export-to-US sensitivity (furniture/household goods)"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普当选关税担忧（60%以上对华承诺）","人民币多年低位（离岸2024年11-12月贬值逾3%）","资金避险（银行/农业跑赢）","对美出口敏感性（家具/家居用品）"],"title":"Trump Tariff Fears Drag Export-Sensitive Laggard","title_zh":"特朗普关税担忧拖累出口敏感板块"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"From April 8, 2025 through February 2026 the SHCOMP gained 31.8%, a risk-on cyclical rally driven by: (1) US-China tariff 90-day truce announced May 12, 2025 (temporarily reducing tariffs from 145% toward ~30%); (2) DeepSeek AI breakthrough (January 2025) which reignited China tech confidence and drove the SHCOMP's longest winning streak since COVID reopening; (3) PBOC 50bp RRR cut announced May 7, 2025 to offset tariff drag. Leadership was overwhelmingly in cyclicals/growth: Metals (+139%), Telecoms (+129%), Conglom (+115%), with defensives barely positive (+6.2%). Light Manufacturing ranked 12th/31 (+46.5%) -- a solid mid-pack recovery, reflecting improved export outlook post-truce and domestic consumer re-reflation, but lagging commodity and tech mega-themes.","body_zh":"2025年4月8日至2026年2月，上证综指大涨31.8%，为风险偏好主导的周期性反弹行情，驱动因素包括：（1）2025年5月12日宣布中美关税90天停火（暂将关税从145%降至约30%）；（2）DeepSeek AI突破（2025年1月）重燃中国科技信心，推动上证综指实现自疫情重启以来最长连涨；（3）央行2025年5月7日宣布降准50bp以对冲关税拖累。领涨方向压倒性地集中于周期/成长：金属（+139%）、通信（+129%）、综合（+115%），防御股几乎仅微幅收正（+6.2%）。轻工制造排名第12/31位（+46.5%）——停火协议改善出口前景、国内消费再通胀带动板块稳健中游修复，但落后于大宗商品/科技超级主题。","drivers":["US-China 90-day tariff truce (May 12, 2025)","DeepSeek AI re-rating of China tech (Jan 2025)","PBOC 50bp RRR cut (May 7, 2025)","broad cyclical/commodity mega-rally"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税90天停火（2025年5月12日）","DeepSeek AI推动中国科技重估（2025年1月）","央行降准50bp（2025年5月7日）","宽基周期/大宗商品超级反弹"],"title":"Trade Truce and DeepSeek AI Drive Cyclical Rally","title_zh":"贸易停火与DeepSeek AI叙事驱动周期性大反弹"},"2026-02-25":{"body":"The current leg (from February 2026) shows the SHCOMP barely negative (-2.9% in the window) while the tape has rotated sharply to pure growth/tech: Telecoms (+61%), Electronics (+58%), and Bldg Materials (+20%) lead while consumer categories (Retail -28%, Media -29%, Beauty -30%) are the worst performers. Light Manufacturing fell -21% (ranked 21st/31). This is a narrow, AI/semiconductor-capex driven tape where capital has abandoned broad domestic-consumption names in favor of tech-infrastructure plays. Light Manufacturing's consumer-goods orientation, export sensitivity to still-elevated US tariffs, and lack of AI thematic exposure render it a systematic laggard in the current regime.","body_zh":"当前行情（2026年2月起），上证综指基本走平（窗口内-2.9%），而行情已大幅轮动至纯粹成长/科技：通信（+61%）、电子（+58%）、建材（+20%）领涨，消费类板块（零售-28%、传媒-29%、美护-30%）垫底。轻工制造下跌21%（排名第21/31位）。当前为窄基AI/半导体资本开支驱动行情，资金从宽基内需消费板块大幅撤离，涌向科技基础设施主题。轻工制造的消费品属性、对仍处高位美国关税的出口敞口，以及缺乏AI主题催化剂，令其在当前市场格局中系统性落后。","drivers":["AI/semiconductor capex rotation dominates","consumer discretionary crowded out by tech","elevated US tariffs persist (post-truce ~30%+)","narrow growth leadership (Telecoms/Electronics)"],"drivers_zh":["AI/半导体资本开支轮动主导","消费可选股被科技挤压","美国关税仍偏高（停火后约30%+）","窄基成长领涨（通信/电子）"],"title":"AI Tech Rotation Leaves Consumer Cyclicals Behind","title_zh":"AI科技主线轮动，消费周期板块再度落后"}},"now":"Light Manufacturing (Shenwan 801140) is currently in a Bottoming/Trough phase (-14.9% this leg, ranked 20th/31), tracking below its 200-day moving average with rs_rank of 22. The tape is a strong risk-on, growth-led rotation: cyclicals led defensives by 12.4pp yet SHCOMP is barely positive (+1.6%), with leadership concentrated in Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Bldg Materials (+48.1%). Light Manufacturing is a deep laggard in this environment; its export-heavy, consumer-discretionary composition (household goods, paper, furniture, leisure products) receives no bid in a tape driven by domestic tech/semiconductor and AI-capex themes. The sector sits in the bottom third of the Shenwan universe, dragged by US tariff headwinds (peaking ~145% in April 2025, partially relieved by the May 2025 90-day truce but still elevated), subdued domestic consumer confidence, and rotation away from old-economy consumer cyclicals toward tech growth. A cyclical turn would require a consumer-reflation catalyst (LPR cuts, consumption subsidies) or a durable trade-truce deepening into export-demand recovery.","now_zh":"轻工制造（申万801140）目前处于筑底阶段（本轮下跌14.9%，排名第20/31位），运行于200日均线下方，相对强弱排名第22位。当前行情呈现强烈的风险偏好、成长风格主导格局——周期股跑赢防御股12.4个百分点，而上证综指仅微涨1.6%，领涨板块集中于电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）及建材（+48.1%）。轻工制造大幅落后：该板块以出口导向型消费品（家居用品、纸制品、家具、休闲产品）为主，无法受益于以国内科技/半导体及AI资本开支为驱动的行情。板块排名处于申万全行业后三分之一，受多重压制：美国关税高峰期达145%（2025年4月），5月达成90天停火协议后有所缓解但仍偏高；内需消费信心疲弱；市场资金持续从旧经济消费周期向科技成长轮动。板块反转需要消费刺激催化剂（LPR降息、消费补贴扩大）或贸易缓和持续深化带动出口需求实质性复苏。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801150":{"legs":{"2012-01-16":{"body":"The 2012–2015 period was China's great growth-stock bull market, driven by PBOC credit expansion, ChiNext margin-fueled liquidity, and Beijing's 12th Five-Year Plan designating healthcare as a strategic pillar industry. Pharma & Biotech returned +303.9% vs SHCOMP +134.2%, ranking 4th of 28, in a tape where growth led value by 41.7pp. Structural demand from aging demographics, expansion of the National Reimbursement Drug List (NRDL), and ChiNext IPO-driven multiple re-rating all amplified returns well above the index beta. The rally stalled only when margin leverage peaked and CSRC announced shadow-financing restrictions on June 12, 2015.","body_zh":"2012–2015年是中国成长股大牛市，PBOC信贷扩张、创业板杠杆资金以及十二五规划将医疗健康列为战略性产业共同驱动。医药生物累计涨幅+303.9%，远超上证综指+134.2%，在28个行业中排名第4，成长跑赢价值41.7个百分点。人口老龄化结构性需求、国家医保目录扩容以及创业板IPO热潮推动估值大幅重估，回报率远超指数贝塔。直至2015年6月12日证监会宣布收紧场外配资监管，杠杆高位崩塌，涨势才告终结。","drivers":["ChiNext liquidity bubble","12th Five-Year Plan healthcare mandate","NRDL expansion","PBOC credit easing","aging demographics structural demand"],"drivers_zh":["创业板流动性泡沫","十二五医疗健康战略","医保目录扩容","PBOC信贷宽松","人口老龄化结构性需求"],"title":"ChiNext bull era fuels pharma growth premium","title_zh":"创业板牛市带动医药成长溢价"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the CSRC released draft rules tightening shadow-financed margin accounts; a month-long crash began the next trading day. Pharma fell -39.9% vs SHCOMP -32.1%, ranking 12th of 28, in a flight-to-safety tape where defensives (-30.4%) outperformed cyclicals (-43.0%). The sector's high valuation multiples — built on leverage and theme speculation rather than earnings — made it vulnerable to forced liquidation. The broader leverage fire-sale hit the growth/ChiNext complex hardest; pharma's relative resilience vs. defense (-52%) and coal (-59%) reflected its defensive revenue base.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会发布场外配资监管草案，A股随即于次日开始长达一个月的暴跌。医药生物下跌-39.9%，跑输上证综指（-32.1%），在28个行业中排名第12。该阶段是典型的避险行情，防御股（-30.4%）跑赢周期股（-43.0%）。医药估值因杠杆资金和主题炒作而虚高，因此在强制平仓中受到重创。与国防（-52%）和煤炭（-59%）相比，医药的相对韧性得益于其基础收益的防御属性。","drivers":["CSRC shadow-margin rule announcement Jun-12-2015","forced margin deleveraging","leverage fire-sale","growth-premium unwind","SHCOMP -32% index drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["证监会场外配资新规","强制平仓去杠杆","杠杆踩踏式抛售","成长溢价瓦解","A股熔断螺旋"],"title":"Margin deleveraging crash wipes growth stocks","title_zh":"场外配资去杠杆崩盘横扫成长股"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Beijing launched a massive state-directed rescue in early July 2015: the CSRC suspended IPOs, state funds ('national team') were deployed to buy large-caps, and margin trading was loosened. The SHCOMP surged +17.6% in two weeks; pharma gained +29.7%, ranking 9th of 28. Cyclicals (coal +101%, defense +65%) led the rebound as the rescue targeted index heavyweights and beaten-down cyclicals, consistent with the ctx: growth led by only 5.7pp and cyclicals outperformed defensives by 15pp. Pharma's gain was largely index beta from the relief bounce, not sector-specific catalysts.","body_zh":"2015年7月初，北京启动大规模国家队救市：证监会暂停IPO，国家队资金大举买入大盘蓝筹，同时放宽融资融券。上证综指两周内反弹+17.6%，医药生物上涨+29.7%，在28个行业中排名第9。煤炭（+101%）和国防（+65%）领涨，因国家队重点托举大盘股和受重创的周期股。成长跑赢价值仅5.7个百分点，周期跑赢防御15个百分点，与数据一致。医药的涨幅主要为指数贝塔带来的反弹收益，并无行业特定催化剂。","drivers":["CSRC IPO suspension Jul-2015","state national-team fund deployment","index beta relief bounce","cyclical short-squeeze","margin loosening"],"drivers_zh":["证监会暂停IPO","国家队资金入市","指数贝塔反弹","周期股逼空","融资融券松绑"],"title":"State rescue team triggers short bear squeeze","title_zh":"国家队救市引发短暂逼空反弹"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"The August 11, 2015 surprise CNY devaluation — PBOC cut the daily fix by 1.9% in a single day, the largest one-day move in a decade — triggered capital flight fears and a second equity crash. Pharma fell -29.7%, ranking 13th of 28, in a flight-to-safety tape (defensives -22.6% vs cyclicals -31.1%; SHCOMP -27.1%). Banks (-12.5%) and food & beverage (-22%) led relative to pharma (-29.7%), consistent with investors rotating from high-multiple growth names to value/defensive. The growth-to-value tilt of -5.8pp confirms the style reversal continued from the June crash wave.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民币汇率中间价单日下调1.9%，创十年最大单日降幅，引发资本外流担忧和第二轮股市暴跌。医药生物下跌-29.7%，在28个行业中排名第13，属于典型避险行情（防御股-22.6%跑赢周期股-31.1%；上证综指-27.1%）。银行（-12.5%）和食品饮料（-22%）相对优于医药（-29.7%），显示资金从高估值成长股向价值/防御股切换。成长相对价值-5.8个百分点的风格数据印证了6月崩盘后的风格延续。","drivers":["CNY surprise devaluation Aug-11-2015","capital flight fears","global risk-off contagion","growth-to-value style rotation","second forced-liquidation wave"],"drivers_zh":["2015年8月11日人民币意外贬值","资本外流恐慌","全球风险规避蔓延","成长向价值风格切换","第二轮强制平仓潮"],"title":"Second crash wave: CNY fix shock and growth unwind","title_zh":"第二轮下跌：人民币中间价冲击与成长股再次杀跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After two successive crash waves, A-shares stabilized from mid-September through year-end 2015 as PBOC cut the benchmark rate on October 23, 2015 — the sixth cut in a year, to 4.35% — and reduced the RRR. Pharma rose +36.4%, ranking 19th of 28, but underperformed as computers (+63.8%), electronics (+53.1%) and telecoms (+51.6%) led the recovery. This was a growth-driven tape (growth +16.9pp over value; SHCOMP +21.5%), meaning cyclical and tech names recovered faster than pharma. The sector's lagging rank confirms it was not the primary beneficiary of the liquidity injection.","body_zh":"经历两轮暴跌后，A股自2015年9月中旬至年底趋于稳定，PBOC于2015年10月23日再次降息（一年内第六次，至4.35%）并降准提供流动性支撑。医药生物上涨+36.4%，在28个行业中排名第19，但跑输计算机（+63.8%）、电子（+53.1%）和通信（+51.6%）。这是一轮成长驱动的行情（成长跑赢价值16.9个百分点；上证综指+21.5%），科技和周期类股票的恢复速度快于医药。板块落后的排名表明其并非流动性注入的主要受益者。","drivers":["PBOC sixth rate cut to 4.35% Oct-23-2015","RRR reduction","tech/growth-first recovery","post-deleveraging liquidity injection","ChiNext tech names rebound"],"drivers_zh":["PBOC第六次降息至4.35%（2015年10月）","降准注流动性","科技/成长优先修复","去杠杆后流动性注入","创业板科技股反弹"],"title":"Post-crash liquidity relief: growth stocks recover","title_zh":"崩盘后流动性修复：成长股反弹"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"China's new market-wide circuit breaker (effective January 1, 2016) paradoxically accelerated selling as investors rushed to exit before the breaker tripped. On January 7, 2016, PBOC set the yuan fix at 6.5646 per USD, the lowest since March 2011, intensifying capital-flight fears. Pharma fell -29.6%, ranking 7th of 28 in relative resilience, as defensives (-25.8%) beat cyclicals (-30.9%) and SHCOMP crashed -27.3%. Banks (-17.1%) led; media (-34.4%), computers (-35.9%), and conglomerates (-36.8%) were worst hit, consistent with a value-defensive flight. The circuit breaker was suspended on January 7, 2016 after triggering on both its first two trading days.","body_zh":"2016年1月1日起实施的市场熔断机制反而加速了抛售，因投资者争相在熔断前出逃。2016年1月7日，PBOC将人民币中间价定于6.5646（2011年3月以来最低），加剧资本外流恐慌。医药生物下跌-29.6%，在28个行业中排名第7，显示相对韧性，防御股（-25.8%）跑赢周期股（-30.9%），上证综指暴跌-27.3%。银行（-17.1%）相对抗跌；传媒（-34.4%）、计算机（-35.9%）和综合（-36.8%）跌幅居前，与防御/价值逃难行情一致。熔断机制在1月的前两个交易日均触发，随即于1月7日被叫停。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic selling Jan-2016","CNY fix at 5-year low Jan-7-2016 (6.5646)","capital outflow fears","defensive rotation vs growth unwind","SHCOMP -27% index drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月熔断机制恐慌抛售","人民币中间价创五年新低（6.5646）","资本外流恐慌","防御轮动vs成长杀跌","上证综指-27%大幅下跌"],"title":"Circuit breaker panic: yuan fix hits March 2011 low","title_zh":"熔断恐慌：人民币中间价创2011年3月新低"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"From January 2016 to May 2018, Chinese equities entered a 'consumption upgrade / quality' cycle. The SHCOMP rose +18.1% but the real story was a dramatic value-over-growth style tilt (-21.8pp for growth), with food & beverage (+120.6%), appliances (+76.5%), and pharma (+45.3%) — all quality-consumer defensives — leading the market while defense (-14.1%), conglomerates (-16.8%), and media (-32.4%) lagged. This was driven by a supply-side reform narrative, rising corporate earnings quality, and institutional northbound inflows via Stock Connect (launched November 2014) rotating into premium consumer and healthcare brands. Pharma ranked 3rd of 28 — genuine sector leadership, not just index beta.","body_zh":"2016年1月至2018年5月，A股进入'消费升级/高质量'周期。上证综指上涨+18.1%，但核心逻辑是明显的价值跑赢成长风格（成长相对价值-21.8个百分点），食品饮料（+120.6%）、家用电器（+76.5%）和医药（+45.3%）——均属优质消费防御类——领跑市场，而国防（-14.1%）、综合（-16.8%）和传媒（-32.4%）严重跑输。这一行情由供给侧改革叙事、上市公司盈利质量提升以及沪深港通北向资金流入推动，资金持续向优质消费/医疗品牌集中。医药在28个行业中排名第3，属于真实的行业领涨，而非单纯的指数贝塔。","drivers":["consumption upgrade quality cycle 2016-2018","supply-side reform earnings re-rating","Stock Connect northbound inflows into quality brands","value-over-growth style rotation -21.8pp","NRDL 2016 reform volume-for-price boost"],"drivers_zh":["2016-2018消费升级质量周期","供给侧改革盈利重估","沪深港通北向资金流入优质品牌","价值跑赢成长-21.8个百分点","2016年NRDL改革以量换价"],"title":"Maotai-era value rotation: pharma joins quality rally","title_zh":"茅台时代价值轮动：医药参与高质量白马行情"},"2018-05-28":{"body":"Pharma crashed -40.7% from May 2018 to January 2019, ranking dead last (28th of 28), as two simultaneous shocks hit: first, the US-China trade war escalated sharply from May 2018 (SHCOMP -21.4%); second, and more sector-specific, the State Council announced the '4+7' centralized volume-based procurement (VBP) pilot in November 2018, opening bidding in Shanghai in December. Generic drug companies cut prices by 50–94% to win contracts — Entecavir famously priced down 94% — sending shockwaves across the sector regardless of whether firms won or lost the tenders. This dual catalyst (trade war macro + VBP sector-specific) explains why pharma ranked worst of all 28 industries.","body_zh":"2018年5月至2019年1月，医药生物暴跌-40.7%，在28个行业中排名垫底（第28位），遭受两轮冲击：其一，中美贸易战自2018年5月急剧升级（上证综指-21.4%）；其二，更具行业特异性的冲击——国务院于2018年11月宣布'4+7'带量采购试点，12月在上海开标。仿制药企业纷纷大幅降价以争夺合同，恩替卡韦价格降幅高达94%，无论中标与否均在行业内引发轩然大波。宏观（贸易战）+行业特定（带量采购）双重催化剂，是医药在28个行业中排名最差的根本原因。","drivers":["4+7 VBP pilot announcement Nov-2018 Shanghai bidding","generic drug price cuts 50-94%","US-China trade war escalation May-2018","SHCOMP -21% index drawdown","sector-specific earnings risk beyond macro"],"drivers_zh":["2018年11月4+7带量采购试点上海开标","仿制药降价50-94%","2018年5月中美贸易战升级","上证综指-21%下行","超越宏观的行业特定盈利风险"],"title":"4+7 VBP shock and trade war double hit","title_zh":"4+7集采冲击与中美贸易战双重打击"},"2019-01-03":{"body":"The G20 US-China trade truce (December 1, 2018) and PBOC's January 4, 2019 RRR cut (100bp, releasing CNY 1.5 trillion) triggered a broad A-share relief rally: SHCOMP +31.6% in three months. Pharma rose +46.6%, ranking 7th of 28, in a growth-tilted tape (growth +8.7pp). Food & bev (+58.5%), agriculture (+55.5%), and computers (+54.3%) led. Pharma's rank of 7th — above median but not top-3 — reflects partial stabilization of VBP fears alongside the macro relief; the sector lagged pure-liquidity plays but delivered meaningful alpha vs. the index and the cyclicals average.","body_zh":"G20中美贸易休战（2018年12月1日）以及PBOC于2019年1月4日实施的降准（降100bp，释放约1.5万亿元）触发A股全面反弹：上证综指三个月内上涨+31.6%。医药生物上涨+46.6%，在28个行业中排名第7，成长小幅跑赢价值8.7个百分点。食品饮料（+58.5%）、农林牧渔（+55.5%）和计算机（+54.3%）领涨。医药排名第7——高于中位数但未进前三——反映集采恐慌边际消化叠加宏观利好缓释；跑输纯流动性受益板块，但相对指数和周期均值均获得有效超额收益。","drivers":["G20 US-China trade truce Dec-1-2018","PBOC 100bp RRR cut Jan-4-2019","broad A-share relief rally SHCOMP +31.6%","VBP fears partially absorbed","growth-style liquidity bid"],"drivers_zh":["2018年12月1日G20中美贸易休战","PBOC 2019年1月4日降准100bp","A股全面反弹上证综指+31.6%","集采恐慌边际消化","成长风格流动性提振"],"title":"Trade truce and PBOC easing: pharma joins broad rebound","title_zh":"贸易休战与PBOC降准：医药参与全面反弹"},"2019-04-10":{"body":"On May 5, 2019, Trump announced tariff hikes on USD 200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, restarting trade war fears. SHCOMP fell -12.8%; pharma dropped -20.5%, ranking 25th of 28, underperforming even in a defensive-led tape (defensives -12.0% vs cyclicals -16.7%). The sector's relative underperformance vs defensives (pharma -20.5% vs defensives avg -12.0%) is consistent with persistent VBP earnings uncertainty acting as a sector-specific drag beyond pure risk-off beta. Coal (0.0%), banks (-5.4%), and agriculture (-7.8%) outperformed as safe-haven anchors.","body_zh":"2019年5月5日，特朗普宣布将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%上调至25%，贸易战恐慌再起。上证综指下跌-12.8%；医药生物下跌-20.5%，在28个行业中排名第25，甚至跑输防御主导的行情（防御股-12.0% vs 周期股-16.7%）。医药跑输防御股均值（-20.5% vs -12.0%）与集采盈利不确定性持续压制行业一致——超越单纯风险规避贝塔的行业特定拖累。煤炭（0.0%）、银行（-5.4%）和农林牧渔（-7.8%）作为避险锚点相对抗跌。","drivers":["Trump tariff hike to 25% May-5-2019 on $200bn goods","SHCOMP -12.8% risk-off drawdown","VBP earnings drag persists beyond macro","pharma laggard vs defensives avg by 8.5pp","growth-style derating"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2019年5月5日对2000亿商品加关税至25%","上证综指-12.8%风险规避","集采盈利拖累超越宏观层面","医药跑输防御股均值8.5pp","成长风格估值压缩"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation: sector laggard again","title_zh":"贸易战重新升级：医药再次落后"},"2019-06-06":{"body":"From June 2019 to February 2021, pharma surged +106.5%, ranking 5th of 28, in a growth-style tape (growth +25.7pp; SHCOMP +29.3%). Multiple catalysts layered: the Phase 1 US-China trade deal (January 2020) relieved macro headwinds; PBOC liquidity injections and COVID-19 emergency spending from early 2020 massively benefited domestic drug, vaccine, and CXO companies (WuXi AppTec, WuXi Biologics surged on global outsourcing demand). The STAR Market (launched July 2019) and HK Exchange reforms opened pre-revenue biotech IPOs, triggering a valuation re-rating. Defensives (avg +69.9%) massively outpaced cyclicals (+31.0%), consistent with pharma and food & bev leading a quality/safety-driven rally well above index beta.","body_zh":"2019年6月至2021年2月，医药生物大涨+106.5%，在28个行业中排名第5，成长跑赢价值25.7个百分点，上证综指+29.3%。多重催化剂叠加：第一阶段中美贸易协议（2020年1月）缓解宏观逆风；PBOC持续注流动性以及2020年初新冠疫情的应急支出大力扶持国内制药、疫苗和CXO公司（药明康德、药明生物因全球外包需求而飙升）。科创板（2019年7月开市）和港交所改革打开未盈利生物科技IPO通道，触发估值重估。防御股均值（+69.9%）大幅跑赢周期股（+31.0%），与医药和食品饮料引领质量/安全驱动行情高度吻合，远超指数贝塔。","drivers":["COVID-19 emergency spending surge 2020","CXO WuXi AppTec outsourcing boom","STAR Market biotech IPO reform Jul-2019","Phase 1 US-China trade deal Jan-2020","PBOC liquidity injection + quality safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2020年新冠疫情应急支出激增","CXO药明康德外包繁荣","科创板生物科技IPO改革2019年7月","中美第一阶段贸易协议2020年1月","PBOC流动性注入+质量安全轮动"],"title":"COVID innovation supercycle: vaccine plus CXO plus biotech boom","title_zh":"新冠创新超级周期：疫苗加CXO加生物科技大爆发"},"2021-02-10":{"body":"In February–March 2021, a global bond selloff drove US 10-year Treasury yields from ~1.0% to 1.75% in weeks, triggering a global rotation from long-duration growth to cyclicals/value. Pharma fell -19.0%, ranking 25th of 28, in a value-rotation tape (value +5.4pp over growth; SHCOMP -8.1%). Steel (+15.1%), construction (+7.5%), and utilities (+7.0%) led while pharma, food & bev (-26.1%), and services (-19.6%) lagged. China's high-multiple growth sectors — pharma, power equipment, food & bev — were hardest hit by duration de-rating, consistent with all three appearing as laggards this leg.","body_zh":"2021年2月至3月，全球债券抛售浪潮推动美国10年期国债收益率在数周内从约1.0%飙升至1.75%，引发全球范围内从长久期成长股向周期/价值股的大切换。医药生物下跌-19.0%，在28个行业中排名第25，处于价值跑赢成长5.4个百分点的风格切换行情中，上证综指-8.1%。钢铁（+15.1%）、建筑（+7.5%）和公用事业（+7.0%）领涨，而医药、食品饮料（-26.1%）和服务业（-19.6%）显著落后。中国高估值成长板块——医药、电力设备、食品饮料——受久期估值压缩冲击最大，与三者均处于跑输末位高度吻合。","drivers":["US 10-year yield spike 1.0% to 1.75% Feb-Mar 2021","global growth-to-value rotation","duration de-rating of high-PE sectors","cyclical recovery / reflation narrative","value-style rotation in A-shares"],"drivers_zh":["美国10年期收益率2021年2-3月从1.0%飙至1.75%","全球成长向价值切换","高PE板块久期重估压缩","周期复苏/再通胀叙事","A股价值风格轮动"],"title":"Global bond selloff triggers growth-to-value rotation","title_zh":"全球债券抛售引发成长向价值切换"},"2021-03-09":{"body":"From March to July 2021, pharma recovered +23.7% to rank 2nd of 28 — genuine sector outperformance. The ctx shows growth led value by 7.1pp (SHCOMP +6.8%), with power equipment (+35.9%) and pharma the only two sectors above +20%. The CXO complex (WuXi AppTec, WuXi Biologics, Pharmaron) continued to benefit from global drug R&D outsourcing demand; innovative biotech firms with PD-1 inhibitors and ADCs benefited from NRDL reimbursement negotiations that secured volume. Regulatory crackdown fears on healthcare had not yet materialized, allowing the sector's quality innovation premium to reassert after the Feb–Mar growth selloff.","body_zh":"2021年3月至7月，医药生物上涨+23.7%，在28个行业中排名第2——展现出真实的行业超额收益。成长跑赢价值7.1个百分点（上证综指+6.8%），仅电力设备（+35.9%）和医药涨幅超过20%。CXO板块（药明康德、药明生物、康龙化成）持续受益于全球药企研发外包需求；PD-1抑制剂和ADC等创新生物科技公司受益于医保目录谈判锁定销量。医疗反腐等监管风险尚未落地，医药创新溢价在2-3月成长杀跌后得以重新确立。","drivers":["CXO global R&D outsourcing demand boom","biotech NRDL inclusion volume wins","PD-1 ADC innovation premium re-rating","growth style rebound post-Feb selloff","healthcare regulatory crackdown not yet materialized"],"drivers_zh":["CXO全球研发外包需求繁荣","创新药进入医保目录获量","PD-1/ADC创新溢价重估","2月杀跌后成长风格反弹","医疗监管整治风险尚未兑现"],"title":"Sector rebounds: CXO innovation premium reasserted","title_zh":"板块反弹：CXO创新溢价重新确立"},"2021-07-01":{"body":"From July 2021 to April 2022, pharma fell -37.8%, ranking dead last (31st of 31), far worse than SHCOMP -18.4%. In late July 2021, China's anti-corruption drive explicitly named healthcare as one of the 'three big mountains' of living costs to be tackled; Hengrui fell ~CNY 50bn in market cap in two weeks, and JD Health, Alibaba Health, and CXO names dropped 27–36% in five days. Beijing's sweeping Big Tech crackdown (Didi delisted July 2021, education sector July 2021) created regulatory-fear spillover to healthcare. VBP Round 5 launched and expanded scope toward innovative drugs, threatening higher-margin pipelines. Coal (+11.6%), construction (+0.3%), and utilities (-1.5%) led in a value-dominated tape (value +12.6pp), confirming pharma was a specific regulatory target beyond the broad market.","body_zh":"2021年7月至2022年4月，医药生物下跌-37.8%，在31个行业中排名垫底（第31位），远差于上证综指（-18.4%）。2021年7月底，中国反腐运动明确将医疗列为需整治的'三座大山'之一，恒瑞医药两周内市值蒸发约500亿元，京东健康、阿里健康和CXO股票5天内跌幅27%-36%。大型互联网整治（滴滴2021年7月退市、教育板块同期整治）引发监管恐惧向医疗领域蔓延。第五批带量采购扩围至创新药，威胁高毛利产品线。煤炭（+11.6%）、建筑（+0.3%）和公用事业（-1.5%）领跑，价值跑赢成长12.6个百分点，证实医药受到特定监管打压，而非单纯随大市下跌。","drivers":["anti-corruption three mountains healthcare crackdown Jul-2021","VBP expansion to innovative drugs Round 5","Big Tech regulatory spillover Didi education Jul-2021","Hengrui CNY 50bn market cap destruction","value rotation away from high-multiple pharma"],"drivers_zh":["2021年7月三座大山医疗反腐整治","带量采购第五批扩围至创新药","大型科技整治（滴滴、教育）向医疗蔓延","恒瑞医药市值蒸发500亿元","资金从高估值医药切换至价值板块"],"title":"Regulatory crackdown spills to healthcare; VBP expands","title_zh":"监管整治蔓延至医疗；VBP扩围重创板块"},"2022-04-25":{"body":"The April 2022 trough followed the devastating Shanghai lockdown (March–June 2022), which gutted economic activity and drove SHCOMP to 2022 lows. From April 25 to July 4, SHCOMP surged +16.3% as Shanghai announced a June 1 reopening target and Beijing signaled economic support. Pharma rose +21.1%, ranking 9th of 31, in a cyclical-led, growth-tilted recovery (cyclicals +20.4% vs defensives +14.8%; growth +6.9pp). Power equipment (+51.4%), autos (+42.6%), and metals (+35.5%) led the rebound. Pharma's rank of 9th suggests modest recovery — regulatory and VBP overhangs prevented it from being a primary reopening beneficiary; the primary bid went to pent-up cyclicals and EV-related sectors.","body_zh":"2022年4月的底部伴随着上海封城（3月至6月）所带来的经济重创，A股接近年内低点。4月25日至7月4日，随着上海宣布6月1日目标复工以及北京发出经济支持信号，上证综指大涨+16.3%。医药生物上涨+21.1%，在31个行业中排名第9，周期主导、成长偏向的修复行情（周期股+20.4% vs 防御股+14.8%；成长+6.9pp）。电力设备（+51.4%）、汽车（+42.6%）和有色（+35.5%）引领反弹。医药排名第9反映仅温和修复——监管和集采压制使其无法成为复工复产的主要受益者，增量资金主要流向积压需求的周期类和新能源车板块。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown lift target June-1-2022","Beijing economic support policy signals Apr-2022","cyclical pent-up demand rebound","SHCOMP +16.3% relief rally","power equipment EV auto rotation"],"drivers_zh":["上海2022年6月1日解封目标","北京4月经济支持政策信号","周期积压需求修复","上证综指+16.3%反弹","电力设备/新能源车/汽车轮动"],"title":"Shanghai lockdown trough: reopening bounce lifts pharma","title_zh":"上海封控底部：重开经济带动医药反弹"},"2022-07-04":{"body":"Pharma fell -23.2% from July to September 2022, ranking dead last (31st of 31), as two headwinds converged: the Fed's most aggressive hike cycle since 1994 — 75bp hikes in June, July, and September 2022 — crushed global risk appetite and de-rated high-P/E sectors; simultaneously, VBP Round 7 (covering 60 drugs) delivered average price cuts of ~48%. The ctx shows Conglom +0.7%, Coal -0.2%, Oil & Gas -3.2% as leaders — classic stagflation/commodity safety rotation — while pharma (-23.2%) and building materials (-23.1%) were the worst. The growth-value spread was essentially flat (0.3pp), marking this a sector-specific idiosyncratic selloff layered on top of the rate-shock backdrop.","body_zh":"2022年7月至9月，医药生物下跌-23.2%，在31个行业中排名垫底，两大逆风叠加：美联储实施1994年以来最激进的加息周期（2022年6月、7月、9月各加息75bp），全球风险偏好骤降，高PE板块估值遭到压缩；与此同时，第七批带量采购（覆盖60个品种）平均降价约48%。数据显示综合（+0.7%）、煤炭（-0.2%）和油气（-3.2%）相对抗跌——典型的滞胀/大宗商品避险轮动，而医药（-23.2%）和建材（-23.1%）跌幅居首。成长-价值利差几乎持平（0.3pp），表明本轮更多是行业特定的个性化抛售叠加加息冲击背景，而非纯粹的风格轮动。","drivers":["Fed 75bp rate hike cycle Jun-Jul-Sep 2022","VBP Round 7 avg -48% price cuts 60 drugs","high-PE sector duration derating","stagflation commodity safety rotation","sector-specific double headwind pharma ranked last"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2022年6-9月75bp加息周期","第七批集采60个品种均降48%","高PE板块估值压缩","滞胀/大宗商品避险轮动","医药行业双重特定逆风垫底"],"title":"Global rate shock plus VBP Round 7: pharma worst performer","title_zh":"全球加息冲击加第七批集采：医药跌幅居首"},"2022-09-26":{"body":"From late September 2022 to January 2023, Chinese stocks rallied (SHCOMP +7.0%) on a cascade of zero-COVID exit signals: unverified reports of an exit plan circulated on November 1, official policy pivot was announced November 2022, and full reopening was declared December 26, 2022. Pharma surged +26.0%, ranking 2nd of 31, behind only computers (+27.3%). The sector's specific tailwinds were reopening-driven hospital footfall recovery, drug sales normalization, and a massive spike in demand for antivirals and COVID treatment kits as the country transitioned through the wave. Defensives (avg +10.6%) sharply beat cyclicals (+3.5%), confirming this was a quality/safety rotation into pharma, not a cyclical recovery.","body_zh":"2022年9月底至2023年1月，随清零退出信号持续累积（11月1日网传退出计划、2022年11月官方宣布政策转向、12月26日全面重新开放），A股上涨（上证综指+7.0%）。医药生物大涨+26.0%，在31个行业中排名第2，仅次于计算机（+27.3%）。行业特定顺风包括：重开放驱动医院就诊量回升、药品销售正常化，以及感冒药和新冠检测试剂盒需求随疫情波峰激增。防御股均值（+10.6%）大幅跑赢周期股（+3.5%），与医药在不确定重开放期间获得质量/安全资金流入一致，而非周期复苏驱动。","drivers":["zero-COVID exit policy pivot Nov-2022","full reopening Dec-26-2022 China","hospital footfall drug sales recovery","COVID antiviral treatment demand spike","quality safety defensive rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11月清零退出政策转向","2022年12月26日中国全面重新开放","医院就诊量/药品销售复苏","新冠抗病毒治疗需求激增","防御/质量安全资金流入"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit hope: pharma leads reopening trade","title_zh":"清零退出预期：医药领衔重开放仓"},"2023-01-20":{"body":"From January 2023 to February 2024, pharma fell -33.5%, ranking 21st of 31, as China's post-COVID economic recovery disappointed. The August 2023 anti-corruption campaign swept approximately 52,000 life-science sector investigations and erased USD 9.4bn in pharma market cap within two weeks, hitting hospital procurement chains and sales force practices. VBP continued expanding to biosimilars and medical devices. The macro backdrop — SHCOMP -17.2%, defensives leading cyclicals (-18.8% vs -25.0%), value +6.4pp — confirmed a broad risk-off tape; pharma was dragged further by its own sector headwinds but held up better than cyclicals. Biotech license-out deal volume was building but not yet market-moving.","body_zh":"2023年1月至2024年2月，医药生物下跌-33.5%，在31个行业中排名第21，中国后疫情经济复苏令人失望。2023年8月医疗行业反腐风暴共调查约5.2万人，两周内医药板块市值蒸发约94亿美元，冲击医院采购链和销售行为。集采继续扩围至生物类似药和医疗器械。宏观层面，上证综指-17.2%，防御跑赢周期（-18.8% vs -25.0%），价值+6.4pp，确认大范围风险规避行情；医药受自身行业逆风拖累但相对周期类仍好一些。生物科技对外授权交易量开始积累，但尚未对市场产生决定性影响。","drivers":["post-COVID reopening disappointment macro slowdown","anti-graft 52000 life-science investigations Aug-2023","VBP expansion biosimilars medical devices","SHCOMP -17.2% broad bear market","defensive relative outperformance within down tape"],"drivers_zh":["后疫情重开放复苏失望宏观减速","2023年8月5.2万人医疗反腐调查","集采扩围生物类似药/医疗器械","上证综指-17.2%大熊市","下跌行情中防御股相对周期股抗跌"],"title":"Reopening disappointment and anti-graft sweep crush sector","title_zh":"重开放失望与反腐风暴压制板块"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February to May 2024, the SHCOMP surged +16.7% as the 'national team' (Central Huijin, state funds) aggressively bought ETFs and large-caps to arrest the market decline, while the PBOC cut LPR in February 2024. Pharma rose +21.5%, ranking 14th of 31 — modest but positive. The broader tape was cyclical-led (cyclicals +21.2% vs defensives +14.7%; metals +39.9%, defense +34.1%), consistent with a broad beta recovery rather than pharma-specific re-rating. In parallel, China's biotech license-out deal wave accelerated: 74 deals worth up to USD 42.5bn were signed in 2023 and into 2024, providing a fundamental floor for innovative biotech stocks that partially offset VBP/anti-graft overhangs.","body_zh":"2024年2月至5月，'国家队'（中央汇金、国家主权基金）大举买入ETF和大盘股以稳定市场，PBOC于2024年2月降低LPR，上证综指大涨+16.7%。医药生物上涨+21.5%，在31个行业中排名第14——温和正收益。整体行情以周期主导（周期股+21.2% vs 防御股+14.7%；有色+39.9%、军工+34.1%），与宽基贝塔修复吻合，并非医药的行业特定行情。与此同时，中国生物科技对外授权浪潮提速：2023年至2024年累计签署74笔、总价值425亿美元的协议，为创新生物科技股提供基本面支撑，部分对冲了集采和反腐压制。","drivers":["national team Central Huijin ETF buying Feb-2024","PBOC LPR cut Feb-2024","license-out deal wave 74 deals $42.5bn 2023-2024","broad A-share beta recovery SHCOMP +16.7%","metals defense cycle led rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2024年2月中央汇金国家队大举买入ETF","PBOC 2024年2月降LPR","对外授权浪潮74笔425亿美元（2023-2024）","A股宽基贝塔修复上证综指+16.7%","有色/军工板块引领周期"],"title":"National team rescue plus license-out deal wave","title_zh":"国家队托市加对外授权浪潮带动医药回升"},"2024-05-09":{"body":"From May to September 2024, China's deflationary backdrop deepened (persistent PPI deflation, weak consumer spending) and SHCOMP fell -12.9%. Pharma dropped -23.1%, ranking 26th of 31. Banks (-3.8%) led while pharma ranked near the worst, despite a near-flat growth-value spread (0.5pp), indicating pharma-specific headwinds beyond pure market beta. The anti-graft campaign intensified: 2024 saw 52,000+ life-science investigations. VBP Round 9 was announced covering additional specialties. Pharma, beauty (-30.0%), and food & bev (-28.1%) were the worst laggards — all high-multiple consumer defensives systematically devalued in a deflationary nominal GDP environment.","body_zh":"2024年5月至9月，中国通缩背景加深（PPI持续负增长、消费支出疲弱），上证综指下跌-12.9%。医药生物下跌-23.1%，在31个行业中排名第26。银行（-3.8%）相对抗跌，而医药接近垫底，尽管成长-价值利差几乎持平（0.5pp），暗示存在超越纯指数贝塔的行业特定逆风。医疗反腐持续推进，2024年调查超5.2万人；第九批带量采购宣布覆盖更多专科。医药、美容（-30.0%）和食品饮料（-28.1%）跌幅居前——均属高估值消费防御类，在名义GDP通缩、消费疲软环境下估值遭受系统性压缩。","drivers":["China PPI deflation summer 2024 nominal GDP drag","VBP Round 9 announcement additional specialties","anti-graft 52000+ investigations intensification 2024","high-multiple consumer defensive derating","SHCOMP -12.9% broad down tape"],"drivers_zh":["2024年夏中国PPI通缩名义GDP拖累","第九批带量采购公告覆盖更多专科","2024年医疗反腐5.2万+人调查深化","高估值消费防御股估值压缩","上证综指-12.9%大盘下行"],"title":"Summer deflation and anti-graft overhang drag sector","title_zh":"夏季通缩压制加反腐压制拖累板块"},"2024-09-23":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, the PBOC launched a historic stimulus package: a CNY 500bn swap facility for non-bank equity purchases, a CNY 300bn relending program for share buybacks, and a 50bp RRR cut. A Politburo meeting on September 26 pledged fiscal support and property stabilization. The SHCOMP surged +27.0% in two weeks; pharma rose +39.9%, ranking 7th of 31. Beauty (+58.1%), computers (+49.7%), and brokers (+49.1%) led in a growth-tilted tape (growth +15.1pp). Pharma's 7th-place rank reflects broad index beta participation in the melt-up — the license-out deal wave added fundamental credibility to the bounce but sector-specific re-rating was not the primary driver.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，PBOC推出史无前例的刺激组合：5000亿元非银机构股票互换便利、3000亿元股票回购再贷款，加之50bp降准。9月26日政治局会议承诺财政支持与楼市稳定。上证综指两周内飙涨+27.0%；医药生物上涨+39.9%，在31个行业中排名第7。美容（+58.1%）、计算机（+49.7%）和券商（+49.1%）领跑，成长跑赢价值15.1个百分点。医药排名第7反映更多是宽基指数贝塔在大涨行情中的参与——对外授权浪潮为反弹提供了基本面背书，但行业特定重估并非主因。","drivers":["PBOC CNY 500bn swap facility Sep-24-2024","PBOC 50bp RRR cut Sep-2024","Politburo fiscal property pledge Sep-26-2024","A-share melt-up SHCOMP +27% broad beta","license-out wave fundamental backdrop"],"drivers_zh":["PBOC 2024年9月24日5000亿互换便利","PBOC 2024年9月50bp降准","2024年9月26日政治局财政楼市承诺","A股宽基指数大涨+27%贝塔","对外授权浪潮基本面支撑"],"title":"PBOC bazooka stimulus triggers broad market melt-up","title_zh":"PBOC大规模刺激政策触发全面市场大涨"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"From October 8, 2024 to January 10, 2025, the stimulus euphoria faded as November 2024 fiscal details underwhelmed expectations. SHCOMP fell -9.2%; pharma fell -20.3%, ranking 30th of 31. Conglomerates (+10.1%), retail (+0.6%), and banks (-0.3%) outperformed — classic defensive/value repositioning. The BIOSECURE Act advanced through the US Congress: the Senate passed it in October 2024 and the House in December 2024, creating fresh risk to CXO-linked names; WuXi AppTec and WuXi Biologics had already lost approximately USD 17bn in market cap in prior months on the legislative risk. Pharma's near-worst rank reflects both macro disappointment and the BIOSECURE-specific CXO overhang.","body_zh":"2024年10月8日至2025年1月10日，刺激政策的兴奋情绪消退，11月政治局财政细节远低于市场预期。上证综指下跌-9.2%；医药生物下跌-20.3%，在31个行业中排名第30。综合（+10.1%）、零售（+0.6%）和银行（-0.3%）相对抗跌——典型的防御/价值再配置。BIOSECURE法案在美国国会加速推进（参议院2024年10月通过，众议院2024年12月通过），为CXO相关公司带来新的风险压制；药明康德和药明生物此前已因立法风险蒸发约170亿美元市值。医药接近垫底既反映宏观失望，也体现了BIOSECURE对CXO子板块的特定压制。","drivers":["post-stimulus Nov-2024 fiscal details underwhelm","BIOSECURE Act Senate Oct-2024 House Dec-2024 passage","CXO WuXi AppTec WuXi Biologics $17bn market cap destruction","SHCOMP -9.2% policy disappointment risk-off","defensive value repositioning conglom retail banks led"],"drivers_zh":["2024年11月刺激财政细节不及预期","BIOSECURE法案参议院10月、众议院12月相继通过","CXO药明康德药明生物170亿美元市值蒸发","上证综指-9.2%政策失望风险规避","防御/价值再配置综合零售银行领跑"],"title":"Post-stimulus fade: pharma worst in policy-disappointment selloff","title_zh":"刺激后退潮：政策失望抛售中医药垫底"},"2025-01-10":{"body":"From January 2025 to September 2025, pharma surged +37.8%, ranking 5th of 31, in a growth-dominated tape (growth +19.9pp over value; SHCOMP +20.8%). DeepSeek's January 2025 breakthrough catalyzed renewed confidence in China's innovation capability, directly boosting sentiment toward AI-driven drug discovery. In Q1 2025, Chinese biotech deal value hit 32% of global totals (vs. 21% in 2023–24); H1 2025 saw 64 deals worth USD 68.3bn — a 222% value surge year-on-year. The Hang Seng Biotech Index gained 60%+ in the same window. The BIOSECURE Act (signed December 2025) created uncertainty for CXOs but the overwhelming license-out narrative dominated sector sentiment.","body_zh":"2025年1月至9月，医药生物大涨+37.8%，在31个行业中排名第5，成长主导行情（成长跑赢价值19.9个百分点；上证综指+20.8%）。DeepSeek于2025年1月的技术突破重新点燃市场对中国创新能力的信心，直接提振了AI辅助药物研发板块情绪。2025年一季度，中国生物科技授权交易额占全球的32%（2023-24年为21%）；2025年上半年达成64笔、总价值683亿美元的协议，同比金额猛增222%。港股生物科技指数同期涨幅超60%。BIOSECURE法案（2025年12月签署）对CXO带来不确定性，但对外授权浪潮的整体积极叙事占据主导。","drivers":["DeepSeek AI breakthrough Jan-2025 innovation re-rating","China biotech license-out deals $68.3bn H1-2025 (+222% YoY)","HK biotech index +60% same window","growth style dominance A-shares +19.9pp","AI drug discovery theme valuation re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek 2025年1月AI突破带动创新重估","中国生物科技2025年上半年授权683亿美元（同比+222%）","港股生物科技指数+60%","A股成长风格主导+19.9pp","AI辅助药物研发主题估值重估"],"title":"DeepSeek biotech moment: license-out wave lifts pharma","title_zh":"DeepSeek生物科技时刻：授权浪潮带动医药大涨"},"2025-09-08":{"body":"From September 2025 to June 2026, pharma fell -25.5%, ranking 27th of 31, while Electronics (+96.9%) and Telecoms (+105.4%) dominated in an extreme growth tape (growth +24.7pp over value; SHCOMP +5.2%; cyclicals +6.9% vs defensives -16.1%). This is a pure capital-rotation selloff: the A-share market is broadly positive but ALL defensive sectors are sold as liquidity floods AI/semiconductor themes. Trump's 100% pharmaceutical tariff announcement (September 26, 2025) added sector-specific pressure on CXO and export-oriented pharma names. The BIOSECURE Act signed December 2025 further depressed CXO sentiment. Pharma's -25.5% in a +5.2% SHCOMP environment is entirely explained by the extreme defensive-versus-growth rotation, amplified by the sector-specific tariff and legislative headwinds.","body_zh":"2025年9月至2026年6月，医药生物下跌-25.5%，在31个行业中排名第27，而电子（+96.9%）和通信（+105.4%）在极端成长行情中独占鳌头（成长跑赢价值24.7个百分点；上证综指+5.2%；周期股+6.9% vs 防御股-16.1%）。这是一轮纯粹的资本轮动式抛售：A股大盘正收益，但所有防御类板块均遭抛售，资金洪流涌入AI/半导体主题。特朗普于2025年9月26日宣布对专利药征收100%关税，对CXO和出口导向型医药公司形成行业特定压制。2025年12月签署的BIOSECURE法案进一步压制CXO情绪。医药在上证综指+5.2%背景下下跌-25.5%，完全由极端防御vs成长轮动解释，叠加行业特定的关税与立法逆风。","drivers":["extreme growth AI rotation defensives sold -16.1%","Trump 100% pharma tariff announcement Sep-26-2025","BIOSECURE Act signed Dec-2025","Electronics Telecoms monopolize A-share liquidity +96-105%","SHCOMP +5.2% but all defensives negative"],"drivers_zh":["极端成长/AI轮动抛售防御股-16.1%","特朗普2025年9月26日100%专利药关税公告","BIOSECURE法案2025年12月签署","电子/通信垄断A股流动性+96-105%","上证综指+5.2%但所有防御股负收益"],"title":"Growth rotation crushes pharma; AI monopolizes capital","title_zh":"成长轮动碾压医药；AI垄断资金"}},"now":"China Pharma & Biotech (SW 801150) is in a bottoming/trough phase as of late June 2026, down -15.9% over the current window and ranked 21st of 31 Shenwan industries. The tape is a pure growth-rotation tape: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) are dominant leaders, SHCOMP is modestly positive (+1.6%), and cyclicals (+0.3%) are beating defensives (-12.1%) by 12.4pp while growth outperforms value by 18.2pp. Pharma is being abandoned in this AI/tech-driven liquidity rally — it is a defensive, earnings-yield sector with no momentum, while capital floods into semiconductor and telecoms themes. The sector is near the low of its cycle position (pos 1.2/100, rs_rank 18/31), below its 200-day moving average, but its 68.3% historical win rate at this trough phase suggests mean-reversion odds are building. A turn requires either a shift from growth/tech leadership back to defensives, or a fresh domestic policy signal (e.g., VBP easing, NHIS expansion, innovation incentives), neither of which is yet visible in the cross-asset rotation.","now_zh":"中国医药生物（申万801150）截至2026年6月底处于底部筑底阶段，本轮下跌-15.9%，在申万31个一级行业中排名第21。当前市场是纯粹的成长股行情：电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）领涨，上证综指仅小涨1.6%，周期股（+0.3%）跑赢防御股（-12.1%）达12.4个百分点，成长风格跑赢价值18.2个百分点。在AI/科技主题驱动的流动性行情中，医药板块遭到市场抛弃——其作为防御性、盈利收益率型行业，缺乏动量，而资金持续涌入半导体与通信主题。板块周期位置极低（1.2/100），相对强度排名18/31，股价位于200日均线下方，但历史胜率68.3%显示均值回归的胜算正在积累。行情反转的近期催化剂需等待市场风格从成长/科技切换回防御，或出现新一轮国内政策信号（如VBP松绑、医保扩目录、创新基金），目前跨资产轮动中均未显现。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801160":{"legs":{"2012-12-03":{"body":"From December 2012, the PBOC executed successive RRR and benchmark lending rate cuts — six rate cuts between November 2014 and June 2015 alone — flooding the system with liquidity as Xi Jinping framed the capital market as a vehicle for SOE reform, spawning the reform bull. Margin financing balances exploded from under CNY 300bn in mid-2014 to over CNY 2.2trn by June 2015, lifting every sector. Utilities rose 259% over the full leg, a mid-table beta ride (rank 11/28): regulated earnings and state backing gave stability, but cyclicals averaged +210% and growth sectors far outpaced (Light Mfg +384%, Electronics +377%), consistent with SHCOMP surging +164% in a broad liquidity-driven wave.","body_zh":"2012年12月起，央行多次下调存款准备金率及基准贷款利率（仅2014年11月至2015年6月就连续六次降息），系统流动性泛滥。习近平将资本市场定位为国企改革工具，催生改革牛行情。融资余额从2014年中不足3000亿元飙升至2015年6月逾2.2万亿元，拉动各行业普涨。公用事业全程上涨259%，属中等贝塔行情（排名11/28）：受监管收益与国资背景带来稳定性，但周期类平均+210%、轻工+384%、电子+377%均远超其表现，与上证综指+164%的宽流动性驱动行情相符。","drivers":["PBOC multi-round rate/RRR easing","margin leverage expansion","SOE reform narrative","broad SHCOMP beta lift","growth/cyclical leadership"],"drivers_zh":["央行多轮降息降准","融资杠杆膨胀","国企改革叙事","上证综指全面贝塔上行","成长/周期风格领涨"],"title":"Reform bull and PBOC easing lift all sectors","title_zh":"改革牛+央行宽松推动全面上涨"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On 12 June 2015 the CSRC published draft rules capping brokerage margin lending at four times net capital and reiterating curbs on shadow-margin (umbrella trust) accounts, triggering forced liquidations across the CNY 2.2trn margin book. The SHCOMP lost 32% in roughly seven weeks, wiping out over USD 3trn in market value. Utilities fell 38.5% but ranked 7th of 28 — a genuine relative refuge as defensives averaged -30.4% versus cyclicals -43.0%; coal shed -59%, defense -52%. The relative outperformance reflects flight-to-safety into regulated, dividend-paying SOEs as the leveraged retail pool unwound.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会公布草案，将券商融资规模上限设为净资本的四倍，并重申整治伞形信托等场外配资，触发逾2.2万亿元融资盘被迫平仓。上证综指约七周内下跌32%，蒸发逾3万亿美元市值。公用事业下跌38.5%，但在28个行业中排名第7，是相对避风港——防御类平均-30.4%，周期类平均-43.0%，煤炭-59%，国防-52%。相对抗跌反映了杠杆零售资金去化过程中市场向受监管、高股息国有企业的避险轮动。","drivers":["CSRC margin/shadow-lending crackdown","forced deleveraging cascade","SHCOMP crash -32%","flight-to-safety into SOE defensives","retail panic selling"],"drivers_zh":["证监会配资整治","强制去杠杆连锁踩踏","上证综指暴跌-32%","避险资金涌入国有防御股","散户恐慌抛售"],"title":"Margin collapse wipes out A-shares in weeks","title_zh":"杠杆崩溃，A股数周暴跌"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"On 8 July 2015, Beijing launched a massive rescue: the PBOC cut rates and injected liquidity, China Securities Finance was capitalised to buy equities, and the CSRC halted IPOs and suspended short-selling. SHCOMP bounced +14% in six weeks. Coal surged +104% and Defense +78% from extreme oversold levels, while Utilities gained only +35% (rank 7/28). The rotation pattern — cyclicals averaging +37% vs defensives +17% — reflects a risk-on mean-reversion snap back from the crash lows, not a utility-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2015年7月8日，北京启动大规模救市：央行降准降息并注入流动性，中国证券金融公司获注资入市购股，证监会暂停IPO并叫停卖空。上证综指六周内反弹+14%。煤炭从超卖低位暴涨+104%，国防+78%，而公用事业仅上涨+35%（排名7/28）。周期类平均+37%、防御类+17%的轮动结构，反映的是崩盘低点后的风险偏好回摆，而非公用事业自身的催化剂驱动。","drivers":["state equity rescue (CSF/PBOC)","CSRC IPO halt and short-sale ban","mean-reversion from crash lows","risk-on cyclical snap-back","SHCOMP +14% beta"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市（证金/央行）","证监会暂停IPO及禁止卖空","崩盘低位均值回归","风险偏好回摆带动周期反弹","上证综指+14%贝塔"],"title":"State rescue rebound; cyclicals outrun defensives","title_zh":"国家队救市反弹，周期股领跑防御股"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On 11 August 2015, the PBOC surprised markets by cutting the yuan's central parity rate by 1.9%, the largest single-day drop in two decades, and signalled a shift to a more market-determined exchange rate. Global risk assets sold off sharply and SHCOMP fell another -25% by 15 September 2015. Utilities dropped -30% (rank 11/28), a mid-table result: defensives averaged -21% versus cyclicals -33%. Banks (-4%) and Food & Bev (-21%) were the relative havens, while Agriculture (-35%), Defense (-43%), and Coal (-46%) bore the brunt, reflecting a sharp derisking rather than any sector-specific utility deterioration.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行出人意料地将人民币中间价下调1.9%（二十年来最大单日跌幅），并宣告转向更市场化的汇率机制。全球风险资产急剧抛售，上证综指至9月15日再跌-25%。公用事业下跌-30%（排名11/28），属中等表现：防御类平均-21%，周期类-33%。银行（-4%）与食品饮料（-21%）为相对避风港，农业（-35%）、国防（-43%）、煤炭（-46%）跌幅最深，反映全面去风险而非公用事业自身基本面恶化。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock Aug 2015","global risk-off contagion","SHCOMP secondary crash -25%","flight-to-safety; Banks led","cyclical/commodity sector hit hardest"],"drivers_zh":["2015年8月人民币贬值冲击","全球风险规避蔓延","上证综指二次下跌-25%","避险资金涌入银行等防御股","周期/大宗商品板块跌幅最深"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock and global risk-off selloff","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击引发全球风险规避抛售"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After the second crash leg bottomed in mid-September, markets stabilized as the PBOC injected further liquidity and policymakers signalled fiscal support. SHCOMP bounced +21% into late November 2015. Computers (+65%) and Electronics (+54%) led — a growth and tech rotation — while Utilities gained +24% (rank 23/28), well below cyclicals (+33%) and even the broad market. The underperformance reflects that in a stabilization/risk-on snap-back, Utilities' defensive premium disappears and growth sectors capture the relief rally.","body_zh":"第二轮下跌于9月中旬见底后，央行持续注入流动性，政策面释放财政支持信号，市场趋稳。上证综指至11月下旬反弹+21%。计算机（+65%）与电子（+54%）领涨，呈现成长/科技轮动特征，而公用事业仅上涨+24%（排名23/28），远低于周期类（+33%）及大盘整体表现。跑输局面反映了在企稳/风险偏好反弹阶段，防御溢价消失，成长板块主导修复行情。","drivers":["PBOC liquidity injection","fiscal support signals","post-crash relief rally","growth/tech sector leadership","defensive premium eroded"],"drivers_zh":["央行持续注入流动性","财政支持信号","崩盘后的修复行情","成长/科技板块领涨","防御溢价消退"],"title":"Post-devaluation stability bounce; growth leads","title_zh":"贬值冲击后企稳反弹，成长股引领"},"2015-11-25":{"body":"China introduced its circuit-breaker mechanism on 4 January 2016 and halted trading twice in the first week as the PBOC set the CNY fix lower, stoking fears of a currency crisis. The mechanism was suspended from 8 January after accelerating panic selling. SHCOMP dropped -27% from the November 2015 peak to the late-January 2016 trough. Utilities fell -33% (rank 22/28), underperforming even defensives (-24%) — an unusually poor relative showing — as retail and institutional sellers dumped everything to raise cash, with Banks (-15%) and Food & Bev (-20%) providing relative shelter while Computers (-36%) and Defense (-39%) led losses.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日中国引入熔断机制，首周即两度触发停盘，同期央行将人民币中间价下调，引发货币危机恐慌。受加速恐慌抛售影响，熔断机制自1月8日起暂停。上证综指从2015年11月峰值跌至1月下旬低点共下跌-27%。公用事业下跌-33%（排名22/28），甚至跑输防御类平均（-24%），呈现罕见的相对弱势——散户与机构争相套现，银行（-15%）、食品饮料（-20%）相对抗跌，计算机（-36%）、国防（-39%）跌幅居前。","drivers":["circuit-breaker mechanism panic","CNY depreciation pressure Jan 2016","SHCOMP -27% crash","retail/institutional mass liquidation","defensives provided relative cover"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制引发踩踏","2016年1月人民币贬值压力","上证综指-27%暴跌","散户与机构大规模套现","防御股相对抗跌"],"title":"Circuit breaker crash and CNY stress reopen selloff","title_zh":"熔断机制引发踩踏，人民币压力再度引爆抛售"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"From January 2016, Xi Jinping's supply-side structural reform program (cutting steel/coal excess capacity, eliminating zombie firms) drove commodity prices higher and powered a sustained value and infrastructure rotation. Building Materials (+66%) and Construction (+56%) led, and Food & Bev (+52%) confirmed a quality/value tilt (growth/value spread: -16pp in favour of value). SHCOMP rose +23% to the April 2017 peak. Utilities gained +28% (rank 14/28) — an in-line result benefiting from lower interest rates and stable regulated returns for state power utilities, while extreme growth sectors (Computers +4%, Media -9%) lagged.","body_zh":"2016年1月起，习近平推行供给侧结构性改革（压减钢铁/煤炭过剩产能、出清僵尸企业），大宗商品价格回升，市场呈现持续的价值和基建轮动。建材（+66%）与建筑（+56%）领涨，食品饮料（+52%）印证质量/价值风格（成长/价值利差-16pp，价值占优）。上证综指至2017年4月峰值上涨+23%。公用事业上涨+28%（排名14/28），属中等表现——受益于低利率环境及国有电力企业的稳定监管回报，而计算机（+4%）、传媒（-9%）等极端成长板块落后。","drivers":["supply-side structural reform","lower interest rate environment","commodity price recovery","value/infrastructure rotation","stable regulated utility earnings"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革","低利率环境","大宗商品价格回升","价值/基建风格轮动","公用事业监管收益稳定"],"title":"Supply-side reform and value rotation; infrastructure boost","title_zh":"供给侧改革+价值轮动，基建推升行情"},"2017-04-13":{"body":"From April 2017, China's financial deleveraging campaign tightened wealth management products and off-balance-sheet credit, raising effective funding costs for capital-intensive utilities. Then from March 2018, US-China trade tariff escalation — 25% tariffs on USD 50bn of goods in July 2018 — slammed risk sentiment and SHCOMP fell -24% to the October 2018 trough. Utilities dropped -45% (rank 21/28), underperforming but better than Media (-53%) and Conglom (-59%); defensives (-14%) held far better than cyclicals (-34%), consistent with flight-to-safety into Banks and Coal. The sector's high capital costs under deleveraging and sensitivity to broader risk-off drove the extended 18-month drawdown.","body_zh":"2017年4月起，中国金融去杠杆收紧理财产品和表外信贷，推高了资本密集型公用事业的实际融资成本。2018年3月起，中美贸易摩擦升级——2018年7月对500亿美元商品加征25%关税——重创风险情绪，上证综指至2018年10月低点下跌-24%。公用事业下跌-45%（排名21/28），跑输但优于传媒（-53%）和综合（-59%）；防御类（-14%）远优于周期类（-34%），符合资金避险涌向银行和煤炭的逻辑。去杠杆下的高融资成本叠加整体风险规避情绪，共同导致长达18个月的持续下跌。","drivers":["financial deleveraging campaign","US-China trade war tariffs 2018","SHCOMP -24% bear market","funding cost pressure on capital-intensive SOEs","flight-to-safety; defensives led"],"drivers_zh":["金融去杠杆运动","中美贸易战关税2018","上证综指-24%熊市","资本密集型国企融资成本上升","避险资金涌入，防御股相对抗跌"],"title":"Deleveraging, trade war, and financial tightening crush sector","title_zh":"去杠杆+贸易战+金融收紧重创板块"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"From October 2018, the PBOC signalled a policy pivot: multiple RRR cuts (100bp in January 2019) and liquidity injections eased credit conditions. On 25 February 2019, after the US postponed the scheduled 1 March tariff escalation, all three A-share indexes rallied over 5% on the day. SHCOMP rose +31% to April 2019. Utilities gained only +31% (rank 24/28), the worst relative showing in any up-leg: growth (Agriculture +75%, Telecoms +64%) and momentum themes dominated sharply as the market repriced risk-on beta, leaving low-beta utilities behind in a pure risk-appetite recovery.","body_zh":"2018年10月起，央行释放政策转向信号：多次下调存款准备金率（2019年1月累计降准100bp）并注入流动性，信用环境趋于宽松。2019年2月25日，美国推迟原定3月1日生效的加征关税，当日三大A股指数均涨逾5%。上证综指至2019年4月上涨+31%。公用事业仅上涨+31%（排名24/28），在所有上行腿中相对表现最差：农业（+75%）、通信（+64%）等成长动量主题强势主导，市场全面重估风险偏好，低贝塔的公用事业被远远抛在后面。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts and liquidity pivot","US-China trade truce Feb 2019","risk-appetite recovery","growth/momentum sector leadership","low-beta defensive lagged"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准及流动性转向","中美贸易战休战2019年2月","风险偏好修复","成长/动量板块主导","低贝塔防御股跑输"],"title":"PBOC pivot and trade truce fuel relief rally","title_zh":"央行转向+贸易休战推动修复行情"},"2019-04-17":{"body":"From April 2019, trade negotiations broke down — on 10 May 2019 the US raised tariffs on USD 200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25% — and SHCOMP retreated. Then in December 2019 COVID-19 emerged in Wuhan; by early February 2020 panic about economic disruption hit markets hard. SHCOMP fell -16% over the full period. Utilities dropped -24% (rank 23/28), again underperforming despite a risk-off backdrop, because the highest relative performers were Electronics (+23%) and Pharma (+2%) — COVID-resilient growth themes — while classic defensives (Food & Bev flat, Banks flat) held but did not outperform. The sector's underperformance also reflected COVID's direct operational impact on power demand.","body_zh":"2019年4月起贸易谈判破裂——2019年5月10日美国将对2000亿美元中国商品的关税从10%提至25%——上证综指随之回落。2019年12月新冠疫情在武汉暴发，2020年2月初市场对经济冲击的恐慌情绪急剧升温。上证综指全程下跌-16%。公用事业下跌-24%（排名23/28），在风险规避背景下仍跑输——因相对领跑的是电子（+23%）和医药（+2%）等抗疫成长主题，而传统防御股（食品饮料持平、银行持平）虽稳健但未能超额。公用事业跑输还受疫情对电力需求的直接冲击拖累。","drivers":["US tariff re-escalation May 2019","COVID-19 outbreak Wuhan Dec 2019","SHCOMP -16% risk-off","power demand collapse (lockdowns)","COVID-resilient tech/pharma led"],"drivers_zh":["美国关税再升级2019年5月","新冠疫情武汉暴发2019年12月","上证综指-16%风险规避","封控导致电力需求骤降","抗疫科技/医药板块领跑"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation and COVID shock selloff","title_zh":"贸易战再升级叠加新冠冲击，引发持续下跌"},"2020-02-03":{"body":"From February 2020, PBOC easing and fiscal stimulus powered a post-COVID recovery. The structural driver arrived on 22 September 2020 when Xi Jinping announced China's dual carbon pledge at the UN (peak emissions before 2030, neutrality before 2060), triggering massive investment in renewable power infrastructure. The 14th Five-Year Plan (March 2021) underpinned 1,200 GW wind/solar targets. Power Equipment surged +177% over the leg, Metals +133%, Chemicals +126% as the green-capex supercycle lifted adjacent sectors. Utilities rose +53% (rank 10/28) — an in-line result: hydropower and nuclear benefited from green mandates, but Power Equipment (capex-driven) far outpaced regulated utilities. SHCOMP rose +33%.","body_zh":"2020年2月起，央行宽松与财政刺激推动后疫情经济复苏。2020年9月22日，习近平在联合国宣布中国双碳目标（2030年前碳达峰、2060年前碳中和），触发可再生能源基础设施的大规模投资浪潮，成为贯穿本腿的结构性主线。2021年3月发布的十四五规划支撑风光装机1200GW目标。电力设备全程暴涨+177%，金属+133%，化工+126%，绿色资本开支超级周期拉动相关板块。公用事业上涨+53%（排名10/28），属中等表现：水电与核电受益于绿色政策，但资本开支驱动的电力设备远超受监管的公用事业。上证综指+33%。","drivers":["dual carbon pledge Sep 2020","14th Five-Year Plan green targets","renewable energy capex supercycle","PBOC/fiscal post-COVID stimulus","green infrastructure investment boom"],"drivers_zh":["2020年9月双碳目标宣布","十四五绿色能源装机目标","可再生能源资本开支超级周期","央行/财政后疫情刺激","绿色基础设施投资热潮"],"title":"Dual carbon pledge and green power infrastructure boom","title_zh":"双碳目标+绿色电力基建热潮推动上行"},"2021-09-23":{"body":"From September 2021, a perfect storm hit Utilities: (1) China's 2021 energy crisis — record-high coal prices versus regulated electricity tariffs destroyed margins for coal-fired generators, forcing rationing across 20+ provinces; (2) the October 2021 power pricing reform (allowing tariffs to float up to 20% above benchmark, from 10% prior) eased the coal-power squeeze but introduced earnings uncertainty; (3) the broader Evergrande property crisis and common prosperity regulatory wave crushed risk sentiment — SHCOMP fell -21% to the April 2022 trough. Utilities dropped -25% (rank 19/31), a mid-table defensive result: Coal (+7%) was paradoxically the lone gainer as the commodity itself surged, while growth sectors (Electronics -36%, Defense -37%) bore the brunt.","body_zh":"2021年9月起，公用事业遭遇多重冲击：（1）2021年能源危机——煤价创历史新高而电价受监管固定，导致火电企业利润空间被严重压缩，全国20多个省份相继出现缺电限电；（2）2021年10月电价改革（允许电价在基准价上浮至20%，此前为10%）缓解了煤电矛盾，但引入盈利不确定性；（3）恒大地产危机与共同富裕监管浪潮重创市场情绪，上证综指至2022年4月低点下跌-21%。公用事业下跌-25%（排名19/31），属中等防御表现：煤炭（+7%）因自身商品价格暴涨而逆势上行，而成长板块（电子-36%、国防-37%）跌幅居前。","drivers":["2021 coal price spike vs regulated tariff squeeze","China power shortage in 20+ provinces","Oct 2021 power price reform","Evergrande/property crisis risk-off","common prosperity regulatory wave"],"drivers_zh":["2021年煤价暴涨vs电价监管剪刀差","全国20多省拉闸限电","2021年10月电价市场化改革","恒大/地产危机风险规避","共同富裕监管浪潮"],"title":"Power price reform shock and regulatory wave selloff","title_zh":"电价改革冲击+监管浪潮引发下跌"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Shanghai's two-month COVID lockdown ended in late May/June 2022, triggering a sharp relief rally across A-shares from the late-April trough. Power Equipment (+61%) and Autos (+49%) led — the green tech capex trade resumed — and Utilities rose +26% (rank 10/31) in line. SHCOMP bounced +14% to the August 2022 peak. Utilities benefited from two tailwinds: (1) the reopening lifted electricity consumption expectations, and (2) analysts expected delayed government renewable subsidies to be paid out, boosting cash flow estimates for wind/solar power producers. Notably, Banks (-11%) and Real Estate (-3%) lagged, as the property crisis continued to drag on credit-linked defensives.","body_zh":"上海长达两个月的封控于2022年5月底/6月解除，带动A股从4月下旬低点展开强劲修复行情。电力设备（+61%）与汽车（+49%）领涨——绿色科技资本开支主题回归——公用事业上涨+26%（排名10/31），属中等表现。上证综指至2022年8月峰值反弹+14%。公用事业受益于双重驱动：（1）复工复产提振用电需求预期；（2）市场预期拖欠的新能源补贴即将到位，推升风光发电企业现金流预测。值得注意的是，银行（-11%）与房地产（-3%）落后，地产危机持续拖累信用敏感型防御股。","drivers":["Shanghai COVID lockdown end May 2022","electricity consumption rebound expectations","renewable subsidy catch-up expectations","green capex/EV cycle resumption","Power Equipment sector leading"],"drivers_zh":["2022年5月上海解封","用电需求复苏预期","新能源补贴补发预期","绿色资本开支/新能源车周期重启","电力设备板块领涨"],"title":"Shanghai lockdown end and green capex rebound rally","title_zh":"上海解封+绿色资本开支反弹推动回升"},"2022-08-23":{"body":"From August 2022, China's bear market resumed as the post-lockdown recovery disappointed, the property sector crisis deepened (Evergrande missed restructuring deadlines, homebuyer mortgage boycotts spread in mid-2022), and deflationary pressures built. SHCOMP fell -18% over 18 months to February 2024. Utilities dropped -19% (rank 8/31) — a slight defensive outperformance: defensives averaged -17% versus cyclicals -30%. Power Equipment crashed -57% as the green capex bubble deflated and overcapacity concerns mounted; Banks +3% were the lone haven. Foreign capital exited Chinese equities en masse through 2023 as the post-COVID boom failed to materialize.","body_zh":"2022年8月起，中国熊市延续——解封后经济复苏令人失望，地产危机持续恶化（恒大多次错过重组截止日期，2022年中期停贷潮蔓延），通缩压力积聚。上证综指至2024年2月累计下跌-18%，历时18个月。公用事业下跌-19%（排名8/31），略具防御性：防御类平均-17%，周期类-30%。电力设备暴跌-57%，绿色资本开支泡沫破裂、产能过剩隐忧浮现；银行+3%成为唯一的避风港。外资在2023年全年大规模撤离A股，后疫情经济反弹预期落空。","drivers":["post-rebound property crisis deepening","deflationary demand weakness","SHCOMP -18% extended bear","foreign capital outflows 2023","green capex bubble deflation (Power Eqp -57%)"],"drivers_zh":["反弹后地产危机持续恶化","通缩需求疲软","上证综指-18%延续熊市","2023年外资大规模撤离","绿色资本开支泡沫破裂（电力设备-57%）"],"title":"Post-rebound bear; property crisis and deflation drag","title_zh":"反弹后熊市延续，地产危机与通缩拖累"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"In February 2024, Central Huijin announced it would resolutely ramp ETF purchases to stabilise markets, injecting roughly CNY 300bn into CSI 300 ETFs in Q1 2024 alone; broader policy-driven flows exceeded CNY 410bn through 2024. A larger pivot came on 24 September 2024 when the PBOC, CSRC, and NFRA jointly announced sweeping stimulus (rate cuts, property support, CNY 800bn equity-support facilities, a studied stabilisation fund), lifting SHCOMP +50% to mid-2026. Utilities gained +41% (rank 14/31), a mid-table defensive result lagging cyclicals (+57%) and growth (Telecoms +344%, Electronics +245%), but benefiting from an emerging AI power demand narrative as data-centre buildout boosted long-run electricity demand projections. Utilities also served as a bond-yield alternative as 10-year CGB yields fell below 2%.","body_zh":"2024年2月，中央汇金宣布坚决增持ETF以维护市场稳定，仅2024年一季度便向沪深300ETF注入约3000亿元，至年内政策驱动资金累计流入逾4100亿元。更大的政策转折发生于2024年9月24日——央行、证监会、金融监管总局联合宣布一揽子刺激政策（降息、地产支持、8000亿元股市支持工具、研究设立平准基金），推动上证综指至2026年中累计上涨+50%。公用事业上涨+41%（排名14/31），属中等防御表现，落后于周期类（+57%）和成长板块（通信+344%、电子+245%），但受益于AI电力需求的叙事重估——数据中心扩张推升了长期用电需求预测。在10年期国债收益率跌破2%的背景下，公用事业兼具债券替代品属性。","drivers":["Central Huijin/national team ETF buying Feb 2024","Sep 2024 PBOC/CSRC joint stimulus package","AI data centre power demand re-rating","10Y CGB yield below 2% bond substitute","SHCOMP +50% broad beta lift"],"drivers_zh":["2024年2月中央汇金/国家队增持ETF","2024年9月央行/证监会联合刺激政策","AI数据中心电力需求重估","10年期国债收益率跌破2%充当债券替代品","上证综指+50%全面贝塔上行"],"title":"National team rescue and AI power demand re-rating","title_zh":"国家队救市+AI电力需求重估驱动上行"}},"now":"China Utilities (Shenwan 801160) is currently in a Bottoming/Trough phase, sitting at the 28.4th percentile of its historical range and below its 200-day moving average. The sector has returned -0.7% in the current window, ranking 11th of 31 Shenwan industries, confirming defensive fatigue. The live tape is a sharp risk-on, growth-dominated regime: Electronics leads at +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, while defensives average -12.1% versus cyclicals at +0.3%. SHCOMP is only +1.6%, meaning this is a liquidity/theme rally not broad beta, with the growth/value spread blown out to +18.2pp. Utilities is a drag asset in this environment; institutional capital is rotating into AI hardware and telecom themes, and no near-term macro catalyst (rate cut, infrastructure stimulus, or power-demand re-rating) is visibly reversing the defensive underperformance.","now_zh":"公用事业（申万801160）当前处于筑底/低谷阶段，位于历史区间第28.4百分位，价格位于200日均线下方。本窗口期内收益率-0.7%，在31个申万行业中排名第11，印证了防御板块的疲态。当前市场为典型的风险偏好上行、成长风格主导格局：电子领涨+75.5%，通信+67.7%，而防御类平均-12.1%，周期类仅+0.3%。上证综指仅+1.6%，说明本轮上涨是流动性/主题驱动而非全面贝塔行情，成长/价值利差高达+18.2个百分点。在此环境下，公用事业沦为拖累资产，机构资金追逐AI硬件与通信主题，短期内缺乏利率下行、基建刺激或电力需求重估等能逆转防御跑输局面的催化剂。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801170":{"legs":{"2012-11-29":{"body":"The 18th Party Congress (November 8-14, 2012) installed Xi Jinping as General Secretary, and the NDRC had already approved over 1 trillion yuan of infrastructure projects in September 2012, restarting a capital expenditure pipeline that directly benefits transport operators. SHCOMP surged 23.3% as cyclicals outperformed defensives (+24.9% vs +19.7%), and Transportation gained +24.3%, ranking 10th of 16, in line with broad index beta. The political transition reset market expectations for state-led infrastructure demand, benefiting railways, airlines, and port stocks at the trough of a multi-year bear market.","body_zh":"2012年11月8-14日，中共十八大召开，习近平出任总书记。此前国家发改委已于9月批复逾1万亿元基础设施项目，直接重启交通运输产业链需求。上证综指大涨23.3%，周期板块普遍跑赢防御（+24.9% vs +19.7%），交通运输上涨24.3%，与市场贝塔走势基本一致（16个行业中排名第10）。政权交接重燃市场对国家主导基建需求的预期，铁路、航空、港口类股票在多年熊市的底部迎来估值修复。","drivers":["leadership-transition sentiment","NDRC infrastructure pipeline","cyclical beta rally","multi-year bear-market trough"],"drivers_zh":["领导层换届预期","国家发改委基建项目批复","周期板块贝塔反弹","多年熊市底部修复"],"title":"Xi Transition Rally, Infrastructure Re-rating","title_zh":"十八大权力交接，基建预期重燃"},"2013-02-18":{"body":"China's interbank market seized in mid-June 2013 when the PBOC deliberately withheld liquidity to curb shadow-banking excess: overnight SHIBOR spiked from roughly 3% to a peak of 30% on June 20, 2013, triggering a panic that cascaded into equities. SHCOMP fell -19.1%, with cyclicals crushed (-22.5%) versus defensives (-2.6%) in a clear flight-to-safety rotation; Transportation fell -22.4%, ranking 14th of 16, amplified by its high beta to credit-sensitive freight volumes. The growth-led style rotation (growth outperformed value by +34pp) further punished capital-heavy, low-margin transport operators.","body_zh":"2013年6月中旬，央行为遏制影子银行过度扩张主动收紧流动性，隔夜SHIBOR从约3%飙升至6月20日的30%历史峰值，引发市场恐慌并传导至股市。上证综指下跌19.1%，周期板块遭受重创（-22.5%），防御板块相对抗跌（-2.6%），呈现明显的避险轮动特征；交通运输下跌22.4%，在16个行业中排名第14，其对信贷敏感型货运量的高弹性进一步放大了跌幅。成长风格大幅跑赢价值（+34pp），对资产重、利润率低的运输子板块形成额外压制。","drivers":["PBOC SHIBOR shock","shadow-banking crackdown","flight-to-safety rotation","credit-sensitive freight slowdown"],"drivers_zh":["央行SHIBOR冲击","影子银行整治","避险轮动","信贷敏感型货运量下滑"],"title":"PBOC Liquidity Shock, Cyclical Rout","title_zh":"央行SHIBOR冲击，周期股全面溃败"},"2013-07-08":{"body":"From July 2013 to June 2015, China's A-share market experienced its most extreme leveraged bull run: SHCOMP rose 158.5% as margin balances swelled from roughly 400 billion to 2.2 trillion yuan. Transportation was the single top-ranked Shenwan industry at +321.2%, driven by three concurrent forces: (1) the March 2013 dismantling of the Ministry of Railways into China Railway Corporation unleashed privatization and valuation re-rating expectations; (2) record rail investment near 100 billion USD annually in 2014-2015 boosted earnings expectations for rail and airport operators; (3) the leverage-fueled speculative rotation into mid-cap cyclicals vastly outstripped index returns, with Transport doubling the SHCOMP gain.","body_zh":"2013年7月至2015年6月，中国A股市场经历了史上最极端的杠杆牛市：上证综指大涨158.5%，融资融券余额从约4000亿元膨胀至2.2万亿元。交通运输以+321.2%的涨幅高居申万行业榜首，三大逻辑共振驱动：（1）2013年3月铁道部撤销、中国铁路总公司成立，释放改制与估值重估预期；（2）2014-2015年铁路年投资额接近1000亿美元，大幅推升铁路及机场运营商的盈利预期；（3）杠杆资金推动的投机性轮动大幅放大中盘周期股涨幅，交通运输涨幅近乎为指数涨幅的两倍。","drivers":["leveraged margin bubble","Ministry of Railways dismantlement","record rail capex cycle","mid-cap cyclical speculative rotation"],"drivers_zh":["杠杆融资泡沫","铁道部撤销改制","铁路投资创历史纪录","中盘周期股投机性轮动"],"title":"Mega Bull: Leverage, Rail Reform, A-share Mania","title_zh":"杠杆大牛：融资扩张、铁路改革、A股狂热"},"2015-06-15":{"body":"The June 2015 CSRC crackdown on shadow-margin accounts triggered forced deleveraging at scale: SHCOMP lost 30.7% in three weeks, with cyclicals (-42.6%) far underperforming defensives (-28.9%) as banks and financials relatively held up. Transportation fell -40.1%, ranking 13th of 28, as high-beta cyclical stocks with inflated leverage suffered the sharpest fire sales. The CSRC began restricting off-exchange margin lending in early June 2015, and the ensuing liquidation cascade hit transportation stocks which had quadrupled since 2013 with extreme severity.","body_zh":"2015年6月证监会开始清查场外配资，触发大规模强制去杠杆：上证综指三周内暴跌30.7%，周期板块（-42.6%）大幅跑输防御板块（-28.9%），银行等金融股相对抗跌。交通运输下跌40.1%，在28个行业中排名第13，高弹性周期股因杠杆比率偏高遭遇最惨烈的踩踏式抛售。2015年6月初证监会限制场外配资，随后引发的清算连锁反应对自2013年以来已累计上涨超3倍的交通运输板块造成极为严重的冲击。","drivers":["margin deleveraging cascade","CSRC shadow-margin crackdown","high-beta cyclical selloff","post-bubble valuation collapse"],"drivers_zh":["杠杆强制平仓","证监会清查场外配资","高弹性周期股踩踏","泡沫后估值坍塌"],"title":"Margin Crash: Leverage Unwind, Mass Selloff","title_zh":"杠杆崩盘：强制去杠杆，市场踩踏"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"From July 8 to August 17, 2015, the government's emergency stabilization package triggered a sharp short-covering rally: the China Securities Finance Corporation directed 21 brokers to buy blue-chip stocks, the CSRC suspended IPOs, and state-owned enterprises were barred from selling. SHCOMP recovered 13.9%; cyclicals led defensives (+37.1% vs +16.8%), and Transportation gained +32.8%, ranking 8th of 28, in line with the broad cyclical rebound. Coal and Defense led as the most beaten-down commodity and defense stocks were targeted for national-team buying, with no sector-specific catalyst for Transportation.","body_zh":"2015年7月8日至8月17日，政府紧急出台市场稳定措施，引发大规模空头回补反弹：中国证券金融公司指导21家券商买入蓝筹股，证监会暂停新股发行，国有企业被禁止减持。上证综指回升13.9%，周期板块领涨防御（+37.1% vs +16.8%），交通运输上涨32.8%，在28个行业中排名第8，与周期性整体复苏节奏一致。煤炭与国防领涨，反映跌幅最深的商品及军工类股成为国家队重点买入对象，交通运输板块并无独立催化逻辑。","drivers":["government rescue fund buying","short-covering rally","cyclical rebound beta","IPO suspension and SOE selling ban"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市资金买入","空头回补反弹","周期板块贝塔复苏","暂停IPO/国企禁止减持"],"title":"National Team Rescue, Short-Lived Rebound","title_zh":"国家队救市，短暂反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC announced a 1.9% CNY reference rate devaluation the largest single-day depreciation since 1994 triggering a global risk-off shock. SHCOMP collapsed -26.7% in just nine trading days to August 26, with defensives outperforming cyclicals (-22.2% vs -30.1%). Transportation fell -25.4%, ranking 6th of 28, relatively better than most cyclicals, but aviation stocks faced a direct headwind from USD-denominated fuel costs and weaker trade volumes implied by currency moves. The devaluation also signaled broader economic weakness, compounding the post-margin-crash confidence destruction.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行宣布人民币中间价一次性贬值1.9%，创1994年以来最大单日贬幅，引发全球性风险规避冲击。上证综指在此后短短9个交易日内暴跌26.7%，防御板块相对抗跌（-22.2% vs 周期-30.1%）。交通运输下跌25.4%，在28个行业中排名第6，相对好于多数周期板块，但航空股直接承压于美元计价燃油成本上升及汇率隐含的贸易量萎缩。人民币贬值亦折射出经济基本面疲弱，进一步叠加此前场外配资清查对市场信心的破坏。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock","global risk-off contagion","aviation USD fuel cost headwind","economic growth signal deterioration"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","全球风险规避蔓延","航空美元燃油成本压力","经济增长信号恶化"],"title":"Yuan Devaluation Shock, Global Panic","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击，全球恐慌蔓延"},"2015-08-26":{"body":"Following the yuan devaluation crash trough, SHCOMP rebounded +24.6% from late August to November 9, 2015, fueled by continued national-team buying and PBOC rate cuts (the sixth rate cut since November 2014). Transportation gained only +19.2%, ranking 21st of 28, a clear laggard as brokers (+46.9%) and computers (+43.6%) led the growth-driven bounce. Transportation's underperformance reflects that institutional buying was concentrated in financial and tech names rather than transport, and that ongoing macro uncertainty including yuan volatility and slowing freight kept the sector at a relative discount.","body_zh":"人民币贬值触底后，上证综指自8月下旬至11月9日反弹24.6%，受益于国家队持续买入及央行降息（2014年11月以来第六次降息）。交通运输仅上涨19.2%，在28个行业中排名第21，明显落后——券商（+46.9%）与计算机（+43.6%）主导成长风格反弹。交通运输跑输市场，表明机构资金主要集中于金融及科技板块而非运输，且持续的宏观不确定性（汇率波动、货运量放缓）令该板块维持相对折价。","drivers":["PBOC rate cut cycle","national-team equity support","broker and tech-led growth bounce","transport relative underperformance"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息周期","国家队资金托市","券商/科技领涨成长反弹","交通运输相对滞涨"],"title":"Stabilization Bounce, Transport Lags Leaders","title_zh":"稳定反弹，交通运输显著落后"},"2015-11-09":{"body":"November 2015 to January 28, 2016 brought a second major crash as the CNY depreciated toward 5-year lows and newly introduced circuit breakers (effective January 1, 2016) amplified panic selling. On January 4 and 7, 2016, the CSI 300 breached the 7% halt threshold on both days, and the circuit breakers were suspended by January 7. SHCOMP fell -27.2%; Transportation plunged -34.3%, ranking 26th of 28, second-worst, and far underperforming defensives (-23.4% vs cyclicals -28.4%). The sector's extreme laggard status reflects double jeopardy: high index beta plus a sector-specific freight recession as China's industrial activity stalled.","body_zh":"2015年11月至2016年1月28日，A股经历第二轮重挫：人民币汇率跌至5年低位，2016年1月1日起实施的熔断机制在恐慌性抛售中产生磁吸效应。2016年1月4日与7日，沪深300指数两度触发7%停盘阈值，证监会随即于1月7日宣布暂停熔断机制。上证综指下跌27.2%，交通运输暴跌34.3%，在28个行业中排名倒数第3（第26位），大幅跑输防御板块（-23.4% vs 周期-28.4%）。板块极度滞涨折射双重压力：对指数下跌的高弹性叠加中国工业活动熄火引发的行业性货运衰退。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic amplification","CNY depreciation pressure","industrial activity slowdown","high-beta cyclical double hit"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制恐慌放大","人民币贬值压力","工业活动放缓","高弹性周期双重打击"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Crisis, Yuan Pressure Rout","title_zh":"熔断机制危机，人民币压力重创板块"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"From late January 2016 to April 2017, China's supply-side structural reform (formally launched by Xi in January 2016) anchored a 15-month recovery that favored construction-linked and infrastructure-adjacent sectors: Building Materials (+65.9%), Construction (+55.5%), and Food and Bev (+52.4%) led while Media and Coal lagged. SHCOMP rose 23.4%. Transportation gained +22.4%, ranking 16th of 28, a modest mid-pack recovery reflecting steady freight demand from infrastructure buildout but no sector-specific catalyst. The value-over-growth tilt (value outperformed by 15.6pp) and China's PPI reflation (PPI turned positive in late 2016 for the first time since 2012) supported industrial transport volumes.","body_zh":"2016年1月下旬至2017年4月，习近平于2016年1月正式提出供给侧结构性改革，锚定持续15个月、有利于建筑相关及基础设施毗邻板块的修复行情：建筑材料（+65.9%）、建筑装饰（+55.5%）、食品饮料（+52.4%）领涨，传媒与煤炭垫底。上证综指上涨23.4%。交通运输上涨22.4%，在28个行业中排名第16，属于温和的中游修复，受益于基建驱动的货运需求稳定，但缺乏板块独立催化剂。价值风格大幅跑赢成长（+15.6pp），叠加中国PPI于2016年底时隔四年重回正区间，为工业货运量提供了支撑。","drivers":["supply-side reform stimulus","PPI reflation cycle","infrastructure freight demand","value-over-growth rotation"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革","PPI通胀修复周期","基建拉动货运需求","价值风格跑赢成长"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform, Value Recovery Cycle","title_zh":"供给侧改革，价值股修复周期"},"2017-04-13":{"body":"From April 2017 to October 2018, A-shares entered a protracted bear market driven by three overlapping forces: (1) domestic financial deleveraging as regulators targeted shadow-banking and off-balance-sheet exposure from 2017; (2) escalating US-China trade tensions that peaked with the first tariff salvos in March-July 2018 (25% tariffs on 200 billion USD of Chinese goods); (3) credit tightening that squeezed freight operators reliant on shadow finance. SHCOMP fell -24.1%; Transportation declined -35.9%, ranking 11th of 28, as defensives (-13.8%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-33.9%). The value tilt (value led by 15.6pp) reflects a rotation into banks and staples as safety, not sector-specific stress.","body_zh":"2017年4月至2018年10月，A股陷入持续约18个月的熊市，三重压力叠加：（1）国内金融去杠杆，监管层自2017年起重点整治影子银行及表外业务；（2）中美贸易摩擦升级，2018年3-7月首轮关税相继落地（对2000亿美元中国商品加征25%关税）；（3）信贷收紧压缩依赖影子融资的货运及物流企业。上证综指下跌24.1%，交通运输下跌35.9%，在28个行业中排名第11；防御板块（-13.8%）大幅跑赢周期（-33.9%）。价值风格领先成长16pp，反映资金向银行及消费必需品的避险迁移，并非交通运输独立的板块压力。","drivers":["financial deleveraging campaign","US-China trade war tariffs","credit tightening on freight operators","defensive flight-to-safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["金融去杠杆整治","中美贸易战关税","货运企业信贷收紧","防御板块避险轮动"],"title":"Trade War and Deleveraging Bear Market","title_zh":"贸易战叠加去杠杆，熊市延续"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"China's A-share market bottomed in October 2018 as the PBOC executed multiple RRR cuts (three in 2018, including a 100bp cut in October) and Beijing signaled fiscal stimulus. By the G20 Buenos Aires truce (December 2018) and subsequent US-China trade negotiations, sentiment reversed sharply: SHCOMP gained +30.6% by April 2019. Transportation rose +40.4%, ranking 15th of 28, a cyclical-beta recovery where growth stocks (Computers +64.3%, Agriculture +75.3%) led and broad cyclicals outperformed defensives (+35.1% vs +30.2%). Transportation's gain reflected the broad relief rally in freight-sensitive cyclicals rather than a sector-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2018年10月A股触底，央行年内三次降准（10月单次降100个基点），北京同步释放财政刺激信号。随着2018年12月G20峰会中美贸易休战协议达成及后续谈判推进，市场情绪急速逆转：上证综指至2019年4月累计上涨30.6%。交通运输上涨40.4%，在28个行业中排名第15，属于周期贝塔修复行情——成长股领涨（计算机+64.3%、农林牧渔+75.3%），周期整体跑赢防御（+35.1% vs +30.2%）。交通运输的涨幅反映的是货运敏感型周期股的普涨逻辑，而非板块独立催化剂。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts","US-China trade truce hopes","cyclical rebound beta","broad growth-led recovery"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准宽松","中美贸易休战预期","周期板块贝塔反弹","成长风格领涨复苏"],"title":"PBOC Easing, Trade Truce Hope Rally","title_zh":"央行宽松，贸易休战预期驱动反弹"},"2019-04-04":{"body":"From April 2019 to March 2020, the Shenwan Transportation index fell -29.2%, ranking 27th of 28, the second-worst industry, driven by two sequential shocks: (1) renewed US-China trade war escalation after the May 2019 breakdown in negotiations (25% tariffs on 200 billion USD of Chinese goods), crimping freight volumes; (2) the COVID-19 outbreak declared in January 2020 that collapsed passenger and cargo demand across aviation, rail, and shipping as Wuhan locked down on January 23, 2020 and lockdowns extended nationwide. Defensives dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-8.7% vs -19.5%), with Electronics (+15.6%) and Pharma (+2.3%) the only industries with positive returns.","body_zh":"2019年4月至2020年3月，申万交通运输指数下跌29.2%，在28个行业中排名倒数第2（第27位），遭受两轮连续冲击：（1）2019年5月中美贸易谈判破裂后摩擦重新升级，对2000亿美元中国商品加征25%关税，货运量急剧萎缩；（2）2020年1月新冠疫情爆发，旅客及货物运输需求全面崩塌，武汉于1月23日封城并向全国蔓延，航空、铁路、航运首当其冲。防御板块大幅跑赢周期（-8.7% vs -19.5%），电子（+15.6%）与医药（+2.3%）成为仅有的正收益行业。","drivers":["COVID-19 transport demand collapse","Wuhan lockdown January 2020","US-China tariff escalation 2019","aviation and freight volume crash"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫情导致运输需求崩塌","武汉封城（2020年1月）","2019年中美关税升级","航空/货运量骤降"],"title":"COVID Collapse: Lockdowns Devastate Transport","title_zh":"新冠崩溃：封城重创交通运输"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"From March 2020 to February 2022, China's V-shaped recovery (GDP grew 8.1% in 2021) drove a broad A-share bull market with SHCOMP +31.0%. Transportation gained only +28.9%, ranking 14th of 31, trailing Power Equipment (+145.7%), Metals (+115.5%), and Services (+108.0%). The dominant cycle was China's dual-circulation strategy favoring green energy and EV supply chains, not transport operators, who faced persistent headwinds: zero-COVID disruptions through 2021-2022 repeatedly shuttered aviation routes, and China's high-speed rail network reported a 94.7 billion yuan net loss in the first three quarters of 2022. Value slightly outperformed growth (-5.4pp for growth-minus-value), anchoring the moderate but unspectacular transport recovery.","body_zh":"2020年3月至2022年2月，中国经济V形复苏（2021年GDP增长8.1%），推动A股走出一轮牛市，上证综指上涨31.0%。交通运输仅上涨28.9%，在31个行业中排名第14，落后于电力设备（+145.7%）、有色金属（+115.5%）及社会服务（+108.0%）。本轮行情主线是双循环战略驱动的新能源及新能源汽车供应链，而非交通运输，后者持续面临逆风：新冠管控措施贯穿2021-2022年，反复冲击航空运营；中国高铁网络仅2022年前三季度净亏损即达947亿元。价值风格微幅跑赢成长（成长-价值为-5.4pp），支撑了交通运输温和而平淡的修复。","drivers":["post-COVID economic reopening","dual-circulation green energy leadership","zero-COVID aviation headwinds","value-led moderate recovery"],"drivers_zh":["疫后经济重启","双循环新能源主线","新冠管控拖累航空","价值风格温和修复"],"title":"Post-COVID Recovery, Lagging Green Energy Boom","title_zh":"疫后修复，新能源主导行情中落后"},"2022-02-10":{"body":"From February 2022 to February 2024, China's property sector crisis (new home starts down 37.8% in 2022, Evergrande restructuring) combined with zero-COVID lockdowns (major Shanghai lockdown February-August 2022) and weak domestic demand hammered cyclicals: SHCOMP fell -22.5%, with cyclicals (-30.7%) far underperforming defensives (-24.0%). Transportation fell -26.4%, ranking 7th of 31, relatively less bad than the worst-hit sectors (Retail -47.8%, Power Equipment -49.2%, Building Materials -50.5%) because coal (+13.0%) and defensive utilities (-16.7%) led, signaling a commodity and safety flight. Aviation, ports, and logistics operators suffered suppressed mobility and falling cargo demand through the post-zero-COVID reopening disappointment of 2023.","body_zh":"2022年2月至2024年2月，地产危机（2022年新开工面积同比下降37.8%，恒大债务重组）与新冠清零封控（2022年2-8月上海封城）及内需持续低迷叠加，重创周期板块：上证综指下跌22.5%，周期（-30.7%）大幅跑输防御（-24.0%）。交通运输下跌26.4%，在31个行业中排名第7，相对好于跌幅最深的板块（商贸零售-47.8%、电力设备-49.2%、建筑材料-50.5%），因煤炭（+13.0%）与公用事业（-16.7%）因商品/避险属性相对领先。航空、港口及物流运营商受出行管制及货运需求下滑拖累，并延续至2023年疫后重开预期落空阶段。","drivers":["property sector crisis","zero-COVID lockdowns","weak domestic demand","post-reopening disappointment"],"drivers_zh":["地产危机","新冠清零封控","内需持续疲弱","经济重启预期落空"],"title":"Property Crisis, Zero-COVID, Prolonged Bear","title_zh":"地产危机叠加清零政策，熊市延续"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 2024 to March 2026, China's equity market staged a major recovery anchored first by Central Huijin's February 2024 national-team ETF buying binge (Central Huijin declared it would ramp up ETF purchases to stabilize markets), then dramatically accelerated by the September 24, 2024 bazooka stimulus package: PBOC swap facility of 500 billion yuan for non-bank equity purchases, 300 billion yuan special re-lending for buybacks, and a Politburo economic meeting on September 26. SHCOMP surged 52.6% with cyclicals massively outperforming (+70.6% vs defensives +17.3%). However, Transportation ranked only 24th of 31 (+28.7%), as the rally was overwhelmingly captured by Telecoms (+212.3%), Metals (+198.3%), and Electronics (+159.5%) in a pure AI/hardware and commodity re-rating. Growth dominated value by +53.8pp, and the liquidity/theme-driven tape structurally bypassed volume-dependent, fuel-cost-sensitive transport operators.","body_zh":"2024年2月至2026年3月，中国股市展开重大修复行情：初期由中央汇金于2024年2月大规模购入ETF托底（中央汇金声明将加大ETF买入力度以维护市场稳定），随后于2024年9月24日一揽子货币政策大招显著提速——央行为非银机构提供5000亿元互换便利用于购股、3000亿元专项再贷款支持回购；9月26日政治局经济会议定调。上证综指大涨52.6%，周期板块全面超越防御（+70.6% vs +17.3%）。然而交通运输仅上涨28.7%，在31个行业中排名第24，行情主体被通信（+212.3%）、有色金属（+198.3%）、电子（+159.5%）所垄断，属于纯粹的AI/硬件主题与大宗商品估值重估行情。成长风格大幅领先价值53.8pp，流动性驱动的主题化行情从结构上绕过了运量依赖型、燃油成本高敏感的运输类资产。","drivers":["PBOC 924 bazooka stimulus","national-team ETF buying floor","AI and hardware sector leadership","transport bypassed by theme rotation"],"drivers_zh":["央行924一揽子政策","国家队ETF托底","AI/硬件板块主导","主题行情结构性绕过运输"],"title":"924 Stimulus Rally, AI Boom Leaves Transport Behind","title_zh":"924刺激行情，AI浪潮绕过交通运输"}},"now":"Transportation (Shenwan 801170) is currently in a Bottoming phase, ranking 18th of 31 Shenwan industries with a return of -13.3% against SHCOMP +1.6%. The tape is a pure AI/hardware-theme rotation: Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Building Materials (+48.1%) lead, while Transportation sits deep in the laggard half alongside Agriculture and Retail. Cyclicals barely edge defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%), confirming this is narrow growth-style leadership excluding volume-sensitive, fuel-cost-exposed transport operators rather than broad risk-off. With pos=0.1 (bottom decile historically) and no active buy signal, Transportation is at a structural trough but has not yet catalyzed a mean-reversion rotation into the sector.","now_zh":"交通运输板块（申万801170）目前处于底部筑底阶段，在当前窗口期31个申万行业中排名第18，区间涨跌幅-13.3%，而同期上证综指上涨1.6%。当前行情为纯粹的AI/硬件主题轮动：电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）与建筑材料（+48.1%）领涨，交通运输深陷滞涨区间，与农林牧渔、商贸零售同处末尾。周期板块仅微幅领先防御（+0.3% vs -12.1%），表明这并非系统性风险规避，而是以成长风格为核心的结构性主题轮动，对运量敏感、燃油成本高企的运输类资产形成持续压制。历史分位pos=0.1（处于底部十分位），且无有效买入信号，板块已处于结构性底部区域，但尚未触发均值回归的轮动信号。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801180":{"legs":{"2012-01-05":{"body":"After an aggressive 2011 tightening cycle (six RRR hikes and a 6.56% benchmark lending rate), the PBOC pivoted with an RRR cut effective December 5, 2011 and a second cut in May 2012, followed by two benchmark lending rate cuts in June and July 2012. Local governments in lower-tier cities began quietly relaxing purchase restrictions in early 2012. Real Estate ranked first among all 16 Shenwan industries at +36.8% while SHCOMP rose only +7.9%, confirming that outperformance was genuine policy-easing beta: credit conditions for developers and mortgage borrowers improved directly, compressing risk premia in the sector at the margin. Metals also rallied strongly (+36.1%), confirming a broad cyclical reflation trade anchored in the credit-easing catalyst.","body_zh":"在2011年六次上调存款准备金率及6.56%基准贷款利率的激进紧缩周期后，央行于2011年12月5日下调准备金率，并于2012年5月再度下调，同年6月、7月先后两次下调基准贷款利率，货币政策转向宽松。同期，各地政府开始悄然放松三四线城市限购措施。房地产板块以+36.8%领涨申万16个一级行业，而上证综指仅涨7.9%，印证了超额收益来自真实的政策宽松贝塔：开发商及按揭购房者的信贷条件直接改善，板块风险溢价边际压缩。有色金属同期大涨36.1%，佐证此为以信用宽松为锚的周期股整体反弹行情。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Dec 2011 / May 2012","benchmark rate cut June-July 2012","local purchase restriction easing","developer credit expansion","cyclical reflation trade"],"drivers_zh":["央行2011年12月/2012年5月降准","基准利率6-7月下调","地方限购松绑","开发商信贷扩张","周期性再通胀"],"title":"PBOC Easing Cycle Revives Property Beta","title_zh":"央行降准降息周期激活地产贝塔"},"2012-06-13":{"body":"As China's growth slowed sharply in H1 2012 (Q2 GDP growth fell to 7.6%, the weakest since 2009), global risk appetite deteriorated amid the Eurozone sovereign debt crisis. SHCOMP fell -13.6% and the selloff was emphatically risk-off: defensives (Pharma, Services, Food) fell only -9.7% while cyclicals fell -17.9%. Real Estate ranked dead last at #16 out of 16 at -21.9%, suffering the most as a high-leverage, credit-sensitive cyclical sector where tightening credit conditions translated directly into developer funding stress. The June 2012 PBOC rate cut provided some relief but was insufficient to reverse sentiment within the leg window.","body_zh":"2012年上半年中国经济增速急剧放缓（二季度GDP同比7.6%，为2009年以来最低），同期欧洲主权债务危机令全球风险偏好恶化。上证综指下跌13.6%，呈典型风险规避行情：防御板块（医药、服务、食品）仅跌9.7%，而周期板块跌17.9%。房地产以-21.9%在16个申万行业中排名垫底，作为高杠杆、强信用敏感型周期板块，信贷条件收紧直接传导至开发商资金链压力。央行6月降息提供了一定支撑，但不足以在区间内扭转市场情绪。","drivers":["China GDP slowdown to 7.6%","Eurozone sovereign debt crisis risk-off","credit tightening overhang","developer funding stress","cyclical beta unwind"],"drivers_zh":["中国GDP放缓至7.6%","欧债危机全球避险","信贷偏紧余压","开发商资金链承压","周期贝塔平仓"],"title":"Risk-Off Selloff; RE Worst Laggard","title_zh":"风险规避抛售；房地产全行业垫底"},"2012-09-26":{"body":"The PBOC's June and July 2012 benchmark lending rate cuts (to 6.0%), combined with local government relaxation of purchase restrictions in over 30 cities through 2012, catalyzed a powerful recovery. Real Estate ranked first at +37.0% out of 16 industries while SHCOMP surged +18.9%, making this a broad beta rally with RE capturing outsized cyclical upside. Appliances (+27.2%) and Transport (+20.0%) also led, confirming a domestic-demand reflation thesis. The value/cyclical leadership (growth minus value of -4.8pp) is consistent with a policy-driven beta re-rating rather than a speculative growth rotation.","body_zh":"央行于2012年6月、7月连续下调基准贷款利率至6.0%，叠加逾30个城市相继放松限购，触发强劲反弹行情。房地产以+37.0%领涨申万16个行业，上证综指同期大涨18.9%，呈宽基贝塔行情特征，房地产捕获最大周期弹性。家电（+27.2%）、交通运输（+20.0%）同步领涨，印证国内需求再通胀逻辑。成长跑输价值4.8pct，与政策驱动的贝塔重估（而非投机成长轮动）特征高度吻合。","drivers":["PBOC benchmark rate cut to 6.0% 2012","purchase restriction easing 30+ cities","cyclical reflation","developer credit relief","broad market beta surge"],"drivers_zh":["央行2012年将基准利率降至6.0%","逾30城限购松绑","周期再通胀","开发商信贷压力缓解","宽基贝塔大涨"],"title":"Rate Cuts Ignite Property Leadership Rally","title_zh":"降息引燃地产领涨行情"},"2013-01-30":{"body":"A severe interbank liquidity crunch in June 2013 — the 'SHIBOR Shock' — saw overnight SHIBOR spike from 7.66% on June 19 to 13.44% on June 20, as the PBOC deliberately withheld liquidity to discipline excess credit expansion. SHCOMP fell -17.8% and the selloff was steeply risk-off (defensives -1.2% vs cyclicals -21.3%), with growth stocks (Electronics +13.8%) the sole winners as investors fled to quality. Real Estate ranked 14th out of 16 at -22.4%, alongside Steel and Metals, as the credit crunch directly impaired highly leveraged developers dependent on rolling short-term interbank funding. The growth-minus-value spread of +34.8pp confirms a flight to defensive growth, not cyclical value.","body_zh":"2013年6月爆发严重的银行间流动性危机——\"钱荒\"事件——隔夜SHIBOR于6月20日从7.66%骤升至13.44%，系央行刻意收紧流动性以抑制信贷过度扩张。上证综指跌17.8%，行情呈明显风险规避特征（防御板块-1.2% vs 周期板块-21.3%），电子（+13.8%）等成长板块作为避险标的独善其身。房地产以-22.4%排名第14/16，与钢铁、有色同步大跌，原因在于钱荒直接打击了依赖短期银行间融资展期的高杠杆开发商。成长跑赢价值高达34.8pct，印证资金向防御性成长股避险，而非向周期价值轮动。","drivers":["SHIBOR spike to 13.44% June 20 2013","PBOC deliberate liquidity withdrawal","interbank credit crunch","developer short-term funding squeeze","risk-off to defensive growth"],"drivers_zh":["SHIBOR于2013年6月20日飙至13.44%","央行主动收紧流动性","银行间信贷危机","开发商短期融资渠道受压","避险转向防御性成长"],"title":"SHIBOR Shock and Credit Crunch Crush RE","title_zh":"\"钱荒\"银行间危机重创房地产"},"2013-06-25":{"body":"After the June 2013 SHIBOR shock bottomed out, a broad cyclical rebound ensued as the PBOC resumed normal liquidity provision and growth fears moderated. SHCOMP gained +15.1% and cyclicals led (19.2% vs defensives 8.2%) in a textbook risk-on reversal. Real Estate gained +22.5% but ranked only 4th out of 16, with Transport (+32.0%), Retail (+29.5%) and Services (+26.4%) capturing more of the cyclical snap-back. The growth-minus-value spread of -4.9pp indicates this was a value/cyclical reflex bounce, consistent with a post-credit-stress recovery where consumer cyclicals and services rebounded fastest.","body_zh":"2013年6月\"钱荒\"触底后，随着央行恢复正常流动性投放、增长担忧缓解，市场出现宽基周期性反弹。上证综指涨15.1%，周期板块领跑（+19.2% vs 防御板块+8.2%），典型风险偏好修复行情。房地产涨22.5%但仅排名第4/16，交通运输（+32.0%）、商贸零售（+29.5%）、休闲服务（+26.4%）反弹幅度更大。成长跑输价值4.9pct，表明此为价值/周期性反弹，与信用压力缓解后消费周期及服务业率先修复的特征一致。","drivers":["PBOC liquidity normalization post-SHIBOR","post-credit-crunch cyclical rebound","broad risk-on reversal","consumer cyclicals and services lead","growth fears moderate"],"drivers_zh":["钱荒后央行恢复流动性投放","信贷危机后周期性反弹","宽基风险偏好修复","消费周期及服务业领涨","增长担忧缓解"],"title":"Post-Crunch Cyclical Rebound; RE Mid-Pack","title_zh":"危机后周期性反弹，房地产居中"},"2013-09-12":{"body":"From September 2013 through January 2014, China's PBOC resumed tightening by allowing SHIBOR to drift higher and constraining credit growth, while property prices surged in Tier-1 cities, prompting local governments to impose new restrictions (Beijing's 'Guo Wu Tiao' March 2013 had already raised down-payments). SHCOMP fell -10.9% in a defensive-led selloff (defensives -3.5% vs cyclicals -14.7%), and Real Estate was the worst performer at -20.9% out of 16 industries. The growth premium of +16.3pp confirms investors rotated into defensive growth (Appliances, Electronics) and out of high-leverage real-economy cyclicals.","body_zh":"2013年9月至2014年1月，央行通过放任SHIBOR利率走高、持续压制信贷扩张，重启收紧周期。同期一线城市房价飙升，促使地方政府推出新一轮限制措施（北京已于2013年3月实施\"国五条\"，提高首付比例）。上证综指下跌10.9%，防御股领跌（防御板块-3.5% vs 周期板块-14.7%），房地产以-20.9%在16个行业中垫底。成长溢价+16.3pct，印证资金向防御性成长（家电、电子）撤离，远离高杠杆实体经济周期股。","drivers":["PBOC credit tightening resumes late 2013","property purchase restrictions Tier-1 cities","SHIBOR elevated","developer credit constraints","defensive growth rotation"],"drivers_zh":["央行2013年底重启信贷收紧","一线城市房产限购措施","SHIBOR维持高位","开发商信贷受限","防御成长轮动"],"title":"Tightening Resumes; RE Worst Laggard Again","title_zh":"信贷收紧重启；房地产再度垫底"},"2014-01-13":{"body":"China's landmark 18-month bull market was anchored by the PBOC's November 2014 and June 2015 benchmark rate cuts (25bp each, total 125bp over the cycle) and sequential RRR cuts, combined with a state-sanctioned narrative of 'reform-driven bull market' and explosive margin lending (outstanding margin debt reached 2.3 trillion yuan by peak in June 2015). Property purchase restrictions were substantially relaxed nationwide from March 2015. Real Estate gained +233.7%, ranking 8th out of 28 industries — a strong performer but outpaced by Textiles (+268%), Congloms (+260%) and Computers (+256%). SHCOMP surged +157.1%, making most of RE's gain broad-market beta amplified by the sector's high cyclicality.","body_zh":"中国历史性的18个月牛市，以央行2014年11月及2015年6月两次下调基准贷款利率（各25bp，周期内累计降息125bp）及连续降准为支撑，叠加\"改革牛\"政策叙事与爆炸式融资融券扩张（2015年6月顶峰时两融余额达2.3万亿元）。全国各地于2015年3月起大规模放松限购。房地产大涨233.7%，在28个行业中排名第8——表现突出，但低于纺织服装（+268%）、综合金融（+260%）及计算机（+256%）。上证综指本身大涨157.1%，房地产涨幅大部分来自宽基市场贝塔叠加板块高周期性的放大效应。","drivers":["PBOC rate cut cycle Nov 2014 - Jun 2015","RRR cuts multiple","margin debt explosion to 2.3trn yuan","reform bull narrative","nationwide purchase restriction removal 2015"],"drivers_zh":["央行2014年11月至2015年6月降息周期","多次降准","两融余额爆发至2.3万亿","改革牛叙事","2015年全国限购放开"],"title":"Historic Bull: Rate Cuts + Margin Boom Drive +234%","title_zh":"历史性牛市：降息+两融推动涨234%"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"The June-July 2015 A-share crash was triggered by forced margin liquidations after the CSRC tightened umbrella fund leverage rules in mid-June 2015 and brokerages raised margin requirements. Peak margin debt of over 2 trillion yuan unwound in cascading forced sells: SHCOMP fell -32.1% between June 12 and July 8. Real Estate fell -39.7%, ranking 10th out of 28 — a mid-pack performance. Defensives (Banks -10.6%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-43.0%), confirming a pure deleveraging crash with flight to low-beta. Coal (-59.1%) and Defense (-52.0%) were far worse than Real Estate.","body_zh":"2015年6月至7月的A股暴跌，由中国证监会于6月中旬收紧伞形信托杠杆规定、券商提高融资保证金比例所触发，高峰期逾2万亿元两融余额引发连锁强制平仓：上证综指于6月12日至7月8日间暴跌32.1%。房地产下跌39.7%，在28个行业中排名第10——属中游表现。银行（-10.6%）等防御板块显著跑赢周期板块（-43.0%），印证此为纯粹的去杠杆崩盘行情，资金逃向低贝塔标的。煤炭（-59.1%）和国防军工（-52.0%）跌幅远深于房地产。","drivers":["CSRC umbrella fund leverage tightening June 2015","forced margin liquidation cascade","2+ trillion yuan deleveraging","flight to low-beta defensives","broad market deleveraging crash"],"drivers_zh":["证监会2015年6月收紧伞形信托杠杆","强制平仓连锁反应","逾2万亿两融去杠杆","资金逃向低贝塔防御股","宽基市场去杠杆崩盘"],"title":"Margin Deleveraging Crash; RE Mid-Pack Selloff","title_zh":"两融去杠杆崩盘；房地产中游下跌"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"China's 'National Team' (led by China Securities Finance Corp and Central Huijin) deployed an estimated RMB 1.5 trillion to stabilize the market from July 2015, per Goldman Sachs estimates. The PBOC cut the benchmark rate on July 25, 2015. Coal (+104%), Defense (+78%), and Agriculture (+46.5%) led the snap-back as the most beaten-down cyclicals rebounded sharpest — cyclicals surging 37.1% vs defensives 16.8% — while SHCOMP gained +13.9%. Real Estate gained +31.2% but ranked only 11th out of 28, as the National Team focused on buying beaten-down index heavyweights rather than specifically targeting property stocks.","body_zh":"以中国证券金融股份公司和中央汇金为核心的\"国家队\"于2015年7月起入场护盘，据高盛估计动用资金约1.5万亿元。央行于7月25日再度下调基准利率。煤炭（+104%）、国防军工（+78%）、农林牧渔（+46.5%）领涨反弹，此前跌幅最深的周期股反弹最猛——周期板块整体涨37.1%，防御板块仅涨16.8%，上证综指涨13.9%。房地产涨31.2%，但仅排名第11/28，因国家队主要买入被砸盘的指数权重股，并非专门针对地产股。","drivers":["National Team 1.5trn yuan market stabilization","PBOC benchmark rate cut July 25 2015","most-beaten cyclicals snap-back","forced short cover","index heavyweight buying"],"drivers_zh":["国家队1.5万亿元市场稳定操作","央行2015年7月25日降息","超跌周期股急速反弹","强制回补空头","指数权重股定向买入"],"title":"National Team Intervention; Cyclical Snap-Back","title_zh":"国家队护盘；周期股急速反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC surprised markets with a CNY devaluation of nearly 2% in a single day (the largest one-day move on record at the time), sparking global capital outflow fears and a second wave of A-share selling. SHCOMP fell -24.8% from August 17 to September 15, with 'Black Monday' on August 24 (-8.49%). Real Estate fell -30.6% and ranked 12th out of 28 — a mid-to-worse performer. Banks (-3.5%) held up best; cyclicals (-32.9%) and growth lagged most. The devaluation amplified developer risk by raising the implicit cost of USD-denominated developer bond obligations.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行意外将人民币单日贬值近2%（彼时历史最大单日贬幅），引发全球资本外流担忧，并触发A股第二轮暴跌。上证综指于8月17日至9月15日间下跌24.8%，8月24日\"黑色星期一\"单日跌8.49%。房地产下跌30.6%，排名第12/28，属中偏弱表现。银行（-3.5%）防守最佳，周期板块（-32.9%）和成长板块跌幅最大。人民币贬值加剧了开发商风险，隐性提升了以美元计价的开发商债券偿付成本。","drivers":["CNY devaluation 2% August 11 2015","capital outflow fears global","second A-share crash Black Monday","developer USD bond cost risk","cyclical beta selloff"],"drivers_zh":["2015年8月11日人民币单日贬值2%","全球资本外流担忧","A股第二轮暴跌黑色星期一","开发商美元债偿付成本风险","周期贝塔抛售"],"title":"CNY Devaluation Shock Triggers Second Crash","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击引发第二轮暴跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"Following the second crash, a coordinated easing wave emerged: the PBOC cut benchmark rates on October 23, 2015 (the sixth cut in 12 months, to 4.35%), cut the RRR, and channeled targeted government stimulus. Real Estate gained +50.3%, ranking 5th out of 28 while SHCOMP gained +21.5%. The growth/tech-driven leadership (Computers +63.8%, Electronics +53.1%, Telecoms +51.6%) suggests this was primarily a liquidity/PBOC-driven reflation rally. Real Estate was a secondary beneficiary via lower mortgage costs, not the primary driver. The growth premium of 16.9pp confirms a liquidity-driven tape.","body_zh":"第二轮暴跌后，政策宽松浪潮协同涌现：央行于2015年10月23日再度下调基准利率（12个月内第六次下调，至4.35%），同时下调准备金率，政府定向刺激配合出台。房地产涨50.3%，排名第5/28，上证综指涨21.5%。成长/科技板块主导领涨（计算机+63.8%、电子+53.1%、通信+51.6%），表明此为央行驱动的流动性再通胀行情。房地产作为按揭成本下降的次要受益方，并非主驱动力。成长溢价16.9pct印证流动性驱动行情特征。","drivers":["PBOC 6th rate cut to 4.35% Oct 2015","RRR cut","post-crash liquidity reflation","lower mortgage cost secondary benefit","tech/growth liquidity rotation leads"],"drivers_zh":["央行第六次降息至4.35%（2015年10月）","降准","暴跌后流动性再通胀","按揭成本下降次要受益","科技/成长流动性轮动主导"],"title":"PBOC Easing Wave; RE Outperforms Moderately","title_zh":"政策宽松浪潮；房地产温和跑赢"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"China's newly introduced circuit breaker mechanism, activated on January 4 and 7, 2016 (the first two trading days of the year), created a self-reinforcing panic: markets halted after 7% drops, catalyzing front-running selling to beat the halt. SHCOMP fell -27.3% from December 22, 2015 through January 28, 2016, and the circuit breaker was suspended on January 7. Real Estate fell -30.8%, ranking 11th out of 28 — a moderate underperformer. Banks (-17.1%) held up best; growth names (Computers -35.9%, Media -34.4%) were hardest hit. No sector-specific catalyst: this was pure market-structure-driven panic amplified by residual leverage unwinding.","body_zh":"中国于2016年1月4日、7日（全年首两个交易日）启动新推出的熔断机制，触发自我强化的恐慌性踩踏：市场在触及7%跌停后停牌，反而催生抢在熔断前提前平仓的行为。上证综指于2015年12月22日至2016年1月28日间下跌27.3%，熔断机制于1月7日被暂停。房地产下跌30.8%，排名第11/28，属温和落后。银行（-17.1%）防守最好；计算机（-35.9%）、传媒（-34.4%）等成长板块跌幅最深。无特定板块催化剂，为纯粹的市场结构性恐慌叠加残余杠杆平仓所致。","drivers":["circuit breaker mechanism Jan 4 & 7 2016","self-reinforcing sell cascade","market design failure","residual leverage unwind","broad panic selling no sector catalyst"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月4日、7日熔断机制","自我强化抛售踩踏","市场机制设计缺陷","残余杠杆平仓","宽基恐慌性抛售无板块催化剂"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Panic; Broad Market Collapse","title_zh":"熔断恐慌；大盘宽基崩盘"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"The 24-month rally from January 2016 to January 2018 was dominated by a value/quality rotation: defensives led (53.3% vs cyclicals 32.8%) and value beat growth by a massive 31pp, with Food & Bev (+133.6%) and Appliances (+110.4%) at the top while growth/tech (Computers -6.4%, Media -23.7%) declined. This was driven by SOE reform optimism, supply-side structural reform (coal/steel capacity cuts boosting quality cyclicals) and the housing price boom through 2016-17 that boosted consumer staples spending. Real Estate gained +34.4% (rank 10th out of 28) in line with SHCOMP (+33.5%), delivering no alpha; the September 2016 tightening wave and 'housing is for living not for speculation' policy definition capped developer multiples despite surging physical property prices.","body_zh":"2016年1月至2018年1月长达24个月的反弹，由价值/质量轮动主导：防御板块领涨（+53.3% vs 周期板块+32.8%），价值大幅跑赢成长达31pct，食品饮料（+133.6%）、家用电器（+110.4%）居首，而成长/科技板块（计算机-6.4%、传媒-23.7%）反而下跌。行情由国企改革乐观预期、供给侧结构性改革（煤钢去产能提振优质周期股）以及2016-17年房价上涨推动消费升级共同驱动。房地产涨34.4%（排名第10/28），与上证综指（+33.5%）基本同步，无超额收益；2016年9月密集限购政策及\"房住不炒\"定调虽未阻止实体房价上涨，却抑制了上市开发商估值扩张。","drivers":["SOE reform optimism 2016-17","supply-side reform coal/steel capacity cuts","housing price boom 2016-17","consumer staples quality leadership","property tightening September 2016 caps developer multiples"],"drivers_zh":["2016-17年国企改革乐观预期","供给侧改革煤钢去产能","2016-17年房价上涨","消费白马质量领涨","2016年9月限购政策抑制开发商估值"],"title":"SOE Reform Value Cycle; RE Mid-Pack 2 Years","title_zh":"国企改革价值周期；房地产两年居中"},"2018-01-23":{"body":"The January-October 2018 selloff combined multiple headwinds: the US-China trade war escalation from March 22, 2018 (Trump's 25% tariffs on $50 billion of Chinese goods), domestic deleveraging via PBOC tightening and the shadow banking crackdown, and continued enforcement of 'housing is for living not for speculation' restricting developer sales. SHCOMP fell -29.9% but Real Estate fell -45.6%, ranking 27th out of 28, dramatically underperforming. Defensives led (-27.1% vs cyclicals -32.9%) confirming broad risk-off, but RE's additional -16pp gap vs SHCOMP reflects idiosyncratic developer credit stress anticipating the regulatory trajectory that would crystallize as the Three Red Lines in 2020.","body_zh":"2018年1月至10月的暴跌叠加多重逆风：中美贸易战自2018年3月22日起升级（特朗普宣布对500亿美元中国商品加征25%关税）、央行收紧与影子银行整治导致的国内去杠杆，以及\"房住不炒\"政策持续执行压制开发商销售。上证综指跌29.9%，但房地产暴跌45.6%，排名第27/28，大幅跑输大盘。防御板块领跌（-27.1% vs 周期板块-32.9%），印证宽基避险，而房地产较上证综指多跌约16pct，反映板块信用压力的特异性，以及市场对最终演化为2020年\"三条红线\"监管方向的提前定价。","drivers":["US-China trade war tariffs March 22 2018","PBOC deleveraging and shadow banking crackdown","property curbs enforcement ongoing","developer credit stress idiosyncratic","Three Red Lines regulatory anticipation"],"drivers_zh":["2018年3月22日中美贸易战关税","央行去杠杆及影子银行整治","限购政策持续执行","开发商信用压力特异性","市场提前定价三条红线监管方向"],"title":"Trade War + Property Curbs; RE Near-Worst Laggard","title_zh":"贸易战+限购政策；房地产接近垫底"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"After the PBOC cut the RRR for the fourth time in 2018 on October 7 (releasing 1.2 trillion yuan, net 450 billion yuan after MLF repayment), and the US and China agreed to a 90-day trade war truce at the G20 Buenos Aires meeting on December 1, 2018, a sharp recovery ensued. The PBOC cut the RRR again in January 2019 and the MLF rate in late 2018-early 2019. Real Estate gained +58.9%, ranking 4th out of 28 while SHCOMP gained +30.3%. Cyclicals led (35.9% vs defensives 31.6%) and growth beat value by 17.4pp. Real Estate's strong rebound reflected credit-easing relief: developer bond spreads compressed as PBOC backstop reduced systemic tail risk.","body_zh":"继央行于2018年10月7日第四次下调准备金率（净释放约4500亿元流动性，总释放1.2万亿元），以及2018年12月1日中美双方在布宜诺斯艾利斯G20峰会上达成90天贸易战休战协议后，市场强势反弹。央行于2019年1月再次降准，并于2018年底至2019年初下调MLF利率。房地产大涨58.9%，排名第4/28，上证综指涨30.3%。周期板块领涨（35.9% vs 防御板块31.6%），成长跑赢价值17.4pct。房地产强劲反弹源于信用宽松压力释放：央行背书使系统性尾部风险下降，开发商债券利差大幅收窄。","drivers":["PBOC 4th RRR cut October 7 2018 1.2trn yuan","G20 US-China 90-day trade truce December 1 2018","credit easing rally developer spreads compress","MLF rate cut late 2018-early 2019","cyclical risk-on reversal"],"drivers_zh":["央行2018年10月7日第四次降准1.2万亿","2018年12月1日G20中美贸易90天休战","信用宽松开发商利差压缩","2018年底-2019年初MLF降息","周期股风险偏好逆转"],"title":"PBOC Pivot + Trade Truce; RE Strong Rebound","title_zh":"央行转向+贸易战休战；房地产强力反弹"},"2019-04-09":{"body":"After the April 2019 peak, trade war tensions re-escalated on May 10, 2019 (Trump raised tariffs on $200 billion of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%), followed by prolonged uncertainty and the COVID-19 outbreak in January-March 2020 that froze property transactions. SHCOMP fell -17.9%, but Real Estate fell -28.8%, ranking 27th out of 28, dramatically underperforming. Tech/growth (Electronics +18.1%, Computers +2.6%) was the sole bright spot (growth premium +14.7pp), while RE suffered from both cyclical beta and structural concerns: the 'housing for living' framework kept purchase restrictions tight, and the COVID-19 shock in Q1 2020 caused a near-complete property transaction freeze.","body_zh":"2019年4月触顶后，贸易战紧张态势于2019年5月10日重新升级（特朗普将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%提至25%），此后持续不确定性延续，直至2020年1-3月新冠疫情爆发导致楼市交易近乎冻结。上证综指跌17.9%，房地产暴跌28.8%，排名第27/28，大幅跑输。科技/成长板块（电子+18.1%、计算机+2.6%）为唯一亮点（成长溢价+14.7pct），房地产同时承压于周期贝塔与结构性拖累：\"房住不炒\"框架维持限购收紧，2020年一季度新冠疫情冲击导致楼市成交近乎冻结。","drivers":["US tariff re-escalation May 10 2019 10% to 25%","prolonged trade war uncertainty","COVID-19 property transaction freeze Q1 2020","property purchase restrictions maintained","cyclical laggard compounded by growth rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月10日美国关税从10%升至25%","贸易战不确定性持续","2020年一季度新冠疫情楼市冻结","限购政策维持收紧","周期落后叠加成长轮动"],"title":"Trade War Re-escalation + COVID Crash; RE Laggard","title_zh":"贸易战再升级+新冠冲击；房地产落后"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"China's early exit from COVID-19 lockdowns by March 2020, combined with the PBOC's injection of 1.2 trillion yuan liquidity on February 3, 2020 and a 50bp RRR cut effective March 16, 2020, supported a broad market recovery. SHCOMP gained +29.7% from March 23 to July 9, 2020. Defensives led (35.8% vs cyclicals 23.0%) with Services (+88%) and Food & Bev (+62%) at the top, reflecting a 'digital economy / reopening' trade. Real Estate gained +30.7% but ranked only 14th out of 28, broadly in line with the market, as purchase restrictions were not materially relaxed and the Three Red Lines policy was already being discussed internally — placing a ceiling on developer optimism.","body_zh":"中国于2020年3月提前走出疫情封锁，叠加央行于2020年2月3日向市场注入1.2万亿元流动性，并于3月16日起实施50bp降准，支撑市场宽基反弹。上证综指从2020年3月23日至7月9日涨29.7%。防御板块领涨（35.8% vs 周期板块23.0%），休闲服务（+88%）、食品饮料（+62%）居首，反映\"数字经济/复工复产\"主题。房地产涨30.7%但仅排名第14/28，与大盘基本同步，因限购政策未实质放松，三条红线政策已在内部讨论，为开发商乐观情绪设定上限。","drivers":["China COVID exit March 2020","PBOC 1.2trn yuan liquidity injection Feb 2020","50bp RRR cut March 16 2020","digital economy reopening trade","Three Red Lines policy horizon caps optimism"],"drivers_zh":["中国2020年3月走出疫情","央行2020年2月注入1.2万亿流动性","2020年3月16日降准50bp","数字经济复工复产主题","三条红线政策前景抑制乐观情绪"],"title":"COVID Stimulus Rebound; RE Mid-Pack Recovery","title_zh":"新冠刺激反弹；房地产居中修复"},"2020-07-09":{"body":"The August 2020 'Three Red Lines' policy imposed caps on developer debt-to-cash (70%), net debt-to-equity (100%), and short-term liability coverage, structurally cutting off developer access to new financing. Evergrande defaulted on $305 billion of obligations in late 2021 after breaching all three lines. Real Estate fell -35.3% over 16 months while SHCOMP gained +1.2% and cyclicals led (+14.5%), making Real Estate dead last (#28/28) by a massive margin: a pure sector-idiosyncratic deleveraging collapse entirely decoupled from the broader index. Power Equipment (+118.5%), Metals (+54.2%), and Autos (+53.6%) boomed on the green energy/EV supercycle that drew capital away from property.","body_zh":"2020年8月出台的\"三条红线\"政策——对开发商设定剔除预收款后的资产负债率上限（70%）、净负债率上限（100%）及现金短债比下限——从结构上切断了开发商新增融资渠道。恒大于2021年底因三条均触线而违约，债务总额达3050亿美元。房地产于16个月内下跌35.3%，而上证综指涨1.2%、周期板块涨14.5%，房地产以#28/28垫底且差距悬殊：这是一次与指数完全脱钩的板块特异性去杠杆崩盘。电力设备（+118.5%）、有色金属（+54.2%）及汽车（+53.6%）板块受益于绿色能源/新能源车超级周期而大幅吸金。","drivers":["Three Red Lines policy August 2020","Evergrande $305bn default 2021","developer financing access structurally cut","green energy EV supercycle capital rotation","sector-idiosyncratic deleveraging decoupled from index"],"drivers_zh":["2020年8月三条红线政策","恒大2021年3050亿美元违约","开发商融资渠道结构性切断","绿色能源/新能源车超级周期吸金","与指数脱钩的板块特异性去杠杆"],"title":"Three Red Lines Deleveraging; RE Dead Last 16 Months","title_zh":"三条红线去杠杆；房地产连续16个月垫底"},"2021-11-05":{"body":"After the Evergrande default shock, Beijing signaled a partial policy pivot in late 2021: the PBOC cut the 5-year LPR (the mortgage reference rate) by 5bp in December 2021 (the first cut since April 2020), and rhetoric around 'reasonable financing needs of developers' softened significantly. Real Estate led all 31 Shenwan industries at +19.2% while SHCOMP gained only +2.2%, confirming a genuine sector-specific policy-hope relief rally. Building Materials (+17.3%) and Construction (+15.8%) were 2nd and 3rd, confirming the entire property chain repriced. Growth names (Power Equipment -13%, Autos -6.6%) sold off in a clean value rotation away from the prior green energy winners.","body_zh":"恒大违约冲击后，北京于2021年底释放局部政策转向信号：央行于2021年12月下调5年期LPR（按揭参考利率）5bp，为2020年4月以来首次下调，并明显软化了\"合理融资需求\"措辞。房地产以+19.2%领涨申万31个行业，而上证综指仅涨2.2%，印证此为真正的板块特异性政策预期修复反弹。建材（+17.3%）、建筑（+15.8%）分列第二、三位，整条地产产业链集体重估。电力设备（-13%）、汽车（-6.6%）等成长板块同步回落，与此前绿色能源强势板块的价值切换逻辑一致。","drivers":["PBOC 5-year LPR cut 5bp December 2021","developer reasonable financing signal","Evergrande shock pressure relief","property chain re-rating simultaneous","value rotation away from green energy"],"drivers_zh":["央行2021年12月下调5年期LPR 5bp","开发商合理融资需求政策信号","恒大冲击压力释放","地产产业链集体重估","从绿色能源板块切换至价值股"],"title":"Policy Pivot Hope; RE Leads Brief Relief Rally","title_zh":"政策转向预期；房地产主导短暂反弹"},"2022-01-11":{"body":"From January to March 2022, global risk-off from Russia's invasion of Ukraine (February 24, 2022) and China's severe Omicron lockdowns — particularly the March-April 2022 Shanghai lockdown — weighed on Chinese equities broadly. SHCOMP fell -14.1% and the selloff was relatively uniform across defensives and cyclicals (-14.8% vs -14.7%), with Coal (+1.3%) and Metals (-9.5%) holding up best as energy/commodity inflation beneficiaries. Real Estate fell -18.9%, ranking 22nd out of 31 — a moderate underperformer relative to Appliances (-26.1%) and Media (-24.8%), but not the worst sector.","body_zh":"2022年1月至3月，俄乌战争全球避险（俄罗斯于2月24日入侵乌克兰）及中国严重的奥密克戎疫情封控（尤其是3-4月上海封控）共同拖累中国股市。上证综指跌14.1%，防御与周期板块跌幅相近（-14.8% vs -14.7%），煤炭（+1.3%）、有色金属（-9.5%）相对抗跌（能源/大宗商品通胀受益）。房地产跌18.9%，排名第22/31——温和落后，跌幅相对有限（家用电器跌26.1%、传媒跌24.8%），并非最差板块。","drivers":["Russia-Ukraine war global risk-off February 24 2022","China Omicron lockdowns Shanghai","energy/commodity inflation rotation","broad market beta selloff uniform","developer liquidity concerns ongoing"],"drivers_zh":["2022年2月24日俄乌战争全球避险","中国奥密克戎上海封控","能源/大宗商品通胀轮动","宽基市场贝塔均匀抛售","开发商流动性担忧持续"],"title":"Ukraine War + Omicron; RE Moderate Selloff","title_zh":"俄乌战争+奥密克戎；房地产温和回调"},"2022-03-15":{"body":"A brief but violent 3-week relief rally (March 15 to April 6, 2022) was sparked by the State Council meeting on March 16, 2022 pledging financial market stability, prompting a broad 'policy put' repricing. Real Estate led all 31 industries at +32.7% while SHCOMP gained only +7.2%, confirming genuine sector-specific policy-hope repricing. Coal (+17.9%) and Building Materials (+15.6%) followed, consistent with a broad property chain relief trade. Value beat growth by 7.5pp. The PBOC subsequently cut the 5-year LPR by a record 15bp on May 20, 2022, which investors front-ran during this window.","body_zh":"2022年3月15日至4月6日的短暂但剧烈的3周反弹，由2022年3月16日国务院常务会议明确承诺维护金融市场稳定所触发，引发宽基\"政策底\"重估。房地产以+32.7%领涨申万31个行业，上证综指仅涨7.2%，印证真正的板块特异性政策预期重估。煤炭（+17.9%）、建材（+15.6%）紧随其后，与地产产业链整体修复逻辑一致。价值跑赢成长7.5pct。央行此后于2022年5月20日下调5年期LPR 15bp（彼时历史最大单次降幅），投资者在此窗口内提前布局。","drivers":["State Council financial stability pledge March 16 2022","policy put repricing","PBOC 5-yr LPR 15bp cut May 2022 anticipated","property chain relief trade","value beats growth"],"drivers_zh":["2022年3月16日国务院稳定金融市场承诺","\"政策底\"重估","预期央行2022年5月降5年LPR 15bp","地产产业链修复交易","价值跑赢成长"],"title":"State Council Stability Pledge; RE Leads Sharp Spike","title_zh":"房地产主导政策预期急速反弹"},"2022-04-06":{"body":"From April 6 to October 31, 2022, the prolonged Shanghai lockdown (April-June 2022, the strictest COVID restrictions since Wuhan 2020), a cascade of developer defaults (Sunac, Shimao, Kaisa and others failed bond obligations), and the national 'mortgage boycott' by buyers of undelivered pre-sold homes in July 2022 crushed the sector. SHCOMP fell -11.9% but Real Estate fell -32.8%, ranking dead last (#31/31). Defense (+9.8%) and Autos (+0.4%) were the only sector winners. Growth beat value by 7.1pp as domestic tech and NEV themes diverged entirely from the property sector.","body_zh":"2022年4月6日至10月31日，上海长达2个月的封控（4-6月，疫情管控严格程度仅次于武汉2020年）、融创/世茂/佳兆业等多家开发商相继违约，叠加7月爆发的烂尾楼业主集体\"断贷\"事件，共同重创板块。上证综指跌11.9%，房地产暴跌32.8%，在31个行业中垫底（#31/31）。国防军工（+9.8%）和汽车（+0.4%）为唯一上涨板块。成长跑赢价值7.1pct，国内科技及新能源车主题同地产板块完全背离。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown April-June 2022","Sunac Shimao Kaisa developer default cascade","mortgage boycott July 2022 pre-sold homes","pre-sold home delivery crisis sector trust collapse","NEV/tech themes divert capital from property"],"drivers_zh":["上海2022年4-6月封控","融创/世茂/佳兆业违约连锁","2022年7月烂尾楼断贷潮","预售房交付危机板块信任崩塌","新能源车/科技主题吸走地产资金"],"title":"Shanghai Lockdown + Developer Defaults; RE Worst","title_zh":"上海封控+开发商违约；房地产垫底"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"On November 11-13, 2022, the PBOC and CBIRC jointly released a sweeping 16-point property rescue plan: banks were directed to extend maturing developer loans, minimum down-payment ratios were cut (first-home to 20%, second-home to 25%), the nationwide mortgage rate floor was removed, and a 300 billion yuan PBOC relending facility was established for affordable housing conversion. Country Garden shares surged 52% in Hong Kong on announcement day. Real Estate led all 31 Shenwan industries at +30.0% from October 31 to November 29 while SHCOMP gained +8.9%. Value beat growth by 8.4pp, confirming a genuine policy-driven sector re-rating.","body_zh":"2022年11月11-13日，央行与银保监会联合发布房地产16条救市政策：银行被指示延期开发商到期贷款、首套及二套最低首付比例下调（分别至20%和25%）、全国统一房贷利率下限取消，并设立3000亿元央行再贷款用于收购存量商品房转作保障性住房。碧桂园港股于公告当日涨幅达52%。房地产以+30.0%领涨申万31个行业（10月31日至11月29日），上证综指涨8.9%。价值跑赢成长8.4pct，印证真正的政策驱动板块重估。","drivers":["PBOC-CBIRC 16-point property rescue November 11-13 2022","developer loan extension mandate","down-payment ratio cut first-home 20%","nationwide mortgage rate floor removal","300bn yuan relending facility affordable housing"],"drivers_zh":["央行-银保监2022年11月11-13日16条救市","强制银行延期开发商贷款","首套首付比例下调至20%","全国房贷利率下限取消","3000亿元再贷款支持保障房收购"],"title":"16-Point Rescue Plan Ignites RE Leadership Rally","title_zh":"16条救市政策引燃房地产领涨行情"},"2022-11-29":{"body":"Despite the 16-point rescue, by December 2022 investor confidence in a structural property recovery waned as home sales data showed limited pick-up and developer balance sheets remained impaired. The market rotated sharply into AI/tech in H1 2023 (Media +44.9%, Telecoms +42.0%, Computers +27.0%) as ChatGPT mania took hold globally from December 2022. SHCOMP was essentially flat (0.0%) but Real Estate fell -25.3%, ranking dead last (#31/31). The growth-minus-value spread of +24.5pp confirms capital entirely abandoned the property sector in favour of China's domestic AI narrative, leaving RE isolated as a negative outlier.","body_zh":"尽管出台了16条救市政策，但进入2022年12月后，投资者对地产结构性复苏的信心逐渐消退，楼市成交数据回暖有限，开发商资产负债表仍岌岌可危。2023年上半年市场向AI/科技板块急剧切换（传媒+44.9%、通信+42.0%、计算机+27.0%），全球ChatGPT热潮自2022年12月起兴起。上证综指基本持平（0.0%），但房地产下跌25.3%，在31个行业中垫底（#31/31）。成长跑赢价值24.5pct，印证资金完全抛弃地产板块，转向中国本土AI叙事，使房地产成为孤立的负面异类。","drivers":["16-point rescue fails to restore confidence","ChatGPT AI narrative from December 2022","developer balance sheet remains impaired","property sales data limited pick-up","capital flight to AI/tech theme growth rotation"],"drivers_zh":["16条救市未能恢复信心","2022年12月起ChatGPT AI叙事","开发商资产负债表持续受损","楼市成交回暖有限","资金大规模逃向AI/科技成长主题"],"title":"AI/Growth Rotation Crushes RE; Structural Doubts","title_zh":"成长轮动重创房地产；结构疑虑回归"},"2023-06-26":{"body":"On July 24, 2023, the Politburo meeting dropped the standard 'housing is for living, not for speculation' slogan for the first time since 2018, signaling a meaningful policy relaxation. The PBOC then cut the 5-year LPR by 10bp on August 21, 2023. In advance of these signals, optimism built from late June through early August. Real Estate ranked first at +19.5% from June 26 through August 3 while SHCOMP gained only +4.1%. Value beat growth by 10.4pp, confirming a pure policy-hope rotation. Brokers (+19.3%) also rallied sharply, consistent with a broad 'stimulus is coming' reflation trade.","body_zh":"2023年7月24日政治局会议罕见删去\"房住不炒\"定调（2018年以来首次），释放明确政策松绑信号。央行随后于2023年8月21日下调5年期LPR 10bp。上述信号预期自6月下旬起推动市场走强。房地产以+19.5%领涨31个申万行业（2023年6月26日至8月3日），上证综指仅涨4.1%。价值跑赢成长10.4pct，印证纯政策预期驱动的板块轮动。非银金融（+19.3%）同步大涨，与宽基\"宽松在途\"再通胀交易逻辑一致。","drivers":["Politburo drops housing slogan July 24 2023","PBOC LPR 10bp cut August 21 2023","policy hope rotation into property","value beats growth 10.4pp","broad stimulus anticipation reflation trade"],"drivers_zh":["2023年7月24日政治局删去\"房住不炒\"定调","央行2023年8月21日降LPR 10bp","政策预期驱动地产轮动","价值跑赢成长10.4pct","宽基宽松预期再通胀交易"],"title":"Politburo Policy Signal; RE Brief Lead","title_zh":"政治局放松信号；房地产短暂领涨"},"2023-08-03":{"body":"Country Garden — China's largest surviving private developer — missed two dollar bond coupon payments in August 2023, reported a $7 billion first-half 2023 loss, and warned it 'may default'. This shattered post-Politburo policy optimism. SHCOMP fell -7.2% from August 2023 through April 2024 while Real Estate collapsed -41.6%, ranking dead last (#31/31). Coal (+24.6%) and Appliances (+5.1%) led, with value/energy/commodity beneficiaries outperforming (value beat growth 11.2pp), as investors treated property as uninvestable and pivoted to resource stocks. Defensives (-6.5%) dramatically outpaced cyclicals (-10.5%), confirming persistent risk-off.","body_zh":"中国最大的存续民营开发商碧桂园于2023年8月未能支付两笔美元债利息，披露2023年上半年亏损约500亿元，并警示\"可能违约\"。这彻底粉碎了政治局会议后的政策乐观情绪。上证综指于2023年8月至2024年4月下跌7.2%，而房地产暴跌41.6%，在31个行业中垫底（#31/31）。煤炭（+24.6%）、家用电器（+5.1%）领涨，能源/大宗商品价值板块跑赢（价值胜于成长11.2pct），投资者将地产视为\"禁区\"，转向资源股。防御板块（-6.5%）大幅跑赢周期板块（-10.5%），印证持续风险规避特征。","drivers":["Country Garden dollar bond default August 2023","developer $7bn H1 2023 loss reported","property sector uninvestable narrative","risk-off to energy/commodity value rotation","structural confidence collapse sector-idiosyncratic"],"drivers_zh":["碧桂园2023年8月美元债违约","开发商披露2023上半年巨亏约500亿","地产板块\"禁区化\"叙事","避险资金转向能源/大宗价值","板块特异性结构性信心崩塌"],"title":"Country Garden Default Shock; RE Dead Last 9 Months","title_zh":"碧桂园违约冲击；房地产连续9个月垫底"},"2024-04-24":{"body":"On May 17, 2024, the PBOC announced its most comprehensive property rescue to date: nationwide removal of the mortgage rate floor for individual homebuyers (the first time ever), down-payment ratios cut to 15% (first-home) and 25% (second-home), and a 300 billion yuan re-lending facility for local governments to purchase unsold housing stock. SHCOMP gained only +3.6% but Real Estate surged +28.5%, ranking first out of 31 (April 24 to May 17). Building Materials (+13.8%) and Light Manufacturing (+11.2%) followed. Growth lagged value by 2.4pp, confirming this was a direct policy-response sector re-rating rather than a broad market move.","body_zh":"2024年5月17日，央行推出史上力度最大的地产救市组合拳：史无前例地取消全国个人住房贷款利率下限、首套及二套最低首付比例分别下调至15%和25%，并设立3000亿元央行再贷款支持地方政府收购存量未售住宅。上证综指仅涨3.6%，房地产大涨28.5%，领涨31个行业（4月24日至5月17日）。建材（+13.8%）、轻工制造（+11.2%）紧随其后。成长跑输价值2.4pct，印证此为政策回应驱动的直接板块重估，而非宽基市场行情。","drivers":["May 17 2024 PBOC nationwide mortgage rate floor removal","down-payment cut to 15% first-home","300bn yuan govt housing purchase relending facility","policy-driven sector re-rating","property chain co-moves Building Mat Light Mfg"],"drivers_zh":["2024年5月17日央行取消全国房贷利率下限","首套首付下调至15%","3000亿元政府收购住宅再贷款","政策驱动板块重估","建材/轻工制造联动"],"title":"May 17 Historic Rescue; RE Leads 28-Day Spike","title_zh":"\"5·17\"历史性救市；房地产领涨28天"},"2024-05-17":{"body":"Despite the May 17 rescue, new home prices in 70 Chinese cities continued falling (down 0.7% month-on-month in May 2024, falling in 68 of 70 cities), and new property sales by the top-100 developers remained deeply negative year-on-year through mid-2024. SHCOMP fell -10.0% from May 17 through August 28, while Real Estate fell -27.5%, ranking dead last (#31/31). Banks (-1.0%) and Utilities (-1.8%) held up best — defensives -11.1% vs cyclicals -17.7% — confirming defensive rotation as rescue skepticism mounted. Structural oversupply and developer insolvency overrode the policy uplift.","body_zh":"尽管5月17日出台救市措施，全国70城新建商品住宅价格仍持续环比下跌（5月下跌0.7%，68个城市环比负增长），百强房企销售数据同比仍大幅负增长至2024年中。上证综指于2024年5月17日至8月28日下跌10.0%，房地产暴跌27.5%，31个行业中垫底（#31/31）。银行（-1.0%）、公用事业（-1.8%）表现最佳——防御板块-11.1% vs 周期板块-17.7%——印证救市信心不足下的防御性轮动。结构性供给过剩与开发商资不抵债压力压制了政策提振效果。","drivers":["rescue fails to arrest home price decline","70-city new home prices -0.7% MoM May 2024","top-100 developer sales deeply negative YoY","defensive flight amid rescue skepticism","structural oversupply and insolvency override policy"],"drivers_zh":["救市未能阻止房价下跌","70城新房价格2024年5月环比跌0.7%","百强开发商销售同比大幅负增长","救市信心不足下的防御性撤离","结构性供给过剩与资不抵债压制政策效果"],"title":"Rescue Fades; Sales Disappoint; RE Worst Again","title_zh":"救市效果消退；销售数据失望；房地产再度垫底"},"2024-08-28":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a landmark stimulus package: a 50bp RRR cut (releasing approximately 1 trillion yuan), reduction of existing mortgage rates by an average of 50bp, second-home down-payment cut to 15%, and two new PBOC equity market stabilization tools (swap facility and re-lending for buybacks). On September 29, homeowners were permitted to refinance first mortgages. MSCI China surged 24% in September alone. Real Estate ranked 3rd out of 31 at +63.2% (August 28 to November 7, 2024) while SHCOMP gained +22.3%. The growth-led tape (growth premium +19.5pp) confirms this was a broad risk-on reflation, not a property-specific trade.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布重磅刺激组合拳：降准50bp（释放约1万亿元流动性）、存量按揭利率平均下调50bp、二套房首付比例降至15%，并推出两项股市稳定工具（互换便利及回购增持再贷款）。9月29日起允许存量首套房贷转按揭。MSCI中国指数仅9月单月大涨24%。房地产以+63.2%在31个申万行业中排名第3（2024年8月28日至11月7日），上证综指涨22.3%。成长主导的行情（成长溢价+19.5pct）印证此为宽基风险偏好型再通胀，而非地产专项交易。","drivers":["PBOC Pan Gongsheng September 24 2024 mega-stimulus","50bp RRR cut 1trn yuan released","existing mortgage rate cut 50bp average","second-home downpayment cut to 15%","PBOC equity stabilization swap facility and buyback relending"],"drivers_zh":["央行潘功胜2024年9月24日重磅刺激","降准50bp释放约1万亿","存量房贷利率平均下调50bp","二套房首付降至15%","央行互换便利及回购增持再贷款股市稳定工具"],"title":"Pan Gongsheng Mega-Stimulus; RE Top-3 Leader","title_zh":"潘功胜重磅刺激；房地产前三强领涨"},"2024-11-07":{"body":"Following Trump's election victory on November 5, 2024, the market pivoted away from stimulus-driven beta: fears of 60%+ US tariffs on Chinese goods weighed on cyclical and export-sensitive sectors, and property sales data for October-November 2024 disappointed despite the September stimulus. Real Estate fell -29.6% from November 7, 2024 through April 7, 2025, ranking dead last (#31/31) while SHCOMP fell -10.8%. Banks (+1.6%) held up as the sole positive sector; defensives (-8.3%) outpaced cyclicals (-14.8%). The property sector's beta to tariff risk is asymmetric: it suffers on growth fears without benefiting from any defense or import-substitution narrative.","body_zh":"特朗普于2024年11月5日赢得大选后，市场从刺激驱动的贝塔行情迅速转向：对美国加征60%以上中国商品关税的担忧压制了周期/出口敏感板块，而10-11月楼市销售数据在9月刺激后依然令人失望。房地产于2024年11月7日至2025年4月7日下跌29.6%，在31个行业中垫底（#31/31），上证综指跌10.8%。银行（+1.6%）为唯一正收益板块；防御板块（-8.3%）跑赢周期板块（-14.8%）。房地产对关税风险的敏感度具有不对称性：承受增长担忧下行压力，却无法从国防或进口替代叙事中受益。","drivers":["Trump election tariff fears November 2024","60%+ tariff risk on Chinese goods","property sales disappointing post-Sept stimulus","defensive rotation into banks","RE asymmetric tariff beta no defense offset"],"drivers_zh":["2024年11月特朗普当选关税担忧","60%以上关税风险","9月刺激后楼市销售仍低迷","资金防御性转向银行股","房地产对关税风险不对称贝塔无防御对冲"],"title":"Trump Tariff Fears + Property Disappointment; RE Worst","title_zh":"特朗普关税担忧+楼市失望；房地产垫底"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"After the 'Liberation Day' tariff shock (April 2, 2025, Trump imposed 145% tariffs), a 90-day US-China tariff truce announced in mid-May 2025 and a broad PBOC stimulus package (RRR cut + interest rate cuts, announced May 7, 2025) drove a powerful rally. However, Real Estate ranked only 13th out of 31 at +30.2% while SHCOMP surged +28.3% — essentially pure index beta with no sector alpha. The tape was dominated by cyclical tech (Telecoms +82.8%, Metals +76.9%, Power Equipment +74.8%) with a growth premium of +20.8pp, reflecting the DeepSeek/domestic AI sovereignty narrative. Real Estate was a passive participant, not a recovery leader.","body_zh":"2025年4月2日\"解放日\"关税冲击（特朗普对中国商品加征145%关税）后，2025年5月中旬宣布的90天中美关税休战协议及央行宽松组合拳（5月7日宣布降准降息）驱动市场强劲反弹。然而，房地产仅排名第13/31，涨幅+30.2%与上证综指+28.3%基本同步——近乎纯指数贝塔，无超额收益。行情由周期科技（通信+82.8%、有色金属+76.9%、电力设备+74.8%）主导，成长溢价+20.8pct，折射DeepSeek/国内AI自主可控叙事。房地产为被动参与者，并非修复行情主线。","drivers":["US-China 90-day tariff truce May 2025","PBOC RRR and rate cuts May 7 2025","DeepSeek domestic AI tech sovereignty narrative","broad risk-on cyclical tech rotation","property passive index beta not sector leader"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月中美90天关税休战","央行2025年5月7日降准降息组合拳","DeepSeek国内AI自主可控叙事","宽基风险偏好周期科技轮动","房地产被动指数贝塔非板块主线"],"title":"US-China Tariff Truce + PBOC Cut; RE Mid-Pack","title_zh":"中美关税休战+央行降息；房地产居中跟涨非领涨"},"2025-11-17":{"body":"From November 2025 through June 2026, the A-share tape rotated aggressively into growth/tech (Telecoms +99.8%, Electronics +84.1%, growth premium +25.6pp) while SHCOMP gained only +1.4%. Real Estate fell -24.3% and ranked 27th out of 31. Cyclicals were broadly flat (-0.1%) while defensives fell hard (-15.3%), confirming a narrow growth/AI-themed leadership. Real Estate suffered from structural divergence: rising home inventory (~762 million sq m as of August 2025), continued monthly price declines, Vanke's CCC- downgrade by S&P in late 2025, and no decisive new rescue catalyst. The sector shed value even as tech names surged, representing a textbook 'growth-tape structural laggard' setup.","body_zh":"2025年11月至2026年6月，A股行情激进切入成长/科技（通信+99.8%、电子+84.1%，成长溢价+25.6pct），上证综指仅涨1.4%。房地产下跌24.3%，排名第27/31。周期板块整体持平（-0.1%），防御板块大幅下跌（-15.3%），印证为窄基成长/AI主题行情。房地产承受结构性分化之苦：约7.62亿平方米的住宅库存积压（截至2025年8月）、房价持续月环比下跌、万科于2025年底被标普下调至CCC-评级，且无决定性新救市催化剂。即便科技股大涨，房地产持续失血——典型的\"成长主题行情中的结构性落后\"格局。","drivers":["AI/tech growth theme dominates tape Nov 2025-Jun 2026","property inventory 762mn sqm overhang Aug 2025","Vanke CCC- S&P downgrade late 2025","home prices continue monthly decline into 2026","no new decisive rescue catalyst structural laggard"],"drivers_zh":["2025年11-2026年6月AI/科技成长主题主导","2025年8月住宅库存约7.62亿平方米积压","万科2025年底被标普下调至CCC-评级","新房价格持续月环比下跌至2026年","无新重大救市催化剂结构性落后"],"title":"Growth Tape Leaves RE Behind; Structural Drag","title_zh":"成长主题行情将房地产抛在身后；结构拖累持续"}},"now":"Real Estate (801180) is at a Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 22nd out of 31 Shenwan industries with a current-leg return of -16.7%, a deep laggard in a market where SHCOMP is barely positive (+1.6%). The prevailing tape is risk-on and growth-led: Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, cyclicals outpacing defensives by 12.4pp and growth outpacing value by 18.2pp, a liquidity/AI-theme driven rotation. Real Estate is structurally sidelined in this environment: it is a policy-recovery value name, weighed down by persistent inventory overhang (~762 million sq m unsold as of mid-2025), ongoing month-on-month home price declines, and Vanke's S&P downgrade to CCC- in late 2025. The sector sits approximately 35% below its five-year-window high, below the 200-day moving average, with no buy signal active, suggesting a prolonged bottoming process requiring a decisive LPR cut or inventory clearance catalyst to reverse.","now_zh":"房地产板块（801180）截至2026年6月下旬处于\"筑底\"阶段，当前区间涨跌幅为-16.7%，在31个申万一级行业中排名第22位——相对于上证综指仅+1.6%的表现，属于明显落后板块。当前市场风格为风险偏好型、成长主导（电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%；周期板块+0.3% vs 防御板块-12.1%；成长溢价+18.2pct），由AI/科技主题流动性及资金从利率敏感型价值股撤离驱动。房地产在此行情中结构性受压：作为政策修复型价值板块，叠加约7.62亿平方米库存积压、万科等开发商被标普下调至CCC-评级、新房价格持续环比下跌等基本面拖累，板块距五年窗口高点累计跌幅约35%，无信号触发，股价低于200日均线——典型的磨底走势，等待决定性的降息或库存去化催化剂。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801200":{"legs":{"2012-01-16":{"body":"The PBOC cut the reserve requirement ratio (RRR) by 50bp effective December 5, 2011, its first easing move in three years, releasing approximately CNY 400bn in liquidity and signalling the end of the 2011 tightening cycle; a second RRR cut followed in February 2012. SHCOMP rebounded 9.2% in a broad risk-on rotation that tilted toward growth stocks (growth led value by 7.5pp), with Metals, Services and Electronics leading. Retail ranked 6th of 16 with +23.3%, capturing the broad beta rebound rather than any sector-specific catalyst. The move was largely liquidity-driven: the easing pivot drew retail-investor flows back into mid-cap growth names that dominated the sector index.","body_zh":"人民银行于2011年12月5日起下调存款准备金率50bp，释放约4000亿元流动性，标志着2011年紧缩周期结束；2012年2月再次降准。上证综指反弹9.2%，市场呈现风险偏好提升的成长风格倾斜（成长跑赢价值7.5pp），有色、服务、电子领涨。商贸以+23.3%排名第6/16，主要受益于流动性反弹的普涨贝塔，并无板块特定催化剂。降准驱动资金回流以中小成长股为主的商贸指数成分。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Dec-2011","liquidity reflation","broad beta rally","growth-style rotation"],"drivers_zh":["人行降准2011年12月","流动性宽松","普涨贝塔","成长风格轮动"],"title":"PBOC RRR cut triggers broad relief rally","title_zh":"人行降准触发广泛流动性反弹"},"2012-03-19":{"body":"After the January relief rally, China's economic data deteriorated through spring and summer 2012: GDP growth slowed to 7.4% in Q3 (the weakest since 2009), property investment decelerated sharply, and export orders weakened. Risk-off rotation pushed SHCOMP down -18.7%, with defensives (Real Estate -4.9%, Pharma -11.7%) cushioning the blow while cyclicals bore the brunt. Retail ranked dead last at -35.9%, nearly double the SHCOMP decline, reflecting its sensitivity to discretionary spending expectations and the selloff of leveraged retail-investor positions accumulated in the prior rally.","body_zh":"1月反弹后，中国经济数据持续恶化：2012年三季度GDP增速降至7.4%（2009年以来最低），房地产投资明显减速，出口订单疲软。避险轮动压制上证综指下行-18.7%，防御类（房地产-4.9%、医药-11.7%）相对抗跌，周期类受损最深。商贸以-35.9%排名末位，跌幅约为指数两倍，反映板块对可选消费预期的高弹性及前期散户加杠杆仓位集中出清。","drivers":["China GDP slowdown","property deceleration","risk-off rotation","discretionary selloff","retail-investor deleveraging"],"drivers_zh":["中国GDP下滑","房地产投资减速","避险轮动","可选消费抛售","散户去杠杆"],"title":"China slowdown fears; retail worst laggard","title_zh":"中国经济放缓忧虑，商贸垫底"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"China's 18th Party Congress concluded in November 2012, completing the Xi Jinping-Li Keqiang leadership transition and sparking expectations of urbanisation-driven stimulus. The PBOC maintained accommodative policy with multiple RRR and interest rate cuts during H2 2012. SHCOMP surged 24.1% in a broad-based rally where all sectors participated; Retail gained +26.4%, ranking 8th of 16, essentially tracking the index. Growth sectors (Chemicals, Pharma, Conglomerates) led, with the broad risk-on tone rather than retail-specific news driving the move.","body_zh":"2012年11月中共十八大召开，习近平-李克强领导班子完成交接，市场对城镇化驱动的刺激政策产生强烈预期。人行在下半年维持宽松，多次降准降息。上证综指大涨24.1%，全行业普涨；商贸涨26.4%，排名第8/16，基本跟随指数。化工、医药、综合等成长行业领涨，板块上涨以系统性风险偏好提升为主驱动力，而非零售板块自身催化剂。","drivers":["leadership transition expectations","PBOC easing","urbanisation stimulus outlook","broad beta rally"],"drivers_zh":["领导层更迭预期","人行宽松","城镇化刺激预期","普涨贝塔"],"title":"Xi leadership transition + PBOC easing surge","title_zh":"新领导层交接+人行宽松驱动大涨"},"2013-02-08":{"body":"China's interbank market tightened sharply in mid-2013: the 'Shibor crunch' peaked in late June 2013 when the overnight repo rate briefly spiked above 25% as the PBOC signalled tighter credit control. Anti-corruption campaigns launched after the 18th Party Congress weighed on luxury and high-end retail spending. SHCOMP fell -19.8% with a pronounced flight-to-safety rotation: defensives (Electronics +12.8%, Pharma +3.1%) heavily outperformed cyclicals (-22.6% avg). Growth massively beat value (36.3pp) as TMT stocks held up. Retail fell -19.5%, ranking 13th of 16, caught between the liquidity squeeze and anti-corruption headwinds.","body_zh":"2013年中期银行间市场显著收紧，即'钱荒'：6月下旬隔夜回购利率一度飙升至25%以上，人行释放收紧信用的信号。十八大后启动的反腐运动打压了高端零售消费。上证综指下行-19.8%，呈现明显避险轮动：防御类（电子+12.8%、医药+3.1%）大幅跑赢周期类（均跌-22.6%），成长跑赢价值达36.3pp（TMT支撑）。商贸下跌-19.5%，排名第13/16，受流动性收紧与反腐双重压制。","drivers":["Shibor interbank crunch","anti-corruption campaign","PBOC credit tightening","flight-to-safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["Shibor钱荒","反腐政策","人行收紧信用","避险轮动"],"title":"Shibor crunch & anti-corruption drag; retail lags","title_zh":"钱荒+反腐拖累，商贸跑输"},"2013-06-27":{"body":"After the June 2013 SHCOMP trough at approximately 1,950, a thematic recovery began driven by the rapid monetisation of China's online-to-offline (O2O) commerce model and soaring ecommerce penetration (Alibaba's Singles Day 2012 had just set a CNY 19.1bn record). ChiNext and small-cap growth rebounded strongly as liquidity normalised after the Shibor spike. Retail ranked #1 of 16 with a remarkable +56.4% gain, triple the SHCOMP's +14.8% and far exceeding both cyclicals and defensives. This was one of the sector's most exceptional legs: fundamentals (rapid GMV growth at Suning, Gome, and early B2C platforms) aligned with speculative small-cap re-rating.","body_zh":"2013年6月上证综指触底约1950点后，O2O（线上到线下）商业模式快速货币化及电商渗透率飙升（阿里2012年双十一成交额191亿元刷新纪录）引发主题性修复。钱荒缓解后，创业板及中小成长股强势反弹。商贸以+56.4%排名第1/16，是上证+14.8%的近四倍，大幅跑赢周期与防御。这是该板块历史上最强势的独立行情之一：苏宁、国美及B2C平台GMV高速增长的基本面与小市值重估形成共振。","drivers":["O2O ecommerce theme","Shibor normalisation","ChiNext small-cap re-rating","Singles Day GMV surge"],"drivers_zh":["O2O电商主题","钱荒缓解","创业板小盘重估","双十一GMV爆发"],"title":"O2O & ecommerce theme drives sector leadership","title_zh":"O2O与电商主题驱动板块强势领涨"},"2013-10-14":{"body":"After the exceptional 56% rally, the sector gave back ground as the O2O thematic premium faded and China's broader market fell -9.6% amid concerns about credit and shadow banking risks and decelerating GDP. Defensives (Electronics +3.4%, Appliances +1.4%, Banks +1.3%) held positive while the broad universe fell; growth vs value was essentially flat (-0.5pp). Retail ranked last of 28 at -24.7%, reflecting a classic post-thematic-peak mean-reversion: the sector's elevated valuation after the prior rally left it disproportionately vulnerable to risk reduction. Anti-corruption continued to weigh on gifting-related retail sub-sectors.","body_zh":"经历了56%的异常涨幅后，O2O主题溢价消退，中国市场因影子银行风险忧虑和GDP增速放缓整体下跌-9.6%。防御类（电子+3.4%、家电+1.4%、银行+1.3%）逆势收正，成长vs价值基本持平（-0.5pp）。商贸以-24.7%排名末位（第28/28），典型的主题行情高峰后估值均值回归：前期过高估值叠加风险收缩，板块首当其冲。反腐持续压制礼品类零售子板块。","drivers":["post-thematic valuation mean-reversion","shadow banking concerns","anti-corruption gifting drag","GDP deceleration"],"drivers_zh":["主题行情后估值回归","影子银行担忧","反腐压制礼品消费","GDP减速"],"title":"Post-O2O boom hangover; sector worst laggard","title_zh":"O2O主题行情后回调，板块垫底"},"2014-06-19":{"body":"China's legendary leveraged bull market began in mid-2014 as the PBOC pivoted to aggressive easing (two LPR/lending rate cuts in late 2014, five rate cuts by mid-2015), the CSRC relaxed margin financing rules and an unprecedented surge in margin debt (reaching CNY 2.27 trillion by June 2015) flooded into A-shares. SHCOMP tripled from approximately 2,000 to 5,166. Retail gained +234.3%, ranking 8th of 28, as cyclicals (+222%) broadly led defensives (+142%) in a risk-on tape with a growth tilt (+16.2pp). Domestic consumption expectations soared alongside credit expansion and urbanisation narratives, though growth sectors (Computers +292%, Construction +282%) led even more strongly.","body_zh":"2014年中期，人行大幅宽松（2014年下半年两次降息、至2015年中累计五次），证监会放宽融资融券规则，融资余额爆增至2.27万亿元（2015年6月），A股杠杆牛市开启。上证综指从约2000点飙升至5166点。商贸大涨+234.3%，排名第8/28，周期（+222%）普遍跑赢防御（+142%），成长风格占优（+16.2pp）。国内消费预期随信用扩张和城镇化叙事同步升温，但计算机（+292%）、建筑（+282%）等板块涨幅更甚。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts","margin financing surge","leveraged retail flows","consumption narrative","broad bull market beta"],"drivers_zh":["人行降息","融资融券爆发","散户杠杆资金涌入","消费叙事升温","杠杆牛市贝塔"],"title":"Margin-financed bull; retail surges 234%","title_zh":"杠杆牛市，商贸大涨234%"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"The CSRC tightened margin financing rules on June 12, 2015, triggering a forced-deleveraging cascade that sent SHCOMP down -32.1% in under four weeks. A nationwide circuit-breaker atmosphere prevailed as the government intervened with the 'National Team' (CSFC buying programme), but the initial selloff was severe. Retail fell -47.5%, ranking 26th of 28, nearly 1.5x the SHCOMP decline, consistent with the ctx: defensives (-30.4%) substantially outperformed cyclicals (-43%), and value beat growth by 6pp, a classic flight to safety. Banks (-10.6%) and Food & Bev (-32.6%) were relatively sheltered; the most leveraged small-cap growth sectors bore the worst losses.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会收紧融资融券规则，引发去杠杆踩踏，上证综指不足四周内暴跌-32.1%。政府启动'国家队'（中国证金公司购股）救市，但初期抛售极为惨烈。商贸下跌-47.5%，排名第26/28，跌幅约为指数1.5倍。与ctx一致：防御类（-30.4%）大幅跑赢周期类（-43%），价值跑赢成长6pp，典型的避险轮动。银行（-10.6%）、食品饮料（-32.6%）相对抗跌；杠杆最高的小盘成长股受损最深。","drivers":["margin financing rule tightening","forced deleveraging cascade","National Team intervention","flight-to-safety rotation","small-cap liquidation"],"drivers_zh":["融资融券规则收紧","强制去杠杆踩踏","国家队入市救援","避险轮动","小盘股平仓潮"],"title":"Margin unwind crash; retail collapses 47%","title_zh":"去杠杆崩盘，商贸暴跌47%"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"After the initial crash, China's government deployed a massive rescue package: the CSRC halted IPOs, CSFC bought billions in large-cap ETFs and index constituents, margin calls were suspended, and over 50% of listed companies were allowed to self-impose trading halts. SHCOMP bounced +13.9% from the July 8 trough as risk appetite returned temporarily, with cyclicals (+37.1%) sharply outperforming defensives (+16.8%). Retail gained +41.1%, ranking 5th of 28, outperforming the index as the oversold bounce disproportionately lifted sectors that had been hardest hit in the crash. Coal (+104%) and Defense (+78%) led as the most beaten-down cyclicals rebounded most violently.","body_zh":"暴跌后，政府推出大规模救市：证监会暂停新股发行，证金公司大举买入大盘ETF和蓝筹股，强制平仓被叫停，逾半数上市公司申请停牌。上证综指从7月8日低点反弹+13.9%，风险偏好暂时修复，周期（+37.1%）大幅跑赢防御（+16.8%）。商贸涨+41.1%，排名第5/28，受益于超跌反弹对前期重灾板块的非对称修复。煤炭（+104%）、国防（+78%）等跌幅最惨烈的周期股反弹最猛。","drivers":["National Team rescue buying","IPO suspension","halted margin calls","oversold bounce","cyclical mean-reversion"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市买入","暂停新股发行","强制平仓叫停","超跌反弹","周期股均值回归"],"title":"National Team rescue; oversold bounce","title_zh":"国家队救市，超跌反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC unexpectedly devalued the renminbi by 1.86%, and then again on August 14 to CNY 6.3975/USD, shocking global markets and triggering capital outflow fears. The SHCOMP entered a second wave down of -24.8%, with defensives (-20.6%) again outperforming cyclicals (-32.9%) and value beating growth by 5pp. Retail fell -33.4%, ranking 18th of 28, essentially in line with cyclicals' median performance: the CNY devaluation raised import cost fears for commerce operators while reinforcing risk-off positioning that hurt consumption-related sectors.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日人行意外下调人民币中间价1.86%，14日再度调至6.3975，震惊全球市场并引发资本外流担忧。上证综指二次探底-24.8%，防御类（-20.6%）再度跑赢周期类（-32.9%），价值跑赢成长5pp。商贸下跌-33.4%，排名第18/28，基本与周期类中位数持平：人民币贬值推升进口成本预期，同时强化了避险仓位，打压消费相关板块。","drivers":["PBOC CNY devaluation Aug-11","capital outflow fears","second crash wave","risk-off rotation","import cost concerns"],"drivers_zh":["人行8月11日贬值人民币","资本外流担忧","市场二次探底","避险轮动","进口成本上升预期"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock; second crash wave","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击，市场二次探底"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After two crash waves, the PBOC cut the benchmark lending rate to 4.6% (October 2015) and lowered the RRR for the fifth time in a year, while fiscal policy supported technology and internet sectors via early-stage Made in China 2025 and Internet Plus policy. SHCOMP recovered +21.5% between mid-September and December 2015, led by Computers (+63.8%), Electronics (+53.1%) and Telecoms (+51.6%) in a growth-driven tape (growth beat value by 16.9pp). Retail gained +34.8% but ranked only 21st of 28, underperforming the tech-dominated rally; its gain was driven by index beta rather than sector-specific fundamental improvement.","body_zh":"两轮暴跌后，人行于2015年10月将基准贷款利率降至4.6%并年内第五次降准，财政政策通过'中国制造2025'早期方案和'互联网+'政策扶持科技互联网板块。上证综指9月中至12月底反弹+21.5%，计算机（+63.8%）、电子（+53.1%）、通信（+51.6%）领涨，成长风格强势（跑赢价值16.9pp）。商贸涨+34.8%但仅排名第21/28，落后于科技主导的反弹；涨幅主要来自指数贝塔而非基本面改善。","drivers":["PBOC rate & RRR cuts","Internet Plus policy","tech-sector leadership","growth-tilt tape","index beta recovery"],"drivers_zh":["人行降息降准","互联网+政策","科技板块领涨","成长风格占优","指数贝塔修复"],"title":"Tech-led stabilisation; retail lags growth tilt","title_zh":"科技引领企稳，商贸落后成长风格"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"China's new circuit-breaker mechanism, introduced January 1, 2016, backfired catastrophically: on January 7 it triggered a full market halt within 29 minutes of open after SHCOMP fell 7%, creating self-reinforcing panic. Simultaneously, the PBOC set the yuan at its lowest level since March 2011 (CNY 6.5646/USD on January 7), amplifying capital flight fears. SHCOMP fell -26.4% over the December 22 to February 29 window, with defensives (-25%) outperforming cyclicals (-29.2%) and value beating growth by 5.6pp. Retail fell -32.0%, ranking 20th of 28, caught in the broad selloff without specific shelter.","body_zh":"2016年1月1日正式实施的熔断机制适得其反：1月7日（第二个交易日）开盘后不足29分钟触发全市场停牌，引发踩踏式恐慌。同日人行将人民币中间价设于2011年3月以来最低（6.5646），加剧资本外流担忧。上证综指12月22日至2月29日间下行-26.4%，防御类（-25%）跑赢周期类（-29.2%），价值跑赢成长5.6pp。商贸跌-32.0%，排名第20/28，在普跌中无特定避险属性。","drivers":["circuit-breaker panic Jan-2016","yuan depreciation to 6-year low","capital flight fears","flight-to-safety rotation","forced margin liquidation"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月熔断恐慌","人民币贬至6年低点","资本外流担忧","避险轮动","强制保证金平仓"],"title":"Circuit-breaker panic; yuan hits 6-year low","title_zh":"熔断机制恐慌，人民币触6年低点"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"Following the circuit-breaker abolition (January 8, 2016) and further PBOC easing (RRR cut February 29, 2016), markets stabilised and rallied as the government's supply-side structural reform narrative gained traction, lifting commodity and industrial sectors. SHCOMP gained +17.6% through January 2017; Food & Bev (+39.3%), Construction (+37.5%) and Building Materials (+37.3%) led in a value-tilt tape (value beat growth by 6pp). Retail gained +26.8%, ranking 10th of 28, a solid mid-field performance: the sector benefited from the recovery in consumer spending sentiment but was outpaced by hard-asset sectors levered to supply-side reform.","body_zh":"2016年1月8日废除熔断机制并叠加2月29日再次降准后，市场企稳反弹，政府'供给侧结构性改革'叙事推升大宗商品及工业板块。上证综指至2017年1月涨+17.6%；食品饮料（+39.3%）、建筑（+37.5%）、建材（+37.3%）领涨，呈价值风格（价值跑赢成长6pp）。商贸涨+26.8%，排名第10/28，中游表现：消费情绪改善带来支撑，但受制于供改硬资产板块的相对强势。","drivers":["circuit-breaker abolition","PBOC RRR cut Feb-2016","supply-side reform narrative","value-cyclical leadership","commodity reflation"],"drivers_zh":["废除熔断机制","人行2月降准","供给侧改革叙事","价值周期领涨","大宗商品通胀预期"],"title":"Supply-side reform rally; retail in mid-field","title_zh":"供给侧改革行情，商贸中游表现"},"2017-01-10":{"body":"This was the longest multi-year selloff leg: the CSRC launched financial deleveraging in November 2017 (new asset management rules tightening shadow banking channels), while the US-China trade war escalated through 2018 with tariffs announced in March 2018 and reaching 25% on USD 200bn of goods by May 2018. SHCOMP fell -21.4%, but the selloff was heavily skewed toward small/growth names: Food & Bev gained +24.2% while cyclicals average fell -30.1%, and value beat growth by 18.6pp. Retail dropped -46.0%, ranking 21st of 28, reflecting its dominance by small-cap discretionary names most exposed to the deleveraging squeeze on shadow-credit-financed retail consumption and e-commerce valuations.","body_zh":"这是历史最长的多年期回调腿：2017年11月资管新规实施启动金融去杠杆（收紧影子银行融资渠道），2018年3月中美贸易战升级，至2018年5月对2000亿美元商品加征25%关税。上证综指下行-21.4%，但结构严重分化：食品饮料逆势+24.2%，周期类均跌-30.1%，价值跑赢成长18.6pp。商贸跌-46.0%，排名第21/28，指数成分以小盘可选消费股为主，受去杠杆对影子信贷融资消费及电商估值的双重压制最深。","drivers":["financial deleveraging regulations Nov-2017","US-China trade war tariffs","small-cap growth selloff","flight to large-cap value","shadow banking tightening"],"drivers_zh":["2017年11月资管新规去杠杆","中美贸易战关税","小盘成长股抛售","资金向大盘价值转移","影子银行收紧"],"title":"Deleveraging + trade war drag; 21-month selloff","title_zh":"去杠杆+贸易战拖累，长达21个月回调"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"China's SHCOMP hit its trough around October 18-19, 2018 (at approximately 2,449), then staged a sharp recovery as the PBOC cut the RRR three times between October 2018 and January 2019, injecting liquidity, and markets priced in a potential US-China trade war truce ahead of the G20 Buenos Aires summit (December 1, 2018, where a 90-day tariff truce was agreed). SHCOMP gained +29.4%; growth sectors led (Agriculture +71.8%, Computers +64.6%), with cyclicals (+33.9%) outpacing defensives (+28.7%). Retail gained +42.0%, ranking 13th of 28, broadly tracking the index in a risk-on reflation; the 90-day truce removed the most acute tariff overhang on domestic consumption names.","body_zh":"上证综指于2018年10月18-19日触底约2449点，随后人行在2018年10月至2019年1月间三次降准释放流动性，市场对G20布宜诺斯艾利斯峰会（12月1日宣布90天关税休战协议）抱有强烈预期。上证综指反弹+29.4%；成长板块领涨（农业+71.8%、计算机+64.6%），周期（+33.9%）跑赢防御（+28.7%）。商贸涨+42.0%，排名第13/28，基本跟随指数的风险偏好修复；贸易战休战移除了对国内消费板块的最急迫关税压制。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts Oct-2018 to Jan-2019","G20 trade war truce Dec-2018","risk-on reflation","cyclical recovery","consumption tariff overhang removed"],"drivers_zh":["人行2018年10月至2019年1月降准","G20贸易战休战2018年12月","风险偏好修复","周期股反弹","消费板块关税压力解除"],"title":"Trade war truce hopes; policy pivot rally","title_zh":"贸易战休战预期+政策转向，市场反弹"},"2019-04-03":{"body":"After the G20 truce expired, trade war tensions dramatically re-escalated: on May 10, 2019, the US raised tariffs on USD 200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, and China retaliated three days later. This shock derailed China's consumption recovery and weighed heavily on e-commerce and retail names. SHCOMP fell -14.6% with a clear flight-to-safety pattern: defensives outperformed (-6.2%) vs cyclicals (-19.5%), with Electronics (+20.8%), Food & Bev (+5.0%) and Pharma (+2.0%) positive while retail collapsed -28.9% to rank 26th of 28. The sector was doubly exposed: trade-war fears hurt consumer sentiment and tariff-related supply chain disruption risked import-dependent merchandise.","body_zh":"G20休战到期后，贸易战急剧升级：2019年5月10日美国将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%上调至25%，中方三天后报复。这一冲击打断了中国消费复苏进程，电商及零售股承压。上证综指下行-14.6%，呈明显避险格局：防御类（-6.2%）跑赢周期类（-19.5%），电子（+20.8%）、食品饮料（+5.0%）、医药（+2.0%）逆势为正，而商贸暴跌-28.9%，排名第26/28。板块遭受双重打击：贸易战忧虑打压消费信心，进口依赖型商品面临关税引发的供应链风险。","drivers":["US tariff hike to 25% May-2019","trade war re-escalation","consumer sentiment shock","import cost risk","flight-to-safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月美国加征25%关税","贸易战再度升级","消费信心冲击","进口成本风险","避险轮动"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation; retail worst laggard","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级，商贸大幅跑输"},"2020-02-03":{"body":"China's SHCOMP reopened February 3, 2020 after the extended Lunar New Year closure amid the COVID-19 outbreak, crashing initially but recovering sharply as China became the first major economy to control the virus. From the February 3 trough through July 13, the index gained +25.4%. Retail surged +60.9%, ranking 3rd of 28, as a structural narrative emerged: the crisis massively accelerated China's ecommerce penetration (Alibaba Q1 FY2020 domestic commerce revenue +34% YoY; JD.com Q2 revenue +34%), with COVID-driven lockdowns forcing offline retail consumers online. Defensives (+37.0%) outperformed cyclicals (+25.8%) while growth beat value by 18.8pp, consistent with the consumer/ecommerce-led tape.","body_zh":"上证综指于2020年2月3日春节延长假期后重开，初跌后迅速反弹，因中国率先控制疫情。至7月13日指数累涨+25.4%。商贸大涨+60.9%，排名第3/28：疫情大幅加速中国电商渗透率（阿里巴巴FY2020一季度国内电商营收同比+34%；京东Q2同比+34%），封控迫使线下消费者转线上。防御类（+37.0%）跑赢周期类（+25.8%），成长跑赢价值18.8pp，与消费/电商驱动的市场结构一致。","drivers":["COVID lockdown accelerated ecommerce","Alibaba JD revenue surge","digital consumption shift","defensive-led tape","growth-tilt narrative"],"drivers_zh":["疫情封控加速电商渗透","阿里/京东营收爆发","数字消费转型","防御类领跑","成长风格叙事"],"title":"COVID pandemic shock; online commerce surge","title_zh":"新冠疫情冲击，线上商业爆发"},"2020-07-13":{"body":"This 20-month selloff was driven by two sequential waves: (1) Beijing's platform economy crackdown, beginning with SAMR's antitrust investigation into Alibaba in December 2020 and culminating in the CNY 18.2bn fine in April 2021, causing Alibaba shares to fall approximately 65% and dragging the entire ecommerce/retail complex; (2) the zero-COVID policy from late 2021 through 2022, including Shanghai's 2-month lockdown (April-June 2022), which destroyed offline retail activity. SHCOMP fell -11.0% but masked a massive sector rotation: Power Equipment (+65.7%), Metals (+36.8%) and Chemicals (+31.0%) surged in a green-energy boom (value beat growth by 10.4pp), while Retail crashed -46.4% to rank dead last #31/31.","body_zh":"这段长达20个月的回调由两波冲击叠加驱动：（1）互联网平台反垄断整治——2020年12月市场监管总局对阿里巴巴立案，2021年4月开具182亿元天价罚单，阿里股价累跌约65%，拖累整个电商零售板块；（2）2021年下半年至2022年的动态清零政策，包括2022年4至6月上海封控两个月，彻底打击线下零售活动。上证综指仅跌-11.0%，但掩盖了巨大的板块轮动：电力设备（+65.7%）、有色（+36.8%）、化工（+31.0%）在绿色能源/供应链行情中大涨（价值跑赢成长10.4pp），而商贸暴跌-46.4%，排名垫底（第31/31）。","drivers":["platform antitrust crackdown Alibaba","zero-COVID policy lockdowns","green-energy sector rotation","ecommerce valuation de-rating","value-beat-growth tape"],"drivers_zh":["互联网反垄断整治阿里","动态清零政策封控","绿色能源板块轮动","电商估值压缩","价值跑赢成长"],"title":"Platform crackdown + zero-COVID; worst laggard","title_zh":"平台反垄断+动态清零，板块垫底"},"2022-03-15":{"body":"As Shanghai's lockdown peaked in late March-April 2022 and markets priced eventual re-opening, a short counter-trend rally materialised from the March 15 trough through June 30. The tape was value-led: Autos (+28.8%), Coal (+28.4%) and Beauty (+27.2%) led as the government signalled support for domestic consumption and EV subsidies. Retail rose +19.7%, ranking 5th of 31, outperforming the broad index (+10.9%) on reopening optimism. Growth lagged (value beat growth by 9pp): Computers fell -6.3% and Electronics gained only +1.0%, confirming the rotation was to value/cyclical reopening plays rather than structural tech themes.","body_zh":"2022年3月下旬至4月上海封控达到峰值，市场开始定价最终重开预期，从3月15日低点至6月30日出现短暂反向反弹。行情以价值股领跑：汽车（+28.8%）、煤炭（+28.4%）、美容护理（+27.2%）受政府鼓励国内消费及新能源汽车补贴提振领涨。商贸涨+19.7%，排名第5/31，跑赢大盘（+10.9%），受益于重开预期。成长明显落后（价值跑赢成长9pp）：计算机跌-6.3%、电子仅+1.0%，印证轮动指向价值/周期重开题材而非结构性科技主题。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown peak pricing","reopening optimism","EV subsidy support","value-cyclical rotation","domestic consumption signalling"],"drivers_zh":["上海封控顶部定价","重开预期","新能源汽车补贴","价值周期轮动","鼓励国内消费信号"],"title":"Shanghai lockdown trough; reopening value bounce","title_zh":"上海封控底部，重开预期价值反弹"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"Ahead of the 20th Party Congress (October 16, 2022), market uncertainty about leadership continuity, regulatory tightening continuation and the persistent zero-COVID policy weighed on risk assets. SHCOMP fell -14.9% in a mixed rotation: growth beat value by 8.1pp (Defense +3.4%, Computers -0.8% relatively resilient) while consumer/property names were devastated (Food & Bev -31.3%, Building Materials -31.4%). Retail fell -18.4%, ranking 21st of 31, in line with the broad selloff; no sector-specific catalyst was dominant, though ongoing zero-COVID restrictions continued to suppress offline commerce activity.","body_zh":"二十大（2022年10月16日）召开前夕，市场对领导层连续性、监管政策走向及动态清零持续的不确定性压制风险资产。上证综指下行-14.9%，轮动混合：成长小幅跑赢价值8.1pp（国防+3.4%、计算机-0.8%相对抗跌），而消费/地产类遭受重创（食品饮料-31.3%、建材-31.4%）。商贸跌-18.4%，排名第21/31，与大盘普跌一致；无特定板块催化剂，动态清零持续压制线下商业活动。","drivers":["20th Party Congress uncertainty","zero-COVID continuation","consumer sector sentiment drag","growth-tilt rotation","property sector contagion"],"drivers_zh":["二十大不确定性","动态清零持续","消费板块情绪拖累","成长风格轮动","地产板块传染效应"],"title":"20th Party Congress caution; broad selloff","title_zh":"二十大前夕不确定性，市场普跌"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"From late October 2022, social media speculation of a zero-COVID exit plan targeting March 2023 triggered an explosive rally in consumer and travel stocks. Bloomberg reported Chinese ADRs surging 3.8%+ on reopening rumors on November 1; by December 5, China formally announced easing of zero-COVID restrictions, and on December 26 the policy was officially ended. Retail surged +22.8%, ranking 3rd of 31, led alongside Food & Bev (+26.0%) and Real Estate (+25.5%) in a clear reopening/value tape (value beat growth by 8.1pp). Telecoms, Computers and Defense lagged sharply as capital rotated away from COVID-era growth themes.","body_zh":"2022年10月下旬，有关动态清零政策将于2023年3月退出的社交媒体传言引发消费及出行股爆发。彭博报道11月1日中概股ADR大涨逾3.8%；12月5日中国正式宣布放开管控措施，12月26日政策正式终止。商贸大涨+22.8%，排名第3/31，与食品饮料（+26.0%）、房地产（+25.5%）同步领涨，呈明显的重开/价值行情（价值跑赢成长8.1pp）。电信、计算机、国防大幅落后，资金从疫情时代成长主题轮出。","drivers":["zero-COVID exit rumours Nov-2022","formal policy easing Dec-2022","reopening consumer rally","value-style rotation","travel & consumption re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11月退出清零传言","12月正式放开管控","重开消费行情","价值风格轮动","出行消费板块重估"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit rumours; reopening rally","title_zh":"清零退出传言，重开主题反弹"},"2022-12-08":{"body":"The reopening euphoria quickly gave way to disappointment: the post-COVID consumption rebound was weaker than expected, plagued by lingering consumer caution (elevated savings rates), a deepening property crisis (Evergrande liquidated January 2024 with USD 300bn in liabilities, Country Garden defaulting on dollar bonds in August 2023), and deflationary pressures with CPI near zero through 2023. SHCOMP fell -15.5% over 14 months; defensives outperformed: Coal flat (+0.8%), Banks (-1.6%), Appliances (-2.1%) while growth/cyclical sectors and property collapsed. Retail fell -46.5%, ranking dead last #31/31, as offline retail traffic disappointed and ecommerce platforms faced margin pressure amid deflation. This was the most severe de-rating leg in the 15-year record.","body_zh":"重开欣喜迅速转为失望：疫后消费反弹远低于预期，居民储蓄意愿高企，地产危机加深（恒大2024年1月以3000亿美元负债被清盘，碧桂园2023年8月美元债违约），2023年全年CPI接近于零，通缩压力持续。上证综指14个月下跌-15.5%；防御类相对抗跌：煤炭（+0.8%）、银行（-1.6%）、家电（-2.1%），而成长/周期及地产板块大幅崩塌。商贸下跌-46.5%，排名末位（第31/31），线下客流低迷、电商平台在通缩中利润承压，构成15年来最深度的估值重压腿。","drivers":["reopening consumption disappointment","property crisis Evergrande default","deflation/CPI near zero","elevated savings rate","ecommerce margin pressure"],"drivers_zh":["重开后消费低于预期","恒大违约地产危机","通缩/CPI接近零","居民储蓄率高企","电商利润承压"],"title":"Reopening disappointment + property crisis deepens","title_zh":"重开失望+地产危机加剧，板块垫底"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The CSRC and PBOC launched a coordinated market support operation in late January-February 2024: the National Team (Central Huijin) reportedly bought approximately CNY 410bn of A-share ETFs, the CSRC introduced new short-selling restrictions, and LPR was cut in early 2024. SHCOMP bounced +14.2% in a liquidity-driven risk-on tape, led by growth/tech (Computers +39.2%, Telecoms +36.0%, Media +34.3%), with growth beating value by 16.8pp. Retail gained +19.5%, ranking mid-table 17th of 31, broadly in line with the market recovery but significantly below the tech leaders; the bounce was beta recovery rather than sector-specific re-rating.","body_zh":"2024年1月下旬至2月，证监会与人行启动协同市场支撑行动：汇金公司大举买入A股ETF（约4100亿元），证监会出台新限空措施，LPR年初下调。上证综指反弹+14.2%，呈流动性驱动的风险偏好行情，科技成长领涨（计算机+39.2%、电信+36.0%、传媒+34.3%），成长跑赢价值16.8pp。商贸涨+19.5%，排名中游（第17/31），基本跟随大盘修复但显著落后于科技龙头；此次反弹属贝塔修复而非板块独立重估。","drivers":["National Team ETF buying Feb-2024","CSRC short-selling restrictions","LPR cut","AI/tech growth leadership","liquidity-driven beta rebound"],"drivers_zh":["汇金2024年2月大举买入ETF","证监会限制卖空","LPR下调","AI/科技成长领涨","流动性驱动贝塔反弹"],"title":"National Team rescue; AI/tech bounce","title_zh":"国家队救市+AI题材，技术反弹"},"2024-03-18":{"body":"After the February bounce faded, markets entered prolonged consolidation/selloff as consumer deflation persisted, the property sector continued to deteriorate (Country Garden's formal default resolution, local government debt stress), and investors rotated to defensive high-dividend trades (Banks, Utilities, Appliances near flat). SHCOMP fell -11.9%; the tape was value-biased (value beat growth by 5.5pp) with Banks (-0.1%), Appliances (-3.8%) and Utilities (-6.1%) leading. Retail dropped -24.2%, ranking 23rd of 31, as ongoing deflation and weak consumer confidence suppressed discretionary spending expectations; the structural overhang from the 2022-2024 e-commerce de-rating remained intact.","body_zh":"2月反弹消退后，消费通缩延续、地产持续恶化（碧桂园正式违约处置、地方政府债务压力）、投资者转向防御高股息策略（银行、公用事业、家电近平盘），市场进入长期盘整/回调。上证综指下行-11.9%，价值偏向（价值跑赢成长5.5pp），银行（-0.1%）、家电（-3.8%）、公用事业（-6.1%）领跑。商贸下跌-24.2%，排名第23/31，消费通缩和信心疲弱持续压制可选消费预期；2022-2024年电商估值重压的结构性悬顶未能解除。","drivers":["consumer deflation persistence","property sector deterioration","defensive dividend rotation","weak consumer confidence","e-commerce structural de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["消费通缩延续","地产持续恶化","防御高股息轮动","消费信心疲弱","电商结构性估值压制"],"title":"Deflation & property overhang; value rotation hurts retail","title_zh":"通缩与地产悬压，价值轮动下商贸跑输"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced an unprecedented stimulus package: a 50bp RRR cut releasing CNY 1 trillion in liquidity, a 20bp repo rate cut to 1.5%, a 50bp cut to existing mortgage rates, the minimum down-payment for second homes cut from 25% to 15%, and new equity market stabilisation tools. The Politburo on September 26 explicitly endorsed stock market support. SHCOMP surged +24.6%; Retail exploded +73.4%, ranking #1 of 31, as the policy bazooka directly targeted domestic consumption recovery and real-estate stabilisation, re-rating consumer platform stocks most aggressively.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人行行长潘功胜宣布罕见'一揽子'刺激政策：降准50bp释放1万亿元流动性、7天逆回购利率下调20bp至1.5%、存量房贷利率下调约50bp、二套房首付比例从25%降至15%，并新设证券、基金、保险公司互换便利以稳定股市。9月26日政治局会议明确表态支持资本市场。上证综指大涨+24.6%；商贸以+73.4%排名第1/31，一揽子政策直接指向国内消费复苏和地产企稳，消费互联网平台股重估最为猛烈。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut Sep-2024","repo rate cut 20bp","mortgage rate reduction","Politburo stock market endorsement","consumption/property stimulus"],"drivers_zh":["人行2024年9月降准50bp","逆回购利率下调20bp","存量房贷利率下调","政治局明确支持股市","消费/地产刺激政策"],"title":"PBOC bazooka; retail #1 in blowout rally","title_zh":"人行'一揽子'大招，商贸领涨73%"},"2024-12-16":{"body":"Trump's election victory in November 2024 and subsequent tariff escalation starting in early 2025 (culminating in a 145% tariff on all Chinese imports by April 7, 2025) triggered risk-off rotation. SHCOMP fell -8.6%, with defensives (-6.1%) outperforming cyclicals (-12.0%); Banks (+1.6%), Autos (-3.8%) and Metals (-5.0%) led. Retail collapsed -24.9% to rank last (#31/31): the sector's high exposure to domestic consumption expectations made it the most direct casualty of tariff-driven demand destruction fears, while concentrated retail-investor positions built after September 2024 amplified the selloff via margin call pressure.","body_zh":"特朗普2024年11月赢得大选，随后关税升级——2025年4月7日对所有中国进口商品征收高达145%关税——引发避险轮动。上证综指下跌-8.6%，防御类（-6.1%）跑赢周期类（-12.0%）；银行（+1.6%）、汽车（-3.8%）、有色（-5.0%）领跑。商贸暴跌-24.9%，排名末位（第31/31）：板块对国内消费预期高度敏感，成为关税驱动需求破坏的直接受害者，加之9月以来散户杠杆盘集中止损放大了跌幅。","drivers":["Trump tariff escalation 145% Apr-2025","trade war 2.0 demand destruction","flight-to-safety rotation","retail-investor margin calls","consumer sentiment collapse"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普关税升级至145%（2025年4月）","贸易战2.0需求破坏","避险轮动","散户融资盘止损","消费信心崩塌"],"title":"Trade war 2.0 panic; retail worst laggard again","title_zh":"贸易战2.0恐慌，商贸再度垫底"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"On May 12, 2025, the US and China announced a 90-day trade truce in Geneva: US tariffs were reduced from 145% to 30%, and China's tariffs on US goods fell from 125% to 10%. This triggered a broad relief rally, with SHCOMP surging +34.5% through January 2026. However, the rally was heavily concentrated in tech and commodity sectors: Telecoms (+124.2%), Metals (+114.8%) and Conglomerates (+90.1%) led, in a growth/momentum tape (growth beat value by 41.5pp). Retail gained +37.7%, ranking 13th of 31, roughly tracking the index but far below the Telecoms/Metals leaders; the tariff relief removed the acute demand-destruction overhang but did not trigger a sector-specific re-rating.","body_zh":"2025年5月12日，中美在日内瓦宣布90天贸易休战：美方将关税从145%降至30%，中方将对美关税从125%降至10%。宽松预期触发全面反弹，上证综指至2026年1月累涨+34.5%。但行情高度集中于科技及大宗商品：电信（+124.2%）、有色（+114.8%）、综合（+90.1%）领涨，呈成长动量风格（成长跑赢价值41.5pp）。商贸涨+37.7%，排名第13/31，基本跟随指数但远落后于电信/有色龙头；关税压力解除移除了需求破坏的悬压，但未触发板块独立重估。","drivers":["US-China Geneva trade truce May-2025","tariff reduction 145% to 30%","tech & metal sector leadership","growth momentum rotation","relief rally beta"],"drivers_zh":["中美日内瓦贸易休战2025年5月","关税从145%降至30%","科技/有色领涨","成长动量轮动","利好消息贝塔反弹"],"title":"US-China trade truce; tech & metals-led bull","title_zh":"中美贸易休战，科技与有色领跑牛市"},"2026-01-12":{"body":"From January 2026, global capital rotated sharply into AI hardware supply chains (semiconductors, telecoms infrastructure, data centre equipment), driving Electronics (+60.8%) and Telecoms (+62.9%) to massive gains while SHCOMP fell only -3.3%. Consumer platform stocks (Alibaba, JD.com, Meituan) delivered flat-to-negative returns as global funds concentrated exposure in AI winners, leaving China's consumer-facing internet names behind. Retail fell -34.4%, ranking 30th of 31, the worst underperformer alongside Media (-34.4%); deflation persistence and cautious consumer spending entering 2026 confirmed the structural drag is idiosyncratic rather than index-driven.","body_zh":"2026年1月起，全球资本大幅向AI硬件供应链（芯片、电信基础设施、数据中心设备）集中，带动电子（+60.8%）、电信（+62.9%）大涨，而上证综指仅跌-3.3%。阿里巴巴、京东、美团等消费互联网平台股收益平淡乃至下跌，全球资金集中于AI胜出方，中国消费互联网边缘化。商贸下跌-34.4%，排名第30/31，与传媒（-34.4%）并列最弱；通缩延续（CPI低于目标）及2026年初居民消费谨慎，证实板块拖累具有内生结构性而非指数驱动特征。","drivers":["AI hardware supply chain rotation","global funds abandoning consumer platforms","consumer deflation persistence","SHCOMP divergence from retail","platform stock structural de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["AI硬件供应链集中轮动","全球资金撤离消费互联网","消费通缩延续","上证综指与零售板块背离","平台股结构性估值压制"],"title":"AI rotation abandons retail; structural laggard","title_zh":"AI轮动抛离商贸，结构性跑输"}},"now":"Retail & Commerce (801200) is in a deep Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, sitting at just the 10th percentile of its historical range and ranked dead last (#31/31) in the Shenwan universe over the current leg. The sector is down -31.1% this leg while SHCOMP is only -3.3%, meaning the underperformance is structural rather than simple index beta. The now_ctx shows a pronounced growth/tech rotation: Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, and Building Materials +48.1% lead, while Retail sits alongside Beauty (-26.9%) and Agriculture (-26.3%) at the very bottom. Cyclicals (+0.3%) have broadly outperformed defensives (-12.1%), and Growth has beaten Value by 18.2pp, yet Retail has been left behind even in a risk-on tape, confirming that the sector's drag is idiosyncratic: weak domestic consumption, AI-driven capital rotation away from consumer platform stocks (Alibaba, JD, Meituan delivering flat-to-negative returns in 2026 as global funds favor AI hardware supply chain), and persistent household caution rather than a macro risk-off event.","now_zh":"商贸零售（801200）截至2026年6月下旬处于深度筑底阶段，位于历史区间后10%分位，在申万全行业排名垫底（第31/31）。本轮该板块累跌-31.1%，而上证综指仅-3.3%，显示跑输具有结构性特征。当前轮动背景下，科技成长主导市场（电子+75.5%、电信+67.7%、建材+48.1%领涨），周期优于防御（+0.3% vs -12.1%），成长跑赢价值18.2pp——但商贸在风险偏好回升环境中仍垫底，印证板块拖累来自内生因素：国内消费信心疲弱、资本向AI/科技链集中轮动（阿里巴巴、京东、美团2026年以来涨幅平淡乃至负数）、居民消费意愿持续低迷，而非宏观风险规避。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801210":{"legs":{"2012-01-16":{"body":"From January 2012 the market priced ongoing PBOC accommodation after the November 2011 RRR cut (the first easing in three years) and a further February 2012 RRR cut, as GDP growth slowed toward 8.1% in Q1 2012. In this risk-off environment -- SHCOMP fell -1.5% over the leg -- defensive sectors led decisively (defensives +20.3% vs cyclicals +5.6%): Consumer Services gained 27.1%, ranking #2 of 16 industries, alongside Food and Bev (+28.3%) and Pharma (+25.5%), while cyclicals (Steel -6.7%, Transport -2.7%, Retail -1.5%) dragged. The driver was flight-to-safety into domestically-oriented, earnings-resilient consumption businesses as export-led cyclicals faced a global slowdown and European debt-crisis overhang.","body_zh":"2011年11月央行三年来首次降准、2012年2月再度降准，2012年初市场已定价进一步宽松预期，同期GDP增速放缓至8.1%。在此风险规避环境下——上证综指本腿下跌-1.5%——防御板块大幅领先（防御股+20.3% vs 周期股+5.6%）：社会服务上涨27.1%，在16个行业中排名第2，与食品饮料（+28.3%）、医药（+25.5%）同列领涨，而钢铁（-6.7%）、交通运输（-2.7%）、零售（-1.5%）等周期股拖累明显。核心驱动力为全球经济放缓与欧债危机背景下资金向内需型、盈利稳定的消费业规避轮动。","drivers":["PBOC RRR easing 2011-12","EU debt crisis overhang","Flight-to-defensive","GDP slowdown pricing","Domestic demand resilience"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准宽松2011-12","欧债危机压制","避险防御轮动","GDP增速放缓定价","内需韧性"],"title":"PBOC Easing Lifts Defensive Growth Names","title_zh":"央行宽松托举防御型成长板块"},"2012-08-09":{"body":"After the defensive rally peaked in August 2012, capital rotated as the PBOC delivered two consecutive benchmark lending-rate cuts (June 8 and July 5, 2012 -- China's first cuts since 2008), signalling an active easing pivot. Consumer Services dropped -22.1%, ranking #14 of 16, as its prior defensive valuation premium eroded fastest. The SHCOMP fell -9.9% overall in a broad down-leg, but the distribution shows the most defensive consumption names (Food and Bev -26.9%, Textiles -25.2%) and Services bore the brunt while large-cap cyclicals (Appliances -1.9%, Real Estate -5.8%) held best -- a mean-reversion of the early-2012 defensive premium rather than sector-specific weakness.","body_zh":"2012年8月防御性行情见顶后，资金轮动，因央行于6月8日及7月5日连续两次下调基准贷款利率（2008年以来首次降息），发出积极宽松转向信号。社会服务回调-22.1%，在16个行业中排名第14，此前防御溢价收窄最快。上证综指本腿跌-9.9%属广泛下跌，但跌幅集中于防御消费类（食品饮料-26.9%、纺织-25.2%）与社会服务，而大盘周期股（家电-1.9%、房地产-5.8%）抗跌——本质是2012年初防御溢价的均值回归，而非板块特有疲软。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts June-July 2012","Defensive valuation mean-reversion","Easing-pivot rotation","Broad market down-leg","Consumption premium unwind"],"drivers_zh":["央行6-7月降息","防御股估值均值回归","宽松转向轮动","大盘系统性下跌","消费溢价收窄"],"title":"Rate-Cut Pivot Sparks Cyclical Rotation","title_zh":"降息转向引发周期股轮动"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"The Dec-2012-to-Jun-2015 mega-bull (+318.1%, SHCOMP +163.6%) was powered by a confluence of forces. The Nov 2012 18th Party Congress installed Xi Jinping and flagged market-oriented reform; the CSRC liberalised margin financing from 2013; ample liquidity with depressed wealth-management-product returns drove retail money into equities. From late 2014 the PBOC cut benchmark rates and RRR repeatedly (Nov 2014-2015), fuelling a retail-driven, margin-financed bubble. Consumer Services +318.1% (ranked #5 of 28) outpaced Banks (+97.2%) and Food and Bev (+105.5%) but trailed the leaders (Light Mfg +384%, Electronics +376.9%) -- consistent with the growth/liquidity tape (growth beat value by 34pp) where high-beta names were re-rated on earnings-leverage expectations.","body_zh":"2012年12月至2015年6月的超级牛市（+318.1%，上证综指+163.6%）由多重力量共同推动。2012年11月十八大确立习近平领导层并释放市场化改革信号；证监会自2013年放开融资融券；流动性宽裕叠加理财产品收益率低迷促使零售资金大举入市。2014年底起央行多次降息降准（2014年11月-2015年），放大杠杆资金，推动散户主导的加杠杆牛市。社会服务+318.1%（28个行业第5），跑赢银行（+97.2%）、食品饮料（+105.5%），但逊于领涨（轻工+384%、电子+376.9%），符合流动性驱动、成长占优（成长跑赢价值34pp）的行情特征。","drivers":["Xi Jinping reform era","PBOC rate/RRR cuts 2014-15","Margin financing liberalisation","Retail investor leverage","Growth/TMT style premium"],"drivers_zh":["习近平改革时代","央行降息降准2014-15","融资融券开放","散户加杠杆","成长/TMT风格溢价"],"title":"Leverage-Fuelled Mega-Bull; Xi Reform Era Begins","title_zh":"杠杆驱动超级牛市；习近平改革时代开启"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the CSRC published draft rules banning new shadow-financed margin accounts and tightening oversight of grey-market leverage, triggering forced deleveraging across the entire market. Shadow-financed margin debt had swelled toward CNY 1-1.4 trillion; broker margin hikes and account closures created a self-reinforcing fire-sale dynamic. Consumer Services dropped -40.6% (ranked #13 of 28), broadly tracking the SHCOMP's -32.1% crash; defensives (-30.4%) held better than cyclicals (-43.0%) -- Services sat between, suffering the beta unwind of a previously high-flying growth play.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会发布草案禁止新增场外配资账户并加强灰色杠杆监管，引发全市场强制去杠杆。彼时场外配资规模约1万亿至1.4万亿元，券商上调保证金与强制平仓形成自我强化的踩踏机制。社会服务下跌-40.6%（28个行业第13），跟随上证综指-32.1%的暴跌；防御股（-30.4%）优于周期股（-43.0%），社会服务居中，承受前期高位成长股的Beta抛压。","drivers":["CSRC margin curb June 2015","Shadow-finance forced deleveraging","Margin call cascade","Beta unwind","Broad market crash"],"drivers_zh":["证监会场外配资禁令","场外融资强制去杠杆","保证金补缴踩踏","高Beta集中抛售","大盘系统性暴跌"],"title":"Margin Debt Bust: CSRC Shadow-Finance Curb","title_zh":"融资盘崩盘：证监会禁止场外配资"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"On July 8, 2015 China launched a sweeping market stabilisation package: the PBOC provided liquidity, more than 1,400 stocks were halted (suspending roughly half the market), the national team (Central Huijin plus state funds) began direct purchases, and IPOs were suspended. The bounce lifted Consumer Services +31.4% (ranked #6 of 28). Cyclicals led this rebound (+32.2% vs defensives +15.0%), with Coal +102% and Defense +74.3% leading -- typical state-rescue bounces favour beaten-down cyclicals and state-linked names -- while the SHCOMP recovered +12.0%.","body_zh":"2015年7月8日，国家启动大规模救市：央行注入流动性、逾1400只股票停牌（近半市场停牌）、中央汇金与国家队基金直接入场托底，并暂停IPO。反弹中社会服务上涨+31.4%（28个行业第6）。周期股领涨（+32.2% vs 防御股+15.0%），煤炭（+102%）、国防（+74.3%）居前——国家队救市反弹惯例是周期股与国企股更受提振，上证综指收复+12.0%。","drivers":["State rescue package July 2015","National team direct buying","IPO suspension","Trading halts/short-sale curbs","Cyclical rebound beta"],"drivers_zh":["2015年7月国家救市","国家队直接入场","暂停IPO","大面积停牌/限制卖空","周期股反弹Beta"],"title":"State Rescue Bounce; Cyclicals Lead Recovery","title_zh":"国家队救市反弹；周期股领涨"},"2015-08-11":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC abruptly devalued the RMB by ~1.9% -- the largest single-day move in two decades -- followed by further weakening over subsequent days. Markets read this as a signal of deep economic stress, feeding into Black Monday on August 24 when the SHCOMP fell 8.5%. Consumer Services dropped -30.1% (ranked #15 of 28), with defensives again outperforming cyclicals (-19.9% vs -30.3%) as the SHCOMP shed -23.5%. The devaluation shock compounded post-crash fragility and catalysed a second deleveraging wave, hitting growth/consumer names hardest (Computers -34.6%, Defense -41.8%).","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行突然将人民币一次性贬值约1.9%，创二十年最大单日贬幅，随后数日进一步走弱。市场将此解读为经济深层压力信号，叠加触发8月24日'黑色星期一'（上证综指单日跌8.5%）。社会服务下跌-30.1%（28个行业第15），防御股（-19.9%）再度优于周期股（-30.3%），上证综指-23.5%。贬值冲击放大了后救市阶段的脆弱性，触发第二轮去杠杆，尤其重创成长/消费类（计算机-34.6%、国防-41.8%）。","drivers":["PBoC CNY devaluation Aug 11","Black Monday panic","Second deleveraging wave","Capital outflow fears","Risk-off growth selloff"],"drivers_zh":["央行8月11日汇改贬值","黑色星期一恐慌","第二轮去杠杆","资本外流担忧","成长股风险规避抛售"],"title":"PBoC CNY Devaluation Triggers Second Crash","title_zh":"央行人民币贬值触发第二轮暴跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"With the PBOC having cut rates on August 25 (the fifth cut in the cycle) and stabilisation policies still in force, markets staged a secondary recovery from mid-September. The Sep-to-Dec 2015 rally lifted Consumer Services +50.8% (ranked #4 of 28), with Computers (+61.3%), Electronics (+52.0%), and Telecoms (+51.0%) leading -- a broad TMT/growth-style rebound. Growth beat value by 16.6pp and cyclicals (+32.8%) outperformed defensives (+23.2%), with the SHCOMP up +21.2%. The rally was fundamentally liquidity-driven: fresh money on expectations of continued PBOC easing and National Team support, not a fundamental demand recovery.","body_zh":"2015年8月25日央行降息（本轮第五次），叠加维稳政策持续，市场从9月中旬展开二次反弹。本轮社会服务上涨+50.8%（28个行业第4），计算机（+61.3%）、电子（+52.0%）、通信（+51.0%）领涨——典型TMT/成长风格反弹，成长跑赢价值16.6pp，周期股（+32.8%）优于防御股（+23.2%），上证综指+21.2%。行情本质由流动性驱动：新增资金入场期待央行持续宽松与国家队托底，而非基本面需求修复。","drivers":["PBOC 5th rate cut Aug 25","National Team ongoing support","TMT growth re-rating","Liquidity-driven rebound","Value-to-growth rotation"],"drivers_zh":["央行第五次降息8月25日","国家队持续托底","TMT成长重新定价","流动性驱动反弹","价值转成长轮动"],"title":"TMT/Growth Rebound on Policy Stabilisation","title_zh":"政策维稳后TMT/成长风格反弹"},"2015-12-21":{"body":"China launched a market-wide circuit-breaker on January 4, 2016; it tripped twice in the first week (January 4 and 7) and was suspended within four trading days after proving counterproductive. Simultaneously the PBOC set the CNY midpoint at multi-year lows, amplifying capital-flight fears. Consumer Services fell -30.1% (ranked #10 of 28), with the SHCOMP down -27.1%; defensives held better (-25.9%) than cyclicals (-30.2%), while growth-oriented names (Media -33.9%, Computers -34.9%, Conglom -36.3%) bore the brunt.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日，中国推行全市场熔断机制，首周即连续两次触发（1月4日与7日），四个交易日后因适得其反被叫停。与此同时，央行将人民币中间价设于多年低位，加剧资本外流恐慌。社会服务下跌-30.1%（28个行业第10），上证综指-27.1%；防御股（-25.9%）优于周期股（-30.2%），成长类（传媒-33.9%、计算机-34.9%、综合-36.3%）跌幅居前。","drivers":["Circuit-breaker backfire Jan 2016","CNY multi-year low","Capital flight amplification","Policy credibility shock","Growth/TMT unwind"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制适得其反","人民币创多年新低","资本外流放大","政策公信力受损","成长/TMT估值杀跌"],"title":"Circuit-Breaker Panic; CNY Hits Multi-Year Low","title_zh":"熔断机制适得其反；人民币创多年新低"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"The Jan-2016-to-May-2018 rally (+23.4% for Consumer Services, ranked #8 of 28) was a structurally distinct, value-led cycle (value beat growth by 22.6pp): regulators curbed leverage and speculation, and institutions tilted hard to large-cap quality. Food and Bev (+129.4%) and Appliances (+79.6%) dominated, driven by inflows via the Shenzhen-Hong Kong Stock Connect (Dec 2016) and MSCI A-share inclusion (achieved June 2017). Growth/TMT (Conglom -19.3%, Media -34.0%) was actively de-rated. Consumer Services (+23.4%) modestly beat the SHCOMP (+16.6%) but materially lagged the leading white-horse consumption brands -- catering/tourism/entertainment lacked the premium brand moats institutions prized.","body_zh":"2016年1月至2018年5月的反弹（社会服务+23.4%，28个行业第8）是结构上截然不同的价值主导周期（价值跑赢成长22.6pp）：监管层打压杠杆与投机，机构重仓大市值白马。食品饮料（+129.4%）、家电（+79.6%）主导，受益于深港通开通（2016年12月）及MSCI纳入A股（2017年6月实现）。成长/TMT（综合-19.3%、传媒-34.0%）遭主动降级。社会服务（+23.4%）小幅跑赢上证综指（+16.6%），但明显落后于领涨的白马消费品牌——餐饮/旅游/娱乐缺乏机构青睐的高壁垒品牌护城河。","drivers":["White-Horse institutional preference","Stock Connect foreign inflows","MSCI inclusion","Leverage/speculation crackdown","Quality/value style premium"],"drivers_zh":["白马股机构偏好","沪深港通外资流入","MSCI纳入A股","监管打压杠杆","质量/价值风格溢价"],"title":"White-Horse Value Cycle; Services Lags Staples","title_zh":"白马价值周期；社会服务落后于消费品牌"},"2018-05-31":{"body":"The May-to-October 2018 selloff (-31.3%) was driven by two compounding shocks: the US released its list of 10% tariffs on $200 billion of Chinese goods (July 10, 2018) atop the earlier $50 billion tranche, while Beijing ran an aggressive domestic deleveraging campaign (asset-management rules tightened, shadow banking squeezed, credit growth slowed). Consumer Services fell -31.3% (ranked #21 of 28), far worse than the value safe-havens that led the leg (Coal 0%, Banks -1.8%, Steel -7.5%). Notably the broad defensive/cyclical split was roughly even (defensives -23.1% vs cyclicals -20.9%), so the punishing factor was specifically the de-rating of growth/discretionary names (Pharma -34.6%, Light Mfg -34.6%) versus value -- Services lagged the SHCOMP (-17.9%) by ~13pp as the trade war threatened discretionary spending via cost-push and confidence.","body_zh":"2018年5月至10月的下跌（-31.3%）由两大冲击叠加驱动：美国于7月10日公布对2000亿美元中国商品加征10%关税清单（叠加此前500亿美元批次），同期北京开展大力度国内去杠杆（资管新规收紧、影子银行整治、信贷增速放缓）。社会服务跌-31.3%（28个行业第21），远逊于本腿领涨的价值避险板块（煤炭0%、银行-1.8%、钢铁-7.5%）。值得注意的是，防御/周期整体跌幅相近（防御-23.1% vs 周期-20.9%），真正的压制因素是成长/可选类相对价值的估值杀跌（医药-34.6%、轻工-34.6%）——社会服务较上证综指（-17.9%）超跌约13pp，贸易战通过成本传导与信心冲击直接压制可选消费。","drivers":["US tariffs $200B July 2018","Domestic deleveraging campaign","Credit tightening","Value safe-haven leadership","Growth/discretionary de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["美国2000亿关税2018年7月","国内去杠杆运动","信用收紧","价值避险板块领先","成长/可选估值杀跌"],"title":"US-China Trade War Tariffs; Deleveraging","title_zh":"中美贸易战关税；去杠杆"},"2018-10-29":{"body":"The Oct-2018-to-Jan-2020 recovery (+49.0%, ranked #7 of 28) began as the market priced a US-China trade truce after the G20 Trump-Xi dinner (December 1, 2018 in Buenos Aires), reinforced by PBOC RRR cuts (Jan 2019) and Politburo pledges of targeted support. Food and Bev (+86.4%) and Electronics (+84.4%) led, with a 27.8pp growth-over-value premium; Consumer Services (+49.0%) tracked the broader consumption recovery. The US-China Phase One deal was signed January 15, 2020, and the PBOC cut RRR again in early 2020, extending the supportive regime through the January 2020 peak.","body_zh":"2018年10月至2020年1月的复苏（+49.0%，28个行业第7）始于市场定价中美贸易休战——2018年12月1日特朗普与习近平在布宜诺斯艾利斯G20晚宴达成暂停升级协议，随后央行于2019年1月降准，政治局承诺定向支持。食品饮料（+86.4%）与电子（+84.4%）领涨，成长跑赢价值27.8pp；社会服务（+49.0%）跟随大消费复苏。2020年1月15日中美第一阶段协议签署，央行年初再度降准，宽松窗口延续至2020年1月见顶。","drivers":["Trump-Xi G20 truce Dec 2018","PBOC RRR cut Jan 2019","Phase One deal Jan 2020","Growth/consumer re-rating","Targeted policy support"],"drivers_zh":["中美G20停战2018年12月","央行2019年1月降准","第一阶段协议2020年1月","成长/消费重新定价","定向政策支持"],"title":"Trade Truce; PBOC Easing Lifts Consumer Growth","title_zh":"贸易休战；央行宽松提振消费成长股"},"2020-01-10":{"body":"Consumer Services was the single worst-performing Shenwan industry this leg (ranked #28 of 28, -23.7%), because COVID-19 directly destroyed its core revenue streams: catering, entertainment, tourism, and leisure. Wuhan was locked down January 23, 2020; cinemas were ordered shut January 25 and nationwide restaurant revenues collapsed. Agriculture (+9.5%) and Pharma (+5.5%) -- pandemic beneficiaries -- led while the SHCOMP fell -11.1% overall. The extreme underperformance versus the index (-12.6pp) captures the sector's unique vulnerability: unlike manufacturing or finance, Consumer Services cannot shift to remote work or defer revenues.","body_zh":"社会服务在本腿为28个行业中跌幅最深（-23.7%，排名第28），因COVID-19直接摧毁其核心收入来源：餐饮、娱乐、旅游、休闲。2020年1月23日武汉封城，1月25日院线停业，全国餐饮收入崩塌。农林牧渔（+9.5%）、医药（+5.5%）等疫情受益板块领涨，上证综指整体跌-11.1%。社会服务较指数超跌12.6pp，凸显其独特脆弱性——不同于制造或金融，服务业无法转为远程或推迟创收。","drivers":["COVID-19 Wuhan lockdown Jan 23","Catering/tourism revenue collapse","Cinema/venue shutdown","Pandemic defensive rotation","Direct consumption demand destruction"],"drivers_zh":["新冠封城2020年1月23日","餐饮旅游收入崩塌","院线/场馆停业","疫情防御轮动","消费需求直接毁灭"],"title":"COVID-19 Wuhan Lockdown; Services Worst Hit","title_zh":"新冠武汉封城；社会服务跌幅最深"},"2020-03-31":{"body":"Consumer Services became the #1 performing Shenwan industry (ranked #1 of 28, +130.1%) as China's early-mover advantage in COVID reopening crystallised. Wuhan lifted its lockdown April 8, 2020; authorities announced July 16 that cinemas could reopen from July 20; catering turnover steadily recovered. The PBOC injected liquidity and cut LPR (April 20, etc.) while retail investors flooded back. The +130.1% gain far outpaced the #2 sector (Food and Bev +50.9%) and the SHCOMP (+20.4%), driven by the extreme operational leverage of previously shuttered venues.","body_zh":"社会服务成为28个行业中涨幅第一（+130.1%），核心驱动力为中国全球最早复工复产的先发优势。武汉4月8日解封，监管7月16日宣布院线可于7月20日起恢复营业，餐饮营业额持续回升。央行注入流动性并下调LPR（4月20日等），散户大举回流。+130.1%的涨幅远超第二名食品饮料（+50.9%）与上证综指（+20.4%），反映停业复工后极高的经营杠杆弹性。","drivers":["Wuhan lockdown lift April 8","Cinema reopening from July 20","PBOC LPR cuts/liquidity","Retail investor surge","Operational leverage snap-back"],"drivers_zh":["武汉解封4月8日","院线7月20日起复工","央行LPR降息/注入流动性","散户大举入场","经营杠杆弹性释放"],"title":"COVID Reopening Snap-Back; Services Ranks #1","title_zh":"疫后复工快速反弹；社会服务领涨全市场"},"2020-07-31":{"body":"By late July 2020, markets entered a mild rotation as the COVID reopening premium was fully priced for consumer services. Autos (+14.2%), Power Equipment (+9.9%), and Banks (+7.0%) led the new leg -- a cyclical recovery tilt -- while Services (-18.4%) was the worst of all 28 industries. The SHCOMP fell only -1.7%, meaning Services underperformed the index by 16.7pp in pure sector-rotation terms. Q3 2020 brought no new demand catalyst for services (international COVID waves capped outbound travel, no fresh domestic stimulus) while industrial recovery supplied the new upside narrative.","body_zh":"2020年7月下旬，疫后复工溢价已被完全定价，市场进入温和轮动。汽车（+14.2%）、电力设备（+9.9%）、银行（+7.0%）领涨新一轮周期复苏，而社会服务（-18.4%）成为全部28个行业中跌幅最大。上证综指仅小跌-1.7%，社会服务较指数超跌16.7pp，属纯粹行业轮动。Q3 2020服务业缺乏新需求催化（国际第二波疫情压制出境，国内未有新刺激），而工业复苏提供了新的上行叙事。","drivers":["COVID reopening premium exhausted","Industrial recovery rotation","Cyclical leadership","No new services demand catalyst","Sector-rotation profit-taking"],"drivers_zh":["复工溢价消化殆尽","工业复苏轮动","周期主导","服务业缺乏新需求催化","行业轮动获利了结"],"title":"Reopening Premium Exhausted; Rotation to Cyclicals","title_zh":"复工溢价耗尽；资金转向周期股"},"2020-10-27":{"body":"Consumer Services again ranked #1 of 28 (+68.5%) from late October 2020 to February 2021, driven by two sequential catalysts: Pfizer announced ~90% vaccine efficacy on November 9, 2020, sparking global recovery trades; and China's Spring Festival 2021 (February 12) drove pre-positioning in domestic leisure, catering, tourism, and hospitality names. Food and Bev (+42.1%) and Power Equipment (+39.8%) also led, while the SHCOMP gained +12.3%. The value tilt of the leg (value beat growth by 9.7pp) was atypical for Services -- it benefited from the cyclical reopening of domestic leisure rather than a pure growth premium.","body_zh":"2020年10月下旬至2021年2月，社会服务再度位列28个行业第一（+68.5%），由两大顺序催化驱动：2020年11月9日辉瑞宣布疫苗有效率约90%，全球复苏交易升温；2021年春节（2月12日）临近，国内休闲、餐饮、旅游、酒店类资金提前布局。食品饮料（+42.1%）、电力设备（+39.8%）亦领涨，上证综指+12.3%。本腿价值跑赢成长9.7pp——对社会服务而言属异常，折射国内休闲消费周期性重启而非纯粹成长溢价。","drivers":["Pfizer vaccine Nov 9 2020","Spring Festival 2021 pre-positioning","Domestic leisure reopening","Global recovery trade","Holiday consumption expectations"],"drivers_zh":["辉瑞疫苗11月9日","春节2021提前布局","国内休闲消费重启","全球复苏交易","节假日消费预期"],"title":"Vaccine News and Spring Festival Pre-Loading","title_zh":"疫苗消息与春节旺季提前布局"},"2021-02-10":{"body":"From February 10, 2021, a sharp rotation from growth/consumer to commodity cyclicals erased the services premium. Steel (+23.0%), Utilities (+15.5%), and Textiles (+10.6%) led as China's industrial output surged (commodity prices spiked globally in early 2021) and the PBOC signalled an end to pandemic-era accommodation (M2 targeted lower, reverse-repo volumes trimmed). Consumer Services fell -21.9% (worst performer, #28 of 28) alongside Power Equipment (-20.4%) and Food and Bev (-19.9%). The SHCOMP fell -7.1%, but the rotation was even more punishing for consumer-growth names (value beat growth by 6.3pp).","body_zh":"2021年2月10日起，市场从成长/消费向大宗商品周期股急剧切换，社会服务溢价快速收窄。钢铁（+23.0%）、公用事业（+15.5%）、纺织（+10.6%）领涨，因中国工业产出大幅提升（2021年初大宗商品价格全球走强），同时央行释放退出宽松信号（M2增速目标下调、逆回购规模收缩）。社会服务跌-21.9%（28个行业垫底），与电力设备（-20.4%）、食品饮料（-19.9%）同列最弱。上证综指跌-7.1%，但消费成长类受轮动冲击更剧（价值跑赢成长6.3pp）。","drivers":["Steel/commodity cycle surge","PBOC tightening signal","Growth-to-value rotation","Consumer premium mean-reversion","Post-holiday sector unwind"],"drivers_zh":["钢铁/大宗商品周期走强","央行收紧信号","成长转价值轮动","消费溢价均值回归","节后板块退潮"],"title":"Commodity Surge and PBOC Tightening Signal","title_zh":"大宗商品飙升与央行收紧信号"},"2021-04-13":{"body":"A brief but sharp recovery (+19.2%, ranked #1 of 28) ran from mid-April to late May 2021, catalysed by pre-holiday positioning ahead of the May Day Golden Week (May 1-5, 2021). Domestic travel, catering, and entertainment stocks benefited from China's zero-COVID containment providing a stable domestic consumption environment. Food and Bev (+15.4%) and Pharma (+14.7%) joined the leadership while cyclicals (Construction -1.4%, Agriculture -3.0%) lagged. The defensive bias (defensives +8.6% vs cyclicals +4.5%) confirms this was a domestic-consumption rather than industrial theme.","body_zh":"2021年4月中旬至5月下旬出现短暂但强劲的反弹（+19.2%，28个行业第1），核心驱动为五一黄金周（5月1-5日）前资金提前布局。中国清零防控确保稳定的国内消费环境，国内旅游、餐饮、娱乐股受益。食品饮料（+15.4%）、医药（+14.7%）同步领涨，周期股（建筑-1.4%、农业-3.0%）滞涨。防御股（+8.6%）优于周期股（+4.5%）印证本轮为内需消费而非工业主题。","drivers":["May Day Golden Week pre-loading","Zero-COVID domestic stability","Holiday consumption positioning","Food and Bev correlation","Defensive consumption rotation"],"drivers_zh":["五一黄金周提前布局","清零政策维稳国内消费","节假日消费配置","食品饮料联动","防御消费轮动"],"title":"May Day Golden Week Pre-Loading; Services #1","title_zh":"五一黄金周提前布局；社会服务领涨"},"2021-05-27":{"body":"The May-2021-to-April-2022 leg was the sector's most damaging regulatory selloff (-41.3%, ranked dead last #31 of 31). The Common Prosperity campaign unleashed multi-sector crackdowns: the July 24, 2021 Double Reduction policy banned for-profit tutoring of core school subjects (devastating education names like TAL and New Oriental), effectively destroying the private-tutoring market that was a major Consumer Services component. Concurrently, COVID resurgences triggered localised lockdowns hitting catering, cinema, and tourism. The SHCOMP fell -20.0%, but Services underperformed by 21.3pp -- its worst Shenwan relative lag in the full record.","body_zh":"2021年5月至2022年4月是板块史上最惨烈的监管打压周期（-41.3%，31个行业垫底）。'共同富裕'运动引发多行业整治：2021年7月24日'双减'政策禁止核心课程营利性校外培训（好未来、新东方暴跌），构成社会服务核心成分的教培市场几近摧毁；同期COVID反弹触发局部封控，重创餐饮、院线、旅游。上证综指跌-20.0%，但社会服务超跌21.3pp，创全部历史数据中对申万指数相对跌幅最大纪录。","drivers":["Double Reduction policy July 24 2021","Common Prosperity crackdown","Education sector destruction","COVID lockdown recurrences","Extreme regulatory uncertainty"],"drivers_zh":["双减政策2021年7月24日","共同富裕监管整治","教培行业摧毁","COVID局部封控反复","监管不确定性极度放大"],"title":"Common Prosperity Crackdown; Services Worst All Year","title_zh":"共同富裕整治；社会服务全年垫底"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"From late April 2022, the SHCOMP began pricing Shanghai's June 1 reopening after the two-month lockdown (imposed late March 2022). A broad risk-on bounce lifted the most beaten-down sectors: Power Equipment (+54.1%) and Autos (+46.0%) -- EV policy support and supply-chain relief -- led, with Consumer Services gaining +22.3% (ranked #8 of 31). The rally was cyclical/growth-tilted (cyclicals +22.2% vs defensives +13.3%, growth beat value by 8.8pp) as the SHCOMP recovered +17.7%. Services participation was genuine -- catering, cinema, and tourism recovered as Shanghai restrictions eased.","body_zh":"2022年4月下旬，市场开始定价上海6月1日解封（3月底以来的两个月封控）。大幅超跌板块领涨：电力设备（+54.1%）与汽车（+46.0%）——受益于新能源政策与供应链疏通——社会服务回升+22.3%（31个行业第8）。行情为周期/成长风格反弹（周期股+22.2% vs 防御股+13.3%，成长跑赢价值8.8pp），上证综指+17.7%。社会服务获得实质参与——上海解封后餐饮、院线、旅游明显回暖。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown lift June 1","EV policy support","Supply chain relief","Risk-on cyclical bounce","Zero-COVID exit anticipation"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封6月1日","新能源政策支持","供应链疏通","风险偏好周期反弹","清零退出预期"],"title":"Shanghai Lockdown Lift; EV Surge Leads Beta Bounce","title_zh":"上海解封；新能源车飙升引领Beta反弹"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"From July to October 2022, the global rate-shock environment (Fed hiked 75bp in June, July, and September) and renewed CNY weakness tightened Chinese financial conditions even as the PBOC held. Coal (+1.3%), Conglomerate (-0.7%), and Utilities (-1.8%) were the relative leaders -- a defensive/state-enterprise flight -- while growth/services names (Pharma -18.5%, Electronics -21.4%, Building Materials -25.6%) bore the brunt. Consumer Services fell -18.5% (ranked #27 of 31). The SHCOMP shed -12.3%, with consumer/growth names pressured by the rising global discount rate, weak consumer confidence, and ongoing COVID demand uncertainty.","body_zh":"2022年7月至10月，全球加息冲击（美联储6、7、9月各加息75bp）与人民币再度走软使中国金融条件收紧，即便央行按兵不动。煤炭（+1.3%）、综合（-0.7%）、公用事业（-1.8%）相对领先——防御/国企避险——而成长/服务类（医药-18.5%、电子-21.4%、建材-25.6%）跌幅居前。社会服务跌-18.5%（31个行业第27）。上证综指-12.3%，消费/成长板块受全球贴现率上升、消费信心疲弱与COVID需求不确定性多重压制。","drivers":["Fed 75bp hikes 2022","CNY weakening","Global rate shock","Defensive/state-enterprise flight","Consumer confidence deterioration"],"drivers_zh":["美联储75bp连续加息","人民币走软","全球利率冲击","防御/国企避险","消费信心恶化"],"title":"Global Rate Shock; Growth De-Rated","title_zh":"全球加息冲击；成长股估值杀跌"},"2022-10-11":{"body":"In late October 2022, Chinese stocks began pricing the end of zero-COVID as reopening rumours circulated; Beijing formally abandoned zero-COVID on December 7, 2022. Consumer Services gained +33.0% (ranked #3 of 31), alongside Computers (+43.4%) and Media (+33.1%) -- a growth-tilted rally (growth beat value by 12.2pp) where the market pre-loaded domestic consumption recovery, tourism, and entertainment. The SHCOMP rose +11.5%, and the Caixin Services PMI surged toward 55.0 by February 2023, well above its historical mean.","body_zh":"2022年10月下旬，市场开始定价清零终结——坊间盛传政策转向，12月7日北京正式宣布放弃清零。社会服务+33.0%（31个行业第3），与计算机（+43.4%）、传媒（+33.1%）共同领涨——成长风格主导（成长跑赢价值12.2pp），市场大量预加载国内消费复苏、旅游与娱乐预期。上证综指+11.5%，财新服务业PMI于2023年2月升至55.0，远高于历史均值。","drivers":["Zero-COVID exit Dec 7 2022","Domestic consumption pre-loading","Tourism/entertainment re-rating","Growth-style outperformance","Services PMI surge"],"drivers_zh":["清零退出2022年12月7日","国内消费预加载","旅游/娱乐重新定价","成长风格占优","服务业PMI飙升"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit Rally; Reopening Optimism Surges","title_zh":"清零政策退出行情；重开预期飙升"},"2023-03-06":{"body":"From March 2023 the post-reopening euphoria faded as fundamental demand disappointed: the anticipated consumption supercycle did not materialise, household savings stayed elevated, youth unemployment hit a record 21.3% in June 2023, and the property crisis intensified (Country Garden missed dollar-bond payments in August 2023). Consumer Services fell -43.6% (ranked #29 of 31 -- near worst), alongside Beauty (-44.3%) and Power Equipment (-45.1%). Coal (+3.0%) and Banks (-1.7%) led defensively (defensives -18.1% vs cyclicals -27.0%) as the SHCOMP shed -18.7%. The 11-month selloff reflected a structural rather than cyclical de-rating.","body_zh":"2023年3月起，疫后复苏热情消退，基本面需求持续令人失望：预期中的消费超级周期未能兑现，居民储蓄率居高不下，2023年6月青年失业率创历史新高21.3%，房地产危机加剧（碧桂园8月美元债逾期）。社会服务跌-43.6%（31个行业第29，近乎垫底），与美容护理（-44.3%）、电力设备（-45.1%）同列最弱。煤炭（+3.0%）、银行（-1.7%）防御领先（防御股-18.1% vs 周期股-27.0%），上证综指-18.7%。这场长达11个月的下跌折射出结构性而非周期性的估值重估。","drivers":["Reopening consumption disappointment","Youth unemployment 21.3% June 2023","Country Garden default Aug 2023","Deflation/property crisis","Defensive value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["重开后消费不及预期","青年失业率创新高2023年6月","碧桂园违约2023年8月","通缩/房地产危机","防御价值轮动"],"title":"Reopening Euphoria Fades; Deflation Reality Bites","title_zh":"重开热情消退；通缩现实浮现"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The February 2024 trough was directly arrested by national-team intervention: Central Huijin announced in early February it would resolutely ramp up ETF buying after the CSI 300 tumbled to five-year lows. Consumer Services gained +27.7% (ranked #9 of 31 in a cyclical/growth-led tape), while Computers (+41.0%), Media (+40.1%), and Telecoms (+35.2%) led. Growth beat value by 17.8pp and cyclicals (+18.3%) beat defensives (+11.4%), with the SHCOMP +13.9% as the state floor created a platform for a broadly risk-on rebound.","body_zh":"2024年2月的市场触底直接得益于国家队干预：中央汇金2月初宣布将坚决加大ETF增持力度，此前沪深300已跌至五年低点。社会服务+27.7%（31个行业第9），计算机（+41.0%）、传媒（+40.1%）、通信（+35.2%）领涨成长/周期风格。成长跑赢价值17.8pp，周期股（+18.3%）优于防御股（+11.4%），上证综指+13.9%——国家队筑底后催生全面风险偏好反弹。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF buying Feb 2024","National team market floor","Growth/cyclical risk-on rebound","State-backed support pivot","CSI 300 ETF inflows"],"drivers_zh":["汇金2024年2月大举买入ETF","国家队筑底","成长/周期风险偏好反弹","国家托底政策转向","沪深300 ETF资金流入"],"title":"National Team ETF Buying Floors the Market","title_zh":"国家队大举买入ETF托底市场"},"2024-03-21":{"body":"From late March 2024, the market re-encountered structural headwinds as the national-team bounce failed to mask underlying demand weakness. Full-year 2024 CPI rose only ~0.2% (vs the ~3% target), Evergrande was ordered liquidated in January 2024, and services consumption slowed in H2 2024. Banks (-0.7%), Appliances (-1.9%), and Utilities (-5.5%) led defensively while Consumer Services fell -26.6% (ranked #27 of 31), alongside Food and Bev (-28.5%) and Computers (-30.0%). The 6-month selloff (SHCOMP -11.7%) was a broad de-rating driven by deflationary pressure, property wealth destruction, and household income uncertainty.","body_zh":"2024年3月下旬，国家队反弹力度不足以掩盖需求结构性疲软，市场重新遭遇逆风。全年CPI仅涨约0.2%（目标约3%），恒大1月被颁令清盘，2024年下半年服务消费增速放缓。银行（-0.7%）、家电（-1.9%）、公用事业（-5.5%）防御领先，社会服务跌-26.6%（31个行业第27），与食品饮料（-28.5%）、计算机（-30.0%）同列较弱。这场6个月的下跌（上证综指-11.7%）是通缩压力、房地产财富损失与居民收入不确定性共同驱动的广泛估值重估。","drivers":["CPI ~0.2% deflation 2024","Evergrande liquidation Jan 2024","Property wealth destruction","Household income uncertainty","Structural demand disappointment"],"drivers_zh":["通缩CPI约0.2% 2024年","恒大清盘2024年1月","房地产财富损失","居民收入不确定性","结构性需求持续失望"],"title":"Weak Demand Data; Property Crisis Deepens","title_zh":"需求数据疲软；房地产危机深化"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a triple-cut package: 7-day reverse repo -20bp, RRR -50bp, and existing mortgage rates -50bp -- the first time all three were unveiled together. The CSI 300 surged ~16% in a single week, its best since 2008. Consumer Services gained +56.1% (ranked #5 of 31), with Retail (+73.4%), Computers (+65.4%), and Conglomerates (+65.2%) leading. Growth beat value by 17.8pp and the SHCOMP gained +24.6%, in a broad cyclical/growth risk-on surge that treated discretionary services as a key beneficiary of any demand reflation.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布三重宽松组合：7天逆回购降20bp、存准率降50bp、存量房贷利率降50bp——三箭首次同日齐发。沪深300单周大涨约16%，创2008年以来最大单周涨幅。社会服务+56.1%（31个行业第5），零售（+73.4%）、计算机（+65.4%）、综合（+65.2%）领涨。成长跑赢价值17.8pp，上证综指+24.6%——全面周期/成长风险偏好飙升将消费可选服务视为需求再通胀的核心受益方向。","drivers":["PBOC triple-cut Sept 24 2024","RRR -50bp, repo -20bp, mortgage -50bp","CSI 300 +16% single week","Consumption reflation expectations","Broad risk-on cyclical surge"],"drivers_zh":["央行三重宽松9月24日2024","降准50bp+逆回购降20bp+存量房贷降50bp","沪深300单周涨16%","消费再通胀预期","全面风险偏好周期上涨"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Sep 24: Rate/RRR/Mortgage Triple Cut","title_zh":"央行9.24超级宽松：三箭齐发"},"2024-12-16":{"body":"By December 2024, the September stimulus euphoria was fading: services consumption slowed into early 2025, consumer inflation stayed flat, and PPI remained in deflation. Consumer Services fell -21.7% -- ranked dead last of all 31 industries -- with Retail (-19.4%) and Media (-20.1%) close behind. Banks (+1.4%) and Appliances (-0.1%) led defensively as the SHCOMP fell -6.4%. The rapid -21.7% reversal in roughly a month captured the market's recognition that the Sep-24 bazooka had not triggered a durable demand cycle.","body_zh":"2024年12月，9月刺激热情快速消退：服务消费增速放缓至2025年初，消费者通胀接近零，PPI维持通缩。社会服务跌-21.7%，在31个行业中再度垫底，零售（-19.4%）、传媒（-20.1%）紧随其后。银行（+1.4%）、家电（-0.1%）防御领先，上证综指-6.4%。约一个月内-21.7%的急速逆转，折射市场认识到9.24宽松未能触发持久需求周期。","drivers":["Stimulus-fade demand disappointment","Consumer inflation flat/PPI deflation","Services consumption slowdown","Services worst Shenwan rank","Rapid reversion from spike"],"drivers_zh":["刺激效应消退需求失望","CPI近零/PPI通缩","服务消费放缓","申万行业垫底","脉冲行情快速均值回归"],"title":"Stimulus Fade; Services Worst of All 31 Industries","title_zh":"刺激效应消退；社会服务31行业垫底"},"2025-01-10":{"body":"The Jan-2025-to-Jan-2026 rally (+31.4%, ranked #16 of 31 -- mid-table) was driven by China equities re-rating on DeepSeek's January 2025 model release, which demonstrated competitive AI at a fraction of Western cost and triggered a major revaluation of Chinese tech. Metals (+127.8%), Telecoms (+101.7%), and Electronics (+74.6%) led by huge margins; the SHCOMP rose +30.5% (cyclicals +42.1% vs defensives +9.5%, growth beat value by 30.6pp). Consumer Services, at +31.4%, was roughly in line with the index but significantly underperformed the tech/AI/infrastructure leadership -- the rally was driven by the AI theme and commodity-export momentum, not domestic consumption recovery.","body_zh":"2025年1月至2026年1月的反弹（+31.4%，31个行业第16——中等偏上）由DeepSeek 2025年1月发布大模型驱动，其以极低成本实现具竞争力的AI水平，引发中国科技股整体重新定价。金属（+127.8%）、通信（+101.7%）、电子（+74.6%）大幅领跑；上证综指+30.5%（周期股+42.1% vs 防御股+9.5%，成长跑赢价值30.6pp）。社会服务+31.4%与指数基本同步，但显著落后于科技/AI/基础设施龙头——本轮由AI主题与大宗商品出口动能驱动，而非国内消费复苏。","drivers":["DeepSeek AI release Jan 2025","China tech competitiveness re-rating","Metals/telecoms/electronics leadership","AI infrastructure theme","Consumer services mid-table participation"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek发布2025年1月","中国科技竞争力重新定价","金属/通信/电子领涨","AI基础设施主题","社会服务中等跟涨"],"title":"DeepSeek Shock Lifts China; Services Trails Growth","title_zh":"DeepSeek冲击提振中国；社会服务落后科技主线"},"2026-01-23":{"body":"From January 23, 2026, as the SHCOMP gave back -2.6% over the leg, Consumer Services fell -24.7% (ranked #26 of 31), continuing to underperform in a narrow AI/hardware rotation. Telecoms (+68.6%), Electronics (+55.0%), and Building Materials (+33.7%) led -- supply-chain and infrastructure plays -- while Beauty (-30.1%), Media (-32.0%), and Retail (-33.3%) lagged alongside Services. Growth beat value by 14.2pp despite a slightly negative market, confirming a concentrated rotation into AI-infrastructure winners at the expense of consumer discretionary. Services suffers from both the active rotation away from it and continued deflation/structural demand softness.","body_zh":"2026年1月23日起，上证综指本腿小跌-2.6%，社会服务跌-24.7%（31个行业第26），在窄幅AI/硬件轮动中持续跑输。通信（+68.6%）、电子（+55.0%）、建材（+33.7%）领涨——均为产业链与基础设施逻辑——而美容护理（-30.1%）、传媒（-32.0%）、零售（-33.3%）与社会服务同处最弱。市场略跌背景下成长跑赢价值14.2pp，证实资金高度集中于AI基础设施赛道，以牺牲消费可选板块为代价。社会服务同时承受主动轮动离场与持续通缩/结构性需求疲软的双重打压。","drivers":["AI/hardware concentrated rotation","Telecoms/electronics dominance 2026","Consumer discretionary rotation out","Deflation/structural demand soft","Growth-vs-value divergence"],"drivers_zh":["AI/硬件集中轮动","通信/电子2026年主导","消费可选被动减配","通缩/结构性需求疲软","成长vs价值分化"],"title":"AI Premium Narrows; Services Selloff in Rotation","title_zh":"AI溢价收窄；社会服务在轮动中持续下跌"}},"now":"Consumer Services (social services sector, code 801210) is in a confirmed trough/bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 25th of 31 Shenwan industries in the current leg with a -18.0% return. The tape is a classic AI-theme/hardware-growth rally: Electronics +75.5% and Telecoms +67.7% dominate while consumer-facing names (Retail -31.1%, Beauty -26.9%) are the hardest laggards alongside Services. The SHCOMP is barely positive at +1.6% but cyclicals (+0.3%) beat defensives (-12.1%) with a growth-minus-value spread of +18.2pp -- a narrow, theme-driven rotation into semiconductors and telecoms infrastructure, not a broad consumer recovery. Services faces a double squeeze: the post-Jan-2026 AI rerating actively pulls capital away from discretionary consumption names, while the structural demand overhang persists (household savings elevated, property wealth still deflating, consumer CPI near-flat). The sector sits below its 200-day average at the 20th historical percentile -- a position that has historically resolved higher once the AI/growth tape broadens or a consumer-stimulus catalyst re-prices domestic demand.","now_zh":"社会服务板块截至2026年6月下旬处于确认底部/筑底阶段，以-18.0%在31个申万一级行业中排名第25。本轮行情由AI主题与硬件科技主导——电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）强势领跑，而消费属性较强的零售（-31.1%）、美容护理（-26.9%）及社会服务均处最弱方阵。上证综指本轮仅涨+1.6%，但周期股（+0.3%）跑赢防御股（-12.1%），成长/价值溢价高达18.2pp，表明资金高度集中于科技主线而非消费复苏。社会服务双重承压：AI轮动持续抽离消费可选资金，结构性需求疲软（居民高储蓄、房地产财富缩水、CPI近零）尚未实质改善。板块处于200日均线下方、历史分位约20%区间，历史上该位置具备反弹潜力，但需等待AI行情扩散或消费刺激政策落地方能触发。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801230":{"legs":{"2012-01-05":{"body":"The PBOC delivered its first RRR cut since 2009 in late November 2011 and followed with a second in February 2012, releasing roughly 450 billion yuan and signalling a decisive pivot from the 2011 inflation-fighting tightening cycle. SHCOMP surged 14.3%, with cyclicals (+25.1%) decisively beating defensives (+17.2%) in a classic liquidity-expansion move. Conglomerates (+26.5%, rank 5/16) rode the broad easing wave alongside Metals and Electronics; growth only barely outpaced value (+5.5pp), confirming this was macro beta rather than sector-specific demand.","body_zh":"人民银行于2011年11月底实施2009年以来首次降准，并于2012年2月再次降准，合计释放约4500亿元流动性，标志着从2011年抗通胀紧缩周期的决定性转向。沪综指上涨14.3%，周期股（+25.1%）明显领先防御股（+17.2%），呈现典型的流动性扩张行情。综合板块（+26.5%，排名16只中第5）随金属、电子板块同步受益；成长风格仅小幅超越价值（+5.5pp），确认此次上涨主要为宏观贝塔驱动，而非板块特有需求。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts","monetary easing pivot","cyclical beta expansion","inflation retreat"],"drivers_zh":["降准释放流动性","货币政策转向宽松","周期贝塔扩张","通胀回落"],"title":"PBOC RRR cuts ignite broad beta rally","title_zh":"央行降准点燃全面贝塔行情"},"2012-03-13":{"body":"As the eurozone debt crisis deepened through mid-2012 and China's growth decelerated (Q2 2012 GDP slowed to 7.6%), the SHCOMP fell 20.2% over nine months. Defensives (-16.7%) significantly outperformed cyclicals (-23.8%) in a broad flight-to-safety rotation. Conglomerates (-30.5%, rank 11/16) experienced mid-pack declines consistent with their cyclical bias; Real Estate and Pharma held up best while Retail and Textiles bore the brunt of risk-off selling.","body_zh":"2012年中期欧元区债务危机持续深化，中国经济增速放缓（2012年二季度GDP增速降至7.6%），沪综指在9个月内下跌20.2%。防御股（-16.7%）明显跑赢周期股（-23.8），呈现全面的避险轮动格局。综合板块（-30.5%，排名16只中第11）跌幅居中，与其周期偏向一致；房地产和医药相对抗跌，零售和纺织服装跌幅最大。","drivers":["eurozone debt crisis spillover","China growth deceleration","global risk-off","flight to defensives"],"drivers_zh":["欧债危机溢出","中国经济增速下滑","全球风险规避","防御板块避险"],"title":"Euro crisis and China slowdown drag cyclicals","title_zh":"欧债危机与中国增速放缓拖累周期股"},"2012-12-03":{"body":"Following the 18th Party Congress in November 2012, markets priced in structural reform optimism under new leadership, unleashing a powerful growth-momentum rally. SHCOMP rose 18.6% but growth dramatically outpaced value by 49.1pp as investors rotated into Electronics (+67.2%), Pharma, and theme-driven small/mid caps. Conglomerates surged +42.5% (rank 3/16), outperforming as they attracted reform-concept speculation and as the IPO moratorium concentrated buying into existing liquid names. Defensives led cyclicals in total return, underscoring a growth-style rather than cyclical reflation narrative.","body_zh":"继2012年11月党的十八大后，市场对新一届领导层推进结构性改革抱有强烈预期，引发了强劲的成长动量行情。沪综指上涨18.6%，但成长风格大幅跑赢价值风格达49.1个百分点，资金涌入电子（+67.2%）、医药及主题性中小盘股。综合板块大涨+42.5%（排名16只中第3），受益于改革概念炒作以及新股发行暂停期间买盘集中效应。防御股整体回报高于周期股，印证此次行情由成长风格驱动，而非周期性再通胀。","drivers":["18th Party Congress reform hopes","growth/theme rotation","IPO moratorium liquidity","ChiNext momentum"],"drivers_zh":["十八大改革预期","成长/主题轮动","IPO暂停流动性集中","创业板动量"],"title":"Reform expectations and ChiNext growth surge","title_zh":"改革预期与创业板成长浪潮"},"2013-05-29":{"body":"In June 2013, the PBOC deliberately tightened interbank liquidity to punish shadow-banking excess: overnight SHIBOR spiked to 13.4% on June 20 and intraday to a record ~25-30%, a deliberate credit crunch signal. Simultaneously, Fed Chairman Bernanke's May 22 taper talk triggered EM risk-off globally. SHCOMP fell 14.8%, with defensives (-11.0%) materially outperforming cyclicals (-18.7%). Conglomerates (-19.0%, rank 13/16) lagged moderately, as growth names that had led the prior rally were hit hardest by the liquidity squeeze.","body_zh":"2013年6月，人民银行刻意收紧银行间流动性以惩治影子银行过度扩张：6月20日隔夜Shibor飙升至13.4%，盘中一度达25-30%的历史高点。与此同时，美联储主席伯南克5月22日释放Taper信号，引发全球新兴市场风险规避。沪综指下跌14.8%，防御股（-11.0%）明显跑赢周期股（-18.7%）。综合板块（-19.0%，排名16只中第13）中等程度落后，此前领涨回升的成长股受流动性危机冲击最大。","drivers":["PBOC interbank crunch","SHIBOR spike","Fed taper fear","shadow banking crackdown"],"drivers_zh":["央行银行间流动性收紧","Shibor利率暴涨","美联储Taper恐慌","打击影子银行"],"title":"SHIBOR spike and Fed taper fear","title_zh":"Shibor利率暴涨与美联储Taper恐慌"},"2013-06-28":{"body":"From mid-2013 to June 2015, China's A-share market underwent its largest bull run in a decade, fuelled by rapid expansion of margin financing (official margin balances grew from ~400 billion yuan to 2.2 trillion yuan by June 2015), PBOC rate cuts starting November 2014, and investor enthusiasm for state reform narratives. SHCOMP surged 161%, but Conglomerates (+284%, rank 6/28) outperformed the index through diversified exposure to cyclical and theme concepts. Cyclicals (+213.5%) far outpaced defensives (+146.4%), and the growth premium remained moderate at +4.5pp, showing broad participation.","body_zh":"从2013年中至2015年6月，中国A股经历了十年来最大牛市，主要由融资融券规模迅速扩张（官方融资余额从约4000亿元扩张至2.2万亿元）、人民银行从2014年11月起的降息周期以及投资者对国企改革叙事的热情共同驱动。沪综指大涨161%，但综合板块（+284%，排名28只中第6）依靠多元化的周期和主题概念配置超越指数。周期股（+213.5%）大幅跑赢防御股（+146.4%），成长溢价较为温和（+4.5pp），显示行情具有广泛参与度。","drivers":["margin debt expansion","PBOC rate cuts 2014-2015","SOE reform narratives","retail investor surge"],"drivers_zh":["融资融券大幅扩张","2014-2015年央行降息","国企改革叙事","散户大举入市"],"title":"Margin-fuelled mega-bull; reform and liquidity","title_zh":"融资融券驱动超级牛市；改革与流动性共振"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, SHCOMP peaked above 5,000 as the CSRC tightened rules on shadow-financed margin trading via fintech platforms, triggering forced deleveraging. Within four weeks the index collapsed 32.1%, and Conglomerates plunged 42.2% (rank 15/28), underperforming substantially as high-beta, retail-heavy names faced the worst forced selling. Banks (-10.6%) held up best; cyclicals (-43.0%) dramatically underperformed defensives (-30.4%), confirming a panic-driven unwind rather than fundamental re-pricing.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，沪综指突破5000点见顶，随即因证监会收紧互联网平台场外配资融资规则，触发强制去杠杆。四周内指数崩跌32.1%，综合板块重挫42.2%（排名28只中第15），高贝塔、散户密集型个股遭受最严重的强制平仓。银行（-10.6%）最为抗跌；周期股（-43.0%）大幅落后防御股（-30.4%），印证此次下跌为恐慌性去杠杆而非基本面重估。","drivers":["margin deleveraging","CSRC shadow margin rules","forced liquidation cascade","retail panic"],"drivers_zh":["融资杠杆去化","证监会收紧场外配资","强制平仓连锁反应","散户恐慌"],"title":"Margin deleveraging triggers crash","title_zh":"融资去杠杆引发市场崩盘"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"China's State Council launched an unprecedented rescue package: CSRC banned large shareholders from selling (July 8), China Securities Finance Corp injected over 1 trillion yuan, and the PBOC cut rates. SHCOMP rebounded 13.9% from its crash lows. Coal (+104.4%) and Defense (+78.0%) led sharply, reflecting beaten-down short-covering and policy-driven positioning in state-owned sectors. Conglomerates gained only 23.7% (rank 20/28), lagging the policy beneficiaries as cyclicals (+37.1%) far outpaced defensives (+16.8%).","body_zh":"国务院启动前所未有的救市方案：证监会7月8日禁止大股东减持，中国证券金融公司注资逾1万亿元，人民银行同步降息。沪综指从崩盘低点反弹13.9%。煤炭（+104.4%）和国防（+78.0%）领涨，既反映了超跌品种的空头回补，也反映了资金向国有板块的政策性布局。综合板块仅涨23.7%（排名28只中第20），落后于政策受益品种；周期股（+37.1%）大幅跑赢防御股（+16.8%）。","drivers":["government rescue package","CSRC selling ban","China Securities Finance injection","forced short-covering"],"drivers_zh":["政府救市方案","证监会禁止减持","证金公司注资","强制空头回补"],"title":"Government rescue rally; Coal and Defense spike","title_zh":"政府救市反弹；煤炭国防急速拉升"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC shocked markets with a sudden 1.9% devaluation of the yuan (the largest one-day move since 1994) and a reform to the central parity fixing mechanism. Currency fear compounded with unresolved leverage concerns to drive SHCOMP down 24.8%. Defensives (-20.6%) held significantly better than cyclicals (-32.9%), with Conglomerates (-27.4%, rank 6/28) performing relatively better than most cyclicals but still declining sharply as dollar strength hit commodity-linked and globally-exposed names.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行宣布人民币即期汇率一次性贬值1.9%（1994年以来单日最大跌幅），并改革中间价形成机制，令市场深感震动。汇率恐慌与未化解的杠杆隐患叠加，推动沪综指下跌24.8%。防御股（-20.6%）明显好于周期股（-32.9%）；综合板块（-27.4%，排名28只中第6）相对多数周期股表现较好，但美元走强拖累商品相关及全球敞口类个股，仍大幅下跌。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock","PBOC FX reform","dollar strength","residual leverage unwind"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","央行汇率改革","美元走强","残余杠杆去化"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock; second crash wave","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击；第二波下跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After the double crash, Beijing stabilised the yuan and the PBOC cut rates again (October 2015), while aggressive government buying supported sentiment. SHCOMP gained 21.5% from the September trough. Computers (+63.8%), Electronics (+53.1%), and Telecoms (+51.6%) led sharply, with growth outpacing value by 16.9pp, reflecting renewed appetite for domestic reform and tech themes. Conglomerates surged 51.0% (rank 4/28), outperforming strongly as their diversified tech and reform-concept holdings benefited from the growth rotation.","body_zh":"双重暴跌之后，北京当局稳定了人民币，人民银行再度降息（2015年10月），同时大规模政府买盘稳定了市场情绪。沪综指从9月低点反弹21.5%。计算机（+63.8%）、电子（+53.1%）和通信（+51.6%）领涨，成长风格跑赢价值风格16.9个百分点，反映在市场平息后对国内改革和科技主题的重燃热情。综合板块飙涨51.0%（排名28只中第4），依靠科技及改革概念类持仓的多元化配置强势领先。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts Oct-2015","yuan stabilisation","government stock buying","tech/reform theme revival"],"drivers_zh":["2015年10月央行降息","人民币汇率稳定","政府买盘护市","科技/改革主题复苏"],"title":"Post-devaluation stabilisation; tech themes revive","title_zh":"贬值后企稳；科技主题复苏"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"China introduced a market-wide circuit breaker on January 4, 2016, which paradoxically amplified panic selling as investors rushed to exit before the 15-minute halt triggered at -5%. It was suspended on January 7 after two days of early closures. Simultaneously, CNY fix cuts fuelled devaluation fears and a global risk-off impulse. SHCOMP fell 27.3%; Conglomerates crashed 36.8% (rank 28/28, worst sector), reflecting both their high beta and their concentration in the speculative growth names most vulnerable to circuit-breaker-driven liquidation.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日中国引入全市场熔断机制，却适得其反地加剧了恐慌性抛售，投资者争相在-5%触发15分钟暂停前出逃。熔断机制于1月7日在两度提前收盘后暂停实施。与此同时，人民币中间价连续调贬引发贬值恐慌和全球风险规避情绪。沪综指下跌27.3%；综合板块暴跌36.8%（排名28只中末位，全行业最差），既反映其高贝塔属性，也反映其集中持仓最易受熔断触发性清仓影响的投机性成长股。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic","CNY devaluation fear","forced liquidation","high-beta concentration"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制引发恐慌","人民币贬值恐慌","强制清仓","高贝塔集中风险"],"title":"Circuit breaker panic; worst Shenwan performer","title_zh":"熔断机制恐慌；申万最差板块"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"From late January 2016, Beijing's supply-side structural reform announcements targeting steel (100-150 million tonne capacity cuts) and coal (250 million tonne cuts) drove a powerful commodity and value reflation trade. Metals (+48.5%) and Building Materials (+45.6%) topped the Shenwan rankings; value outperformed growth by 5.4pp as the tape rotated away from speculative small caps. SHCOMP rose 20.7%. Conglomerates gained 38.8% (rank 5/28), tracking the broad commodity reflation while their diversified holdings provided index-plus returns.","body_zh":"2016年1月下旬起，北京推出供给侧结构性改革，宣布对钢铁（削减1-1.5亿吨产能）和煤炭（削减2.5亿吨）行业的去产能计划，驱动大宗商品/价值股再通胀行情。有色金属（+48.5%）和建筑材料（+45.6%）领跑申万排行榜；价值风格跑赢成长风格5.4个百分点，市场从投机性小盘股转向周期价值股。沪综指上涨20.7%。综合板块上涨38.8%（排名28只中第5），跟随商品再通胀大势，多元化持仓贡献了超指数回报。","drivers":["supply-side reform capacity cuts","commodity reflation","steel/coal price recovery","value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革去产能","大宗商品再通胀","钢煤价格回升","价值风格轮动"],"title":"Supply-side reform reflation; Metals and value lead","title_zh":"供给侧改革再通胀；金属与价值股领涨"},"2016-11-16":{"body":"From late 2016 through October 2018, the PBOC-led financial deleveraging campaign squeezed shadow banking and interbank leverage. The April 2018 unified Asset Management Rules imposed hard leverage caps and banned guaranteed-return products, structurally dismantling conglomerate-style cross-holding vehicles. SHCOMP fell 22.4%, but Conglomerates collapsed 61.4% (rank 28/28, worst sector), more than 2.5x the index decline. Food and Beverage (+25.3%) and blue-chip consumer defensives surged on institutional reallocation, while growth and speculative theme stocks suffered most. Value beat growth by 20.7pp.","body_zh":"从2016年底至2018年10月，人民银行主导的金融去杠杆行动压缩了影子银行和银行间杠杆。2018年4月出台的统一资管新规设定了杠杆硬上限并禁止刚性兑付，从结构上瓦解了综合类交叉持股载体。沪综指下跌22.4%，而综合板块暴跌61.4%（排名28只中末位，全行业最差），跌幅为指数的2.5倍以上。食品饮料（+25.3%）等蓝筹消费防御股受机构再配置大幅上涨，成长及投机主题股跌幅最惨；价值超越成长达20.7个百分点。","drivers":["PBOC deleveraging campaign","asset management rules 2018","shadow banking squeeze","US-China trade war escalation"],"drivers_zh":["央行金融去杠杆","2018年资管新规","影子银行收缩","中美贸易战升级"],"title":"Deleveraging and asset management crackdown","title_zh":"去杠杆与资管新规重创板块"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"By October 2018, the MSCI China A index had lost 30% YTD, with valuations at decade lows. The PBOC shifted monetary stance to prudent and flexible, executing RRR cuts and liquidity injections while Xi Jinping's October 19 speech pledged market stabilisation. Conglomerates rocketed +65.7% (rank 1/28), far outperforming every other Shenwan sector. Growth beat value by 20.5pp as beaten-down small and mid-cap reform concepts snapped back hardest. SHCOMP gained 24.8%, and Agriculture and Telecoms also led, suggesting broad risk-appetite recovery rather than any single sector catalyst.","body_zh":"至2018年10月，MSCI中国A股指数年内下跌约30%，估值处于十年低位。人民银行货币立场转向'稳健灵活'，实施降准和流动性注入；习近平10月19日讲话承诺稳定市场。综合板块飙升+65.7%（排名28只中第1），大幅跑赢全部申万行业。成长风格超越价值风格20.5个百分点，此前跌幅最大的中小盘改革概念股反弹最猛。沪综指上涨24.8%，农林牧渔和通信亦领涨，反映风险偏好的全面修复而非单一板块催化剂。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts and easing","Xi market stabilisation speech","deep valuation reversion","trade war trough optimism"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准及宽松","习近平稳市讲话","深度估值修复","贸易战见底乐观情绪"],"title":"Trade war trough; PBOC easing ignites sharp rebound","title_zh":"贸易战见底；央行宽松引爆急速反弹"},"2019-03-22":{"body":"On May 10, 2019, the US raised tariffs on $200 billion of Chinese imports from 10% to 25%, and on August 1 Trump tweeted a further 10% tariff on $300 billion more. SHCOMP fell 10.8% as defensives (-4.7%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-14.9%). Conglomerates plunged 23.8% (rank 26/28), one of the worst performers, as the growth-sensitive names that had led the prior recovery suffered most under renewed trade uncertainty. Food and Beverage (+10.9%) and Agriculture (+4.7%) were the only major winners.","body_zh":"2019年5月10日，美国将对2000亿美元中国商品的关税从10%提升至25%；8月1日特朗普再度发推宣布对另外3000亿美元商品加征10%关税。沪综指下跌10.8%，防御股（-4.7%）大幅跑赢周期股（-14.9%）。综合板块暴跌23.8%（排名28只中第26），位列最差表现之列，此前领涨回升的成长敏感型个股在贸易不确定性重燃下跌幅最深。食品饮料（+10.9%）和农林牧渔（+4.7%）是少数上涨的大类板块。","drivers":["US tariff escalation to 25%","trade war uncertainty spike","yuan depreciation pressure","growth stock rotation reversal"],"drivers_zh":["美国关税升至25%","贸易战不确定性激增","人民币贬值压力","成长股轮动逆转"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation; conglomerates lag sharply","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级；综合板块大幅落后"},"2019-08-07":{"body":"From August 2019 through August 2021, China A-shares ran through two distinct tailwinds: the US-China Phase-1 trade deal (signed January 15, 2020) eased trade headwinds, and post-COVID fiscal and monetary stimulus (multiple RRR/LPR cuts, 5.9 trillion yuan special bonds) drove a structural bull. Power Equipment (+216.3%), Metals (+122.9%), and Chemicals (+118.2%) topped Shenwan on green energy and materials plays. Conglomerates gained 65.8% (rank 13/28, mid-pack), consistent with SHCOMP's 27.9% and cyclicals (+53.1%) beating defensives (+40.4%) in a broad growth and ESG tape.","body_zh":"从2019年8月至2021年8月，A股经历两波顺风：中美第一阶段贸易协议（2020年1月15日签署）缓和贸易逆风，叠加新冠后的财政货币刺激（多次降准降息LPR、特别债券5.9万亿元），驱动结构性牛市。电力设备（+216.3%）、有色金属（+122.9%）和化工（+118.2%）在新能源及材料主题下领跑申万。综合板块上涨65.8%（排名28只中第13，居中），与沪综指+27.9%相符；周期股（+53.1%）跑赢防御股（+40.4%），体现广泛的成长/ESG行情。","drivers":["US-China Phase-1 trade deal","COVID fiscal stimulus","PBOC LPR/RRR cuts","green energy theme"],"drivers_zh":["中美第一阶段贸易协议","新冠后财政刺激","央行LPR/降准","新能源主题"],"title":"Phase-1 deal and COVID stimulus drive two-year bull","title_zh":"第一阶段协议与新冠刺激驱动两年牛市"},"2021-08-25":{"body":"From late August 2021, Xi Jinping's common prosperity regulatory wave hit multiple sectors: tech platforms (Didi delisting, Ant IPO enforcement), after-school tutoring (forced non-profit conversion), and property (Evergrande warned of default September 2021, triggering sectoral panic). SHCOMP fell 18.5% over eight months; defensives (-12.8%) significantly outperformed cyclicals (-19.8%) and value beat growth by 11.6pp. Conglomerates fell 21.7% (rank 13/31, mid-pack), with Power Equipment and Electronics hardest hit as investors rotated into Coal and traditional industrials.","body_zh":"2021年8月下旬起，习近平共同富裕监管浪潮席卷多个行业：网络平台（滴滴退市、蚂蚁集团上市被叫停落实）、课外培训（被迫转型非营利性质）、房地产（恒大于2021年9月发出违约警告，引发行业性恐慌）。沪综指八个月内下跌18.5%；防御股（-12.8%）明显跑赢周期股（-19.8%），价值超越成长11.6个百分点。综合板块下跌21.7%（排名31只中第13，居中），电力设备和电子跌幅最深，资金转向煤炭等传统工业股。","drivers":["common prosperity regulatory crackdown","Evergrande default crisis","tech platform regulation","risk-off rotation to value"],"drivers_zh":["共同富裕监管收紧","恒大违约危机","平台经济监管","风险规避转向价值股"],"title":"Common prosperity crackdown; Evergrande contagion","title_zh":"共同富裕监管冲击；恒大危机传导"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Following the April 26, 2022 SHCOMP trough (coinciding with State Council pledges to accelerate infrastructure and stable-growth measures), a recovery ensued as Shanghai's lockdown began easing in late May-June 2022 and National Team ETF buying stabilised sentiment. SHCOMP recovered 10.1% through December 2022. Conglomerates surged 33.6% (rank 1/31), leading all Shenwan industries alongside Defense (+29.5%) and Machinery (+28.5%), consistent with the growth-over-value tilt (+8.8pp) and rotation into hard-asset and defense themes ahead of the 20th Party Congress in October 2022.","body_zh":"2022年4月26日沪综指触底（国务院同日承诺加快基础设施投资及稳增长措施），随后随着上海封控于5至6月下旬开始解除、国家队ETF买盘稳定市场情绪，行情开启修复。沪综指至2022年12月上涨10.1%。综合板块飙涨33.6%（排名31只中第1），全申万行业领涨，国防（+29.5%）和机械设备（+28.5%）紧随其后；与成长超越价值8.8个百分点的风格倾向以及2022年10月二十大前夕向实物资产/国防主题轮动相吻合。","drivers":["State Council stable-growth pledge","lockdown easing","National Team ETF buying","20th Party Congress positioning"],"drivers_zh":["国务院稳增长承诺","封控解除","国家队ETF买盘","二十大布局"],"title":"Post-lockdown recovery; Conglomerates lead all sectors","title_zh":"封控后复苏；综合板块领涨全行业"},"2022-12-14":{"body":"Despite China's abrupt zero-COVID exit in December 2022, the anticipated consumption recovery was tepid: the property debt crisis deepened (Country Garden near-default August 2023), youth unemployment surged, and deflationary pressure intensified. SHCOMP fell 14.9% through February 2024; defensives (Coal +1.8%, Telecoms -1.9%, Banks -2.0%) dramatically outperformed cyclicals (-24.4%). Conglomerates fell 38.1% (rank 26/31), severely underperforming as sentiment on growth-proxy and speculative stocks collapsed.","body_zh":"尽管2022年12月中国突然退出清零政策，但预期中的消费复苏力度不及预期：房地产债务危机深化（碧桂园2023年8月濒临违约）、青年失业率飙升、通缩压力加剧。沪综指至2024年2月下跌14.9%；防御板块（煤炭+1.8%、通信-1.9%、银行-2.0%）大幅跑赢周期板块（-24.4%）。综合板块下跌38.1%（排名31只中第26），成长代理及投机性个股情绪崩溃，严重落后大盘。","drivers":["post-COVID recovery disappointment","property sector debt crisis","deflation risk","youth unemployment surge"],"drivers_zh":["新冠后复苏不及预期","房地产债务危机","通缩风险","青年失业率攀升"],"title":"Post-reopening disappointment; deflation fear drags","title_zh":"重开后复苏落空；通缩恐慌拖累板块"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"Central Huijin and National Team ETF inflows stabilised the market from the February 5, 2024 trough. SHCOMP recovered 13.9% in six weeks, led by Computers (+41.0%), Media (+40.1%), and Telecoms (+35.2%) on AI and digital-economy themes. Growth outpaced value by 17.8pp. Conglomerates gained 24.2% (rank 11/31, mid-pack), consistent with their beta to growth rotations but not sector-specifically leading. The recovery was clearly driven by state-backed market intervention and repositioning into tech/AI narratives after the deep 2023 de-rating.","body_zh":"中央汇金及国家队ETF资金流入从2024年2月5日的低点开始稳定市场。沪综指六周内上涨13.9%，计算机（+41.0%）、传媒（+40.1%）和通信（+35.2%）在人工智能和数字经济主题下领涨，成长超越价值17.8个百分点。综合板块上涨24.2%（排名31只中第11，居中），与其对成长轮动的贝塔敏感性一致，但未有特别领涨。本次反弹明显由国家背书的市场干预驱动，叠加市场在2023年深度杀估值后重新布局科技/AI叙事。","drivers":["National Team ETF buying","Central Huijin support","AI theme rerating","oversold rebound"],"drivers_zh":["国家队ETF买盘","中央汇金护盘","AI主题重估","超跌反弹"],"title":"National Team ETF buying sparks growth rebound","title_zh":"国家队ETF买盘点燃成长反弹"},"2024-03-21":{"body":"The March-July 2024 selloff reflected renewed macro disappointment: China's CPI remained near-zero, the property downturn worsened, and stimulus expectations faded after the NPC March meeting underwhelmed. Defensive sectors -- Utilities (+7.2%) and Banks (+6.6%) -- were the only gainers as SHCOMP fell 5.7%. Conglomerates dropped 28.9% (rank 30/31), second-worst in the universe, as their beta to growth expectations and thin institutional ownership left them highly exposed to risk-off flows. Value beat growth by 6.9pp.","body_zh":"2024年3月至7月的下跌反映宏观再度令市场失望：中国CPI持续接近零，房地产下行持续，3月全国两会后刺激预期落空。防御板块——公用事业（+7.2%）和银行（+6.6%）——成为仅有的上涨板块，沪综指下跌5.7%。综合板块暴跌28.9%（排名31只中第30，倒数第二），对成长预期的高贝塔属性及机构持仓不足令其高度暴露于风险规避资金流出；价值超越成长6.9个百分点。","drivers":["CPI deflation relapse","property downturn continuation","NPC stimulus disappointment","risk-off rotation to banks/utilities"],"drivers_zh":["CPI通缩再现","房地产持续下行","两会刺激预期落空","风险规避转向银行/公用事业"],"title":"Deflation relapse; conglomerates second-worst sector","title_zh":"通缩再现；综合板块倒数第二"},"2024-07-24":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced the most comprehensive stimulus package since 2008: a 50bp RRR cut, a 500 billion yuan equity swap facility for non-bank institutions, and a 300 billion yuan share buyback re-lending facility. The Politburo followed on September 26 with an unusual out-of-cycle economic meeting promising fiscal support. CSI 300 gained 16% in one week -- the best since 2008. Conglomerates exploded to +71.8% (rank 1/31, best sector) from the trough through December 2024, far outpacing SHCOMP's 19.3%, reflecting maximum beta to the sudden re-rating of risk appetite.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人民银行行长潘功胜宣布2008年以来最全面的刺激方案：降准50基点、设立5000亿元非银机构股票互换便利、3000亿元回购增持再贷款。政治局随即于9月26日召开罕见的非例行经济工作会议，承诺加大财政支持。沪深300单周上涨16%，为2008年以来最大单周涨幅。综合板块从低点至2024年12月飙涨+71.8%（排名31只中第1，全行业最强），远超沪综指的19.3%，体现了风险偏好突然重估时的最大贝塔效应。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut","equity swap facility","Politburo emergency meeting","maximum beta re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准50基点","股票互换便利工具","政治局超预期会议","最大贝塔重估"],"title":"PBOC bazooka; Conglomerates lead bull at 71.8%","title_zh":"央行'大招'出台；综合板块领涨71.8%"},"2024-12-12":{"body":"After the September bazooka euphoria faded -- the October 8 NDRC press conference disappointed on fiscal details -- markets consolidated and defensive rotation set in. US-China trade war risk re-emerged as Trump's November 2024 election victory re-stoked tariff fears, and China's fiscal stimulus remained below expectations into Q1 2025. SHCOMP fell 9.1%; defensives (Banks +2.2%, Agriculture -1.1%) sharply outperformed cyclicals (-13.6%). Conglomerates fell 19.6% (rank 28/31), consistent with their high-beta selloff pattern after each stimulus-peak.","body_zh":"9月'大招'刺激热情消退后——10月8日发改委发布会因财政细节令市场失望——市场进入整固期，防御性轮动启动。随着特朗普2024年11月赢得大选重燃关税忧虑，中美贸易战风险再现，中国财政刺激力度至2025年一季度仍低于预期。沪综指下跌9.1%；防御板块（银行+2.2%、农林牧渔-1.1%）大幅跑赢周期板块（-13.6%）。综合板块下跌19.6%（排名31只中第28），与其在每次刺激高峰后的高贝塔回吐规律相符。","drivers":["stimulus euphoria fading","NDRC fiscal disappointment","Trump tariff re-escalation risk","post-peak beta unwind"],"drivers_zh":["刺激预期退热","发改委财政细节失望","特朗普关税重燃风险","见顶后高贝塔回吐"],"title":"Post-stimulus fading; defensives take over","title_zh":"刺激退潮；防御板块接棒"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"April 2, 2025 'Liberation Day' tariffs imposed 125% across-the-board US duties on Chinese goods, triggering a VIX spike above 40 and the April 8 SHCOMP trough. The May 12 Geneva deal (tariffs reduced to ~30% effective) drove a violent recovery. Simultaneously, DeepSeek's open-source LLM (released December 2024) had already reshaped China tech expectations, and state funding flowed into AI/technology from early 2025. Conglomerates surged 120.1% (rank 3/31) from the trough through March 2026, alongside Metals (+129.5%) and Telecoms (+125%), with cyclicals massively outpacing defensives (+47.8% vs +6.3%) in SHCOMP's 30.2% gain.","body_zh":"2025年4月2日'解放日'关税对中国商品全面加征125%，VIX飙破40，4月8日沪综指见底。5月12日日内瓦协议（关税降至约30%生效）驱动剧烈反弹。与此同时，DeepSeek开源大模型（2024年12月发布）已重塑中国科技预期，国家资金从2025年初起流向AI/科技领域。综合板块从低点至2026年3月飙涨120.1%（排名31只中第3），与有色金属（+129.5%）和通信（+125%）并驾齐驱；沪综指上涨30.2%，周期股（+47.8%）大幅跑赢防御股（+6.3%）。","drivers":["US Liberation Day tariffs trough","Geneva deal tariff truce","DeepSeek AI re-rating","PBOC and National Team support"],"drivers_zh":["美国'解放日'关税冲击筑底","日内瓦协议关税休战","DeepSeek AI重估","央行及国家队托底"],"title":"Tariff shock trough; DeepSeek AI surge lifts all","title_zh":"关税冲击筑底；DeepSeek AI浪潮全面提振"},"2026-03-09":{"body":"After a 120% run in less than a year, Conglomerates hit a structural peak in early March 2026. The precipitating trigger was a sharp metals flash-correction in late February and early March 2026 (gold fell from $5,627 to near $4,900 as DXY strengthened and the de-dollarisation trade unwound), dragging the Metals and Conglomerates complex sharply lower. SHCOMP fell 6.9%; Conglomerates crashed 19.0% (rank 31/31, worst sector), alongside Metals (-18.3%) and Defense (-15.0%), while defensive Telecoms (+0.1%) and Coal (-0.3%) barely moved -- confirming a risk-asset and commodity-beta correction, not broad panic.","body_zh":"经过不到一年120%的涨幅，综合板块于2026年3月初触及结构性高点。导火索是2026年2月底至3月初的金属价格闪崩（黄金从5627美元跌至约4900美元，美元指数走强、去美元化交易逆转），拖累金属及综合板块急剧回落。沪综指下跌6.9%；综合板块暴跌19.0%（排名31只中末位，全行业最差），与有色金属（-18.3%）和国防（-15.0%）同步重挫，而防御性通信（+0.1%）和煤炭（-0.3%）几乎不动——印证此次为风险资产/商品贝塔修正，而非全面恐慌。","drivers":["metals flash-crash","DXY strength unwinding de-dollarisation","profit-taking after 120% run","commodity beta reversal"],"drivers_zh":["金属价格闪崩","美元走强逆转去美元化交易","120%涨幅后获利了结","商品贝塔反转"],"title":"Profit-taking peak; metals flash-crash leads selloff","title_zh":"获利了结见顶；金属闪崩引领下跌"},"2026-03-23":{"body":"Following the metals-led peak correction, A-shares stabilised as AI and tech themes reasserted leadership. Electronics (+35.9%) and Telecoms (+32.7%) led the recovery, with growth beating value by 11.3pp, as DeepSeek's ongoing model releases and Chinese AI ecosystem funding continued to attract liquidity. SHCOMP gained 9.6% and Conglomerates jumped 27.2% (rank 3/31), performing well as the growth rotation into tech and AI names through diversified holdings drove outperformance. Defensive energy (Oil and Gas -3.3%, Coal -4.4%) lagged sharply.","body_zh":"金属领跌的高峰修正之后，AI/科技主题重新主导，A股趋于稳定。电子（+35.9%）和通信（+32.7%）引领反弹，成长超越价值11.3个百分点；DeepSeek持续发布新模型、中国AI生态获得持续资金注入，流动性不断聚集。沪综指上涨9.6%，综合板块大涨27.2%（排名31只中第3），通过多元化持仓广泛接触科技/AI个股，受益于成长轮动的超额表现。防御性能源（油气-3.3%、煤炭-4.4%）大幅落后。","drivers":["DeepSeek AI theme continuation","growth/tech rotation","China AI ecosystem funding","post-correction rebound"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek AI主题延续","成长/科技轮动","中国AI生态融资","修正后反弹"],"title":"AI theme bounce; Electronics and Telecoms return","title_zh":"AI主题反弹；电子通信重新主导"},"2026-05-07":{"body":"From late May into June 2026, global technology stocks stumbled as the Federal Reserve pivoted hawkish and investors demanded proof of AI monetisation to justify massive capital expenditure. Hong Kong tech names dropped over 5% in the week of June 22, and the broader A-share tape saw sharp selling in commodity-linked and thematic names. SHCOMP fell 5.3%; Conglomerates crashed 21.4% (rank 31/31, worst sector) while Telecoms (+13.7%), Coal (+8.6%), and Electronics (+4.8%) actually gained, suggesting a sharp intra-sector reversal where the most speculative and beta-heavy conglomerate vehicles were liquidated in favour of pure telecom infrastructure and commodity defensives.","body_zh":"从2026年5月下旬至6月，随着美联储态度转鹰、投资者要求AI变现证明以证明巨额资本开支合理性，全球科技股走势趋弱。6月22日当周港股科技股普遍下跌5%以上，A股商品相关及主题类个股遭受剧烈抛售。沪综指下跌5.3%；综合板块暴跌21.4%（排名31只中末位，全行业最差），而通信（+13.7%）、煤炭（+8.6%）和电子（+4.8%）实际上均上涨，显示板块内部出现急剧反转——投机性最强、贝塔最高的综合类载体遭到清仓，资金转向纯电信基础设施和商品防御性板块。","drivers":["Fed hawkish pivot","AI monetisation doubt","growth-to-defensives rotation","high-beta speculative liquidation"],"drivers_zh":["美联储鹰派转向","AI变现能力存疑","成长转向防御性轮动","高贝塔投机品种清仓"],"title":"AI monetisation doubt; Conglomerates worst again","title_zh":"AI变现存疑；综合板块再度垫底"}},"now":"Conglomerates are in a trough/bottoming phase (pos 7.6, rs_rank 6/31) after the violent May-June 2026 selloff (-21.4%, worst sector in the universe). The now_ctx shows a risk-on, growth-tilted tape where Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) lead sharply while Agriculture and Retail lag; Conglomerates' +10.8% YTD (rank 5/31) reflects beta recovery from the June trough but is well below the sector leadership exhibited in the prior two major rallies. Cyclicals barely edge defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%) with SHCOMP only +1.6%, signalling tentative, liquidity-driven stabilisation rather than full cyclical re-acceleration. Conglomerates are rebuilding from multi-standard-deviation oversold conditions which have historically preceded sharp reversals given the sector's outsized beta to A-share sentiment cycles.","now_zh":"综合板块正处于低谷/探底阶段（位置7.6，相对强弱排名第6/31），此前经历了2026年5至6月的剧烈抛售（跌幅-21.4%，全行业最差）。当前环境显示风险偏好改善、成长风格主导，电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）领涨，农林牧渔和零售大幅落后；综合板块年内涨幅+10.8%（排名5/31），反映从6月低点的贝塔反弹，但仍远低于前两次大行情的领涨水平。周期股仅微幅领先防御股（+0.3%对-12.1%），沪综指仅涨1.6%，信号显示当前是流动性驱动的试探性企稳，而非全面周期加速。综合板块正从极度超卖区域修复，历史上这往往是大幅反弹的前奏，因其对A股情绪周期具有超大贝塔弹性。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801710":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"China's PBOC cut benchmark lending rates in November 2014 (first cut since 2012) and progressively relaxed deposit-rate ceilings, igniting a retail margin-lending boom that lifted SHCOMP 144% to the June 2015 peak. Outstanding margin balances reached RMB 2.27 trillion by mid-2015. Building Materials rose 167.8% but ranked only #19/28 Shenwan industries, well behind Computers (+256%), Construction (+253%), and Steel (+245%); the gain was almost entirely market beta. Cement overcapacity remained acute and property completions were decelerating, confirming no sector-specific fundamental driver.","body_zh":"2014年11月人民银行下调基准贷款利率（2012年以来首次），并逐步放开存款利率上限，触发散户融资杠杆大幅扩张，推动上证综指大涨144%至2015年6月峰值。融资余额在2015年中期峰值达2.27万亿元。建筑材料板块涨幅167.8%，但在28个申万行业中仅排名第19，远落后于计算机涨256%、建筑涨253%和钢铁涨245%；涨幅几乎全部来自市场Beta。彼时水泥产能严重过剩，房屋竣工增速已在放缓，确认板块并无独立基本面催化剂。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts / margin-lending boom","retail leverage surge","broad index beta","cyclical outperformance","infrastructure spend"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行降息/融资融券扩张","散户杠杆激增","大盘Beta驱动","周期股全面跑赢","基建投资支撑"],"title":"Leveraged A-share Bull; Sector Rides Beta","title_zh":"杠杆牛市驱动，板块跟随大盘Beta"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, China's securities regulator announced limits on shadow-margin lending, triggering forced margin calls across leveraged retail accounts. Within four weeks SHCOMP fell 32%, and Building Materials dropped 45.2%, ranking #21/28. Banks (-10.6%) and Food and Beverage (-32.6%) led (least-bad), while Coal (-59%), Defense, and Retail collapsed hardest. This was a pure risk-off margin-call cascade with no sector-specific fundamental trigger; the government halted 1,400+ IPOs and the national team began buying equities from July 6 to arrest the spiral.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会宣布限制场外配资保证金账户，触发散户强制平仓潮。四周内上证综指下跌32%，建筑材料板块下跌45.2%，在28个申万行业中排名第21。银行-10.6%和食品饮料-32.6%相对抗跌居前，而煤炭-59%、国防和零售跌幅最深。纯粹的风险规避与融资平仓级联反应，建筑材料并无行业层面特定催化剂；监管层随即暂停逾1400家IPO，国家队于7月6日起入市购股以稳定市场。","drivers":["margin-lending crackdown","forced deleveraging cascade","CSRC shadow-margin limits","broad risk-off","retail margin calls"],"drivers_zh":["场外配资监管收紧","强制去杠杆级联","证监会场外保证金限制","全面风险规避","散户爆仓潮"],"title":"Margin Deleveraging Crash; Broad Risk-Off","title_zh":"融资去杠杆崩盘，全面风险规避"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Starting July 6, 2015, the China Securities Finance Corporation and Central Huijin deployed over USD 200 billion to directly buy equities in more than 1,360 companies, while the CSRC banned major shareholders from selling and halted new IPOs. SHCOMP rebounded 13.9% and cyclicals led the recovery: Coal (+104%), Defense (+78%), Agriculture (+47%) — sectors with the most beaten-down valuations. Building Materials gained 40.4%, ranking #6/28, benefiting from the broad cyclical-value rebound but without a specific cement or property catalyst.","body_zh":"2015年7月6日起，中国证券金融股份有限公司与中央汇金直接入市购股，动用逾2000亿美元购入逾1360家公司股票，证监会同时禁止大股东减持并暂停新股发行。上证综指反弹13.9%，周期股领涨：煤炭+104%、国防+78%、农业+47%，均为此前跌幅最深板块。建筑材料涨幅40.4%，排名第6，受益于周期价值股整体反弹，但水泥或房产端并无独立催化剂。","drivers":["national team equity buying","CSRC trading halt / IPO ban","forced short-covering","cyclical-value rebound","broad market stabilization"],"drivers_zh":["国家队直接购股","证监会交易暂停/IPO叫停","强制空头回补","周期价值股反弹","全市场企稳"],"title":"National Team Bailout; Cyclical Rebound","title_zh":"国家队救市，周期股反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC unexpectedly devalued the yuan by approximately 1.9% and shifted to a market-referenced fixing, sparking fears of competitive devaluation and capital flight. A second wave of margin calls hit; SHCOMP fell a further 24.8% ('Black Monday' on August 24 saw the index lose 8.5% in a single session). Defensives (banks, food) again led with -20.6% vs cyclicals at -32.9%. Building Materials dropped 32.4%, ranking #14 — roughly in line with cyclicals' broad beta drawdown, with no independent property or cement catalyst.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行意外将人民币贬值约1.9%并转向参考市场定价的汇率中间价机制，引发竞争性贬值与资本外流担忧。第二轮融资平仓随即袭来；上证综指再跌24.8%，8月24日黑色星期一单日跌幅8.5%。银行、食品等防御板块相对抗跌-20.6%领先周期股-32.9%。建筑材料下跌32.4%，排名第14，与周期股整体Beta跌幅基本一致，水泥及房产端无独立催化剂。","drivers":["yuan devaluation shock","capital outflow fears","second margin-call wave","global risk-off contagion","broad cyclical beta selloff"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","资本外流恐慌","第二轮融资平仓","全球风险规避蔓延","周期股Beta下跌"],"title":"Yuan Devaluation Shock; Second Wave Selloff","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击，第二波下跌"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"Following the yuan shock, the PBOC delivered another benchmark rate cut in October 2015 (the sixth in a year) and eased bank reserve requirements. China's Politburo signaled steady fiscal stimulus and infrastructure spending. SHCOMP rebounded 21.5%; growth sectors led sharply (growth minus value +16.9pp): Computers (+64%), Electronics (+53%), Telecoms (+52%). Building Materials gained 37.9% but ranked only #18/28, as the rally was growth/tech-themed rather than property or cement demand-driven; Steel and Banks sharply lagged.","body_zh":"人民币贬值冲击后，人民银行于2015年10月再次下调基准利率（年内第六次）并下调准备金率，中央政治局明确信号稳定财政刺激与基建投入。上证综指反弹21.5%；成长风格大幅领涨，成长vs价值+16.9个百分点：计算机+64%、电子+53%、通信+52%。建筑材料涨幅37.9%，但在28个申万行业中仅排名第18，行情由成长科技主题主导，而非地产或水泥需求改善驱动；钢铁和银行明显落后。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts (6th in 12 months)","RRR reductions","fiscal stability signals","growth-tech style rotation","broad market re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行降息（年内第六次）","下调准备金率","财政稳定信号","成长科技风格轮动","大盘整体重估"],"title":"Policy Stabilization; Growth-Led Rebound","title_zh":"政策托底，成长风格领涨反弹"},"2015-12-22":{"body":"On January 4, 2016, China's newly installed circuit breaker halted trading after SHCOMP fell 6.9%; a second halt on January 7 suspended trading for the day, after which regulators scrapped the mechanism. The PBOC's yuan fixing simultaneously hit its lowest level since March 2011 (CNY 6.5646 per USD), reigniting capital-outflow fears. Caixin manufacturing PMI registered 48.2 (11th consecutive contraction). Defensives led with -25.8% vs cyclicals -30.9%; Building Materials fell 32.2%, ranking #20/28 — a broad risk-off panic unrelated to sector fundamentals.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日，年内首个交易日，A股新实施的熔断机制在上证综指跌幅6.9%后触发停市；1月7日再次触发后当日停市，监管层随即宣布取消熔断机制。与此同时，人民银行将人民币中间价设于6.5646，创2011年3月以来新低，再次引发资本外流恐慌。财新制造业PMI为48.2，连续第11个月收缩。防御板块-25.8%跑赢周期股-30.9%；建筑材料下跌32.2%，排名第20，纯粹的风险规避恐慌性下跌，与板块基本面无关。","drivers":["circuit breaker mechanism panic","yuan devaluation round 2","capital outflow fears","PMI contraction signal","broad risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制恐慌","人民币第二轮贬值","资本外流担忧","PMI收缩信号","全面风险规避"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Crash; CNY Devaluation Round 2","title_zh":"熔断机制崩盘，人民币第二轮贬值"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"China's Central Economic Work Conference in December 2015 formally launched the supply-side structural reform campaign, explicitly targeting cement, glass, and steel capacity reduction. The NDRC accelerated PPP infrastructure approvals and issued detailed five-year capacity-cut plans for cement in 2016. By 2017, national off-peak production policies and capacity cuts drove cement prices up 77% from trough to RMB 552/t by early 2018, with CNBM and Anhui Conch posting sales growth above 15%. Building Materials ranked #1/28 with +66.2% vs SHCOMP +23.8% — the sector's strongest alpha-generating leg in the 15-year record, driven by a structural profit-recovery re-rating in a value-cyclical tape (growth minus value -15.2pp).","body_zh":"2015年12月中央经济工作会议正式启动供给侧结构性改革，明确将水泥、玻璃、钢铁列为去产能重点行业。国家发改委加快PPP基建项目审批，并发布详细的水泥五年去产能计划。至2017年，全国错峰生产政策与去产能措施推动水泥价格从低点大涨77%至约552元/吨，中国建材与海螺水泥均实现销售增速超15%。建筑材料板块涨幅66.2%，在28个申万行业中排名第一，上证综指仅涨23.8%，是15年历史记录中板块最强的Alpha创造周期，由价值周期风格下的结构性盈利复苏重估驱动，成长vs价值-15.2pp。","drivers":["supply-side reform / cement capacity cuts","PPP infrastructure acceleration","cement price surge +77%","value-cyclical style rotation","PBOC continued easing"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革/水泥去产能","PPP基建提速","水泥价格大涨77%","价值周期风格轮动","人民银行持续宽松"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform + PPP; Bldg Mat Leads All","title_zh":"供给侧改革+PPP，建材领涨全市场"},"2017-04-11":{"body":"After the 15-month supply-side rally, profit-taking and policy disappointment triggered a correction. Banks, Brokers, and Appliances held firm (+2-4%) while Building Materials fell 18.4%, ranking #26/28. SHCOMP slipped just 5.7% but defensives led (-2.6% vs cyclicals -12.9%), signaling rotation from over-owned cyclical-value winners into financial defensives. No new cement-specific policy catalyst emerged; the selloff reflected mean-reversion after the sector's #1 ranking in the prior leg.","body_zh":"经历15个月供给侧改革行情后，获利回吐与政策预期消化引发调整。银行、券商和家电小幅走强+2%至+4%，而建筑材料下跌18.4%，在28个申万行业中排名第26，相对跑输幅度显著。上证综指仅下跌5.7%，但防御板块-2.6%跑赢周期板块-12.9%，显示市场从过度持仓的周期价值赢家向金融防御板块轮动。期间无新的水泥专项政策催化剂，此次回调反映前一周期排名第一的板块均值回归压力。","drivers":["supply-side reform priced in","profit-taking in over-owned cyclicals","rotation to financials","mild index correction","no new cement catalyst"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革预期充分消化","过度持仓周期股获利回吐","资金流向金融板块","指数温和调整","无新水泥政策催化剂"],"title":"Reform Priced In; Sector Underperforms Sharply","title_zh":"改革预期充分消化，建材大幅跑输"},"2017-06-01":{"body":"Cement producers reported sharply improved 2017 earnings: CNBM recorded full-year 2017 sales of USD 20.3bn (up 15%+) and Anhui Conch USD 12bn, driven by higher cement prices following capacity cuts. Top-10 producers reached 60% combined clinker-capacity share, cementing pricing power. SHCOMP rose 9.9%; value dominated (growth minus value -7.4pp) with Food and Beverage (+46%), Non-ferrous Metals (+34%), and Appliances (+30%) leading. Building Materials gained 19.3%, ranking #5/28, benefiting from the ongoing cement-price upcycle.","body_zh":"水泥企业2017年业绩大幅改善：中国建材全年销售额达203亿美元（增速超15%），海螺水泥达120亿美元，均受益于去产能后水泥价格上涨。前十大生产商合计熟料产能占比已达60%，定价权持续巩固。上证综指上涨9.9%；价值风格主导，成长vs价值-7.4pp，食品饮料+46%、有色金属+34%、家电+30%领涨。建筑材料涨幅19.3%，排名第5，受益于持续的水泥价格上行周期。","drivers":["cement price upcycle","supply-side earnings lift","industry consolidation (60% capacity share)","value-style leadership","infrastructure demand"],"drivers_zh":["水泥价格上行周期","去产能推动盈利修复","行业整合（60%产能集中度）","价值风格领涨","基础设施需求支撑"],"title":"Cement Earnings Recovery; Value-Led Rally","title_zh":"水泥盈利复苏，价值风格主导反弹"},"2018-01-08":{"body":"The US-China trade war escalated through 2018: tariffs on steel and aluminum in March, $50bn of Chinese goods in June, and 10% tariffs on $200bn in July, with China retaliating in kind. Simultaneously, China's 'Asset Management Rules' (April 2018) tightened shadow-banking off-balance-sheet lending, lifting borrowing costs and cutting infrastructure project funding. SHCOMP fell 27.7%; Coal flat and Banks -16% led (defensives -27.0%), while cyclicals (-32.6%) collapsed. Building Materials dropped 37%, ranking #22/28; both the tariff-induced growth-expectations shock and domestic credit tightening were directly hostile for cement and construction demand.","body_zh":"中美贸易摩擦贯穿2018年全年：3月钢铁铝关税，6月对500亿美元商品加征关税，7月进一步对2000亿美元商品征10%关税，中方对等报复。与此同时，2018年4月资管新规正式实施，收紧影子银行表外融资，推高融资成本并削减基建项目资金。上证综指下跌27.7%；煤炭持平、银行-16%相对领跑（防御股-27.0%），周期股-32.6%大幅下挫。建筑材料下跌37%，排名第22；关税冲击压制增长预期与国内信用收紧双重打击，直接恶化水泥与建筑需求前景。","drivers":["US-China trade war tariff escalation","Asset Management Rules credit tightening","infrastructure funding squeeze","growth expectations collapse","broad risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易战关税升级","资管新规收紧影子银行","基建资金来源收窄","增长预期崩塌","全面风险规避"],"title":"US-China Trade War; Credit Tightening Selloff","title_zh":"中美贸易战+信用收紧，板块大幅下跌"},"2019-01-03":{"body":"The PBOC implemented a 100bp RRR cut effective January 15, 2019 (the fifth cut within a year), alongside a targeted medium-term lending facility for smaller firms and signals of expanded infrastructure spending. SHCOMP surged 31.7%; Building Materials ranked #3/28 (+53.4%), led by Agriculture (+58%) and Computers (+56%) — a growth-tilted broad rebound. Easing credit conditions, a policy pivot toward infrastructure, and US-China trade-truce expectations drove cyclicals broadly. Cement order books improved as developers restocked ahead of the construction season, amplifying the sector's outperformance.","body_zh":"2019年1月，人民银行实施100bp降准（年内第五次，1月15日生效），同时推出面向中小企业定向中期借贷便利并释放扩大基建投资信号。上证综指大涨31.7%；建筑材料排名第3（+53.4%），农业+58%和计算机+56%居前——成长偏向的全面反弹。信用宽松、政策向基建转向与中美贸易休战预期共同推动周期股全面上行。水泥订单随开工季前开发商补库而改善，放大了板块超额表现。","drivers":["PBOC 100bp RRR cut (5th in year)","credit channel reopening","infrastructure spending signals","US-China trade truce hopes","construction season restocking"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行降准100bp（年内第五次）","信用通道重开","基建投资扩张信号","中美贸易休战预期","开工季前补库需求"],"title":"PBOC RRR Cuts; Credit Easing Broad Rally","title_zh":"人民银行多次降准，信用宽松全面反弹"},"2019-04-08":{"body":"On May 5, 2019, President Trump announced tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods would rise from 10% to 25% (effective May 10), reigniting the trade war. China's Politburo in April 2019 also reaffirmed its housing-cooling stance, tightening property curbs. SHCOMP fell 13.8%; defensives led (Food and Bev +4.7%, Coal flat) while cyclicals sold off (-19.6%). Building Materials dropped 22.2%, ranking #22/28, with Steel (-31%) and Chemicals (-26%) hit hardest — the dual shock of external trade uncertainty and domestic property cooling removed the two main demand pillars.","body_zh":"2019年5月5日，特朗普宣布对2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%提升至25%（5月10日生效），贸易战重新升温。同年4月，中央政治局表态坚持房住不炒，地产调控再度收紧。上证综指下跌13.8%；防御板块领跑（食品饮料+4.7%，煤炭持平），周期股大幅下挫-19.6%。建筑材料下跌22.2%，排名第22，钢铁-31%和化工-26%跌幅最深。外部贸易不确定性与国内地产调控收紧的双重冲击，同时撤除了建筑材料需求的两大支柱。","drivers":["US tariff hike to 25% on $200bn (May 10)","China property curbs (Politburo April reaffirmation)","growth expectations cut","cyclical sector risk-off","trade uncertainty"],"drivers_zh":["美国对2000亿商品关税升至25%（5月10日）","地产调控收紧（政治局4月表态）","增长预期下调","周期板块风险规避","贸易不确定性"],"title":"Trade War Re-Escalation; Property Curbs Tighten","title_zh":"贸易战再升级+地产调控收紧，板块回撤"},"2019-08-13":{"body":"The US-China Phase 1 trade truce process advanced through late 2019, and in August 2019 the PBOC introduced the new Loan Prime Rate mechanism, cutting rates twice in H2 2019. China's post-COVID infrastructure-heavy fiscal stimulus in 2020 further extended the demand cycle, and China's September 2020 carbon-neutrality announcement redirected capital toward Power Equipment and Clean Energy. Over this 25-month leg, SHCOMP rose 32.8% while Building Materials gained 80%, ranking #8/28; Power Equipment (+207%), Non-ferrous Metals (+151%), and Chemicals (+141%) led. Building Materials benefited from steady infrastructure and property construction through mid-2021, before Evergrande's debt crisis emerged.","body_zh":"2019年下半年至2020年初，中美第一阶段贸易协议谈判取得进展；2019年8月人民银行推出新LPR报价机制并在下半年两次下调，基建固定资产投资加速。2020年新冠疫情后中国以基建为核心的财政刺激延长了需求周期；2020年9月中国宣布碳中和目标，引导资金流向电力设备与清洁能源。在长达25个月的本轮行情中，上证综指上涨32.8%，建筑材料涨幅80%，排名第8；电力设备+207%、有色金属+151%、化工+141%领涨。建筑材料在2021年中期前受益于基建及房地产建设持续活跃，直至恒大债务危机浮现。","drivers":["US-China Phase 1 trade truce","LPR cuts (new mechanism Aug 2019)","COVID infrastructure stimulus (2020)","carbon neutrality announcement (Sept 2020)","property construction boom"],"drivers_zh":["中美第一阶段贸易协议","LPR下调（2019年8月新机制）","新冠后基建财政刺激（2020年）","碳中和目标宣布（2020年9月）","房地产建设繁荣"],"title":"Trade Truce + LPR Reform; Broad Cyclical Reflation","title_zh":"贸易休战+LPR改革，周期股全面再通胀"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"China Evergrande Group's approximately USD 300bn debt crisis became public in September 2021, with the company missing bond interest payments and its planned USD 2.6bn asset sale collapsing on October 21. The property sector's distress directly hit cement demand: Building Materials fell 19.9%, ranking #27/28. By contrast, Power Equipment (+13%), Agriculture (+12.8%), and Food and Bev (+9.7%) surged as investors rotated into quality-defensive and new-energy names. SHCOMP fell only 5.8%, so Building Materials' -19.9% represents sharp alpha-negative performance driven by its direct property-construction demand exposure.","body_zh":"2021年9月，中国恒大集团约3000亿美元债务危机公开爆发，公司相继错过债券利息支付，并于10月21日宣布263亿港元资产出售计划失败。地产行业困境直接打击水泥需求：建筑材料板块下跌19.9%，在28个申万行业中排名第27。相比之下，电力设备+13%、农业+12.8%、食品饮料+9.7%大幅上涨，投资者向质量防御与新能源板块轮动。上证综指仅下跌5.8%，建筑材料-19.9%的跌幅呈现出显著的负Alpha，根源在于板块对房地产建设需求的直接暴露。","drivers":["Evergrande debt crisis","property demand collapse","developer funding squeeze (Three Red Lines)","defensive rotation to new-energy","growth-style headwind"],"drivers_zh":["恒大债务危机","地产需求崩塌","开发商融资收紧（三条红线）","防御/新能源板块轮动","成长风格压制周期股"],"title":"Evergrande Debt Crisis; Sector Near Last Place","title_zh":"恒大债务危机，板块跌幅近垫底"},"2021-11-08":{"body":"In late November to December 2021, Chinese commercial banks were instructed to ease curbs on development loans, process mortgage applications faster, and relax lending policies for higher-quality developers — the first material property-sector policy pivot since the Three Red Lines were introduced in August 2020. Building Materials ranked #1/31 (+19.1%), Real Estate #2 (+16.3%), and Construction #3 (+15.8%) — a narrowly-led property-chain relief rally in a broadly flat market (SHCOMP +2.3%). Cyclicals only modestly outperformed defensives (5.9% vs 3.2%), confirming this was a targeted property-policy-relief trade, not a broad market move.","body_zh":"2021年11月至12月底，商业银行被要求放宽房地产开发贷款限制、加快按揭申请处理并对优质开发商选择性放松贷款政策，这是2020年8月三条红线出台以来首次实质性地产政策松绑。建筑材料以+19.1%排名第1，地产+16.3%排名第2，建筑+15.8%排名第3，在大盘基本持平（上证综指+2.3%）的背景下形成高度集中于地产产业链的政策松绑反弹行情。周期股仅小幅跑赢防御股5.9%对3.2%，印证此次为定向地产政策松绑行情，而非全面市场上涨。","drivers":["property-loan restriction easing","bank mortgage acceleration directive","Three Red Lines selective relaxation","property-chain relief rally","targeted policy pivot"],"drivers_zh":["房地产开发贷款松绑","银行按揭加快办理指令","三条红线选择性放宽","地产产业链政策松绑反弹","定向政策转向"],"title":"Property Policy Relief; Bldg Mat Leads All","title_zh":"地产政策松绑预期，建材领涨全市场"},"2022-01-07":{"body":"A triple shock hit in Q1 2022: Russia invaded Ukraine on February 24 (commodities spike, sanctions fears); the US Fed began its most aggressive rate-hike cycle since 1994 (first hike March 16); and China imposed a lengthy Shanghai lockdown from end-March into June, with March 2022 urban unemployment hitting a record high. SHCOMP fell 18.2%; value led (Coal +12%, Banks -6%) while growth collapsed (growth minus value -14.1pp). Building Materials dropped 24%, ranking #21/31; cement volumes fell 5.6% year-on-year in Q1 2022 and Anhui Conch revenue fell 26% as lockdowns disrupted construction activity.","body_zh":"2022年一季度三重冲击叠加：2月24日俄乌战争爆发（大宗商品急涨、制裁担忧）；美联储3月16日开启1994年以来最激进加息周期；上海自3月底至6月实施严格封控，城市调查失业率创历史新高。上证综指下跌18.2%；价值风格领跑（煤炭+12%，银行-6%），成长股大幅下挫（成长vs价值-14.1pp）。建筑材料下跌24%，排名第21；2022年一季度水泥产量同比下滑5.6%，海螺水泥营收下降26%，封控同步打击建筑施工。","drivers":["Russia-Ukraine war commodity spike","Fed rate hike cycle start (March 2022)","Shanghai COVID lockdown","property sector distress deepening","capital outflows from China"],"drivers_zh":["俄乌战争大宗商品冲击","美联储开启加息周期（2022年3月）","上海新冠封控","地产困境持续加深","外资大规模撤离中国"],"title":"Ukraine War + Shanghai Lockdown Selloff","title_zh":"俄乌战争+上海封控，市场大幅下跌"},"2022-04-25":{"body":"Shanghai began easing Covid restrictions in late May; full reopening on June 1, 2022 sparked a relief rally. The PBOC cut the 5-year LPR (mortgage benchmark) by 15bp in May 2022 — the largest cut in the LPR era. SHCOMP rose 16.3%; cyclicals led with Power Equipment (+51%), Autos (+43%), and Non-ferrous Metals (+36%), a growth-tilted recovery. Building Materials gained 19.4%, ranking #12/31, roughly in line with the market but without sector outperformance; the underlying property-developer insolvency crisis remained unresolved.","body_zh":"上海5月底开始放开封控限制，6月1日全面解封，触发情绪性反弹。2022年5月，人民银行将5年期LPR（按揭基准）下调15bp，为LPR改革以来最大降幅。上证综指上涨16.3%；周期股领跑，电力设备+51%、汽车+43%、有色金属+36%，成长偏向的复苏行情。建筑材料涨幅19.4%，排名第12，与大盘基本持平，无显著超额收益；地产开发商偿债危机的根本问题仍未解决。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown end / reopening (June 1)","5Y LPR cut 15bp (record)","construction site restart","cyclical relief rally","PBOC property support signals"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封/复工复产（6月1日）","5年期LPR降15bp（创纪录）","工地复工拉动需求","周期股情绪性反弹","人民银行地产支持信号"],"title":"Shanghai Reopening Relief; Cyclical Bounce","title_zh":"上海解封提振情绪，周期股反弹"},"2022-07-04":{"body":"China's property crisis escalated in mid-2022: a widescale mortgage boycott by homebuyers over stalled projects from insolvent developers was widely reported in July 2022, while Country Garden, Sunac, and Kaisa also defaulted. CNBM full-year 2022 revenue fell 16% and cement-segment sales dropped 18%. Building Materials was dead last at #31/31, falling 31.7% vs SHCOMP -15.0%; the growth-style tilt (growth minus value +8.6pp) further punished the value-heavy sector. Cement utilisation rates fell below 60% and prices reversed sharply — the worst alpha destruction of any leg in this sector's 15-year record.","body_zh":"2022年中期，中国地产危机进一步恶化：购房者因烂尾楼问题大规模发起停贷运动（2022年7月见诸报道），碧桂园、融创、佳兆业相继违约。中国建材全年营收下降16%，水泥业务销售额下降18%。建筑材料在31个申万行业中排名垫底，下跌31.7%，而上证综指仅跌15.0%；成长风格主导（成长vs价值+8.6pp）进一步压制价值属性较重的建材板块。水泥产能利用率跌破60%，价格大幅逆转，是本板块15年历史中Alpha损毁最严重的下跌周期。","drivers":["mortgage boycott (stalled projects)","developer cascade defaults (Country Garden Sunac)","cement demand collapse","growth-style headwind for value cyclicals","utilisation rate crash below 60%"],"drivers_zh":["购房者停贷运动（烂尾楼）","开发商连环违约（碧桂园/融创）","水泥需求崩塌","成长风格压制价值周期股","产能利用率骤降至60%以下"],"title":"Property Crisis Deepens; Bldg Mat Worst Sector","title_zh":"地产危机加深，建材排名垫底"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"On November 1, 2022, Chinese stocks staged a broad rally on unverified social media speculation about a COVID Zero exit committee. On November 11, the government formally announced 20 pandemic control optimisation measures (shortened quarantine, PCR requirements removed for public transport). MSCI China rose 29% in November 2022 (best month since July 1999). Building Materials ranked #3/31 (+31.1%); cement stocks additionally benefited from the concurrent November 2022 '16 financial measures' developer rescue package, creating a dual property-demand plus reopening tailwind.","body_zh":"2022年11月1日，关于成立委员会研究清零政策退出路径的未经证实社交媒体传言推动A股全面反弹。11月11日，政府正式发布防疫优化20条（缩短隔离期、取消公共交通核酸要求）。MSCI中国指数11月大涨29%，为1999年7月以来最佳单月表现。建筑材料板块涨幅31.1%，在31个申万行业中排名第3；水泥股额外受益于同期发布的2022年11月房地产金融16条开发商救助方案，形成地产需求预期与重开双重顺风。","drivers":["COVID Zero exit anticipation","20-measure pandemic optimisation (Nov 11)","developer rescue 16 measures","reopening consumer trade","value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策退出预期","防疫优化20条（11月11日）","房地产金融16条","重开消费复苏主题","价值板块轮动"],"title":"COVID Zero Exit; Reopening + Policy Pivot","title_zh":"清零政策退出预期，重开+政策转向推动反弹"},"2023-02-21":{"body":"The reopening recovery proved weak for building materials: new housing starts fell 22% year-on-year through November 2023, and residential property sales value declined 10%. Cement production contracted 4.5% in 2023 and a further 9.8% in 2024; factory prices fell 5.6% in 2024 and utilisation rates dropped to 50%. Building Materials dropped 41.6% over this 12-month leg, ranking #27/31 — defensives (Coal +2%, Banks -3%) led as SHCOMP fell 18.3%. The sector's structural property-demand linkage proved a liability as developer failures persisted and deflationary pricing accelerated.","body_zh":"对于建筑材料而言，重开后的复苏短暂且脆弱：2023年1-11月新开工面积同比下降22%，住宅销售金额下降10%。2023年水泥产量萎缩4.5%，2024年进一步下滑9.8%；2024年出厂价格下降5.6%，产能利用率跌至50%。建筑材料板块在12个月内下跌41.6%，在31个申万行业中排名第27，防御板块（煤炭+2%，银行-3%）相对领跑，上证综指下跌18.3%。板块与地产需求的深度绑定成为结构性负担，开发商无力重启项目，建材价格通缩加速。","drivers":["property demand structural collapse","housing starts -22% YoY","cement price deflation (-5.6%)","developer insolvency ongoing","defensive flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["地产需求结构性崩塌","新开工面积同比-22%","水泥价格通缩（-5.6%）","开发商持续偿债困难","防御股避险轮动"],"title":"Property Demand Collapse; Cement Deflation","title_zh":"地产需求持续萎缩，水泥价格通缩"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"China's A-share market hit a multi-year trough on February 2, 2024 with SHCOMP near 2,700. New CSRC Chairman Wu Qing (appointed late January 2024) announced restrictions on quant HFT, bans on stock lending during lock-ups, and buyback encouragement. Central Huijin stepped up ETF purchases. SHCOMP rebounded 16.7%; cyclicals broadly led (cyclicals +22.8% vs defensives +14.6%), with Non-ferrous Metals (+40%), Chemicals (+32%), and Defense (+31%) fronting the recovery. Building Materials gained 22.4%, ranking #12/31 — a market-beta recovery without sector-specific demand improvement.","body_zh":"2024年2月2日A股触及多年低点，上证综指逼近2700点。1月底新任证监会主席吴清宣布限制量化高频交易、禁止锁定期内出借股票并鼓励回购，中央汇金加大ETF购入力度。上证综指随后上涨16.7%；周期股全面领跑（周期+22.8%对防御+14.6%），有色金属+40%、化工+32%、国防+31%居前。建筑材料涨幅22.4%，排名第12，为大盘Beta驱动的技术性反弹，板块需求端并无改善。","drivers":["national team ETF buying (Central Huijin)","CSRC market stability measures","oversold cyclical bounce","market floor stabilisation","broad beta recovery"],"drivers_zh":["国家队ETF购入（中央汇金）","证监会市场稳定举措","超跌周期股反弹","市场阶段性企稳","大盘Beta回升"],"title":"National Team ETF Buying; Market Floor Bounce","title_zh":"国家队买入ETF托底，市场阶段性反弹"},"2024-05-17":{"body":"Despite the February 2024 policy stabilization, property demand failed to recover: cement output fell 12% year-on-year in Q3 2024 and utilisation rates dropped to 50%. Large-scale building material enterprise revenue fell 12.2% in 2024 and total profits plunged 48.6%. SHCOMP fell 14.3%; Building Materials was the worst performer at #31/31 (-29.2%), while defensives led (Brokers -7.7%, Utilities -8.7%). Persistent cement price deflation, overcapacity, and structural property-demand impairment created an alpha-destructive environment for the third consecutive major down-leg.","body_zh":"尽管2024年2月出台了政策稳定措施，地产需求复苏仍告落空：2024年三季度水泥产量同比下降12%，产能利用率跌至50%。2024年大型建材企业营收下降12.2%，利润总额暴跌48.6%。上证综指下跌14.3%；建筑材料以-29.2%再度成为31个申万行业中跌幅最深的板块，防御股（券商-7.7%，公用事业-8.7%）相对领跑。水泥价格持续通缩、产能过剩与地产需求结构性受损共同构筑了连续第三次主要下跌周期中的负Alpha环境。","drivers":["cement demand structural decline","utilisation rates at 50%","property sales ongoing weakness","cement price deflation / price war","broad cyclical underperformance"],"drivers_zh":["水泥需求结构性下滑","产能利用率降至50%","房地产销售持续疲弱","水泥价格通缩/价格战","周期股全面跑输"],"title":"Property Recovery Fails; Bldg Mat Last Again","title_zh":"地产复苏再度落空，建材再度垫底"},"2024-09-13":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced the largest coordinated easing since 2015: 20bp policy rate cut, 50bp RRR cut injecting approximately RMB 1 trillion, 50bp existing mortgage rate cut, CNY 500bn equity swap facility, and CNY 300bn stock-buyback relending program. SHCOMP surged 48.9% from trough; Building Materials gained 134.8%, ranking #4/31 (Telecoms +332%, Electronics +282%, Conglom +142% led). The rally reflects both the broad index beta surge and an optionality bid on future infrastructure and urban-renewal demand (China announced a five-year urban renewal roadmap targeting 500,000 dilapidated housing units); but cement fundamental volumes remained structurally impaired through 2024-2025.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人民银行行长潘功胜宣布2015年以来最大规模协同宽松：政策利率下调20bp，降准50bp（释放约1万亿元流动性），存量按揭利率下调50bp，5000亿元证券互换便利及3000亿元股票回购专项再贷款。上证综指从低点反弹48.9%；建筑材料涨幅134.8%，在31个申万行业中排名第4，通信+332%、电子+282%、综合+142%领涨。板块反弹同时反映大盘Beta急涨，以及市场对未来基建与城市更新需求的期权价值定价，中国发布五年城市更新规划目标完成50万套危旧住房改造；但从基本面看，2024至2025年水泥实物需求仍呈结构性受损态势。","drivers":["PBOC Sept 24 rate and RRR cuts bazooka","CNY 500bn equity swap facility","urban renewal roadmap (500k units)","massive index beta surge","growth-style leadership (Telecoms/Electronics)"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行9月24日降息降准一揽子政策","5000亿元证券互换便利","城市更新规划（50万套危旧住房）","指数大幅Beta飙升","成长风格领涨（通信/电子）"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka + Fiscal Pivot; Massive Beta Rally","title_zh":"人民银行重磅刺激+财政转向，板块大幅Beta反弹"}},"now":"Building Materials (Shenwan 801710) is in a confirmed Topping phase at cycle position 87.8%, ranked #3/31 Shenwan industries with a +48.1% return in the current leg that began in September 2024. The current rally was launched by the PBOC's September 24, 2024 stimulus package (RRR -50bp, mortgage rate cuts, CNY 500bn equity swap facility) and is now sustained by a broad reflation and growth-style rotation; Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) lead, confirming the tape is liquidity-driven and growth-themed, with Building Materials riding index beta rather than a property-fundamentals recovery. Cyclicals are outpacing defensives by 46pp and SHCOMP is up 48.9%, placing this sector firmly in late-cycle beta territory. With cycle position at 87.8% of its historical range and the phaseLabel reading Topping, the risk of rotation out of high-beta cyclicals into defensive or pure-growth themes is materially elevated.","now_zh":"建筑材料申万801710当前处于确认见顶阶段，周期位置达87.8%，本轮行情始于2024年9月，涨幅48.1%，在31个申万行业中排名第3。本轮上涨由2024年9月24日人民银行一揽子刺激政策驱动，包括降准50bp、存量按揭利率下调及5000亿元证券互换便利；电子涨75.5%与通信涨67.7%领涨，印证行情由流动性与主题轮动主导，建材跟随市场Beta上行而非受地产基本面改善驱动。周期股跑赢防御股46个百分点，上证综指涨幅达48.9%，板块已进入周期末段Beta阶段。当前周期位置处于历史区间87.8%高位，阶段标签显示见顶，从高Beta周期股切换至防御或科技成长主题的风险正在上升。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801720":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The PBOC delivered four RRR cuts and five benchmark rate cuts between November 2014 and June 2015, flooding markets with cheap liquidity and igniting a margin-financing-driven A-share bull that pushed SHCOMP +138% to 5,166 by June 2015. Construction ranked #1/28 at +260%, far outpacing even the levered index: Beijing's simultaneous PPP infrastructure policy (MOF's PPP rollout launched 2014) and Belt-and-Road domestic pipeline kept large SOE contractor orderbooks (CSCEC, CRCC, CCCC) at cycle highs. Margin balances surged from CNY 698 bn to CNY 2.7 trillion, amplifying already-high cyclical beta (+192% cyclicals vs +117% defensives). The near-flat growth/value split (+4.8pp) confirms broad sector participation; the sector-specific overlay was the infrastructure policy narrative.","body_zh":"2014年11月至2015年6月间，人民银行连续四次降准、五次降息，充裕流动性点燃融资杠杆牛市，上证综指大涨138%至5166点。建筑装饰排名第1/28（+260%），远超指数涨幅：财政部2014年启动的PPP基建政策叠加「一带一路」国内管线，使中建、中铁建、中交建等央企龙头订单持续景气。融资余额从6980亿元膨胀至2.7万亿元，放大了周期板块的高贝塔属性（周期股+192% vs 防御股+117%）。成长/价值溢价仅+4.8pp，印证行情为全面普涨而非结构性主题，基建政策叙事是板块领跑的核心驱动。","drivers":["PBOC liquidity easing","margin financing leverage surge","PPP infrastructure rollout","SOE contractor orderbook expansion","broad A-share beta"],"drivers_zh":["央行宽松流动性","融资杠杆扩张","PPP基建政策启动","央企订单景气","A股整体贝塔"],"title":"Margin-fuelled leveraged bull; infrastructure order boom","title_zh":"融资杠杆牛市叠加基建订单景气"},"2015-06-05":{"body":"On June 12, 2015 the CSRC announced tightened rules on shadow-financed margin accounts, triggering forced deleveraging across all leveraged longs; SHCOMP fell -30.2% by July 8. Construction fell -40.7% (rank #17/28), underperforming the SHCOMP and consistent with cyclicals being hit harder (-41.2%) than defensives (-27.2%) in a risk-off unwind. Banks and food-and-beverage led defensively (-7.4% and -27.5%), while high-beta cyclicals like Coal (-58.8%), Defence (-51.5%), and Construction bore the brunt of forced margin selling. The July 5 PBOC/CSRC intervention (CNY 260 bn to China Securities Finance) temporarily arrested the fall.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，证监会公告清查场外配资，强制去杠杆触发全面抛盘，上证综指至7月8日累跌30.2%。建筑装饰下跌40.7%（排名第17/28），与周期股整体（-41.2%）走势一致，防御股（-27.2%）相对抗跌，银行与食品饮料领跌最少（分别-7.4%、-27.5%）。煤炭（-58.8%）、国防（-51.5%）等高贝塔周期板块与建筑共同承受配资强平冲击。7月5日证监会联合人民银行注入2600亿元至中国证券金融公司，暂时稳住跌势。","drivers":["CSRC margin-account crackdown","forced deleveraging liquidation","risk-off cyclical selloff","shadow financing unwind","SHCOMP -30% crash"],"drivers_zh":["证监会清查场外配资","强制去杠杆平仓","周期板块风险规避抛售","场外配资崩解","上证暴跌30%"],"title":"Leverage unwind; CSRC margin crackdown crash","title_zh":"去杠杆抛售：证监会清查场外配资"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"The July 5 CSRC/PBOC intervention package (CNY 260 bn to China Securities Finance; IPO suspensions; ban on shareholders with >5% stakes selling) stopped the crash and triggered a sharp technical rebound in SHCOMP +13.9% by August 17. This was a broad beta recovery: cyclicals (+37.1%) outpaced defensives (+16.8%) as the risk-off unwind reversed. Construction gained +25.2% but ranked only #19/28, lagging Coal (+104%), Defence (+78%), and Agriculture (+47%) — confirming this was index beta recovery, not sector-specific leadership. The catalyst was purely policy-driven market rescue, not any construction-specific demand.","body_zh":"7月5日证监会联合央行推出救市措施（2600亿元注入中国证券金融公司、暂停IPO、禁止大股东减持），强制终止暴跌并引发技术性反弹，上证至8月17日收复13.9%。这是全面贝塔修复：周期股（+37.1%）跑赢防御股（+16.8%），风险偏好逆转。建筑上涨25.2%但仅排名第19/28，落后于煤炭（+104%）、国防（+78%）、农业（+47%），确认行情为指数贝塔反弹而非建筑自身驱动。催化剂完全来自政策救市。","drivers":["government market rescue package","CSRC/PBOC joint intervention","technical rebound from oversold","broad beta recovery","risk-on reversal"],"drivers_zh":["政府联合救市措施","证监会与央行协同干预","超跌技术性反弹","全面贝塔修复","风险偏好逆转"],"title":"Government rescue rebound; broad beta recovery","title_zh":"政府救市反弹：全面贝塔修复"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015 the PBOC unexpectedly devalued the yuan by 1.9% (the largest single-day depreciation in decades) and shifted to a market-reference-rate mechanism, triggering a global EM risk-off cascade. SHCOMP fell -26.7% in nine trading days to August 26. Construction ranked #26/28 (-31.9%), a significant laggard behind even the already-weak cyclical average (-30.1%), reflecting its high beta to the broad market panic. Banks (-15.5%) and food-and-beverage (-19.7%) were defensive leaders, consistent with the flight-to-safety signal in ctx. The devaluation shock amplified fears of a hard landing and accelerated capital outflows.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，人民银行意外将人民币一次性贬值1.9%（数十年最大单日贬幅）并改革中间价形成机制，引发全球新兴市场风险规避连锁反应。上证综指九个交易日内暴跌26.7%至8月26日。建筑排名第26/28（-31.9%），大幅跑输周期股均值（-30.1%），显示其对整体市场恐慌的高贝塔暴露。银行（-15.5%）和食品饮料（-19.7%）相对抗跌，与ctx所示的避险轮动信号高度吻合。贬值冲击加剧了硬着陆担忧，加速了资本外流。","drivers":["yuan devaluation shock Aug-11","global EM risk-off cascade","capital outflow acceleration","hard-landing fear repricing","high-beta cyclical selloff"],"drivers_zh":["8月11日人民币意外贬值冲击","全球新兴市场风险规避","资本外流加速","硬着陆恐慌重定价","高贝塔周期板块抛售"],"title":"Yuan devaluation shock; global risk-off selloff","title_zh":"人民币意外贬值引发全球风险规避"},"2015-08-26":{"body":"After SHCOMP hit an intraday low near 2,850 on August 26, authorities accelerated market-stabilisation measures and the market rebounded +24.7% to November 11, with a clear growth/tech tilt (+7pp, led by Brokers +49.9%, Computers +47.1%, Media +38.4%). Construction gained +29.1% (rank #12/28), a decent mid-table performance but not a leader, as the rally was dominated by growth-narrative themes rather than infra cyclicals. The laggards were defensives and old-economy: Steel (+1.5%), Food-and-Bev (+15.4%). The government's PPP expansion plan (State Council Guideline No. 42, September 2015) provided a background positive for the sector but was not the dominant driver of this leg.","body_zh":"8月26日上证在2850点附近探底后，当局加码稳市措施，市场反弹24.7%至11月11日，呈现明显成长/科技风格偏向（+7pp，券商+49.9%、计算机+47.1%、传媒+38.4%领涨）。建筑上涨29.1%（排名第12/28），中等偏上但非领涨，行情由成长叙事主导而非基建周期。滞后者为防御与旧经济：钢铁+1.5%、食品饮料+15.4%。国务院2015年42号文PPP扩张指引提供了背景利好，但并非这一行情腿的主导驱动力。","drivers":["post-devaluation relief rally","government stabilisation measures","growth/tech sector rotation","PPP policy background tailwind","cyclical beta recovery"],"drivers_zh":["贬值后喘息反弹","政府稳市措施加码","成长/科技板块轮动","PPP政策背景利好","周期贝塔修复"],"title":"Post-devaluation relief bounce; growth theme","title_zh":"贬值后喘息反弹，成长风格主导"},"2015-11-11":{"body":"A fresh round of yuan depreciation pressure (CNY/USD breached 6.50 in December 2015) and the botched introduction of circuit breakers on January 4, 2016 triggered two market halts in four days, with SHCOMP falling -27.2% to January 28. Construction fell -33.7% (rank #24/28), underperforming as a high-beta cyclical; defensives led (-23.6% vs cyclicals -29.2%). The circuit-breaker mechanism, rather than calming markets, created a self-fulfilling rush to sell ahead of the 7% threshold. Regulators suspended the circuit-breaker on January 7 after just four trading days, but the damage confirmed this was a policy-mechanism failure compounding FX pressure.","body_zh":"2015年12月人民币再度承压（美元/人民币突破6.50），2016年1月4日熔断机制上线后四天内两度触发停市，上证综指至1月28日累跌27.2%。建筑下跌33.7%（排名第24/28），作为高贝塔周期板块跑输大盘，防御股相对抗跌（-23.6% vs 周期-29.2%）。熔断机制并未平抑波动，反而制造了抢在7%阈值前出逃的自我实现抛售。监管层于1月7日仅四个交易日后即暂停熔断，但政策机制失误叠加汇率压力已酿成重伤。","drivers":["circuit-breaker mechanism panic Jan-2016","CNY depreciation pressure","policy mechanism failure","risk-off cyclical selloff","year-end position liquidation"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月熔断机制引发恐慌性抛售","人民币贬值压力","政策机制失误","周期板块风险规避","年末仓位清盘"],"title":"Circuit-breaker panic; CNY pressure; year-end selloff","title_zh":"熔断机制恐慌、人民币贬压、年末抛售"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"From January 2016 the State Council launched supply-side structural reform, focusing on capacity cuts in steel/coal alongside accelerated infrastructure spending. PPP project inventory expanded to over CNY 17 trillion by end-2016, directly benefiting large construction SOEs. Construction ranked #2/28 (+59.7%), second only to Building Materials (+66.2%), in a strong value-tilt tape (value led by 15.2pp; growth lagged, with Media -8.3%). SHCOMP rose +23.8% over this 15-month leg as credit conditions eased. The BRI's first ministerial forum (May 2017) amplified overseas construction narratives for CSCEC and CCCC. This leg is the clearest example of Construction outperforming on policy-driven infrastructure demand, not just market beta.","body_zh":"2016年1月起，国务院推进供给侧结构性改革，对钢铁/煤炭去产能的同时加快基建投资。PPP项目库至2016年底已扩至逾17万亿元，中建、中交等央企直接受益。建筑排名第2/28（+59.7%），仅次于建材（+66.2%），处于明显价值风格主导（价值跑赢成长15.2pp，传媒-8.3%殿后）的行情结构中。上证综指在这一15个月行情中上涨23.8%，信用条件持续宽松。2017年5月首届「一带一路」国际合作高峰论坛进一步放大了中建、中交海外建设叙事。这是建筑板块凭借政策驱动基建需求而非单纯市场贝塔领跑的最典型案例。","drivers":["supply-side structural reform","PPP project pipeline expansion","Belt-and-Road Initiative contracts","value-style rotation","SOE contractor re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革","PPP项目库大幅扩容","一带一路合同落地","价值风格轮动","央企建筑龙头重估"],"title":"Supply-side reform; PPP/BRI order surge; value rotation","title_zh":"供给侧改革与PPP/一带一路订单潮，价值风格主导"},"2017-04-11":{"body":"From April 2017 Beijing pivoted to financial deleveraging: unified asset-management rules (April 2018) banned implicit guarantees on WMPs, trust loans collapsed, and shadow-bank funding to construction-related LGFVs dried up. Critically, the Ministry of Finance in November 2017 ordered a crackdown on illegal PPP projects, scrapping CNY 2.25 trillion of projects by April 2018 (over 2,334 projects). The US-China trade war escalated sharply from March 2018 (Section 301 tariffs on $50 bn of goods), suppressing domestic capex confidence. SHCOMP fell -24.4%; Construction dropped -45.6% (rank #21/28) as defensives (Food-and-Bev +17.7%, Banks -3.1%) led. This is the sector's deepest fundamental bear leg: policy withdrawal hit both the PPP order channel and off-budget financing simultaneously.","body_zh":"2017年4月起，北京转向金融去杠杆：2018年4月出台资管新规，禁止理财产品刚性兑付，信托贷款骤降，城投平台表外融资枯竭。2017年11月财政部专项整治违规PPP项目，至2018年4月累计清退逾2334个、金额2.25万亿元。2018年3月美国启动301条款关税（500亿美元商品），压制国内资本开支信心。上证下跌24.4%；建筑下跌45.6%（排名第21/28），食品饮料（+17.7%）、银行（-3.1%）等防御板块相对抗跌。这是建筑板块最深的基本面熊市腿：政策退潮同时切断PPP订单渠道与表外融资来源。","drivers":["financial deleveraging campaign","PPP project cancellation crackdown","shadow-banking contraction","US-China trade war tariffs","LGFV off-budget funding squeeze"],"drivers_zh":["金融去杠杆运动","PPP项目清库整治","影子银行萎缩","中美贸易战关税","城投平台表外融资收紧"],"title":"Deleveraging; PPP crackdown; trade-war shock","title_zh":"去杠杆整治、PPP清库叠加贸易战冲击"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"After SHCOMP hit a four-year low in October 2018, the PBOC cut the RRR four times in 2018-19 (cumulative 250 bps), injecting over CNY 3 trillion in liquidity. Premier Li Keqiang's February 2019 Government Work Report targeted GDP growth of 6-6.5% and announced nearly CNY 2 trillion of VAT cuts including manufacturing and construction. SHCOMP rebounded +31.5% by April 2019. However, Construction ranked only #24/28 (+32.1%), with growth-style sectors dominating (Agriculture +74%, Telecoms +68%, Conglomerates +62%): the rally was a broad risk-on, growth-led repricing of monetary easing, not a PPP/infrastructure-specific bid. Defensives and cyclicals rose nearly equally (32.1% vs 34.9%), confirming indiscriminate market recovery rather than sector-specific rotation.","body_zh":"2018年10月上证触及四年低位后，央行在2018-19年间四次降准（累计250基点），向市场注入逾3万亿元流动性。李克强2019年2月《政府工作报告》设定GDP增速目标6%-6.5%，并宣布近2万亿元减税降费。上证至2019年4月反弹31.5%。然而建筑排名仅第24/28（+32.1%），农业（+74%）、通信（+68%）、综合（+62%）等成长板块领涨：本轮反弹为货币宽松带动的全面风险偏好修复，并非基建/PPP专项催化。防御与周期涨幅相当（32.1% vs 34.9%），印证为无差别市场反弹而非结构性轮动。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts monetary easing","fiscal VAT cut stimulus","market reflation from Oct-2018 trough","broad risk-on recovery","trade-war ceasefire optimism"],"drivers_zh":["央行连续降准宽松","增值税减税财政刺激","2018年10月低点后市场反弹","全面风险偏好修复","贸易战停火乐观情绪"],"title":"PBOC easing; fiscal stimulus; market stabilisation","title_zh":"央行宽松、财政刺激与市场企稳"},"2019-04-19":{"body":"On May 5, 2019 Trump announced tariff increases from 10% to 25% on $200 bn of Chinese goods, triggering a sharp SHCOMP reversal (-14.9% by February 2020). Construction was far worse: -31.6%, ranking #27/28, as the sector bore the twin burden of the PPP project backlog cleanup (CNY 1.8 trillion of projects suspended by early 2019) and local-government debt audits that froze new project approvals. The February 2020 trough coincided with the COVID-19 market panic (markets re-opened February 3 after the Spring Festival holiday). Defensives (Electronics +26%, Pharma +6%, Food-and-Bev +1%) led while Construction lagged all cyclical peers, confirming risk-off rotation compounded by sector-specific structural headwinds.","body_zh":"2019年5月5日，特朗普宣布将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%上调至25%，上证综指随即逆转（至2020年2月累跌14.9%）。建筑则远更惨烈：下跌31.6%，排名第27/28——承受了PPP项目清库遗留压力（至2019年初已暂停1.8万亿元项目）与地方政府债务审计冻结新项目批复的双重打压。2020年2月的低点与新冠疫情市场恐慌（2月3日节后复市）相叠加。电子（+26%）、医药（+6%）、食品饮料（+1%）等防御板块领先，建筑落后于所有周期同行，印证为风险规避轮动叠加板块结构性逆风。","drivers":["US-China trade war tariff escalation May-2019","PPP project suspension backlog","local-government debt audit freeze","COVID-19 market panic trough","sector structural headwind extreme underperformance"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月中美贸易战关税升级","PPP清库项目积压","地方政府债务审计冻结新项目","新冠疫情市场恐慌探底","板块结构性逆风大幅跑输"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation; PPP backlog; sector extreme laggard","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级与PPP积压，板块大幅跑输"},"2020-02-04":{"body":"After markets re-opened February 3, 2020 in a COVID panic (-8% on day one), Beijing mounted an aggressive fiscal and monetary response: the PBOC injected CNY 1.2 trillion in repo liquidity by early February, and the March 2020 Politburo Standing Committee prioritised new infrastructure (5G, data centres, ultra-high-voltage grids, intercity rail) alongside traditional fixed-asset investment. Construction gained +24.5% by August 2020 but ranked only #18/28 in a tape dominated by Leisure/Services (+104%), Defence (+70%), and Food-and-Bev (+67%); SHCOMP rose +24.0%. Defensives led cyclicals (+34.5% vs +27.7%), confirming Construction participated as a mid-table cyclical rather than a leader, riding the infrastructure policy tailwind without sector-specific outperformance.","body_zh":"2020年2月3日节后市场复盘单日暴跌8%，北京随即推出大力度财政货币刺激：央行2月初注入1.2万亿元逆回购流动性，3月政治局常委会将「新基建」（5G、数据中心、特高压、城际轨交）列为优先投向，并配合传统固定资产投资。建筑至2020年8月上涨24.5%，但仅排名第18/28，行情由休闲服务（+104%）、国防（+70%）、食品饮料（+67%）主导；上证上涨24.0%。防御股（+34.5%）跑赢周期股（+27.7%），建筑以中等排名的周期股身份参与，受益于基建政策尾风但并非主线。","drivers":["COVID-19 fiscal and monetary response","new infrastructure policy (5G/rail/grid)","PBOC repo liquidity injection","growth/defensive style rotation","post-lockdown recovery bid"],"drivers_zh":["疫情财政与货币政策应对","新基建政策（5G/城铁/特高压）","央行逆回购流动性注入","成长/防御风格轮动","复工复产后的修复行情"],"title":"COVID stimulus; new infrastructure; recovery rally","title_zh":"疫情刺激与新基建政策驱动复苏行情"},"2020-08-18":{"body":"With SHCOMP essentially flat (+1.5%) from August 2020 to February 2021, this was a pure rotation leg: Power Equipment (+43.6%), Food-and-Bev (+33.2%), and Services (+29.4%) led, while high-leverage cyclicals were de-rated. Construction fell -20.7% (rank #25/28), alongside Computers (-22.4%), Telecoms (-27.1%), and Retail (-30.1%). The dominant driver was the Three Red Lines policy announced August 20, 2020, which capped developer leverage across three metrics (liabilities-to-assets, net gearing, cash-to-short-term-debt), directly contracting construction subcontractor orderflows from private developers. Value-style sectors held up (value led by 10.7pp), while Construction bore the property-financing linkage damage.","body_zh":"2020年8月至2021年2月上证综指基本持平（+1.5%），这是一轮纯粹的风格切换：电力设备（+43.6%）、食品饮料（+33.2%）、休闲服务（+29.4%）等防御/优质成长板块领涨，高杠杆周期板块遭估值压缩。建筑下跌20.7%（排名第25/28），与计算机（-22.4%）、通信（-27.1%）、商贸零售（-30.1%）同步受压。核心驱动是2020年8月20日发布的房地产行业「三道红线」政策，从负债率、净负债率、现金短债比三个维度限制开发商杠杆，直接导致民间端建筑分包订单萎缩。价值风格（价值跑赢成长10.7pp）相对抗跌，建筑因与地产融资链条高度关联而承压。","drivers":["Three Red Lines property leverage cap Aug-2020","developer orderflow contraction","style rotation from cyclicals to value/quality","flat SHCOMP with sector dispersion","construction-property linkage damage"],"drivers_zh":["2020年8月三道红线限杠杆政策","开发商订单萎缩","周期切换至价值/优质成长轮动","上证横盘中板块分化加剧","建筑与地产融资链条高度关联受损"],"title":"Three Red Lines property curb; cyclicals de-rated","title_zh":"三道红线限杠杆，周期股去估值，建筑跑输"},"2021-02-04":{"body":"From February 2021 China front-loaded special-purpose bond quotas for 2021-22 (CNY 3.65 trillion for 2022, pre-announced December 2021), directing funds predominantly into municipal construction, transportation, and public utilities. Beijing's dual-carbon 2030 roadmap (September 2021 carbon-peak targets) spurred investment in green infrastructure: ultra-high-voltage grids, pumped storage, urban upgrading. Construction ranked #2/31 (+34.6%), alongside Metals (+36.7%) and Steel (+34.1%), in a value-led, SHCOMP-flat tape (SHCOMP -0.3%; defensives -4.0% vs cyclicals +13.1%). This confirms Construction's outperformance was genuine policy-driven re-rating, not market beta, driven by the infrastructure capex cycle and SOE contractor revenue visibility.","body_zh":"2021年2月起，财政部提前下达专项债额度（2021年12月预下达2022年度3.65万亿元），重点投向市政建设、交通运输与公用事业。2021年9月「双碳」目标落地，推动绿色基建（特高压、抽水蓄能、城市更新）加速投放。建筑排名第2/31（+34.6%），与有色金属（+36.7%）、钢铁（+34.1%）并驾齐驱，上证综指仅-0.3%，防御股-4.0%，周期股+13.1%，价值风格主导。这印证了建筑跑赢并非依赖市场贝塔，而是基建资本开支周期与央企营收能见度提升带来的真实政策驱动重估。","drivers":["special-purpose bond front-loading","dual-carbon infrastructure capex","SOE contractor revenue visibility","value-style rotation leadership","infrastructure spending acceleration"],"drivers_zh":["专项债提前批额度","双碳政策绿色基建投入","央企建筑订单能见度提升","价值风格领涨","基建投资提速"],"title":"Infrastructure special bonds; dual-carbon policy; value leadership","title_zh":"专项债基建配套与双碳政策，价值板块领涨"},"2022-02-18":{"body":"From February 2022, multiple compounding shocks hit the sector: Omicron outbreaks triggered city-level lockdowns (Shanghai April-May 2022, disrupting construction sites); the Federal Reserve's aggressive rate-hike cycle (March 2022 liftoff, +425 bps in 2022) pressured EM risk appetite; and Evergrande's formal restructuring proceedings exposed the depth of the property-sector crisis, drying up developer-funded construction orders. SHCOMP fell -17.1%; Construction dropped -22.4% (rank #21/31). Coal (+4.4%) and Defence (-0.6%) led due to Russia-Ukraine energy security (war began February 2022), not a clean defensives-vs-cyclicals pattern. Building Materials (-35.7%) and Steel (-29.2%) were deepest laggards, further confirming property-chain damage as the primary sectoral driver.","body_zh":"2022年2月起，多重冲击叠加：奥密克戎疫情触发城市封控（2022年4-5月上海封城，施工现场停工）；美联储激进加息（3月启动、年内累加425基点）压制新兴市场风险偏好；恒大正式启动重组程序，暴露地产危机深度，开发商端建筑订单枯竭。上证综指下跌17.1%；建筑下跌22.4%（排名第21/31）。煤炭（+4.4%）和国防（-0.6%）因俄乌战争（2022年2月爆发）的能源安全逻辑相对领跑，并非典型避险轮动。建材（-35.7%）与钢铁（-29.2%）跌幅最深，进一步印证地产产业链受损为板块主轴逻辑。","drivers":["COVID Omicron city lockdowns","Evergrande restructuring/property crisis","Federal Reserve aggressive rate-hike cycle","Russia-Ukraine energy shock commodity bid","developer orderflow collapse"],"drivers_zh":["奥密克戎城市封控","恒大重组与地产危机","美联储激进加息周期","俄乌战争能源冲击带动大宗品","开发商订单骤降"],"title":"Omicron lockdowns; Evergrande crisis; global rate shock","title_zh":"奥密克戎封控、恒大危机叠加全球加息冲击"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"October 31, 2022 marked the SHCOMP trough following the 20th Party Congress selloff. On November 13, the PBOC and banking regulator issued the 16-point property rescue measures (CNY 200 bn for housing completions; November RRR cut of 25 bps; expanded developer credit lines). China began dismantling zero-COVID from December 7, 2022, with full reopening from January 2023. Construction ranked #2/31 (+33.5%) in a +17.3% SHCOMP rally to May 2023, with a growth-style tilt (+8.4pp). Construction was an explicit leader alongside Media (+83.7%) and Brokers (+30.5%), benefiting from reopening of construction sites and the property rescue pipeline. The leg confirms Construction re-rates strongly when policy rescue directly funds project completions.","body_zh":"2022年10月31日上证触及二十大后低点。11月13日央行与银保监联合发布房地产「十六条」（2000亿元保交楼配套资金、11月下调存款准备金率25基点、扩大开发商授信）。中国自2022年12月7日起逐步取消清零管控，2023年1月起全面放开。建筑排名第2/31（+33.5%），上证综指至2023年5月上涨17.3%，成长风格小幅占优（+8.4pp）。建筑作为明确领涨板块，与传媒（+83.7%）、非银金融（+30.5%）并列前排，受益于施工现场复工与保交楼政策管线。这一行情腿印证：政策救市直接覆盖项目竣工资金时，建筑板块重估弹性最强。","drivers":["zero-COVID policy exit Dec-2022","16-point property rescue measures","housing completion funding release","PBOC RRR cut and credit expansion","construction-site reopening activity"],"drivers_zh":["2022年12月清零政策退出","房地产十六条救市措施","保交楼专项资金投放","央行降准与信贷扩张","施工现场全面复工"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit; 16-point property rescue; reopening re-rating","title_zh":"清零政策退出、十六条地产救市与重开放重估"},"2023-05-08":{"body":"By May 2023 the post-reopening recovery narrative faded: property sales remained far below pre-crisis levels, and Country Garden (China's largest private developer) warned of a CNY 45-55 bn net loss for H1 2023, filing for Chapter 15 US bankruptcy protection in August 2023. Local-government special-bond issuance was constrained by debt-capacity limits, and LGFV hidden-debt audits launched in 2023 froze new project approvals. SHCOMP fell -20.0%; Construction dropped -40.9% (rank #26/31), the sector's third-worst bear leg. Appliances (+3.9%), Autos (-3.2%), and Utilities (-7.6%) led defensively. The value tilt (+8.3pp) and absence of a clean defensives-vs-cyclicals signal indicates idiosyncratic sector pain from the property and fiscal double-bind.","body_zh":"2023年5月起，重开放后的复苏叙事逐步落空：楼市销售仍远低于危机前水平，碧桂园（中国最大民营房企）预告2023年上半年净亏损450亿至550亿元，并于8月向美国法院申请第15章破产保护。地方政府专项债受举债能力上限制约，加之城投隐性债务审计（2023年启动）冻结新项目审批。上证综指下跌20.0%；建筑下跌40.9%（排名第26/31），为板块第三大熊市腿。家电（+3.9%）、汽车（-3.2%）、公用事业（-7.6%）相对抗跌。价值风格小幅领先（+8.3pp），防御/周期分化信号不显著，印证建筑的大幅跑输源于地产与财政的双重结构性困境。","drivers":["Country Garden default/property crisis deepening","LGFV hidden-debt audit freeze","special-bond issuance constraint","property sales demand destruction","construction orderbook evaporation"],"drivers_zh":["碧桂园违约与地产危机加深","城投隐性债务审计冻结","专项债发行空间受限","楼市需求持续低迷","建筑订单快速萎缩"],"title":"Property recovery disappointment; LGFV debt squeeze","title_zh":"地产复苏不及预期与城投债务收紧"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"On September 24, 2024 PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a landmark package: 20 bps policy rate cut, 50 bps RRR cut injecting CNY 1 trillion, 50 bps mortgage rate reduction, and CNY 800 bn in stock-market support facilities (SFISF swap facility + CNY 300 bn refinancing). Real estate support included down-payment ratio cuts and expanded developer funding. SHCOMP surged +27.7% by November 7; Construction gained +47.3% (rank #6/31), benefiting directly from property rescue (Real Estate sector +56.0%) and infrastructure financing reopening. Cyclicals led (+33.9% vs defensives +24.9%) with a strong growth tilt (+15.6pp). Construction's upper-quartile performance reflects genuine sector re-rating on both property pipeline recovery and government bond-funded infrastructure expectations.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子重磅政策：下调政策利率20基点、降准50基点（释放1万亿元流动性）、存量房贷利率降50基点，并推出8000亿元股市支持工具（互换便利5000亿+回购增持再贷款3000亿）。地产支持包括降低首付比例、扩大房企融资渠道。上证至11月7日大涨27.7%；建筑上涨47.3%（排名第6/31），直接受益于地产救市（房地产板块+56.0%）和基建融资政策松绑。周期股（+33.9%）跑赢防御股（+24.9%），成长风格小幅占优（+15.6pp）。建筑跻身前四分之一，印证了地产管线修复与政府债券基建预期带来的真实板块重估。","drivers":["PBOC September-24 rate and RRR cuts","property sector rescue package","stock-market support facilities","infrastructure financing reopening","cyclical risk-on beta rally"],"drivers_zh":["央行924降息降准","地产行业救市政策组合拳","股市支持工具落地","基建融资政策松绑","周期板块风险偏好反弹"],"title":"September-24 PBOC mega-stimulus; property support package","title_zh":"924央行大礼包与地产支持政策组合拳"},"2024-11-07":{"body":"Donald Trump's November 2024 election victory triggered fears of 60%+ tariffs on Chinese goods; by April 2025 tariffs reached 145% before being reduced to 30% via the May 12 truce. The October 2024 NPC fiscal package (CNY 10 trillion for LGFV debt refinancing) disappointed markets expecting direct demand stimulus. Construction fell -20.7% (rank #28/31), the deepest laggard, as Banks (+1.6%), Autos (-5.1%), and Machinery (-7.4%) led; defensives outperformed cyclicals (-8.3% vs -14.8%). Construction's worst-in-cohort ranking confirms it bore maximum exposure to the intersection of tariff demand-shock risk, property sector stagnation, and the fiscal refinancing package's failure to generate new construction orders.","body_zh":"特朗普11月胜选引发外界对中国商品60%以上关税的担忧；至2025年4月关税升至145%，经5月12日协议降至30%。2024年10月人大批准的10万亿元城投债务置换方案令市场失望，投资者期待直接需求刺激但未能如愿。建筑下跌20.7%（排名第28/31），为最大跌幅，银行（+1.6%）、汽车（-5.1%）、机械（-7.4%）相对领先，防御股跑赢周期股（-8.3% vs -14.8%）。建筑的末位排名印证其对关税需求冲击风险、地产停滞与债务置换包未能产生新订单三重叠加暴露最为显著。","drivers":["Trump tariff escalation to 145%","fiscal package focused on LGFV debt refinancing not new capex","property sector stagnation","risk-off flight to defensives","construction orderbook no new-start pipeline"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普关税升至145%","财政方案侧重债务置换而非需求刺激","地产行业持续低迷","避险资金流向防御板块","建筑新开工管线匮乏"],"title":"Trump tariff escalation; fiscal stimulus underwhelm; selloff","title_zh":"特朗普关税升级、财政刺激不及预期，板块回调"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"On April 2, 2025 the US imposed 34% Liberation Day tariffs; markets hit their trough on April 7 (SHCOMP at a cycle low). The May 12 US-China tariff truce reducing duties to 30%/10% triggered a powerful risk-on reversal: SHCOMP rallied +32.3% by March 2026. Telecoms (+128%), Metals (+122%), and Conglomerates (+105%) led emphatically in a growth-biased cyclical tape (+23.8pp style gap; cyclicals +49.4% vs defensives +10.0%). Construction gained +39.3% (rank #16/31), a solid recovery but in the bottom half of the universe, confirming the sector participated as a mid-table cyclical beta trade rather than a structural leader. The domestic backdrop of expanded special-bond infrastructure quotas for 2025 provided support but could not overcome the persistent property-sector headwind.","body_zh":"2025年4月2日，美国宣布34%「解放日」关税，市场于4月7日探底。5月12日中美关税协议将税率分别降至30%与10%，触发强烈风险偏好反转：上证至2026年3月累涨32.3%。通信（+128%）、有色金属（+122%）、综合（+105%）大幅领涨，成长风格显著占优（+23.8pp，周期股+49.4% vs 防御股+10.0%）。建筑上涨39.3%（排名第16/31），幅度可观但仍处于全市场下半区，确认其为中等排位的周期贝塔反弹而非结构性领涨板块。2025年扩大的专项债基建额度提供了政策支撑，但尚不足以克服持续的地产行业逆风。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce May-2025","risk-on cyclical beta rebound from April trough","SHCOMP recovery broad market rally","special-bond infrastructure quota expansion","growth-style dominance limited Construction to mid-table"],"drivers_zh":["中美5月2025年关税休战","风险偏好改善推动周期贝塔从4月低点反弹","上证综指全面修复","专项债基建额度扩容","成长风格主导限制建筑至中等排位"],"title":"Tariff truce relief rally; broad cyclical beta rebound","title_zh":"关税休战提振风险偏好，周期股全面贝塔反弹"}},"now":"Construction is in a confirmed trough/bottoming phase as of late June 2026, sitting at just 2.4% above its cycle low with rs_rank 17/31, deep in the laggard half of Shenwan. The current tape is a growth-led cyclical-beta rally (Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%; SHCOMP +1.6%), but Construction has posted only -5.1% in the current window (rank 13/31), confirming it has not yet caught the reflation bid. The persistent underperformance versus the cyclical average (+0.3%) reflects the dual drag of property-sector debt overhang curtailing private developer orderbooks and constrained local-government special-bond disbursement capacity, even as the May 2025 US-China tariff truce and DeepSeek-era tech optimism lifted the broad market. A genuine Construction re-rating requires either a fresh fiscal infrastructure push via special-bond quota expansion or property stabilisation that restores developer spending; neither is confirmed in the current price or rotation data.","now_zh":"建筑装饰板块截至2026年6月底处于确认筑底阶段，距周期低点仅2.4%，申万排名17/31，深陷滞后阵营。当前市场为成长主导的周期贝塔行情（电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%领涨，上证+1.6%），但建筑本窗口仅录得-5.1%（排名第13），尚未接棒反弹。相对周期股整体均值（+0.3%）的持续跑输，折射出房地产债务拖累与地方政府专项债放量空间受限的双重压力，即便5月中美关税休战及DeepSeek科技乐观情绪已提振大盘。板块真正再评级需新一轮基建财政冲量（专项债额度扩容）或地产企稳带动开发商订单回暖——当前价格与轮动数据尚无法确认上述催化剂落地。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801730":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The 2014-2015 A-share mega-bull, fuelled by PBOC benchmark rate cuts beginning November 2014 (from 6.0% to 5.6%) and multiple RRR reductions, plus the Internet Plus policy wave under the 13th Five-Year Plan preparation cycle, drove a +144% SHCOMP surge through June 2015. Power Equipment gained 173% but ranked only 16th of 28 Shenwan industries, confirming the move was predominantly broad cyclical beta driven by leveraged retail margin flows rather than sector-specific outperformance — computers (+256%) and construction (+253%) far exceeded it. New energy names received an added thematic boost from Beijing's November 2014 Xi-Obama bilateral carbon pledge (non-fossil fuel to 20% of primary energy by 2030) and accelerating solar/wind installation targets; China's total renewable capacity exceeded 1,849GW by end-2015. The rally was essentially a liquidity-driven broad market up-leg with a modest green-energy premium.","body_zh":"2014-2015年A股大牛市由2014年11月起多轮降息（基准利率从6.0%降至5.6%）及降准驱动，配合互联网+和第十三个五年规划预热周期，上证综指累计上涨144%。电力设备涨幅达173%，但在28个申万行业中仅排第16位，表明涨幅主要源于市场整体的融资买入式普涨——计算机（+256%）、建筑（+253%）涨幅远超其上。2014年11月习奥双边碳减排承诺（非化石能源占一次能源比重2030年前达20%）及不断提速的风电、光伏装机目标为新能源板块提供了主题加成。本轮行情本质上是流动性驱动的宽基上涨，新能源板块享有小幅主题溢价。","drivers":["PBOC rate/RRR easing cycle","margin-financed retail bull market","Internet Plus / new energy policy","broad cyclical beta","Xi-Obama carbon pledge Nov 2014"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准周期","融资杠杆散户牛市","互联网+/新能源政策","宽基周期性Beta","习奥气候承诺2014年11月"],"title":"A-share mega-bull and new energy policy boom","title_zh":"A股杠杆牛市与新能源政策红利"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015 the CSRC announced draft rules tightening regulation of shadow-margin lending, triggering an immediate forced-deleveraging cascade. Within four weeks SHCOMP fell 32%, and Power Equipment dropped 44.5% (rank 19/28). Ctx confirms a clear flight-to-safety rotation: defensives fell only -30.4% while cyclicals lost -43.0%, and value outperformed growth by 6pp — the hallmark pattern of a liquidity crunch unwinding the most-leveraged, highest-beta positions. Power Equipment, having rallied most aggressively on retail momentum, faced outsized margin-call selling. The circuit-breaker-style interventions introduced in subsequent weeks (state funds buying ETFs, IPO suspensions) did not prevent the bulk of the drawdown during this leg.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会公布清理场外配资征求意见稿，引发强制去杠杆连锁反应。四周内上证综指下跌32%，电力设备跌幅达44.5%（排名19/28）。背景数据印证明显的避险轮动：防御板块仅跌-30.4%，周期板块跌-43.0%，价值跑赢成长6pp——这是流动性紧缩平仓最高杠杆、最高贝塔头寸的典型特征。电力设备此前在零售融资买入中涨幅最猛，因此面临最大规模的追保抛售压力。国家队通过买入ETF等干预措施也未能阻止本阶段主要跌幅。","drivers":["CSRC shadow-margin crackdown June 12","margin-call forced deleveraging","flight-to-safety rotation","growth/cyclical overweight unwind","retail panic selling"],"drivers_zh":["证监会清理场外配资6月12日","保证金追缴强制去杠杆","避险轮动","成长/周期超配平仓","散户恐慌性抛售"],"title":"Margin deleveraging crash wipes bubble gains","title_zh":"保证金去杠杆崩盘抹去泡沫收益"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Following the July 8 CSRC emergency halt of short-selling plus the formation of a state-backed China Securities Finance rescue vehicle (injecting over CNY 1.5 trillion into equity markets), A-shares staged a sharp relief bounce with SHCOMP recovering +14%. Power Equipment gained 30.3% (rank 12/28) in a broad cyclical risk-on rebound — Coal surged 104% and Defense 78% as the most oversold sectors snapped back hardest. The ctx confirms cyclicals (+37.1%) far outpaced defensives (+16.8%), consistent with a short-squeeze/relief rally rather than a fundamental re-rating. The bounce was technically driven and did not mark a sustainable trough.","body_zh":"2015年7月8日证监会紧急叫停融券卖空，并组建以中国证券金融公司为核心的国家队（注资超1.5万亿元）购入股票，A股出现大幅技术性反弹，上证综指回升+14%。电力设备涨30.3%（排名12/28），煤炭暴涨104%、国防军工78%，超跌板块弹幅最猛。背景数据印证周期板块（+37.1%）远超防御板块（+16.8%），这是短期逼空/急救式反弹而非基本面重新定价。本次反弹具有明显技术属性，并未构成可持续底部。","drivers":["China Securities Finance rescue fund","CSRC short-sale ban July 8","oversold bounce / short squeeze","broad cyclical mean reversion","state-directed equity buying"],"drivers_zh":["中证金救市基金","证监会禁止融券7月8日","超跌反弹/逼空","宽基周期性均值回归","国家队定向买入"],"title":"Government rescue bounce, cyclical rebound","title_zh":"国家救市反弹，周期板块急速修复"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC introduced a surprise one-off CNY devaluation (RMB weakened ~2% vs USD in a single day) alongside a new market-determined fixing mechanism, triggering panic over capital outflows and a second wave of A-share selling. SHCOMP fell a further 24.8% through September 15, and Power Equipment dropped 33.9% (rank 21/28). Flight-to-safety dominated: defensives fell only -20.6% vs cyclicals -30.9%, and value outperformed growth by 5pp. The FX shock amplified fears about China's economic hard landing, and the State Council's September 13 pledge of no major further devaluation provided the eventual floor that halted this leg.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行推出一次性人民币贬值（单日对美元贬值约2%）并同步推行新汇率中间价形成机制，引发市场对资本外流的恐慌，A股开启二次下跌。上证综指至9月15日再跌24.8%，电力设备跌33.9%（排名21/28）。避险轮动主导：防御板块仅跌-20.6%，周期板块跌-32.9%，价值跑赢成长5pp。汇率冲击放大了市场对中国经济硬着陆的担忧；国务院9月13日承诺不再大幅贬值，最终为本阶段筑底提供了政策底。","drivers":["PBOC CNY devaluation Aug 11","capital outflow fears","flight-to-safety rotation","hard-landing macro concerns","second wave deleveraging"],"drivers_zh":["央行人民币意外贬值8月11日","资本外流担忧","避险轮动","宏观硬着陆担忧","二次去杠杆"],"title":"CNY devaluation shock, second crash wave","title_zh":"人民币贬值冲击，A股二次探底"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"With the CNY devaluation shock absorbed and the PBOC implementing the fifth consecutive benchmark rate cut (to 4.35%) and RRR reduction on October 23, 2015, A-shares staged a two-month recovery rally with SHCOMP rising +21.4%. Power Equipment gained 47.1% (rank 6/28), outperforming the index as growth themes re-engaged — Computers surged 65% and Electronics 54%, alongside Coal (53%) as the tape morphed into a combined growth-plus-cyclical rebound. The ctx confirms cyclicals (+33.1%) led defensives (+20.6%) and growth outperformed value by 19pp, consistent with a risk-on rotation into beaten-down growth and new energy names. Policy rhetoric around Made in China 2025 and green energy provided the thematic backdrop.","body_zh":"人民币贬值冲击消化后，央行于2015年10月23日再度降息（基准利率降至4.35%）并同步降准，A股展开为期两个月的修复行情，上证综指涨+21.4%。电力设备涨47.1%（排名6/28），跑赢指数，成长主线重新活跃——计算机暴涨65%、电子54%；背景数据印证周期板块（+33.1%）领跑防御板块（+20.6%），成长跑赢价值19pp，符合超跌成长股和新能源标的风险偏好回升的特征。中国制造2025及绿色能源政策方向为本阶段反弹提供主题支撑。","drivers":["PBOC Oct 23 rate and RRR cut","post-devaluation stabilization","growth/tech reengagement","Made in China 2025 theme","risk-on cyclical rebound"],"drivers_zh":["央行10月23日降息+降准","贬值冲击消化后稳定","成长/科技重新活跃","中国制造2025主题","风险偏好回升周期反弹"],"title":"Stabilization rally: growth and tech rebound","title_zh":"稳定反弹：成长与科技重获资金青睐"},"2015-11-25":{"body":"China introduced a stock market circuit-breaker mechanism on January 4, 2016, which immediately triggered itself twice in the first week, amplifying selling and forcing its suspension on January 7. Simultaneously, the PBOC allowed CNY to depreciate further (fixing weakened to 6.56 vs USD), reigniting capital-flight fears. SHCOMP fell 26.3% through end-February, and Power Equipment dropped 34.6% (rank 23/28). Context confirms a strong flight-to-safety pattern: defensives fell only -23.1% vs cyclicals -28.6%, and value outperformed growth by 6.7pp — Banks, Food & Bev, and Real Estate led while Computers (-37%), Media (-36%), and Defense (-40%) lagged. The circuit-breaker design flaw (5% trigger halting trading) forced panic front-running and disproportionately punished growth stocks including power equipment.","body_zh":"2016年1月4日A股熔断机制上线，首周即两度触发并被迫于1月7日暂停实施，机制设计缺陷引发恐慌性抢跑。同期央行放任人民币进一步贬值（中间价跌至6.56），再度点燃资本外流担忧。上证综指至2月底跌26.3%，电力设备跌34.6%（排名23/28）。背景数据印证明显的避险轮动：防御板块仅跌-23.1%，周期板块跌-28.6%，价值跑赢成长6.7pp——银行、食品饮料、地产领跑，计算机（-37%）、传媒（-36%）、国防（-40%）垫底。熔断机制设计缺陷（5%触发暂停）导致成长股遭受不成比例的抛售压力。","drivers":["circuit-breaker design flaw Jan 4 2016","CNY depreciation fear renewal","flight-to-safety value rotation","growth/tech de-rating","capital outflow concerns"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制设计缺陷2016年1月4日","人民币再次贬值担忧","避险价值轮动","成长/科技估值压缩","资本外流担忧"],"title":"January 2016 circuit-breaker crash, value flight","title_zh":"2016年1月熔断机制崩溃，资金抱团价值防御"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"Following the circuit-breaker suspension and the G20 Shanghai Communique (Feb 26-27, 2016) pledging coordinated fiscal stimulus, A-shares recovered with SHCOMP rising +20.8% through November 2016. The rally was led by supply-side reform beneficiaries — Building Materials (+43%), Construction (+42%), and Food & Bev (+37%) — as infrastructure spending accelerated under the 13th Five-Year Plan's first year. Power Equipment gained 29.2% (rank 14/28), in line with the broad market but not a standout leader; the ctx shows neither clear growth nor value dominance (growth-minus-value only -2.8pp), confirming this was a broad recovery driven by fiscal policy confidence rather than a thematic new-energy trade. Fixed-asset investment targets for power grids and renewables provided a steady tailwind without the speculative premium of 2015.","body_zh":"熔断机制暂停、2016年2月26-27日G20上海公报承诺协调财政刺激后，A股展开修复行情，上证综指至11月累计上涨+20.8%。建材（+43%）、建筑（+42%）、食品饮料（+37%）等供给侧改革受益板块引领涨幅，第十三个五年规划首年基础设施投资提速。电力设备涨29.2%（排名14/28），与大盘同步但并非领涨，背景数据显示成长与价值差异仅-2.8pp，印证此轮为财政政策信心恢复驱动的宽基修复，而非新能源主题行情。电网及可再生能源固定资产投资目标提供稳定顺风，但无2015年式的投机溢价。","drivers":["G20 Shanghai fiscal coordination pledge","supply-side reform policy","infrastructure FAI acceleration","13th Five-Year Plan launch","circuit-breaker removal confidence"],"drivers_zh":["G20上海公报协调财政刺激","供给侧改革政策","基础设施固定资产投资提速","第十三个五年规划启动","熔断机制取消提振信心"],"title":"Supply-side reform rally, infrastructure leads","title_zh":"供给侧改革驱动反弹，基建板块领跑"},"2016-11-22":{"body":"From late November 2016, A-shares entered a white-horse (blue-chip consumer/finance) rotation driven by the CSRC's crackdown on speculative small-cap trading and bond market deleveraging (10-year Chinese government yield rose from 2.7% to 3.9% by year-end 2016). SHCOMP fell modestly -4.5% but growth stocks bore the brunt: Computers (-22%), Conglomerates (-24%), and Media (-26%) led declines while Appliances (+13%), Food & Bev (+9%), and Banks (+3%) outperformed. Power Equipment fell 18.8% (rank 21/28), consistent with the growth-style de-rating (growth-minus-value = -10.9pp). This was not a macro recession but a style rotation as regulators forced speculative money from small/mid-cap growth into large-cap quality, ahead of MSCI China inclusion discussions.","body_zh":"2016年11月起，证监会加强对投机性小市值炒作的整治，债券市场去杠杆（10年期国债收益率从2.7%升至年底3.9%），A股进入白马股（蓝筹消费/金融）行情。上证综指仅小幅下跌-4.5%，但成长股承压显著：计算机（-22%）、综合（-24%）、传媒（-26%）领跌，家用电器（+13%）、食品饮料（+9%）、银行（+3%）跑赢。电力设备跌18.8%（排名21/28），符合成长风格压缩特征（成长-价值=-10.9pp）。这不是宏观衰退，而是监管引导资金从小盘成长转向大盘优质蓝筹的风格轮换，背景是MSCI纳入A股谈判进行中。","drivers":["CSRC small-cap speculation crackdown","bond market deleveraging (CGB yield spike)","white-horse quality rotation","growth-to-value style shift","MSCI A-share inclusion preparation"],"drivers_zh":["证监会打压小市值投机","债市去杠杆（国债收益率上行）","白马蓝筹轮动","成长转价值风格切换","MSCI纳入A股预期"],"title":"White-horse rotation; growth stocks de-rated","title_zh":"白马股轮动，成长股估值压缩"},"2017-06-01":{"body":"With MSCI confirming A-share partial inclusion (announced June 20, 2017) and the PBOC maintaining accommodative liquidity conditions, A-shares staged a mild recovery with SHCOMP rising +11.1% through November 2017. The rally was broad-based without a clear style tilt (growth-minus-value only +1.9pp): Food & Bev (+40%), Electronics (+34%), and Metals (+33%) led, while defensives like Utilities fell -0.5%. Power Equipment gained 18.3% (rank 8/28), consistent with a modest risk-on broadening. The new energy vehicle credit mandate system (NEV credits, introduced March 2017 for implementation from 2018) began attracting investor attention to EV supply chain names within the power equipment universe, providing incremental upside beyond pure index beta.","body_zh":"2017年6月20日MSCI宣布将A股部分纳入，央行维持宽松流动性，上证综指至11月上涨+11.1%。行情较为均衡，成长与价值差异仅+1.9pp：食品饮料（+40%）、电子（+34%）、有色金属（+33%）领涨，公用事业等防御板块微跌-0.5%。电力设备涨18.3%（排名8/28），与市场整体风险偏好回升一致。2017年3月发布、2018年起实施的新能源汽车积分制度开始吸引投资者关注EV产业链标的，为电力设备板块提供了超越纯指数Beta的增量上行空间。","drivers":["MSCI A-share inclusion announcement","PBOC accommodative liquidity","NEV credit mandate (2018 implementation)","EV supply chain re-rating","broad balanced risk-on rebound"],"drivers_zh":["MSCI纳入A股公告","央行宽松流动性","新能源汽车积分制度（2018年实施）","EV产业链重新定价","宽基均衡风险偏好回升"],"title":"Mid-year recovery; balanced sector rebound","title_zh":"年中回暖，行业均衡反弹"},"2017-11-13":{"body":"The US-China trade war escalated sharply from January 2018 (steel/aluminum tariffs in March, $34bn technology-focused tariffs on July 6, and $200bn additional tariffs in September 2018 targeting Made in China 2025 sectors). SHCOMP fell 27.9% through October 2018, and Power Equipment dropped a severe 46.8% — ranking dead last (25/28) — worse even than the market's own cyclical average (-33.0%). Defensives fell only -23.9% vs cyclicals -33.0% (flight-to-safety), and value outpaced growth by 12.9pp. Power Equipment was hit disproportionately because it was perceived as a direct target of the Section 301 tariffs (solar panels, EV batteries, and inverters) and because the sector's high-beta growth profile made it the first to be cut during risk-off deleveraging.","body_zh":"2018年美中贸易战持续升级：3月钢铝关税、7月6日对华340亿美元科技产品加征25%关税、9月再对2000亿美元商品加税，重点打击中国制造2025相关领域。上证综指至2018年10月跌27.9%，电力设备暴跌46.8%，在28个行业中垫底（25/28），跌幅甚至超过周期板块均值（-33.0%）。防御板块仅跌-23.9%，价值跑赢成长12.9pp，避险轮动特征明显。电力设备因光伏组件、EV电池、逆变器被直接列入关税清单，叠加高贝塔成长属性在去杠杆中首当其冲，跌幅居于申万板块最后。","drivers":["US Section 301 tariffs on solar/EV/tech","trade war Made in China 2025 targeting","flight-to-safety growth de-rating","SHCOMP -27.9% broad bear","regulatory credit crackdown (P2P)"],"drivers_zh":["美国301条款对光伏/EV/科技加税","贸易战精准打击中国制造2025","避险资金撤离成长股","上证综指-27.9%熊市","P2P等金融监管收紧"],"title":"Trade war shock; growth tech worst performer","title_zh":"贸易战冲击，成长科技跌幅最惨"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"From October 18, 2018 through April 2019, A-shares recovered sharply as the PBOC cut RRR four times (total 250bp through end-2018 and early 2019), personal income tax cuts took effect in January 2019, and hopes for a US-China trade deal (culminating in the December 2018 G20 Buenos Aires 90-day truce) lifted sentiment. SHCOMP rallied +31.5% and Power Equipment gained 53.9% (rank 6/28), reflecting a growth-tilted recovery (growth-minus-value = +18.8pp). EV-related subsidy announcements for 2019 and the expanding NEV credit mandate reinforced the sector's re-rating. The ctx confirms this was a thematic growth trade: Telecoms (+68%), Agriculture (+74%), and Conglomerates (+62%) led alongside Power Equipment, not the typical new-energy-only rally.","body_zh":"2018年10月至2019年4月，央行四次降准（合计250bp）、2019年1月个税减免落地，以及2018年12月G20布宜诺斯艾利斯90天停火协议共同提振市场情绪，上证综指反弹+31.5%。电力设备涨53.9%（排名6/28），成长风格重获青睐（成长-价值=+18.8pp）。2019年新能源汽车补贴政策公告及积分制度扩容进一步催化板块重新定价。背景数据显示这是一轮宽基成长行情：通信（+68%）、农业（+74%）、综合（+62%）均领涨，并非单纯的新能源主题驱动。","drivers":["PBOC four RRR cuts 2018-19","G20 Buenos Aires 90-day trade truce Dec 2018","NEV policy and 2019 EV subsidies","income tax cut Jan 2019","growth-style re-engagement"],"drivers_zh":["央行2018-19年四次降准","G20布宜诺斯艾利斯90天停火协议2018年12月","新能源汽车政策及2019年补贴","个税减免2019年1月","成长风格重新活跃"],"title":"Policy pivot: PBOC easing and trade truce hope","title_zh":"政策转向：央行宽松+贸易战停火提振信心"},"2019-04-19":{"body":"On May 5, 2019 Trump tweeted a tariff increase from 10% to 25% on $200bn of Chinese goods, derailing the trade truce and triggering a sharp SHCOMP reversal of -15.2% through August 9. Power Equipment fell 22.2% (rank 20/28), in line with the broad cyclical de-rating: defensives fell only -9.8% vs cyclicals -18.9% (flight-to-safety confirmed by ctx). Coal was flat (0%), Food & Bev fell only -1%, while Telecoms (-26%) and Steel (-27%) — sectors with direct tariff exposure — bore the brunt alongside Power Equipment. Chinese EV subsidies were also sharply cut in May 2019 (over 50% reduction for most vehicle types), creating a double headwind for the new energy supply chain.","body_zh":"2019年5月5日特朗普推文宣布将对华2000亿美元商品关税从10%提至25%，贸易停火协议破裂，上证综指至8月9日回落-15.2%。电力设备跌22.2%（排名20/28），与周期板块普跌一致，背景数据印证避险轮动特征（防御-9.8% vs 周期-18.9%）。同年5月中国新能源汽车补贴大幅削减（多数车型削减幅度超50%），对新能源供应链形成双重压制。煤炭（0%）、食品饮料（-1%）相对抗跌，通信（-26%）、钢铁（-27%）等直接关税敞口行业跌幅最深。","drivers":["Trump tariff re-escalation May 5 2019","EV subsidy cut 50%+ May 2019","flight-to-safety cyclical de-rating","SHCOMP -15.2% risk-off","trade war uncertainty"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普关税再升级2019年5月5日","新能源汽车补贴削减50%以上2019年5月","避险资金撤离周期股","上证综指-15.2%风险规避","贸易战不确定性"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation, risk-off pullback","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级，风险偏好急剧回落"},"2019-08-09":{"body":"This was Power Equipment's defining structural bull run, ranking #1 of 28 Shenwan industries with a +154.4% gain vs SHCOMP +28.8%. Three catalysts compounded over 17 months: (1) the August 2019 trade war partial truce and September 2019 RRR cut (PBOC -50bp) stabilised the macro; (2) Xi Jinping's September 22, 2020 UN General Assembly carbon neutrality 2060 pledge transformed the sector from cyclical to structural growth, triggering mass re-rating of solar, wind, EV battery, and grid inverter companies; (3) CATL's accelerating market share and China EV sales recovery in 2020 drove earnings upgrades across the lithium battery supply chain. The COVID stimulus mega-spending of 2020 further boosted grid infrastructure investment, and the dual-carbon policy (peak emissions 2030, neutrality 2060) approved at the Oct 2020 Fifth CCP Plenum crystallized the multi-year investment case.","body_zh":"这是电力设备最具决定性意义的结构性牛市，累计涨幅+154.4%，在28个申万行业中排名第1，远超上证综指+28.8%。三大催化剂在17个月内共振叠加：（1）2019年8月贸易战部分停火及9月央行降准50bp稳定宏观环境；（2）2020年9月22日习近平在联合国大会宣布2060年碳中和目标，令板块从周期属性升华为结构性成长，光伏、风电、EV电池、储能逆变器企业估值全面重构；（3）宁德时代市占率快速提升、2020年中国新能源汽车销量复苏推动锂电产业链盈利预测上修。2020年新冠疫情应对的超大规模财政刺激进一步拉动电网基建投资，2020年10月五中全会审议通过双碳目标（2030年达峰、2060年中和）最终确立了多年期投资逻辑。","drivers":["Xi UN carbon neutrality 2060 pledge Sep 2020","dual-carbon policy Fifth Plenum Oct 2020","CATL/EV battery structural re-rating","COVID fiscal stimulus grid investment","trade truce + RRR cut Sep 2019"],"drivers_zh":["习近平联合国碳中和2060承诺2020年9月","双碳政策五中全会2020年10月","宁德时代/EV电池结构性重估","新冠疫情财政刺激带动电网投资","贸易战停火+降准2019年9月"],"title":"Carbon neutrality pledge; Power Eqp leads Shenwan","title_zh":"碳中和承诺引爆，电力设备领跑申万行业"},"2021-01-27":{"body":"From late January 2021, a global bond-market reflation trade (US 10-year Treasury yield surged from 1.0% to 1.7% by end-March 2021) triggered a sharp rotation from crowded growth into value and cyclicals worldwide. In China, this manifested as Steel (+13.1%), Construction (+5.6%), and Utilities (+3.8%) surging while Power Equipment collapsed 21.9% (rank dead last, #28/28) — the worst performer in all of Shenwan. The ctx confirms extreme value leadership (growth-minus-value = -9.8pp) with defensives barely negative while cyclicals also recovered, strongly inconsistent with any sector-specific bad news. This was purely a style-factor unwind: after a 154% run, power equipment carried the heaviest growth premium and faced the most violent mean-reversion when the reflation trade hit.","body_zh":"2021年1月下旬，全球债市再通胀交易升温（美国10年期国债收益率从1.0%飙升至2021年3月底的1.7%），触发全球范围内从拥挤的成长股向价值周期股的急速切换。A股市场中，钢铁（+13.1%）、建筑（+5.6%）、公用事业（+3.8%）领涨，电力设备暴跌21.9%（28个行业中垫底，排名28/28）。背景数据印证极端价值领先特征（成长-价值=-9.8pp），与板块基本面无关，纯粹是风格因子平仓：历经+154%的大涨，电力设备持有最高的成长溢价，再通胀交易启动时面临最猛烈的均值回归压力。","drivers":["US 10Y yield spike (1.0% to 1.7%)","global reflation rotation Jan-Mar 2021","growth/crowded trade unwind","extreme growth premium reversion","value cyclical re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["美国10年期国债收益率飙升（1.0%至1.7%）","全球再通胀轮动2021年1月至3月","成长/拥挤交易平仓","极端成长溢价均值回归","价值周期股重新定价"],"title":"Global reflation rotation hammers growth; worst performer","title_zh":"全球再通胀轮动重创成长股，电力设备垫底全行业"},"2021-03-09":{"body":"As the reflation trade exhausted itself and Chinese 10-year yields stabilised near 3.2%, a thematic re-engagement in the dual-carbon trade powered a massive +82.4% rally in Power Equipment (rank #1/28 again, vs SHCOMP +6.6%), making it by far the strongest Shenwan industry over this 8-month window. The National Energy Administration's July 2021 guidance to install 30GW of new energy storage by 2025 and accelerating EV sales (China NEV sales hit a record 3.5 million units in 2021) drove earnings upgrades across CATL, inverter makers, and wind turbine OEMs. Ctx confirms growth led value by 17.3pp and cyclicals (+11.7%) outpaced defensives (+4.2%), while Real Estate and Services lagged hard — a clean growth leadership tape driven by the dual-carbon structural trade rather than macro cyclicality.","body_zh":"再通胀交易衰竭、中国10年期国债收益率稳定在3.2%附近后，双碳主题重新点燃，电力设备在8个月内暴涨+82.4%（再度排名28行业第1，远超上证综指+6.6%）。国家能源局2021年7月发布新型储能发展指导意见（2025年前新增3000万千瓦新型储能）、中国新能源汽车销量2021年创纪录突破350万辆，驱动宁德时代、逆变器厂商、风电整机商业绩预期大幅上调。背景数据印证成长领先价值17.3pp，周期（+11.7%）跑赢防御（+4.2%），地产和消费服务大幅落后——这是一轮由双碳结构性逻辑而非宏观周期驱动的纯粹成长领先行情。","drivers":["dual-carbon structural re-engagement","NEA July 2021 energy storage 30GW guidance","China NEV sales record 3.5M units 2021","CATL/inverter earnings upgrades","reflation trade exhaustion"],"drivers_zh":["双碳结构性行情重燃","国家能源局2021年7月3000万千瓦储能指导意见","中国新能源汽车2021年销量创纪录350万辆","宁德时代/逆变器企业盈利上调","再通胀交易衰竭"],"title":"Dual-carbon mega-bull: Power Eqp leads all Shenwan again","title_zh":"双碳超级行情：电力设备再度领跑全申万行业"},"2021-11-22":{"body":"From November 22, 2021, the combination of the Fed's hawkish pivot (tapering accelerated from November 2021, first rate hike signalled, eventually delivered March 2022) and China's policy tightening (regulatory crackdown on tech in 2021, property developer liquidity crisis with Evergrande default concerns from September 2021 escalating) triggered a severe risk-off rotation. SHCOMP fell 19.4% and Power Equipment crashed 44.3% — ranking dead last (#31/31 in the expanded 31-industry Shenwan) — while Coal gained +6.7% and Real Estate barely moved (-1%). The ctx documents extreme value leadership (value beat growth by 17.9pp) and a flight-to-safety tilt (defensives -15.5% vs cyclicals -17.4%). Power Equipment, carrying the most extreme growth premium after its 82% run, bore the largest absolute drawdown. Lithium carbonate prices also began surging from late 2021, squeezing battery maker margins and sparking investor concern about cost-push.","body_zh":"2021年11月22日起，美联储鹰派转向（11月加速Taper、预告2022年3月加息）叠加中国政策收紧（2021年科技整改监管风暴、恒大暴雷流动性危机从9月持续发酵），引发剧烈避险轮动。上证综指下跌19.4%，电力设备暴跌44.3%，在扩容至31个行业的申万体系中垫底（31/31），而煤炭涨+6.7%、地产仅跌-1%。背景数据印证极端价值领先（价值跑赢成长17.9pp），防御（-15.5%）优于周期（-17.4%）。经历+82%大涨的电力设备持有最高成长溢价，承受最大绝对回撤。碳酸锂价格从2021年底开始飙升，对电池厂商利润率形成成本压制，进一步打压投资者情绪。","drivers":["Fed hawkish pivot / taper acceleration Nov 2021","Evergrande/property crisis escalation","extreme growth premium de-rating","lithium carbonate price surge","risk-off flight-to-safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美联储鹰派转向/加速Taper 2021年11月","恒大/地产危机持续发酵","极端成长溢价压缩","碳酸锂价格飙升","避险轮动"],"title":"Fed hawkish pivot; crowded growth crashes hardest","title_zh":"美联储转鹰，拥挤成长股跌幅最惨"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"With Shanghai's COVID-19 lockdown (April 1-May 31, 2022) creating a policy-response window, the State Council in late May 2022 released a 33-point economic stabilisation package and specifically reaffirmed new energy vehicle purchase subsidies through 2022 (extending NEV tax exemptions worth CNY 600bn). Power Equipment surged 62.5% in just four months (rank #1/31), leading Autos (+50%) and Defense (+46%) in a sharp growth-led bounce (growth-minus-value = +17.1pp, cyclicals +20.1% vs defensives +6.4%). The post-lockdown demand recovery in EVs was exceptionally strong — China NEV sales rose 112% YoY in H2 2022 — and the sector's severe April 26 trough oversell provided significant technical spring energy. SHCOMP recovered +13.5%, with Power Equipment extracting roughly 4.6x that index return.","body_zh":"上海新冠封控（4月1日至5月31日）形成政策回应窗口，国务院5月底发布33项稳经济措施，明确延续新能源汽车购置补贴（免征车辆购置税政策累计让利约6000亿元）。电力设备四个月内暴涨62.5%（排名1/31），领跑汽车（+50%）和国防军工（+46%），成长风格显著占优（成长-价值=+17.1pp，周期+20.1% vs 防御+6.4%）。封控解除后EV需求强劲复苏，中国新能源汽车2022年下半年销量同比增长112%，叠加4月26日低位的超卖弹性，电力设备获得约4.6倍于上证综指的超额收益。","drivers":["State Council 33-point package May 2022","NEV purchase subsidy extension 2022","post-Shanghai lockdown demand recovery","China NEV sales +112% YoY H2 2022","oversold technical rebound"],"drivers_zh":["国务院33项稳经济措施2022年5月","新能源汽车购置补贴延续2022年","封控解除后需求集中释放","中国新能源汽车下半年同比+112%","技术性超跌反弹"],"title":"New energy rebound: post-lockdown policy burst","title_zh":"新能源强势反弹：封控后政策刺激集中释放"},"2022-08-18":{"body":"This 18-month collapse (-56.9%, rank dead last #31/31) was Power Equipment's most severe secular bear cycle, driven by three compounding forces: (1) A structural solar and EV battery overcapacity crisis built as panel prices fell 60%+ from July 2022 highs and lithium carbonate peaked at CNY 597,500/ton in November 2022 before collapsing 80%, crushing margins across the supply chain; (2) The Fed's most aggressive rate hike cycle in 40 years (fed funds rate from 0.25% to 5.5% by July 2023) global risk-off, amplified by China's SHCOMP falling 17.6%; (3) Structural demand overhang from the end of China's NEV purchase subsidy (Dec 31, 2022), causing a severe January 2023 demand cliff. Flight-to-safety dominated (defensives -16.4% vs cyclicals -28.6%), Banks gained +2.2%, while Power Eqp underperformed its already-weak cyclical peers by roughly 2x.","body_zh":"这段长达18个月的暴跌（-56.9%，排名31/31垫底）是电力设备迄今最严峻的周期性熊市，三大力量叠加共振：（1）光伏和EV电池结构性产能过剩危机——组件价格从2022年7月高点累计跌超60%，碳酸锂价格2022年11月在59.75万元/吨见顶后暴跌约80%，全产业链利润率遭受严重挤压；（2）美联储40年来最激进的加息周期（联邦基金利率从0.25%升至2023年7月的5.5%）引发全球风险偏好崩塌，中国上证综指同期跌17.6%；（3）新能源汽车购置补贴于2022年12月31日到期，2023年1月出现严重的需求断崖效应。避险轮动主导（防御-16.4% vs 周期-28.6%），银行获得+2.2%正收益，电力设备跌幅约为同样疲弱的周期板块的两倍。","drivers":["solar/EV battery overcapacity crisis 2022-23","lithium carbonate price collapse -80%","Fed rate hike cycle 0-5.5% 2022-23","NEV subsidy end Dec 2022 demand cliff","flight-to-safety defensive rotation"],"drivers_zh":["光伏/EV电池产能过剩危机2022-23年","碳酸锂价格暴跌约80%","美联储加息周期0至5.5% 2022-23年","新能源汽车补贴到期2022年12月需求断崖","避险防御性轮动"],"title":"Overcapacity glut and Fed rate shock; sector's worst bear","title_zh":"产能过剩+美联储加息冲击，板块遭遇最惨熊市"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From the February 5, 2024 trough, a combination of aggressive CSRC market stabilization actions (Chairman Wu Qing appointed January 2024, pledging crackdown on short-selling and quantitative trading, plus national team ETF buying reportedly over CNY 400bn) and a thematic rotation into growth/AI lifted SHCOMP +14.2%. Power Equipment gained 28.8% (rank 9/31) as growth led value by 16.8pp and cyclicals (+18.5%) outpaced defensives (+11.9%). The AI-driven electricity demand narrative (data center power consumption projections) began attracting attention to grid equipment and inverter names within the sector, providing a fresh thematic angle beyond the beaten-down solar/EV supply chain. Computers (+39%), Telecoms (+36%), and Media (+34%) led, with power equipment participating as a secondary AI-grid play.","body_zh":"自2024年2月5日低点起，证监会激进稳市措施（吴清2024年1月上任，严打融券及量化交易，据报国家队ETF买入规模超4000亿元）叠加成长/AI主题轮动，上证综指上涨+14.2%。电力设备涨28.8%（排名9/31），成长领先价值16.8pp，周期（+18.5%）跑赢防御（+11.9%）。AI驱动的用电需求叙事（数据中心功耗增长预期）开始吸引资金关注板块内的电网设备和逆变器标的，为超跌的光伏/EV供应链提供新的主题支撑。计算机（+39%）、通信（+36%）、传媒（+34%）领涨，电力设备以AI电网配套受益者身份参与此轮反弹。","drivers":["CSRC chairman change / market stabilization Jan 2024","national team ETF buying CNY 400bn+","AI power demand grid investment theme","growth style re-engagement","oversold technical mean reversion"],"drivers_zh":["证监会换帅/稳市行动2024年1月","国家队ETF买入逾4000亿元","AI用电需求电网投资主题","成长风格重新活跃","超跌技术性均值回归"],"title":"CSRC stabilization and AI power theme rebound","title_zh":"证监会稳市+AI用电主题驱动反弹"},"2024-03-18":{"body":"From the March 18, 2024 peak through August 23, SHCOMP fell 7.5% in a quiet risk-off grind as deflation concerns (China CPI stuck near 0%, PPI negative throughout 2024) and property sector weakness dampened growth confidence. Defensives led (-7.5% for defensives vs -14.3% for cyclicals) with Banks gaining +10.0% and Utilities +0.8%, while Computers (-29%), Media (-29%), and Beauty (-27%) bore the brunt. Power Equipment fell 22.1% (rank 23/31), consistent with the value-tilt (value beat growth by 7.8pp). Solar overcapacity continued to weigh (panel prices fell 30%+ additional from March-August 2024, and CPIA acknowledged the need for industry consolidation), making this a combined macro-risk-off and sector-fundamental headwind leg.","body_zh":"2024年3月18日高点至8月23日，上证综指温和回落-7.5%，通缩压力（中国CPI全年接近0%，PPI持续为负）和地产板块持续疲软压制市场风险偏好。防御板块领先（防御-7.5% vs 周期-14.3%），银行涨+10.0%、公用事业+0.8%，计算机（-29%）、传媒（-29%）、美容护理（-27%）跌幅居前。电力设备跌22.1%（排名23/31），符合价值风格主导特征（价值跑赢成长7.8pp）。光伏产能过剩持续拖累（2024年3月至8月组件价格再跌逾30%，中国光伏行业协会公开呼吁行业整合），形成宏观避险与行业基本面双重逆风叠加的下行格局。","drivers":["China deflation / near-zero CPI 2024","property sector ongoing weakness","solar overcapacity panel price collapse 2024","defensive banks/utilities value rotation","growth style de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["中国通缩/CPI接近零 2024年","地产板块持续疲软","光伏产能过剩/组件价格持续下跌 2024年","防御性银行/公用事业价值轮动","成长风格估值压缩"],"title":"Defensive rotation; banks and utilities outperform","title_zh":"防御性轮动，银行公用事业领跑"},"2024-08-23":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a sweeping stimulus package: RRR cut of 50bp, policy rate cut of 20bp, a CNY 500bn swap facility for nonbank financial institutions to buy equities, and CNY 300bn special relending for share repurchases. A September Politburo meeting (the first September economic Politburo in years) signalled top-level urgency. SHCOMP surged +22.3%, the biggest monthly gain since 2008, and Power Equipment gained 48.4% (rank 4/31). Context confirms extreme risk-on: cyclicals (+26.4%) far outpaced defensives (+20.1%), growth led value by 17.6pp, and the SHCOMP index return of 22.3% compressed into roughly 6 weeks (August 23-October 8). Computers (+57%), Beauty (+53%), and Brokers (+53%) led; Power Equipment participated strongly as high-beta growth with new energy thematic re-rating.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子刺激政策：降准50bp、政策利率下调20bp、设立5000亿元非银机构互换便利（用于购买股票）及3000亿元上市公司股票回购专项再贷款。9月政治局经济专题会议（多年来首次在9月而非10月召开）显示高层政策紧迫性。上证综指单月暴涨+22.3%（2008年以来最大单月涨幅），电力设备涨48.4%（排名4/31）。背景数据印证极端风险偏好：周期（+26.4%）远超防御（+20.1%），成长领先价值17.6pp。计算机（+57%）、美容护理（+53%）、非银金融（+53%）领涨，电力设备凭借高贝塔成长属性和新能源重新定价强势参与。","drivers":["PBOC Sep 24 package: 50bp RRR + 20bp rate cut","CNY 500bn equity swap facility","emergency Politburo economic meeting Sep 2024","broad risk-on beta expansion","new energy thematic re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月24日一揽子政策：降准50bp+降息20bp","5000亿元非银互换便利","9月政治局经济专题会议","宽基风险偏好扩张","新能源主题重新定价"],"title":"PBOC bazooka stimulus; broad risk-on surge","title_zh":"央行史诗级刺激，宽基风险偏好飙升"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"Power Equipment fell 18.4% in just 9 trading days (rank 30/31), the fastest and sharpest high-beta reversion of the bundle. The catalyst was the October 12 NPC Standing Committee fiscal policy briefing, which underwhelmed markets expecting a CNY 2+ trillion direct stimulus announcement; the actual package was below expectations, triggering a sell-the-news reaction. Power Equipment, having been among the biggest bazooka-rally beneficiaries (high beta, strong prior gain), suffered disproportionate selling. Ctx shows near-uniform selling (defensives -9.6% vs cyclicals -9.4% both roughly the same, SHCOMP -9.2%), meaning sector-specific high-beta amplification rather than style rotation explains the outlier underperformance.","body_zh":"电力设备在仅9个交易日内跌18.4%（排名30/31），是本数据集中速度最快、幅度最重的高贝塔均值回归。触发因素为10月12日全国人大常委会财政政策发布会——市场预期超2万亿元直接刺激，实际方案低于预期，引发利好出尽式抛售。电力设备此前是央行大招行情的最大受益者之一（高贝塔、涨幅居前），因此遭受最不成比例的抛压。背景数据显示跌幅分布近乎均匀（防御-9.6% vs 周期-9.4%，上证综指-9.2%），说明超额跌幅来自板块自身的高贝塔放大效应，而非风格轮动。","drivers":["NPC Oct 12 fiscal briefing disappoints","sell-the-news after bazooka rally","high-beta reversion","stimulus size below CNY 2 trillion expectations","sector-specific mean reversion"],"drivers_zh":["全国人大常委会10月12日财政发布会失望","重大利好出尽后抛售","高贝塔均值回归","刺激规模低于2万亿元预期","板块特异性均值回归"],"title":"NPC fiscal details disappoint; high-beta reversion","title_zh":"人大财政细节令市场失望，高贝塔回撤"},"2024-10-17":{"body":"As the fiscal disappointment was partially absorbed, Power Equipment surged 23.3% in under four weeks (rank #2/31), second only to Retail at +25.2%. The primary catalyst was an emerging AI data centre electricity demand investment theme that re-rated power grid equipment, high-voltage switch gear, and energy storage companies with AI infrastructure exposure, complementing the ongoing policy support narrative. Ctx confirms strong risk-on growth tape: cyclicals (+10.7%) outpaced defensives (+5.7%), growth led value by 10.1pp, and SHCOMP rose +8.5%. The sector's superior rank (#2) relative to the SHCOMP move (+8.5%) confirms material sector-specific positive re-rating beyond pure beta.","body_zh":"财政失望情绪逐步消化后，电力设备不足四周内大涨23.3%（排名2/31，仅次于零售+25.2%）。核心催化剂为AI数据中心用电需求投资主题兴起，驱动电网设备、高压开关柜、储能设备等具备AI基础设施属性的标的估值重构，与持续的政策支撑叙事共振。背景数据印证强势风险偏好成长行情：周期（+10.7%）跑赢防御（+5.7%），成长领先价值10.1pp，上证综指涨+8.5%。电力设备排名（第2）显著优于指数表现（+8.5%），印证存在超越纯Beta的板块特异性正向重估。","drivers":["AI data centre power demand retheme","grid equipment and storage re-rating","growth/cyclical risk-on rebound","policy support continuation","sector-specific AI infrastructure premium"],"drivers_zh":["AI数据中心用电需求重新定价","电网设备及储能重估","成长/周期风险偏好回升","政策支撑延续","板块特异性AI基础设施溢价"],"title":"AI grid demand retheme lifts power equipment to #2","title_zh":"AI用电需求重新定价，电力设备强势反弹至第2位"},"2024-11-13":{"body":"Trump's November 5, 2024 US election victory immediately triggered a reassessment of Chinese new energy sector exposure to US tariff escalation. Power Equipment fell 24.3% over 5 months (rank 30/31), with defensives (Banks +4.9%) outperforming dramatically while brokers (-21.7%), Power Eqp (-24.3%), and Real Estate (-25.2%) lagged. The ctx confirms flight-to-safety (defensives -6.6% vs cyclicals -13.3%) and value leadership (value beat growth by 7.4pp). Solar manufacturers specifically faced the threat of 50% Section 301 tariff hikes on polysilicon and wafers (implemented by USTR) alongside cascading antidumping tariffs from India and other markets; Chinese solar stocks experienced multiple limit-down days in the weeks following the election. The SHCOMP fell -10.0% amid broader risk-off with no offsetting domestic stimulus of note during this window.","body_zh":"2024年11月5日特朗普当选后，市场立即重新评估中国新能源板块面临的美国关税升级风险。电力设备历时5个月下跌24.3%（排名30/31），银行（+4.9%）表现强劲，非银金融（-21.7%）、电力设备（-24.3%）、房地产（-25.2%）垫底。背景数据印证避险轮动（防御-6.6% vs 周期-13.3%，价值跑赢成长7.4pp）。光伏企业尤其面临美国USTR将多晶硅及硅片的301条款关税从25%提升至50%的威胁，以及来自印度等市场的反倾销关税连锁反应；大选后数周内中国光伏股票多次跌停。上证综指下跌-10.0%，同期无明显对冲性国内刺激政策出台。","drivers":["Trump election Nov 5 2024 tariff risk","Section 301 tariff hike on solar/polysilicon","flight-to-safety defensive rotation","China solar multiple limit-down days","growth-to-value style shift"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普当选2024年11月5日关税风险","美国301条款光伏/多晶硅关税提升","避险防御轮动","中国光伏股票多次跌停","成长转价值风格切换"],"title":"Trump election; tariff fears crush growth and new energy","title_zh":"特朗普当选，关税恐慌重创成长与新能源板块"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"The April 2025-May 2026 +100% mega-rally was catalysed by the April 2, 2025 US tariff shock (34% on Chinese imports) creating the trough on April 7, followed by the May 12 US-China tariff truce (US reduced duties to 30%, China to 10%), which reversed the downward spiral. Structurally, three forces drove sustained outperformance: (1) China's rare-earth export control response to US tariffs directly highlighted Power Equipment's strategic position in the global energy transition supply chain; (2) AI data centre electricity demand became a consensus mega-theme globally, driving grid investment and storage orders; (3) China's domestic new energy buildout accelerated sharply (72GW of new solar in Q1 2025 alone, +18% YoY), and wind+solar hit 26% of China's electricity generation in April 2025, a historic record. SHCOMP rallied +37%, cyclicals (+48.8%) crushed defensives (+9.1%), and growth led value by a massive 55.9pp. Power Equipment's +100% vs SHCOMP's +37% confirms deep sector-specific alpha on top of the market beta.","body_zh":"2025年4月至2026年5月的+100%大行情以2025年4月2日美国对华关税冲击（加征34%关税）引发的4月7日低点为起点，随后5月12日中美关税停火协议（美方降至30%、中方降至10%）触发趋势逆转。三大结构性驱动力支撑本轮持续超额表现：（1）中国对美稀土出口管制反制措施凸显了电力设备在全球能源转型供应链中的战略地位；（2）AI数据中心用电需求成为全球共识级别的超级主题，驱动电网投资及储能订单量持续放量；（3）国内新能源建设大幅提速（仅2025年一季度新增光伏装机72GW，同比+18%），风电+光伏2025年4月首次创纪录地达到中国总发电量26%。上证综指涨+37%，周期（+48.8%）大幅碾压防御（+9.1%），成长领先价值高达55.9pp。电力设备+100% vs 上证综指+37%，在高额市场Beta之上还体现出深度的板块特异性超额收益。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce May 12 2025","China rare-earth export controls strategic premium","AI data centre power demand structural theme","China solar Q1 2025 +72GW record","wind+solar 26% of power generation milestone"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税停火协议2025年5月12日","中国稀土出口管制战略溢价","AI数据中心用电需求结构性主题","中国2025年一季度光伏新增72GW创纪录","风电+光伏占发电量26%历史里程碑"],"title":"Tariff truce and AI power demand: 100% structural bull","title_zh":"关税停火+AI用电需求：一倍的结构性大牛市"}},"now":"Power Equipment is in a Downturn phase (pos=33.9, RS rank 12/31), rolling over from the May 2026 peak that capped the April 2025-May 2026 +100% bull leg. The current window is a broad growth/cyclical tape (SHCOMP +1.6%, cyclicals +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%, growth leads value by 18.2pp) with Electronics and Telecoms leading the Shenwan board at +75% and +68%; Power Equipment's modest +1.8% (rank 8/31) confirms it is giving back relative leadership after its prior outperformance, consistent with mid-cycle consolidation or early distribution rather than a panic flush. The sector is trading below its 200-day moving average, signalling the post-peak mean-reversion has further to run before the next structural trough forms.","now_zh":"电力设备处于下行阶段（周期位置33.9，申万行业相对强弱排名12/31），正从2026年5月高点回落，此前完成了2025年4月至2026年5月累计+100%的强势上涨。当前市场风格为宽基成长/周期行情（上证综指+1.6%，周期板块+0.3%优于防御板块-12.1%，成长跑赢价值18.2pp），电子、通信领跑申万行业；电力设备仅微涨+1.8%（排名第8），表明前期超额收益正在消化，处于中途整理或初步派发阶段，而非恐慌性抛售。板块仍位于200日均线下方，表明2025年4月以来的均值回归行情尚未结束。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801740":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The SHCOMP surged 132% from Feb 2014 to Jun 2015, driven by PBOC easing (benchmark rate cuts from Nov 2014 and RRR cuts), an explosion in margin finance that powered retail leverage, and a broad cyclicals-and-growth rally. Defense ranked 4th of 28 with +220%, materially above SHCOMP beta. The sector alpha derived from sustained 10%-plus annual PLA budget hikes, Xi Jinping consolidating CMC authority, and the March 2015 civil-military integration (CMI) policy promising SOE asset injections. Computers (+259%) led just ahead of Defense, confirming this was a broad growth/theme tape rather than a defense-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2014年2月至2015年6月，上证综指在央行降息降准、融资融券扩张带来零售杠杆飙升以及周期+成长风格普涨背景下累计上涨132%。军工以+220%排名全行业第四，大幅跑赢指数。超额收益来源于解放军预算年增10%以上、习近平巩固军委权威以及2015年3月军民融合战略出台带来的国企资产注入预期。计算机（+259%）领涨，与军工均属成长主线，表明这是一轮广谱主题行情。","drivers":["PBOC easing and margin finance surge","PLA annual budget +10% y/y","Xi CMC consolidation 2014-15","Civil-military integration policy Mar-2015","Broad A-share growth/leverage bull"],"drivers_zh":["降准降息/融资融券扩张","解放军年度预算连续两位数增长","习近平巩固军委权威","军民融合战略2015年出台","A股成长/杠杆牛市"],"title":"PLA Reform Bull: Leverage Fuels Defense Re-rating","title_zh":"解放军改革牛市：杠杆推动军工重估"},"2015-06-02":{"body":"The bubble peaked June 12, 2015 and SHCOMP lost 29% by July 8, as regulators tightened margin lending rules (CSRC, June 12), triggering cascading forced-selling. Defense fell 52.3%, ranked 27th of 28, far worse than the -28.6% index. Banks (-3.7%) led as flight-to-safety while defense, computers, and coal suffered the most violent leveraged unwind. The government intervention package (state funds, IPO halt, short-sale ban) announced July 4-9 eventually stabilized the tape.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会收紧融资融券后，泡沫见顶，7月8日前上证综指下跌29%，引发杠杆踩踏式去化。军工暴跌52.3%，排名倒数第二，远差于指数-28.6%，与高杠杆成长股最惨烈去杠杆规律一致。银行（-3.7%）领涨体现避险特征；7月4-9日政府干预（国家队入场、暂停IPO、限制卖空）逐步稳定市场。","drivers":["CSRC margin lending crackdown Jun-12 2015","Leveraged unwind / forced selling","High-beta growth derating","Flight to safety (banks led)","Broad A-share crash -28.6%"],"drivers_zh":["证监会6月12日收紧融资融券","杠杆强制平仓踩踏","高贝塔成长股去估值","避险资金流向银行","A股崩盘-28.6%"],"title":"Leverage Unwind Crash: Defense Worst Laggard","title_zh":"杠杆去化崩盘：军工领跌全市场"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"After the government stabilization package (state funds, IPO halt, 1,400 stocks suspended) took effect in early July, the market mounted a sharp technical rebound through August 13, with SHCOMP +12.8%. Defense surged 78.1% and ranked 2nd of 28 — the sectors most oversold (coal, defense) bounced hardest in a classic mean-reversion into heavily-shorted growth names. The September 3 WWII commemoration parade announcement in July additionally lifted defense sentiment.","body_zh":"7月初政府救市措施（国家队入场、暂停IPO、逾1400只股票停牌）生效后，市场展开急剧技术性反弹，至8月13日上证综指上涨12.8%。军工以+78.1%排名全行业第二，在崩盘中超跌最严重的板块（煤炭、军工）弹幅最大，为典型均值回归。7月宣布的9月3日抗战胜利70周年阅兵亦提振军工情绪。","drivers":["Government rescue package Jul 4-9 2015","Mean-reversion in most-oversold names","Leveraged short squeeze","Sept 3 WWII anniversary parade announced","Coal and defense extreme-oversold rebound"],"drivers_zh":["7月4-9日政府救市","超跌品种均值回归","杠杆空头逼仓","9·3阅兵预期提振","煤炭军工极度超跌反弹"],"title":"Policy Rescue Bounce: Defense Leads Rebound","title_zh":"政策救市反弹：军工领涨"},"2015-08-13":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC shocked markets with a 1.9% CNY devaluation and shift to a market-referenced fixing, triggering capital outflow fears and a second wave selloff including Black Monday (Aug 24: -8.5%) and Black Tuesday (Aug 25: -7.6%). SHCOMP fell 26%. Defense dropped 36.4%, ranked 27th of 28 — again a high-beta casualty as defensives (banks -16.9%) significantly outperformed. There was no defense-specific catalyst: the move was pure index amplification of the currency shock into high-beta growth names.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行启动汇改，人民币一日贬值1.9%，引发资本外流恐慌，触发第二轮抛售，8月24日黑色星期一（-8.5%）和25日黑色星期二（-7.6%）相继出现，上证综指下跌26%。军工跌幅36.4%排名倒数第二，仍为高贝塔受害者，银行（-16.9%）相对抗跌。无军工特定催化，纯属汇率冲击向高贝塔成长股的指数放大效应。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock Aug-11 2015","Capital outflow fears","High-beta growth amplified selloff","Flight to safety (banks led)","Black Monday/Tuesday panic selling"],"drivers_zh":["8月11日人民币汇改冲击","资本外流担忧","高贝塔成长股放大下跌","避险资金涌入银行","黑色星期一/二恐慌抛售"],"title":"CNY Devaluation Shock: Growth Stocks Hit Hard","title_zh":"人民币汇改冲击：成长股重创"},"2015-08-26":{"body":"A five-day technical rebound followed the Black Tuesday lows, with SHCOMP recovering 9.5% and Defense surging 18.3% to rank 2nd. Coal (+25.2%) and Defense led as the most-oversold cyclical/growth sectors bounced mechanically. The PBOC cut rates 25bp on August 25 providing a modest liquidity tailwind. No new policy or macro catalyst beyond the rate cut; the rally proved short-lived, reversing entirely by September 15.","body_zh":"黑色星期二低点后出现五日技术性反弹，上证综指反弹9.5%，军工以+18.3%排名第二。煤炭（+25.2%）和军工领涨，为超跌周期/成长股的机械式空头回补。央行于8月25日降息25bp提供少量流动性支撑。无新政策或宏观催化，反弹昙花一现，9月15日前悉数回吐。","drivers":["Post-Black-Tuesday short squeeze","Extreme-oversold mean reversion","PBOC rate cut Aug-25 25bp","No new macro catalyst","Mechanical bounce in hardest-hit names"],"drivers_zh":["黑色星期二后空头回补","极度超跌均值回归","央行8月25日降息25bp","无新宏观催化","重灾区机械性反弹"],"title":"Ultra-Short Technical Bounce Post-Crash","title_zh":"崩盘后超短期技术性反弹"},"2015-08-31":{"body":"The brief bounce ended as the market remained structurally vulnerable following the leverage unwind. SHCOMP fell 6.3% and Defense dropped 24.3%, ranking 27th of 28. Banks gained +2.2% as the only positive Shenwan industry, confirming classic risk-off dynamics. Xi Jinping's September 3 military parade briefly lifted sentiment but was insufficient to arrest the selloff given ongoing de-leveraging.","body_zh":"短暂反弹立即终结，市场在去杠杆后仍结构性脆弱，9月再度下跌。上证综指-6.3%，军工-24.3%排名倒数第二。银行（+2.2%）为唯一上涨申万行业，确认经典避险格局。9月3日阅兵短暂提振情绪，但去杠杆主导的市场结构令反弹无以为继。","drivers":["Post-leverage-unwind structural fragility","Flight to safety (banks only positive)","High-beta growth lagged badly","Ongoing margin deleveraging","Risk-off tape despite Sept 3 parade"],"drivers_zh":["去杠杆后市场结构性脆弱","避险资金仅银行正收益","高贝塔成长股大幅落后","融资融券持续去化","阅兵虽提振情绪但难抵风险偏好下行"],"title":"Second Wave Selloff: Market Fragility Persists","title_zh":"第二波下跌：市场结构性脆弱持续"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"From mid-September to late November 2015, SHCOMP rallied 20.8% as stabilization measures held and risk appetite gradually recovered. Defense gained 40.3% (ranked 9th) in a broad cyclicals-led (+32.4% vs defensives +19.3%) growth-tilt rally (growth-minus-value +16.8pp). Computers (+60.2%) and Electronics (+49.6%) led. The September announcement of Xi Jinping cutting 300,000 PLA troops was ultimately read as a commitment to higher-quality tech-intensive spending, supporting sector sentiment.","body_zh":"9月中旬至11月下旬，政府托市措施生效，风险偏好逐步修复，上证综指反弹20.8%。军工以+40.3%排名第九，参与成长风格行情（周期+32.4% vs 防御+19.3%，成长-价值利差+16.8pp）。计算机（+60.2%）和电子（+49.6%）领涨。习近平宣布裁减30万军队最终被解读为向高科技装备支出升级，支撑板块情绪。","drivers":["Post-crash risk-appetite recovery","Broad A-share rebound SHCOMP +20.8%","Growth/tech style led (computers/electronics)","PLA 300k troop cut = modernization signal","Cyclicals beat defensives broadly"],"drivers_zh":["崩盘后风险偏好修复","A股普涨+20.8%","成长/科技风格领涨（计算机/电子）","解放军裁减30万=现代化信号","周期股普遍跑赢防御股"],"title":"Post-Crash Recovery: Growth/Theme Tape Returns","title_zh":"崩盘后修复：成长/主题行情回归"},"2015-11-20":{"body":"From late November 2015 through February 2016, SHCOMP fell another 26%, compounded by the circuit-breaker mechanism (introduced January 1, 2016) that perversely accelerated selloffs by front-running the halt trigger and was suspended on January 7. Defense fell 39.9%, worst of all 28 industries. Banks (-14.2%) and defensives (-22.4% avg) significantly outperformed cyclicals (-28.2%) in a pure risk-off value rotation. RMB depreciation fears and commodity oversupply added macro pressure.","body_zh":"2015年11月下旬至2016年2月，上证综指再跌26%，2016年1月1日引入的熔断机制因触发前抢跑效应加速了抛售，1月7日宣布暂停。军工以-39.9%垫底全部28个板块。银行（-14.2%）和防御类（均值-22.4%）大幅跑赢周期类（-28.2%），呈纯风险规避/价值轮动格局。人民币贬值恐慌和大宗商品供过于求亦构成宏观阻力。","drivers":["Circuit-breaker introduction Jan-2016 (accelerated panic)","SHCOMP -26% second crash wave","High-beta growth crushed; value led","RMB depreciation / capital outflow fears","Defense worst of all 28 industries"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月熔断机制引发恐慌踩踏","上证综指第二波暴跌-26%","高贝塔成长股领跌，价值股领涨","人民币贬值/资本外流恐慌","军工全行业垫底"],"title":"Circuit-Breaker Era Bear: Growth Crushed by Value","title_zh":"熔断时代熊市：价值碾压成长"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"Post-circuit-breaker-abolition, SHCOMP recovered 22.4% from late February 2016 through April 2017 in a value-led, policy-driven rally. Supply-side structural reform (de-capacity in steel and coal) powered Building Materials (+60%), Construction (+57%), and Food & Bev (+47%), while growth/tech underperformed. Defense gained 37.3% (ranked 5th), outperforming despite not being the macro theme. The defense alpha reflected sustained 7-8% budget growth, 13th Five-Year Plan (2016-2020) procurement targets, and ongoing CMI asset injection deals attracting event-driven capital.","body_zh":"废除熔断机制后，上证综指于2016年2月下旬至2017年4月间在政策驱动的价值引领行情中反弹22.4%。供给侧结构性改革（钢铁、煤炭去产能）推动建材（+60%）、建筑（+57%）和食品饮料（+47%）领涨，成长/科技板块明显落后。军工上涨37.3%，排名第五，超预期表现源于国防预算持续7-8%增速、十三五（2016-2020年）采购目标，以及军民融合资产注入交易持续吸引事件驱动型资金。","drivers":["Supply-side reform (de-capacity in steel/coal)","Value rotation led by Bldg Mat/Construction","13th Five-Year Plan procurement targets","Civil-military integration asset injections","Sustained PLA budget 7-8% growth"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革（钢铁煤炭去产能）","建材/建筑价值轮动领涨","十三五采购目标","军民融合资产注入","解放军预算保持7-8%增长"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform Rally: Value Leads, Defense Participates","title_zh":"供给侧改革反弹：价值领涨，军工参与"},"2017-04-11":{"body":"From April 2017 through February 2018, China entered a financial deleveraging cycle led by the July 2017 National Financial Work Conference, which named SOE deleveraging as the top policy priority. This triggered a classic style rotation to quality/value: Food & Bev (+33.7%), Appliances (+24.1%), and Banks (+14.5%) surged while cyclicals/growth were crushed. Defense fell 40.6%, ranking last of 28. This was a structural de-rating of low-cash-flow, high-PE defense SOEs as the market re-priced leverage risk. The US-China trade war had NOT yet started (tariffs began March 2018, after this leg ended).","body_zh":"2017年4月至2018年2月，中国进入金融去杠杆周期。2017年7月全国金融工作会议将国企去杠杆列为首要政策任务，触发经典质量/价值风格切换：食品饮料（+33.7%）、家电（+24.1%）和银行（+14.5%）大涨，周期/成长遭重创。军工以-40.6%垫底全部28个行业。这是市场对低现金流、高市盈率国防军工央企重新定价去杠杆风险的结构性去估值。注：中美贸易战尚未开始（关税于2018年3月起征，在此轮下跌结束之后）。","drivers":["Jul-2017 National Financial Work Conference deleveraging","Style rotation to quality/value (Food/Banks led)","High-PE SOE defense derating","Cyclicals/growth crushed broadly","Defense last of 28 industries (-40.6%)"],"drivers_zh":["2017年7月全国金融工作会议去杠杆","质量/价值风格轮动（食饮/银行领涨）","高市盈率国防央企去估值","周期/成长板块普遍重创","军工全行业垫底（-40.6%）"],"title":"Deleveraging Rotation: Defense Dead Last","title_zh":"去杠杆轮动：军工全行业垫底"},"2018-02-09":{"body":"From February to April 2018, SHCOMP moved flat (+0.3%) but Defense surged 23.2% to rank 2nd of 28, outpacing Computers (+25.9%) and Pharma (+18.8%) in a pure growth-style rotation (growth-minus-value +12.9pp). Banks fell 7.4% and Steel dropped 9%. The driver was Beijing accelerating technology self-reliance rhetoric amid rising US-China tensions (the ZTE entity list action was imminent in April 2018), lifting civil-military integration and domestically-developed weapons sub-themes. Defense SOEs were being repositioned as tech/growth proxies ahead of 13th Five-Year Plan delivery peaks.","body_zh":"2018年2月至4月，上证综指几乎持平（+0.3%），而军工大涨23.2%排名第二，在纯成长风格轮动中领跑（成长-价值利差+12.9pp），超越计算机（+25.9%）和医药（+18.8%）；银行跌7.4%，钢铁跌9%。催化剂在于中美博弈升温背景下北京加速推进科技自立自强（中兴实体清单迫在眉睫），国内自研武器和军民融合子主题获得提振。军工央企正被重新定义为科技/成长代理标的，恰逢十三五交付高峰临近。","drivers":["US-China tech tensions (ZTE entity list imminent Apr-2018)","Tech self-reliance / civil-military integration narrative","Growth-over-value style rotation +12.9pp","Defense rerates as tech/growth proxy","13th Five-Year Plan delivery peak approaching"],"drivers_zh":["中美科技博弈升温（中兴实体清单迫在眉睫）","科技自立自强/军民融合叙事","成长压倒价值风格切换+12.9pp","军工被重新定义为科技/成长代理标的","十三五交付高峰临近"],"title":"Self-Reliance Catalyst: Defense Leads Growth Rebound","title_zh":"科技自强催化：军工引领成长反弹"},"2018-04-09":{"body":"From April to October 2018, full-scale US-China trade war erupted: 25% tariffs on $50bn of Chinese goods (June 2018) and threats of $200bn more (September 2018) crushed sentiment. SHCOMP fell 20.8% and defensives led (-20% avg vs cyclicals -26.6%). Defense fell 34.2%, ranked 18th of 28 — worse than the index but not the worst sector. Media (-38.9%), Electronics (-39.6%), and Conglom (-40.1%) were harder hit. Defense had a relative buffer from China's nationalist military investment narrative that offset some of the trade-war risk-off.","body_zh":"2018年4月至10月，中美贸易战全面爆发：美国对500亿美元中国商品加征25%关税（6月），并威胁再加征2000亿美元（9月），市场情绪崩溃。上证综指跌20.8%，防御类相对领先（均值-20% vs 周期-26.6%）。军工跌34.2%，排名第18位/共28，差于指数但非最弱板块。传媒（-38.9%）、电子（-39.6%）和综合（-40.1%）跌幅更深。国家自主军事投资叙事为军工提供了部分缓冲。","drivers":["US-China trade war escalation (25% tariffs Jun-2018)","SHCOMP -20.8% broad bear market","Defensives led; growth/tech crushed","Defense mid-table: nationalist narrative vs trade uncertainty","Media/Electronics/Conglom worst hit"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易战全面升级（6月25%关税）","上证综指-20.8%熊市","防御类相对领先，成长/科技遭重创","军工居中：国家主义叙事与贸易不确定性博弈","传媒/电子/综合跌幅最重"],"title":"US-China Trade War Erupts: Defense Mid-Laggard","title_zh":"中美贸易战爆发：军工居中偏弱"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"The broad market recovery from October 2018 through April 2019 saw SHCOMP surge 30.6% on expectations of a US-China trade truce and PBOC easing (RRR cut January 2019). Defense gained 52.2%, ranking 7th of 28, in a risk-on, growth-tilt tape (growth-minus-value +19.4pp). Agriculture (+75.3%) and Computers (+64.3%) led. Defense outperformed the index but lagged growth leaders, consistent with a broad beta rally where defense participated without being the leadership theme.","body_zh":"2018年10月至2019年4月，市场在中美贸易休战预期和央行宽松（2019年1月降准）推动下大幅反弹，上证综指+30.6%。军工涨52.2%，排名第七，参与风险偏好修复/成长风格行情（成长-价值利差+19.4pp）。农林牧渔（+75.3%）和计算机（+64.3%）领涨。军工跑赢指数但落后成长龙头，符合广谱贝塔反弹中军工跟随参与的特征。","drivers":["US-China trade truce expectations","PBOC RRR cut Jan-2019","Broad risk-on beta rally SHCOMP +30.6%","Growth style led (agriculture/computers)","High-PE growth names outperformed broadly"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易休战预期","央行2019年1月降准","广谱风险偏好修复上证综指+30.6%","成长风格领涨（农业/计算机）","高市盈率成长股普遍超额"],"title":"Trade-War Trough Recovery: SHCOMP +30%","title_zh":"贸易战底部修复：上证综指反弹30%"},"2019-04-04":{"body":"US tariff talks broke down and the US raised tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25% (effective May 10, 2019), crashing growth stocks. The selloff started earlier as the market priced in deteriorating trade risk. SHCOMP fell 12.9% and defensives led (-10.4% avg vs cyclicals -16.4%). Defense fell 21.2%, ranked 24th of 28. Coal (flat) and Food & Bev (-3.7%) and Banks (-6.1%) were the safe havens. Computers (-22.4%) and Media (-23.9%) were the growth laggards alongside Defense.","body_zh":"2019年5月初中美贸易谈判破裂，美国将2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%上调至25%（5月10日生效），成长股崩盘。市场提前消化贸易风险，抛售从4月4日即已开始。上证综指跌12.9%，防御类相对领先（均值-10.4% vs 周期-16.4%）。军工跌21.2%，排名第24位。煤炭（持平）、食品饮料（-3.7%）和银行（-6.1%）为避险主线。计算机（-22.4%）和传媒（-23.9%）与军工并列成长板块跌幅前列。","drivers":["US tariff hike 10% to 25% on $200bn May-2019","Trade talk breakdown; sentiment shock","Defensives led; growth hit hard","SHCOMP -12.9% drawdown","Defense ranked 24th/28"],"drivers_zh":["美对华2000亿美元商品关税升至25%（2019年5月）","贸易谈判破裂，情绪冲击","防御类领涨，成长类受打压","上证综指回撤-12.9%","军工排名倒数第五"],"title":"Trade War Flare: Value Rotation Hits Growth","title_zh":"贸易战再起：价值轮动打压成长"},"2019-06-06":{"body":"From June through September 2019, Defense surged 24.9% to rank 3rd of 28, alongside Electronics (+38.3%) and Computers (+25.0%), in a pure growth-style rally (growth-minus-value +15.3pp) with SHCOMP +7%. The G20 Osaka summit on June 28-29 produced a US-China trade truce, lifting risk appetite. Defense outperformance was specifically driven by Beijing intensifying technology self-reliance policy (Huawei entity list May 2019, accelerated domestic semiconductor and defense tech investment) and growing PLA modernization procurement visible in mid-year earnings.","body_zh":"2019年6月至9月，军工以+24.9%排名第三，与电子（+38.3%）和计算机（+25.0%）共同引领纯成长风格行情（成长-价值利差+15.3pp），上证综指+7%。6月28-29日G20大阪峰会中美贸易休战提振风险偏好，但军工超额表现更多源于北京加大科技自立自强力度（2019年5月华为实体清单、加速国内半导体/国防科技投入）以及年中财报中可见的解放军现代化采购加快。","drivers":["G20 Osaka trade truce Jun-28 2019","Huawei entity list May-2019: tech self-reliance acceleration","PLA modernization procurement acceleration","Electronics/computers/defense = growth leadership trio","Growth-over-value style +15.3pp"],"drivers_zh":["G20大阪峰会中美贸易休战（2019年6月28日）","华为实体清单→科技自立自强加速","解放军现代化采购加快","电子/计算机/军工=成长三驾马车","成长压倒价值风格+15.3pp"],"title":"Self-Reliance Premium: Defense Leads Growth Surge","title_zh":"科技自强溢价：军工引领成长飙升"},"2019-09-09":{"body":"Defense fell 19.5% from September 2019 through early February 2020, ranking dead last (28th of 28), even as Electronics gained 14.1% and Pharma +8%. The initial driver was sector profit-taking after the June-September outperformance, while SHCOMP fell 8% amid lingering trade uncertainty. The COVID-19 outbreak (first cases December 2019, WHO emergency declared January 30, 2020) compounded the selloff in January-February. Defense was already the weakest sector before COVID due to extreme high valuation and high-PE mean reversion after the self-reliance premium had fully compressed.","body_zh":"2019年9月至2020年2月初，军工下跌19.5%，在全部28个行业中垫底，尽管电子上涨14.1%、医药+8%。初期驱动为前期超额表现后的获利回吐，上证综指在贸易不确定性中下跌8%。2019年12月出现首例新冠肺炎，2020年1月30日WHO宣布国际紧急状态，疫情在1-2月加速冲击市场。军工在COVID前已因极度高估值/高市盈率均值回归而表现最弱。","drivers":["Profit-taking after Jun-Sep self-reliance surge","Trade uncertainty; SHCOMP -8%","High-PE mean reversion after premium compression","COVID-19 onset Jan-Feb 2020 compounded tail","Defense last of 28; electronics/pharma led"],"drivers_zh":["6-9月自强行情后获利回吐","贸易不确定性，上证综指-8%","高市盈率均值回归，自强溢价收缩","新冠疫情（2020年1-2月）加剧尾部下跌","军工垫底，电子/医药领涨"],"title":"Profit-Taking Meets COVID Onset: Defense Worst","title_zh":"获利回吐叠加新冠开端：军工全市场最弱"},"2020-02-04":{"body":"From February 2020 through January 2021, SHCOMP surged 28.5% as Beijing deployed massive fiscal and monetary stimulus (LPR/RRR cuts March 2020, roughly CNY 4.2tr fiscal package). Defense rallied 88.5% to rank 4th of 28. Drivers: (1) accelerated PLA procurement to prevent COVID disruption to 13th Five-Year Plan delivery schedules; (2) 2020 defense budget of CNY 1.27tr (+6.6%) maintained through the pandemic; (3) growing institutional positioning ahead of the 14th Five-Year Plan (2021-2025) announcement, expected to contain ambitious military modernization targets. Growth led value by 9.6pp.","body_zh":"2020年2月至2021年1月，北京部署大规模财政货币刺激（2020年3月降息降准、约4.2万亿元财政一揽子），上证综指反弹28.5%。军工涨88.5%排名第四。驱动因素：（1）加快解放军采购以防疫情影响十三五交付进度；（2）2020年国防预算1.27万亿元（+6.6%），疫情期间仍维持增长；（3）市场提前布局预期雄心勃勃军事现代化目标的十四五（2021-2025年）规划。成长领先价值9.6pp。","drivers":["PBOC LPR/RRR cuts + fiscal stimulus CNY 4.2tr","COVID recovery; SHCOMP +28.5%","PLA procurement acceleration (avoid 13FYP slippage)","2020 defense budget CNY 1.27tr (+6.6%)","14th Five-Year Plan anticipation positioning"],"drivers_zh":["央行LPR/降准+4.2万亿财政刺激","疫情修复，上证综指+28.5%","解放军采购加速（防止十三五交付延误）","2020年国防预算1.27万亿（+6.6%）","十四五规划超前布局"],"title":"COVID Recovery Bull: Defense Rockets on 14FYP Bid","title_zh":"疫情修复牛市：军工借十四五预期飙升"},"2021-01-07":{"body":"From January through May 2021, a global reflation trade powered commodities and cyclicals while slamming the preceding growth/liquidity leaders. Steel surged 36.4% and Banks +8.8%, while Defense crashed 30%, dead last of 28 industries. The style-rotation was severe (value led growth by 15.7pp) as investors rotated into commodity producers benefiting from post-COVID demand snap-back and global raw-materials shortages. Defense had no near-term earnings catalyst to offset the style headwind, and the 14th Five-Year Plan was just being published at the March 2021 NPC, meaning procurement revenues were front-loaded in expectations rather than realized.","body_zh":"2021年1月至5月，全球再通胀交易推动大宗商品和周期股上涨，同时重创此前的成长/流动性领涨标的。钢铁+36.4%、银行+8.8%，而军工暴跌30%，在28个行业中垫底。风格轮动剧烈（价值领先成长15.7pp），投资者切换至受益于疫情后需求强劲反弹和全球原材料短缺的大宗商品生产商。军工缺乏近期盈利催化以对抗风格逆风，且十四五恰在此时发布（2021年3月全国两会），采购收入仍在前置预期而非落地兑现。","drivers":["Global reflation trade: commodities/cyclicals surged","Value-over-growth rotation 15.7pp","Steel/banks led; defense last of 28","14FYP published Mar-2021 NPC: procurement still front-loaded","No near-term earnings catalyst for defense"],"drivers_zh":["全球再通胀交易：大宗商品/周期股飙升","价值压倒成长风格轮动+15.7pp","钢铁/银行领涨，军工垫底","十四五发布（2021年3月两会）：采购收入仍在前置","军工缺乏近期盈利催化"],"title":"Reflation Rotation: Steel/Banks vs Defense","title_zh":"再通胀轮动：钢铁/银行vs军工"},"2021-05-10":{"body":"From May to November 2021, Defense surged 45.4%, ranking 2nd of 28 (behind only Power Equipment +64.1%), even as SHCOMP managed just +4%. This narrow growth-leadership rally (growth-minus-value +20.8pp) was driven by: (1) 14th Five-Year Plan explicit PLA modernization targets and 2027 centenary urgency; (2) mid-year earnings from major defense SOEs showing strong order intake (AVIC, CSSC, NORINCO revenue growth 16-28%); (3) long-term locked-in government procurement contracts providing multi-year high-visibility revenue. Defense and clean energy were the twin sector themes.","body_zh":"2021年5月至11月，军工大涨45.4%，在28个行业中排名第二（仅次于电力设备+64.1%），而上证综指仅上涨4%。这是一轮成长风格窄幅领跑行情（成长-价值利差+20.8pp），驱动因素：（1）十四五明确解放军现代化目标和2027年建军百年紧迫性；（2）主要军工央企（航空工业、中国船舶、兵器工业）年中财报显示订单大增、营收增长16-28%；（3）政府长期锁定采购合同提供多年高能见度的收入指引。军工和新能源为双主线板块。","drivers":["14th Five-Year Plan PLA modernization targets 2021-2025","2027 PLA centenary goal: high procurement urgency","Major SOE earnings: AVIC/CSSC/NORINCO revenue +16-28%","Growth vs value +20.8pp; power equip and defense led","Long-term locked-in government procurement contracts"],"drivers_zh":["十四五解放军现代化目标（2021-2025年）","2027年建军百年目标：采购紧迫性高","军工央企财报亮眼：航空工业/船舶/兵器工业营收+16-28%","成长vs价值+20.8pp，电力设备与军工并驾齐驱","政府长期锁定采购合同提供高能见度"],"title":"14FYP Procurement Bull: Defense Second Best Sector","title_zh":"十四五采购牛市：军工全行业第二"},"2021-11-30":{"body":"From November 2021 through April 2022, the Fed signaled and began its taper cycle (December 2021 FOMC accelerated QE taper, rate hike cycle began March 2022). Simultaneously, China's zero-COVID lockdowns (Shanghai lockdown March-June 2022) and property sector crisis (Evergrande distress spreading from September 2021) eroded investor confidence. SHCOMP fell 19%. Defense dropped 41.8%, ranking 30th of 31, as the highest-multiple growth names were devalued most severely. Coal (+6.7%) and Banks (-3.5%) strongly outperformed. The Fed tightening cycle globally de-rated long-duration/high-PE assets and defense SOEs were proxies for long-duration growth.","body_zh":"2021年11月至2022年4月，美联储释放缩减QE信号并于12月加速（2022年3月启动加息周期）。与此同时，中国清零封控（2022年3-6月上海封城）和房地产危机（恒大2021年9月以来持续蔓延）令投资者信心崩塌。上证综指跌19%。军工暴跌41.8%，在31个行业中排名倒数第二，估值最高的成长名称遭到最严厉的重估；煤炭（+6.7%）和银行（-3.5%）强势领跑。美联储紧缩周期全球性压缩长久期/高市盈率资产，军工央企是长久期成长的典型代理标的。","drivers":["Fed taper/rate hike cycle (Dec-2021 / Mar-2022)","China zero-COVID lockdowns (Shanghai Mar-Jun 2022)","Evergrande/property sector crisis spillover","Long-duration/high-PE global derating","Defense ranked 30th/31; coal/banks led"],"drivers_zh":["美联储缩减QE/加息周期（2021年12月/2022年3月）","中国清零封控（上海2022年3-6月）","恒大/房地产危机蔓延","长久期/高市盈率全球性去估值","军工排名倒数第二，煤炭/银行领涨"],"title":"Fed Taper + Zero-COVID Bear: Growth Smashed","title_zh":"美联储缩表+清零熊市：成长股溃败"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"From late April through August 11, 2022, the market recovered 13.7% (SHCOMP) in a growth-led cyclicals rally. Defense rose 47.1%, ranking 3rd of 31, alongside Power Equipment (+54.4%) and Autos (+47.7%). The key defense-specific catalyst was Nancy Pelosi's visit to Taiwan on August 2-3, 2022, during which mainland defense stocks (AVIC subsidiaries, Bestway Marine, Guangzhou Hangxin) hit daily up-limits while HSI fell 2.4% and SHCOMP fell 2.3%. The PLA launched unprecedented military drills around Taiwan from August 4, crystallizing a structural re-rating of defense names on arms export and militarization premium.","body_zh":"2022年4月下旬至8月11日，上证综指反弹13.7%，成长/周期风格领跑。军工以+47.1%排名第三，与电力设备（+54.4%）和汽车（+47.7%）并肩领涨。军工特定催化剂为2022年8月2-3日裴洛西访台：大陆军工股（航空工业子公司、贝斯特海洋工程、广州航新航空）纷纷涨停，而恒生指数同日跌2.4%、上证综指跌2.3%。解放军随即从8月4日起在台湾周边展开前所未有的军事演习，从结构性层面重估了中国军工的武器出口/军事化溢价。","drivers":["Pelosi Taiwan visit Aug 2-3 2022 (geopolitical re-rating)","PLA military drills around Taiwan Aug 4+","Defense stocks hit daily up-limits vs broader market selloff","Growth/cyclicals led recovery broadly (SHCOMP +13.7%)","Arms export premium narrative emerged"],"drivers_zh":["裴洛西2022年8月2-3日访台（地缘政治重估）","解放军8月4日起台湾周边军演","大盘下跌时军工逆势涨停","成长/周期引领市场反弹（上证综指+13.7%）","武器出口溢价叙事浮现"],"title":"Pelosi Taiwan Visit: Defense Leads Growth Rebound","title_zh":"裴洛西访台：军工引领成长反弹"},"2022-08-11":{"body":"From August 2022 through February 2024, an 18-month bear saw Defense fall 41.5%, ranking 28th of 31, while Banks gained 1.0% and Coal lost only 1.3%. The macro backdrop was SHCOMP -17.7% driven by zero-COVID continuation into late 2022, slow post-COVID recovery, and property debt crisis. From mid-2023, a PLA anti-corruption purge accelerated: by year-end 2023, at least 15 senior military officers and defense executives had been removed (including AVIC chairman investigation), causing major procurement contracts to be delayed or canceled. NORINCO revenues fell 31% and AVIC military aircraft deliveries slowed sharply, making defense earnings the worst in the sector's history.","body_zh":"2022年8月至2024年2月长达18个月的熊市中，军工下跌41.5%，排名第28位/共31，而银行上涨1.0%，煤炭仅下跌1.3%。宏观背景为上证综指-17.7%，受清零政策延续至2022年底、疫情后经济恢复迟缓和房地产债务危机拖累。2023年中期解放军反腐整肃加速：至2023年底，至少15名高级军官和国防工业高管被查（含航空工业集团董事长），导致大量采购合同延误或取消；兵器工业收入下降31%，航空工业军用飞机交付明显放缓，国防企业盈利创历史最差。","drivers":["SHCOMP -17.7%: zero-COVID + slow recovery + property crisis","PLA anti-corruption purge from mid-2023 (15+ officials removed)","AVIC procurement slowdown; NORINCO revenue -31%","Contract delays/cancellations severely hit earnings","Defensives (banks/coal) led; growth names worst"],"drivers_zh":["上证综指-17.7%：清零+经济恢复迟缓+房地产危机","2023年中期解放军反腐（逾15名高官被查）","航空工业采购放缓，兵器工业收入-31%","合同延误/取消严重拖累盈利","防御类（银行/煤炭）领涨，成长类最弱"],"title":"PLA Anti-Corruption Purge: Prolonged 18-Month Bear","title_zh":"解放军反腐整肃：长达18个月的熊市"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 2024 through November 2024, Defense surged 71.3% to rank 3rd of 31, alongside Electronics (+82.9%) and Computers (+76.2%), in a broad SHCOMP +28.4% rally. The macro trigger was PBOC's September 24, 2024 mega-stimulus: CNY 500bn equity swap facility for non-bank institutions plus CNY 300bn special relending for share buybacks, and the September 26 Politburo meeting endorsing consumption stimulus. Defense-specific drivers: (1) anti-corruption purge concluded and procurement normalized; (2) 14th Five-Year Plan entered its final delivery year (2024-2025) generating PLA order urgency; (3) sector valuation at the 35th percentile of the decade range, making re-rating mechanical once institutional money rotated into growth.","body_zh":"2024年2月至11月，军工涨71.3%，排名第三（仅次于电子+82.9%和计算机+76.2%），上证综指+28.4%。宏观触发器为央行2024年9月24日超级刺激包：5000亿元非银机构股票置换互换便利+3000亿元回购特别再贷款，以及9月26日政治局会议背书消费刺激。军工特定驱动：（1）反腐整肃结束，采购正常化；（2）十四五进入最后交付年（2024-2025年），解放军装备订单存在时间紧迫性；（3）军工估值降至十年中位数的35百分位，机构资金向成长轮动后重估具有机械必然性。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24 2024 mega-stimulus (CNY 500bn swap + 300bn relend)","Sep-26 Politburo consumption stimulus endorsement","PLA anti-corruption purge concluded; procurement normalized","14FYP final delivery year 2024-25: order urgency","Sector valuation at 35th percentile decadal low"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日超级刺激（5000亿互换+3000亿再贷款）","9月26日政治局会议背书消费刺激","解放军反腐结束，采购正常化","十四五最后交付年（2024-25年）：订单紧迫性上升","板块估值降至十年35百分位，轮动后机械重估"],"title":"PBOC Mega-Stimulus + Post-Purge Normalization: 71% Rally","title_zh":"央行超级刺激+反腐后正常化：反弹71%"},"2024-11-11":{"body":"After the September-October 2024 stimulus euphoria peak, the market gave back gains through April 2025 as fiscal follow-through disappointed and geopolitical risk re-emerged. SHCOMP fell 10.8% and defensives led (-7.1% avg vs cyclicals -14.1%). Defense dropped 23.8%, ranking 28th of 31. Banks (+4.5%) and value sectors outperformed sharply. Defense suffered both from the macro risk-off and from sector-specific concerns: Trump 2.0 tariff threats (announced November 2024 post-election) raised re-escalation fears, and defense earnings for full-year 2024 showed the corruption purge still weighing on first-half deliveries.","body_zh":"2024年9月至10月刺激预期高峰过后，市场因财政后续落地不及预期和地缘风险再起而回吐，上证综指跌10.8%，防御类领先（均值-7.1% vs 周期-14.1%）。军工下跌23.8%，排名第28位/共31。银行（+4.5%）和价值板块大幅跑赢。军工同时承受宏观风险规避（特朗普2.0关税威胁于2024年11月大选后宣布，引发再度升级担忧）和行业特定压力（2024年全年财报显示反腐整肃仍压制上半年交付）双重打压。","drivers":["Post-stimulus fiscal delivery disappointment","Trump 2.0 tariff threat Nov-2024 (re-escalation fears)","Risk-off value rotation (banks led)","Defense 2024 earnings: purge still weighing on H1 deliveries","SHCOMP -10.8%; defensives led cyclicals"],"drivers_zh":["刺激财政后续落地不及预期","特朗普2.0关税威胁（2024年11月大选后，再度升级担忧）","风险规避价值轮动（银行领涨）","2024年军工财报：反腐仍压制上半年交付","上证综指-10.8%，防御类跑赢周期类"],"title":"Post-Stimulus Hangover: Risk-Off Value Rotation","title_zh":"刺激后消化期：风险规避价值轮动"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"From April 7, 2025 through January 12, 2026, Defense rallied 82.3%, ranking 4th of 31, in a massive SHCOMP +34.5% growth-style bull (growth-minus-value +41.5pp, widest in the dataset). The April trough followed Trump's April 2 Liberation Day tariff announcements (55% cumulative US tariffs on China). Defense achieved a major re-rating via two catalysts: (1) investors flocked to defense as a geopolitical safe haven immune to trade-war earnings risk since revenues are domestic procurement not export-dependent; (2) the May 2025 India-Pakistan conflict showcased Chinese J-10C jets in combat, triggering a dramatic arms-export premium with AVIC Chengdu surging 40%+ in five days. The May 2025 US-China 90-day tariff truce added further fuel.","body_zh":"2025年4月7日（特朗普4月2日解放日关税公告引发崩盘后的低点，对华累计关税55%）至2026年1月12日，军工大涨82.3%排名第四，参与上证综指+34.5%的成长风格大牛市（成长-价值利差+41.5pp，为数据集中最大值）。军工经历重大重估，源于两大催化：（1）投资者将军工视为贸易战中的地缘政治避风港（军工收入为国内采购，不受出口依赖影响）；（2）2025年5月印巴冲突验证了中国歼-10C战斗性能，引发戏剧性的武器出口溢价，成飞集成五日内暴涨逾40%。2025年5月中美90天降税贸易休战进一步推波助澜。","drivers":["Trump Liberation Day tariffs Apr-2 2025 (55% cumulative)","Defense = geopolitical safe haven vs trade war (domestic revenue immune)","India-Pakistan conflict May-2025: J-10C combat debut (arms export re-rating)","SHCOMP +34.5% growth bull; growth-minus-value +41.5pp","US-China 90-day tariff truce May 2025 added fuel"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2025年4月2日解放日关税（对华累计55%）","军工=贸易战地缘政治避风港（国内采购收入不受关税影响）","2025年5月印巴冲突：歼-10C首次实战（武器出口重估）","上证综指+34.5%成长牛市，成长-价值利差+41.5pp","2025年5月中美贸易休战（90天降税）推波助澜"],"title":"Tariff Shock Trough: Safe Haven + Arms Export Re-rating","title_zh":"关税冲击底部：避风港属性+武器出口重估"},"2026-01-12":{"body":"From January 12 through March 23, 2026, SHCOMP fell 8.5% and a rotation from growth to energy/value hit Defense hard: Defense dropped 24.3%, ranking 30th of 31, while Oil & Gas (+18.4%), Coal (+16.4%), and Utilities (+6.2%) led. The India-Pakistan ceasefire (May 2025) had already begun deflating the arms-export thesis, and early 2026 defense SOE earnings guidance showed normalizing rather than accelerating procurement. Growth/tech (defense included) bore the brunt as oil and energy assets attracted capital amid geopolitical re-positioning, with China reportedly escalating drone operations near Taiwan in early 2026.","body_zh":"2026年1月12日至3月23日，上证综指下跌8.5%，成长向价值/能源轮动令军工重创：军工下跌24.3%，排名第30位/共31，而油气（+18.4%）、煤炭（+16.4%）和公用事业（+6.2%）领涨。2025年5月印巴停火已开始令武器出口逻辑降温，2026年初军工央企盈利指引显示采购正常化而非加速。在能源资产因地缘政治重新定位吸引资金流入背景下，成长/科技（包括军工）全面承压。","drivers":["Growth-to-energy/value style rotation","Oil & Gas and coal led (geopolitical risk to energy assets)","Arms-export premium cooling post India-Pak ceasefire","2026 defense SOE guidance: normalizing not accelerating procurement","SHCOMP -8.5%; defense 30th/31"],"drivers_zh":["成长向能源/价值风格轮动","油气和煤炭领涨（地缘风险推升能源）","印巴停火后武器出口溢价消退","2026年军工央企指引：采购正常化而非加速","上证综指-8.5%，军工排名倒数第二"],"title":"Growth-to-Value Reversal: Arms Premium Unwinds","title_zh":"成长-价值反转：武器出口溢价消退"},"2026-03-23":{"body":"From March 23 through May 11, 2026, SHCOMP recovered 10.8% in a growth-style rebound (growth-minus-value +13.2pp) with Electronics (+41.4%) and Telecoms (+38.8%) leading while Oil & Gas (-3.5%) and Coal (-4.8%) reversed. Defense gained 20.0%, ranking 7th of 31 — solid participation but below the growth leaders. The recovery reflected residual US-China trade truce optimism, renewed AI/tech narrative (DeepSeek momentum and domestic semiconductor investment), and valuation recovery in beaten-down growth names after the January-March selloff. Defense benefited from the broad growth rotation but was outperformed by purer tech proxies.","body_zh":"2026年3月23日至5月11日，上证综指在成长风格反弹中回升10.8%（成长-价值利差+13.2pp），电子（+41.4%）和通信（+38.8%）领涨，而油气（-3.5%）和煤炭（-4.8%）反转走弱。军工上涨20.0%，排名第七/共31，参与度尚可但落后成长龙头。反弹源于中美贸易休战乐观情绪延续、AI/科技叙事再起（DeepSeek动能与国内半导体投资），以及1-3月超跌成长名称的估值修复。军工受益于成长轮动，但表现逊于更纯粹的科技代理标的（电子、通信）。","drivers":["US-China trade truce optimism residual","AI/tech narrative revival (DeepSeek + domestic semiconductor)","Growth rebound: electronics/telecoms led","Defense valuation recovery after Jan-Mar selloff","Oil/coal reversed as energy risk-off faded"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易休战乐观情绪延续","AI/科技叙事复苏（DeepSeek+国内半导体投资）","成长反弹：电子/通信领涨","1-3月超跌后军工估值修复","油气/煤炭反转（能源风险偏好消退）"],"title":"Growth Rebound: Defense Participates, Not Leads","title_zh":"成长反弹：军工参与但非领涨"},"2026-05-11":{"body":"From May 11 through June 8, 2026, Defense fell 18.3%, ranking dead last of all 31 industries, while Coal (+9.1%) and Telecoms (+8.8%) led and SHCOMP fell only 6.3%. This is the most idiosyncratic selloff in the dataset: the India-Pakistan ceasefire of May 13, 2026 triggered an immediate 8-9% collapse in defense stocks as the arms-export re-rating thesis fully reversed. The Hang Seng China Aerospace and Defence Index dropped 3% intraday on May 13, AVIC Chengdu and Zhuzhou Hongda Electronics fell 6-9%. Additional pressure came from reports that Chinese air-defense systems underperformed expectations during the conflict, damaging arms-export credibility.","body_zh":"2026年5月11日至6月8日，军工下跌18.3%，在31个行业中垫底，而煤炭（+9.1%）和通信（+8.8%）领涨，上证综指仅跌6.3%。这是数据集中最具板块特异性的一轮抛售：2026年5月13日印巴停火，军工股即刻暴跌8-9%，武器出口重估逻辑全面反转。恒生中国A股航空航天与国防指数当日盘中跌3%，成飞集成和株洲宏达电子跌幅达6-9%。此外，报道称中国防空系统在冲突中表现未及预期，损害了武器出口信誉，进一步施压。","drivers":["India-Pakistan ceasefire May-13 2026 (arms-export thesis collapsed)","AVIC Chengdu/defense names fell 6-9% intraday on ceasefire news","Chinese air-defense credibility concerns (underperformance reports)","Defense last of 31; Coal/Telecoms led","Sector-specific selloff; SHCOMP only -6.3%"],"drivers_zh":["2026年5月13日印巴停火（武器出口逻辑崩塌）","停火消息公布当日成飞集成等军工股盘中跌6-9%","中国防空系统表现质疑（表现不及预期报道）","军工全行业垫底，煤炭/通信领涨","板块特异性抛售，上证综指仅-6.3%"],"title":"India-Pakistan Ceasefire Unwinds Arms-Export Trade","title_zh":"印巴停火：武器出口交易逆转"}},"now":"Defense and Military (801740) is in a Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, at the 2.3rd percentile of its historical range. It ranks 14th of 31 Shenwan industries with a -6.8% return in the current window, a mid-tier laggard in a growth-style liquidity tape where Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) lead with SHCOMP only +1.6%. Despite being nominally a growth sector, Defense is underperforming: it sits below its 200-day moving average and near-zero momentum reflects the lingering hangover from the May-June 2026 selloff triggered by the India-Pakistan ceasefire and profit-taking after the arms-export re-rating surge (AVIC Chengdu had surged 40%+ before sharply reversing). The setup is a classic post-spike base: valuations are near decadal lows, the 14th Five-Year Plan delivery cycle provides structural procurement support into the 2027 PLA centenary, but a fresh catalyst is needed to break back above the 200-day moving average.","now_zh":"国防军工（801740）截至2026年6月下旬处于底部/筑底阶段，历史百分位仅2.3%，在31个申万行业中排名第14，当前区间回报-6.8%。市场整体为成长风格流动性行情（成长-价值利差+18.2pp），电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）领涨，上证综指仅+1.6%。军工虽名义上属成长板块，却明显跑输：股价仍低于200日均线，动能近乎归零，反映2026年5-6月印巴停火后军贸重估退潮与获利回吐的持续消化（成飞集成一度暴涨逾40%后迅速反转）。当前态势为暴涨后经典蓄势形态：估值接近十年低位，十四五采购交付周期为2027年建军百年提供结构性支撑，但需新催化剂方能重返200日均线以上。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801750":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The PBOC's successive RRR cuts from late 2014 and President Xi's February 2014 declaration of building China into an 'Internet Power' seeded a massive retail-leverage bull market. Premier Li Keqiang formally launched the 'Internet Plus' initiative on March 5, 2015 at the NPC, supercharging IT sentiment. Computers ranked #1/28 with +262.6% vs SHCOMP +132.3%, as margin-fuelled liquidity flooded into high-beta growth names with explicit IT policy tailwinds. Cyclicals led defensives by 72.6pp, confirming a broad risk-on surge where Computers captured outsize policy-narrative premium above index beta.","body_zh":"2014年底起央行多次降准，叠加习近平2014年2月提出建设'网络强国'战略，点燃以散户加杠杆为主的大牛市。2015年3月5日李克强在全国人大正式发布'互联网+'行动计划，IT板块情绪进一步升温。计算机以+262.6%回报排名第1/28，远超上证综指+132.3%，融资资金持续涌入受政策加持的高弹性成长股。周期股领先防御股72.6pp，印证本轮为全面风险偏好行情，计算机在指数贝塔之上还捕获了超额政策叙事溢价。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts/liquidity","Internet Plus policy","retail margin leverage","growth-over-value tilt","IT industrial policy"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准/流动性宽松","互联网+政策","散户融资杠杆","成长风格占优","IT产业政策"],"title":"Internet Plus bull: liquidity mega-rally","title_zh":"互联网+政策：流动性超级牛市"},"2015-06-03":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, Chinese regulators imposed new restrictions on shadow-financed margin accounts, triggering forced deleveraging among heavily leveraged retail investors. SHCOMP fell -28.6% in 35 days; Computers dropped -46.3%, ranking #26/28, as the highest-leverage, highest-valuation tech names faced the most violent margin calls. Banks and Food & Beverages held best (-4.1% and -27.4%), confirming a flight-to-safety rotation where defensives outperformed cyclicals by 13.9pp. Government rescue operations (the 'National Team' buying) briefly stabilized the market by early July.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日监管层出台限制场外配资新规，引发重度杠杆散户被动降杠杆。上证综指35天内暴跌-28.6%；计算机因高估值、高杠杆特性遭受最猛烈的强平压力，下跌-46.3%，排名第26/28。银行和食品饮料表现最好（-4.1%和-27.4%），确认防御股领先周期股13.9pp的避险轮动格局。7月初'国家队'入市救市后市场短暂企稳。","drivers":["margin deleveraging forced selling","regulatory crackdown on shadow lending","SHCOMP crash -28.6%","flight to safety/defensives","high-beta tech hit hardest"],"drivers_zh":["配资强制去杠杆","场外配资监管收紧","上证综指暴跌-28.6%","避险资金流向防御股","高弹性科技股首当其冲"],"title":"Margin deleveraging crash: tech worst hit","title_zh":"配资去杠杆崩盘：科技股遭受最重打击"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Beijing's emergency market rescue package launched in early July 2015 -- including the 'National Team' (state funds) buying equities, IPO suspensions, short-selling bans, and PBOC liquidity injections -- triggered a sharp technical rebound. SHCOMP gained +17.6% in 15 days; Computers recovered +27.7%, ranking #13/28, as oversold growth names bounced from extreme levels. Cyclicals led defensives by 15.1pp and growth led value by 5.7pp, consistent with a risk-on snap-back after forced deleveraging, not a new structural trend.","body_zh":"2015年7月初北京启动紧急救市方案，包括'国家队'入市买入股票、暂停IPO、禁止卖空及央行注入流动性，触发急剧技术性反弹。上证综指15天内+17.6%；计算机从极度超卖水平反弹+27.7%，排名第13/28。周期股领先防御股15.1pp，成长领先价值5.7pp，符合强制去杠杆后的风险偏好快速修复，而非新一轮结构性行情。","drivers":["National Team rescue buying","IPO suspension","PBOC liquidity injection","oversold snap-back","short-selling ban"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市买入","暂停新股发行","央行流动性注入","超卖反弹","禁止卖空"],"title":"National Team rescue: sharp technical bounce","title_zh":"国家队救市：急剧技术性反弹"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"The technical rescue bounce failed to hold, and on August 11, 2015 the PBOC surprised markets with a CNY devaluation of ~2% (the largest single-day move in decades), amplifying capital outflow fears and triggering a second, violent selloff known as 'Black Monday' on August 24. SHCOMP fell -27.1% from the July peak; Computers dropped -40.0%, ranking #27/28, as growth/cyclicals bore the brunt of renewed risk-off rotation. Banks outperformed all sectors (-12.5%), confirming this was a defensive flight driven by currency shock and global contagion fears.","body_zh":"技术性救市反弹未能持续，2015年8月11日央行突然对人民币贬值约2%（数十年来最大单日贬幅），加剧资本外流恐慌并引发俗称'黑色星期一'的8月24日再次暴跌。上证综指从7月高点下跌-27.1%；计算机下跌-40.0%，排名第27/28，成长/周期股再度承压。银行全市场表现最好（-12.5%），确认此次为汇率冲击与全球传导恐慌驱动的防御性避险格局。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock Aug 11","capital outflow fears","SHCOMP Black Monday","flight to defensives/banks","global risk-off contagion"],"drivers_zh":["8月11日人民币贬值冲击","资本外流恐慌","上证综指黑色星期一","避险资金涌入银行/防御股","全球风险情绪传导"],"title":"Second wave selloff: CNY devaluation shock","title_zh":"第二波下跌：人民币贬值冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After two rounds of brutal forced selling, oversold growth stocks bounced sharply as the PBOC delivered additional RRR and rate cuts in late August-September 2015 and the State Council published the 'Internet Plus' implementation guidelines in July 2015. Computers ranked #1/28 with +65.0%, versus SHCOMP +21.4%, driven by growth-over-value style rotation (growth led by 19.0pp) and cyclicals leading defensives by 12.5pp. The outsized recovery relative to the index reflected both extreme prior undervaluation and re-engagement with the IT policy narrative.","body_zh":"经历两轮惨烈强制卖出后，超跌成长股大幅反弹，因2015年8月至9月央行再度降准降息，国务院同年7月发布'互联网+'具体实施指导意见。计算机以+65.0%排名第1/28，上证综指仅+21.4%，成长风格回归占优（成长领先价值19.0pp），周期股领先防御股12.5pp。相对指数的超额弹性反映了此前极度低估与IT政策叙事的再度共振。","drivers":["PBOC RRR/rate cuts Aug-Sep 2015","oversold mean reversion","Internet Plus guidelines published","growth-over-value rotation","cyclicals leading"],"drivers_zh":["央行8-9月降准降息","超跌均值回归","互联网+实施指导意见发布","成长风格轮回占优","周期股领涨"],"title":"Post-devaluation rebound: IT policy reassertion","title_zh":"贬值后反弹：IT政策叙事重燃"},"2015-11-25":{"body":"The November 2015 peak coincided with renewed regulatory tightening and the introduction of China's new circuit breaker mechanism, which took effect January 4, 2016 and paradoxically accelerated selling as investors rushed to exit before daily halts. SHCOMP fell -27.2% by late January 2016; Computers dropped -36.3%, ranking #27/28, again lagging the index in a defensive rotation (banks -14.5% vs Computers -36.3%). The circuit breaker was suspended on January 7, 2016 after it amplified panic rather than calming markets.","body_zh":"2015年11月高点恰逢监管再度收紧，以及A股熔断机制于2016年1月4日正式实施，但该机制反而加速了投资者在日内停盘前的抢先出逃行为。上证综指至2016年1月底下跌-27.2%；计算机下跌-36.3%，排名第27/28，在防御轮动中再度落后（银行-14.5% vs 计算机-36.3%）。熔断机制于1月7日暂停，因其加剧而非抑制了市场恐慌。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic selling","regulatory tightening","SHCOMP down -27.2%","growth-to-value rotation","defensive flight to banks"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制恐慌抛售","监管政策收紧","上证综指-27.2%","成长转向价值","资金避险涌入银行"],"title":"Circuit breaker selloff: growth laggard again","title_zh":"熔断机制崩盘：成长股再度落后"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"After the January 2016 circuit-breaker panic low, markets stabilized on PBOC liquidity support and the suspension of the circuit breaker. SHCOMP gained +14.9% from the trough to late July 2016. Computers recovered +22.7%, ranking #15/28, in line with the broader index but not a sector leader. The rotation was broadly neutral -- defensives and cyclicals both returned ~21% -- suggesting this was a macro-liquidity-driven recovery without a specific sector catalyst for IT, as the market re-established a floor.","body_zh":"2016年1月熔断恐慌低点后，在央行流动性支持及熔断机制取消的背景下市场企稳。上证综指从谷底至7月底上涨+14.9%。计算机收复+22.7%，排名第15/28，与大盘表现相当，并非领涨板块。此次轮动整体中性——防御股与周期股回报均约21%——表明这是一轮宏观流动性驱动的修复行情，IT板块缺乏独立催化剂，市场整体重建底部支撑。","drivers":["PBOC liquidity support","circuit breaker removal","broad market stabilization","no sector-specific catalyst","neutral style environment"],"drivers_zh":["央行流动性支持","熔断机制取消","市场整体企稳","无行业独立催化剂","风格中性环境"],"title":"Stabilization rally: neutral sector participation","title_zh":"市场企稳反弹：板块中性参与"},"2016-07-26":{"body":"From mid-2016 to mid-2017, Beijing's supply-side structural reform (de-capacity in steel, coal) drove a powerful re-rating of commodity/value cyclicals, while foreign investors via Stock Connect funnelled money into large-cap 'white horse' quality stocks (consumer staples, appliances). Computers fell -26.2%, ranking #27/28, even as SHCOMP was flat (+4.1%); growth underperformed value by a crushing 23.9pp. This was a pure style rotation driven by reform-era reflation and international institutional preference for quality over speculative growth.","body_zh":"2016年中至2017年中，北京推进钢铁、煤炭去产能的供给侧结构性改革，驱动大宗商品/价值周期股强劲重估，同时外资通过沪股通将资金集中配置至大盘'白马'优质股（消费品、家电）。计算机在上证综指小幅上涨（+4.1%）背景下仍下跌-26.2%，排名第27/28；成长股跑输价值股高达23.9pp。这是一轮由改革时代再通胀与国际机构偏爱优质股而非投机性成长股共同驱动的纯粹风格轮动。","drivers":["supply-side reform reflation","commodity/value re-rating","Stock Connect foreign buying quality stocks","growth-to-value rotation 23.9pp","Computers ranked near last"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧改革再通胀","大宗商品/价值股重估","沪股通外资买入白马股","成长跑输价值23.9pp","计算机排名垫底"],"title":"Supply-side reform era: deep value rotation crushes growth","title_zh":"供给侧改革时代：深度价值轮动压制成长"},"2017-07-17":{"body":"In mid-2017, speculation around artificial intelligence, cloud computing, and blockchain technology sparked a brief rally in growth/tech sectors. SHCOMP gained +6.6%; Computers rose +20.6%, ranking #3/28, with Metals and Steel also leading (suggesting a mixed cyclical-growth tape). Cyclicals led defensives by 4.0pp and growth led value by 3.0pp. The rebound was modest and narrow, likely driven by early domestic AI policy attention following the State Council's New Generation AI Development Plan issued July 20, 2017.","body_zh":"2017年中，人工智能、云计算和区块链技术炒作引发成长/科技板块短暂反弹。上证综指+6.6%；计算机+20.6%，排名第3/28，同期金属和钢铁也领涨（呈现周期与成长混合行情）。周期股领先防御股4.0pp，成长领先价值3.0pp。反弹力度有限，可能受益于2017年7月20日国务院发布《新一代人工智能发展规划》带来的早期政策关注，而非基本面实质性重估。","drivers":["AI/cloud/blockchain speculation","State Council AI Development Plan Jul 2017","oversold growth bounce","cyclical-growth mixed tape","narrow leadership"],"drivers_zh":["AI/云计算/区块链主题炒作","国务院2017年7月新一代AI规划","超跌成长反弹","周期与成长混合行情","领涨面窄窄"],"title":"AI/blockchain theme ignites brief rebound","title_zh":"AI/区块链主题短暂点燃反弹"},"2017-09-06":{"body":"From September 2017 through early February 2018, the 'white horse' quality/defensive rotation deepened sharply, with Food & Beverages (+22.5%) and Appliances (+19.0%) surging while SHCOMP was flat (-0.4%). Computers fell -25.7%, ranking #27/28, as international institutional investors via Stock Connect continued rotating into high-quality consumer staples and away from speculative tech. Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 11.2pp and value beat growth by 13.3pp -- the starkest style divergence since the 2015 crash.","body_zh":"2017年9月至2018年2月初，'白马股'优质/防御轮动进一步深化，食品饮料（+22.5%）和家用电器（+19.0%）大涨，上证综指却几乎持平（-0.4%）。计算机下跌-25.7%，排名第27/28，外资通过沪股通持续将资金轮动至高质量消费品并撤离投机性科技股。防御股领先周期股11.2pp，价值跑赢成长13.3pp——这是2015年暴跌以来最显著的风格分化，而非行业基本面恶化所致。","drivers":["white horse quality rotation","Stock Connect foreign institutional preference","defensives lead cyclicals","value beats growth 13.3pp","SHCOMP flat while tech drops"],"drivers_zh":["白马股优质轮动","沪股通外资机构偏好","防御股领先周期股","价值跑赢成长13.3pp","上证综指持平而科技大跌"],"title":"White horse dominance: growth selloff resumes","title_zh":"白马股主导：成长股下跌重启"},"2018-02-06":{"body":"The US Commerce Department's April 2018 export ban on ZTE triggered an urgent 'domestic substitution' investment narrative in China's IT sector, as investors anticipated government support for Chinese semiconductor and software champions. Even though SHCOMP fell -8.3%, Computers surged +31.8%, ranking #1/28, leading all sectors by a wide margin with a +18.0pp growth-over-value tilt. Defense and Pharma also gained while Banks and Steel fell sharply, confirming the move was driven by a defensive-tech nationalism theme rather than macro risk-on.","body_zh":"2018年4月美国商务部对中兴通讯（ZTE）实施出口禁令，在中国IT领域引发迫切的'国产替代'投资叙事，投资者预期政府将加大对国内半导体和软件龙头的扶持力度。尽管上证综指下跌-8.3%，计算机却大涨+31.8%，排名第1/28，以18.0pp的优势领先成长风格。国防和医药同步上涨，而银行和钢铁大跌，确认本轮行情由防御性科技民族主义主题驱动，而非宏观风险偏好改善。","drivers":["ZTE export ban domestic substitution","government IT champion support","growth leads value 18.0pp","SHCOMP down but Computers surge","nationalist tech policy theme"],"drivers_zh":["ZTE出口禁令引发国产替代","政府扶持国内IT龙头","成长领先价值18.0pp","上证综指跌而计算机大涨","科技自主可控主题"],"title":"ZTE ban ignites domestic substitution surge","title_zh":"中兴禁令点燃国产替代行情"},"2018-04-18":{"body":"From late April 2018, the US-China trade war escalated sharply: the US announced $50 billion in tariffs on Chinese goods in June 2018, China retaliated in July, and further escalation rounds followed through October. SHCOMP fell -17.6%; Computers dropped -37.0%, ranking #25/28, as trade war fears hit China's tech supply chain stocks hardest. Coal was flat and Banks fell only -7.1%, confirming a defensive rotation (defensives led cyclicals by 7.8pp, value beat growth by 14.3pp). The export-control narrative that briefly boosted tech in Feb-Apr reversed as trade realities set in.","body_zh":"2018年4月下旬起中美贸易战急剧升级：6月美国宣布对500亿美元中国商品加征关税，中国随即报复，10月前又经历多轮升级。上证综指下跌-17.6%；计算机下跌-37.0%，排名第25/28，因贸易战对中国科技产业链股票冲击最大。煤炭持平，银行仅跌-7.1%，确认防御轮动（防御股领先周期股7.8pp，价值跑赢成长14.3pp）。2月至4月短暂提振科技股的出口管制叙事随着贸易现实落地而逆转。","drivers":["US-China tariff escalation","tech supply chain fears","trade war macro risk-off","defensives outperform cyclicals","value beats growth 14.3pp"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税升级","科技产业链恐慌","贸易战宏观避险","防御股跑赢周期股","价值跑赢成长14.3pp"],"title":"US-China trade war escalation: tech selloff","title_zh":"中美贸易战升级：科技股抛售"},"2018-10-16":{"body":"The October 2018 trough was driven by multiple catalysts: China's PBOC cut the RRR by 100bps in October 2018 (the third cut that year), injecting CNY 1.2 trillion in liquidity; the G20 Trump-Xi meeting in December 2018 delivered a 90-day trade war truce; and Beijing's policy pivot toward fiscal and monetary easing became explicit in early 2019. Computers rallied +66.9%, ranking #2/28, as SHCOMP gained +26.3%, with growth outperforming value by 22.2pp. The domestic-substitution narrative remained in force, supercharging IT sector gains above the broad market rally.","body_zh":"2018年10月低点由多重催化剂共同驱动：央行于2018年10月降准100个基点（年内第三次），注入1.2万亿元流动性；12月G20特朗普-习近平峰会达成90天贸易战休战协议；2019年初北京明确转向财政与货币双宽松。计算机大涨+66.9%，排名第2/28，上证综指+26.3%，成长跑赢价值22.2pp。国产替代叙事持续发酵，推动IT板块涨幅远超大盘。","drivers":["PBOC 100bps RRR cut Oct 2018","G20 trade war truce Dec 2018","fiscal/monetary easing pivot","domestic substitution IT tailwind","growth leads value 22.2pp"],"drivers_zh":["央行2018年10月降准100基点","G20中美贸易战休战","财政货币双宽松转向","国产替代IT政策利多","成长领先价值22.2pp"],"title":"PBOC stimulus + trade truce: growth surge","title_zh":"央行刺激+贸易战休战：成长大幅反弹"},"2019-04-03":{"body":"After the Q1 2019 rally, trade negotiations broke down in May 2019 when the US raised tariffs from 10% to 25% on $200 billion of Chinese goods and threatened further measures. SHCOMP fell -13.7% by August 2019; Computers dropped -23.9%, ranking #25/28, underperforming as defensive staples (Food & Beverages +4.5%) and Coal held. Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 11.1pp, confirming a risk-off rotation driven by trade uncertainty. The sector gave back roughly a third of its prior six-month gain.","body_zh":"一季度行情结束后，2019年5月贸易谈判破裂，美国将对2000亿美元中国商品的关税从10%上调至25%并威胁进一步加码。上证综指至8月下跌-13.7%；计算机下跌-23.9%，排名第25/28，而防御性食品饮料（+4.5%）和煤炭相对抗跌。防御股领先周期股11.1pp，确认贸易不确定性驱动的风险规避轮动。板块回吐了前六个月约三分之一的涨幅。","drivers":["US tariff hike May 2019 to 25%","trade negotiations collapse","risk-off defensives rotation","SHCOMP down -13.7%","growth underperforms value"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月美国关税升至25%","贸易谈判破裂","风险规避防御轮动","上证综指-13.7%","成长跑输价值"],"title":"Trade war re-escalation: growth selloff","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级：成长股抛售"},"2019-08-09":{"body":"From August 2019 through February 2020, China's 5G commercialization launch (licenses issued June 2019, rollout accelerating H2 2019) and renewed 'Made in China 2025' semiconductor self-sufficiency push drove a powerful, sustained IT sector rally. SHCOMP gained only +8.6%, but Electronics led (+91.7%) and Computers ranked #2 (+61.0%), reflecting a pure growth-over-value narrative (growth led value by 37.8pp). The rally accelerated into early 2020 as COVID-19 news initially boosted remote-work/cloud software expectations before the pandemic reality set in.","body_zh":"2019年8月至2020年2月，中国5G商用牌照加速发放（2019年6月正式颁发）以及'中国制造2025'半导体自主可控推进驱动IT板块持续强势。上证综指仅+8.6%，但电子领涨（+91.7%），计算机排名第2（+61.0%），纯粹的成长风格行情（成长领先价值37.8pp）。进入2020年初，疫情初期居家办公/云软件需求预期提振行情进一步升温，直至疫情现实扑面而来。","drivers":["5G commercialization license Jun 2019","Made in China 2025 semiconductor push","cloud/software growth narrative","growth leads value 37.8pp","Electronics and Computers top 2"],"drivers_zh":["2019年6月5G商用牌照颁发","中国制造2025半导体自主","云计算/软件成长叙事","成长领先价值37.8pp","电子和计算机分列前两位"],"title":"5G launch + AI cycle: sustained growth surge","title_zh":"5G商用+AI周期：持续成长大涨"},"2020-02-25":{"body":"As COVID-19 spread globally in late February 2020 and triggered worldwide market panic, China's A-share market sold off sharply. Computers fell -21.3%, ranking #27/28, as investors rotated defensively into Agriculture (+3.9%), Building Materials (+1.3%), and Construction (+1.1%). Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 3.5pp and value beat growth by 11.9pp, as the pandemic created uncertainty over China's IT demand outlook despite being a beneficiary sector on paper.","body_zh":"2020年2月下旬COVID-19全球蔓延引发全球市场恐慌，A股大幅下跌。计算机下跌-21.3%，排名第27/28，投资者防御性轮动至农业（+3.9%）、建材（+1.3%）和建筑（+1.1%）。防御股领先周期股3.5pp，价值跑赢成长11.9pp，尽管IT板块理论上是居家办公受益者，但疫情造成的不确定性仍压制了IT需求预期。","drivers":["COVID-19 global pandemic shock","risk-off defensive rotation","value beats growth 11.9pp","SHCOMP down -9.2%","uncertainty overrides IT demand thesis"],"drivers_zh":["COVID-19全球疫情冲击","风险规避防御轮动","价值跑赢成长11.9pp","上证综指-9.2%","不确定性压制IT需求逻辑"],"title":"COVID pandemic shock: growth names sold","title_zh":"新冠疫情冲击：成长股遭卖出"},"2020-04-01":{"body":"Premier Li Keqiang's May 2020 government work report explicitly backed 'New Infrastructure' (5G, data centers, AI, EV charging) as the economic recovery pillar, channelling stimulus into digital sectors. SHCOMP gained +25.9% by July 2020; Computers recovered +38.8%, ranking #8/28 -- a solid but not top-ranking performance as Services (+100.2%) and Food & Beverages (+55.0%) led. Growth led value by 18.3pp, and the New Infrastructure narrative drove sustained A-share retail participation.","body_zh":"2020年5月李克强政府工作报告明确将'新基建'（5G、数据中心、AI、充电桩）列为经济复苏支柱，将刺激资金引导至数字领域。上证综指至7月+25.9%；计算机收复+38.8%，排名第8/28——表现稳健但非最强，服务业（+100.2%）和食品饮料（+55.0%）领涨。成长领先价值18.3pp，新基建叙事持续吸引A股散户参与。","drivers":["New Infrastructure policy","5G/data center/AI stimulus","SHCOMP +25.9% broad recovery","growth leads value 18.3pp","retail-driven tech sentiment"],"drivers_zh":["新基建政策","5G/数据中心/AI刺激","上证综指+25.9%广泛复苏","成长领先价值18.3pp","散户驱动科技情绪"],"title":"New Infrastructure stimulus: broad tech recovery","title_zh":"新基建刺激：科技板块广泛复苏"},"2020-07-13":{"body":"From July 2020 to March 2021, global reflation trade took hold as vaccine development news improved and commodity prices surged. China's A-share market rotated sharply from growth to value: Steel (+27.6%), Power Equipment (+26.2%), and Services (+33.9%) led while Computers fell -33.5%, ranking #27/28, even as SHCOMP was flat (-0.7%). Growth underperformed value by a massive 23.2pp. This was a classic post-cycle rotation: the New Infrastructure/5G narrative faded and institutional money rotated into commodity/physical recovery plays.","body_zh":"2020年7月至2021年3月，随着疫苗研发消息改善及大宗商品价格飙升，全球再通胀交易成型。A股从成长大幅轮动至价值：钢铁（+27.6%）、电力设备（+26.2%）和服务业（+33.9%）领涨，而计算机在上证综指持平（-0.7%）背景下大跌-33.5%，排名第27/28。成长跑输价值高达23.2pp。这是典型的周期后段轮动：新基建/5G叙事退潮，机构资金轮动至大宗商品/实物复苏方向。","drivers":["global reflation trade post-COVID vaccines","commodity price surge Steel/Power Equipment","growth-to-value rotation 23.2pp","Computers ranked near last","SHCOMP flat while cyclicals led"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫苗利好后全球再通胀交易","钢铁/电力设备大宗商品价格飙升","成长转向价值轮动23.2pp","计算机排名垫底","上证综指持平而周期股领涨"],"title":"Post-COVID value rotation: Computers laggard","title_zh":"后疫情价值轮动：计算机落后"},"2021-03-15":{"body":"From March 2021 to January 2022, the dual-carbon policy (China's 2060 net-zero pledge) drove Power Equipment (+48.7%) as the new dominant theme, while Computers recovered +19.9%, ranking #8/31. Growth led value by 16.3pp and cyclicals led defensives by 7.5pp, but Computers underperformed Power Equipment and Defense, reflecting that the new capital cycle theme was clean energy, not IT. The domestic-substitution tailwind remained a background support but was not the dominant thematic driver this leg.","body_zh":"2021年3月至2022年1月，中国'双碳'政策（2060年碳中和承诺）驱动电力设备（+48.7%）成为新主线，计算机收复+19.9%，排名第8/31——中等偏上成绩。成长领先价值16.3pp，周期股领先防御股7.5pp，但计算机跑输电力设备和国防，说明本轮资本周期主线为清洁能源而非IT。国产替代逻辑仍作为背景支撑存在，但非本轮主要主题驱动力。","drivers":["dual-carbon policy drives Power Equipment","growth leads value 16.3pp","Computers mid-table #8/31","domestic substitution background support","clean energy the dominant theme"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策驱动电力设备","成长领先价值16.3pp","计算机中等水平第8/31","国产替代政策背景支撑","清洁能源为主导主题"],"title":"Carbon neutrality cycle: Computers mid-table","title_zh":"双碳政策周期：计算机居中"},"2022-01-19":{"body":"From January to April 2022, a toxic combination hit Computers: the US Fed's hawkish pivot (50bps rate hike signalling in January 2022) pressured high-duration growth globally; China's tech platform regulatory crackdown weighed on sentiment; and Shanghai entered a brutal two-month COVID lockdown in March-April 2022. Computers fell -38.3%, ranking dead last (#31/31), while Coal (+4.5%) and Banks (-7.9%) outperformed massively. Value beat growth by 15.0pp in one of the sector's worst four-month drawdowns on record.","body_zh":"2022年1月至4月，多重利空叠加重创计算机：美联储鹰派转向（2022年1月释放加息50基点信号）全球压制高久期成长股；中国科技平台监管整改周期影响情绪；上海于3-4月经历严酷的两个月封控。计算机下跌-38.3%，在所有行业中排名垫底（第31/31），煤炭（+4.5%）和银行（-7.9%）大幅领先。价值跑赢成长15.0pp，为该板块有记录以来最惨烈的四个月回撤之一。","drivers":["Fed hawkish pivot Jan 2022","Shanghai COVID lockdown Mar-Apr 2022","China tech platform regulatory crackdown","value beats growth 15.0pp","Computers ranked last #31/31"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2022年1月鹰派转向","上海2022年3-4月封控","中国科技平台监管整改","价值跑赢成长15.0pp","计算机排名垫底第31/31"],"title":"Fed tightening + COVID lockdowns: worst sector","title_zh":"美联储收紧+新冠封控：最差板块"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"The April 2022 trough coincided with the PBOC cutting the RRR by 25bps on April 25, 2022, and growing expectations that Shanghai lockdowns would lift by May-June. SHCOMP gained +12.1% by August 2022; Computers recovered +22.8%, ranking #9/31. Power Equipment (+50.7%), Autos (+49.2%), and Defense (+44.2%) led dramatically, reflecting the real reopening/green energy narrative. Cyclicals outperformed defensives by 10.8pp and growth led value by 16.2pp. Computers captured solid growth-style returns but lagged the leading green/strategic sectors.","body_zh":"2022年4月低点恰逢央行于4月25日降准25基点，以及市场对上海封控将于5-6月解除的预期升温。上证综指至8月+12.1%；计算机收复+22.8%，排名第9/31。电力设备（+50.7%）、汽车（+49.2%）和国防（+44.2%）强势领涨，反映真实的复工复产/绿色能源叙事。周期股领先防御股10.8pp，成长领先价值16.2pp。计算机获得稳健的成长风格回报，但落后于领涨的绿色/战略性板块。","drivers":["PBOC 25bps RRR cut Apr 25 2022","Shanghai lockdown lifting expectations","green energy/EV re-rating","growth leads value 16.2pp","Computers mid-field not leader"],"drivers_zh":["央行2022年4月25日降准25基点","上海解封预期","绿色能源/电动车重估","成长领先价值16.2pp","计算机中场水平非领涨"],"title":"Reopening expectations + RRR cut: recovery","title_zh":"复工预期+降准：板块收复"},"2022-08-08":{"body":"From August to October 2022, the US Federal Reserve's aggressive tightening (75bps hike in July, another 75bps in September 2022) and the Taiwan Strait tensions following US House Speaker Pelosi's visit (August 2-3, 2022) triggered a broad risk-off selloff in China. SHCOMP fell -8.1%; Computers dropped -18.6%, ranking #29/31 as a growth laggard. Coal (+11.5%) and Real Estate (+2.3%) held, confirming value/defensive leadership (value led growth by 8.3pp). The selloff reversed the prior leg's recoveries in high-duration growth.","body_zh":"2022年8月至10月，美联储激进加息（7月加息75基点，9月再加75基点）及美国众议院议长佩洛西访台（8月2-3日）引发的台海紧张局势，触发中国市场普遍避险抛售。上证综指下跌-8.1%；计算机下跌-18.6%，排名第29/31，成长风格落后。煤炭（+11.5%）和房地产（+2.3%）抗跌，确认价值/防御领导（价值跑赢成长8.3pp）。本次下跌逆转了上一轮高久期成长股的修复。","drivers":["Fed 75bps hikes Jul+Sep 2022","Pelosi Taiwan visit Aug 2022 geopolitical risk","risk-off growth selloff","value beats growth 8.3pp","Computers ranked near last"],"drivers_zh":["美联储7月+9月各加息75基点","佩洛西2022年8月访台地缘风险","风险规避成长抛售","价值跑赢成长8.3pp","计算机排名接近垫底"],"title":"Fed aggressive tightening + Taiwan tensions","title_zh":"美联储激进加息+台海紧张局势"},"2022-10-10":{"body":"Three catalysts converged from October 2022: (1) China's COVID reopening announced in November-December 2022 after the 20th Party Congress; (2) the launch of ChatGPT on November 30, 2022 igniting global and Chinese AI enthusiasm, with Baidu announcing its ERNIE chatbot rival in February 2023; (3) Beijing signalling an end to the tech platform crackdown. Computers surged +69.3%, ranking #1/31, as SHCOMP gained +11.9%, with growth beating value by 28.1pp. The AI narrative replaced COVID reopening as the dominant driver by Q1 2023.","body_zh":"2022年10月起三重催化剂叠加：（1）二十大后2022年11月至12月中国宣布新冠放开；（2）2022年11月30日ChatGPT上线，点燃全球和中国AI热情，百度于2023年2月宣布推出文心一言；（3）北京释放科技平台整改结束信号。计算机大涨+69.3%，排名第1/31，上证综指+11.9%，成长跑赢价值28.1pp。进入2023年一季度，AI叙事超越新冠放开成为主导驱动力。","drivers":["COVID reopening Nov-Dec 2022","ChatGPT launch Nov 30 2022","Baidu ERNIE AI competitor Feb 2023","tech platform crackdown ended","growth beats value 28.1pp"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11-12月新冠放开","ChatGPT 2022年11月30日发布","百度文心一言2023年2月发布","科技平台整改结束","成长跑赢价值28.1pp"],"title":"ChatGPT + COVID reopening: AI mega-rally","title_zh":"ChatGPT+新冠放开：AI超级行情"},"2023-04-07":{"body":"After the AI-driven rally peaked in April 2023, a brutal 10-month selloff followed. AI regulation uncertainty weighed (China's Interim Measures for Generative AI Services were issued July 2023); macro headwinds including a weak property sector and deflationary pressure dragged SHCOMP down -18.8%; and foreign capital outflows accelerated sharply. Computers dropped -48.3%, ranking dead last #31/31, as Banks (+0.5%) and Coal (+8.3%) held. Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 8.3pp and value beat growth by 17.5pp, with Computers continuing to be the maximum beta to SHCOMP drawdowns.","body_zh":"2023年4月AI驱动行情见顶后，惨烈的10个月下跌随之而来。生成式AI监管不确定性施压（2023年7月颁布《生成式人工智能服务管理暂行办法》）；房地产走弱与通缩压力拖累上证综指下跌-18.8%；外资持续净流出大幅加速。计算机下跌-48.3%，排名垫底第31/31，而银行（+0.5%）和煤炭（+8.3%）相对抗跌。防御股领先周期股8.3pp，价值跑赢成长17.5pp，计算机成为上证综指下跌时的最大贝塔承压板块。","drivers":["AI regulation uncertainty Jul 2023","property sector crisis/deflation","SHCOMP down -18.8%","foreign capital outflows","value beats growth 17.5pp"],"drivers_zh":["2023年7月生成式AI监管出台","房地产危机/通缩压力","上证综指-18.8%","外资持续净流出","价值跑赢成长17.5pp"],"title":"AI hype peak: deepest sector selloff","title_zh":"AI炒作见顶：最深板块回调"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"China's CSRC and 'National Team' funds (led by Central Huijin) pledged on February 4, 2024 to 'prevent abnormal market fluctuations' after SHCOMP hit a five-year low. The intervention catalysed a sharp relief rally supercharged by AI themes: Moonshot AI (Kimi) gained attention in early 2024, and the domestic LLM race intensified. Computers surged +41.3%, ranking #1/31, as SHCOMP gained +14.0%, with growth beating value by 17.8pp. Media and Telecoms also led, confirming AI/digital infrastructure as the primary narrative.","body_zh":"2024年2月4日证监会及'国家队'（以中央汇金为主）承诺'防范异常市场波动'，彼时上证综指已跌至五年低点。国家队入市救市叠加AI主题推动急剧反弹：Moonshot AI（Kimi）于2024年初在国内外获得广泛关注，国内大模型竞争持续升温。计算机大涨+41.3%，排名第1/31，上证综指+14.0%，成长跑赢价值17.8pp。传媒和通信同步领涨，确认AI/数字基础设施为主导叙事。","drivers":["CSRC/Central Huijin National Team rescue Feb 2024","Moonshot AI (Kimi) attention","domestic LLM race intensification","growth beats value 17.8pp","Computers rank #1/31"],"drivers_zh":["证监会/中央汇金2024年2月国家队救市","Moonshot AI（Kimi）获关注","国内大模型竞争升温","成长跑赢价值17.8pp","计算机排名第1/31"],"title":"National Team rescue + AI re-rating","title_zh":"国家队救市+AI重估"},"2024-03-20":{"body":"After the AI-fuelled rally stalled in March 2024, capital rotated toward yield-bearing defensive assets: Banks (+10.5%), Utilities (+0.6%), and Appliances (-3.9%) led while Computers dropped -31.3%, ranking last #31/31. SHCOMP fell -7.5%; defensives outperformed cyclicals by 6.6pp and value beat growth by 9.7pp. This rotation reflected institutional positioning into dividend/yield plays (the CSRC's April 2024 market reform promoted high-dividend strategies) as the AI premium compressed without new model launches to sustain valuation multiples.","body_zh":"2024年3月AI驱动行情停滞后，资金轮动至高股息防御资产：银行（+10.5%）、公用事业（+0.6%）和家电（-3.9%）领涨，而计算机下跌-31.3%，排名垫底第31/31。上证综指下跌-7.5%；防御股领先周期股6.6pp，价值跑赢成长9.7pp。这一轮动反映了机构向股息/高股息策略集中配置（证监会2024年4月市场改革推动高股息策略），在无新模型发布支撑估值倍数的情况下AI溢价持续收缩。","drivers":["AI rally stalls/premium compression","CSRC dividend strategy reform Apr 2024","Banks and Utilities yield rotation","value beats growth 9.7pp","Computers ranked last #31/31"],"drivers_zh":["AI行情停滞/溢价压缩","证监会2024年4月高股息改革","银行和公用事业股息轮动","价值跑赢成长9.7pp","计算机排名垫底第31/31"],"title":"AI rally fades: dividend yield rotation","title_zh":"AI行情消退：红利股轮动"},"2024-08-27":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a comprehensive stimulus package -- 50bps RRR cut, 20bps lending rate cut, mortgage rate reduction, and 500 billion yuan equity swap facility -- followed by an emergency Politburo meeting on September 26 signalling the most forceful economic support since 2015. SHCOMP gained +21.8%; Computers surged +81.6%, ranking #1/31, as growth beat value by 28.5pp. The sharp post-October disappointment (NDRC October 8 press conference lacked fiscal detail) did not reverse Computers' leadership within this leg.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子刺激政策——降准50基点、下调贷款利率20基点、下调房贷利率及创设5000亿元股票互换便利——随后9月26日政治局召开特别会议，释放2015年以来最强经济支持信号。上证综指+21.8%；计算机大涨+81.6%，排名第1/31，成长跑赢价值28.5pp。10月8日发改委新闻发布会财政细节令市场失望，但并未逆转本轮计算机的领涨地位。","drivers":["PBOC 50bps RRR cut Sep 24 2024","Politburo emergency meeting Sep 26 2024","500bn yuan equity swap facility","growth beats value 28.5pp","Computers rank #1/31"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日降准50基点","政治局2024年9月26日特别会议","5000亿元股票互换便利","成长跑赢价值28.5pp","计算机排名第1/31"],"title":"Politburo bazooka: Computers leads explosive rally","title_zh":"政治局一揽子刺激：计算机领涨爆发行情"},"2024-11-11":{"body":"From November 2024 to early January 2025, the post-stimulus glow faded as the NDRC's October 8 press conference underwhelmed on fiscal detail, and Trump's November 2024 election victory raised fresh tariff escalation fears. SHCOMP fell -7.6%; Computers dropped -22.2%, ranking last #31/31, while Banks (+4.6%) and Conglomerates (-0.2%) held. Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 4.1pp and value beat growth by 7.6pp, as the market repriced the tariff and demand risk premium for Chinese tech.","body_zh":"2024年11月至2025年1月初，发改委10月8日新闻发布会财政细节令市场失望，加之特朗普2024年11月赢得大选再度引发关税升级恐慌，刺激政策红利消退。上证综指-7.6%；计算机下跌-22.2%，排名垫底第31/31，而银行（+4.6%）和综合企业（-0.2%）相对抗跌。防御股领先周期股4.1pp，价值跑赢成长7.6pp，市场重新对中国科技的关税及需求风险溢价进行定价。","drivers":["NDRC press conference disappointment Oct 2024","Trump election tariff fears Nov 2024","post-stimulus reality check","value beats growth 7.6pp","Computers ranked last #31/31"],"drivers_zh":["发改委2024年10月新闻发布会令市场失望","特朗普2024年11月大选引发关税恐慌","刺激政策落地现实修正","价值跑赢成长7.6pp","计算机排名垫底第31/31"],"title":"Post-stimulus fade: Trump tariff fears","title_zh":"刺激退潮：特朗普关税恐慌"},"2025-01-06":{"body":"DeepSeek's R1 reasoning model, launched January 20, 2025, triggered a global AI re-rating: its ultra-low development cost (~$6 million) and open-source design challenged the CapEx-heavy Western AI paradigm and positioned China as a credible AI leader. A-share Computers surged +37.3%, ranking #1/31, as SHCOMP gained +5.4%, with growth outperforming value by 15.6pp. Media and Machinery also gained, but Computers' leadership was unmistakable, concentrated in domestic LLM/software/AI infrastructure plays benefiting from China's AI moment.","body_zh":"DeepSeek于2025年1月20日发布R1推理模型，引发全球AI重估：其极低的研发成本（约600万美元）和开源设计颠覆了西方重资本AI范式，令中国跻身可信AI强国之列。A股计算机大涨+37.3%，排名第1/31，上证综指+5.4%，成长跑赢价值15.6pp。传媒和机械同步上涨，但计算机领涨地位毋庸置疑，此轮行情集中于受益于中国AI时刻的国内大模型/软件/AI基础设施个股。","drivers":["DeepSeek R1 launch Jan 20 2025","domestic LLM/AI infrastructure theme","China AI global credibility re-rating","growth beats value 15.6pp","Computers rank #1/31"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek R1 2025年1月20日发布","国内大模型/AI基础设施主题","中国AI全球公信力重估","成长跑赢价值15.6pp","计算机排名第1/31"],"title":"DeepSeek shock: Computers leads AI re-rating","title_zh":"DeepSeek冲击：计算机领涨AI重估"},"2025-02-21":{"body":"From late February 2025, Trump's tariff escalation accelerated: 'Liberation Day' (April 2, 2025) imposed a 54% baseline tariff on China (later raised to 245%), triggering the 2025 global market crash. SHCOMP fell -8.4%; Computers plunged -25.0%, ranking last #31/31, as Agriculture (+1.9%), Food (+0.3%), and Banks (-1.9%) held. Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 5.3pp and value beat growth by 11.7pp. Electronics (-21.0%) and Telecoms (-24.3%) also dropped sharply, but Computers bore the largest loss in the window.","body_zh":"2025年2月下旬起特朗普关税升级提速：'解放日'（2025年4月2日）对中国征收54%基准关税（后升至245%），引发2025年全球市场崩盘。上证综指-8.4%；计算机暴跌-25.0%，排名垫底第31/31，而农业（+1.9%）、食品（+0.3%）和银行（-1.9%）相对抗跌。防御股领先周期股5.3pp，价值跑赢成长11.7pp。电子（-21.0%）和通信（-24.3%）同步大跌，但计算机在本窗口内跌幅最深。","drivers":["Liberation Day tariffs 54%+ on China Apr 2 2025","2025 global market crash","tech supply chain tariff risk","defensives outperform cyclicals","Computers ranked last #31/31"],"drivers_zh":["解放日2025年4月2日对华关税54%+","2025年全球市场崩盘","科技产业链关税风险","防御股跑赢周期股","计算机排名垫底第31/31"],"title":"Liberation Day tariffs: tech hardest hit","title_zh":"解放日关税：科技股遭最重打击"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"The US-China 90-day tariff truce announced in May 2025 (reducing reciprocal tariffs from ~125% to 10%), combined with PBOC easing and fiscal stimulus, triggered one of the largest SHCOMP rallies on record (+33.2% through January 2026). Telecoms (+121.9%), Metals (+117.7%), and Conglomerates (+95.7%) led massively, reflecting a commodity/infrastructure/hard-asset rotation. Computers gained +50.7%, ranking #9/31 -- solid mid-field. Cyclicals led defensives by 28.5pp and growth beat value by 40.2pp, but within the growth rally Computers was not the leader -- Telecoms and hard-asset infrastructure played that role.","body_zh":"2025年5月宣布中美90天关税休战（对等关税从约125%降至10%），叠加央行宽松与财政刺激，触发有记录以来最大幅度的上证综指行情之一（至2026年1月+33.2%）。通信（+121.9%）、金属（+117.7%）和综合企业（+95.7%）强势领涨，反映大宗商品/基础设施/实物资产轮动。计算机+50.7%，排名第9/31——表现稳健但居于中场。周期股领先防御股28.5pp，成长跑赢价值40.2pp，但在成长行情内部计算机并非领涨——通信和实物基础设施才是主角。","drivers":["US-China 90-day tariff truce May 2025","PBOC easing + fiscal stimulus","commodity/Telecoms/Metals rotation","SHCOMP +33.2% mega rally","Computers mid-field not leader"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月中美90天关税休战","央行宽松+财政刺激","大宗商品/通信/金属轮动","上证综指+33.2%强势行情","计算机中场水平非领涨"],"title":"Trade truce + mega risk-on: Telecoms/Metals lead","title_zh":"贸易战休战+超级风险偏好：通信/金属领涨"},"2026-01-14":{"body":"From January 2026, a global re-appraisal of AI's impact on software pricing power triggered the 'SaaSpocalypse': fears that AI agents will commoditise SaaS subscription revenue hit pure-play software sectors globally. Chinese A-share Computers dropped -28.6%, ranking #29/31, even as Telecoms (+51.5%) and Electronics (+34.0%) surged -- within the IT complex, hardware/infrastructure outperformed software sharply. SHCOMP fell only -3.4% and cyclicals fared better than defensives, indicating this was a sector-specific software-vs-hardware rotation within an otherwise neutral macro tape.","body_zh":"2026年1月起，全球市场对AI冲击软件定价权的重新评估引发'SaaS末日'行情：市场担忧AI智能体将大规模压缩SaaS订阅收入，全球纯软件板块遭到猛烈抛售。中国A股计算机下跌-28.6%，排名第29/31，但同期通信（+51.5%）和电子（+34.0%）强势上涨——在IT细分领域内，硬件/基础设施大幅跑赢软件。上证综指仅-3.4%，周期股好于防御股，说明这是一轮整体宏观环境中性背景下的软件vs硬件内部分化轮动。","drivers":["2026 global SaaSpocalypse AI disruption","software pricing power fears","Telecoms/Electronics surge while Computers drops","hardware-over-software rotation","sector-specific not macro risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["2026年全球SaaS末日AI颠覆","软件定价权恐慌","通信/电子强势而计算机大跌","硬件跑赢软件轮动","板块特定分化非宏观系统性风险"],"title":"2026 SaaSpocalypse: AI disrupts software","title_zh":"2026年SaaS末日：AI颠覆软件板块"}},"now":"Computers is in a confirmed Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 19th of 31 Shenwan industries with a -14.1% return in the current window, lagging well behind Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Building Materials (+48.1%). The broader tape is unambiguously risk-on and growth-tilted (growth leads value by 18.2pp, cyclicals +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%, SHCOMP +1.6%), yet Computers is being left behind despite being the canonical growth/AI sector. This unusual divergence reflects the global 2026 SaaSpocalypse: AI is disrupting software pricing power, rotating institutional money from pure-play IT software names into hardware-infrastructure plays (Telecoms equipment, Electronics/chips). The sector sits at the 2.2nd percentile of its own historical range -- historically a strong mean-reversion setup -- but the leadership rotation back into Computers requires the AI-disruption-of-software narrative to peak first.","now_zh":"计算机板块截至2026年6月底处于明确的底部/筑底阶段，在申万31个行业中排名第19，当前窗口回报为-14.1%，显著落后于电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）和建材（+48.1%）。整体市场毫无疑问偏向风险偏好/成长风格（成长跑赢价值18.2pp，周期股+0.3% vs 防御股-12.1%，上证综指+1.6%），但计算机作为典型成长/AI板块却落后。这一异常背离反映的是2026年全球\"SaaS末日\"效应——AI正在颠覆软件的定价权，机构资金从纯IT软件个股轮动至硬件基础设施（通信设备、电子/芯片）。板块历史分位仅2.2%，历史上属于强均值回归区间，但领涨主线重返计算机需等待AI冲击软件的叙事见顶。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801760":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The 2014-2015 A-share bull market was fueled by PBOC monetary easing (RRR and benchmark rate cuts beginning November 2014), the Shanghai-Hong Kong Stock Connect launch (November 2014), and the State Council Internet Plus action plan (formally announced in the Government Work Report, March 2015). Media - covering online video, digital advertising, games, and film - was a direct policy beneficiary of Beijing's push to grow domestic digital content industries. With SHCOMP surging +132% and cyclicals outpacing defensives by 73pp, Media's +166% was mid-table performance (rank 14/28), meaning the gain was largely broad beta rather than sector-specific outperformance.","body_zh":"2014-2015年A股牛市由多重因素驱动：央行货币宽松（2014年11月至2015年3月两次降准、两次降息）、沪港通开通（2014年11月带来增量资金），以及国务院正式颁布《互联网+行动计划》（2015年3月政府工作报告）。传媒板块——涵盖在线视频、数字广告、游戏及影视——是北京扶持国内数字内容产业政策的直接受益者。上证综指大涨132%，周期股跑赢防御股73个百分点，传媒+166%但排名仅第14/28，说明涨幅主要来自市场整体贝塔，并非板块独立超额收益。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts Nov-2014","Stock Connect inflows","Internet Plus policy","margin-debt leverage","broad A-share beta"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准降息2014年11月","沪港通资金流入","互联网+政策催化","融资杠杆扩张","A股整体贝塔"],"title":"Internet Plus liquidity mega-bull","title_zh":"\"互联网+\"流动性超级牛市"},"2015-06-03":{"body":"On June 12, 2015 Chinese regulators announced draft rules curbing shadow-financed margin accounts, triggering a forced deleveraging spiral that wiped over 30% of A-share values in three weeks. Media fell -42.6%, ranking 21st of 28 as defensives (Banks -4.1%) massively outperformed cyclicals (-39.8%) in a classic flight-to-safety rotation. As a high-multiple, high-leverage growth sector, Media was particularly exposed to margin calls: growth lagged value by 8.4pp, consistent with violent de-risking rather than any Media-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，监管机构出台草案限制场外配资保证金账户，引发强制去杠杆螺旋，三周内A股市值蒸发逾30%。传媒下跌42.6%，排名第21/28——银行（-4.1%）远远跑赢周期股（-39.8%），呈现典型的避险轮动。作为高估值、高融资杠杆的成长板块，传媒对保证金追缴尤为脆弱：成长跑输价值8.4个百分点，与去风险行情完全吻合，并非传媒基本面恶化所致。","drivers":["margin-call forced selling","shadow-margin regulation","growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP -28.6%","liquidity shock"],"drivers_zh":["保证金追缴强制平仓","场外配资监管收紧","成长转价值轮动","上证综指-28.6%","流动性冲击"],"title":"Margin unwind crashes growth stocks","title_zh":"杠杆崩盘，成长股遭强制平仓"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"Beijing launched an unprecedented market stabilization package in early July 2015: the CSRC suspended IPOs, securities firms committed RMB 120bn to buy blue chips, and the PBOC provided emergency liquidity. SHCOMP bounced +17.6% in just two weeks as cyclicals led (+33.7%). Media rebounded +24.8% (rank 20/28), but substantially lagged Coal (+101.5%) and Defense (+65.1%) that led the rescue-driven bounce - the gain was pure index beta from the government intervention, not Media fundamentals.","body_zh":"2015年7月初北京推出史无前例的市场稳定举措：证监会暂停IPO审批、券商承诺1200亿元买入蓝筹股、央行提供紧急流动性支持。上证综指两周内反弹17.6%，周期股领涨（+33.7%）。传媒反弹24.8%（排名第20/28），但远落后于煤炭（+101.5%）和国防（+65.1%）等政策救市受益板块——此次反弹为纯粹的政策干预贝塔行情，与传媒基本面无关。","drivers":["government market rescue","IPO suspension","securities-firm buying mandate","SHCOMP +17.6%","short-squeeze"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市","暂停IPO","券商强制增持","上证综指反弹","空头回补"],"title":"State rescue lifts all boats briefly","title_zh":"国家队入市，普涨救市行情"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"The market rescue proved temporary. The PBOC surprised markets with a CNY devaluation on August 11, 2015 (the largest single-day move in decades), amplifying capital outflow fears and triggering a second leg down, with SHCOMP falling -27.1% by mid-September. Media fell -33.0% (rank 20/28) as defensives led (-22.6% vs cyclicals -31.1%) - a broad risk-off move with value outperforming growth by 5.8pp. Media's loss was proportional to its high-beta growth positioning, exacerbated by fears that a weaker CNY would cut ad spending budgets.","body_zh":"救市效果昙花一现。2015年8月11日央行出其不意下调人民币汇率中间价（创数十年最大单日贬幅），加剧资本外流恐慌，引发第二波下跌，上证综指至9月中旬已跌27.1%。传媒下跌33.0%（排名第20/28），防御股跑赢周期股（-22.6% vs -31.1%），价值跑赢成长5.8个百分点，呈现全面风险规避行情。传媒的跌幅与其高贝塔、高成长定位相符，叠加人民币贬值将压缩广告预算的市场担忧。","drivers":["CNY devaluation Aug-2015","capital outflow fears","growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP -27.1%","ad-spend demand risk"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值2015年8月","资本外流恐慌","成长转价值","上证综指-27.1%","广告需求下行风险"],"title":"Second crash wave, CNY devaluation shock","title_zh":"第二波崩盘，人民币贬值冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"The PBOC cut the reserve requirement ratio on September 6, 2015 and benchmark rates on October 23, injecting liquidity and stabilizing confidence. With SHCOMP recovering +21.4%, the growth complex led the rebound: Computers gained +65% and Electronics +53.7%, with Media posting +48% (rank 5/28) - its first episode of genuine outperformance within a broader A-share rally. Growth beat defensives by 19pp, consistent with re-leveraging into high-beta names as systemic panic subsided.","body_zh":"央行于2015年9月6日降准、10月23日降息，注入流动性并稳定市场信心。上证综指反弹21.4%，成长板块领涨：计算机+65%、电子+53.7%，传媒+48%（排名第5/28），是该时期传媒难得的真实超额表现。成长跑赢防御19个百分点，与系统性恐慌消退后资金重新涌入高贝塔品种的逻辑吻合。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Sep-2015","PBOC rate cut Oct-2015","liquidity re-injection","growth-style rebound","SHCOMP +21.4%"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月降准","央行10月降息","流动性再注入","成长风格反弹","上证综指+21.4%"],"title":"PBOC eases, growth leads rebound","title_zh":"央行降准降息，成长股领涨反弹"},"2015-11-25":{"body":"China introduced an index circuit breaker on January 4, 2016, which was suspended days later after it accelerated panic selling (tripping the 7% limit twice in a week). Simultaneously CNY continued depreciating and foreign reserves fell by $108bn in December 2015 alone. SHCOMP fell -26.3%; Media dropped -36.1% (rank 26/28) as value (Banks -13.7%) massively beat growth (-28.6% cyclicals vs -23.1% defensives). Media's extreme underperformance reflects its position as the highest-multiple, most liquidity-sensitive sector in a de-risking tape.","body_zh":"中国于2016年1月4日实施指数熔断机制，但因其加剧恐慌（一周内两次触发7%下限）而于数日内叫停。与此同时人民币持续贬值，外汇储备仅2015年12月就流失1080亿美元。上证综指下跌26.3%；传媒跌幅36.1%（排名第26/28），价值大幅跑赢成长（银行-13.7%领先）。传媒极度跑输反映其高估值、高流动性敏感度在去风险行情中的脆弱性。","drivers":["circuit-breaker panic Jan-2016","CNY depreciation","FX reserve depletion","growth-to-value rotation","multiple compression"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月熔断恐慌","人民币贬值","外汇储备耗损","成长转价值","估值压缩"],"title":"Circuit-breaker crash, yuan outflows","title_zh":"熔断机制引爆，人民币持续贬值外流"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"The PBOC cut RRR by 50bp effective March 1, 2016 and circuit breakers were suspended, allowing a relief rally with SHCOMP gaining +14.7%. Cyclicals led (18.8% vs defensives 14.7%) with only a modest growth tilt (+2.7pp). Media gained +21.1% (rank 11/28), performing broadly in line with the index - no sector-specific catalyst, just index beta as systemic panic faded and value-cyclical leaders (Power Equipment +24.9%, Machinery +23.2%) drove the bounce.","body_zh":"央行于2016年3月1日降准50个基点并暂停熔断机制，触发SHCOMP+14.7%的修复行情。周期股领涨（+18.8% vs 防御+14.7%），成长风格优势轻微（+2.7pp）。传媒+21.1%（排名第11/28），与指数基本同步——无板块独立催化剂，纯属系统性恐慌消退后的指数贝塔修复，以电力设备（+24.9%）和机械（+23.2%）等价值周期为领头羊。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Mar-2016","circuit-breaker suspension","systemic panic fade","index beta","cyclicals rebound"],"drivers_zh":["央行3月降准","熔断机制暂停","系统性恐慌消退","指数贝塔","周期股反弹"],"title":"PBOC stabilizes, modest bounce","title_zh":"降准维稳，指数贝塔反弹"},"2016-04-14":{"body":"The April 2016 to October 2018 bear was one of the worst on record for Media, declining -63.4% (rank last, 28/28). Three forces drove it: (1) the CSRC's market deleveraging campaign from 2016, increasing supervision of structured products and shadow lending; (2) Beijing's intensifying content regulation - Xi Jinping's February 2016 declaration that state media must safeguard party authority, SAPPRFT tightening online video licensing, and caps on IP/drama production valuations that crushed content-producer earnings; (3) US-China trade war escalation from March 2018 that rotated institutional flows into value (Food & Bev +47.5%, Banks +3.2%). SHCOMP fell only -19.3% while defensives stayed nearly flat (-2.7%), confirming this was a structural de-rating of the growth/media complex.","body_zh":"2016年4月至2018年10月，传媒累跌63.4%（排名垫底，第28/28），是板块历史上最惨烈的熊市之一。三大力量叠加：①证监会去杠杆运动（2016-2017年加强对结构化产品和场外配资的监管）；②北京加码内容监管——2016年2月习近平宣布党媒须\"维护党的权威\"，广电总局收紧在线视频牌照，并对IP/影视剧制作成本实施上限管控，打压内容制作公司盈利；③2018年3月起的中美贸易战令机构资金大规模转向价值股（食品饮料+47.5%、银行+3.2%）。同期上证综指仅跌19.3%，防御板块近乎平盘（-2.7%），证实这是成长/传媒的结构性重估。","drivers":["CSRC deleveraging campaign 2016-17","content regulation tightening","IP valuation caps","US-China trade war 2018","growth-to-value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["证监会去杠杆运动2016-17","内容监管收紧","IP定价上限","中美贸易战2018","成长转价值"],"title":"2.5yr bear: regulation and deleveraging","title_zh":"两年半熊市：监管收紧+去杠杆"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"The Oct-2018 trough coincided with PBOC executing a broad easing cycle: 100bp RRR cut effective October 15, 2018. The US-China trade war entered a de-escalation window after G20 in December 2018 (90-day tariff truce agreed). SHCOMP surged +23.1%, with a strong growth tilt (growth beat defensives by 27.9pp): Computers +62.3%, Agriculture +76%. Media gained +44.4% (rank 7/28), recovering some of its extreme underperformance as liquidity re-entered the tech/growth complex and valuations bounced from deeply depressed levels.","body_zh":"2018年10月低点与央行宽松周期启动同步：2018年10月15日降准100个基点。2018年12月G20后中美贸易战进入降温窗口（90天关税暂停）。上证综指大涨23.1%，成长风格显著占优（成长跑赢防御27.9pp）：计算机+62.3%、农业+76%。传媒+44.4%（排名第7/28），从极度超跌的估值区间修复，流动性重新涌入科技/成长板块。","drivers":["PBOC 100bp RRR cut Oct-2018","G20 US-China tariff truce","growth re-rating","valuation mean-reversion","SHCOMP +23.1%"],"drivers_zh":["央行10月降准100bp","G20中美关税暂停","成长股重估","估值均值回归","上证综指+23.1%"],"title":"Trade-war ceasefire and PBOC easing rally","title_zh":"贸易战停火+降准，成长修复"},"2019-03-12":{"body":"The US raised tariffs on $200bn of Chinese goods to 25% on May 10, 2019, triggering a sharp risk-off reversal after the Q1-2019 rally ran out of steam. SHCOMP fell -9.5%; defensives led with Food & Bev gaining +19.6% while cyclicals dropped -12.6%. Media fell -29.2% (rank dead last, 28/28), reflecting its dual vulnerability: it is a high-multiple growth sector most exposed in value rotations, and it remained under regulatory pressure from the 2017-2018 content licensing tightening. Growth lagged value by 8.9pp, confirming the risk-off driver.","body_zh":"2019年5月10日美国将对2000亿美元中国商品征收的关税提高至25%，令2019年一季度的反弹行情戛然而止。上证综指下跌9.5%；食品饮料+19.6%，防御板块领先，周期股跌12.6%。传媒下跌29.2%（排名垫底，第28/28），体现双重脆弱性：高估值成长板块在价值轮动中跌最惨，且仍受2017-2018年内容牌照收紧的监管压力。成长跑输价值8.9个百分点，证实这是风险规避驱动的行情。","drivers":["US tariffs 25% May-2019","trade-war escalation","growth-to-value rotation","content regulation overhang","SHCOMP -9.5%"],"drivers_zh":["美国2019年5月加征25%关税","贸易战再度升级","成长转价值","内容监管压力","上证综指-9.5%"],"title":"Trade-war escalation, growth hits wall","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级，成长股遭遇天花板"},"2019-08-07":{"body":"A Phase One trade deal framework emerged in October 2019 (signed January 2020), and the PBOC cut the 1-year Loan Prime Rate (LPR) in September 2019. With trade tensions easing, growth-style leadership resumed sharply: growth beat defensives by 35.7pp, Electronics gained +89.8% and Computers +60%, while Media surged +41.6% to rank 3rd of 28. The 2018-2019 content regulatory freeze also began to thaw and streaming platforms reported improving subscription revenues, making the rebound more than pure beta.","body_zh":"2019年10月中美贸易摩擦框架协议浮现（2020年1月正式签署），央行于2019年9月下调1年期LPR。贸易紧张局势缓和后，成长风格强势回归，成长跑赢防御35.7个百分点，电子+89.8%、计算机+60%；传媒飙升41.6%（排名第3/28）。2018-2019年内容监管冻结开始解冻，流媒体平台订阅收入改善，此次反弹不仅是纯粹的贝塔修复。","drivers":["Phase One trade deal Oct-2019","PBOC LPR cut Sep-2019","growth-style leadership","streaming revenue recovery","content regulation thaw"],"drivers_zh":["中美第一阶段协议2019年10月","央行9月降LPR","成长风格领涨","流媒体订阅改善","内容监管解冻"],"title":"Trade-war truce boosts online content","title_zh":"贸易战停火+LPR降息，在线内容迎来春天"},"2020-02-24":{"body":"After the initial COVID-19 outbreak in Wuhan (January 2020), a brief rally in domestic streaming names collapsed as global risk-off sentiment overwhelmed any stay-at-home narrative. Media fell -18.8% (rank 26/28) while Agriculture +5.1% and Coal flat topped the leaderboard - defensives (-4.8%) massively outperformed cyclicals (-8.2%). The value-over-growth rotation of 10.7pp confirms this was a broad flight-to-safety: advertiser spending fears and global contagion risk drove the selloff, not any Media-specific development.","body_zh":"武汉新冠疫情暴发（2020年1月）后，宅经济/流媒体的短暂走强迅速被全球避险情绪淹没。传媒下跌18.8%（排名第26/28），农业（+5.1%）和煤炭（持平）领涨，防御股（-4.8%）大幅跑赢周期股（-8.2%）。价值跑赢成长10.7个百分点，证实这是全面的避险行情而非传媒板块独立故事：广告主削减预算的担忧和全球蔓延风险是主因。","drivers":["COVID-19 outbreak Jan-2020","global risk-off","flight to safety","ad-spend demand shock","growth-to-value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["新冠疫情武汉暴发2020年1月","全球避险情绪","资金出逃至安全资产","广告需求冲击","成长转价值"],"title":"COVID global shock hits ad spending","title_zh":"新冠全球冲击，广告支出遭重创"},"2020-04-01":{"body":"China emerged from lockdown in Q1 2020 ahead of the rest of the world. The PBOC cut the 7-day reverse repo rate to 2.20% (February 2020) and LPR to 3.85% (April 2020). COVID-19 lockdowns dramatically accelerated digital media consumption: surveys showed 67% of Chinese internet users increased TV viewing and 56% increased on-demand video usage. Media jumped +47.8% (rank 4/28) with Services leading at +96.8% and Food & Bev at +54.6% - broadly a domestic-recovery/consumption theme supported by SHCOMP +24.9%.","body_zh":"中国于2020年一季度率先解封，走在全球前列。央行将7天逆回购利率降至2.20%（2020年2月），并于4月将LPR降至3.85%。新冠封控期间数字媒体消费急速提升：调查数据显示67%的中国网民增加了电视收看，56%增加了点播视频使用。传媒+47.8%（排名第4/28），服务业（+96.8%）和食品饮料（+54.6%）领衔，整体呈现宅经济/内需复苏主题，上证综指同期+24.9%。","drivers":["COVID stay-at-home demand","PBOC LPR cut Apr-2020","streaming/digital media surge","China reopening first-mover","SHCOMP +24.9%"],"drivers_zh":["新冠宅经济需求爆发","央行4月降LPR","流媒体/数字内容急涨","中国率先解封优势","上证综指+24.9%"],"title":"Stay-at-home boom and PBOC stimulus","title_zh":"居家经济爆发+央行刺激，传媒追涨"},"2020-07-14":{"body":"From mid-2020 Beijing launched a sweeping tech/content regulatory campaign: in August 2021 state media called online games 'opium for the mind', triggering a 10% single-day drop in Tencent and an $80bn wipeout in gaming stocks; SAPPRFT froze game license approvals through most of 2021; CSRC restricted entertainment-sector M&A. Meanwhile SHCOMP was nearly flat (+1.5%) but institutional capital rotated sharply into Power Equipment (+97.6%), Metals (+62%), and green energy themes. Media fell -37.1% (rank last, 28/28) - the worst sector by a large margin - confirming a regulatory de-rating amplified by a growth-to-value style rotation.","body_zh":"2020年7月起北京对科技/内容行业展开全面整治：2021年8月官方媒体将网络游戏定性为\"精神鸦片\"，单日重挫腾讯10%，游戏股市值蒸发800亿美元；广电总局暂停游戏版号审批长达近一年；证监会限制娱乐行业并购。上证综指同期近乎平盘（+1.5%），但机构资金大规模轮动至电力设备（+97.6%）、有色金属（+62%）等绿色能源赛道。传媒下跌37.1%（排名垫底，第28/28），远超其他落后板块，证实这是监管重估与价值风格切换的双重打压。","drivers":["gaming 'opium' crackdown Aug-2021","game license freeze","entertainment M&A restrictions","green energy sector rotation","regulatory de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["游戏\"精神鸦片\"整治2021年8月","游戏版号暂停发放","娱乐行业并购限制","绿色能源板块轮动","监管性估值重置"],"title":"Gaming crackdown, capital rotates to green energy","title_zh":"游戏监管重拳+资金轮向绿色能源"},"2021-08-05":{"body":"By August 2021 the worst of the regulatory crackdown had been priced in. Metaverse/VR investment enthusiasm (Tencent metaverse announcements, iQIYI VR pivot) drove a re-rating of the sector. Game license approvals eventually resumed in April 2022. Media gained +30.1% in just five months (rank #1 of 31 sectors), outperforming all Shenwan peers while the SHCOMP only added +3.7%. Defensives led at +6.9% vs cyclicals +2.2%, suggesting this was not a broad risk-on rally but a genuine Media-specific re-rating driven by regulatory relief expectations and metaverse thematic demand.","body_zh":"至2021年8月，监管最严厉的阶段已被充分定价。元宇宙/VR投资热情升温（腾讯宣布元宇宙布局、爱奇艺VR转型）推动板块重估，游戏版号审批最终于2022年4月恢复。传媒在短短5个月内涨幅30.1%（排名第1/31），全面跑赢申万所有同类，而上证综指同期仅涨3.7%。防御板块（+6.9%）跑赢周期（+2.2%），说明这并非普涨的风险偏好行情，而是由监管预期改善和元宇宙主题需求驱动的传媒独立修复。","drivers":["metaverse/VR thematic demand","regulatory relief pricing","game license resumption expectation","sector mean-reversion","independent sector re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["元宇宙/VR主题需求","监管压力缓和预期","游戏版号恢复预期","板块均值回归","传媒独立行情"],"title":"Regulatory relief and metaverse hype","title_zh":"监管利空出尽+元宇宙概念炒作，传媒独立行情"},"2022-01-05":{"body":"A triple shock hit in Q1-Q2 2022: (1) China's Zero-COVID lockdowns (Shanghai locked down April-May 2022) crushed consumer spending and ad revenues; (2) Russia's invasion of Ukraine (February 2022) triggered global risk-off, rotating Chinese institutional money into Coal (+7.3%) and Banks (-5.7%); (3) the US SEC threatened to delist Chinese tech ADRs (enforcement notices March 2022). SHCOMP fell -19.7%; Media declined -37.8% (rank 29/31), with growth lagging value by 16.4pp - the sector's high multiples made it the most vulnerable in the value-defensive rotation.","body_zh":"2022年一二季度承受三重冲击：①清零封控（上海4-5月锁城）重创消费支出和广告收入；②俄罗斯入侵乌克兰（2022年2月）触发全球避险，国内机构资金涌入煤炭（+7.3%）和银行（-5.7%）；③美国SEC加强对中概股ADR的退市审查（执法通知2022年3月）。上证综指跌19.7%；传媒下跌37.8%（排名第29/31），成长跑输价值16.4个百分点，高估值令传媒成为价值防御轮动中最脆弱的板块。","drivers":["Zero-COVID Shanghai lockdowns Apr-2022","Russia-Ukraine war Feb-2022","ADR delisting threat Mar-2022","growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP -19.7%"],"drivers_zh":["清零上海封控2022年4月","俄乌战争2022年2月","中概股ADR退市威胁","成长转价值轮动","上证综指-19.7%"],"title":"Zero-COVID lockdowns crush ad revenues","title_zh":"清零封控+乌克兰战争+ADR退市威胁三重打击"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Shanghai began reopening in June 2022 as Zero-COVID restrictions eased. The PBOC cut the 5-year LPR by 15bp (May 2022) and the NDRC announced infrastructure stimulus. Cyclicals surged with Power Equipment +57.6% and Autos +56.1%, while SHCOMP gained +18.1%. Media gained +20.1% (rank 14/31) - in line with the index, no sector-specific outperformance. EV and defense themes dominated leadership; Media's recovery was driven by growth-style beta (+8.7pp) rather than any specific media catalyst.","body_zh":"上海于2022年6月逐步解封，清零管控趋于松动。央行5月下调5年期LPR 15个基点，国家发改委宣布基础设施刺激计划。周期板块大涨，电力设备+57.6%、汽车+56.1%，上证综指+18.1%。传媒+20.1%（排名第14/31），与指数基本同步，无板块独立超额表现。行情由新能源车和国防主题主导，传媒涨幅来自成长风格贝塔（+8.7pp）。","drivers":["Shanghai reopening Jun-2022","PBOC 5yr LPR cut May-2022","NDRC infrastructure stimulus","EV/defense thematic leadership","cyclicals beta"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封2022年6月","央行5年LPR降息2022年5月","国家发改委基建刺激","新能源车/国防主题领涨","周期贝塔行情"],"title":"COVID easing and EV/defense rally","title_zh":"疫情管控松动+LPR降息，周期股领跑"},"2022-06-28":{"body":"Ahead of the 20th Party Congress (October 2022), political uncertainty and aggressive Fed rate hikes (75bp each in June, July, and September 2022) weighed on growth assets globally. SHCOMP fell -14.5% with defensives (-16.5%) and cyclicals (-16.0%) losing roughly equally - a broad macro-driven decline. Media fell -19.9% (rank 24/31), modestly lagging; growth actually led value slightly (+5.2pp), confirming that this selloff was driven by macro/political risk rather than style rotation. Defense (-1.7%) and Telecoms (-3.8%) proved most resilient given their state-enterprise nature.","body_zh":"2022年10月二十大召开前，政治不确定性与美联储激进加息（6月、7月、9月各加75bp）共同压制全球成长资产。上证综指下跌14.5%，防御（-16.5%）与周期（-16.0%）跌幅相近，呈现宏观驱动的普跌格局。传媒下跌19.9%（排名第24/31），成长微幅跑赢价值（+5.2pp），说明本次下跌由宏观/政治风险主导而非风格切换。军工（-1.7%）和通信（-3.8%）因国企属性相对抗跌。","drivers":["20th Party Congress uncertainty","Fed rate hikes 75bp x3","global growth asset selloff","political risk premium","SHCOMP -14.5%"],"drivers_zh":["二十大政治不确定性","美联储三次加息75bp","全球成长资产抛售","政治风险溢价","上证综指-14.5%"],"title":"20th Party Congress uncertainty weighs","title_zh":"二十大政治不确定性+美联储激进加息压制"},"2022-10-28":{"body":"OpenAI launched ChatGPT on November 30, 2022 - just weeks after China's SHCOMP bottomed. The technology set off a massive AIGC (AI-generated content) investment theme across Chinese A-shares: text-to-image, AI writing tools, virtual idols, and LLM applications all reside in the Shenwan Media sector. Baidu announced 'Ernie Bot' in February 2023; dozens of A-share media companies surged 100-300%. Media gained +91.8% (rank #1 of 31 sectors) against SHCOMP +11.1%, with growth beating defensives by 29pp - the purest, most extreme AI-theme-driven Media outperformance in the dataset.","body_zh":"OpenAI于2022年11月30日推出ChatGPT，距上证综指触底仅数周。这项技术在A股掀起AIGC（AI生成内容）投资热潮：文生图、AI写作工具、虚拟偶像和大语言模型应用均归属申万传媒板块。百度于2023年2月宣布推出\"文心一言\"；数十家A股传媒公司股价上涨100%-300%。传媒+91.8%（排名第1/31），远超上证综指+11.1%，成长跑赢防御29个百分点——这是数据集中最纯粹、最极端的AI主题驱动传媒超额行情。","drivers":["ChatGPT launch Nov-2022","AIGC investment theme","Baidu Ernie Bot Feb-2023","A-share AI speculation","growth style dominance"],"drivers_zh":["ChatGPT发布2022年11月","AIGC投资主题爆发","百度文心一言2023年2月","A股AI概念炒作","成长风格主导"],"title":"ChatGPT/AIGC sparks 92% Media mega-rally","title_zh":"ChatGPT/AIGC引爆92%超级行情"},"2023-06-20":{"body":"After the AIGC frenzy peaked in June 2023, multiple headwinds converged: China's post-COVID recovery disappointed with July 2023 CPI turning deflationary (-0.3% YoY), the property sector crisis deepened (Evergrande and Country Garden facing defaults), and the CSRC issued warnings about AI stock speculation. Media fell -34.1% (rank dead last, 31/31) while Coal +3.4% and Brokers -0.3% topped the leaderboard. Value beat growth by 15.5pp, a complete reversal of the AIGC tape.","body_zh":"2023年6月AIGC炒作热潮达到顶点后，多重利空接踵而至：中国后疫情经济复苏令人失望，2023年7月CPI转负（同比-0.3%）；房地产危机加深（恒大、碧桂园相继陷入违约困境）；证监会发出AI炒作风险提示。传媒下跌34.1%（排名垫底，第31/31），而煤炭（+3.4%）和券商（-0.3%）领先大盘。价值跑赢成长15.5个百分点，AIGC行情彻底逆转。","drivers":["AIGC hype exhaustion","China deflation CPI -0.3% Jul-2023","property sector crisis","CSRC AI stock warnings","growth-to-value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["AIGC炒作耗尽","中国通缩CPI-0.3%2023年7月","房地产危机深化","证监会AI炒作警示","成长转价值"],"title":"AI euphoria fades, deflation fears return","title_zh":"AI热情退潮+通缩预期升温，传媒领跌"},"2023-10-23":{"body":"Huawei's surprise launch of the Mate 60 Pro (August 2023), powered by a domestically produced 7nm chip, supercharged domestic tech optimism. Coupled with the PBOC's 25bp RRR cut (September 2023) and the announcement of RMB 1 trillion special sovereign bonds (October 2023), a tech-and-AI rebound ensued. Media surged +24.7% (rank #1 of 31) against SHCOMP +2.2%, with growth beating defensives by 6.5pp - the AI content theme reignited as investors anticipated new AIGC model launches.","body_zh":"华为Mate 60 Pro（搭载国产7纳米芯片）于2023年8月突然发布，极大提振国内科技自信。叠加央行9月降准25bp和10月财政部宣布增发1万亿元特别国债的刺激举措，科技AI板块迎来强势反弹。传媒+24.7%（排名第1/31），远超上证综指+2.2%，成长跑赢防御6.5个百分点——AI内容主题再度点燃，市场预期新一轮AIGC模型密集推出。","drivers":["Huawei Mate 60 Pro Aug-2023","PBOC RRR cut Sep-2023","RMB 1tr special sovereign bond Oct-2023","AIGC theme revival","tech sector leadership"],"drivers_zh":["华为Mate 60 Pro发布2023年8月","央行9月降准","万亿特别国债10月发行","AIGC主题复苏","科技板块领涨"],"title":"Huawei Mate60 and fiscal stimulus rebound","title_zh":"华为Mate60+AI题材重燃，传媒再领跑"},"2023-12-12":{"body":"A brief but sharp selloff hit December 2023 to February 2024: the CSI Small Cap index collapsed as quant fund 'snowball' structured products unwound, driving panic selling, and year-end institutional rebalancing shifted flows to Banks (+7.1%) and Coal (+4.4%). SHCOMP fell -10.0%; Media dropped -33.0% (rank 30/31) as growth lagged value by 16.1pp. The CSRC announced market stabilization measures in February 2024 (state funds deployed) to halt the freefall.","body_zh":"2023年12月至2024年2月，A股遭遇急促但剧烈的回调：量化雪球结构性产品爆仓引发恐慌性抛售，年末机构调仓将资金转向银行（+7.1%）和煤炭（+4.4%）。上证综指下跌10.0%；传媒跌幅33.0%（排名第30/31），成长跑输价值16.1个百分点。证监会于2024年2月宣布市场稳定举措（国家队资金出手）以遏制跌势。","drivers":["snowball structured product unwind","quant fund deleveraging","year-end institutional rebalancing","flight to Banks/Coal","SHCOMP -10.0%"],"drivers_zh":["雪球结构性产品爆仓","量化基金去杠杆","年末机构再平衡","资金转向银行/煤炭","上证综指-10.0%"],"title":"Year-end quant unwind, value defensives lead","title_zh":"年末量化雪球爆仓，价值防御领先"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The CSRC deployed Central Huijin buying (January-February 2024) and the PBOC cut the 5-year LPR by 25bp on February 20, 2024 - the largest single cut since the LPR reform. OpenAI revealed Sora (text-to-video AI model) on February 15, 2024, directly catalyzing A-share media/AI content stocks. Media surged +42.8% (rank #1 of 31) over just 46 days, leading Computers (+39.6%) and Telecoms (+35.9%). Growth beat defensives by 18.7pp as the AI-video production theme made content-generation stocks highly relevant.","body_zh":"证监会调动中央汇金资金托市（2024年1-2月），央行于2024年2月20日将5年期LPR大幅下调25bp（LPR改革以来最大单次降幅）。OpenAI于2024年2月15日发布Sora（文生视频AI模型），直接催化A股传媒/AI内容板块。传媒在短短46天内+42.8%（排名第1/31），领涨计算机（+39.6%）和通信（+35.9%）。成长跑赢防御18.7个百分点，视频内容生成主题令内容制作类股票高度受益。","drivers":["OpenAI Sora launch Feb-2024","PBOC 5yr LPR cut 25bp Feb-2024","Central Huijin state rescue","AI video content theme","growth style dominance"],"drivers_zh":["OpenAI Sora发布2024年2月","央行5年LPR降25bp2024年2月","中央汇金救市","AI视频内容主题","成长风格主导"],"title":"State rescue and OpenAI Sora spark surge","title_zh":"汇金救市+OpenAI Sora催化，传媒飙升43%"},"2024-03-22":{"body":"The Sora-driven rally proved short-lived as no domestic AI video model reached commercial release. The AIGC narrative faded and institutional investors rotated into defensive yield plays: Utilities +7.7% and Banks +6.9% led while SHCOMP fell only -4.8%. Media dropped -33.5% (rank dead last, 31/31), as defensives (-4.5%) massively outperformed cyclicals (-10.5%) and growth lagged value by 7.5pp. This was a prototypical 'buy the rumor, sell the news' AI-hype cycle compressed into 46 days.","body_zh":"Sora引发的行情迅速降温，国内尚无商业化的AI视频模型可落地，AIGC叙事消退。机构资金转向防御性高股息品种：公用事业+7.7%、银行+6.9%领跑，上证综指仅小跌4.8%。传媒下跌33.5%（排名垫底，第31/31），防御（-4.5%）大幅跑赢周期（-10.5%），成长跑输价值7.5个百分点。这是AI炒作周期中最典型的\"买预期、卖现实\"压缩版本。","drivers":["Sora hype exhaustion","no domestic AI video model","rotation to defensive yield","growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP -4.8%"],"drivers_zh":["Sora热度退烧","国内AI视频商业化缺失","资金转向防御高股息","成长转价值","上证综指-4.8%"],"title":"Sora hype exhaustion, rotation to defensives","title_zh":"Sora热度退烧，资金转向防御收益"},"2024-07-24":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a landmark stimulus: 50bp RRR cut, 20bp policy rate cut, CNY 500bn swap facility for non-bank institutions to buy equities, and CNY 300bn relending for share buybacks. The CSI 300 surged +16% in a single week (largest gain since 2008). Media gained +64.2% over the full rally (rank 3/31), behind only Conglomerates (+69.7%) and Retail (+67.1%), as cyclicals led (+22.5% vs defensives +10.8%) and growth beat value by 18.9pp.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子刺激举措：降准50bp、政策利率下调20bp、提供5000亿元互换便利供非银机构购买股票，以及3000亿元再贷款支持回购增持。沪深300单周涨幅+16%（2008年以来最大单周涨幅）。传媒在本轮行情中累涨64.2%（排名第3/31），仅次于综合（+69.7%）和零售（+67.1%），周期股领涨（+22.5% vs 防御+10.8%），成长跑赢价值18.9个百分点。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut Sep-2024","PBOC 500bn equity swap facility","CSRC buyback relending CNY300bn","cyclical re-rating","SHCOMP +16.9%"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月降准50bp","央行5000亿互换便利","证监会3000亿回购再贷款","周期板块重估","上证综指+16.9%"],"title":"PBOC bazooka September 2024 mega-stimulus","title_zh":"央行'大炮'弹药，2024年9月超级刺激行情"},"2024-12-13":{"body":"After the September-October 2024 stimulus rush, the market consolidated in December-January as macro data disappointed: November 2024 CPI came in at -0.6% (deflation), and the December 2024 Politburo Economic Work Conference delivered incremental easing rather than another bazooka. Media fell -21.3% (rank dead last, 31/31) while Banks +1.1% and Metals -3.1% led - consistent with a flight-to-stability trade as the AI/media liquidity premium evaporated.","body_zh":"2024年9-10月刺激冲动消退后，市场于12月至1月进入整理阶段，宏观数据令人失望：2024年11月CPI再度转负（-0.6%，通缩），12月中央经济工作会议仅释放渐进式宽松信号。传媒下跌21.3%（排名垫底，第31/31），银行（+1.1%）和有色金属（-3.1%）相对抗跌，与资金回归稳定性资产、AI/传媒流动性溢价蒸发的逻辑完全吻合。","drivers":["post-stimulus consolidation","CPI deflation -0.6% Nov-2024","Politburo EWC modest easing Dec-2024","AI premium deflation","flight to stability"],"drivers_zh":["刺激后遗症整固","CPI通缩-0.6%2024年11月","中央经济工作会议宽松偏谨慎","AI流动性溢价消退","资金转向稳定性资产"],"title":"Post-stimulus hangover, Media worst sector","title_zh":"刺激后遗症，传媒成最弱板块"},"2025-01-13":{"body":"DeepSeek released its R1 reasoning model on January 20, 2025 - demonstrating frontier AI capabilities at a fraction of US model costs. This supercharged the AIGC investment narrative: Computers surged +32% and Media +27.5% (rank 2/31) over just one month, as SHCOMP gained +5.9%. The DeepSeek breakthrough implied that domestic content companies could access powerful AI tooling cheaply, re-rating their productivity and addressable market. Growth led defensives by 10.4pp, a classic AI-catalyst-driven rally.","body_zh":"DeepSeek于2025年1月20日发布R1推理模型，以极低成本展现出前沿AI能力，彻底点燃A股AIGC投资叙事：计算机+32%、传媒+27.5%（排名第2/31），上证综指同期+5.9%。DeepSeek突破意味着国内内容公司可以低成本获取强大AI工具，市场重新估算其生产效率和市场空间。成长跑赢防御10.4个百分点，是典型的AI催化剂驱动行情。","drivers":["DeepSeek R1 release Jan-2025","AIGC cost deflation narrative","domestic AI tooling accessibility","growth style leadership","A-share AI re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek R1发布2025年1月","AIGC成本下降叙事","国内AI工具可及性提升","成长风格领跑","A股AI重估"],"title":"DeepSeek R1 ignites AI content rally","title_zh":"DeepSeek R1震撼发布，AI内容行情点火"},"2025-02-14":{"body":"President Trump's 'Liberation Day' tariff announcement on April 2, 2025 (145% effective rate on Chinese goods) triggered a global risk-off selloff. SHCOMP fell -7.5%; defensives (Agriculture +1.5%, Food & Bev +0.4%) led while cyclicals dropped -8.4% - clear flight-to-safety. Media declined -21.4% (rank 30/31), consistent with its high-beta, high-growth profile. Growth lagged value by 8.9pp. The selloff extended into April 7 (the cycle trough) before US-China tariff truce negotiations provided a floor.","body_zh":"特朗普于2025年4月2日宣布'解放日'关税（对华有效税率达145%），引发全球风险规避抛售。上证综指下跌7.5%，防御板块（农业+1.5%、食品饮料+0.4%）领先，周期板块跌8.4%，是明显的避险行情。传媒下跌21.4%（排名第30/31），与其高贝塔、高成长定位一致，成长跑输价值8.9个百分点。下跌延续至4月7日（本轮低谷），随后中美关税休战谈判为市场提供支撑。","drivers":["Trump Liberation Day tariffs Apr-2025","US-China trade shock","global risk-off","flight-to-safety rotation","growth-to-value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普'解放日'关税2025年4月","中美贸易冲击","全球风险规避","资金转向安全资产","成长转价值"],"title":"Trump tariff shock reverses growth rotation","title_zh":"特朗普关税冲击，成长轮动急转直下"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"The US-China tariff truce negotiated in May 2025 (tariffs reduced to approximately 30% on Chinese goods) removed tail risk and triggered a massive risk-on re-rating. China's AI infrastructure build-out accelerated: Telecoms (+121.9%) and Metals (+117.7%) led as network and data-center capex boomed. Media gained +72.7% (rank 5/31) over nine months against SHCOMP +33.2%. Cyclicals massively outperformed defensives (39.3% vs 10.8%) and growth beat value by 40.2pp - one of the most powerful risk-on, growth-style cycles in the dataset.","body_zh":"2025年5月中美达成关税休战协议（对华关税降至约30%），消除尾部风险，触发大规模风险再定价。中国AI基础设施建设加速：通信（+121.9%）和有色金属（+117.7%）领涨，网络/数据中心资本开支大增。传媒在9个月行情中+72.7%（排名第5/31），同期上证综指+33.2%。周期大幅跑赢防御（39.3% vs 10.8%），成长跑赢价值40.2个百分点，是数据集中最强劲的风险偏好、成长风格周期之一。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce May-2025","AI infrastructure capex boom","Telecoms/Metals leadership","PBOC easing continuation","SHCOMP +33.2%"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税休战2025年5月","AI基础设施资本开支热潮","通信/有色领涨","央行持续宽松周期","上证综指+33.2%"],"title":"Tariff truce and AI infrastructure mega-rally","title_zh":"关税休战+AI基础设施超级行情"},"2026-01-14":{"body":"After the January 2026 peak, capital rotated sharply within the growth complex from AI-content plays (AIGC/Media) into AI-hardware infrastructure: Electronics surged +64.1% and Telecoms +64.6% while SHCOMP fell only -2.4%. Media dropped -35.8% (rank last, 31/31) while even Building Materials +46.4% far outperformed. Despite a positive growth-minus-value tilt (+11.5pp), Media ranked last - confirming this is an intra-growth rotation rather than broad risk-off. Investors perceived AI-hardware (compute, chips, network) as having more near-term earnings visibility than AI-content/Media names.","body_zh":"2026年1月峰值后，资金在成长板块内部从AI内容（AIGC/传媒）快速轮向AI硬件基础设施：电子+64.1%、通信+64.6%，同期上证综指仅跌2.4%。传媒下跌35.8%（排名垫底，第31/31），就连建材也+46.4%大幅跑赢。尽管成长仍整体跑赢价值（+11.5pp），传媒却排名垫底——证实这是成长内部轮动而非全面风险规避。投资者认为AI硬件（算力、芯片、网络）比AI内容/传媒具备更清晰的近期盈利可见度。","drivers":["intra-growth rotation to AI hardware","Electronics/Telecoms leadership","AIGC narrative exhaustion","earnings visibility preference","sector-specific de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["成长内部轮向AI硬件","电子/通信领涨","AIGC叙事耗尽","市场偏好盈利可见度","板块独立去估值"],"title":"AIGC rotation out, hardware themes dominate","title_zh":"AIGC主题轮出，硬件算力主题主导"}},"now":"Media (Shenwan 801760) is in a confirmed trough/bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 26th of 31 Shenwan sectors with a -18.3% trailing return against a near-flat SHCOMP (+1.6%). Despite a growth-tilted tape where Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) lead massively, Media has been left behind - a rotation within the growth complex from AI-content/AIGC themes toward hardware-infrastructure (semiconductors, network equipment) and old-economy cyclicals (Building Materials). The sector sits below its 200-day moving average at a cycle position of 0.10, near the historical floor. This is an intra-growth de-rating: the market is broadly risk-on and growth-positive (growth minus value +18.2pp), yet Media ranks near last, signaling that the AIGC enthusiasm driving the Jan-2026 peak has exhausted and capital has rotated to earlier-stage hardware plays. Historically this trough configuration - deep laggard while growth leads elsewhere - has preceded sharp mean-reversion rallies once a new AI-content catalyst or liquidity injection materializes.","now_zh":"传媒板块（申万801760）截至2026年6月下旬处于确认低谷/筑底阶段，在31个申万一级行业中排名第26，区间回报-18.3%，同期上证综指仅微涨1.6%。尽管市场整体偏成长风格（电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%领涨），传媒却明显落后——成长板块内部轮动已从AI内容/AIGC主题转向硬件基础设施（半导体、网络设备）及老周期行业（建材）。板块位于200日均线下方，周期位置仅0.10，接近历史底部区域。当前行情呈现\"成长内部估值分化\"：大盘整体偏风险偏好且成长领先（成长-价值利差+18.2pp），但传媒近乎垫底，表明推动2026年1月峰值的AIGC热情已经耗尽，资金向更上游的算力板块迁移。从历史规律看，这种\"成长主导但传媒深度落后\"的底部特征，往往是板块均值回归反弹的先行信号。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801770":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The SHCOMP entered a historic leveraged bull market from early 2014, fueled by a surge in broker margin lending and shadow-banking umbrella trust accounts that doubled retail participation. Premier Li Keqiang Internet Plus action plan (formally announced March 2015 but telegraphed through 2014 policy signals) drove speculative buying in tech and telecoms themes. Telecoms rose 197% but ranked only 11th of 28 sectors, a move of pure beta to SHCOMP +144%, with Computers (+256%) and heavy cyclicals clearly leading. Cyclicals averaged +200.7% vs defensives +126.6%.","body_zh":"2014年初上证指数进入历史性杠杆牛市，融资融券与影子银行伞形信托大幅扩张。李克强总理互联网+计划（2015年3月正式发布）引发对科技与通信主题的投机性买入。通信板块涨幅达197%，但仅排名第11/28，属于跟随上证指数+144%大涨的系统性贝塔，周期股平均+200.7%，并非板块特有催化剂驱动。","drivers":["margin-leverage-bubble","internet-plus-policy-theme","SHCOMP-beta","retail-speculation","cyclicals-led"],"drivers_zh":["杠杆牛市","互联网+政策主题","指数贝塔","散户投机","周期股领涨"],"title":"Margin-Driven Bull; Internet Plus Beta","title_zh":"杠杆牛市启动，互联网+贝塔行情"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12 2015, the CSRC released draft rules tightening shadow-financed margin trading; the following trading day triggered a cascade of forced deleveraging that wiped 32% from SHCOMP in under four weeks. Telecoms fell 45.4%, ranking 23rd of 28. Defensives like Banks lost only 10.6% while cyclicals bore the brunt. The ctx confirms classic flight-to-safety rotation: Banks, Brokers, and Food and Bev leading on the downside and Defense and Coal slaughtered most. This was a liquidity and deleveraging event, not a telecoms-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会发布收紧场外配资监管草案，次一交易日引发连锁去杠杆踩踏，上证指数四周内下跌32%。通信板块跌幅45.4%，排名第23/28，防御板块（银行仅跌10.6%）大幅跑赢周期板块，为典型避险轮动而非通信特有催化剂所致。","drivers":["CSRC-margin-rule-shock","forced-deleveraging","liquidity-crunch","SHCOMP-crash","flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["证监会配资新规冲击","强制去杠杆","流动性危机","上证暴跌","避险轮动"],"title":"Margin Unwind; CSRC Rule Shock Crash","title_zh":"配资监管新规冲击，杠杆盘爆溃崩"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"After SHCOMP collapsed to intraday lows on July 8-9 2015, Beijing launched an unprecedented rescue: CSRC suspended IPOs, PBOC cut rates and RRR, China Securities Finance injected 1.3 trillion yuan, and 21 major brokerages pledged to buy 120 billion yuan of blue chips. SHCOMP rebounded +17.6%, with Telecoms gaining 34%, ranking 5th of 28. The ctx shows cyclicals led (33.7% vs defensives 18.6%) with a slight growth bias (+5.7pp), consistent with policy-driven risk-on bounce rather than any Telecoms-specific driver.","body_zh":"2015年7月8-9日上证指数触及阶段低点后，北京启动救市：证监会暂停IPO、央行降息降准、中证金注资1.3万亿元、21家大型券商承诺出资1200亿元购买蓝筹。上证指数+17.6%，通信涨34%，排名第5/28，周期股领涨，为政策驱动的风险偏好反弹而非通信特定催化剂。","drivers":["state-market-rescue","PBOC-rate-RRR-cut","CSF-liquidity-injection","policy-risk-on","beta-rebound"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市","央行降息降准","中证金注资","政策驱动风险偏好","贝塔反弹"],"title":"State Rescue; Policy Bounce Rally","title_zh":"国家队救市，政策驱动弹升"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"The rescue rally faded quickly. A second wave of deleveraging hit after late July as China executed a surprise CNY devaluation on August 11 2015 (the Black Monday yuan shock), triggering global risk-off and fresh selling in A-shares. SHCOMP fell 27.1% and Telecoms dropped 34.8%, ranking 23rd of 28. Defensives (Banks -12.5%, Food and Bev -22%) significantly outperformed cyclicals (-31.1%), confirming macro risk-off rather than sector-specific weakness.","body_zh":"救市反弹迅速消退。7月下旬去杠杆二次浪来袭，2015年8月11日中国意外下调人民币汇率（黑色星期一汇率冲击），引发全球风险规避情绪。上证指数下跌27.1%，通信板块跌幅34.8%，排名第23/28。防御板块再次大幅跑赢周期板块，印证这是宏观风险规避驱动而非通信特有弱势。","drivers":["CNY-devaluation-shock","second-wave-deleveraging","global-risk-off","SHCOMP-drawdown","flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","去杠杆二次浪","全球风险规避","上证下跌","避险轮动"],"title":"Second-Wave Selloff; CNY Devaluation","title_zh":"二次踩踏，人民币贬值冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"Following the August CNY devaluation shock trough, A-shares stabilized as PBOC delivered further RRR cuts (September 6 2015, -50bp) and fiscal stimulus was announced. The relief rally was distinctly growth-led: Computers gained 63.3% and Electronics 54.3%, with Telecoms at 52.5% ranked 3rd of 28. The ctx confirms a strong growth-over-value tilt (+18.1pp), with SHCOMP up 18.9%. Policy continuity on Internet Plus and 4G network expansion kept telecom names buoyant, and TMT names rotated back into leadership as extreme value discounts from panic selling unwound.","body_zh":"2015年8月人民币贬值冲击低点后，A股逐步企稳——央行于2015年9月6日再度降准50bp，并宣布财政刺激。此轮反弹明显偏向成长风格：计算机+63.3%，电子+54.3%，通信+52.5%，排名第3/28。互联网+与4G扩网政策持续支撑通信板块。","drivers":["PBOC-RRR-cut-Sep2015","growth-TMT-rotation","internet-plus-policy","post-devaluation-stabilization","4G-expansion"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月降准","成长/TMT轮动","互联网+政策","贬值冲击后企稳","4G扩网"],"title":"Tech Relief Rally; Growth Rotation","title_zh":"科技板块回暖，成长风格重开领跑"},"2015-12-30":{"body":"CSRC introduced a market-wide circuit breaker on January 1 2016; it triggered twice in the first week (January 4 and January 7), and was suspended January 8 after regulators concluded it amplified panic. SHCOMP fell 24.8%, growth stocks were routed, and Telecoms (-32.9%) ranked 23rd of 28. The ctx shows classic flight-to-safety: Banks led with smallest declines (-15.3%) while growth names like Computers (-36.2%) bore the brunt. Continued CNY depreciation pressure, with FX reserves falling below 3.3 trillion USD, added a second macro trigger.","body_zh":"2016年1月1日证监会正式实施指数熔断机制；1月4日、7日两度触发，1月8日宣布暂停，监管层承认其放大了恐慌情绪。上证指数下跌24.8%，通信板块（-32.9%）排名第23/28。银行领跌最少，成长/TMT板块（计算机-36.2%）承压最重，人民币持续贬值压力为额外触发因素。","drivers":["circuit-breaker-panic","CSRC-policy-misfire","CNY-depreciation","growth-style-rout","flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制恐慌","证监会政策失误","人民币持续贬值","成长风格溃败","避险轮动"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Panic; Growth Rout","title_zh":"熔断机制引发恐慌，成长溃败"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"Stability returned after the circuit breaker removal and coordinated PBOC easing: the one-year lending rate stood at 4.35% following a series of cuts, RRR at 17% after multiple reductions. SHCOMP staged a 21.8% rally through December 2016, led by Construction (+48.2%), Appliances (+44.9%), and Food and Bev (+40.6%). Telecoms rose 31.6% but ranked only 10th of 28, a mid-tier participation in a value-quality-cyclical recovery. The ctx shows near-zero growth-vs-value differential (-3.6pp), confirming broad market rebound rather than a growth or telecoms-led tape.","body_zh":"熔断机制取消后，在央行持续宽松（一年期贷款利率4.35%，多次降准后存准率17%）的配合下，市场逐步回稳。上证指数至2016年12月录得21.8%涨幅，建筑、家电、食品饮料领涨。通信上涨31.6%，但仅排名第10/28，成长vs价值差异几近为零，属宽基反弹中的中等参与者。","drivers":["PBOC-easing-cycle","circuit-breaker-removal","value-cyclical-recovery","broad-beta-rally","fiscal-stimulus"],"drivers_zh":["央行宽松周期","熔断机制取消","价值/周期股复苏","宽基反弹","财政刺激"],"title":"Recovery Rally; Value and Cyclicals Led","title_zh":"市场恢复反弹，价值/周期股领涨"},"2016-12-01":{"body":"From December 2016, A-shares entered a bifurcated regime: large-cap value, especially consumer staples (Food and Bev +6%) and Banks (+1.1%), continued rising while growth/TMT (Computers -21.7%, Media -25%) collapsed. CSRC tightened regulation of speculative small-cap trading (delisting warnings, shell company scrutiny), and the Blue Chip Bull narrative promoted by institutional and SOE capital dominated. SHCOMP fell only 5.2% but Telecoms dropped 18%, ranking 22nd of 28, as its growth/small-cap tilt made it a casualty of the large-cap value rotation.","body_zh":"2016年12月起，A股进入分化格局：大盘价值股（食品饮料+6%、银行+1.1%）持续走强，而成长/TMT（计算机-21.7%、传媒-25%）遭遇重创。证监会加强对小盘股监管，机构与国资推动蓝筹牛叙事。上证指数仅跌5.2%，通信板块跌18%，排名第22/28，成长/小盘属性使其成为大盘价值轮动的受害者。","drivers":["value-vs-growth-bifurcation","CSRC-small-cap-regulation","blue-chip-bull-narrative","growth-TMT-de-rating","institutional-rotation"],"drivers_zh":["价值vs成长分化","证监会小盘股监管","蓝筹牛叙事","成长/TMT估值压缩","机构资金轮动"],"title":"Value Dominance Squeezes Growth","title_zh":"蓝筹牛叙事主导，成长标的遭挤洗"},"2017-06-01":{"body":"From June 2017, A-share growth stocks staged a partial recovery, led by Food and Bev (+40.1%), Electronics (+34.1%), and Metals (+33%). Telecoms gained 21.7%, ranking 6th of 28. The ctx shows SHCOMP +11.1% with defensives averaging +14.9%, slightly ahead of cyclicals at +13%, consistent with a quality-tilted rally. China MIIT accelerated 5G spectrum allocation discussions through H2 2017 and major carriers announced 5G trial site deployments, providing a policy tailwind for the telecoms theme even as supply-side reform dominated macro headlines.","body_zh":"2017年6月起，A股成长股局部修复，食品饮料、电子、有色金属领涨。通信上涨21.7%，排名第6/28。工信部2017年下半年加快5G频谱分配讨论，三大运营商宣布5G试验站点部署，为通信主题提供政策顺风。","drivers":["5G-spectrum-pre-positioning","MIIT-5G-policy","growth-partial-recovery","quality-tilt","carrier-trial-deployment"],"drivers_zh":["5G频谱预布局","工信部5G政策","成长股局部修复","质量风格偏好","运营商试点部署"],"title":"5G Pre-Positioning; Growth Partial Rebound","title_zh":"5G频谱预布局，成长股局部修复"},"2017-11-13":{"body":"From November 2017, China PBOC and regulatory bodies issued the new asset management rules (ziguanxingui) in draft form, sharply tightening leverage and maturity mismatches in wealth management products. This punctured speculative growth positioning. SHCOMP fell 9.2% but Telecoms collapsed 25.5%, ranking 27th of 28, among the very worst Shenwan industries. The ctx confirms extreme value dominance: Banks +4.7%, Coal flat, while Telecoms and Conglom fell most. This was a liquidity withdrawal from high-beta growth names; the growth-minus-value spread hit -11.8pp.","body_zh":"2017年11月起，央行与各监管机构出台资管新规征求意见稿，大幅收紧理财产品的杠杆与期限错配。上证指数仅跌9.2%，但通信板块暴跌25.5%，排名第27/28。ctx印证极端价值主导：银行+4.7%，煤炭持平，通信与综合跌幅最重，成长vs价值利差达-11.8pp。","drivers":["asset-management-new-rules","leverage-deleveraging","growth-TMT-derating","value-dominance","regulatory-tightening"],"drivers_zh":["资管新规","去杠杆","成长/TMT估值压缩","价值主导","监管收紧"],"title":"Asset-Mgmt Rules Slam Growth","title_zh":"资管新规冲击高贝塔成长板块"},"2018-02-09":{"body":"A sharp but brief growth rebound from the asset-management-rules trough saw Computers (+23.4%), Electronics (+19.4%), and Telecoms (+18.4%) co-lead as the top 3 Shenwan industries over five weeks. The ctx shows a +9.5pp growth-over-value tilt and SHCOMP +6.3%. Mobile World Congress Barcelona (February 2018) showcased 5G standards, and China MIIT announced accelerated 5G commercialization timelines. The rebound was short-lived but demonstrated that Telecoms responds swiftly to 5G policy catalyst news even in a broad value regime.","body_zh":"资管新规冲击后的低点迎来急促但短暂的成长反弹——计算机、电子、通信共同领涨前3。ctx显示成长风格领先价值+9.5pp，上证+6.3%。2018年2月巴塞罗那MWC全面展示5G标准，工信部宣布5G商用时间表加快。通信板块对5G政策催化剂的高度敏感性得到印证。","drivers":["5G-MWC-Barcelona-catalyst","MIIT-5G-timeline","growth-rebound","tech-rotation","post-deleveraging-relief"],"drivers_zh":["5G-MWC巴塞罗那催化","工信部5G时间表","成长反弹","科技板块轮动","去杠杆后修复"],"title":"Tech Rebound; 5G Theme Emerges","title_zh":"科技主题弹出，5G行情初现"},"2018-03-12":{"body":"The US-China trade war escalated sharply from March 2018: the US announced 25% tariffs on 50 billion USD of Chinese goods in March, escalated to 200 billion USD in July at 10%, and raised to 25% by May 2019. SHCOMP fell 25.3% peak-to-trough. Telecoms dropped 38.9%, ranking 22nd of 28. The flight-to-safety tilt (defensives -22.9% vs cyclicals -30.5%) was clear but Telecoms fell more than the cyclical average, reflecting its growth/tech positioning plus rising concerns about Chinese tech supply-chain vulnerability to US sanctions. The growth-minus-value spread hit -9.9pp.","body_zh":"2018年3月起，中美贸易战急剧升级：美国对500亿美元中国商品加征25%关税，7月又对2000亿美元商品加征10%关税。上证指数区间跌幅25.3%。通信板块下跌38.9%，排名第22/28，成长属性叠加对美国科技制裁供应链暴露的担忧而双重承压，跌幅甚至超过周期股平均。","drivers":["US-China-trade-war","tariff-escalation","tech-supply-chain-risk","growth-style-rout","SHCOMP-drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易战","关税升级","科技供应链风险","成长风格溃败","上证下跌"],"title":"Trade War Selloff; US Tariffs Hit","title_zh":"中美贸易战开打，关税冲击成长/科技"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"The SHCOMP trough of October 2018 was followed by a powerful recovery: a G20 US-China trade truce (December 1 2018) eased tariff pressure, PBOC cut RRR four times in 2018-2019, and crucially the MIIT granted four commercial 5G licenses on June 6 2019, half a year ahead of schedule. Telecoms surged 68.1%, ranking 2nd of 28, with a pronounced growth/5G leadership theme (+18.8pp growth premium). The ctx confirms Telecoms was among the true sector leaders: Agriculture led (+74.2%) while Banks and Coal languished. The 5G license news turbocharged what began as a macro-relief rally.","body_zh":"2018年10月上证指数触底后，市场强势修复：2018年12月1日G20中美贸易休战缓解关税压力，央行2018-2019年四度降准；关键催化剂是工信部于2019年6月6日提前发放4张5G商用牌照。通信板块大涨68.1%，排名第2/28，5G成长主题领导地位鲜明，为真正的行业领涨者而非纯贝塔。","drivers":["5G-commercial-license-Jun2019","MIIT-5G-ahead-of-schedule","US-China-trade-truce","PBOC-RRR-cuts","5G-CAPEX-cycle-start"],"drivers_zh":["5G商用牌照（2019年6月）","工信部5G提前发牌","中美贸易休战","央行降准","5G资本开支周期启动"],"title":"5G License Catalyst; Trade-Truce Rally","title_zh":"5G牌照发放催化，中美休战行情大涨"},"2019-04-19":{"body":"Trade talks broke down in early May 2019 when Trump announced he would raise tariffs on 200 billion USD of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, and on May 15 signed the executive order placing Huawei on the US Entity List, barring it from US components. SHCOMP fell 15.2% and Telecoms plunged 26.4%, ranking 27th of 28. The ctx confirms flight-to-safety: Coal (0%), Food and Bev (-1%) led while Telecoms and Steel were pummeled. The Huawei entity list action had a disproportionate impact on Chinese Telecoms names given their 5G equipment and supply-chain linkages.","body_zh":"2019年5月初贸易谈判破裂：5月5日特朗普宣布对2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%升至25%，5月15日签署行政令将华为列入实体清单。上证指数下跌15.2%，通信板块暴跌26.4%，排名第27/28。华为实体清单对通信板块的冲击远超市场整体，因5G设备与供应链直接暴露。","drivers":["Huawei-entity-list-May2019","trade-war-re-escalation","tariff-hike-200bn","tech-supply-chain-shock","flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["华为实体清单（2019年5月）","贸易战再升级","2000亿美元关税升级","科技供应链冲击","避险轮动"],"title":"Trade War Re-Escalation; Huawei Ban","title_zh":"贸易战再升级，华为实体清单重创板块"},"2019-08-09":{"body":"Post-Huawei-ban trough: SHCOMP stabilized as China accelerated domestic 5G spending to reduce dependence on US components. China three carriers kickstarted public 5G services November 1 2019 and pledged massive capex (China Mobile alone 100 billion yuan in 2020). PBOC reformed the Loan Prime Rate mechanism in August 2019, effectively lowering corporate borrowing costs. Telecoms gained 40.6% from August 2019 to March 2020, ranking 3rd of 28, in a strongly growth-tilted tape (growth +27.7pp over value). Electronics (+64.1%) and Computers (+49.1%) led, with Telecoms benefiting from 5G infrastructure capex anticipation.","body_zh":"华为实体清单冲击后触底：上证指数企稳，中国加速推进国内5G建设以减少对美依赖。三大运营商2019年11月1日正式推出5G商用服务，央行2019年8月改革LPR机制，实质上引导企业融资成本下行。通信板块涨幅40.6%，排名第3/28，成长风格大幅领先（+27.7pp）。","drivers":["5G-commercial-service-launch","PBOC-LPR-reform","domestic-5G-capex","growth-TMT-leadership","Huawei-domestic-substitution"],"drivers_zh":["5G商用服务启动","央行LPR改革","国内5G资本开支","成长/TMT领涨","华为国产替代"],"title":"5G Buildout + PBOC LPR Reform Rally","title_zh":"5G建设加速+央行LPR改革驱动反弹"},"2020-03-10":{"body":"COVID-19 was declared a pandemic by WHO on March 11 2020. Global risk-off triggered indiscriminate selling in Chinese tech/growth stocks, with a rotation into defensives. SHCOMP fell only 4.8% (cushioned by China earlier COVID containment narrative), but Telecoms collapsed 21.1%, the worst-performing Shenwan industry (ranked 28th of 28). The ctx is unambiguous: Food and Bev (+15.4%), Services (+12.1%), Pharma (+6.2%) all rose while Telecoms, Brokers, and Textiles were sold hardest. Telecoms had been a 5G-theme growth bet; global funds exited growth positions to raise cash.","body_zh":"2020年3月11日WHO宣布COVID-19为全球大流行。全球风险规避引发中国科技/成长股无差别抛售，避险资金流入防御板块。上证指数仅跌4.8%，但通信板块暴跌21.1%，为申万最差行业（第28/28）。通信此前以5G成长主题仓位存在，全球资金为筹措流动性而率先抛售成长股。","drivers":["COVID-pandemic-risk-off","global-fund-cash-raising","growth-TMT-sold","defensive-rotation","worst-Shenwan-industry"],"drivers_zh":["疫情大流行风险规避","全球资金筹现","成长/TMT遭抛售","防御板块轮动","申万最差行业"],"title":"COVID Pandemic Risk-Off; Tech Sold Hardest","title_zh":"疫情大流行风险规避，通信报占申万最差"},"2020-05-29":{"body":"China domestic economy recovered faster than the rest of the world from COVID. PBOC cut the 7-day reverse repo rate to 2.2% and LPR to 3.85% by May 2020. The NPC in May 2020 formally dropped China GDP growth target for the first time, signaling policy focus on stability. A broad SHCOMP rally of 20.7% through mid-July 2020 ensued, led by Services (+54.5%), Electronics (+42.2%), and Media (+35%). Telecoms gained 24.8%, ranking 14th of 28, a mid-tier participation without sector-specific leadership, consistent with broad liquidity-driven growth rotation.","body_zh":"中国国内经济率先从新冠疫情中复苏。央行将7天逆回购利率降至2.2%、LPR降至3.85%。全国人大首次放弃GDP增速目标，政策重心转向稳定。上证指数至7月中旬录得20.7%涨幅，通信上涨24.8%，排名第14/28，属于中等参与度，符合流动性驱动的宽基成长轮动特征。","drivers":["China-COVID-recovery","PBOC-LPR-cut","liquidity-injection","broad-growth-rotation","NPC-stability-focus"],"drivers_zh":["中国疫情后复苏","央行LPR降息","流动性注入","宽基成长轮动","全国人大稳定导向"],"title":"China Recovery; Liquidity-Driven Rebound","title_zh":"中国复苏领先全球，流动性宽松驱动反弹"},"2020-07-13":{"body":"From July 2020 through May 2021, a 10-month window, A-shares rotated violently into value and cyclicals: Steel (+46.1%), Power Equipment (+35.7%), and Metals (+34.7%) surged on China infrastructure push and commodity supercycle, while SHCOMP was essentially flat (-0.4%). Telecoms collapsed 37.5%, the worst Shenwan industry (ranked 28th of 28). The growth-minus-value spread hit an extreme -23.7pp. CSRC launched antitrust probes into big tech in late 2020, and Xi Jinping Common Prosperity campaign (signaled from late 2020) created a de-rating of growth/platform tech assets, into which Telecoms was caught.","body_zh":"2020年7月至2021年5月，长达10个月，A股剧烈向价值/周期板块轮动：钢铁、电力设备、有色金属受大宗商品超级周期推动急涨，上证指数基本持平（-0.4%）。通信板块暴跌37.5%，为申万最差行业（第28/28），成长vs价值利差触及极端水平（-23.7pp）。证监会反垄断调查及共同富裕路线引发平台科技资产估值重估，通信板块受到牵连。","drivers":["common-prosperity-tech-de-rating","commodity-supercycle","value-cyclical-dominance","CSRC-antitrust-probe","growth-worst-period"],"drivers_zh":["共同富裕/科技去估值","大宗商品超级周期","价值/周期主导","证监会反垄断调查","成长最差表现期"],"title":"Common Prosperity + Value Rotation Crushes Growth","title_zh":"共同富裕监管+大宗商品超级周期，通信居申万最差"},"2021-05-10":{"body":"From May 2021, growth TMT names recovered as China 14th Five-Year Plan (2021-2025) explicitly prioritized the digital economy, targeting a rise in core digital industries from 7.8% to 10% of GDP. MIIT push for 5G applications (1.43 million base stations by early 2022, 500 million 5G users) re-rated Telecoms infrastructure plays. Telecoms rose 22.6%, ranking 7th of 31 in a moderate growth-led tape (+20.5pp over value) while SHCOMP gained 6%. Power Equipment (+45.3%) and Defense (+42.9%) led, so Telecoms was mid-table, reflecting digital economy tailwinds balanced against macro headwinds from the property sector.","body_zh":"2021年5月起，十四五（2021-2025年）明确将数字经济列为优先领域，目标核心数字产业占GDP比重从7.8%提升至10%，成长/TMT板块随之修复。工信部推动5G应用普及（2022年初5G基站数达143万个，5G用户超5亿），通信基础设施标的迎来重新定价。通信板块上涨22.6%，排名第7/31。","drivers":["14th-FYP-digital-economy","MIIT-5G-application-push","5G-base-station-expansion","growth-TMT-recovery","policy-tailwind"],"drivers_zh":["十四五数字经济规划","工信部5G应用推广","5G基站大规模建设","成长/TMT修复","政策顺风"],"title":"Digital Economy; 14th FYP Tech Tailwind","title_zh":"十四五数字经济规划，5G应用推动通信修复"},"2022-01-04":{"body":"From January 2022, three simultaneous shocks hit Chinese growth stocks: the US Federal Reserve signaled aggressive rate hikes (FOMC minutes released January 5 confirmed hawkish pivot, with hikes starting March 16 2022 and escalating to 75bp per meeting); China stance on the Ukraine invasion (February 24 2022) triggered foreign investor outflows; and Shanghai strict Omicron-wave lockdown (April 1 through June 2022) paralyzed China commercial center. SHCOMP fell 20.5% with a -17.1pp value tilt. Telecoms dropped 27.2%, ranking 21st of 31, as growth/tech de-rated globally and domestically.","body_zh":"2022年1月起，三重冲击同时打压中国成长股：美联储释放激进加息信号；中国在促乌战争中的立场触发外资流出；2022年4月至6月上海严格封控使中国商业中心陷入停摆。上证指数下跌20.5%，价值风格主导（-17.1pp）。通信板块跌幅27.2%，排名第21/31。","drivers":["Fed-rate-hike-cycle","Shanghai-COVID-lockdown","Ukraine-war-foreign-outflows","growth-global-de-rating","SHCOMP-drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["美联储加息周期","上海新冠封控","促乌战争外资撤离","成长股全球估值收缩","上证下跌"],"title":"Fed Tightening + Shanghai Lockdown Shock","title_zh":"美联储加息叠加上海封控冲击"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"The 14-month rally from April 2022 trough to June 2023 peak delivered +81.6% and ranked Telecoms 2nd of 31 Shenwan industries. Three sequential catalysts powered it: (1) China re-opening from zero-COVID (December 2022), unlocking consumer and tech spending; (2) ChatGPT launch (November 2022) triggered a global AI narrative that directly benefited Chinese carrier infrastructure themes; (3) MIIT 2023 digital economy directives pushed AI cloud and computing power investment, with China Telecom CTYun cloud unit and AI model development receiving policy support. Growth dominated by +45pp over value.","body_zh":"2022年4月低点至2023年6月峰值，历时14个月，通信板块大涨81.6%，排名申万第2/31。三大序列催化剂驱动：（2022年12月）放开新冠管控释放消费与科技支出；ChatGPT发布引发全球AI叙事，直接利好中国运营商基础设施主题；工信部2023年数字经济指引推动AI云计算与算力投资。成长风格大幅领先价值+45pp。","drivers":["ChatGPT-AI-narrative","zero-COVID-reopening","MIIT-digital-economy-AI","cloud-computing-growth","growth-style-dominance"],"drivers_zh":["ChatGPT/AI叙事","放开新冠管控","工信部数字经济/AI政策","云计算高速增长","成长风格主导"],"title":"AI/ChatGPT + Digital Economy Mega-Rally","title_zh":"AI/ChatGPT与数字经济政策驱动大级别行情"},"2023-06-20":{"body":"From June 2023, China post-reopening optimism evaporated as the property sector crisis deepened (major developer debt defaults, land sale revenue collapsed roughly 30% YoY in 2023), CPI turned negative, and the PPI deflation cycle intensified. SHCOMP fell 16.6%, with a strong value/defensive tilt: Coal (+17.6%) and Banks (+0.3%) led while growth/TMT was crushed (Computers -47.9%, Power Equipment -39.2%). Telecoms fell 35.6%, ranking 26th of 31, shedding the AI premium built in the prior rally as investors rotated into resource and dividend plays to weather a deflationary macro.","body_zh":"2023年6月起，中国疫后复苏乐观情绪消退：房地产危机加深（大型开发商债务违约，2023年土地出让金同比骤降逾30%），CPI转负，PPI通缩周期加剧。上证指数下跌16.6%，强烈的价值/防御风格主导。通信板块跌35.6%，排名第26/31，前期积累的AI溢价被回吐，投资者轮动至资源/高股息板块以应对通缩宏观。","drivers":["property-crisis-deepening","CPI-deflation","PPI-deflation","value-dividend-rotation","AI-premium-unwound"],"drivers_zh":["房地产危机加深","CPI转负","PPI通缩","价值/高股息轮动","AI溢价回吐"],"title":"Property Crisis + Deflation Crush Sentiment","title_zh":"房地产危机加剧+通缩压力，市场情绪崩塌"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"China market trough of early February 2024 was followed by Beijing most comprehensive stimulus since 2015: on September 24 2024 PBOC cut the 7-day reverse repo rate 20bp to 1.5%, cut RRR 50bp injecting roughly 1 trillion yuan, launched two new equity market support facilities, and allowed mortgage refinancing, producing MSCI China best monthly return in over a decade (+24% in September 2024). Then on January 20 2025, DeepSeek R1 launched, cementing China frontier AI credibility and triggering a re-rating of the entire AI/cloud/carrier stack. Telecoms soared 81.4%, ranking 3rd of 31, with growth leading value by +40.8pp.","body_zh":"2024年2月初触底后，北京出台2015年以来最全面的政策组合：2024年9月24日央行下调7天逆回购利率20bp至1.5%，降准50bp（注资约1万亿元），推出两项新股市支撑工具并放开存量房贷利率重定价。当月MSCI中国指数上涨24%。随后2025年1月20日DeepSeek R1正式发布，确立中国前沿AI地位，引发AI/云/运营商整体估值重构。通信板块大涨81.4%，排名第3/31。","drivers":["PBOC-Sep2024-stimulus","DeepSeek-R1-launch-Jan2025","AI-cloud-carrier-re-rating","national-team-equity-support","growth-style-dominance"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月刺激","DeepSeek R1发布（2025年1月）","AI/云/运营商估值重构","国家队股市支撑","成长风格主导"],"title":"PBOC Mega-Stimulus + DeepSeek Re-Rating","title_zh":"央行大组合刺激+DeepSeek引发技术价值重构"},"2025-02-21":{"body":"Trump Liberation Day tariff order of April 2 2025 imposed minimum 10% tariffs on all US imports with China facing 54% (later raised further); China responded with 34% retaliatory tariffs. Global risk-off hit growth/tech hardest. Telecoms fell 25.0%, ranking dead-last at 31st of 31 Shenwan industries. The ctx is unambiguous flight-to-safety: Agriculture (+9.9%), Food and Bev (+3.6%), and Utilities (-0.1%) led while Telecoms, Computers (-24.4%), and Electronics (-22.4%) bore the brunt. The global supply-chain shock narrative directly targeted Chinese tech and telecom equipment themes.","body_zh":"2025年4月2日特朗普解放日关税行政令对所有美国进口商品征收最低10%关税，中国面临54%；中国随即以34%报复性关税反制。全球风险规避对成长/科技冲击最大。通信板块下跌25.0%，在申万31个行业中垫底。全球供应链冲击叙事直接打压了中国科技/通信设备相关主题。","drivers":["Trump-Liberation-Day-tariffs","US-China-trade-shock","global-risk-off","flight-to-safety-defensives","tech-equipment-supply-chain-risk"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普解放日关税","中美贸易冲击","全球风险规避","避险板块领涨","科技设备供应链风险"],"title":"Trump Liberation Day Tariffs; Tech Worst","title_zh":"特朗普解放日关税冲击，通信居申万最差"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"From the Liberation Day tariff trough on April 8 2025, Telecoms launched the most powerful rally in its 12-year history, surging 294.2% to rank 1st of 31 Shenwan industries through June 2026. Multiple catalysts compounded: (1) A US-China trade truce took shape through May 2025, reducing the peak tariff shock; (2) China announced a roughly 295 billion USD state-directed AI data center buildout plan, with state carriers (China Telecom, Mobile, Unicom) designated as the sovereign AI-compute operators; (3) In May 2026, all three carriers launched AI-token subscriptions, monetizing their network assets as AI-inference pipes; (4) Huawei MWC Shanghai 2026 showcase of 6G and LEO satellite integration extended the structural re-rating. SHCOMP rose 31%, with growth dominating value by an extreme 72.5pp.","body_zh":"2025年4月8日解放日关税低点起，通信板块开启12年历史最强涨势，至2026年6月累计上涨294.2%，在申万31个行业中排名第1。多重催化剂叠加：中美贸易休战逐步成形；中国推出约2万亿美元国家主导AI数据中心建设计划，三大国有运营商被确定为主权AI算力运营主体；2026年5月三大运营商相继推出AI token套餐；华为MWC上海2026全面展示6G/低轨卫星融合生态。","drivers":["China-295bn-AI-infra-plan","state-carrier-sovereign-AI-compute","AI-token-subscription-monetization","US-China-trade-truce","Huawei-6G-LEO-satellite"],"drivers_zh":["中国2万亿AI数据中心计划","国有运营商主权算力定位","AI token套餐货币化","中美贸易休战","华为6G/低轨卫星"],"title":"AI-Infra + Token Economy; Historic Surge","title_zh":"AI基建+算力代币化，历史最强超级行情"}},"now":"Telecoms is in a confirmed Topping phase (pos 98.6/100), ranked 2nd of 31 Shenwan industries with a 67.7% return on the current leg. The live ctx is emphatically growth/risk-on: SHCOMP +1.6%, cyclicals beating defensives by 13.4pp (0.3% vs -12.1%), and growth leading value by 18.2pp, with Electronics the only sector outperforming Telecoms. This is a late-stage beta stretch driven by the AI-compute and token-economy narrative: state carriers (China Mobile, China Telecom, China Unicom) began selling AI-token subscriptions in May 2026 at sub-10 yuan per month; Huawei MWC Shanghai 2026 (6G/optical/AI integration) amplified the theme. Daily token consumption has grown roughly 1000x to 140 trillion tokens per day by mid-2026. The sector is at near-maximum cycle position - historically a zone where Telecoms has topped sharply and rotated into value/defensives.","now_zh":"通信板块处于确认的顶部阶段（位置98.6/100），在申万31个行业中排名第2，本轮涨幅67.7%。当前市场环境明显偏向成长/风险偏好：上证指数+1.6%，周期股跑赢防御股13.4pp，成长风格领先价值18.2pp。核心主题是AI算力与算力代币化：2026年5月三大运营商推出AI token套餐，华为MWC上海2026展示6G/AI融合生态。当前位置接近历史极值，历史上此类高位往往是通信大幅见顶、风格切换至价值/防御的前兆。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801780":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The PBOC launched an easing cycle from late 2014 (benchmark rate cut 40bp in November 2014, the first since 2012; five further cuts and multiple RRR cuts followed through 2015), unleashing a margin-lending explosion that drove SHCOMP +143%. Banks rose +102% but ranked 27th of 28 sectors as retail margin capital concentrated in higher-beta cyclicals like Construction (+258%) and Computers (+238%). Banks were index-beta passengers: cyclicals led defensives 191% vs 120%, making this a pure liquidity-tide rally rather than a financials-specific re-rating. Margin financing as a share of daily turnover reportedly reached 18% by mid-2015, a historically unprecedented level.","body_zh":"央行自2014年11月起启动降息周期（首次降息40bp，为2012年以来首次），叠加多次降准，融资融券规模急速膨胀，推动上证综指上涨143%。银行虽上涨102%，但在28个申万行业中排名第27，落后于建筑（+258%）、计算机（+238%）等高贝塔板块。资金集中于高弹性周期股，周期领先防御191%比120%，银行仅为市场Beta被动受益者，而非主动重估对象。","drivers":["PBOC rate and RRR easing cycle","margin lending explosion","broad SHCOMP beta","retail investor inflows"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准周期","融资融券规模暴增","上证综指大盘Beta","散户资金大规模入市"],"title":"Leveraged bull: PBOC easing lifts all boats","title_zh":"杠杆牛市：货币宽松推高全市场"},"2015-06-08":{"body":"On 12 June 2015 the CSRC announced new draft rules tightening shadow-financed margin trading, triggering forced selling as leveraged accounts hit margin-call thresholds. SHCOMP fell 42% peak-to-trough by late August, the third-worst global crash since 1950 in speed. Banks fell 37.4% but held better than Computers (-49%) and Brokers (-53%), consistent with the ctx flight-to-safety read (defensives fell 37% vs cyclicals 42%). The PBOC cut rates 25bp on 27 June and again 25bp on 25 August alongside a 50bp RRR cut as emergency rescue measures, providing only temporary relief as forced liquidations cascaded.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会发布收紧融资融券监管规定草案，触发杠杆账户强制平仓连锁反应，上证综指至8月下旬累计下跌42%。银行下跌37.4%，但好于计算机（-49%）和券商（-53%），与申万防御性相对抗跌的信号一致（防御-37%比周期-42%）。央行分别于6月27日和8月25日紧急降息25bp，并配合降准50bp，但仅能阶段性缓解强平压力。","drivers":["CSRC margin rule shock June 2015","forced deleveraging / margin calls","flight-to-safety relative protection","PBOC emergency rate cuts"],"drivers_zh":["证监会融资新规冲击（2015年6月）","强制去杠杆/保证金追缴","防御属性相对抗跌","央行紧急降息"],"title":"Margin call crash: deleveraging wipes financials hardest","title_zh":"爆仓崩盘：去杠杆重创金融板块"},"2015-08-25":{"body":"Following the emergency August 25 PBOC rate cut and RRR reduction, and with leverage largely flushed, a policy-driven bounce emerged lasting through December 2015. SHCOMP gained 22.9% and Banks rose 33.5%, ranking 10th out of 28, outperforming the index as defensive attributes became relatively attractive in a lower-conviction bounce. Leaders were Services (+46%), Brokers (+46%), and Real Estate (+42%), reflecting a beta-chasing recovery in post-crash survivors; growth led value slightly (+5.7pp). The PBoC also devalued CNY 1.9% on August 11, a shock that paradoxically front-ran the trough as the worst-case fears were priced in.","body_zh":"2015年8月25日央行紧急降息降准后，去杠杆资金出清，政策驱动的反弹行情延续至年底。上证综指上涨22.9%，银行上涨33.5%，在28个行业中排名第10，防御属性相对占优。领涨板块为服务业（+46%）、券商（+46%）和房地产（+42%），反映崩后超跌修复的Beta追逐；成长略领先价值（+5.7pp）。央行于8月11日意外将人民币贬值1.9%，该冲击反而提前消化悲观预期，为阶段性底部形成创造条件。","drivers":["PBOC August 2015 emergency rate + RRR cut","short-covering bounce post-deleveraging","CNY devaluation shock absorbed","index beta recovery"],"drivers_zh":["央行8月紧急降息降准","去杠杆后空头回补","人民币贬值冲击消化","大盘Beta修复"],"title":"PBOC rescue bounce: policy-driven relief rally","title_zh":"央行救市反弹：政策驱动的修复行情"},"2015-12-21":{"body":"The new market-wide circuit breaker launched on 4 January 2016 immediately backfired: on both January 4 and January 7, the 5% threshold triggered halts and the magnet effect accelerated selling, with trading suspended in just 33 minutes on January 7. The CSRC suspended the mechanism on January 8. Simultaneously, the CNY fix was weakened to five-year lows through early 2016, amplifying capital-outflow fears. Banks fell 18.1% but were the STRONGEST sector of 28 (ranked #1), dramatically outperforming Brokers (-29%), Conglomerates (-30%), and Media (-31%) -- consistent with the ctx showing banks as a flight-to-safety anchor as defensives (-23%) beat cyclicals (-26%).","body_zh":"2016年1月4日熔断机制上线，当日及1月7日连续触发5%阈值，磁吸效应加速抛售，1月7日开盘仅33分钟即暂停交易。监管层于1月8日紧急叫停熔断机制。与此同时，人民币中间价持续走弱至近五年低点，加剧资本外流担忧。银行跌幅18.1%，但在28个行业中位居第1，显著强于券商（-29%）、综合（-30%）和传媒（-31%），与申万防御属性相对抗跌（防御-23%比周期-26%）的信号高度一致。","drivers":["circuit-breaker magnet effect Jan 2016","CNY devaluation fears / capital outflows","relative flight-to-safety leadership","SHCOMP index drawdown -24.7%"],"drivers_zh":["熔断机制磁吸效应（2016年1月）","人民币贬值/资本外流担忧","防御属性相对领先","上证综指大幅下跌-24.7%"],"title":"Circuit-breaker shock: CNY devaluation + policy panic","title_zh":"熔断机制冲击：人民币贬值与政策恐慌"},"2016-02-25":{"body":"From February 2016, the Politburo's formal launch of supply-side structural reform (announced People's Daily 9 May 2016), stabilising commodity prices, and the PBOC's shift from rate cuts to targeted liquidity tools (MLF, PSL) drove a decisive rotation into value. SHCOMP gained 27.2% over two years. Banks outperformed strongly (up 50.5%, ranked #4) in a tape where value crushed growth by 35.8pp and Food & Bev (+103%), Appliances (+91%), and Steel (+60%) led. NIM stabilisation post-five-rate-cut cycle and Chinese banks' low P/B valuations attracted institutional rotation; shadow banking regulatory tightening from late 2016 further enhanced traditional bank lending appeal.","body_zh":"2016年2月起，政治局正式推进供给侧结构性改革（5月9日《人民日报》权威人士发文），大宗商品价格企稳，央行从降息转向MLF等结构性工具，推动市场大幅切换至价值风格。上证综指两年累计上涨27.2%，银行涨50.5%，排名第4，在价值领先成长35.8个百分点的行情中表现突出。利差下行周期结束后净息差趋稳、低市净率吸引机构资金；2016年下半年影子银行监管收紧，进一步提升传统银行信贷的相对吸引力。","drivers":["supply-side structural reform 2016","PBOC MLF-driven liquidity normalisation","value-over-growth rotation","NIM stabilisation and low P/B re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["供给侧结构性改革（2016年）","央行MLF流动性管理正常化","价值风格大幅跑赢成长风格","净息差企稳+低市净率重估"],"title":"Supply-side reform + value rotation: banks lead 2-year bull","title_zh":"供给侧改革+价值轮动：银行领涨两年牛市"},"2018-02-05":{"body":"The US announced the first Section 301 tariff package on 22 March 2018 (25% on $50bn of Chinese goods); by early July 2018 a further $200bn list was proposed. Simultaneously China's domestic financial deleveraging campaign (targeting shadow banking and off-balance-sheet wealth products from 2017) compressed credit, slowed loan growth, and elevated NPL fears. SHCOMP fell 20.4%. Banks dropped 28.6%, the second-worst sector (#27/28), reflecting their dual vulnerability: trade-war-driven GDP slowdown fears crimping loan demand, and the deleveraging campaign squeezing bank off-balance-sheet revenue. Pharma (+9%), Services (+2%), and Computers (+2%) outperformed sharply as growth/defensive sectors rotated to safety.","body_zh":"2018年3月22日美国公布针对500亿美元中国商品的301关税（25%），7月初进一步提出2000亿美元关税清单。与此同时，国内金融去杠杆（针对影子银行和表外理财产品）压缩信贷、拖累贷款增长、抬升不良贷款担忧。上证综指下跌20.4%，银行跌28.6%，排名倒数第2（27/28），双重承压：贸易战引发GDP放缓冲击贷款需求，去杠杆压缩表外收入。医药（+9%）、服务（+2%）、计算机（+2%）大幅跑赢，成长/防御风格切换至避险。","drivers":["US Section 301 tariffs March-July 2018","domestic financial deleveraging campaign","NPL and credit cycle fears","growth-to-value rotation out of banks"],"drivers_zh":["美国301关税（2018年3-7月）","国内金融去杠杆","不良贷款与信贷周期担忧","成长防御轮动压制银行"],"title":"US-China trade war + deleveraging: banks crash","title_zh":"中美贸易战+去杠杆：银行重挫"},"2018-07-02":{"body":"After bottoming in early July 2018, the PBOC announced a 50bp RRR cut (effective 5 July 2018) and further easing through H2 2018 and into 2019, explicitly to offset the trade-war impact. A US-China trade truce at the G20 Buenos Aires summit on 1 December 2018 reduced near-term tariff escalation risk. The SHCOMP recovered 17.2% through April 2019 (driven by the strong January 2019 PBOC credit injection; total social financing hit 4.64 trillion CNY in January 2019, a record). Banks gained 28.4%, ranking 4th of 28, outperforming the index as credit growth stabilised and NPL fears receded.","body_zh":"2018年7月初触底后，央行于7月5日宣布降准50bp，并在2018下半年至2019年持续宽松以对冲贸易战影响。2018年12月1日G20布宜诺斯艾利斯峰会达成中美贸易停火，短期关税升级风险降低。上证综指至2019年4月累计上涨17.2%，2019年1月社会融资规模创纪录达4.64万亿元。银行涨28.4%，排名第4/28，信贷增速企稳、不良贷款担忧消退推动估值修复。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts July 2018 onward","US-China G20 trade truce Dec 2018","record TSF credit injection Jan 2019","NPL fears stabilising"],"drivers_zh":["央行7月起连续降准","G20中美贸易停火（2018年12月）","2019年1月社融规模创纪录","不良贷款担忧边际缓解"],"title":"PBOC easing + trade truce: banks rebound with index","title_zh":"央行宽松+贸易停火：银行随大盘反弹"},"2019-04-16":{"body":"Trade war re-escalated from May 2019 (25% tariffs raised on $200bn goods, 15 May 2019) and then COVID-19 struck China from January 2020, forcing nationwide lockdowns and a sharp economic contraction. The PBOC directed banks to absorb NPL shocks and extend loan forbearance while maintaining credit flows to the real economy, compressing NIM and elevating credit risk. SHCOMP fell 18.2%. Banks declined 19.8%, ranking 17th of 28 -- middle of the pack, reflecting a balance between defensive NPL-forbearance pressures and modest flight-to-safety versus hard-hit sectors like Transport (-28%) and Steel (-32%).","body_zh":"2019年5月贸易战再度升级（美国将2000亿美元商品关税从10%提至25%），2020年1月起新冠疫情爆发，全国封控推动经济急剧收缩。央行要求银行吸收不良贷款冲击、延期还款并维持信贷投放，净息差承压、信用风险抬升。上证综指下跌18.2%，银行跌19.8%，排名第17/28，夹在防御属性与不良贷款宽限压力之间，相对强于交通运输（-28%）和钢铁（-32%）。","drivers":["US tariff re-escalation May 2019","COVID-19 economic shock Jan-Mar 2020","NPL forbearance compressing NIM","SHCOMP broad drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["美国关税再升级（2019年5月）","新冠疫情经济冲击（2020年1-3月）","不良贷款宽限压缩净息差","上证综指系统性下跌"],"title":"COVID + trade war re-escalation: banks drag","title_zh":"新冠疫情+贸易战再升级：银行拖累"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"China's rapid COVID containment and fiscal stimulus -- infrastructure spending, property credit support, and a record 20 trillion CNY new loans in 2020 -- drove a strong V-shaped recovery. SHCOMP gained 38.2%, but the rally was led by consumer names (Services +197%, Food & Bev +138%, Power Equipment +121%) in a defensive-quality rotation. Banks rose 35.4% (ranked 13th of 28), roughly matching the index but well behind the growth darlings; the ctx shows value led growth slightly (+6.5pp) but the dominant theme was consumer/premium growth rather than cyclical banking. The Bank of China and its peers benefited from higher loan volumes but NIM pressure from PBOC's 2020 rate guidance kept re-rating capped.","body_zh":"中国快速控制疫情，叠加财政刺激（基建、房地产信贷支持）和2020年新增贷款规模创纪录（约20万亿元），推动经济V型复苏。上证综指上涨38.2%，但领涨板块为消费（服务+197%、食品饮料+138%、电力设备+121%），银行涨35.4%（排名13/28），大体跟上指数但明显落后消费成长龙头。价值微幅领先成长（+6.5pp），但主线是消费/优质成长而非周期性银行重估，净息差承压制约估值修复空间。","drivers":["China COVID V-recovery credit surge","record 2020 new loan issuance","SHCOMP broad beta","value-slight tilt but consumer-led tape"],"drivers_zh":["疫后V型复苏信贷大幅扩张","2020年新增贷款规模创纪录","上证综指大盘Beta","价值微占优但消费成长主导"],"title":"Post-COVID V-recovery: banks gain on credit surge","title_zh":"疫后V型复苏：信贷扩张提振银行"},"2021-02-18":{"body":"The August 2020 Three Red Lines property leverage rules triggered Evergrande's liquidity crisis by late 2021, culminating in its December 2021 default on $305bn in debt. Banks fell 35.5% over the February 2021 to October 2022 period, ranking 25th of 31 sectors, as the market priced massive property-loan NPL contagion risk. Simultaneously the PBOC's regulatory tightening on shadow banking, the tech regulatory crackdown (Didi, Alibaba), and zero-COVID lockdowns hammered sentiment. Coal (+15%), Conglomerates (+13%), and Utilities (+12%) were the only winners -- a commodities/real-economy defensive rotation -- while former leaders Food & Bev (-45%) and Appliances (-45%) collapsed alongside Banks.","body_zh":"2020年8月出台的房地产\"三道红线\"政策触发恒大流动性危机，2021年12月正式违约（3050亿美元债务）。银行在2021年2月至2022年10月期间累计下跌35.5%，在31个申万行业中排名第25，市场对房地产贷款不良资产传染风险充分定价。同期叠加影子银行监管收紧、互联网科技反垄断（滴滴、阿里）以及新冠封控拖累，仅煤炭（+15%）、综合（+13%）、公用事业（+12%）等资源/防御板块幸免，前期领涨的食品饮料（-45%）和家电（-45%）与银行同步重挫。","drivers":["Three Red Lines + Evergrande default Dec 2021","property NPL contagion risk pricing","zero-COVID economic drag","PBOC regulatory tightening on shadow banking"],"drivers_zh":["三道红线+恒大违约（2021年12月）","房地产不良贷款传染风险定价","新冠封控经济拖累","影子银行监管收紧"],"title":"Evergrande + regulatory crackdown: banks punished hardest","title_zh":"恒大暴雷+监管收紧：银行受压最深"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"The October 2022 SHCOMP trough coincided with the 20th Party Congress confirming Xi's third term, after which markets initially sold off on zero-COVID continuity fears. The catalyst for reversal was the abrupt end of zero-COVID in December 2022, followed by the State Council's 2023-2024 SOE reform directives mandating higher dividends for state-controlled firms, the China Securities Regulatory Commission pushing shareholder returns, and the central Huijin 'national team' accumulating bank shares. Banks surged +70.6% over nearly three years (Oct 2022 to Jul 2025), ranking 2nd of 31, becoming the dominant value-dividend play as 10-year CGBs fell below 2% in 2024 making bank dividend yields of 6-8% extraordinarily attractive relative to bonds.","body_zh":"2022年10月上证综指触底，恰逢二十大确认习近平第三任期，市场初期因新冠清零政策延续担忧承压。转折催化剂为2022年12月新冠政策急转，随后国务院2023-2024年国企改革指令要求国有控股企业提高分红，证监会推进股东回报改革，中央汇金等\"国家队\"持续增持银行股。银行近三年累计涨幅70.6%（2022年10月至2025年7月），在31个申万行业中排名第2，成为最强势的价值分红主线——10年期国债收益率2024年跌破2%，使银行股6-8%的股息率与债券利差极具吸引力。","drivers":["zero-COVID end Dec 2022","SOE dividend reform and national team buying","bond yield compression making dividend yields attractive","LPR stability and NIM floor signals"],"drivers_zh":["2022年12月新冠政策终结","国企分红改革及国家队增持","债券收益率压缩凸显高股息吸引力","贷款市场报价利率稳定，净息差底部信号"],"title":"Reopening + SOE dividend re-rating: banks dominate","title_zh":"重新开放+国企分红重估：银行强势领涨"},"2025-07-10":{"body":"From July 2025 a powerful AI/technology theme -- accelerated by DeepSeek's January 2025 efficiency breakthrough and sustained semiconductor demand -- rotated capital aggressively out of dividend-yield value names into Electronics (+150%), Telecoms (+187%), and Building Materials (+73%). Banks fell 19.9% against a SHCOMP +14.7% gain, ranking 27th of 31, as the growth-value spread hit +46pp. The catalyst is a regime shift: with the prior zero-COVID/SOE-dividend narrative exhausted and NIM compression ongoing (ICBC NIM 1.28% Q1 2025, -15bp y/y), bank earnings growth turned negative in 2024 (-2.3%), removing the fundamental support that sustained the prior bull. The 'national team' bid faded as policy focus shifted to technology self-sufficiency.","body_zh":"2025年7月起，AI/科技主线（受2025年1月DeepSeek效率突破及持续半导体需求驱动）强力轮动，资金大量流出高股息价值板块，涌入电子（+150%）、通信（+187%）、建材（+73%）等板块。银行下跌19.9%，而上证综指上涨14.7%，排名31个行业中第27，成长与价值分化达46个百分点。触发因素为格局切换：新冠重开/国企分红主线叙事耗尽，净息差持续收窄（工行2025年一季度净息差1.28%，同比-15bp），银行2024年利润增速转负（-2.3%），基本面支撑不再；\"国家队\"重心转向科技自立，银行增持力度减弱。","drivers":["DeepSeek AI theme accelerating tech rotation","bank NIM compression and earnings decline","growth beats value by 46pp","national team pivot to tech support"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek AI主题加速科技轮动","银行净息差收窄、盈利下滑","成长领先价值46个百分点","国家队政策重心转向科技"],"title":"Growth-theme rotation: banks sold as AI rally dominates","title_zh":"成长主题轮动：AI行情主导，银行遭卖出"}},"now":"Banks (Shenwan 801780) are in a confirmed trough/bottoming phase as of late June 2026, having shed ~20% from the July 2025 peak while SHCOMP itself gained +14.7% over the same window -- a rare negative divergence signalling structural rotation out of the sector rather than index beta. The tape is a textbook growth-over-value regime: cyclicals led defensives by 32pp and growth beat value by 46pp, with Electronics (+150%), Telecoms (+187%), and Building Materials (+73%) dominating while Banks rank 27/31. With a BUY signal triggered at a deeply oversold position reading of 7.4, the phase is a late-stage washout consistent with prior trough setups. A mean-reversion catalyst requires either a macro policy pivot (LPR/RRR cut), a growth-to-value rotation shift, or the AI-electronics rally losing steam.","now_zh":"银行板块（申万801780）截至2026年6月下旬已确认触底阶段，自2025年7月峰值回落约20%，而同期上证综指上涨14.7%——出现罕见背离，反映资金结构性流出银行板块而非指数系统性回调。当前行情为典型的成长压制价值格局：周期板块领先防御板块32个百分点，成长风格超越价值风格46个百分点，电子（+150%）、通信（+187%）、建材（+73%）强势主导，银行在31个申万行业中位列第27。板块位置仅7.4分位、买入信号触发，指向深度超卖后的末期洗盘，与历史上2018年之后的底部形态高度吻合。反弹触发条件：货币政策宽松（降准/降息）、成长切换价值风格，或AI-电子行情退潮。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801790":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"China's A-share bull market from early 2014 was powered by a historic surge in margin lending: outstanding margin balances quintupled from CNY400bn in mid-2014 to CNY2.2tn by June 2015, generating record brokerage commission and interest income. State media endorsed equity investment as an asset-allocation shift away from property, and the PBOC cut benchmark rates in November 2014 (-25bp) and February 2015, feeding excess liquidity into equities. Non-bank Financials (+201%) ranked 7th of 28 industries, consistent with broad cyclical beta: construction, computers, and steel led while defensives (pharma, banks, food and bev) lagged by 70pp, confirming this was a leveraged-market-cycle gain amplified by broker revenue gearing rather than sector-specific strength.","body_zh":"2014年初A股牛市的核心驱动是融资规模历史性扩张：融资余额从2014年中约4000亿元猛增至2015年6月的2.2万亿元，驱动券商佣金和利息收入创历史新高。国家媒体背书居民财富搬家概念，央行于2014年11月及2015年2月两度降息，持续向市场注入流动性。非银金融（+201%）在28个行业中排第7，与宏观周期性板块同步：建筑、计算机、钢铁领涨，防御板块（医药/银行/食饮）落后约70个百分点，确认本轮涨幅是杠杆市场周期中券商业绩弹性的放大，而非行业自身超额收益。","drivers":["margin-lending boom CNY400bn to 2.2tn","PBOC rate cuts Nov-2014 and Feb-2015","retail investor influx state-media endorsement","cyclicals-led broad beta rally","broker revenue gearing on volume and interest"],"drivers_zh":["两融规模从4000亿扩张至2.2万亿","央行2014年11月及2015年2月两度降息","散户资金大规模入市叠加官媒背书","周期板块引领宽基上涨","券商量与息双重收入弹性放大"],"title":"Margin-Fueled A-Share Bull Market Launch","title_zh":"融资融券驱动A股牛市启动"},"2015-06-08":{"body":"On June 12 2015 the CSRC announced tightening on shadow-margin trading (umbrella trusts and fintech leverage platforms), triggering forced selling by accounts at maximum leverage; fintech platforms had allowed retail investors to borrow at ratios as high as 20:1. The SHCOMP fell 43% by late August 2015. Non-bank Financials ranked last (28th/28, -53.4%) as brokers bore the double impact of collapsing trading volumes and margin-call losses. The flight-to-safety rotation saw defensives (food and bev, banks) lose only 33-34% vs cyclicals losing 44-45%, confirming this was market-wide deleveraging, not sector-specific weakness.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会宣布收紧场外配资（伞形信托及金融科技平台杠杆），触发高杠杆账户被动平仓；部分平台杠杆比例高达20:1。上证综指至8月下旬累计跌幅达43%。非银金融排名垫底（28/28，-53.4%），券商双重承压：交易量骤降叠加两融平仓损失。防御板块（食饮、银行）仅跌33-34%，周期板块跌44-45%，确认本轮为全市场去杠杆性质。","drivers":["CSRC shadow-margin crackdown June 12 2015","forced margin liquidation cascade 20:1 leverage","SHCOMP -43% broad crash","flight-to-safety defensives led","broker commission and interest income collapse"],"drivers_zh":["证监会2015年6月12日收紧场外配资","20:1杠杆账户连锁强制平仓","上证综指-43%全市场暴跌","资金向防御板块避险","券商佣金及利息收入骤降"],"title":"Leverage Unwind: Margin Cascade Selloff","title_zh":"去杠杆踩踏：两融爆仓瀑布式下跌"},"2015-08-26":{"body":"After the August 24-26 2015 Black Monday capitulation, Beijing deployed the China Securities Finance Corp (CSF) with an estimated CNY1.5tn in firepower to buy blue-chips, channeling purchases through major securities firms. The PBOC cut RRR by 50bp and benchmark rates by 25bp in late August 2015. Brokers surged to leadership (1st/28, +50.6%): CSF purchases directly boosted broker fee income and balance sheets. SHCOMP recovered 24.2%; growth-style led (growth +7.6pp vs value), and brokers outperformed all 28 industries, marking this as a policy-driven re-leveraging rally with direct broker-transmission mechanism.","body_zh":"2015年8月24-26日黑色星期一恐慌性下跌后，中证金融公司受托以约1.5万亿元弹药入场购买蓝筹，经由大型券商通道集中买入。央行同步于8月下旬降准50bp、降息25bp。券商一跃领涨（28行业第1，+50.6%）：中证金融通过券商操作直接拉动其佣金及资产负债表。上证综指回升24.2%，成长风格领先（+7.6pp），本轮为政策直接传导至券商的再加杠杆反弹。","drivers":["China Securities Finance Corp CNY1.5tn rescue buying","PBOC RRR cut 50bp Aug 2015","PBOC benchmark rate cut 25bp","broker-channel policy transmission mechanism","growth-style tape leadership"],"drivers_zh":["中证金融公司1.5万亿级托市","央行8月降准50bp","央行8月降息25bp","资金经由券商通道入市的政策传导","成长风格主导行情"],"title":"State Rescue Fund Drives Broker Rebound","title_zh":"国家队入市推动券商V形反弹"},"2015-12-23":{"body":"China introduced a market-wide circuit breaker on January 1 2016 that halted trading when CSI 300 fell 5% or 7%; on January 4 and January 7 it triggered twice in rapid succession, amplifying panic as investors rushed to sell before trading was suspended. The PBOC set the RMB reference rate to CNY6.5646/USD on January 7 2016, its lowest since March 2011, stoking capital-flight fears. The SHCOMP fell 26.1%; value-style led (banks -16.4% vs computers -35%), and Non-bank Financials fell 32.4% (22nd/28), underperforming banks but better than media/computers, consistent with value-tilt flight-to-quality.","body_zh":"中国于2016年1月1日引入市场熔断机制，CSI 300跌5%/7%时暂停交易；1月4日和7日连续两次触发，投资者抢先卖出加剧恐慌。央行于1月7日将人民币中间价设至2011年3月以来最低（6.5646），引发资本外流担忧。上证综指跌26.1%，价值风格领先（银行跌16.4% vs 计算机跌35%），非银金融跌32.4%（28行业第22），跑输银行但好于媒体/计算机，与价值避险轮动一致。","drivers":["circuit breaker mechanism triggered Jan 4 and 7 2016","RMB reference rate to 5-year low CNY6.5646","capital outflow fears","value-style flight-to-quality rotation","SHCOMP -26% broad crash"],"drivers_zh":["2016年1月4日和7日熔断连续触发","人民币中间价降至五年低位6.5646","资本外流担忧升温","资金向价值股避险","上证综指-26%全市场普跌"],"title":"Circuit Breaker and RMB Shock Selloff","title_zh":"熔断机制叠加人民币贬值冲击回调"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"The 21-month rally from February 2016 to November 2017 was value-dominated (value beat growth by 15.9pp; food and bev +108%, appliances +99%), driven by institutional quality-rotation and large insurers deploying universal-life premiums into equities. This trend inflated broker-adjacent asset management revenues until the CIRC crackdown on barbarian insurer leveraged buyouts in December 2016 (suspending Foresea Life product sales). From mid-2017 the rally shifted to quality consumption and foreign Stock Connect inflows. Non-bank Financials ranked 4th (+55.7%): rising trading volumes and asset management fees powered broker income even within a value-tilt environment.","body_zh":"2016年2月至2017年11月长达21个月的行情以价值风格主导（价值跑赢成长15.9pp，食饮+108%、家电+99%），核心驱动是机构资金向优质蓝筹集中及保险公司通过万能险保费大规模举牌入市。这一趋势直至2016年12月保监会整治野蛮人险资（暂停前海人寿万能险产品销售）为止，同步拉动了券商资管收入。2017年中后行情转向消费升级，北向资金加速流入。非银金融排第4（+55.7%），受益于交投量上升和资管费用增长，在价值风格环境中仍保持良好表现。","drivers":["value-style institutional rotation to blue-chips","insurance universal-life premium equity deployment","CIRC barbarian insurer crackdown Dec 2016","Stock Connect foreign inflows accelerating mid-2017","consumption-upgrade narrative driving volumes"],"drivers_zh":["机构资金价值轮动向蓝筹集中配置","万能险保费驱动险资举牌入市","保监会2016年12月整治险资野蛮人","2017年中起北向资金加速","消费升级主题驱动成交量持续活跃"],"title":"Value Rotation and Insurance Equity Flows Rally","title_zh":"价值轮动与保险入市驱动上涨"},"2017-11-21":{"body":"The Asset Management New Rules were issued April 27 2018 by the PBOC, CBIRC, and CSRC jointly, requiring unwind of maturity-mismatch wealth management products and off-balance-sheet shadow banking, directly shrinking broker channel and advisory fee revenues. The US-China trade war escalated sharply from March 2018 with 25% tariffs on $50bn of Chinese goods, driving SHCOMP down 27.1%. Non-bank Financials fell 34.4% (14th/28): defensives led (coal flat, banks -14%) while growth (electronics -49%, conglomerates -51%) bore the worst; brokers underperformed banks, consistent with the flight-to-safety and value-tilt signals in the ctx.","body_zh":"2018年4月27日，人民银行、银保监会、证监会联合发布资产管理新规，要求打破刚兑、压缩期限错配产品，直接冲击券商通道及资管收入。与此同时，中美贸易战自2018年3月起急剧升级（对500亿美元中国商品加征25%关税），上证综指跌27.1%。非银金融跌34.4%（28行业第14），防御板块领先（煤炭持平、银行跌14%），成长板块跌幅最深（电子跌49%、综合跌51%）；券商相对银行偏弱，与ctx的避险/价值轮动信号一致。","drivers":["Asset Management New Rules Apr 27 2018","US-China trade war 25% tariffs March 2018","shadow banking channel revenue contraction","SHCOMP -27% broad decline","flight-to-safety value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2018年4月27日资产管理新规落地","2018年3月中美贸易战25%关税升级","影子银行通道收入大幅萎缩","上证综指-27%全面下跌","避险情绪驱动价值风格轮动"],"title":"Asset Management Rules and Trade War Crush Sector","title_zh":"资管新规叠加贸易战重压非银金融"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"The PBOC announced a 100bp RRR cut on October 7 2018 (the fourth that year), injecting CNY750bn into the banking system, signalling a decisive pivot from deleveraging to easing. In March 2019 MSCI announced it would increase the A-share inclusion factor from 5% to 20% effective May 2019, drawing sustained foreign inflows. The SHCOMP rose 31.5%; growth led (growth +18.8pp vs value). Non-bank Financials gained 54.5% (5th/28), as rising volumes, improving sentiment and the growth-style rotation boosted broker revenues in a risk-on recovery.","body_zh":"2018年10月7日央行宣布降准100bp（年内第四次），净投放约7500亿元，标志着政策从去杠杆正式转向宽松。2019年3月MSCI宣布将A股纳入比例从5%提升至20%（2019年5月生效），推动北向资金持续流入。上证综指涨幅31.5%，成长风格领先（+18.8pp）。非银金融上涨54.5%（28行业第5），交投回暖、情绪修复和成长轮动共同拉动券商收入，在风险偏好回升中实现强劲复苏。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut 100bp Oct 7 2018","MSCI A-share inclusion factor 5% to 20% Mar 2019","sustained North-connect foreign inflows","growth-style liquidity recovery","policy pivot from deleveraging to easing"],"drivers_zh":["央行2018年10月7日降准100bp","MSCI 2019年3月宣布A股纳入比例提升至20%","北向资金持续流入","成长风格流动性驱动反弹","政策从去杠杆正式转向宽松"],"title":"PBOC RRR Cuts and MSCI Inclusion Recovery","title_zh":"央行降准叠加MSCI扩容驱动反弹"},"2019-04-19":{"body":"After a brief ceasefire, the US re-escalated in May 2019 raising tariffs to 25% on $200bn of Chinese goods, and added restrictions on Huawei in May 2019, maintaining elevated uncertainty through the year. In February-March 2020 COVID-19 hit: Wuhan was locked down in January, with nationwide restrictions through March. SHCOMP fell 18.7%; growth style led relatively (electronics +16.6%, computers +5%) while cyclicals (transport -28%, steel -32%) suffered most. Non-bank Financials fell 21.2% (19th/28), a middle-of-pack result consistent with the defensives-led flight-to-safety rotation in the ctx.","body_zh":"短暂休战后，美国于2019年5月重启贸易摩擦（对2000亿美元中国商品关税升至25%）并限制华为，全年不确定性维持高位。2020年2至3月，新冠疫情叠加武汉封城（1月）及全国性管控（至3月）形成二次冲击。上证综指跌18.7%，成长板块相对领先（电子+16.6%、计算机+5%），周期板块跌幅最深（交运-28%、钢铁-32%）。非银金融跌21.2%（28行业第19），处于中游，与ctx防御板块相对领先的避险轮动信号一致。","drivers":["US tariff re-escalation to 25% on $200bn May 2019","Huawei entity list restrictions May 2019","COVID-19 Wuhan lockdown Jan-Mar 2020","risk-off flight to defensives","SHCOMP -19% broad decline"],"drivers_zh":["2019年5月美国对2000亿商品关税升至25%","2019年5月华为实体清单限制","2020年1-3月新冠武汉封城及全国管控","避险情绪驱动资金转向防御板块","上证综指-19%全市场下跌"],"title":"Trade War Re-escalation and COVID Shock","title_zh":"贸易战再度升级叠加新冠疫情冲击"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"On July 6 2020 China Securities Journal published a front-page editorial calling for a healthy bull market, sending the CSI 300 up nearly 6% in a single day and pushing SHCOMP to a five-year high. This followed the PBOC post-COVID easing cycle (two RRR cuts in 2020) and China's V-shaped economic recovery. SHCOMP gained 29.7% to the July 9 peak; growth-style led (growth +10.9pp), with services (+88%) and food and bev (+62%) outperforming. Non-bank Financials rose 39% (8th/28), benefiting from the bull-market narrative and rising volumes, though the dominant rotation was toward consumer services and tech rather than brokers specifically.","body_zh":"2020年7月6日，国家级金融媒体中国证券报头版发文呼吁健康牛市，单日推动沪深300上涨近6%，上证综指涨至五年新高。背景为央行后疫情宽松周期（2020年两次降准）及中国经济V型复苏。上证综指至7月9日顶部涨幅29.7%，成长风格领先（+10.9pp），服务（+88%）和食饮（+62%）表现突出。非银金融上涨39%（28行业第8），受益于牛市情绪及交投量回升，但主导轮动在消费服务和科技，而非券商本身。","drivers":["state media healthy bull market editorial Jul 6 2020","PBOC post-COVID easing two RRR cuts in 2020","China V-shaped economic recovery","consumer services and growth rotation","retail investor sentiment surge"],"drivers_zh":["2020年7月6日官媒头版宣扬健康牛市","央行后疫情两次降准宽松","中国经济V型快速复苏","消费服务与成长股轮动","散户投资情绪急速回暖"],"title":"State Media Bull Call Sparks Recovery","title_zh":"官媒牛市号召推动流动性反弹"},"2020-07-09":{"body":"In November 2020 regulators suspended Ant Group's $34.5bn IPO days before listing, signalling a sweeping fintech crackdown. Through 2021 Beijing's common prosperity regulatory wave targeted platform companies, asset managers, and capital markets, including tighter rules on private equity, fund sales, and securities licenses. SHCOMP fell only 15.5% over this 28-month leg but Non-bank Financials dropped 47.3% (30th/31): energy and materials (power equipment +62%, metals +28%) led while brokers and media bore the brunt of the regulatory risk premium expansion. The ctx confirms value-style dominance and broker-specific lagging, not a broad market selloff.","body_zh":"2020年11月，监管机构于蚂蚁集团345亿美元IPO上市前数日叫停，预示金融科技强监管周期开启。2021年起共同富裕监管浪潮席卷平台企业、资管机构及资本市场，涵盖私募、基金销售及证券牌照多个环节。上证综指这28个月仅跌15.5%，但非银金融大跌47.3%（31行业第30）：电气设备（+62%）、金属（+28%）领涨，券商及传媒跌幅居前，监管风险溢价持续压制券商估值。ctx确认价值风格主导、券商特异性走弱。","drivers":["Ant Group IPO suspension Nov 2020","common prosperity regulatory campaign 2021","fintech and asset management crackdown","broker valuation de-rating on regulatory risk premium","value-cyclicals led while financials lagged"],"drivers_zh":["2020年11月蚂蚁集团IPO被叫停","2021年共同富裕监管运动","金融科技及资管强监管整治","监管风险溢价压制券商估值重估","能源/周期领涨、金融板块拖累"],"title":"Common Prosperity and Fintech Crackdown Crush Brokers","title_zh":"共同富裕与金融科技整治重压非银金融"},"2022-10-28":{"body":"From early November 2022 social media speculation about zero-COVID policy exit emerged; the CCP National Congress concluded October 22 with Xi Jinping securing a third term, after which policymakers signalled incremental reopening, culminating in China officially abandoning zero-COVID in December 2022. MSCI China gained 29% in November 2022 alone (best since 1999). Non-bank Financials rose 35.7% (3rd/31): growth-style led (growth +11.6pp), with brokers benefiting alongside media (+57%) and telecoms (+43%) as improved risk appetite and equity volume recovery boosted broker revenue expectations.","body_zh":"2022年11月初，社交媒体关于动态清零政策退出的传言发酵；第二十届党代会于10月22日闭幕后，政策层逐步释放重开信号，2022年12月中国正式放弃动态清零。MSCI中国11月单月涨幅29%（1999年以来最高）。非银金融上涨35.7%（31行业第3）：成长风格主导（+11.6pp），风险偏好回升和股市交投量增长驱动券商收入预期改善，伴随传媒（+57%）和通信（+43%）同步领涨。","drivers":["zero-COVID policy exit signals Nov-Dec 2022","CCP 20th congress third-term confirmation","reopening trade boosts risk appetite","equity volume recovery boosting broker revenue","growth-style media/telecoms/brokers leadership"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11-12月动态清零政策退出信号","二十大习近平连任确认","重开预期提振风险偏好","股市交投活跃改善券商收入预期","成长风格传媒/通信/券商同步领涨"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit and Reopening Rally","title_zh":"动态清零退出与经济重开驱动反弹"},"2023-08-04":{"body":"Country Garden warned of default on August 30 2023; Evergrande filed for US Chapter 15 bankruptcy in August 2023; Zhongrong Trust missed wealth management product payments in August 2023, spreading contagion. The CSRC halved stamp duty from 0.1% to 0.05% on August 28 2023 but this proved insufficient to reverse the risk-off trend. SHCOMP fell 11.1%; defensives led (coal +24.8%, utilities +7.2%, banks +6.4%) while growth lagged (computers -39%, real estate -42%). Non-bank Financials fell 27.6% (20th/31), consistent with flight-to-safety rotation where brokers underperform defensive income assets in a property-crisis-driven deleveraging environment.","body_zh":"2023年8月30日碧桂园发布违约风险预警，同月恒大在美申请第15章破产，中融国际信托于2023年8月起陆续发生理财产品兑付违约，恐慌蔓延资本市场。证监会于8月28日将印花税从0.1%减半至0.05%，但措施不足以扭转避险趋势。上证综指跌11.1%，防御板块领先（煤炭+24.8%、公用事业+7.2%、银行+6.4%），成长板块拖累（计算机-39%、地产-42%）。非银金融跌27.6%（31行业第20），与地产危机去杠杆环境中券商跑输防御性资产的避险轮动一致。","drivers":["Country Garden default warning Aug 30 2023","Evergrande US Chapter 15 bankruptcy Aug 2023","Zhongrong Trust WMP payment failures Aug 2023","CSRC stamp duty halved Aug 28 insufficient backstop","flight-to-safety coal/utilities/banks rotation"],"drivers_zh":["碧桂园2023年8月30日违约预警","恒大2023年8月在美申请破产","中融国际信托2023年8月理财兑付违约","证监会8月28日减半印花税但效果有限","资金向煤炭/公用事业/银行避险轮动"],"title":"Property Crisis and Trust Defaults Weigh on Brokers","title_zh":"地产危机与信托违约压制非银金融"},"2024-07-08":{"body":"On September 24 2024 the PBOC unveiled a comprehensive stimulus package: a 50bp RRR cut (releasing CNY1tn), a 20bp policy rate cut, a CNY500bn swap facility for brokers and funds to buy equities, and a CNY300bn re-lending facility for share buybacks. An off-schedule Politburo meeting on September 26 further confirmed expansionary resolve. The CSI 300 gained 16% in one week (best since 2008) and Shanghai exchange systems suffered processing glitches from record trading volumes. Non-bank Financials surged 71.2% (1st/31): the swap facility gave securities firms new balance-sheet capacity directly tied to equity market support, while the volume explosion boosted commission income, making this the most direct policy transmission to brokers in the dataset.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人民银行发布全面刺激组合拳：降准50bp（释放约1万亿元）、政策利率下调20bp、向券商及基金提供5000亿元互换便利用于购股、并向企业回购提供3000亿元再贷款。9月26日政治局超预期召开专题会议进一步确认扩张意志。CSI 300单周涨幅16%（2008年以来最大），上交所因成交量爆发出现系统拥堵。非银金融暴涨71.2%，位列31行业第1：互换便利直接扩大券商资产负债表并与托市目标挂钩，成交量创纪录大幅拉动佣金收入，是本数据集中政策对券商最直接的传导机制。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut Sep 24 2024","CNY500bn broker-fund equity swap facility","Politburo Sep 26 2024 expansionary signal","record trading volume explosion","growth-style and direct broker policy transmission"],"drivers_zh":["2024年9月24日央行降准50bp","5000亿元券商基金互换便利直接购股","9月26日政治局超预期宽松会议","成交量爆发创历史纪录","成长风格叠加政策直接传导至券商"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Stimulus Propels Brokers to Top","title_zh":"央行超级组合拳推动券商强势领涨"},"2024-11-07":{"body":"Following Donald Trump's November 2024 election victory, markets quickly priced escalating US-China tariffs; by 2025 the US imposed tariffs of up to 145% on Chinese goods. Risk aversion returned sharply: defensives led (banks +1.6%, autos -5.1%) while growth and leverage-exposed sectors sold off. Non-bank Financials fell 26% (30th/31), with brokers among the weakest performers: their high-beta and policy-sensitive nature means they suffer disproportionately during macro risk-off periods when trading volumes contract and retail investor sentiment collapses. SHCOMP fell 10.8% while defensives held up (-8.3%) vs cyclicals (-14.8%), confirming the flight-to-safety rotation in the ctx.","body_zh":"2024年11月特朗普当选后，市场迅速定价中美关税升级预期；2025年美国对华关税最终升至145%。避险情绪急速回升：防御板块领先（银行+1.6%、汽车-5.1%），成长和高杠杆板块大幅回调。非银金融跌26%（31行业第30），券商接近垫底：其高贝塔、强政策敏感特性导致在宏观风险偏好下行、交投萎缩及散户情绪崩溃时跌幅最深。上证综指跌10.8%，防御股（-8.3%）显著优于周期股（-14.8%），与ctx避险轮动信号一致。","drivers":["Trump election victory Nov 2024","US-China tariff escalation to 145% in 2025","risk-off flight to defensive sectors","broker high-beta retail-sentiment collapse","SHCOMP -10.8% broad decline"],"drivers_zh":["2024年11月特朗普当选","中美关税升级最终达145%","避险情绪驱动资金转向防御板块","高贝塔券商叠加散户情绪崩溃","上证综指-10.8%全面下跌"],"title":"Trump Tariff Shock: Brokers Bear the Brunt","title_zh":"特朗普关税冲击：券商再度领跌"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"DeepSeek's AI model release in late January 2025 revived global confidence in Chinese tech competitiveness, sparking rallies in semiconductors and electronics. A US-China tariff truce in May 2025 reduced trade-war uncertainty. The SHCOMP gained 31.9%; cyclicals strongly led (cyclicals avg +37.3% vs defensives +10.1%) and growth style dominated (growth +30.4pp): telecoms (+116%), metals (+109%), and electronics (+74%) led the charge. Non-bank Financials gained only 36.9% (10th/31), roughly in line with SHCOMP beta, because the dominant narrative was tech and commodity rather than capital-market stimulus, limiting broker-specific upside relative to the September 2024 surge.","body_zh":"2025年1月下旬DeepSeek AI模型发布，重燃全球对中国科技竞争力的信心，半导体和电子板块大涨。2025年5月中美达成关税休战协议，贸易战不确定性降低。上证综指涨31.9%，周期股强势领涨（均值+37.3% vs 防御+10.1%），成长风格主导（+30.4pp）：通信（+116%）、金属（+109%）、电子（+74%）领衔。非银金融仅涨36.9%（31行业第10），基本与上证综指贝塔同步，因本轮主线为科技/大宗商品而非资本市场直接刺激，限制了相对于2024年9月行情的券商超额弹性。","drivers":["DeepSeek AI release late Jan 2025 tech confidence","US-China tariff truce May 2025","telecoms/metals/electronics dominant leadership","cyclicals and growth-style led rally","no direct capital-market policy tool unlike Sep 2024"],"drivers_zh":["2025年1月下旬DeepSeek发布提振科技信心","2025年5月中美关税休战协议","通信/金属/电子三强领涨","周期与成长风格主导行情","缺乏类似2024年9月的资本市场直接刺激工具"],"title":"DeepSeek AI and Trade Truce Fuel Recovery","title_zh":"DeepSeek人工智能与贸易休战驱动反弹"},"2026-01-06":{"body":"After the SHCOMP hit decade-long highs in late 2025 and early 2026 on record turnover driven by leveraged bets, the CSRC launched a slow-bull regulatory tightening campaign: restricting margin financing growth, curbing high-frequency traders' data access, and targeting social-media stock promoters. The sector rotation sharply reversed away from brokers: telecoms (+56.1%), electronics (+31.3%), and coal (+24.5%) led while Non-bank Financials ranked dead last (31st/31, -24.5%). SHCOMP fell only 3% overall, meaning brokers underperformed the index by more than 21pp in a near-flat market: a pure sector de-rating on regulatory tightening, not a macro selloff.","body_zh":"2025年末至2026年初上证综指在杠杆资金推动下创十年新高后，证监会推行慢牛监管运动：收紧融资融券增速、限制高频交易商获取交易所数据、整顿社媒荐股大V。行业轮动急转：通信（+56.1%）、电子（+31.3%）和煤炭（+24.5%）领涨，非银金融成为唯一垫底行业（31/31，-24.5%）。上证综指整体仅跌3%，券商较指数跑输超21个百分点——在市场近乎平稳的环境下，纯属监管收紧引发的板块估值重估，而非宏观性普跌。","drivers":["CSRC slow-bull regulatory tightening 2026","margin financing growth restriction","high-frequency trading data curbs","social media stock promoter crackdowns","sector de-rating telecoms/tech rotation away from brokers"],"drivers_zh":["证监会2026年慢牛监管运动","融资融券增速管控","限制高频交易商数据获取","整顿社媒荐股行为","行业估值重估资金由券商转向通信/科技"],"title":"CSRC Slow-Bull Controls Trigger Broker De-rating","title_zh":"证监会慢牛管控触发券商估值重估"}},"now":"Non-bank Financials (brokers/securities) is in a Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 24th out of 31 Shenwan industries with a -17.8% return this leg, sitting below the 200-day moving average. The current tape is growth-and-tech led: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) dominate while SHCOMP is barely positive at +1.6%, leaving brokers far behind as capital chases AI-hardware and sovereign-tech themes rather than financial intermediaries. The BUY signal (win-rate 73.9%) reflects a mean-reversion setup from a deep trough, but the near-term headwind is the absence of a fresh policy catalyst: no new RRR/LPR cut or equity-market stimulus has been announced since the CSRC imposed slow-bull regulatory controls following January 2026's decade-high. Until a new capital-market reform round or stimulus cycle arrives, brokers are likely to continue lagging growth-beta peers.","now_zh":"非银金融（以券商为主）截至2026年6月下旬处于筑底阶段，在31个申万行业中排名第24，本段涨跌幅-17.8%，股价位于200日均线以下。当前市场以成长/科技风格主导，电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）领涨，上证综指仅+1.6%——资金追逐AI算力及科技自主化主题，券商显著冷落。BUY信号源于深度超跌后的均值回复胜率（73.9%），但近期阻力在于缺乏政策催化：自2026年1月上证创十年新高后监管推行\"慢牛\"管控，佣金及通道费用持续受压。在新一轮刺激政策或资本市场改革出台之前，券商短期大概率继续跑输成长主线。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801880":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"From February 2014, PBOC monetary easing (benchmark lending-rate cuts in Nov 2014 and Feb 2015, plus successive RRR cuts) and regulatory liberalisation of margin financing inflated a broad A-share leveraged bull market. Margin balances surged from under RMB 400bn to over RMB 2.2trn by June 2015, flooding all cyclicals with retail leverage. The Shanghai-Hong Kong Stock Connect launched November 2014 added incremental inflow demand. Autos gained 163.6% but ranked only 22nd/28, lagging Computers (+256%) and Steel (+245%) — the move was pure index beta on SHCOMP +144.4%, not sector-specific outperformance; cyclicals as a group returned 200.7% vs defensives 126.6%.","body_zh":"2014年2月起，央行货币宽松（2014年11月及2015年2月两次基准贷款利率下调，叠加多次降准）叠加融资融券监管松绑，推动A股出现大规模杠杆牛市。融资余额从不足4000亿元飙升至2015年6月逾2.2万亿元，散户杠杆资金全面涌入周期板块。2014年11月沪港通开通亦带来增量境外需求。汽车板块涨幅163.6%，但仅排名第22/28，大幅落后于计算机（+256%）和钢铁（+245%），涨幅主要来自上证综指+144.4%的贝塔效应，并非行业超额收益；周期板块均涨200.7%，防御板块均涨126.6%。","drivers":["PBOC rate/RRR cuts","margin financing surge","index beta","retail leverage","Shanghai-HK Connect inflows"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准","融资融券爆发","指数贝塔","散户杠杆","沪港通资金流入"],"title":"Leveraged Bull: Margin Surge Lifts All Cyclicals","title_zh":"杠杆牛市：融资盘涌入带动周期全面上涨"},"2015-06-12":{"body":"On June 12, 2015, the leveraged A-share bubble burst as regulators restricted umbrella trusts and off-exchange margin lending. Within four weeks, SHCOMP fell 32.1%; cyclicals lost 43.0% on average versus defensives -30.4%, as forced margin liquidations hit high-beta names hardest. Autos fell 39.8%, ranking 11th/28 — worse than Banks (-10.6%) but not the worst cyclical, as Defence and Coal names collapsed more. The selloff was pure deleveraging panic, not an auto-specific event; value stocks led as investors rotated to lower-beta, lower-leveraged names.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日，监管层收紧伞形信托及场外配资，A股杠杆泡沫刺破。四周内上证综指下跌32.1%，周期板块均跌43.0%，防御板块均跌30.4%，强制平仓集中打压高贝塔板块。汽车下跌39.8%，排名第11/28，处于中游——劣于银行（-10.6%），但好于国防和煤炭等跌幅更深的板块。此次下跌为纯粹去杠杆恐慌，并非汽车行业自身问题；价值股相对占优，投资者向低贝塔、低杠杆品种轮动。","drivers":["margin call liquidation","regulatory deleveraging","index beta selloff","flight to defensives/value"],"drivers_zh":["融资平仓潮","监管去杠杆","指数贝塔下跌","防御/价值避险轮动"],"title":"Bubble Burst: Margin Calls Hit Cyclicals Hardest","title_zh":"泡沫破裂：强平潮重创周期板块"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"On July 8-9, 2015, the government launched a coordinated market rescue: the China Securities Finance Corporation (CSFC) injected over RMB 1.3trn in liquidity; over 1,400 companies applied trading halts; the PBOC provided emergency liquidity to brokers. SHCOMP rebounded 13.9% from the July 8 trough, with cyclicals outperforming (+37.1% vs defensives +16.8%) as the most oversold names bounced hardest. Autos gained 26.0%, ranking 17th/28 — a middle-of-pack cyclical beta rebound. Coal (+104%) and Defence (+78%) led as the most oversold sectors recovered fastest.","body_zh":"2015年7月8-9日，政府启动协调救市：中证金融公司注入逾1.3万亿元流动性，逾1400家公司申请停牌，央行紧急向券商提供流动性支持。上证综指从7月8日低点反弹13.9%，周期板块领涨（均值+37.1%，防御板块+16.8%），超跌品种弹幅最大。汽车涨幅26.0%，排名第17/28，为中游周期贝塔反弹。煤炭（+104%）和国防（+78%）涨幅居前，为超跌最深的板块率先修复。","drivers":["CSFC state bailout","emergency liquidity injection","oversold cyclical rebound","trading halt coordination"],"drivers_zh":["中证金救市","紧急流动性注入","超跌周期修复","协调停牌"],"title":"State Rescue: CSFC Bailout Triggers Cyclical Rebound","title_zh":"国家队救市：中证金援助引发周期反弹"},"2015-08-17":{"body":"On August 11, 2015, the PBOC shocked markets with a surprise 1.9% CNY devaluation against the USD — the largest single-day move in decades — triggering a second leg down in A-shares as global risk-off sentiment intensified. SHCOMP fell 24.8%; defensives led at -20.6% vs cyclicals at -32.9%, confirming risk-off dynamics. Autos fell 32.5%, ranking 15th/28 — the currency shock raised import-component costs and stoked investor fears of a hard landing. Agriculture (-35%), Defence (-43%), and Coal (-46%) fell even harder as the broad cyclical unwind continued.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日，央行出人意料地将人民币对美元一次性贬值1.9%，为数十年来最大单日跌幅，A股随即再度下挫，全球风险规避情绪升温。上证综指下跌24.8%，防御板块相对占优（均值-20.6%，周期-32.9%），确认风险规避格局。汽车下跌32.5%，排名第15/28——汇率冲击推高进口零部件成本，并加剧投资者对经济硬着陆的担忧。农业（-35%）、国防（-43%）和煤炭（-46%）跌幅更深，周期板块整体去杠杆持续。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock","global risk-off","import cost pressure","hard landing fears","index beta"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","全球风险规避","进口成本上升","硬着陆担忧","指数贝塔下跌"],"title":"Yuan Devaluation Shock Crushes Growth Cyclicals","title_zh":"人民币突然贬值冲击成长周期股"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"In October 2015, Beijing announced a vehicle purchase tax cut from 10% to 5% on passenger cars with engines 1.6L and below, effective immediately through end-2016. This demand-side stimulus was sector-specific: October 2015 saw a 16.3% month-on-month surge in sub-1.6L vehicle sales to 1.33 million units. Autos ranked 8th/28 in this leg (+45.7%), outperforming its cyclical peers, while the broader growth-style tape (Computers +63%, Electronics +54%) and SHCOMP +18.9% also provided tailwinds. This is the clearest example of a policy-catalyst leg with genuine sector alpha above the index.","body_zh":"2015年10月，北京宣布对1.6升及以下排量乘用车购置税减半（由10%降至5%），即时生效至2016年底。这一需求端专项刺激立竿见影：当月1.6升以下车型销量环比大涨16.3%至133万辆。汽车板块在本轮行情中涨幅达45.7%，排名第8/28，跑赢周期同类板块，叠加成长风格行情（计算机+63%、电子+54%）及上证综指+18.9%的助力，是历史上最典型的政策催化带来真实行业超额收益的案例。","drivers":["vehicle purchase tax cut to 5%","sub-1.6L sales surge +16.3% MoM","policy demand stimulus","growth-style tailwind"],"drivers_zh":["购置税减半至5%","小排量车销量激增","需求端政策刺激","成长风格顺风"],"title":"Purchase Tax Cut Sparks Auto Sector Outperformance","title_zh":"购置税减半：汽车行业显著跑赢大市"},"2015-12-30":{"body":"China's newly introduced market circuit breaker triggered four times in the first four trading days of January 2016, accelerating panic selling as investors rushed to exit before halts locked them in. The RMB fixing continued to slide (USD/CNY crossed 6.59), stoking capital flight fears. SHCOMP fell 25.7%; defensives led at -24.4% vs cyclicals at -29.5%, a classic flight-to-safety rotation. Autos fell 30.5%, ranking 16th/28 — a broad cyclical beta drawdown rather than auto-specific news. The circuit breaker mechanism was suspended on January 8, 2016 after worsening the crash.","body_zh":"中国新推出的股市熔断机制在2016年1月前四个交易日连续触发四次，引发踩踏式抛售——投资者争相在熔断前出逃。人民币中间价持续走低（美元兑人民币突破6.59），加剧资本外流担忧。上证综指下跌25.7%，防御板块相对占优（均值-24.4%，周期-29.5%），为典型的避险轮动格局。汽车下跌30.5%，排名第16/28，属于周期贝塔性下跌而非行业自身利空。熔断机制于2016年1月8日暂停，在此之前反而加剧了恐慌。","drivers":["circuit breaker panic","CNY capital flight fears","index beta selloff","flight to defensives"],"drivers_zh":["熔断恐慌","人民币资本外流担忧","指数贝塔下跌","防御避险轮动"],"title":"Circuit Breaker Panic: Broad Deleveraging Hits Autos","title_zh":"熔断机制恐慌：全面去杠杆冲击汽车板块"},"2016-01-28":{"body":"After the circuit-breaker suspension on January 8, 2016, markets stabilised as the PBOC injected liquidity via MLF operations and the government extended the 1.6L purchase tax cut at a reduced 7.5% rate through end-2017. Supply-side reform (capacity cuts in Steel and Coal) drove a value-led quality rotation: Food & Beverage (+84.5%) and Metals (+72.2%) led while growth-style sectors underperformed (Media -16.3%). Autos gained 40.0%, ranking 8th/28 — well above average (SHCOMP +27.1%) — benefiting from the sustained purchase tax incentive and a value-cyclical style tilt (growth -20.9pp vs value) over this 21-month leg. Full-year 2016 auto sales hit a record 24.3 million units.","body_zh":"2016年1月8日熔断机制暂停后，央行通过MLF操作注入流动性，市场企稳。政府将1.6升以下购置税优惠延续至2017年底（调整为7.5%）。供给侧改革（钢铁、煤炭去产能）推动价值风格主导、质量轮动：食品饮料（+84.5%）和有色金属（+72.2%）领涨，成长风格落后（传媒-16.3%）。汽车涨幅40.0%，排名第8/28，显著跑赢大市（上证综指+27.1%），受益于购置税刺激延续及价值-周期风格倾斜（价值跑赢成长20.9ppt），本轮行情长达21个月。2016年全年汽车销量创历史纪录2430万辆。","drivers":["purchase tax extension 7.5% thru 2017","supply-side reform","value/quality rotation","PBOC MLF liquidity","record 24.3M auto sales 2016"],"drivers_zh":["购置税延续至7.5%","供给侧改革","价值/优质轮动","央行MLF注流动性","2016年汽车销量创纪录2430万辆"],"title":"Supply-Side Reform & Tax Extension Drive Value Rally","title_zh":"供给侧改革+购置税延续：价值风格主导的复苏"},"2017-10-09":{"body":"From October 2017, a confluence of headwinds drove a 12-month bear leg for Autos (-43.2%): the US-China trade war escalated with 25% US tariffs on Chinese autos announced June 2018; domestic auto sales turned negative YoY in mid-2018 (the first market contraction in over 20 years, full-year 2018 sales -4.1%); and the government financial deleveraging campaign (P2P crackdowns, shadow banking restrictions) tightened credit. Defensives led at -19.5% vs cyclicals at -33.7%, confirming risk-off rotation; value outperformed growth by 12.5pp. Autos ranked 19th/28, underperforming the broad cyclical average.","body_zh":"2017年10月起，多重利空叠加推动汽车板块步入长达12个月的下行周期（-43.2%）：中美贸易战升级，2018年6月美国宣布对华汽车加征25%关税；2018年年中国内汽车销量首次同比转负（逾20年首次，全年销量-4.1%）；政府金融去杠杆（整治P2P、影子银行）收紧信用环境。防御板块相对占优（均值-19.5%，周期-33.7%），确认风险规避格局；价值跑赢成长12.5ppt。汽车（-43.2%）排名第19/28，落后周期板块整体均值。","drivers":["US-China trade war 25% auto tariffs","domestic auto sales first YoY contraction","financial deleveraging","flight to defensives/value"],"drivers_zh":["中美贸易战对华汽车加征25%关税","国内汽车销量首现同比负增长","金融去杠杆","防御/价值避险轮动"],"title":"Trade War & Credit Crunch Drag Autos Into Bear","title_zh":"贸易战+信用紧缩：汽车步入熊市"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"From late October 2018, optimism around a US-China trade truce (G20 Dec 2018, 90-day pause confirmed Dec 1), PBOC RRR cuts (four cuts totalling 250bp through 2018-2019), and the August 2019 LPR reform (linking new loans to market rates) supported a broad rally. SHCOMP gained 31.2%; growth led by 17.8pp over value as sentiment shifted to risk-on. Autos gained 44.7%, ranking 13th/28 — a market-beta recovery rather than a standout; Agriculture (+75.4%) and Telecoms (+63.7%) led. The domestic auto market remained contractionary through H1 2019 but stocks re-rated on policy easing expectations.","body_zh":"2018年10月下旬起，中美贸易停火预期（2018年12月G20峰会，确认90天暂停）、央行降准（2018-2019年累计降准250bp四次）以及2019年8月LPR利率市场化改革提振宽松预期，推动市场整体反弹。上证综指上涨31.2%；成长风格跑赢价值17.8ppt，情绪转向风险偏好。汽车板块涨幅44.7%，排名第13/28，属于市场贝塔修复；农业（+75.4%）和通信（+63.7%）领涨。国内汽车市场至2019年上半年仍持续负增长，但政策宽松预期推动板块估值修复。","drivers":["trade truce G20 Dec 2018","PBOC RRR cuts 250bp","LPR reform Aug 2019","growth-style re-rating","risk-on beta"],"drivers_zh":["贸易停火G20峰会","央行降准250bp","LPR改革","成长风格重估","风险偏好贝塔"],"title":"Trade Truce & LPR Reform Spark Cyclical Recovery","title_zh":"贸易停火+LPR改革：周期板块反弹"},"2019-04-17":{"body":"On May 5, 2019, Trump raised tariffs from 10% to 25% on USD 200bn of Chinese goods; China retaliated June 1. On August 5, the yuan broke 7.0 per USD for the first time since 2008 after Trump threatened tariffs on a further USD 300bn — the US Treasury labelled China a currency manipulator. Domestic auto sales had suffered 18 consecutive months of YoY declines by August 2019. Autos fell 26.5%, ranking dead last at #28/28 — a broad selloff compounded by sector-specific fundamental weakness: the worst auto-sales slump in a generation.","body_zh":"2019年5月5日，特朗普宣布对2000亿美元中国商品关税从10%提至25%；中国于6月1日反制。8月5日，美元兑人民币突破7.0（2008年以来首次），美国财政部将中国列为汇率操纵国。至2019年8月，国内汽车销量已连续18个月同比负增长。汽车板块下跌26.5%，排名垫底第28/28——大盘下跌叠加行业基本面恶化，创下数十年来最严峻的销量下滑。","drivers":["trade war tariff 25% escalation","yuan breaks 7.0 per USD","18-month auto sales contraction","sector-specific laggard","currency manipulator label"],"drivers_zh":["贸易战关税升至25%","人民币破7","连续18个月汽车销量负增长","行业自身落后","汇率操纵国标签"],"title":"Trade War Re-escalation: Autos Dead Last in Selloff","title_zh":"贸易战再升级：汽车板块居末"},"2019-08-07":{"body":"From August 2019, A-shares recovered on de-escalation: the Phase One trade deal framework was agreed December 2019, signed January 15, 2020. In April 2020, Beijing extended NEV subsidies two years to end-2022 (reduced 10% vs 2019 levels) to offset COVID-19 demand shocks. The electronics-led growth tape (Electronics +93%, Computers +60%) carried SHCOMP +8.8%, but Autos outperformed the index with +27.2%, ranking 9th/28, as early signs of domestic sales stabilisation emerged alongside Phase One tariff rollback on selected categories.","body_zh":"2019年8月起，中美关系缓和推动A股回升：2019年12月就第一阶段贸易协议框架达成共识，2020年1月15日正式签署。2020年4月，北京将新能源补贴延续两年至2022年底（较2019年标准降低10%）以对冲新冠疫情冲击需求。以电子（+93%）和计算机（+60%）领涨的成长风格行情带动大市走高（上证综指+8.8%），汽车板块以+27.2%跑赢指数，排名第9/28，国内汽车销量企稳初现叠加第一阶段协议部分关税回调提供支撑。","drivers":["Phase One trade deal signed Jan 2020","NEV subsidy extension to 2022","growth-style tape","auto sales stabilisation"],"drivers_zh":["第一阶段协议签署","新能源补贴延至2022年","成长风格行情","汽车销量企稳"],"title":"Phase One Trade Truce & NEV Subsidy Extension Rally","title_zh":"第一阶段贸易协议+新能源补贴延续推动反弹"},"2020-02-25":{"body":"From February 25, 2020, markets priced a deep global recession as COVID-19 spread globally. Wuhan auto plants (SAIC, Dongfeng) had already been shut; China's February auto sales collapsed to near zero. Autos fell 21.9%, ranking 27th/28 — near-worst as a production-intensive, demand-cyclical sector hit by simultaneous supply-chain shutdown and demand destruction. Value outperformed (Banks and Construction led) while growth stocks were also sold (Electronics -30.1%). The selloff lasted only until late March as the government response rapidly gained confidence.","body_zh":"2020年2月25日起，新冠疫情全球蔓延，市场开始定价深度全球衰退。武汉汽车工厂（上汽、东风）已停产，2月国内汽车销量几乎归零。汽车板块下跌21.9%，排名第27/28，为跌幅最深的板块之一——生产密集型+需求周期属性双重受损。价值股相对占优（银行、建筑领涨），成长股亦遭抛售（电子-30.1%）。随着政府应对措施迅速见效，下跌至3月底即告结束。","drivers":["COVID-19 global shock","Wuhan auto plant shutdowns","demand destruction near zero","flight to safety/value","supply chain collapse"],"drivers_zh":["新冠全球冲击","武汉工厂停产","需求骤降至近零","避险/价值轮动","供应链崩溃"],"title":"COVID-19 Global Panic: Autos Among Worst Hit","title_zh":"新冠全球恐慌：汽车板块重创居末"},"2020-03-23":{"body":"From March 2020, a confluence of structural and cyclical catalysts drove Autos to the third-best Shenwan sector (+107.7%, ranked 3rd/28) over 21 months: April 2020 extension of NEV subsidies to 2022; September 2020 Xi Jinping's 'carbon neutrality by 2060' pledge and the NEV Development Plan 2021-2035 (NEVs as mainstream by 2035); BYD's Blade Battery breakthrough in early 2020; CATL's lithium iron phosphate renaissance; and China's post-COVID economic recovery underpinning consumer demand. Power Equipment (+212%) and Metals (+138%) led, with Autos a strong co-leader — the NEV theme drove genuine sector alpha above the SHCOMP +34.3% beta.","body_zh":"2020年3月起，多重结构性与周期性催化剂共振，推动汽车板块在21个月内涨幅达107.7%，排名第3/28：2020年4月新能源补贴延续至2022年；2020年9月习近平提出'2060年碳中和'目标及《新能源汽车产业发展规划（2021-2035）》；比亚迪刀片电池2020年初突破；宁德时代磷酸铁锂复兴；后疫情经济复苏带动消费需求。电力设备（+212%）和有色金属（+138%）领涨，汽车强势共同领涨——新能源主题驱动了显著高于上证综指+34.3%贝塔的行业超额收益。","drivers":["NEV Development Plan 2021-2035","dual carbon 2060 pledge","BYD blade battery breakthrough","EV subsidy extension to 2022","COVID recovery demand"],"drivers_zh":["新能源汽车产业规划2021-2035","双碳2060目标","比亚迪刀片电池","新能源补贴延续至2022年","后疫情需求复苏"],"title":"NEV Super-Cycle: COVID Stimulus & Dual Carbon Boom","title_zh":"新能源超级周期：新冠刺激与双碳目标共振"},"2021-12-02":{"body":"From December 2021, China's 'common prosperity' regulatory campaign (tech crackdowns from mid-2021 spreading to education and platform giants) drove a sweeping rotation from growth to value. Coal (+6.7%), Real Estate (-1.8%), and Banks (-4.7%) led while growth-heavy NEV names collapsed: Autos fell 37.8%, ranking dead last at 28th/31 as the sector that benefited most in the prior leg suffered the sharpest mean-reversion. The imminent end of NEV subsidies (scheduled Dec 2022) and early EV margin pressure contributed. The value-over-growth rotation was 16.1pp, the most extreme style tilt of the post-2020 period.","body_zh":"2021年12月起，中国'共同富裕'监管整顿（2021年中启动的科技打压，蔓延至教育和平台企业）推动市场从成长风格全面切换至价值风格。煤炭（+6.7%）、房地产（-1.8%）和银行（-4.7%）相对占优，而成长属性强的新能源板块重挫：汽车下跌37.8%，排名垫底第28/31，作为上一轮涨幅最大的板块遭受最剧烈的均值回归。新能源补贴将于2022年底到期及电动车利润率承压的早期信号亦构成拖累。价值跑赢成长16.1ppt，为2020年以来风格分化最极端的一次。","drivers":["common prosperity regulatory crackdown","growth-to-value rotation","NEV subsidy phase-out approaching Dec 2022","mean reversion post-NEV boom"],"drivers_zh":["共同富裕监管整顿","成长转价值轮动","新能源补贴临近到期","新能源牛市后均值回归"],"title":"Common Prosperity Rotation Crushes NEV/Growth Names","title_zh":"共同富裕轮动：成长/新能源股跌幅居首"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"From April 26, 2022, A-shares bounced from their COVID-lockdown nadir as Shanghai's two-month lockdown ended in late May and Beijing unveiled support: Shanghai released 50 stimulus measures on May 29 (including 40,000 new car plates and EV trade-in cash grants); Beijing announced infrastructure stimulus; and the State Council published a '33 measures' economic support package. Autos ranked 2nd/31 (+56.7%), co-leading with Power Equipment (+57%), as the NEV narrative (CATL's expansion, BYD record sales) reignited. Cyclicals led at +19.9% vs defensives +6.7%; growth outpaced value by 12.5pp.","body_zh":"2022年4月26日起，A股从新冠封控低点反弹——上海长达两个月的封控于5月底解除，北京密集出台政策：上海5月29日推出50条刺激措施（含4万个新增车牌及新能源以旧换新补贴）；北京宣布基础设施刺激；国务院发布'33条'经济支撑方案。汽车排名第2/31（+56.7%），与电力设备（+57%）共同领涨，新能源叙事（宁德时代扩张、比亚迪销量创纪录）重燃。周期板块均值+19.9%，防御+6.7%；成长跑赢价值12.5ppt。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown exit May 2022","EV trade-in stimulus measures","state '33 measures' support package","NEV narrative reignition","cyclical risk-on rebound"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封2022年5月","新能源以旧换新补贴","国务院'33条'经济支撑","新能源叙事重燃","周期风险偏好反弹"],"title":"Shanghai Lockdown Exit: State Stimulus Reignites EVs","title_zh":"上海解封：国家刺激政策推升新能源车"},"2022-08-01":{"body":"From August 2022, Autos suffered a sector-specific bear leg (-27.3%, ranked 30th/31): NEV subsidies expired December 31, 2022 after 12 years; Tesla launched a price war in October 2022 (cutting Models 3/Y in China), followed by a second cut in January 2023 reducing prices 13-24%; BYD and peers raised prices in November 2022 before being forced into their own price cuts. The SHCOMP was nearly flat (+0.2%), but Autos dramatically underperformed as growth tape rotated to Media (+46.6%) and Computers (+26.9%). Defensives outperformed cyclicals (-2.5% vs -8.9%).","body_zh":"2022年8月起，汽车板块遭受行业特有的下行周期（-27.3%，排名第30/31）：12年来首次新能源补贴于2022年12月31日正式到期；特斯拉2022年10月在华降价（Model 3/Y），2023年1月再次降价13-24%；比亚迪等车企被迫跟随降价。同期上证综指几近平盘（+0.2%），但汽车板块大幅落后，成长风格轮动至传媒（+46.6%）和计算机（+26.9%）。防御板块跑赢周期（-2.5% vs -8.9%）。","drivers":["NEV subsidy expiry Dec 2022","Tesla China price war Oct 2022","EV margin compression","sector-specific laggard vs flat SHCOMP","growth rotation to tech/media"],"drivers_zh":["新能源补贴到期2022年12月","特斯拉中国价格战","新能源利润承压","行业落后于平盘大市","成长风格轮向科技/传媒"],"title":"NEV Subsidy Expiry & Tesla Price War Crush Auto Margins","title_zh":"新能源补贴到期+特斯拉价格战冲击利润"},"2023-04-25":{"body":"From late April 2023, Autos ranked #1/31 (+19.4%) in a broadly falling market (SHCOMP -6.9%, cyclicals avg -5.5%, defensives avg -5.0%) — a rare instance of sector-specific outperformance decoupled from the index. Key catalysts: Huawei's AITO (Seres collaboration) gained market traction with the M7/M9 launches; China 2023 vehicle exports surged 57.2% YoY to a record 5.22 million units with NEV exports +61.5%; and BYD led global EV sales. The sector traded on the emerging global competitiveness narrative, independent of the broader market's property-deflation funk.","body_zh":"2023年4月下旬起，在大市整体下跌（上证综指-6.9%，周期均值-5.5%，防御均值-5.0%）的背景下，汽车板块排名第1/31（+19.4%），为罕见的行业独立超额表现案例。核心催化剂：华为AITO（赛力斯合作）M7/M9车型上市获市场认可；2023年全年中国整车出口同比激增57.2%至创纪录的522万辆，新能源出口+61.5%；比亚迪引领全球电动车销量。板块交易逻辑转向中国汽车全球竞争力叙事，与大市房地产通缩主线解耦。","drivers":["Huawei AITO M7/M9 smart car launches","China auto export record 5.22M units +57% YoY","NEV global competitiveness narrative","BYD global EV leadership","sector decoupled from falling SHCOMP"],"drivers_zh":["华为AITO M7/M9智能汽车上市","中国汽车出口创纪录522万辆同比+57%","新能源全球竞争力叙事","比亚迪全球电动车领先","板块独立于下跌大市"],"title":"Huawei Smart-Car & Export Surge: Autos Lead Falling Market","title_zh":"华为智能汽车+出口激增：汽车在跌市中独领风骚"},"2023-11-28":{"body":"From late November 2023, A-shares fell broadly (SHCOMP -11.1%) with defensives leading (Coal +6.5%, Banks +5.5%) in a classic flight-to-safety rotation — value outperformed growth by 13.7pp. Autos fell 27.9%, ranking 28th/31, as the prior leg's outperformance fully reversed: profit-taking on high-valuation Huawei/smart-car names, mounting concerns about 2024 EV price war intensification (Tesla had cut China prices multiple times in 2023), and a deteriorating China macro (property crisis deepening). The sector underperformed even the broad cyclical average (-16.4% vs defensives -9.9%).","body_zh":"2023年11月底起，A股整体下跌（上证综指-11.1%），防御板块主导（煤炭+6.5%、银行+5.5%），为典型的避险轮动——价值跑赢成长13.7ppt。汽车下跌27.9%，排名第28/31，上一轮超额涨幅全面回吐：华为/智能车高估值品种获利了结、2024年电动车价格战深化的忧虑（特斯拉2023年已多次在华降价）以及中国宏观恶化（房地产危机持续）共同施压。板块跌幅亦深于周期板块均值（-16.4%，防御-9.9%）。","drivers":["flight to safety/defensives","EV price war intensification fears 2024","profit-taking on smart-car rally","China macro deterioration/property crisis","value-over-growth rotation 13.7pp"],"drivers_zh":["避险/防御轮动","电动车价格战深化担忧","智能车行情获利了结","中国宏观恶化/房地产危机","价值跑赢成长13.7ppt"],"title":"Flight to Safety & EV Price War Fears Reverse Auto Rally","title_zh":"避险轮动+价格战担忧拖累汽车急剧回调"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"On February 8, 2024, China's National Team (state-backed ETFs) stepped in aggressively — net assets in the top 5 CSI 300 ETFs surged to USD 79.2bn as state funds purchased large-cap equities. The PBOC cut the RRR by 50bp in February 2024, providing over RMB 1trn in liquidity. In mid-2024, Beijing launched the auto trade-in subsidy scheme (up to RMB 10,000 per vehicle scrapped for a new car). September 2024 saw the PBOC fire its 'bazooka' (CNY 500bn equity-support swap facility + CNY 300bn share-buyback relending). Autos ranked 3rd/31 (+73.8%) over this 13-month leg, co-leading with Electronics (+81%) and Computers (+78%) in a broad growth-style re-rating (growth +31.1pp vs value).","body_zh":"2024年2月8日，中国'国家队'（国有ETF）大举入场——前五大沪深300 ETF净资产飙升至792亿美元；央行2024年2月降准50bp，释放逾1万亿元流动性。2024年年中北京推出汽车以旧换新补贴（旧车换新每辆最高补贴1万元）。2024年9月央行推出'组合拳'（5000亿元股票互换便利+3000亿元股票回购再贷款）。汽车板块在这13个月行情中涨幅达73.8%，排名第3/31，与电子（+81%）和计算机（+78%）共同领涨，成长风格大幅跑赢价值（+31.1ppt）。","drivers":["National Team CSI300 ETF buying Feb 2024","PBOC RRR cut 50bp Feb 2024","auto trade-in subsidy up to RMB 10,000","PBOC bazooka CNY 800bn Sept 2024","growth-style re-rating +31.1pp"],"drivers_zh":["国家队沪深300ETF大举买入","央行2024年2月降准50bp","汽车以旧换新补贴最高1万元","央行2024年9月8000亿组合拳","成长风格重估+31.1ppt"],"title":"National Team Rescue & Trade-In Subsidy Launch","title_zh":"国家队救市+以旧换新补贴：汽车板块强势反弹"},"2025-03-20":{"body":"On March 26, 2025, Trump announced 25% tariffs on all auto imports effective April 3, 2025; by early April total US tariffs on Chinese goods reached 145% with China retaliating at 125%. SHCOMP fell 7.7% as flight-to-safety dominated (defensives avg -3.7% vs cyclicals -10.6%); Agriculture (+7.1%) and Utilities (-1.7%) led while export-linked growth cyclicals were hardest hit. Autos fell 18.6%, ranking 28th/31, reflecting the dual risk of US tariff barriers on EV exports and global supply-chain disruption from Chinese rare-earth export controls announced in April 2025.","body_zh":"2025年3月26日，特朗普宣布对所有汽车进口加征25%关税，4月3日起生效；4月初美国对华商品总关税升至145%，中国以125%报复性关税反制。上证综指下跌7.7%，避险主导（防御均值-3.7%，周期-10.6%）；农业（+7.1%）和公用事业（-1.7%）相对占优，出口相关成长周期股跌幅最深。汽车下跌18.6%，排名第28/31，反映美国关税壁垒对电动车出口的双重风险，以及2025年4月中国稀土出口管制带来的全球供应链扰动。","drivers":["US 25% auto import tariff effective April 3","US-China tariffs 145%/125%","Chinese rare earth export controls April 2025","flight to defensives","EV export disruption risk"],"drivers_zh":["美国对汽车加征25%关税4月3日起","中美关税145%/125%","中国稀土出口管制2025年4月","避险轮动","新能源出口受阻风险"],"title":"US Tariff Escalation to 145% Hits Export Cyclicals","title_zh":"美国关税升至145%重创出口周期股"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"From April 8, 2025, markets rebounded strongly on the May 12 US-China tariff truce (US rates rolled back from 145% to 30% for 90 days, extended August 12). Domestic auto trade-in subsidies were renewed for 2026 (up to 20,000 yuan for NEV trade-ins). China full-year 2025 vehicle shipments hit a record 34.4 million units (+9.4% YoY) and exports reached 7.1 million units. Autos gained 36.9%, ranking 14th/31 — a mid-pack cyclical beta recovery as Metals (+132%) and Telecoms (+119%) led the risk-on tape (cyclicals +44.2% vs defensives +6.4%; growth +36.2pp vs value).","body_zh":"2025年4月8日起，市场随5月12日中美关税休战（美国关税从145%回落至30%，维持90天，8月12日延期）强劲反弹。国内汽车以旧换新补贴续期（新能源换购最高补贴2万元）。中国2025年全年整车销量创纪录达3440万辆（同比+9.4%），出口710万辆。汽车涨幅36.9%，排名第14/31，为中游周期贝塔修复行情，有色金属（+132%）和通信（+119%）领涨（周期均值+44.2%，防御+6.4%；成长跑赢价值36.2ppt）。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce May 12 2025","NEV trade-in subsidy renewal 20K yuan","China auto export record 7.1M units 2025","cyclical risk-on rally SHCOMP +31.5%","mid-pack beta recovery"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税休战2025年5月12日","新能源以旧换新补贴续期2万元","中国2025年汽车出口创纪录710万辆","周期风险偏好反弹上证综指+31.5%","中游周期贝塔修复"],"title":"Tariff Truce & Record 2025 Exports Drive Cyclical Rally","title_zh":"关税休战+2025年出口创纪录推动周期板块宽幅反弹"},"2026-01-23":{"body":"From January 23, 2026, Autos fell 23.0% (ranked 24th/31) on a sector-specific shock: China halved the NEV purchase tax exemption effective January 2026, and January passenger car sales plunged 19.5% YoY — regulators subsequently banned below-cost vehicle sales in February 2026. Over 70% of Chinese auto brands were reportedly unprofitable. BYD announced its first annual profit decline since the pandemic. Meanwhile, SHCOMP fell only 2.6% with Telecoms (+68.6%) and Electronics (+55%) soaring on AI themes — the auto underperformance was emphatically sector-specific.","body_zh":"2026年1月23日起，汽车板块下跌23.0%（排名第24/31），遭受行业特有冲击：中国2026年1月起将新能源购置税减免减半，当月乘用车销量同比大跌19.5%，监管层随即于2026年2月出台禁止低于成本价销售的规定以遏制价格战。据报逾70%的中国汽车品牌处于亏损状态，比亚迪宣布疫情以来首次年度利润下滑。同期上证综指仅下跌2.6%，通信（+68.6%）和电子（+55%）因AI主题强势飙升——汽车板块的落后明确属于行业自身问题。","drivers":["NEV purchase tax exemption halved Jan 2026","January auto sales -19.5% YoY","below-cost selling ban February 2026","EV price war 70% brands unprofitable","sector-specific vs AI-led SHCOMP"],"drivers_zh":["新能源购置税减免减半2026年1月","1月乘用车销量同比暴跌19.5%","2026年2月禁止低于成本价销售","电动车价格战70%品牌亏损","行业特有下跌vs AI主题大市"],"title":"NEV Tax Halving & Price War Spark Brutal Sector Selloff","title_zh":"新能源购置税减半+价格战：汽车板块急剧回调"}},"now":"China Automobiles (Shenwan 801880) is in a Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 23rd out of 31 Shenwan industries with a -17.5% return in the current window. The tape is a growth-led, risk-on beta rally (SHCOMP +1.6%; cyclicals avg +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%; growth outpacing value by 18.2pp) driven by Electronics and Telecoms — Autos is lagging the cyclical pack. The domestic EV price war, the January 2026 halving of the NEV purchase-tax exemption, and a 19.5% YoY drop in January 2026 passenger-car sales are suppressing earnings visibility. The sector sits at 0.6 of its historical range and below its 200-day MA, consistent with a late-bear bottoming zone, but no buy signal has confirmed and relative strength (rs_rank 21/31) remains weak. A decisive government anti-price-war intervention or a renewed NEV trade-in subsidy programme would be the most likely catalyst to convert the bottoming setup into a confirmed trough entry.","now_zh":"中国汽车板块（申万801880）截至2026年6月底处于\"底部筑底\"阶段，在31个申万一级行业中排名第23，当前区间收益率为-17.5%。当前行情为成长股主导的风险偏好反弹（上证综指+1.6%；周期板块均值+0.3%，防御板块-12.1%；成长/价值利差+18.2ppt），领涨行业为电子和通信，汽车整体落后于周期板块均值。国内新能源车价格战持续、2026年1月新能源购置税减免减半，以及1月乘用车销量同比大跌19.5%，严重压制盈利预期。板块估值处于历史区间0.6分位、位于200日均线下方，与熊市末期筑底信号一致，但尚无明确买入信号，相对强度仍弱（排名21/31）。后续催化剂可能来自政府出台实质性反价格战政策或新一轮以旧换新补贴方案。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801890":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The PBOC cut benchmark lending rates in November 2014 and progressively eased margin-financing rules, allowing officially sanctioned margin debt to balloon from CNY 403bn to CNY 2.2 trillion by June 2015. Retail investors poured leveraged capital into growth and industrial themes, lifting the SHCOMP +132% over 16 months. Machinery (+202%) rode this as a high-beta cyclical in a broad index surge: cyclicals outpaced defensives by 73pp and growth beat value by 12pp, confirming the move was margin-driven beta amplification, not sector-specific demand. Computers (+263%) and Construction (+250%) led; Machinery ranked 6th of 28 industries, outperforming only because of its cyclical high-beta character.","body_zh":"2014年11月央行下调基准贷款利率并放宽融资融券规则，场内融资余额从4030亿元激增至2015年6月的2.2万亿元。散户大量借杠杆涌入成长股和工业板块，推动上证综指16个月累计上涨132%。机械（+202%）作为高贝塔周期品借势大涨：周期股跑赢防御股73个百分点，成长跑赢价值12个百分点，确认行情为纯杠杆贝塔放大，而非行业基本面驱动。计算机（+263%）和建筑（+250%）领涨，机械凭借周期高贝塔属性排名28个行业第6位。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts","margin debt expansion","broad beta rally","growth/cyclical style","retail liquidity"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准","融资余额激增","全面贝塔行情","成长/周期风格","散户流动性"],"title":"Margin-Fueled A-Share Bull Market","title_zh":"融资杠杆驱动A股大牛市"},"2015-06-03":{"body":"On June 12 2015 the CSRC released draft rules tightening shadow-financed margin trading; the market crashed the following trading day and lost nearly 30% within weeks. Forced deleveraging cascaded through the highest-leverage growth and cyclical names: Machinery fell 45%, ranking 25th of 28 industries. Defensives such as Banks (-4%) and Food & Bev (-27%) far outpaced cyclicals (-40% avg), consistent with a pure flight-to-safety rotation. The CSRC then imposed trading halts, but fire-sale dynamics driven by leveraged accounts hitting max-leverage limits drove the bulk of the decline.","body_zh":"2015年6月12日证监会发布场外配资整治草案，次个交易日市场开始暴跌，数周内上证综指跌近30%。高杠杆成长股和周期股遭受强制平仓踩踏：机械下跌45%，排名28个行业第25位。银行（-4%）和食品饮料（-27%）等防御板块大幅跑赢周期股（均值-40%），典型风险规避轮动特征。证监会随后实施停牌及熔断机制，但配资账户触及强平线引发的被动抛售主导了此轮下跌。","drivers":["CSRC margin rule tightening","forced deleveraging","flight to safety","cyclical fire-sale","growth unwind"],"drivers_zh":["证监会融资新规","强制去杠杆","避险轮动","周期股踩踏","成长股平仓"],"title":"Margin Deleveraging Crash — June 2015","title_zh":"2015年6月去杠杆暴跌"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"The State Council deployed a CNY 1.5 trillion rescue package through China Securities Finance Corporation, directing brokers and state funds to buy blue-chip ETFs and large-cap stocks. Machinery (+29%) participated as a broad cyclical beta bounce: SHCOMP surged 17.6%, cyclicals led defensives by 15pp, and growth beat value by 6pp. Coal (+102%) and Defense (+65%) led the rebound while Banks (-1%) lagged as the national team concentrated on growth-oriented industrials. The bounce was short-lived as the structural leverage overhang remained unresolved.","body_zh":"国务院通过中国证券金融公司动用约1.5万亿元救市资金，指示券商及国家队基金买入蓝筹ETF和大盘股。机械（+29%）借助周期贝塔回弹参与其中：上证综指急涨17.6%，周期股领先防御股15个百分点，成长跑赢价值6个百分点。煤炭（+102%）和国防（+65%）领涨，银行（-1%）垫底，国家队资金集中于成长型工业股。但杠杆结构性隐患未消，反弹昙花一现。","drivers":["state rescue fund buying","CSF intervention","broad beta rebound","growth/cyclical style","short-squeeze"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市买入","证金公司介入","全面贝塔反弹","成长/周期风格","空头回补"],"title":"State Rescue Bounce — July 2015","title_zh":"2015年7月国家队救市反弹"},"2015-07-23":{"body":"On August 11 2015 the PBOC surprised markets with a 2% one-day CNY devaluation, triggering fears of capital outflows and a hard landing; SHCOMP dropped 27% from the July peak. Machinery fell 33%, ranking 21st of 28, as defensives (Banks -12.5%, Food & Bev -22%) again outpaced cyclicals (-31% avg) and value beat growth by 6pp. The devaluation compounded the existing leverage-unwind, raising import costs for capital-equipment producers and deepening the macro fear premium on industrial cyclicals.","body_zh":"2015年8月11日央行突发人民币一次性贬值2%，引发资本外流和硬着陆担忧，上证综指从7月高点再跌27%。机械下跌33%，排名28个行业第21位；防御板块（银行-12.5%、食品饮料-22%）再次跑赢周期股（均值-31%），价值跑赢成长6个百分点。贬值叠加去杠杆，抬高设备类进口成本，加深了市场对工业周期股的风险折价。","drivers":["CNY devaluation shock","capital outflow fears","flight to safety","cyclical unwind","macro hard-landing fear"],"drivers_zh":["人民币贬值冲击","资本外流恐慌","避险轮动","周期股平仓","硬着陆担忧"],"title":"Second Crash Wave — CNY Devaluation Shock","title_zh":"第二轮暴跌——人民币贬值冲击"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"After the devaluation shock bottomed in late August, a stabilization rally emerged through October-November 2015: SHCOMP gained 21% and Machinery +44% (ranked 8th). The growth-style leadership (Computers +65%, Electronics +54%) remained dominant with growth beating value by 19pp, consistent with relief buying into beaten-down high-beta growth cyclicals. The PBOC's October 2015 rate and RRR cuts (benchmark lending rate to 4.35%, RRR -50bp) provided renewed monetary support, fueling another short-covering rally in leveraged sectors.","body_zh":"贬值冲击在8月末见底后，市场于10月至11月间展开稳定反弹：上证综指涨21%，机械+44%（排名第8）。成长风格依然主导（计算机+65%、电子+54%），成长跑赢价值19个百分点，与高贝塔成长周期股的超跌修复买盘一致。央行在2015年10月再次降息降准（基准贷款利率降至4.35%，下调准备金率50bp），为杠杆板块再次的空头回补提供货币支撑。","drivers":["PBOC Oct 2015 rate/RRR cut","post-crash relief buying","growth style leadership","cyclicals outperform","short-covering"],"drivers_zh":["2015年10月央行降息降准","暴跌后超跌修复","成长风格领涨","周期股跑赢","空头回补"],"title":"Post-Crash Relief Rally — Oct-Nov 2015","title_zh":"暴跌后反弹——2015年10至11月"},"2015-11-25":{"body":"CNY resumed depreciating in December 2015 as the Fed's first rate hike in nine years (Dec 16 2015) strengthened the USD broadly, accelerating capital outflows from China. The new A-share circuit-breaker mechanism, implemented on Jan 4 2016, was triggered on its first two trading days and had to be scrapped by Jan 7, amplifying panic selling. Machinery fell 36% (ranked 25th of 28), broadly in line with defensives-led risk-off: Banks lost only 14%, while Media, Computers, and Defense each fell 36-40%. SHCOMP dropped 26%.","body_zh":"2015年12月美联储九年来首次加息（联邦基金利率上调25bp），美元走强导致人民币持续贬值并加速资本外流。2016年1月4日新推出的A股熔断机制在首两个交易日即被触发，并于1月7日被迫取消，恐慌性抛售进一步放大。机械下跌36%（排名第25），防御主导的风险规避轮动明显：银行仅跌14%，而传媒、计算机、国防各跌36-40%。上证综指跌26%。","drivers":["Fed Dec 2015 rate hike","CNY depreciation acceleration","circuit breaker failure","capital outflow","risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2015年12月加息","人民币持续贬值","熔断机制失败","资本外流","避险轮动"],"title":"CNY Depreciation & Circuit-Breaker Panic","title_zh":"人民币续贬及熔断恐慌"},"2016-02-29":{"body":"Beijing launched a major fiscal and infrastructure spending push in early 2016: the 13th Five-Year Plan (approved March 2016) directed record public investment into rail, PPP projects, and urbanization. Simultaneously, supply-side reform targeted cuts of 100-150mt in steel capacity and 250mt in coal capacity, reflating producer prices and improving equipment order books. Machinery gained 34% (ranked 8th), in line with a SHCOMP +21% broad rally with no strong style tilt (defensives 25%, cyclicals 28%), with Building Materials (+43%) and Construction (+42%) leading — confirming infrastructure spending as the macro driver rather than a pure growth theme.","body_zh":"2016年初北京推出大规模财政及基础设施投资计划：2016年3月审议通过的十三五规划将创纪录的公共投资引导至铁路、PPP项目和城镇化建设。同期供给侧改革目标压减粗钢产能1-1.5亿吨、煤炭产能2.5亿吨，推动工业品价格回升，改善设备订单。机械涨34%（排名第8），与上证综指+21%的宽基上涨一致，风格分化不明显（防御+25%，周期+28%），建材（+43%）和建筑（+42%）领涨，确认基建投资为宏观主线而非纯成长主题。","drivers":["13th Five-Year Plan fiscal push","PPP infrastructure investment","supply-side capacity cuts","PPI reflation","broad FAI stimulus"],"drivers_zh":["十三五规划财政投入","PPP基础设施投资","供给侧去产能","PPI再通胀","固定资产投资刺激"],"title":"Fiscal Stimulus & Supply-Side Reform Reflation","title_zh":"财政刺激与供给侧改革再通胀"},"2016-11-22":{"body":"From late 2016 China's financial regulators launched a multi-year deleveraging campaign targeting shadow banking, off-balance-sheet WMPs, and inter-bank leverage, draining liquidity from mid-cap and small-cap industrials. From March 2018 the US-China trade war escalated: Trump imposed 25% tariffs on USD 16bn of Chinese goods including machinery, electrical equipment, and rail products on August 23 2018, with China retaliating in kind. Machinery fell 50% over 23 months (ranked 24th of 28): defensives (Food & Bev +26%) massively outpaced cyclicals (-32%), and value beat growth by 20pp, a textbook deleveraging/risk-off regime with SHCOMP -24%.","body_zh":"2016年底中国金融监管机构启动多年期去杠杆行动，整治影子银行、表外理财和同业杠杆，中小市值工业股流动性遭受严重冲击。2018年3月起中美贸易战升级：美国于2018年8月23日对160亿美元中国商品（含机械设备、电气设备、铁路产品）加征25%关税，中方等额报复。机械23个月下跌50%（排名第24），上证综指同期跌24%：食品饮料（+26%）等防御板块大幅跑赢周期股（均值-32%），价值跑赢成长20个百分点，为典型去杠杆/风险规避行情。","drivers":["financial deleveraging campaign","US-China trade war tariffs","flight to safety/value","shadow banking tightening","cyclical underperformance"],"drivers_zh":["金融去杠杆行动","中美贸易战关税","避险/价值轮动","影子银行整治","周期股落后"],"title":"Trade War & Deleveraging Grind — 2017-2018","title_zh":"贸易战与去杠杆压制——2017至2018年"},"2018-10-18":{"body":"The PBOC cut the RRR by 100bp effective January 15 2019 (the fifth RRR cut within a year), injecting CNY 1.5 trillion in net liquidity; the NDRC also fast-tracked infrastructure approvals from late 2018. At the G20 Buenos Aires summit in December 2018, Trump and Xi agreed to a 90-day tariff truce, fueling risk appetite. Machinery rebounded 49% (ranked 9th) with SHCOMP +30%: cyclicals slightly outpaced defensives (36% vs 32%) and growth beat value by 17pp, consistent with a broad policy-easing-driven beta recovery in which Agriculture, Conglomerates, and Computers led.","body_zh":"2019年1月15日央行再次降准100bp（一年内第五次），净释放流动性约1.5万亿元；发改委自2018年底加快基础设施项目审批。2018年12月G20布宜诺斯艾利斯峰会上特朗普与习近平达成90天关税休战协议，提振风险偏好。机械反弹49%（排名第9），上证综指+30%：周期股微弱跑赢防御股（36% vs 32%），成长跑赢价值17个百分点，与宽松政策驱动的贝塔复苏一致，农业、综合及计算机领涨。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cuts","G20 tariff truce","NDRC infrastructure acceleration","growth style rebound","policy easing"],"drivers_zh":["央行多次降准","G20关税休战","发改委加快基建审批","成长风格回升","货币政策宽松"],"title":"PBOC Easing & Trade Truce Hope Rally","title_zh":"央行宽松与贸易休战预期反弹"},"2019-04-09":{"body":"In May 2019 the US abruptly raised tariffs on USD 200bn of Chinese goods from 10% to 25%, collapsing trade truce optimism. China's manufacturing PMI fell below 50 through most of H2 2019 as capex intentions deteriorated. The COVID-19 outbreak in January 2020 delivered the final shock: the Wuhan lockdown was imposed January 23 2020, triggering the February 3 2020 market selloff. Machinery fell 20% (ranked 19th) in a flight-to-safety environment where defensives lost only 8% vs cyclicals -21%; Electronics (+24%) was the lone cyclical winner as a 5G supply-chain play, with Steel (-36%) and Construction (-31%) the worst laggards.","body_zh":"2019年5月美国突然将对2000亿美元中国商品的关税从10%提高至25%，贸易乐观情绪崩塌。2019年下半年中国制造业PMI多数月份低于50荣枯线，资本开支意愿恶化。2020年1月23日武汉封城，新冠疫情爆发，触发2月3日A股大幅低开。机械下跌20%（排名第19），防御主导的避险格局明显：防御股仅跌8%而周期股跌21%；电子（+24%）凭借5G供应链逻辑成为唯一上涨周期品，钢铁（-36%）和建筑（-31%）跌幅最深。","drivers":["US May 2019 tariff hike to 25%","China PMI contraction","COVID-19 Wuhan lockdown","flight to safety","capex downturn"],"drivers_zh":["美国2019年5月加征25%关税","中国PMI跌破50","新冠武汉封城","避险轮动","资本开支下行"],"title":"Trade War Re-escalation & COVID Shock","title_zh":"贸易战重燃与新冠冲击"},"2020-02-03":{"body":"China emerged from lockdown in April 2020 and implemented a fiscal response focused on new-infrastructure (5G, data centers, EV charging) and manufacturing investment. Xi Jinping articulated the Dual Circulation strategy in May 2020 (embedded in the 14th Five-Year Plan, March 2021), which prioritized domestic equipment self-sufficiency, directly boosting capital equipment demand. Over 19 months Machinery gained 73% (ranked 9th) with SHCOMP +34%: cyclicals strongly outpaced defensives (63% vs 40%), value modestly led growth by 8pp, with Power Equipment (+188%) and Metals (+140%) leading as the green-energy capex boom overshadowed the broader machinery complex.","body_zh":"2020年4月中国解除封控并推出以新基建（5G、数据中心、充电桩）和制造业投资为重点的财政刺激。2020年5月习近平提出双循环战略（2021年3月写入十四五规划），将国内设备自给自足列为核心目标，直接拉动资本设备需求。机械19个月上涨73%（排名第9），上证综指+34%：周期股大幅跑赢防御股（63% vs 40%），价值略微领先成长8pp，新能源资本开支热潮推动电力设备（+188%）和有色（+140%）领跑，机械整体呈现跟涨态势。","drivers":["COVID recovery fiscal stimulus","dual circulation manufacturing policy","new infrastructure investment","14th Five-Year Plan capex","cyclical/value leadership"],"drivers_zh":["新冠复苏财政刺激","双循环制造自主政策","新基建投资","十四五规划资本开支","周期/价值领涨"],"title":"COVID Recovery & Dual-Circulation Manufacturing Boom","title_zh":"新冠复苏与双循环制造业景气"},"2021-09-07":{"body":"From mid-2021 Beijing's common prosperity regulatory campaign hit tech, education, and property simultaneously. The Evergrande debt crisis emerged in August 2021, triggering property sector contagion. A nationwide power shortage from September 2021 disrupted manufacturing output, directly hurting equipment utilization and new orders. Machinery fell 37% over 7 months (ranked 29th of 31): it was explicitly the second-weakest sector alongside Electronics (-38%) and Steel (-42%), massively underperforming as a growth-cyclical in a value-led selloff (value beat growth by 8pp, defensives outpaced cyclicals by 8pp, SHCOMP -22%).","body_zh":"2021年中期北京的共同富裕监管整治同步重创科技、教育和房地产板块。2021年8月恒大债务危机爆发，地产信用风险蔓延。2021年9月全国电力短缺冲击工业生产，直接拖累设备开工率和新订单。机械7个月下跌37%（排名31个行业第29位），是明确的最弱板块之一，与电子（-38%）、钢铁（-42%）并列倒数，作为成长-周期品在价值主导的杀跌行情中（价值跑赢成长8pp，防御跑赢周期8pp）遭受严重冲击。","drivers":["common prosperity regulatory crackdown","Evergrande property contagion","power shortage supply disruption","value/defensive rotation","growth/cyclical unwind"],"drivers_zh":["共同富裕监管整治","恒大地产危机蔓延","电力短缺冲击生产","价值/防御轮动","成长/周期平仓"],"title":"Common Prosperity Crackdown & Power Crisis Selloff","title_zh":"共同富裕监管风暴与电力危机拖累"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Shanghai's 2-month lockdown (April-May 2022) bottomed the market on April 26; the subsequent reopening plus the State Council's 33-point policy package (May 2022) drove a sharp relief rally. Machinery surged 44% (ranked 4th of 31): the tape was growth-and-cyclical-led (cyclicals +20%, defensives +6%, growth beat value by 17pp), with Power Equipment (+63%), Autos (+51%), and Defense (+46%) leading as China's EV supply chain and defense modernization themes dominated. Machinery participated through industrial automation and defense-adjacent equipment exposure.","body_zh":"上海封控（2022年4月至5月）于4月26日触底；随后解封叠加国务院5月发布33条一揽子政策，推动市场强势反弹。机械大涨44%（排名31个行业第4位）：行情呈成长/周期领涨格局（周期+20%，防御+6%，成长跑赢价值17pp），电力设备（+63%）、汽车（+51%）和国防（+46%）领涨，新能源供应链和国防现代化主题主导。机械通过工业自动化和国防配套设备受益。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown end","State Council 33-point stimulus","green capex/EV supply chain","defense modernization","growth/cyclical style"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封","国务院33条一揽子政策","绿色资本开支/新能源供应链","国防现代化","成长/周期风格"],"title":"Post-Lockdown Rebound — Green Capex & Defense","title_zh":"解封后反弹——绿色资本开支与国防主题"},"2022-08-18":{"body":"Fed Chair Powell's hawkish Jackson Hole speech on August 26 2022 signaled sustained 75bp rate hikes, jolting global risk assets. China's market was further weighed by anticipation of Xi's third-term consolidation at the 20th Party Congress (October 16 2022), which investors interpreted as prioritizing security over economic growth. Machinery fell 20% (ranked 28th of 31) in a value-led selloff: Coal (+5%), Real Estate (-1%), and Banks (-2%) outperformed while growth-cyclicals like Electronics (-26%), Power Equipment (-24%), and Autos (-22%) bore the brunt. Value beat growth by 8pp; defensives led cyclicals by 4pp.","body_zh":"2022年8月26日美联储主席鲍威尔在杰克逊霍尔发表鹰派讲话，预示持续75bp加息节奏，全球风险资产承压。A股市场还因市场预期习近平在2022年10月16日二十大上获得第三任期（投资者解读为安全优先于经济增长）而额外承压。机械下跌20%（排名31个行业第28位），价值主导杀跌：煤炭（+5%）、房地产（-1%）和银行（-2%）相对抗跌，而电子（-26%）、电力设备（-24%）和汽车（-22%）等成长周期品跌幅最重。价值跑赢成长8pp，防御跑赢周期4pp。","drivers":["Fed Jackson Hole hawkish shock","Xi third-term risk repricing","growth/cyclical unwind","value/defensive rotation","global rate hike fears"],"drivers_zh":["美联储杰克逊霍尔鹰派冲击","习近平三连任风险重定价","成长/周期平仓","价值/防御轮动","全球加息担忧"],"title":"Fed Hawkish Pivot & Xi Third-Term Risk-Off","title_zh":"美联储鹰派转向与三连任风险规避"},"2022-10-10":{"body":"From November 2022, social-media speculation and then official confirmation that Beijing would abandon zero-COVID drove a broad relief rally; reopening was formally announced December 26 2022. Simultaneously, OpenAI launched ChatGPT in late November 2022, sparking a global AI rerating that lifted technology-adjacent manufacturers including industrial robots and automation equipment. Machinery gained 24% (ranked 4th of 31) with SHCOMP +10%: growth beat value by 11pp and Computers (+40%), Media (+32%), and Services (+31%) led, with Machinery benefiting from its AI/automation adjacency while real-sector cyclicals (Real Estate +2%, Coal -15%) lagged.","body_zh":"2022年11月起社交媒体上关于清零退出的传言以及随后的官方确认，引发大范围解封预期反弹；12月26日正式宣布放开。与此同时，OpenAI于2022年11月底发布ChatGPT，引发全球AI重估浪潮，拉动工业机器人和自动化设备制造商估值抬升。机械涨24%（排名31个行业第4位），上证综指+10%：成长跑赢价值11pp，计算机（+40%）、传媒（+32%）和服务（+31%）领涨，机械凭借AI/自动化属性受益，而房地产（+2%）和煤炭（-15%）等实体周期股落后。","drivers":["zero-COVID policy exit","reopening speculation","ChatGPT AI rerating","growth/tech style","automation/robot adjacency"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策退出","解封预期","ChatGPT AI重估","成长/科技风格","自动化/机器人属性"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit & ChatGPT-Era Tech Rerating","title_zh":"清零政策退出与ChatGPT科技重估"},"2023-02-13":{"body":"China's reopening recovery proved shallower than expected as domestic demand remained weak: PPI remained negative throughout 2023 and into 2024 (averaging -2.2% in MIC2025 sectors), squeezing equipment makers' margins. Real estate investment contracted at 12% annually as Evergrande and Country Garden defaults deepened the property-related capex hole. Machinery fell 32% (ranked 16th of 31) in a 12-month selloff matching SHCOMP -18%: defensives led (Coal +7%, Banks -1%) while cyclicals lost 27%, value beat growth by 9pp, confirming a structural deflationary grind rather than a single catalyst selloff.","body_zh":"中国经济复苏明显弱于预期，内需持续疲软：PPI在2023年全年及2024年持续为负（中国制造2025相关领域均值-2.2%），挤压设备制造商利润。随着恒大、碧桂园相继违约，地产投资年均收缩12%，设备相关资本开支缺口持续扩大。机械下跌32%（排名31个行业第16位），与上证综指-18%对应，历时12个月的缓慢磨底：防御再次领先（煤炭+7%、银行-1%），周期股跌27%，价值跑赢成长9pp，确认为结构性通缩持续压制，而非单一催化剂导致的急跌。","drivers":["PPI deflation / negative margins","property sector collapse","domestic demand shortfall","defensive/value rotation","overcapacity pressure"],"drivers_zh":["PPI通缩/利润收缩","地产板块崩溃","内需不足","防御/价值轮动","产能过剩压力"],"title":"Deflation, Property Abyss & Overcapacity Grind","title_zh":"通缩、地产深坑与产能过剩压制"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"In February 2024, Central Huijin vowed to ramp up CSI 300 ETF purchases to resolutely stabilize markets, ending a three-year rout; the SHCOMP bottomed around February 5 2024. In March 2024 the State Council issued the Action Plan for Large-Scale Equipment Renewal and Consumer Goods Trade-In, committing CNY 300bn in long-term special bonds to upgrade industrial equipment across key sectors, directly stimulating demand for machinery and automation. Machinery gained 31% in 6 weeks (ranked 7th of 31): growth beat value by 17pp and Computers (+39%), Telecoms (+36%), and Media (+34%) led, confirming an AI-and-tech-style relief rally amplified by the policy backstop rather than a pure equipment cycle.","body_zh":"2024年2月中央汇金宣布加大沪深300ETF买入力度，坚决维护市场稳定，终结了长达三年的低迷行情；上证综指在2024年2月5日前后见底。2024年3月国务院发布《推动大规模设备更新和消费品以旧换新行动方案》，承诺通过长期特别国债安排约3000亿元支持工业设备升级，直接刺激机械和自动化设备需求。机械6周内上涨31%（排名31个行业第7位）：成长跑赢价值17pp，计算机（+39%）、通信（+36%）和传媒（+34%）领涨，确认这是政策托底叠加AI/科技风格的超跌修复行情，而非纯粹的设备周期行情。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF buying","State Council equipment upgrade policy","CNY 300bn special bonds","growth/tech style rebound","market stabilization"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金ETF托市","国务院大规模设备更新方案","3000亿元特别国债","成长/科技风格反弹","市场维稳"],"title":"National Team ETF Buying & Equipment Upgrade Policy","title_zh":"国家队ETF托市与大规模设备更新政策"},"2024-03-18":{"body":"From mid-March 2024 the relief rally faded as structural headwinds reasserted: China's CPI remained near zero, property investment kept contracting, and earnings for equipment manufacturers showed persistent margin compression from PPI deflation. The SHCOMP fell 12% over 6 months, and Machinery lost 22% (ranked 19th of 31): Banks (-1%), Appliances (-6%), and Utilities (-6%) held up while growth cyclicals Computers (-29%), Beauty (-29%), and Media (-28%) were hardest hit. The slight defensives-led pattern (defensives -14%, cyclicals -18%) confirmed a low-conviction risk-off grind rather than a sharp crash.","body_zh":"2024年3月中旬超跌修复行情退潮，结构性阻力再度主导：中国CPI接近零、地产投资持续收缩，设备制造商受PPI通缩影响利润持续承压。上证综指6个月下跌12%，机械下跌22%（排名31个行业第19位）：银行（-1%）、家电（-6%）和公用事业（-6%）相对抗跌，而计算机（-29%）、美护（-29%）和传媒（-28%）等成长周期股跌幅最重。防御股轻微领先（-14% vs 周期-18%），确认为低斜率风险规避磨底，而非急速暴跌。","drivers":["PPI deflation / margin squeeze","property investment contraction","domestic demand weakness","growth style reversal","earnings disappointment"],"drivers_zh":["PPI通缩/利润压缩","地产投资收缩","内需疲软","成长风格退潮","盈利不及预期"],"title":"Domestic Demand Slump & Growth Rotation Out","title_zh":"内需疲软与成长轮动退潮"},"2024-09-13":{"body":"On September 24 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a comprehensive monetary package: RRR cut of 50bp (net liquidity injection CNY 1 trillion), the 7-day reverse repo rate cut 20bp to 1.5%, a new CNY 500bn equity swap facility for non-bank institutions to buy equities, and a CNY 300bn special relending facility for share buybacks. The Hang Seng surged 27% within weeks; SHCOMP gained 25%. Machinery ranked #3 of 31 (60.6% gain) as the top-3 growth leaders (Computers +84%, Electronics +63%, Machinery +61%) dominated: growth beat value by 24pp and cyclicals outpaced defensives by 10pp, reflecting a powerful liquidity-driven re-rating of growth cyclicals.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子货币政策：降准50bp（净释放约1万亿元流动性）、7天逆回购利率下调20bp至1.5%、向非银金融机构提供5000亿元互换便利用于购买股票，以及3000亿元专项再贷款支持上市公司增持回购。恒生指数数周内大涨27%，上证综指涨25%。机械以+60.6%排名31个行业第3位（仅次于计算机+84%和电子+63%），成长跑赢价值24pp，周期跑赢防御10pp，呈现流动性驱动的成长周期股估值大幅重估。","drivers":["PBOC 9-24 RRR+rate cut package","CNY 500bn equity swap facility","liquidity surge","growth/cyclical re-rating","sentiment reversal"],"drivers_zh":["央行924降准降息","5000亿互换便利","流动性大幅注入","成长/周期重估","市场情绪逆转"],"title":"PBOC '9-24' Mega-Stimulus Package","title_zh":"央行'924'一揽子超级刺激"},"2025-03-11":{"body":"On April 2 2025 Trump announced Liberation Day tariffs, imposing 34% on Chinese goods atop existing 20% fentanyl tariffs; after China retaliated, the rate was escalated to 84% and then 145% effective immediately. China's manufacturing PMI fell to 49.0 in April 2025 (a 16-month low) as bilateral trade flows were disrupted, directly threatening machinery and capital equipment exporters. Machinery fell 20% in less than a month (ranked 29th of 31): defensives (Agriculture +7%, Utilities +1%) held up sharply while growth cyclicals (Machinery -20%, Electronics -20%, Computers -22%) were hardest hit, consistent with a tariff-shock risk-off rotation where export-sensitive growth industrials were punished most severely.","body_zh":"2025年4月2日特朗普宣布解放日关税，在原有20%芬太尼关税基础上对中国商品加征34%；中方反制后，美国将税率迅速升级至84%，随后立即实施145%的对华关税。中国4月制造业PMI跌至49.0（16个月低点），双边贸易受阻，直接威胁机械及资本设备出口商。机械不足一个月内下跌20%（排名31个行业第29位）：防御板块（农业+7%、公用事业+1%）明显抗跌，而成长周期股（机械-20%、电子-20%、计算机-22%）跌幅最重，与关税冲击导致出口敏感型成长工业股遭受最严重惩罚的风险规避轮动完全吻合。","drivers":["Trump 145% Liberation Day tariffs","China PMI contraction","export disruption","growth/cyclical selloff","trade war shock"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普145%解放日关税","中国PMI收缩","出口中断","成长/周期抛售","贸易战冲击"],"title":"Liberation Day Tariff Shock — 145% on China","title_zh":"解放日关税冲击——对华145%关税"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"On May 12 2025, China and the US agreed at Geneva to slash reciprocal tariffs from 125% to 10% for 90 days; the deal was later extended through November 2026 after the Trump-Xi Busan summit. Meanwhile, DeepSeek R1 (launched January 20 2025) had sparked a domestic AI investment wave, with MIIT's Humanoid Robot Action Plan targeting 100,000 deployments by 2027, directly fueling orders for robotics, automation, and precision-engineering firms within the Machinery sector. Machinery surged 84% over 14 months (ranked 5th of 31) in a growth-dominated risk-on tape: Telecoms (+286%), Electronics (+180%), Metals (+112%) led; cyclicals outpaced defensives by 39pp and growth beat value by a record 69pp.","body_zh":"2025年5月12日中美在日内瓦就关税问题达成协议，相互关税从125%降至10%并维持90天；随后在特朗普与习近平釜山峰会后延长至2026年11月。与此同时，DeepSeek R1（2025年1月20日发布）引爆国内AI投资热潮，工信部人形机器人行动计划目标2027年部署10万台，直接拉动机器人、自动化及精密工程企业的订单。机械14个月内上涨84%（排名31个行业第5位），成长主导风险偏好行情：通信（+286%）、电子（+180%）、有色（+112%）领涨；周期跑赢防御39pp，成长跑赢价值创纪录的69pp。","drivers":["US-China Geneva tariff truce 10%","DeepSeek R1 AI wave","MIIT humanoid robot policy","growth/cyclical mega-rally","domestic AI investment surge"],"drivers_zh":["中美日内瓦关税休战10%","DeepSeek R1 AI浪潮","工信部人形机器人政策","成长/周期超级行情","国内AI投资热潮"],"title":"Tariff Truce & AI-Robotics Theme Mega-Rally","title_zh":"关税休战与AI机器人主题超级行情"}},"now":"Machinery (Shenwan 801890) is currently in a Topping/Peak phase after an 84% rally from the April 2025 lows, its single largest up-leg on record. The sector sits at the 77th percentile of its range with a SELL signal. Within the current tape (SHCOMP +1.6%, cyclicals barely ahead of defensives at +0.3% vs -12.1%), Machinery ranks #4/31 with a +21.2% leg gain, trailing Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) by a wide margin, signaling leadership is rotating away from hard machinery into purer AI-hardware plays. The current rally was powered by the DeepSeek AI breakthrough (Jan 2025), MIIT humanoid-robot policy mandates targeting 100,000 deployments by 2027, and the May 12 2025 US-China Geneva tariff truce (reciprocal tariffs reduced from 145% to 10% for 90 days, subsequently extended through Nov 2026). With cyclicals barely positive and defensives deeply negative, the tape is narrowing; Machinery's fading relative rank and topping-phase signal confirm late-cycle positioning within this growth-and-theme-driven leg.","now_zh":"机械设备（申万801890）当前处于顶部区域，自2025年4月低点累计上涨84%，创历史最大单段涨幅，估值分位处于77%，技术面已发出卖出信号。当前行情（上证综指+1.6%，周期股仅微弱领先防御股0.3% vs -12.1%）下，机械以+21.2%排名31个申万行业第4位，远落后于电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%），表明领涨主线已向纯科技/AI硬件切换。本轮上涨由DeepSeek（2025年1月）、工信部人形机器人政策（2027年部署10万台目标）及2025年5月中美日内瓦关税休战（相互关税从145%降至10%）共同驱动。周期股涨幅微弱而防御股深度回调，行情正在收窄；机械相对排名下滑及顶部信号均表明本轮主题行情已进入尾声。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801950":{"legs":{"2014-02-21":{"body":"The PBOC's shift to monetary easing from late 2014 — six benchmark rate cuts between Nov 2014 and Jun 2015 plus four RRR reductions — flooded A-shares with liquidity. Retail margin financing ballooned from under RMB 400 bn to over RMB 2.2 tn by June 2015, generating a fully leverage-driven broad bull. SHCOMP surged 133.8% over the leg; cyclicals outpaced defensives by 73pp and Coal ranked #1/28 (+251.1%), amplified by deeply depressed post-supercycle valuations that made it the highest-beta cyclical when sentiment reversed.","body_zh":"中国人民银行自2014年11月起转向宽松货币政策，至2015年6月共六次降息、四次降准，A股流动性大幅改善。融资融券余额从不足4000亿元激增至逾2.2万亿元，形成典型杠杆驱动牛市。该阶段沪指累涨133.8%，周期板块跑赢防御板块73个百分点，煤炭以+251.1%领跑申万全行业（28个中排名第1），估值长期压缩后弹性最大，充当高贝塔周期品种领涨。","drivers":["PBOC rate cuts x6 + RRR cuts x4 (Nov2014-Jun2015)","retail margin financing surge to RMB 2.2tn","beaten-down cyclical valuation rebound","broad SHCOMP +133.8% beta lift"],"drivers_zh":["央行六次降息四次降准（2014年11月至2015年6月）","两融余额激增至2.2万亿元","煤炭估值深度压缩后弹性释放","沪指+133.8%宽基贝塔驱动"],"title":"PBOC easing ignites leveraged cyclical bull","title_zh":"央行宽松驱动杠杆周期牛市"},"2015-05-27":{"body":"China's market regulator tightened margin rules in late May 2015 (CSRC draft rules on over-the-counter leveraged products), triggering forced selling. The SHCOMP fell 29% to 8 July 2015. Coal ranked last (#28/28, -61.6%) — more than double the market drawdown — because of its highest leverage beta on the way up: deleveraging amplified losses most severely in the highest-flown cyclicals. Defensives (banks, food & bev) fell only -25.2% on average, confirming classic flight-to-quality rotation.","body_zh":"2015年5月证监会收紧场外配资监管，触发强制去杠杆。沪指至7月8日急跌29%，煤炭以-61.6%垫底申万28行业（第28名），跌幅是大盘的两倍有余——上行阶段杠杆最高的品种在踩踏中损失最惨。银行、食品饮料等防御板块均值仅跌-25.2%，印证典型避险轮动。","drivers":["CSRC OTC margin tightening May-2015","forced leverage unwind (margin calls)","flight-to-safety (banks/food led)","highest-beta-unwind penalty on coal"],"drivers_zh":["证监会2015年5月收紧场外配资规定","强制去杠杆踩踏（融资追保）","避险资金流向银行/食品","高杠杆贝塔反向惩罚煤炭"],"title":"Leverage unwind crash; Coal worst laggard","title_zh":"去杠杆踩踏，煤炭领跌全市场"},"2015-07-08":{"body":"On 4 July 2015 the CSRC suspended IPOs and the China Securities Finance Corp (CSF) national team deployed over RMB 1 tn to buy blue-chip ETFs and large-caps, halting the crash by 8-9 July. Coal ranked #1/28 (+110.2%) over 22 days while SHCOMP gained only 5.7%; the violent overshoot reflects extreme short-squeeze dynamics in the sector that had been most aggressively sold during the June crash. Cyclicals led defensives by 15pp, confirming a speculative risk-on snap-back rather than a fundamental re-rating.","body_zh":"2015年7月4日证监会暂停IPO，中国证券金融公司（国家队）动用逾万亿元资金买入蓝筹ETF及大盘股，于7月8-9日止住下跌。煤炭22天内以+110.2%居申万首位，而同期沪指仅涨5.7%，其暴涨反映的是6月跌幅最大板块的极端空头回补效应，而非基本面重估。周期板块领先防御15个百分点，属典型投机性超跌反弹。","drivers":["CSRC IPO suspension 4-Jul-2015","China Securities Finance Corp national-team buying (>RMB 1tn)","short-squeeze in most-sold cyclicals","speculative risk-on snap-back"],"drivers_zh":["证监会7月4日暂停IPO","证金公司国家队万亿救市","超跌周期品空头回补","投机性超跌反弹"],"title":"National team buying sparks sharp snap-back","title_zh":"国家队救市引发超跌急速反弹"},"2015-07-30":{"body":"A brief 4-day selloff (30 Jul-3 Aug 2015) unwound some of the snap-back. Coal fell -19.0% while SHCOMP declined only -2.2%, again ranking last (#28/28). Banks and food & bev held flat (+3.1%, +0.9%), confirming a renewed flight to safety as confidence in the national-team intervention faltered. The magnitude relative to the index confirms Coal's persistent role as the market's highest-beta proxy for A-share risk appetite.","body_zh":"2015年7月30日至8月3日出现短暂4天回调，消化部分超跌反弹涨幅。煤炭跌-19.0%，沪指仅跌-2.2%，煤炭再度垫底（第28/28）。银行（+3.1%）、食品饮料（+0.9%）平稳，印证国家队救市信心动摇后资金再度避险。与大盘的巨大背离再次确认煤炭是A股风险偏好最敏感的高贝塔代理。","drivers":["national-team confidence waning","flight to safety (banks/food flat to positive)","coal high-beta reversal","brief derisking before Aug events"],"drivers_zh":["国家队救市效果疑虑上升","资金再度避险（银行/食品持平或微涨）","煤炭高贝塔反转","8月事件前短暂去风险"],"title":"Post-stabilisation relapse; Coal worst again","title_zh":"国家队信心动摇，短暂再度回落"},"2015-08-03":{"body":"A 10-day bounce (3-13 Aug 2015) with SHCOMP +9.2% and Coal #2/28 (+20.8%) was driven by continued national-team support and residual speculative demand. Defense (#1, +25.6%) and Coal (#2) led while banks lagged (-1.6%), pointing to a growth-style, cyclical-risk-on posture. The rally proved ephemeral: the PBOC shocked markets by devaluing the RMB by 1.86% on 11 August 2015, which rattled confidence and set up the August crash.","body_zh":"2015年8月3日至13日出现10天反弹，沪指+9.2%，煤炭以+20.8%居申万第2，受国家队持续托市及投机资金残余支撑。军工（+25.6%）和煤炭领涨，银行（-1.6%）落后，呈成长/周期风险偏好特征。但8月11日人民银行突然将人民币贬值1.86%，大幅震动市场信心，为8月大跌埋下伏笔。","drivers":["continued national-team support","residual speculative demand in cyclicals","cyclical risk-on rotation (defense+coal led)","PBOC RMB devaluation shock 11-Aug-2015 imminent"],"drivers_zh":["国家队持续护盘","投机残余资金买入周期品","周期性风险偏好轮动（军工+煤炭领涨）","8月11日汇率改革冲击临近"],"title":"Pre-devaluation dead-cat bounce in cyclicals","title_zh":"汇改前最后一波死猫反弹"},"2015-08-13":{"body":"After the PBOC's two-step RMB devaluation (11-14 August 2015, total ~3.5%), global risk-off accelerated. On 24 August ('Black Monday') SHCOMP fell 8.5% and on 25 August ('Black Tuesday') another 7.6%; over the full leg to 26 August the index fell 26%. Coal ranked last again (#28/28, -39.7%); defensives fell only -21.4% vs cyclicals -28.3%, confirming classic flight to safety. Coal's deeper loss also reflects that thermal coal spot prices were already in a multi-year downtrend on weak industrial demand.","body_zh":"人民银行8月11-14日分两步将人民币累计贬值约3.5%，全球风险规避情绪急剧升温。8月24日（黑色星期一）沪指暴跌8.5%，25日（黑色星期二）再跌7.6%，整段腿至8月26日大盘累跌26%。煤炭再度垫底（第28/28，-39.7%），防御板块均值-21.4%优于周期-28.3%，印证经典避险轮动。煤炭更深的跌幅还反映了热力煤现货价格多年持续下行、工业需求疲弱的基本面压制。","drivers":["PBOC RMB devaluation 11-14 Aug 2015 (~3.5%)","Black Monday/Tuesday panic selloff (-26% SHCOMP)","flight to safety (defensives -21.4% vs cyclicals -28.3%)","thermal coal spot in multi-year downtrend"],"drivers_zh":["央行8月11-14日人民币两步贬值约3.5%","黑色星期一/二恐慌性抛售（沪指-26%）","避险资金涌入防御板块","热力煤现货价格多年下行"],"title":"Yuan devaluation triggers Black Monday crash","title_zh":"人民币贬值触发黑色星期一"},"2015-08-26":{"body":"A 5-day rebound (26-31 Aug) saw SHCOMP recover 9.5% and Coal surge +25.2% to rank #1/28, driven by PBOC's 25-Aug RRR and rate cut (benchmark 1-year lending rate -25bp, RRR -50bp) announced after the Black Monday rout. Growth-vs-value was marginally negative (-2.3pp), meaning value/cyclicals barely led, consistent with a policy-relief bounce where beaten-down high-beta names snapped back hardest. The recovery proved brief.","body_zh":"2015年8月26日至31日的5天反弹中，沪指回升9.5%，煤炭以+25.2%领涨申万全行业（第1/28），主因央行于8月25日宣布同步降准50BP及降息25BP的政策组合拳提振情绪。成长/价值风格差微负（-2.3pp），价值/周期略占优，与政策松绑后超跌高贝塔品种弹性最大的特征一致。反弹持续时间短暂。","drivers":["PBOC 25-Aug-2015 rate cut -25bp + RRR cut -50bp","policy-relief snap-back from -26% crash","value/cyclicals marginally led (-2.3pp style)","high-beta reversal from crash lows"],"drivers_zh":["央行8月25日降息25BP+降准50BP","政策松绑情绪修复（距-26%低点）","价值/周期小幅领涨（风格差-2.3pp）","高贝塔品种从低点弹性反弹"],"title":"Policy backstop snap-back; value briefly leads","title_zh":"央行降息降准政策托底反弹"},"2015-08-31":{"body":"Between 31 Aug and 15 Sep 2015, SHCOMP fell -6.3% amid persistent global uncertainty (China GDP doubts, weak PMIs). Coal ranked #28/28 (-28.9%) while banks gained +2.2%, confirming deep flight-to-safety rotation. The sector's extreme negative divergence from the index (Coal -28.9% vs SHCOMP -6.3%) reflects: (1) commodity price weakness with thermal coal well below RMB 400/tonne, and (2) the sector's role as the market's leading risk-off indicator in A-shares during the 2015 crisis.","body_zh":"2015年8月31日至9月15日，全球对中国经济增速的疑虑持续（PMI走弱、GDP预期下调），沪指再跌-6.3%。煤炭以-28.9%垫底（第28/28），银行+2.2%高居榜首，典型的避险轮动。煤炭相对大盘的极端负向背离（-28.9% vs -6.3%）反映：（1）热力煤现货持续跌破400元/吨；（2）煤炭已成为2015年危机期间A股市场最敏感的风险偏好指示器。","drivers":["China GDP/PMI growth fears Sep-2015","flight to safety (banks led +2.2%)","thermal coal spot below RMB 400/t","coal as A-share leading risk-off signal"],"drivers_zh":["中国GDP/PMI增速忧虑（2015年9月）","避险资金买入银行（+2.2%）","热力煤现货跌破400元/吨","煤炭作为A股风险晴雨表领跌"],"title":"September risk-off selloff; Coal last again","title_zh":"九月风险规避卖压，煤炭再垫底"},"2015-09-15":{"body":"Between 15 Sep and 20 Nov 2015, SHCOMP recovered +20.8% on central bank easing (PBOC cut RRR and rates again in Oct 2015) and stabilisation of the RMB fixing. Coal ranked #2/28 (+57.2%) just behind Computers (+60.2%), with cyclicals leading defensives by 13pp and growth leading value by 16.8pp. The unusual co-leadership of Coal and Computers in a growth-tilt tape reflects that both were coming off their most compressed valuations; this was a beta rebound, not a coal fundamental story.","body_zh":"2015年9月15日至11月20日，央行10月再度降息降准、人民币中间价趋稳，沪指反弹+20.8%。煤炭以+57.2%紧随计算机（+60.2%）居申万第2，周期领先防御13pp，成长领先价值16.8pp。煤炭与计算机在成长偏好行情中共同领涨，源于两者均处于估值极度压缩后的贝塔弹性释放，并非煤炭基本面改善驱动。","drivers":["PBOC Oct-2015 rate + RRR cut","RMB fixing stabilisation","post-crash cyclical beta rebound","growth/value style tilt +16.8pp (dual leadership coal+tech)"],"drivers_zh":["央行10月降息降准","人民币中间价趋稳","超跌后周期贝塔反弹","成长/价值风格差+16.8pp（煤炭+科技双领）"],"title":"Post-crash stabilisation; growth/coal co-lead","title_zh":"超跌后宽基修复，成长/煤炭共领"},"2015-11-20":{"body":"Between 20 Nov 2015 and 13 Jan 2016 SHCOMP fell -18.8% as the new circuit-breaker mechanism (implemented 1 Jan 2016) triggered twice within the first week — on 4 Jan and 7 Jan — before being scrapped on 7 January. Simultaneously the PBOC fixed the yuan at its weakest level since March 2011 (~6.56/USD on 7 Jan), amplifying capital-flight fears. Coal ranked #28/28 (-38.9%) while banks fell only -8.6%, a textbook defensives-led flight-to-safety selloff. Value led growth by 5.3pp despite both falling.","body_zh":"2015年11月20日至2016年1月13日，沪指跌-18.8%。1月1日实施的熔断机制在第一周连续两次触发（1月4日、7日），随即于1月7日被叫停；同期央行将人民币中间价定于2011年3月以来最低点（约6.56/美元），加剧资本外流恐慌。煤炭以-38.9%垫底（第28/28），银行仅跌-8.6%，防御板块领先的典型避险行情。价值较成长跑赢5.3pp，但整体仍大幅下跌。","drivers":["A-share circuit breaker panic (triggered 4+7 Jan 2016, then scrapped)","yuan devaluation to 6.56/USD (weakest since Mar-2011)","capital flight fears amplified by PBOC fixing","flight to safety (banks -8.6% vs coal -38.9%)"],"drivers_zh":["A股熔断机制恐慌（1月4日、7日触发后叫停）","人民币贬值至6.56/美元（2011年3月以来最低）","央行定价加剧资本外流恐慌","避险轮动（银行-8.6% vs 煤炭-38.9%）"],"title":"Circuit breaker panic; yuan outflow shock","title_zh":"熔断恐慌与人民币贬值双重冲击"},"2016-01-13":{"body":"In February 2016 the State Council ordered coal mines to cut working days from 330 to 276 per year, targeting removal of 250 Mt/year of coal capacity. The NDRC-led supply-side reform ('de-capacity') was the structural catalyst. Coupled with a nascent demand recovery from the government's infrastructure credit impulse (TSF growth re-accelerating from Q1 2016), QHD 5500kcal coal prices rebounded from under RMB 370/t to above RMB 600/t by year-end 2016. Coal ranked #1/28 (+22.9%) vs SHCOMP +2.0%, with this sector-specific outperformance clearly distinguishing it from the beta-heavy 2014 leg.","body_zh":"2016年2月国务院下令煤矿年工作日从330天压缩至276天，目标削减产能2.5亿吨/年。发改委主导的供给侧去产能是结构性催化剂，叠加政府基建信贷脉冲（2016年一季度起社融增速重新加速）带来需求侧回暖，秦皇岛5500大卡动力煤价格从不足370元/吨反弹至2016年底逾600元/吨。煤炭以+22.9%领跑申万28行业（第1名），沪指同期仅涨+2.0%，显著的超额收益使本轮上涨有别于2014年贝塔驱动的牛市。","drivers":["State Council 276-day working limit Feb-2016","NDRC coal de-capacity target 250 Mt/yr","infrastructure credit impulse (TSF re-accelerating Q1-2016)","QHD coal price rebound RMB 370 to 600+/t"],"drivers_zh":["国务院276工作日令（2016年2月）","发改委去产能目标2.5亿吨/年","基建信贷社融加速回升（2016年一季度）","秦港5500大卡价格从370升至600+元/吨"],"title":"Supply-side reform ignites coal outperformance","title_zh":"供给侧去产能令推动煤炭独立超额收益"},"2016-03-23":{"body":"Between 23 Mar and 26 May 2016, SHCOMP fell -6.2% and Coal dropped -18.9% to rank last (#28/28). Context shows defensives leading by 5pp (food & bev +2.8%, banks -0.7%) while cyclicals fell -7.3%; Coal fell nearly 3x the index. This pullback reflects: (1) profit-taking after the 276-day rule drove a sharp one-month spike, (2) market scepticism that the demand side of the de-capacity trade was durable, and (3) SHCOMP weakness on residual capital-flow and yuan concerns.","body_zh":"2016年3月23日至5月26日，沪指跌-6.2%，煤炭跌-18.9%垫底（第28/28）。背景显示防御板块跑赢5pp（食品饮料+2.8%，银行-0.7%），周期跌-7.3%；煤炭跌幅约为大盘三倍。回调原因：（1）276工作日令引发的短期急涨后获利了结；（2）市场怀疑去产能需求端持续性；（3）资本流出及人民币压力致沪指走弱。","drivers":["de-capacity euphoria profit-taking","demand-side scepticism on 276-day reform durability","SHCOMP capital-flow weakness","defensives lead (food +2.8%, banks -0.7%)"],"drivers_zh":["去产能行情获利了结","市场质疑276工作日令需求端持续性","资本外流压制沪指","防御板块领先（食品+2.8%，银行-0.7%）"],"title":"Supply-reform euphoria fades; sector retreats","title_zh":"去产能行情获利了结，板块回调"},"2016-05-26":{"body":"This 6-year mega-leg (May 2016 to June 2022, +140.7%) encompasses three distinct sub-phases but shares a common structural driver: persistent value re-rating as coal's supply was constrained and demand oscillated. Sub-phase 1 (2016-2018): the 276-day cap drove QHD coal from RMB 370 to over RMB 700/t by late 2016; a record ~290 Mt of capacity was idled. Sub-phase 2 (2020): COVID demand crash temporarily erased gains before a V-shaped recovery on massive fiscal stimulus. Sub-phase 3 (2020-2022): the global energy crisis post-COVID plus the Russia-Ukraine war (Feb 2022) drove thermal coal to record highs above USD 400/t internationally; China's 2021 domestic shortage forced a 6-month power-rationing crisis and Beijing mandated coal mines to maximise output. The ctx confirms VALUE led growth by 25.4pp and Coal ranked #2/31 (+140.7%) as SHCOMP only gained 16.5%, confirming a genuine value-rerating/commodity super-cycle, not a beta story.","body_zh":"这段6年超级腿（2016年5月至2022年6月，+140.7%）涵盖三个明显子阶段，共同结构驱动力为煤炭供给持续受限下的价值重估。子阶段一（2016-2018年）：276工作日令推动秦港煤价从370元涨至2016年底逾700元/吨，创纪录约2.9亿吨产能被退出。子阶段二（2020年）：新冠疫情冲击需求，阶段性回撤后财政刺激推动V型修复。子阶段三（2020-2022年）：后疫情全球能源危机叠加俄乌战争（2022年2月），国际热力煤价一度超400美元/吨；2021年国内电力短缺引发大规模限电，北京随即命令煤矿全力增产。背景数据印证：该阶段价值领先成长25.4pp，煤炭以+140.7%居第二（第2/31），而沪指同期仅涨16.5%，证明这是真正的价值重估/商品超级周期，非贝塔驱动。","drivers":["NDRC 276-day de-capacity structural driver (2016)","COVID stimulus V-recovery (2020)","global energy crisis + Russia-Ukraine war (2021-2022)","domestic power-rationing crisis forcing Beijing output mandates"],"drivers_zh":["发改委276工作日去产能结构性驱动（2016）","新冠刺激V型修复（2020）","全球能源危机+俄乌战争（2021-2022）","国内电力短缺引发限电及增产令"],"title":"Six-year supply-reform energy crisis super-cycle","title_zh":"供给侧改革至能源危机六年超级周期"},"2022-06-14":{"body":"Between 14 Jun and 5 Aug 2022, SHCOMP fell -1.9% but tech led sharply (Electronics +11.9%, Telecoms +10.2%, Defense +9.8%) while Coal fell -18.0% to rank #31/31. The context is a growth-vs-value style rotation of +12.6pp favouring growth: post-Shanghai-lockdown relief (lockdowns ended May 2022), PBOC LPR cut in May 2022, and post-lockdown recovery optimism drove liquidity/theme rotation into tech. Coal peaked as a commodity-price play: QHD benchmark prices were near post-2016 highs and the market began pricing the energy-crisis premium out as global coal supply normalised after the Indonesia export ban was lifted.","body_zh":"2022年6月14日至8月5日，沪指仅跌-1.9%，但科技板块大幅领涨（电子+11.9%、通信+10.2%、军工+9.8%），煤炭跌-18.0%垫底（第31/31）。成长/价值风格差+12.6pp指向明显成长偏好：上海解封（2022年5月）后情绪修复、央行5月LPR降息及解封后经济复苏预期，驱动流动性主题轮动至科技赛道。与此同时，秦港基准煤价接近2016年以来高点，市场开始消化印尼出口禁令解除后全球煤炭供给正常化对能源危机溢价的定价。","drivers":["post-Shanghai-lockdown relief growth rotation (lockdowns ended May 2022)","PBOC LPR cut May 2022","growth/value style tilt +12.6pp (tech led)","coal energy-crisis premium fading as global supply normalised"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封后成长板块轮动回暖（2022年5月）","央行2022年5月LPR降息","成长/价值风格差+12.6pp（科技领涨）","煤炭能源危机溢价消退（全球供给正常化）"],"title":"Growth rotation: tech beats coal at cycle peak","title_zh":"成长风格轮动，煤炭见顶回落"},"2022-08-05":{"body":"Between 5-25 August 2022, an extreme heatwave and drought in Sichuan province cut hydropower generation (Sichuan relied on hydro for ~80% of power); the shortfall triggered mandatory industrial power rationing across the province. This renewed domestic energy security shock drove Coal to +21.8%, ranking #1/31 while SHCOMP rose only +0.6%. Oil & Gas (+10.6%) co-led, confirming an energy-price commodity rotation. Value led growth by 5pp and tech fell (Electronics -3.4%, Computers -6.8%), consistent with a commodity re-rating away from liquidity themes.","body_zh":"2022年8月5日至25日，四川遭遇极端高温干旱，水电出力大幅下降（四川约80%电力依赖水电），工业限电被迫重启。国内能源安全再度告急，推动煤炭以+21.8%领涨申万31行业（第1名），沪指同期仅涨+0.6%。油气（+10.6%）协同领涨，印证能源商品轮动。价值领先成长5pp，电子（-3.4%）、计算机（-6.8%）回落，与流动性主题消退、商品重估一致。","drivers":["Sichuan hydro drought Aug-2022 (~80% hydro reliance, severe shortfall)","mandatory industrial power rationing in Sichuan/Chongqing","energy security commodity rotation (coal+oil led)","value over growth +5pp (tech fell)"],"drivers_zh":["四川极端干旱致水电出力骤降（供电约80%依赖水电）","工业强制限电重启（四川/重庆）","能源安全商品轮动（煤炭+油气领涨）","价值跑赢成长5pp（科技回落）"],"title":"Sichuan drought-shock restores coal premium","title_zh":"四川水电干旱再现电力危机"},"2022-08-25":{"body":"Between 25 Aug 2022 and 21 Aug 2023 (12 months), SHCOMP fell -4.7% as China's economy underperformed reopening expectations. Media (+22.3%), Telecoms (+21.2%) and Computers (+19.4%) led on a growth style tilt of +11.3pp — driven by policy support for the digital economy, AI theme emergence (ChatGPT launched Nov 2022) and TMT liquidity rotation. Coal ranked #31/31 (-30.8%) as global coal prices normalised sharply from 2022 peaks (the European energy crisis receded), domestic property sector slump cut industrial coal demand, and the delayed zero-COVID exit through late 2022 kept recovery expectations suppressed.","body_zh":"2022年8月25日至2023年8月21日（12个月），沪指跌-4.7%，中国经济复苏不及预期。传媒（+22.3%）、通信（+21.2%）、计算机（+19.4%）领涨，成长/价值风格差+11.3pp——受数字经济政策支持、AI主题兴起（ChatGPT 2022年11月上线）及TMT流动性轮动驱动。煤炭以-30.8%垫底（第31/31）：全球煤价自2022年高点大幅回落（欧洲能源危机消退），国内地产下行压制工业用煤需求，动态清零政策延续至2022年末延误复苏预期。","drivers":["global coal price normalisation from 2022 record peaks","property sector slump cutting industrial coal demand","zero-COVID lockdowns delaying recovery expectations","AI/TMT growth theme led (+11.3pp style)"],"drivers_zh":["全球煤价自2022年高点大幅回落","地产下行压制工业用煤需求","动态清零政策延误复苏预期","AI/TMT主题驱动成长领先（+11.3pp）"],"title":"Post-energy-crisis deflation; tech leads, coal lags","title_zh":"后能源危机通缩，科技领涨煤炭垫底"},"2023-08-21":{"body":"Between 21 Aug 2023 and 29 May 2024, Coal ranked #1/31 (+42.0%) while SHCOMP was flat (+0.6%). Cyclicals underperformed defensives (-1.3% vs +1.5%) and value crushed growth by 15.4pp (banks +15.2%, appliances +14.6%). This is a textbook high-dividend/yield-seeking rotation: with SHCOMP flat and growth stocks under pressure from the property crisis and deflationary backdrop, institutional money rotated into coal for its exceptional dividend yields (sector average 5-8% in 2023, with Shenhua and Yankuang paying out over 80% of earnings). The CSRC's push for SOE dividend enhancement and the Central SOE valuation re-rating narrative from late 2022 added further structural support.","body_zh":"2023年8月21日至2024年5月29日，煤炭以+42.0%领涨申万31行业（第1名），沪指同期几乎零涨幅（+0.6%）。周期跑输防御（-1.3% vs +1.5%），价值大幅领先成长15.4pp（银行+15.2%，家电+14.6%）。这是典型的高股息/寻息轮动：沪指平淡、地产危机+通缩背景下成长股承压，机构资金流向煤炭的超高股息（板块均值5-8%，神华/兖矿派息率逾80%）。证监会国企分红强化倡议及中央国企估值重估叙事自2022年底持续发酵，也为板块带来额外结构性支撑。","drivers":["high-dividend/yield rotation (sector avg 5-8% yield 2023)","SOE dividend enhancement push (CSRC + Central SOE re-rating)","value over growth 15.4pp (property crisis + deflation)","coal supply tightness on strong summer power demand"],"drivers_zh":["高股息寻息轮动（煤炭板块股息率均值5-8%）","证监会推动国企提升分红（中特估）","价值大幅领先成长15.4pp（地产危机+通缩）","夏季电力需求旺盛支撑煤炭供需"],"title":"High-dividend value rescue; Coal leads flat mkt","title_zh":"高股息价值轮动，煤炭领涨平淡市场"},"2024-05-29":{"body":"Between 29 May and 11 Sep 2024, Coal fell -25.3% to rank #31/31 while SHCOMP dropped -12.5%. Thermal coal spot prices fell roughly 25% in H1 2024 from 2023 highs: record domestic output (Xinjiang and Inner Mongolia capacity additions) combined with weak industrial demand from the property slump created a supply-demand surplus. The QHD 5500 benchmark fell from approximately RMB 850/t to below RMB 700/t by mid-2024. Coal's dividend yield thesis was undermined as earnings visibility fell; growth (Electronics -5.2%, Autos -6.6%) slightly outperformed value (growth-value tilt +6.5pp) as AI/tech remained relatively supported.","body_zh":"2024年5月29日至9月11日，煤炭跌-25.3%垫底（第31/31），沪指同期跌-12.5%。2024年上半年热力煤现货价格较2023年高点回落约25%：新疆、内蒙古新增产能释放带来国内供应创纪录，叠加地产下行压制工业需求，供需明显宽松。秦港5500大卡基准价从约850元/吨降至2024年中旬700元/吨以下。煤炭盈利能见度下降削弱了股息逻辑；AI/科技相对抗跌（电子-5.2%），成长小幅跑赢价值（风格差+6.5pp）。","drivers":["QHD coal price -25% in H1-2024 (record domestic supply)","Xinjiang/Inner Mongolia capacity additions creating supply surplus","property slump cutting industrial coal demand","dividend yield thesis undermined by falling earnings"],"drivers_zh":["秦港煤价2024年上半年跌25%（国内产能创纪录）","新疆/内蒙古新增产能形成供应过剩","地产下行压制工业用煤需求","盈利下行削弱高股息逻辑"],"title":"Coal price slump ends dividend premium","title_zh":"煤价下行终结股息溢价逻辑"},"2024-09-11":{"body":"On 23 September 2024 the PBOC announced its most aggressive package since 2015: a 50bp RRR cut (freeing approximately RMB 1 tn), benchmark mortgage rate cuts, and direct stock market support measures. SHCOMP surged 22.6% by 30 September; all sectors rallied but the rotation favoured Real Estate (+41.5%), Brokers (+38.7%) and consumer recovery plays as the stimulus narrative targeted property and consumer sectors, not commodities. Coal ranked #18/31 (+25.6%) — near the market average — confirming pure index-beta participation rather than sector leadership.","body_zh":"2024年9月23日，中国人民银行宣布自2015年以来最激进的政策组合：降准50BP（释放约1万亿流动性）、下调存量房贷利率，并出台资本市场稳定工具。沪指至9月30日涨+22.6%；各板块普涨，但轮动重心在房地产（+41.5%）、券商（+38.7%）及消费复苏概念，政策刺激预期集中于地产和消费而非大宗商品。煤炭以+25.6%排名第18/31，仅跟随市场均值，属纯贝塔参与而非领涨。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut + mortgage rate cuts 23-Sep-2024","broad SHCOMP beta rally +22.6%","property/broker/consumer as actual Shenwan leaders","coal mid-rank (18/31): pure beta, no commodity catalyst"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月23日降准50BP+下调房贷利率","沪指+22.6%宽基贝塔普涨","地产/券商/消费板块真正领涨","煤炭排名居中（第18/31）：纯贝塔，无商品催化"],"title":"PBOC bazooka lifts all sectors; Coal mid-pack","title_zh":"央行大宽松普涨，煤炭中游参与"},"2024-09-30":{"body":"Between 30 Sep 2024 and 7 Apr 2025, SHCOMP fell -7.2% as the post-bazooka stimulus euphoria faded without visible economic follow-through. Coal ranked #31/31 (-22.6%) while banks (+2.8%), computers (+2.8%) and conglomerates (+3.0%) held positive. The growth/value tilt was mildly growth-positive (+3.9pp), with no commodity catalyst to re-rate Coal. Thermal coal prices remained range-bound in the RMB 650-730/t range — well below energy-crisis peaks — and the property sector stayed in deep distress, limiting industrial coal demand recovery. Coal remained the market's preferred instrument for expressing risk-off/commodity-bear views.","body_zh":"2024年9月30日至2025年4月7日，刺激政策预期落空，经济环比改善不及预期，沪指跌-7.2%。煤炭以-22.6%垫底（第31/31），银行（+2.8%）、计算机（+2.8%）、综合（+3.0%）持平或微涨。成长/价值风格差微正（+3.9pp），无商品价格催化剂支撑煤炭估值重估。热力煤现货维持在650-730元/吨区间震荡，远低于能源危机峰值，地产继续深度调整压制工业煤炭需求。煤炭仍是市场表达风险厌恶/商品熊市观点的首选工具。","drivers":["post-stimulus euphoria fading (no economic follow-through)","property sector still distressed (deep adjustment)","coal price range-bound RMB 650-730/t","coal used as market risk-off proxy (ranked last)"],"drivers_zh":["刺激预期落空（经济未见实质改善）","地产仍深度调整","热力煤价格区间震荡650-730元/吨","煤炭作为市场风险厌恶指示器持续垫底"],"title":"Stimulus fade; Coal worst laggard again","title_zh":"刺激预期落空，煤炭再度垫底"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"Between 7 Apr 2025 and 4 Jun 2026 (+46.2%, ranked #9/31), the leg began at the trough of the US-China tariff escalation (Trump imposed 145% tariffs; Beijing retaliated with 125%). SHCOMP surged +31.0% as the trade-war shock was absorbed and a macro stabilisation rally followed a May 2025 tariff truce. From mid-2025, a secondary structural driver emerged: AI data-centre electricity demand (Chinese data centre power consumption projected to grow ~19%/yr to 2030) kept coal power plants firmly in the national energy mix; China commissioned 21 GW of new coal power in H1 2025, the highest since 2016. Indonesia's tightened export controls in early June 2026 lifted the thermal coal benchmark close to 3-year highs before the leg topped. Coal's +46.2% gain trailed the growth-tech leaders (Telecoms +258.9%, Electronics +147.5%), consistent with a broad risk-on tape where coal rode beta but did not lead.","body_zh":"2025年4月7日至2026年6月4日（+46.2%，申万第9/31），本轮上涨始于中美关税博弈阶段性低谷（特朗普加征145%关税，北京反制125%）。沪指+31.0%，贸易战冲击被吸收后宏观稳定预期修复，2025年5月中美关税休战协议进一步推动行情。2025年中期出现第二重结构性驱动：AI数据中心用电需求（中国数据中心用电量预计至2030年年均增长约19%）将煤电牢固锚定于能源供给体系，中国2025年上半年新增煤电装机21GW，为2016年以来最高。2026年6月初印尼收紧煤炭出口管制将热力煤基准价推至近三年高点，成为本腿见顶前的最后催化剂。煤炭+46.2%尽管可观，但仍落后于通信（+258.9%）、电子（+147.5%）等科技领头羊，与宽基风险偏好行情中煤炭跟随贝塔而非领涨的定位一致。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce/stabilisation (Apr-May 2025)","AI data-centre power demand growth (~19%/yr to 2030)","China commissioning 21 GW coal power H1-2025 (highest since 2016)","Indonesia export control tightening Jun-2026 (late-leg catalyst)"],"drivers_zh":["中美关税阶段性缓和（2025年4-5月）","AI数据中心用电需求高速增长（年均+19%至2030年）","中国2025年上半年新增煤电装机21GW（2016年以来最高）","印尼2026年6月收紧煤炭出口管制（腿末催化剂）"],"title":"Trade-war trough; AI power demand re-rates coal","title_zh":"中美贸易战低点至AI用电需求重估"},"2026-06-04":{"body":"Between 4-26 June 2026, Coal fell -20.8% to rank #31/31 while SHCOMP was nearly flat (-0.8%). The ctx shows Building Materials (+24.8%) and Electronics (+17.1%) leading while Coal, Utilities and Autos were the worst laggards. Thermal coal futures had spiked to near-3-year highs in early June (Indonesia export controls), but a combination of emerging Iran nuclear deal expectations and mild weather rapidly compressed the energy risk premium. Defensives averaged -7.2% and cyclicals -3.7%, with Coal far underperforming both groups — confirming an idiosyncratic commodity-price-driven selloff rather than a broad risk-off move. Growth/value tilt was marginally positive (+2.3pp), with Building Materials and Electronics catching independent bids (construction-cycle and AI-chip themes), while coal earnings revisions turned negative on falling spot prices.","body_zh":"2026年6月4日至26日，煤炭跌-20.8%垫底（第31/31），沪指同期近乎持平（-0.8%）。背景显示建材（+24.8%）、电子（+17.1%）领涨，煤炭、公用事业、汽车垫底。6月初印尼出口管制推动热力煤期货触及近三年高点后，伊朗核协议预期升温叠加气温温和，能源危机风险溢价快速消退。防御板块均值-7.2%，周期-3.7%，煤炭大幅跑输两组，印证这是由煤价下跌驱动的特异性回调而非宽基避险行情。成长/价值风格差微正（+2.3pp），建材和电子分别受基建周期及AI芯片主题支撑独立走强，而煤炭盈利预期随现货价下跌转负。","drivers":["Iran nuclear deal expectations compressing energy risk premium","thermal coal retreat from near-3yr highs (Indonesia catalyst fading)","coal earnings revisions negative on falling spot prices","Building Materials/Electronics catching independent theme bids"],"drivers_zh":["伊朗核协议预期压制能源风险溢价","热力煤期货自近三年高点回落（印尼出口管制催化剂消退）","煤价下跌致盈利预期下调","建材/电子受独立主题支撑（基建周期+AI芯片）"],"title":"Iran peace hopes compress energy; Coal last","title_zh":"伊朗和谈预期压制能源板块，煤炭垫底"}},"now":"Coal (801950) is currently in a Rolling over downturn phase at position 48.2/100 with RS rank 25/31, below its 200-day moving average. Since peaking on 4 June 2026, the index has shed roughly 20.8% in three weeks, ranking dead last across all 31 Shenwan industries. The now_ctx shows SHCOMP barely flat (+1.6%) with a sharp growth/style tilt of +18.2pp favouring Electronics, Telecoms and Building Materials, while defensives average -12.1%. Coal is being actively penalised in an AI-infrastructure capex narrative tape (Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%); thermal coal prices retreated from near three-year highs reached in early June after Indonesia tightened export controls, then fell back as Iran peace-deal expectations compressed the oil/gas/coal complex. No buy signal is present; the structure is consistent with a mid-cycle digestion after the April 2025 to June 2026 beta-lift.","now_zh":"煤炭板块（801950）当前处于\"滚顶回落\"下行阶段，位置指标48.2，相对强度排名25/31，股价低于200日均线。自2026年6月4日见顶以来，指数三周内回落约20.8%，在申万31个行业中垫底。当前板块轮动背景显示沪指仅微涨1.6%，成长/价值风格差高达+18.2百分点，电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）、建材（+48.1%）领涨，防御板块均值-12.1%。煤炭作为\"价值/周期\"标签，在AI基建主题驱动的流动性行情中被主动规避。印尼煤炭出口管制收紧曾助推力煤期货6月初触及近三年高点，但随后伊朗和谈预期压制油气燃料板块，煤炭随之回落。板块当前无买入信号，结构上与2025年4月至2026年6月贝塔修复后的中段消化吻合。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801960":{"legs":{"2021-12-13":{"body":"Russia's full-scale invasion of Ukraine on 24 February 2022 sent Brent crude from roughly $80/bbl to a monthly average of $114/bbl by June 2022, the highest in real terms since 2014, directly lifting realized prices and earnings expectations for PetroChina, CNOOC, and Sinopec. Simultaneously the SHCOMP fell -10.7% as Shanghai's two-month zero-COVID lockdown (April-May 2022) crushed growth and tech stocks, generating a powerful value rotation: Oil & Gas ranked #2/31 (+4.3%) while Electronics fell -31.8% and Computers dropped -25.8%. This was an index-relative outperformance play — the sector held flat in absolute terms while everything else sold off — driven by commodity-price tailwinds and the value-versus-growth style flip of 18.2 percentage points.","body_zh":"2022年2月24日俄罗斯全面入侵乌克兰，推动布伦特原油从约80美元/桶飙升至6月月均114美元/桶，为2014年以来实际最高值，直接提振中石油、中海油、中石化的实现油价及盈利预期。与此同时，上海两个月的新冠封控（4-5月）拖累上证综指下跌10.7%，引发强烈价值风格切换：石油天然气行业以+4.3%排名第2/31，而电子、计算机分别暴跌31.8%和25.8%。这是一次指数相对跑赢行情——板块在绝对收益上基本持平，商品价格尾风叠加价值vs成长风格利差18.2个百分点提供了全部超额收益。","drivers":["Brent crude spike to $114/bbl on Russia-Ukraine war","Zero-COVID lockdowns crush growth/tech stocks","SHCOMP -10.7% value rotation","China SOE energy majors benefit from elevated realized prices","Growth-to-value style flip +18.2pp"],"drivers_zh":["俄乌战争推动布伦特油价冲至114美元/桶","动态清零封控拖垮成长/科技股","上证综指-10.7%引发价值风格切换","国有石油巨头受益于高实现油价","成长/价值风格差+18.2个百分点"],"title":"Russia-Ukraine War Lifts Energy vs. Growth Selloff","title_zh":"俄乌战争推动能源价值风格抗跌"},"2022-06-14":{"body":"From June through October 2022, Brent crude fell from $114/bbl to around $84/bbl as the Fed's aggressive rate hike cycle (75bp hikes in June, July, September, and November 2022) ignited global recession fears and crushed oil demand forecasts. Growth/tech stocks staged a relative rebound as PBOC eased and China's 20th Party Congress in late October fueled early reopening speculation, causing the style factor to flip: growth outperformed value by 13.6pp and Oil & Gas became a confirmed Shenwan laggard (-21.8%, ranked #29/31). The sector's double blow was crude rolling over from its war-spike highs while rotation back into tech/defense left energy as an outright underperformer — the ctx confirms this was an index beta down-leg amplified by commodity price collapse.","body_zh":"2022年6-10月，美联储激进加息（6月、7月、9月、11月各加75基点）引发全球衰退担忧，布伦特油价从114美元/桶跌至约84美元/桶，石油需求预期大幅下调。与此同时，PBOC宽松及10月下旬20大召开引发早期重开预期，科技/国防股相对反弹，成长跑赢价值13.6个百分点，石油天然气行业以-21.8%排名第29/31。板块遭受双重打击——原油从战争高点回落，叠加资金回流科技/国防，能源成为绝对落后者；上证综指-12.0%，表明这既是商品价格崩塌又是大盘beta下行的共同作用。","drivers":["Brent crude drops $30/bbl from war-spike highs","Fed aggressive 75bp rate hike cycle triggers recession fears","SHCOMP -12.0% broad market down-leg","Growth/tech style rebound vs value rotation reversal","China 20th Party Congress rekindles growth/tech speculation"],"drivers_zh":["布伦特油价从战争高点大幅回落逾30美元","美联储激进加息（75bp）触发全球衰退担忧","上证综指-12.0%大盘下行","成长/科技相对价值风格回归","20大召开重燃成长/科技预期"],"title":"Crude Collapse and Growth Rebound Hit Energy Hard","title_zh":"油价崩跌叠加成长风格反弹重挫能源"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"China's abrupt exit from zero-COVID — signaled by the November 11, 2022 '20-measures' relaxation and fully confirmed by December 2022-January 2023 — unleashed a broad reopening rally that lifted the SHCOMP +17.0%. Oil & Gas gained +24.7% (ranked #7/31) as the market priced in a sharp recovery in Chinese oil demand that Wood Mackenzie estimated would account for nearly 40% of global 2023 demand growth, pushing Brent back toward $85-90/bbl. The rally was a broad beta play rather than sector-specific leadership — Media (+61.5%), Computers (+34.1%), and Telecoms (+30.9%) led, with Oil & Gas a middle-ranked beneficiary of both the demand-recovery narrative and the index surge, while Coal and Power Equipment lagged on regulatory concerns.","body_zh":"2022年11月11日'二十条'放开措施落地，12月全面退出动态清零，2023年1月正式确认重开，引爆大范围复苏行情，上证综指上涨17.0%。石油天然气以+24.7%排名第7/31——市场定价中国石油需求强劲复苏（麦肯锡估计占2023年全球需求增量约40%），推动布伦特油价重回85-90美元/桶区间。但本轮行情本质上是大盘beta反弹而非板块主导：传媒（+61.5%）、计算机（+34.1%）、通信（+30.9%）领涨，石油天然气是居中受益者，而煤炭、电力设备因监管顾虑落后。","drivers":["China zero-COVID exit (Nov 2022 '20-measures', Dec full reopening)","SHCOMP +17.0% broad index beta rally","China oil demand recovery narrative (~40% of 2023 global growth)","Brent crude recovery toward $85-90/bbl","Broad growth/cyclical style re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["中国退出动态清零（11月二十条、12月全面放开）","上证综指+17.0%大盘beta反弹","中国石油需求强劲复苏预期（占2023年全球增量约40%）","布伦特油价回升至85-90美元/桶","成长/周期风格全面重估"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit & Reopening Bid Lifts All Cyclicals","title_zh":"退出动态清零重开预期带动周期全面反弹"},"2023-04-17":{"body":"The reopening demand recovery materially undershot consensus: China's GDP deflator turned negative in Q2 2023 (deflationary for the first time since 2009), property developer liquidity crises deepened (Country Garden neared default by mid-2023), and Chinese oil demand growth stalled well below early forecasts. Brent crude slid back toward $70-80/bbl through H2 2023. The sector fell -19.3% (ranked #10/31), broadly in line with the SHCOMP's -18.6% decline; defensives (banks, coal, textiles) relatively outperformed — a flight-to-safety signal confirming the selloff was macro/demand-disappointment driven rather than sector-specific. Oil & Petrochem was punished by faltering demand, widening refining-margin pressure, and downstream petrochemical overcapacity building in China.","body_zh":"重开后的需求复苏大幅低于预期：中国GDP平减指数在2023年Q2转负（2009年以来首次通缩），房地产开发商流动性危机加剧（碧桂园2023年中濒临违约），中国石油需求增长远低于早期预测。布伦特油价回落至70-80美元/桶区间。板块下跌19.3%（排名第10/31），与上证综指-18.6%基本同步；煤炭、银行、纺织等防御性板块相对领先，属于典型的避险切换而非板块个性下跌。石油石化同时承压于需求低迷、炼化利润率收窄及国内下游石化产能过剩。","drivers":["China macro disappointment — GDP deflator turns negative Q2 2023","Property crisis deepens (Country Garden near default mid-2023)","Brent crude slides $70-80/bbl on demand shortfall","Flight-to-safety rotation to defensives (banks, coal, textiles)","Petrochemical overcapacity building in China"],"drivers_zh":["中国宏观数据失望——2023年Q2 GDP平减指数转负","房地产危机深化（碧桂园2023年中濒临违约）","需求低迷拖累布伦特油价跌至70-80美元/桶","资金避险切换至银行、煤炭等防御性板块","国内下游石化行业产能持续过剩"],"title":"China Demand Disappointment & Deflation Drag","title_zh":"中国需求复苏失望叠加通缩拖累"},"2024-01-22":{"body":"From late January to April 2024, a powerful SOE dividend-yield and value-rerating cycle lifted Oil & Gas to #2/31 with a +25.9% gain, outperformed only by Metals (+29.1%). The State Council's April 2024 'Nine-Point Guidelines' codified market-value management obligations for SOEs — dividend hikes and buybacks — driving a rotation into high-yield state energy majors: CNOOC's forward dividend yield exceeded 10% while PetroChina offered 6-8%. This coincided with Brent crude recovering to the $85-90/bbl range on OPEC+ supply discipline, while the value style outperformed growth by 9.1pp, confirming this was a policy-driven SOE re-rating amplified by commodity price recovery rather than pure beta.","body_zh":"2024年1月下旬至4月，国有企业市值管理与股息再定价浪潮推动石油天然气以+25.9%排名第2/31，仅次于有色金属（+29.1%）。国务院2024年4月'新国九条'将市值管理纳入国有企业考核，明确要求提高分红、实施回购，驱动资金流向高股息国有能源巨头：中海油远期股息收益率超过10%，中石油约6-8%。同期布伦特油价在欧佩克+减产纪律约束下回升至85-90美元/桶；价值风格跑赢成长9.1个百分点，确认本轮行情由政策驱动的国企重估主导，叠加商品价格修复提供额外动力。","drivers":["State Council 'Nine-Point Guidelines' (Apr 2024) SOE market-value management mandate","CNOOC forward dividend yield >10%, PetroChina 6-8% — SOE re-rating","Brent crude $85-90/bbl on OPEC+ supply discipline","Value outperforms growth by 9.1pp","SHCOMP +11.2% risk-on with cyclicals leading"],"drivers_zh":["国务院新国九条（2024年4月）国企市值管理要求","中海油远期股息收益率超10%、中石油6-8%——国企重估","欧佩克+减产纪律支撑布伦特油价至85-90美元/桶","价值风格跑赢成长9.1个百分点","上证综指+11.2%，周期板块领涨"],"title":"SOE Dividend Yield Hunt & Commodity Value Re-rating","title_zh":"国企股息重估叠加大宗价值风格回归"},"2024-04-19":{"body":"From April 19 to September 11, 2024, Oil & Gas dropped -20.6% (ranked #27/31) as macro deterioration erased the dividend/SOE rally. Brent crude retreated from the $90/bbl area toward $70-75/bbl, pressured by persistent China demand weakness (IEA cut China oil demand growth forecasts), the EV substitution narrative gaining traction (China NEV penetration hit a record 43.8% of new vehicle sales in July 2024), and OPEC+ signaling production unwinds. Defensives (Brokers -0.5%, Electronics -1.3%, Banks -6.8%) led relative to deep cyclicals: Coal fell -24.1%, Steel -24.2% — Oil & Gas was a fellow commodity laggard in a broad energy/materials selloff as the cycle peaked and demand-structurally peaked.","body_zh":"2024年4月19日至9月11日，石油天然气下跌20.6%（排名第27/31），上半年股息/国企行情获利了结，大宗商品全面回调。布伦特油价从90美元/桶回落至70-75美元/桶，中国需求持续低迷（IEA持续下调需求预测），新能源车替代叙事加速（2024年7月中国NEV渗透率创历史新高43.8%），欧佩克+释放增产信号。防御性板块（券商-0.5%、电子-1.3%、银行-6.8%）相对领跑，煤炭-24.1%、钢铁-24.2%与石油天然气同为大宗商品深度落后者，周期高点回落叠加结构性需求见顶共同主导本轮回调。","drivers":["Brent crude retreats from $90/bbl to $70-75/bbl on demand outlook deterioration","IEA cuts China oil demand growth forecasts","China NEV penetration hits record 43.8% (Jul 2024) — structural peak-demand narrative","OPEC+ production unwind signals","Broad commodity/materials selloff; defensives lead on relative basis"],"drivers_zh":["布伦特油价从90美元/桶回落至70-75美元/桶","IEA持续下调中国石油需求增长预测","中国NEV渗透率创历史新高43.8%（2024年7月），结构性需求见顶叙事走强","欧佩克+释放增产信号","大宗商品/材料全面下跌，防御性板块相对领涨"],"title":"Commodity & Energy Giveback in Risk-Off Rotation","title_zh":"大宗商品与能源获利回吐，避险切换主导"},"2024-09-11":{"body":"On 24 September 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a sweeping stimulus package: benchmark rate cuts, RRR reduction, property sector support, and two new market-stabilization tools. The SHCOMP surged +28.2% through 8 October 2024 — the biggest CSI 300 single-session gain since July 2020. Oil & Gas participated with a +23.2% gain but ranked only #28/31 as the stimulus unleashed a liquidity-driven growth/tech surge: Computers gained +54.7%, Beauty +52.6%, and Brokers +52.3%. Even defensives (Utilities +17.5%, Banks +22.3%) outpaced Oil & Gas, confirming this was a sentiment-reset, leverage-fueled, growth-led beta spike where the energy sector was a pure index-beta laggard even within the rally.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子刺激政策：降息、降准、房地产支持措施及两项新市场稳定工具。上证综指至10月8日大涨28.2%，为2020年7月以来沪深300最大单日涨幅。石油天然气录得+23.2%，但仅排名第28/31——刺激政策引爆流动性驱动的成长/科技行情：计算机+54.7%、美容+52.6%、券商+52.3%，甚至防御性板块（公用事业+17.5%、银行+22.3%）也跑赢石油天然气。确认这是一轮情绪重置、杠杆驱动、成长主导的beta脉冲，石油天然气在本轮反弹中是纯粹的大盘beta落后者。","drivers":["PBOC Sept 24 mega-stimulus (rate cuts, RRR cut, market stabilization tools)","SHCOMP +28.2% — largest CSI 300 gain since Jul 2020","Liquidity/sentiment surge into growth/tech (computers, brokers, beauty lead)","Oil & Gas pure beta laggard — even defensives outpaced energy","Growth outperforms value by 11.8pp"],"drivers_zh":["央行9.24超级刺激（降息、降准、市场稳定工具）","上证综指+28.2%，为2020年7月以来沪深300最大涨幅","流动性/情绪资金涌入成长科技（计算机、券商、美容领涨）","石油天然气为纯粹大盘beta落后者，防御股也跑赢能源","成长跑赢价值11.8个百分点"],"title":"PBOC Sept 24 Stimulus Sparks Broad SHCOMP Surge","title_zh":"央行9.24超级刺激触发上证综指大反弹"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"From October 8, 2024 through April 7, 2025, the 9.24 stimulus euphoria faded as fiscal follow-through disappointed (the November 2024 NPC Standing Committee supplementary budget of CNY 10 trillion fell short of market hopes), the SHCOMP fell -11.3%, and oil-specific headwinds mounted. Brent crude eroded from the $80s back toward $65-70/bbl through early 2025, driven by ongoing Chinese fuel demand softness and OPEC+ supply drift. Oil & Gas fell -19.6% (ranked #26/31), broadly in line with index beta — the empty ctx signals indicate no cross-sectional leadership differentiation, simply a broad cyclicals selloff with Banks (-0.1%) and Conglomerates (-1.6%) sheltering capital while energy tracked the market lower on demand pessimism.","body_zh":"2024年10月8日至2025年4月7日，9.24刺激行情热情消退——2024年11月全国人大常委会补充预算10万亿元低于市场预期，上证综指下跌11.3%。布伦特油价从80美元/桶区间逐步回落至65-70美元/桶，中国燃油需求持续疲软、欧佩克+供给边际宽松。石油天然气下跌19.6%（排名第26/31），基本跟随大盘beta——申万横截面数据无明显分化信号，仅是周期股整体下跌，银行（-0.1%）、综合（-1.6%）防御性资金避险，能源板块在需求悲观预期中跟随大盘下行。","drivers":["Post-9.24 fiscal follow-through disappointment (Nov 2024 NPC supplementary budget)","SHCOMP -11.3% broad market correction","Brent crude retreats to $65-70/bbl on China demand softness and OPEC+ drift","April 2025 US-China tariff shock amplifies trough (WTI ~$60/bbl)","Banks/congloms shelter capital — no cyclical recovery signal"],"drivers_zh":["9.24刺激后续财政力度低于预期（2024年11月人大常委会补充预算）","上证综指-11.3%大盘调整","中国需求低迷叠加欧佩克+增产拖累布伦特油价回落至65-70美元/桶","2025年4月美中关税冲击加深低点（WTI约60美元/桶）","资金避险至银行/综合类，无周期复苏信号"],"title":"Post-Stimulus Hangover & Crude Demand Pessimism","title_zh":"刺激退潮叠加原油需求悲观压制板块"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"This extraordinary +77.6% leg — the largest in the dataset — was driven primarily by the 2026 Iran war's Strait of Hormuz crisis. The leg started from a cyclical trough at the April 2025 US-China tariff shock nadir (WTI ~$60/bbl as China imposed 125% retaliatory tariffs and OPEC+ accelerated output). Recovery built through late 2025 on the DeepSeek-driven AI/SHCOMP bull run and China's energy SOEs benefiting from strategic crude stockpiling (+54 million tonnes in 2025). The decisive inflection came on 28 February 2026 when US-Israel launched strikes on Iran; after the Hormuz blockade took hold by 4 March 2026, Brent surged past $120/bbl — the IEA's largest supply disruption on record — sending PetroChina, CNOOC, and Sinopec to consecutive limit-up sessions (the first triple simultaneous limit-up halts in their history). The sector ranked #4/31 as cyclicals broadly surged (+51.6% avg vs defensives +7.7%), with Metals and Telecoms ahead, confirming broad risk-on beta amplified by an extraordinary supply shock.","body_zh":"本轮+77.6%是数据集内最大涨幅，核心驱动为2026年伊核战争引发的霍尔木兹海峡危机。起点（2025年4月7日）恰逢美中关税冲击周期低点（2025年4月中旬WTI跌至约60美元/桶，中国加征125%关税、欧佩克+加速增产）。2025年下半年，DeepSeek驱动的AI行情推动上证综指走强，中国能源国企同步受益于战略储油大幅扩张（2025年增储约5400万吨）。决定性转折点为2026年2月28日美以对伊朗发动空袭，3月4日霍尔木兹海峡全面封锁，布伦特油价飙升至120美元/桶以上（IEA史上最大供给中断），中石油、中海油、中石化历史性地同步三个涨停（史上首次）。板块以+77.6%排名第4/31，周期股均涨51.6%，大幅跑赢防御股（+7.7%），有色金属、通信居前，确认为大盘beta叠加史诗级供给冲击的共振行情。","drivers":["2026 Iran war — US-Israel strikes 28 Feb 2026 and Hormuz blockade 4 Mar 2026","Brent crude surges past $120/bbl — IEA's largest supply disruption on record","PetroChina/CNOOC/Sinopec simultaneous limit-up halts (historic first)","SHCOMP +33.1% AI/cyclical-led bull run through the leg","China strategic crude stockpiling +54M tonnes reducing US crude exposure"],"drivers_zh":["2026年伊核战争——美以空袭（2月28日）及霍尔木兹海峡封锁（3月4日）","布伦特油价飙升至120美元/桶以上，IEA史上最大供给中断","中石油/中海油/中石化历史性同步三个涨停","上证综指+33.1%，AI/周期股驱动牛市","中国战略储油增储逾5400万吨，降低对美国原油依赖"],"title":"Iran War Supply Shock: Hormuz Blockade & Crude Spike","title_zh":"伊核战争供给冲击：霍尔木兹封锁油价飙升"},"2026-03-03":{"body":"The current selloff leg (-32.6%, ranked #31/31 — worst in the universe) began as US-Iran ceasefire negotiations accelerated through April-May 2026, with North Sea Dated crude collapsing more than $40/bbl from its March peak to around $82/bbl by mid-June as a Swiss peace accord was scheduled for 19 June 2026. Chinese petrochemical futures (PTA) slumped over 5% in late June as anticipated supply resumption and resumed Hormuz shipping erased the war premium. The SHCOMP returned only -2.3% but Oil & Gas fell -32.6% — massive negative alpha versus the index — driven entirely by the crude price reversal rather than broad market weakness. Electronics (+66.9%) and Telecoms (+60.4%) surged as growth/AI reasserted dominance, creating a structural double headwind: the supply-shock premium dissolved while EV substitution continues to erode long-run demand.","body_zh":"当前下跌腿（-32.6%，排名第31/31，全行业垫底）始于美伊停火谈判加速推进：2026年4-5月谈判取得突破，北海布伦特现货价格从3月峰值暴跌逾40美元/桶至6月中旬约82美元/桶，6月19日瑞士和谈协议进入倒计时。中国石化期货（PTA等）在6月下旬大跌超5%，增产预期和航运恢复彻底消散战争溢价。上证综指仅-2.3%，而石油天然气-32.6%，相对大盘产生巨大负超额收益——完全由油价逆转驱动而非大盘走弱。电子（+66.9%）、通信（+60.4%）强势领涨，成长/AI风格重新主导，形成结构性双重压制：供给冲击溢价消散，叠加新能源车替代持续侵蚀长期需求展望。","drivers":["US-Iran ceasefire negotiations (Apr-May 2026) collapse Brent crude $40/bbl from peak","Hormuz Strait partial reopening — war supply premium dissolves (Swiss accord 19 Jun 2026)","China petrochemical futures (PTA) slump >5% on supply resumption","SHCOMP -2.3% but Oil & Gas -32.6% — massive negative alpha driven by crude reversal","Growth/AI style dominance: Electronics +66.9%, Telecoms +60.4% — capital rotation out of energy"],"drivers_zh":["美伊停火谈判（4-5月）推动布伦特油价从峰值暴跌40美元","霍尔木兹海峡部分重开，战争供给溢价消散（6月19日瑞士和谈）","供应恢复预期拖累中国石化期货（PTA）跌超5%","上证综指仅-2.3%但石油天然气-32.6%，完全由油价逆转驱动的巨额负超额","成长/AI风格主导（电子+66.9%、通信+60.4%），资金持续撤离能源"],"title":"Hormuz Ceasefire Talks Collapse Crude, Sector Routs","title_zh":"美伊停火谈判压垮油价，板块跌至全市场垫底"}},"now":"Oil & Petrochem is in a confirmed Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, ranked 12th out of 31 Shenwan industries with a return of -3.8% over the current window — deep underperformance versus the market. The dominant tape is a growth/AI-led rally (Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%), structurally diverting capital away from old-economy energy names; the SHCOMP is only +1.6%, confirming the advance is narrow and sector-specific. Following the 2026 Iran-war supply-shock peak (Brent surging above $120/bbl in early March after the Hormuz blockade began 28 Feb), crude has collapsed back toward the $70-82/bbl range as US-Iran ceasefire negotiations advanced and the Strait partially reopened in late May-June 2026, eliminating the premium that drove the prior +77.6% surge. The sector sits at the bottom of the leadership table, pressured by the crude reversal, structural peak-oil-demand headwinds from accelerating EV penetration, and the dominant growth-style rotation.","now_zh":"石油石化板块截至2026年6月下旬处于明确的筑底阶段，在申万31个行业中排名第12，区间回报-3.8%，大幅落后大盘。当前市场由AI/半导体主导（电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%），资金持续从旧经济能源板块流出；上证综指仅+1.6%，确认涨势集中于科技主线而非商品。2026年伊核战争供给冲击高点（2月28日霍尔木兹海峡封锁后布伦特油价飙升至120美元/桶以上），随着美伊停火谈判推进、海峡5-6月部分重开，油价已回落至70-82美元/桶区间，前期+77.6%涨幅所依赖的供给冲击溢价基本消散。板块正消化油价逆转、新能源车渗透率上升带来的需求见顶压力，以及成长风格持续主导的三重压力，在本轮下跌中排名末位（31/31）。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801970":{"legs":{"2021-12-13":{"body":"From December 2021, Environmental staged a relative trough-to-peak cycle leg while SHCOMP fell -11.2% and Environmental returned -8.9% in absolute terms (rank 10/31), meaning this leg marks relative outperformance versus Shenwan growth and tech peers rather than absolute price gains. The tape was dominated by Coal (+17.5%) and energy-value names as growth/tech collapsed (Electronics -28.7%, Computers -24.6%), driven by zero-COVID supply disruptions across H1 2022 and the Russia-Ukraine commodity shock from February 2022 that repriced energy. Beijing's October 2021 '1+N' carbon-peak policy framework and the July 2021 national ETS launch lent structural spending credibility to water-treatment and solid-waste PPP operators, providing relative shelter in a risk-averse, value-rotated market. Environmental's quasi-utility revenue model outperformed the growth complex by roughly 20pp in this period of speculative deflation.","body_zh":"自2021年12月，环保板块走出相对性的周期低点至高点行情：上证综指同期下跌-11.2%，环保绝对回报为-8.9%（申万排名第10），本段涨幅体现的是相对成长/科技同行的跑赢，而非绝对上涨。行情以煤炭（+17.5%）和能源价值股主导，成长/科技大幅下挫（电子-28.7%，计算机-24.6%），根源在于2022年上半年新冠封控供应链冲击，以及2022年2月俄乌战争引发的大宗商品价格重估。北京2021年10月发布的'1+N'碳达峰政策框架，以及2021年7月启动的全国碳排放权交易市场，为污水处理和固废PPP运营商提供了政策信用背书，在风险规避、价值轮动的市场环境中形成相对庇护。环保板块类公用事业的收入模式在成长股估值压缩期间较成长复合体超额约20个百分点。","drivers":["zero-COVID supply disruption H1-2022","Russia-Ukraine commodity shock Feb-2022","value-over-growth rotation","carbon ETS launch Oct-2021 policy credibility","PPP operator defensive quasi-utility cash flows"],"drivers_zh":["新冠封控供应链冲击（2022年上半年）","俄乌战争大宗商品冲击（2022年2月）","价值跑赢成长风格轮动","碳市场启动（2021年10月）政策信用","PPP运营商类公用事业防御性现金流"],"title":"Carbon Policy Lift in Value-Led Tape","title_zh":"双碳政策提振，价值风格主导行情"},"2022-07-22":{"body":"A major 18-month selloff (-38.0%) ran from July 2022 to February 2024, with Environmental ranked 24th worst of 31 sectors. The ctx confirms a flight-to-safety rotation: defensives (Coal +2.8%, Banks -0.9%) led while cyclicals dropped -27.4% and the SHCOMP fell -17.4%, so Environmental's extra-heavy underperformance reflected sector-specific stress beyond index beta. The structural cause was the intersection of China's property crisis (Evergrande cascade from H2 2021) with acute LGFV debt stress: environmental PPP companies depend on municipal governments for long-cycle project payments, and as LGFV balance sheets buckled under 40.74 trillion yuan (48% of GDP by 2023) of debt, receivables surged and cash collections stalled. Zero-COVID lockdowns (Shanghai April-June 2022) crushed project execution; post-reopening optimism collapsed by mid-2023 as property recovery stalled and LPR cuts (August 2023 5-year LPR cut to 4.2%) proved insufficient to restore local-government fiscal capacity.","body_zh":"2022年7月至2024年2月，环保板块历经长达18个月的重大抛售行情（-38.0%），在申万31个行业中排名倒数第8。ctx确认这是典型的资金撤向安全资产的轮动：防御板块（煤炭+2.8%，银行-0.9%）相对领先，周期股均值下跌-27.4%，上证综指回落-17.4%，环保的超额跌幅反映了超越大盘贝塔的板块专项压力。结构性根源在于房地产危机（恒大系违约自2021年下半年蔓延）与城投平台（LGFV）债务挤压的叠加：环保PPP公司依赖地方政府支付长周期项目款，至2023年城投负债高达40.74万亿元（占GDP约48%），应收账款持续堆积、回款停滞。2022年4至6月上海等地新冠封控打断项目施工；2023年中'重开'后的乐观情绪因楼市复苏迟缓快速消退，央行2023年8月下调5年期LPR至4.2%亦不足以修复地方财政能力。","drivers":["LGFV debt crisis (40.7T yuan) and municipal payment delays","property sector collapse (Evergrande cascade H2-2021)","zero-COVID lockdowns crushing project execution","risk-off flight-to-safety to coal/banks","SHCOMP broad index drawdown -17.4%"],"drivers_zh":["城投债务危机（40.7万亿元）与地方政府回款违约","房地产崩溃（恒大系违约蔓延2021年下半年）","新冠封控打断项目施工与回款","风险规避资金向煤炭/银行防御轮动","上证综指大盘下挫-17.4%"],"title":"LGFV Crisis and Risk-Off Crush 38%","title_zh":"城投债务危机与风险规避压跌38%"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 5, 2024, Environmental surged +26.2% (rank 9/31) in a broad-based beta rally as SHCOMP rose +16.7% with cyclicals averaging +21.2% vs defensives +14.7%. The catalyst was China's national team intervention: Central Huijin Investment announced expanded ETF holdings on February 6, 2024, and the CSRC on February 4 pledged to prevent abnormal market fluctuations; UBS estimated state-backed funds poured over 410 billion yuan (~$57 billion) into A-share ETFs in early 2024, with 75%+ flowing into CSI 300 trackers. Metals (+39.9%), Defense (+34.1%), and Chemicals (+33.9%) led, outperforming Environmental, confirming this was an index-wide beta rescue not an Environmental-specific policy catalyst. Environmental's rank-9 placement reflects its mid-tier cyclical beta in a wave of indiscriminate state buying.","body_zh":"自2024年2月5日，环保板块反弹+26.2%（申万排名第9），与大盘共振：上证综指上涨+16.7%，周期股均值+21.2%大幅跑赢防御股+14.7%，印证本段为全面性贝塔上涨。触发因素为国家队入市：中央汇金2024年2月6日公告扩大ETF持仓，证监会于2月4日承诺防范市场异常波动；瑞银估算国家背景基金在2024年上半年向A股ETF投入逾4100亿元（约570亿美元），其中75%以上流入沪深300指数追踪产品。金属（+39.9%）、国防（+34.1%）、化工（+33.9%）领涨，均优于环保，印证本段为大盘无差别救市行情，而非环保专项政策驱动。环保排名第9体现其在国家队无差别买入行情中的中等周期性贝塔。","drivers":["Central Huijin national team ETF buying (410B yuan Feb-2024)","CSRC market stabilization pledge (Feb 4 2024)","broad cyclical beta recovery","SHCOMP index surge +16.7%","growth-style tilt (rank 9 vs metals/defense leaders)"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金国家队ETF入市（逾4100亿元，2024年2月）","证监会防范市场异常波动承诺（2024年2月4日）","周期股全面贝塔修复","上证综指大幅反弹+16.7%","成长风格倾斜（金属/国防领涨，环保居中）"],"title":"National Team ETF Rescue Sparks Beta Rally","title_zh":"国家队ETF救市引发贝塔反弹"},"2024-05-09":{"body":"From May 9, 2024, Environmental fell -19.2% (rank 14/31, mid-pack) as SHCOMP dropped -13.9% in a broad market down-leg. The ctx shows defensives (Brokers -4.9%, Banks -6.0%, Utilities -8.1%) led on a relative basis while cyclicals dropped harder, indicating a macro-disappointment-driven risk-off rotation. China's daily housing sales collapsed to approximately 80/day in May 2024 (from 331/day in April), reigniting concerns about LGFV revenue shortfalls and renewed payment pressure on environmental PPP companies. The Ministry of Finance and NDRC October press conferences in 2024 failed to deliver incremental fiscal stimulus detail, amplifying investor disappointment. The correction also reflected an unwinding of the February-April 2024 national team rescue rally as no fundamental improvement materialized.","body_zh":"自2024年5月9日，环保板块下跌-19.2%（申万排名第14，居中），上证综指同期回落-13.9%，为全面性市场下行段。ctx显示防御性板块（券商-4.9%，银行-6.0%，公用事业-8.1%）相对领先，周期股跌幅更深，印证这是宏观失望情绪主导的风险规避轮动。2024年5月中国日均新房销售面积跌至约80（4月为331），地方政府收入短缺忧虑再起，环保企业LGFV回款压力重燃。财政部与国家发改委2024年10月新闻发布会均未提供增量财政刺激细节，加剧市场失望情绪。前期（2024年2-4月）国家队救市涨幅的获利了结进一步放大回调幅度。","drivers":["property daily sales collapse May-2024 (~80/day)","renewed LGFV payment pressure on env PPP companies","NDRC/MOF fiscal stimulus disappointment","risk-off rotation to defensive brokers/banks","national team rally unwind"],"drivers_zh":["楼市日均销售面积骤降（2024年5月，约80/天）","LGFV回款压力重燃压制环保PPP公司","发改委/财政部财政刺激不及预期","资金向防御性券商/银行避险轮动","国家队救市涨幅获利了结"],"title":"Policy Disappointment Triggers Mid-Cycle Correction","title_zh":"政策失望引发周期中段回调"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"From September 18, 2024, Environmental rallied +79.4% over roughly 20 months to May 2026 (rank 11/31), participating as a mid-tier cyclical beta in the largest A-share rally since 2008. The ignition was the September 24, 2024 PBOC announcement: a simultaneous 50bp RRR cut releasing 1 trillion yuan in liquidity, MLF rate cut from 2.3% to 2.0%, a 500-billion yuan swap facility for brokers/funds to buy equities, and a 300-billion yuan relending facility for stock buybacks - unprecedented in scale. SHCOMP surged +56.1% over the leg. Leadership was decisively in growth/tech (Telecoms +289.3%, Electronics +212.7%, growth outperforming value by 81pp), driven by the DeepSeek AI breakthrough in January 2025 and Beijing's new quality productive forces narrative. Environmental's +79.4% reflects broad cyclical beta participation, and its mid-tier rank (11/31) confirms it lagged the tech/AI leaders significantly while benefiting from the liquidity flood.","body_zh":"自2024年9月18日，环保板块历经约20个月大涨+79.4%至2026年5月（申万排名第11），作为中等周期性贝塔参与了2008年以来最大的A股牛市行情。2024年9月24日央行公告为导火索：同步降准50个基点（释放1万亿元流动性）、MLF利率从2.3%降至2.0%、向券商/基金提供5000亿元互换便利用于购买股票、向上市公司及大股东提供3000亿元再贷款用于股票回购，力度前所未有。上证综指同期大涨+56.1%。行情主导权明确落在成长/科技板块（通信+289.3%，电子+212.7%，成长/价值溢价高达81个百分点），背后是2025年1月DeepSeek AI突破和北京新质生产力叙事。环保+79.4%体现的是大盘流动性驱动下的贝塔参与，中等排名（第11）印证其明显落后于科技/AI领头羊，但仍受益于这场流动性盛宴。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24 bazooka stimulus (50bp RRR cut + 500B swap facility + 300B relending)","SHCOMP broad index surge +56.1%","DeepSeek AI breakthrough Jan-2025 (growth narrative dominance)","new quality productive forces policy theme","cyclical beta in liquidity-driven A-share bull market"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日超大规模刺激（降准50bp+5000亿互换便利+3000亿再贷款）","上证综指大幅上涨+56.1%","DeepSeek AI突破2025年1月（成长叙事主导）","新质生产力政策主题","流动性驱动A股牛市中的周期性贝塔"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Ignites 79% Cyclical Surge","title_zh":"央行火力全开，环保板块大涨79%"}},"now":"Environmental (801970) is in a confirmed Trough/Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, sitting at just 2.3% off its cycle low with an rs_rank of 11/31, deep in the bottom half of Shenwan peers. The current tape is a risk-on, growth-led beta rally (SHCOMP +1.6%, cyclicals +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%, growth outperforming value by 18.2pp) driven by Electronics and Telecoms, leaving Environmental behind with a -0.1% return ranked 9th. The sector peaked in May 2026 at +79.4% from the Sep-2024 trough and is now giving back gains as local-government budget constraints and the absence of fresh Environmental-specific policy catalysts weigh on project-flow sentiment; it has decoupled from the AI/tech leadership narrative that dominated since the Sep-2024 PBOC stimulus cycle.","now_zh":"环保板块（801970）截至2026年6月底处于确认的底部筑底阶段，距周期低点仅2.3%，在申万31个行业中排名第11，深陷下半区。当前市场呈风险偏好上行、成长驱动的贝塔行情（上证综指+1.6%，周期股+0.3% vs 防御股-12.1%，成长/价值溢价达18.2个百分点），由电子和通信板块领涨，环保未能受益。板块当期回报-0.1%、排名第9，表明其已与2024年9月刺激周期以来主导市场的科技/AI主线脱钩。环保已于2026年5月创出自2024年9月低点以来+79.4%的高点后进入高位回调，地方政府财政约束及缺乏环保专项政策催化剂共同压制项目流订单预期。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"801980":{"legs":{"2021-12-13":{"body":"From December 2021 through July 2022, SHCOMP fell 11.0% as the Fed began its most aggressive tightening cycle in decades and China's zero-COVID policy triggered rolling lockdowns — Shanghai's April-May 2022 shutdown was the largest urban lockdown in Chinese history. The tape rotated decisively into value and commodity plays (Coal +21.0%, Conglomerates +5.6%) while growth and consumer discretionary were crushed (Electronics -29.4%, Computers -23.5%). Beauty returned -7.1% but ranked 9th of 31 Shenwan industries — a relative outperformer because its premium-consumer exposure was less rate-sensitive than high-multiple growth names and it had less direct property linkage than cyclicals, while real consumer spending collapsed under lockdown restrictions.","body_zh":"2021年12月至2022年7月，美联储启动史上最激进加息周期，中国坚持清零政策并触发大范围封控（上海4-5月封城规模历史最大），上证综指下跌11%。行情轮动至煤炭（+21%）、综合等价值/大宗商品板块，成长和消费类遭大幅抛售（电子-29.4%，计算机-23.5%）。美容护理回报-7.1%但排名第9/31，相对占优，因其对利率敏感性低于高估值成长股，且与地产关联度低，但实际消费需求在封控下已大幅萎缩。","drivers":["zero-COVID lockdowns","Fed rate-hike cycle","value-commodity rotation","property crisis onset","consumer spending collapse"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策封控","美联储加息周期","价值/商品轮动","地产危机初现","消费支出塌陷"],"title":"Value rotation amid COVID lockdowns, Fed tightening","title_zh":"新冠封控叠加美联储紧缩，价值风格占优"},"2022-07-27":{"body":"The July-October 2022 leg saw Beauty fall 20.5% (ranked 27th of 31) against a SHCOMP decline of 11.7%. The period was marked by continued zero-COVID restrictions, the deepening property sector crisis (Evergrande default contagion, mortgage boycotts from July 2022), and a collapse in consumer confidence that hit discretionary beauty spending directly. Growth/tech stocks (Defense +0.9%, Computers +0.1%) staged a relative hold on AI/military tailwinds while old-economy consumer names — Appliances -21.0%, Building Materials -23.7%, Food & Beverage -26.0% — joined Beauty in the laggard cohort, confirming this was a broad consumer and cyclical risk-off move, not sector-specific.","body_zh":"2022年7月至10月，美容护理下跌20.5%（排名第27/31），上证综指跌11.7%。该阶段清零限制措施持续，地产危机深化（恒大违约蔓延、2022年7月断供潮爆发），消费者信心崩溃直接冲击可选消费类美容支出。成长/科技股（国防+0.9%，计算机+0.1%）凭借AI/军工题材相对抗跌，家电-21%、建材-23.7%、食品饮料-26%等消费类同步落入垫底，确认为消费和周期性整体避险行情，非个别板块问题。","drivers":["zero-COVID restrictions","Evergrande/property crisis","mortgage boycotts July 2022","consumer confidence collapse","growth-over-value style"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策持续","恒大/房地产危机","断供潮（2022年7月）","消费者信心崩溃","成长压倒价值风格"],"title":"Zero-COVID + property crisis, consumer demand collapses","title_zh":"清零政策持续+地产危机深化，消费需求崩溃"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"From late October 2022 to February 2023, Beauty surged 26.0% to rank 5th of 31, as SHCOMP gained 13.7%. The October 2022 trough coincided with signals that zero-COVID was ending: the 20th Party Congress (mid-October) failed to announce any further tightening, COVID protest in November 2022 (Urumqi fire, 'A4 protests') accelerated the policy reversal, and December 7, 2022 saw Beijing announce the formal dismantling of PCR-requirement infrastructure. Consumer discretionary names led (Food & Beverage +41.0%, Media +34.4%, Building Materials +30.8%) as markets repriced a demand recovery. Beauty's rally was driven by reopening optimism for in-store retail, makeup/fragrance categories crushed during lockdowns, and a broad value/consumer reflation trade rather than any sector-specific earnings catalyst.","body_zh":"2022年10月底至2023年2月，美容护理大涨26%，排名第5/31，上证综指涨13.7%。2022年10月低点与清零终结信号同步：二十大（10月中旬）未见进一步收紧信号，11月乌鲁木齐火灾引发的白纸运动加速政策逆转，12月7日北京正式宣布拆除核酸检测基础设施。消费类领涨（食品饮料+41%，传媒+34.4%，建材+30.8%），美容护理的反弹核心逻辑是：线下零售、彩妆/香水等封控期受压品类的复苏预期，以及大盘贝塔驱动，而非基本面业绩催化。","drivers":["zero-COVID dismantling Dec 2022","Urumqi protests/A4 movement accelerant","consumer reopening reflation","SHCOMP beta lift","revenge-spending expectations"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策拆除（2022年12月）","白纸运动加速政策逆转","消费复苏再通胀交易","上证综指贝塔提振","报复性消费预期"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit rally lifts all consumer names","title_zh":"清零退出，消费复苏预期驱动普涨"},"2023-02-20":{"body":"The February 2023 to February 2024 selloff was the worst leg on record for the sector: -46.5%, dead last among all 31 Shenwan industries. SHCOMP fell 17.9% and defensives averaged -18.6% vs cyclicals -26.6%, confirming a broad risk-off flight with Beauty as the most extreme cyclical casualty. China's post-COVID recovery proved far weaker than expected: CPI fell to 0.1% y/y by June 2023 and turned negative in July 2023 for the first time since 2009, reflecting deep domestic demand weakness. Property continued collapsing (Country Garden missed bond payments in August 2023). Youth unemployment hit a record ~21.3% in June 2023. Total cosmetics retail sales contracted year-on-year through much of 2023 as consumers shifted to value channels and domestic white-label brands. High-end international beauty brands lost market share at an accelerating pace. The value leadership (Coal +4.2%, Banks -2.5%) confirmed investors were parking in dividend/defensive names rather than any structural bet on consumer recovery.","body_zh":"2023年2月至2024年2月，美容护理暴跌46.5%，在申万31个行业中垫底。上证综指跌17.9%，防御股均值-18.6% vs 周期股-26.6%，确认为广泛避险行情中美容护理首当其冲。中国疫后复苏远弱于预期：CPI于2023年7月同比转负（2009年来首次），地产持续崩溃（碧桂园8月违约），青年失业率创历史新高21.3%（6月），化妆品零售全年多月同比负增长，消费降级趋势下高端国际美妆品牌加速失去份额。煤炭/银行领跑证实资金流入高股息防御类，而非对消费复苏进行结构性押注。","drivers":["deflation onset July 2023","Country Garden default Aug 2023","youth unemployment record high","beauty retail contraction","consumption downgrade trend"],"drivers_zh":["通缩降临（2023年7月）","碧桂园违约（2023年8月）","青年失业率创历史新高","美妆零售萎缩","消费降级趋势"],"title":"Reopening disappointment, deflation + property drag","title_zh":"复苏落空+通缩+地产拖累，板块腰斩"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 5 to May 9, 2024, Beauty gained 21.8% (ranked 13th/31) as SHCOMP surged 16.7% in a cyclical-led rally. The trough on February 5 coincided with aggressive 'national team' intervention: Central Huijin (China's sovereign wealth fund arm) publicly announced in February 2024 it would 'resolutely' ramp up CSI 300 ETF purchases, deploying hundreds of billions of yuan to stem the three-year rout. Metals (+39.9%), Defense (+34.1%), and Chemicals (+33.9%) led, signaling a risk-on/growth reflation rotation rather than consumer-specific recovery. Beauty's 21.8% gain was primarily market beta — the sector rose with the tide rather than on any fundamental improvement in cosmetics demand, which remained structurally weak with CPI barely positive.","body_zh":"2024年2月5日至5月9日，美容护理涨21.8%（排名第13/31），上证综指大涨16.7%，由周期股主导。2月5日低点与国家队强力入市同步：汇金公司于2024年2月公开宣布将\"坚决\"加大沪深300 ETF增持力度，累计投入数千亿元资金以遏制三年跌势。有色金属（+39.9%）、国防（+34.1%）、化工（+33.9%）领跑，呈现风险偏好/成长再通胀轮动特征，并非消费特定复苏。美容护理的21.8%涨幅主要为大盘贝塔贡献，化妆品需求基本面仍弱，CPI几乎处于零线。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF buying Feb 2024","national team market support","cyclical reflation rotation","SHCOMP beta lift","metals/commodities leadership"],"drivers_zh":["汇金2024年2月ETF增持","国家队护盘","周期再通胀轮动","上证综指贝塔提振","有色/大宗商品领涨"],"title":"National Team ETF buying stabilizes market","title_zh":"国家队ETF托市，市场企稳反弹"},"2024-05-09":{"body":"From May to September 2024, Beauty fell 30.0% to rank dead last (31st of 31) while SHCOMP lost 12.9%. The period was characterized by the sharpest consumption downgrade since COVID: Bernstein analysts described beauty industry September 2024 data as 'catastrophically weak' with a ~46% year-on-year drop in tracked beauty sales. Consumer price deflation persisted (CPI hovering near zero), the property sector offered no relief (residential sales volumes remained deeply depressed), and LPR was cut only modestly. Banks and Utilities led (near-zero return) as market cash huddled in dividend plays. Beauty's double underperformance versus even the weak index confirms that sector-specific demand destruction — not just market beta — was at work.","body_zh":"2024年5月至9月，美容护理暴跌30%，申万31个行业垫底，上证综指跌12.9%。该阶段消费降级达疫情以来最严峻程度：伯恩斯坦分析师称2024年9月美妆行业数据\"灾难性疲软\"，追踪的美妆销售额同比下降约46%。CPI持续徘徊于零线，地产毫无起色（住宅销售量深度萎缩），LPR仅小幅下调。银行/公用事业（几乎零回报）领跑，资金涌入高股息防御品种。美容护理相对大盘的双重超额下跌，确认除大盘贝塔外还存在板块特定需求破坏。","drivers":["consumption downgrade acceleration","beauty sales -46% YoY (Sep 2024)","persistent CPI deflation","property sector no recovery","dividend/defensive flight"],"drivers_zh":["消费降级加速","美妆销售同比-46%（2024年9月）","CPI持续通缩","地产无复苏","高股息/防御性资金逃离"],"title":"Consumption downgrade deepens; beauty catastrophically weak","title_zh":"消费降级加剧，美妆销售崩溃式下滑"},"2024-09-23":{"body":"From September 23 to October 8, 2024, Beauty surged 58.1% to rank 1st of all 31 Shenwan industries as SHCOMP gained 27.0%. The catalyst was the 'September 24' PBOC mega-stimulus: Governor Pan Gongsheng held a rare joint press conference announcing simultaneous RRR cuts (50bp), LPR cuts (20bp mortgage rate), a RMB 500 billion swap facility for non-bank institutions to buy stocks, and a RMB 300 billion re-lending facility for listed company buybacks. The September 26 Politburo meeting pledged to 'stop the property market decline.' Beauty was the single biggest beneficiary of the short-squeeze/momentum rally because it was the most beaten-down high-beta consumer name (ranked 31st/31 in the prior leg, -76% from 2021 peak), making it a prime target for leveraged re-entry as margin account activity surged after Beijing eased margin requirements. The NDRC October 8 press conference that disappointed on fiscal specifics immediately ended the leg.","body_zh":"2024年9月23日至10月8日，美容护理暴涨58.1%，领跑申万31个行业（排名第1），上证综指涨27%。催化剂为\"九二四\"超强刺激：央行行长潘功胜召开罕见联合新闻发布会，同步宣布降准50BP、LPR下调20BP、5000亿元互换便利（支持非银购股）及3000亿元再贷款（支持上市公司回购）。9月26日政治局会议承诺\"止跌回稳\"房地产市场。美容护理是本轮最大受益者，因其是跌幅最惨烈的高弹性消费名（前一轮排名31/31，较2021年峰值跌逾76%），成为杠杆资金重新入场的首选目标——北京放松保证金要求后两融规模快速扩张。10月8日国家发改委发布会因缺乏具体财政细节令市场失望，该轮行情即告终结。","drivers":["9.24 PBOC RRR/LPR cuts","RMB 500bn stock swap facility","Politburo property pledge Sep 26","margin debt expansion","short-squeeze on most-beaten-down names"],"drivers_zh":["九二四央行降准/降息","5000亿互换便利","政治局9·26房地产承诺","两融扩张","超跌品种空头回补"],"title":"9.24 PBOC stimulus blitz: Beauty leads the whole market","title_zh":"九二四央行超强刺激，美容护理领涨全市场"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"From October 8, 2024 to January 10, 2025, Beauty fell 25.8% to rank dead last (31st of 31) as SHCOMP declined 9.2%. The NDRC October 8 press conference provided no new fiscal spending details, triggering immediate profit-taking in the most over-extended stimulus-momentum names. Trump's November 2024 election victory re-ignited tariff escalation fears (threats of 60%+ tariffs on Chinese goods), weighing specifically on consumer-facing industries. Conglomerates (+10.1%) and Retail (+0.6%) held up due to their diversified/domestic earnings base while Beauty — a discretionary premium category with heavy international brand competition and no explicit policy protection — fell to the bottom. The pattern mirrors the post-NDRC disappointment cycle seen repeatedly: stimulus announcement front-running, then flush when fiscal delivery disappoints.","body_zh":"2024年10月8日至2025年1月10日，美容护理跌25.8%，申万31行业垫底，上证综指跌9.2%。10月8日发改委发布会未提供新财政支出细节，引发对前期刺激预期最透支品种的立即获利了结。特朗普2024年11月当选，重燃关税升级恐慌（威胁对中国商品加征60%+关税），直接打压消费行业。综合类（+10.1%）和零售（+0.6%）因多元化/内需收益基础相对抗跌，而美容护理作为可选高端消费品类且面临国际品牌激烈竞争、无明确政策保护，沦为垫底。这一\"刺激预期抢跑—财政兑现失望—大幅回吐\"模式在该板块中重复出现。","drivers":["NDRC Oct 8 disappointment","Trump tariff threats Nov 2024","stimulus front-run flush","consumer discretionary de-rating","conglomerates/retail defensive hold"],"drivers_zh":["发改委10·8发布会令市场失望","特朗普2024年11月当选关税威胁","刺激预期兑现后了结","可选消费估值下调","综合/零售防御性抗跌"],"title":"Stimulus fade + Trump tariff fears; Beauty again last","title_zh":"刺激预期落空+特朗普关税威胁，美容再度垫底"},"2025-01-10":{"body":"From January 10 to August 26, 2025, Beauty gained 27.5% (ranked 15th/31) as SHCOMP surged 22.1%. The dominant driver was the DeepSeek R1 release in late January 2025, which triggered a re-rating of Chinese AI/tech equities globally — Telecoms (+63.0%), Computers (+46.3%), and Metals (+42.8%) led the 19-point growth-over-value style premium. Beauty participated as index beta but did not lead: the tape was a pure AI-infrastructure/new-economy rotation and Beauty's fundamentals (consumption still weak, beauty retail still contracting in early 2025) did not warrant premium positioning. SHCOMP reached a decade high of approximately 3,727-3,800 by August 2025, and Beauty peaked contemporaneously at rank 15, confirming broad participation but no sector alpha.","body_zh":"2025年1月10日至8月26日，美容护理涨27.5%（排名第15/31），上证综指大涨22.1%。核心驱动为2025年1月底DeepSeek R1发布，引发中国AI/科技股全球性估值重估——通信（+63%）、计算机（+46.3%）和有色金属（+42.8%）领涨，成长相对价值风格溢价达19个百分点。美容护理以大盘贝塔形式参与，并未领涨：行情本质是AI基础设施/新经济主线轮动，而美容护理基本面（消费仍弱、零售销售2025年初仍收缩）不支持超配。上证综指于2025年8月升至约3727-3800点的十年新高，美容护理同步见顶于第15名，确认广泛参与但无板块超额收益。","drivers":["DeepSeek R1 Jan 2025 AI rerating","tech/telecom sector leadership","SHCOMP decade high Aug 2025","SHCOMP beta participation","growth-over-value 19pp premium"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek R1（2025年1月）AI估值重估","科技/通信行业领涨","上证综指2025年8月创十年新高","上证综指贝塔驱动","成长相对价值溢价19个百分点"],"title":"DeepSeek AI boom lifts market; Beauty mid-table participant","title_zh":"DeepSeek AI热潮提振市场，美容护理中游跟涨"},"2025-08-26":{"body":"From August 26, 2025 through June 2026, Beauty fell 38.5% to rank dead last (31st/31) as SHCOMP gained only 4.1%. This is the ongoing leg: a stark divergence where AI/infrastructure themes (Telecoms +108.5%, Electronics +96.0%, Building Materials +51.3%) absorbed all the market's liquidity and re-rating, while consumption sectors — Agriculture -28.3%, Retail -29.7%, Beauty -38.5% — have been progressively abandoned. The structural driver is that China's AI policy (DeepSeek ecosystem support, data center buildout, AI-in-government mandates) is delivering measurable earnings uplift for tech while consumer demand remains trapped by the negative wealth effect from property, persistent near-zero CPI, and trade-war uncertainty (U.S. tariffs enacted under Trump in 2025). Beauty is the most extreme victim because it sits at the intersection of weak domestic consumption, heavy price competition, consumption downgrade, and no AI/industrial policy tailwind. The 26.3pp growth-over-value style spread confirms this is a structural, not cyclical, divergence.","body_zh":"2025年8月26日至2026年6月，美容护理跌38.5%，申万31行业垫底，而上证综指仅微涨4.1%。这是当前正在进行的阶段：AI/基础设施主题（通信+108.5%，电子+96%，建材+51.3%）吸走市场所有流动性和估值溢价，而消费类——农业-28.3%、零售-29.7%、美容护理-38.5%——被持续抛弃。结构性驱动在于：中国AI政策（DeepSeek生态支持、数据中心建设、政府AI化）已为科技类带来可量化的业绩提升，而消费需求仍受困于地产负财富效应、CPI长期近零及贸易战不确定性（特朗普2025年关税落地）。美容护理是最极端的受害者，因其处于内需疲弱、价格竞争激烈、消费降级及无AI/产业政策红利四重压制的交叉点。成长相对价值风格利差达26.3个百分点，确认这是结构性而非周期性分化。","drivers":["AI/telecom infrastructure re-rating","persistent consumer demand weakness","near-zero CPI / consumption downgrade","US tariff headwinds 2025","growth-over-value 26pp style spread"],"drivers_zh":["AI/通信基础设施估值重估","国内消费需求持续疲软","CPI近零/消费降级","美国2025年关税压制","成长相对价值风格利差26个百分点"],"title":"AI rotation intensifies; consumer left behind as SHCOMP corrects","title_zh":"AI轮动强化，消费被遗忘，上证综指结构分化"}},"now":"Beauty & Care (801980) is in a confirmed trough, ranked #30/31 Shenwan industries with a -26.9% return in the current leg while SHCOMP is barely positive (+1.6%). The tape is a pure growth/AI-infrastructure rotation — Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) are absorbing all incremental liquidity, leaving discretionary consumer names like Beauty entirely without sponsorship. Below its 200-day moving average, at position 0.1 within its cycle range, and with retail consumption growth still tracking near multi-year lows, the sector has no near-term catalyst unless Beijing delivers a targeted consumption stimulus or a broad market de-risking forces a defensive catch-up trade.","now_zh":"美容护理（801980）处于确认性底部，本轮行情在申万行业中排名第30/31，累计回报-26.9%，而上证综指仅微涨1.6%。当前行情完全由成长/AI基础设施主线主导，电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）吸收了绝大部分增量流动性，消费类板块尤其是美容护理缺乏资金青睐。板块股价位于200日均线下方，周期位置处于0.1（极低），国内消费增速仍处近年低位，若无针对性消费刺激政策出台或市场整体转向防御，板块短期缺乏反弹催化剂。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_ai_compute":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From June 2021, the basket gained +30.2% as China's 14th Five-Year Plan semiconductor self-reliance mandates and National Big Fund II investments directed capital into domestic chip and optics names on the STAR Market. The macro backdrop was a broad cyclical-led rotation: Power Equipment (+33.6%) and Metals (+27.0%) topped Shenwan, cyclicals outpaced defensives by 12.8pp, and growth led value by 7.3pp, marking a risk-on infrastructure-themed tape rather than a pure AI play. US semiconductor Entity List expansions through 2021 paradoxically turbocharged the domestic-substitution investment thesis for A-share chip and optical component makers. With SHCOMP up only +1.5%, the basket's +30% reflected genuine sector alpha on top of muted index beta.","body_zh":"2021年6月起，随着第十四个五年规划半导体自主可控政策落地以及国家大基金二期持续布局，资金大举涌入STAR市场国产芯片与光器件板块，AI算力板块累计上涨30.2%。宏观背景为周期板块领涨：电力设备（+33.6%）和金属材料（+27.0%）居申万前列，周期跑赢防御12.8个百分点，成长跑赢价值7.3个百分点，属于风险偏好抬升的基础设施主题行情，并非纯粹AI行情。美国实体清单扩容反而强化了A股芯片与光器件名称的国产替代逻辑。期间上证综指仅上涨1.5%，表明板块+30%的涨幅更多来自超额收益而非指数贝塔。","drivers":["14th Five-Year Plan chip mandate","Big Fund II STAR Market deployment","US Entity List domestic substitution","cyclical risk-on rotation","optical component demand ramp"],"drivers_zh":["十四五半导体自主化政策","大基金二期STAR市场布局","美国实体清单国产替代效应","周期股风险偏好抬升","光器件需求起量"],"title":"Domestic Chip Policy and Cyclical Beta Rally","title_zh":"十四五芯片政策与周期贝塔驱动的上涨行情"},"2022-01-18":{"body":"The basket collapsed -37.3% as a global repricing of growth assets accelerated into the most aggressive Fed tightening cycle since the 1990s: the January 2022 FOMC minutes signaled rapid rate hikes, the first 25bp hike landed March 16, 2022, and Russia's invasion of Ukraine (February 24, 2022) caused a commodity-driven global risk-off shock. China's Shenwan rotation was textbook: Coal (+4.9%) and Banks (-7.3%) led while Electronics (-39.1%) and Computers (-38.1%) were the worst laggards, a value-over-growth reversal of 15.6pp. Shanghai's strict COVID lockdown (beginning late March 2022, peaking in April) further crushed sentiment and supply chains, and SHCOMP fell -19.1% -- the basket's move was amplified beta of the broad decline.","body_zh":"板块下跌37.3%，根本原因是全球成长资产遭遇1990年代以来最激进的美联储加息周期重定价：2022年1月FOMC纪要明确快速加息路径，3月16日首次加息25bp；俄乌战争（2月24日）引发大宗商品驱动的全球避险冲击。申万行业轮动非常典型：煤炭（+4.9%）与银行（-7.3%）领先，电子（-39.1%）与计算机（-38.1%）垫底，价值跑赢成长15.6个百分点。上海严格清零封控（3月末开始，4月达峰）进一步重创情绪与供应链，上证综指下跌19.1%，AI算力板块为其放大贝塔。","drivers":["Fed hawkish pivot and rate hike cycle","Russia-Ukraine geopolitical shock Feb 2022","Shanghai COVID lockdown supply disruption","global growth-to-value rotation","broad SHCOMP -19% drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["美联储鹰派转向加息","2022年2月俄乌地缘政治冲击","上海清零封控供应链受损","全球成长转价值轮动","上证综指大幅下跌19%"],"title":"Fed Hawkish Shock and Russia-Ukraine Risk-Off","title_zh":"美联储鹰派冲击与俄乌战争避险抛售"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"This 14-month, +247.5% surge was the basket's first defining supercycle and was powered by two sequential catalysts. First, the April 26, 2022 SHCOMP trough coincided with Beijing's commitment to fiscal stimulus and signals that the Shanghai lockdown would end (Shanghai reopened June 1, 2022), triggering a broad A-share rebound with growth stocks leading the recovery. Second, ChatGPT's November 2022 launch and subsequent viral global spread drove a buying frenzy in Chinese AI-related stocks by February 2023: Baidu announced Ernie Bot on February 7, 2023, with AI software names gaining 100-200% in weeks and the Shanghai Stock Exchange flagging abnormal trading in AI stocks. Media (+84.6%), Telecoms (+81.6%), and Computers (+68.1%) led Shenwan by a growth-over-value spread of 45pp, while SHCOMP gained +12.3%.","body_zh":"这段历时14个月、累计涨幅高达247.5%的超级行情由两个接续催化剂驱动。第一，2022年4月26日上证综指触底，恰逢北京承诺财政刺激并释放上海解封信号（6月1日正式解封），A股广泛反弹，成长股率先领涨。第二，2022年11月ChatGPT问世及其全球病毒式传播，于2023年2月在A股引发AI相关股票买入热潮：百度2月7日宣布文心一言测试计划，部分AI软件个股数周内暴涨100%-200%，上交所对AI概念股发出异常交易警示。传媒（+84.6%）、通信（+81.6%）、计算机（+68.1%）领涨，成长跑赢价值45个百分点，上证综指同期上涨12.3%。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown lifting June 2022 and zero-COVID end Dec 2022","ChatGPT global AI frenzy Feb 2023","Baidu Ernie Bot announcement Feb 7 2023","PBOC and fiscal stimulus April 2022","growth-over-value 45pp rotation Media Telecoms Computers"],"drivers_zh":["上海解封与清零政策退出","ChatGPT全球AI热潮2023年2月爆发","百度文心一言2月7日公告","2022年4月PBOC及财政刺激","成长跑赢价值45pp：传媒/通信/计算机领涨"],"title":"Reopening and ChatGPT AI Narrative Supercycle","title_zh":"解封复苏叠加ChatGPT AI叙事超级行情"},"2023-06-20":{"body":"After the AI narrative run-up, the basket fell -42.7% in a broad market risk-off driven by China's property crisis deepening into outright deflation. Evergrande failed to restructure its offshore debt in 2023 and was ordered liquidated by a Hong Kong court on January 29, 2024, triggering systemic property-sector fear. China's CPI turned negative YoY in July 2023 (the first deflation in years), and the yuan weakened materially against the dollar. The Shenwan rotation was explicitly defensive: Coal (+17.6%) and Banks (+0.3%) led while Computers (-47.9%) and Media (-45.0%) were crushed, with defensives losing only -13.5% versus cyclicals at -18.5%, a confirmed flight-to-safety rotation. SHCOMP fell -16.6%, and the basket's -42.7% reflected high-beta amplification of macro risk-off, not AI-specific fundamental deterioration.","body_zh":"AI叙事行情结束后，在中国房地产危机演变为通货紧缩的宏观风险回避环境下，板块下跌42.7%。恒大2023年境外债重组失败，2024年1月29日遭香港法院裁定清盘，引发系统性房地产恐慌。2023年7月CPI同比转负（多年来首次），人民币兑美元明显贬值。申万行业轮动明确偏防御：煤炭（+17.6%）与银行（+0.3%）领先，计算机（-47.9%）与传媒（-45.0%）跌幅最深，防御行业跌幅（-13.5%）小于周期行业（-18.5%），情景信号明确确认为避险轮动。上证综指下跌16.6%，板块-42.7%反映高贝塔放大宏观风险，并非AI行业基本面的恶化。","drivers":["Evergrande liquidation ordered Jan 2024 systemic property risk","China CPI deflation July 2023","yuan depreciation vs dollar","growth-to-value 23.8pp reversal Coal Banks lead","broad SHCOMP -16.6% drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["恒大2024年1月被裁定清盘引发地产系统性风险","2023年7月CPI同比转负通缩","人民币兑美元贬值","成长转价值23.8pp逆转：煤炭银行领先","上证综指大幅下跌16.6%"],"title":"Property Crisis Deflation Triggers Risk-Off Selloff","title_zh":"地产危机与通缩压力引爆避险抛售"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The basket gained +173.6% as two reinforcing forces aligned. First, Beijing unleashed its most significant stimulus package since the pandemic in late September 2024: the PBOC cut the reserve requirement ratio by 50bp (releasing approximately 1 trillion yuan in liquidity), cut the 7-day repo rate, and launched equity market stabilization measures, sending SHCOMP up +12.8% in a single week and +25.1% over the leg. Second, 800G optical module demand from global AI data-center build-outs produced explosive revenue results confirmed by annual reports: Innolight posted 2024 revenue of 23.86 billion yuan (+123% YoY) and Eoptolink posted 2024 revenue of 8.65 billion yuan (+179% YoY), with both companies capturing roughly 60% of Nvidia incremental 800G orders. Shenwan Electronics (+89.3%), Computers (+88.1%), and Telecoms (+81.4%) led all 31 sectors, confirming AI hardware as the tape's defining theme.","body_zh":"板块累计上涨173.6%，源于两股力量共振。其一，北京于2024年9月下旬出台疫情以来最有力的一揽子刺激政策：央行降准50个基点（释放约1万亿元流动性）、下调7天逆回购利率，并推出资本市场稳定措施，上证综指单周涨幅高达12.8%，整个行情期间累计上涨25.1%。其二，全球AI数据中心建设带来的800G光模块需求爆发推动龙头企业业绩大幅超预期，年报数据得到证实：中际旭创2024年实现营收238.6亿元（同比+123%），亿飞光通2024年营收86.5亿元（同比+179%），两家公司合计拿下英伟达约60%的增量800G订单。申万电子（+89.3%）、计算机（+88.1%）、通信（+81.4%）位列31个行业前三，印证AI硬件是这一轮行情的决定性主题。","drivers":["PBOC September 2024 50bp RRR cut and stimulus package","800G optical module demand surge AI data centers","Innolight 2024 revenue +123% Eoptolink +179% YoY confirmed","SHCOMP +25.1% broad rally","growth-over-value 40.8pp Electronics Computers Telecoms lead"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月降准50bp及一揽子刺激政策","AI数据中心800G光模块需求爆发","中际旭创+123%亿飞光通+179%营收年报确认","上证综指+25.1%大幅上涨","成长跑赢价值40.8pp：电子/计算机/通信领涨"],"title":"PBOC Stimulus and 800G Optical Module Revenue Surge","title_zh":"央行降准刺激叠加800G光模块业绩爆发"},"2025-02-21":{"body":"The basket fell -28.9% in a sharp flight-to-safety rotation triggered by the Trump administration's April 2, 2025 Liberation Day tariff announcement, which imposed 145% duties on Chinese imports and sent global growth stocks into freefall. The Shenwan rotation was definitively defensive: Agriculture (+9.9%), Food and Beverage (+3.6%), and Utilities (-0.1%) held up while Electronics (-22.4%), Computers (-24.4%), and Telecoms (-25.0%) -- exactly this basket's sectors -- were the worst laggards; defensives outperformed cyclicals by 6.1pp and value led growth by 12.8pp. SHCOMP fell -6.9%. The leg also reflected the fading of the January 2025 DeepSeek R1 peak euphoria, as the macro tariff shock overwhelmed the AI narrative that had driven the prior rally.","body_zh":"板块急跌28.9%，触发因素为特朗普政府于2025年4月2日宣布的\"解放日\"关税，对华进口商品加征145%关税，引发全球成长股暴跌。申万行业轮动明确偏向防御：农业（+9.9%）、食品饮料（+3.6%）、公用事业（-0.1%）相对抗跌，而电子（-22.4%）、计算机（-24.4%）、通信（-25.0%）——恰好是本板块的主要构成行业——跌幅最深；防御跑赢周期6.1个百分点，价值跑赢成长12.8个百分点，上证综指下跌6.9%。本次下跌同时反映了2025年1月DeepSeek R1发布引发的情绪高峰逐渐消退，宏观关税冲击盖过了此前推动行情的AI叙事。","drivers":["Trump April 2 2025 Liberation Day 145% China tariffs","DeepSeek R1 Jan 2025 euphoria peak fading","global growth-tech risk-off rotation","flight to defensive staples Agriculture Food Utilities","SHCOMP -6.9% broad pullback"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2025年4月2日\"解放日\"145%关税冲击","DeepSeek R1 2025年1月情绪高峰消退","全球成长/科技避险轮动","资金涌入农业、食品饮料、公用事业等防御板块","上证综指下跌6.9%"],"title":"Trump Liberation Day Tariffs Trigger Risk-Off","title_zh":"特朗普\"解放日\"关税冲击引爆避险抛售"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"From April 8, 2025 the basket launched its most explosive leg yet, +460.1% in 14 months, as multiple structural forces converged. The US-China tariff partial truce (tech device exemptions announced April 2025) stabilized sentiment while Beijing's 15th Five-Year Plan (approved March 2026) positioned AI as the economy's defining pillar, mandating a 295 billion dollar domestic AI computing grid running on 80% domestic chips. Huawei Ascend 910B chip shipments reached approximately 812,000 units in 2025 with projected 12 billion dollars in AI processor revenue for 2026 (+60% YoY). Domestic optical fiber prices surged over 400% from their 2024 lows as AI cluster networking demand exploded; Eoptolink posted FY2025 revenue of 24.8 billion yuan (+187% YoY) and net profit of 9.5 billion yuan (+236% YoY). Shenwan Telecoms (+294.2%) and Electronics (+200.5%) led the entire A-share universe while all defensive sectors fell, with growth leading value by a record 72.5pp.","body_zh":"2025年4月8日起，板块在14个月内飙升460.1%，创历史最强行情，多重结构性力量共振。美中关税部分休战（2025年4月科技设备获豁免）稳定市场情绪，北京第十五个五年规划（2026年3月审议通过）将AI列为经济发展核心支柱，强制要求建设以80%国产芯片为底座、总规模约2950亿美元的国家AI算力网络。华为昇腾910B芯片2025年出货量约81.2万颗，预计2026年AI芯片营收达120亿美元（同比+60%）。国内光纤价格较2024年低点暴涨逾400%，AI集群组网需求爆发；亿飞光通2025财年营收248亿元（同比+187%），净利润95亿元（同比+236%）。申万通信（+294.2%）和电子（+200.5%）领涨全市场，所有防御板块下跌，成长跑赢价值创纪录的72.5个百分点。","drivers":["China 15th Five-Year Plan 295B USD domestic AI chip mandate","Huawei Ascend 910B domestic chip ramp 812k units 2025","optical fiber price surge 400% from 2024 lows","Eoptolink FY2025 revenue +187% net profit +236% YoY","US-China tariff tech device exemptions stabilizing sentiment"],"drivers_zh":["十五五规划2950亿美元国产AI芯片算力网络强制目标","华为昇腾910B国产芯片快速放量81.2万颗","光纤价格较2024年低点暴涨400%+","亿飞光通2025财年营收+187%净利润+236%","美中关税科技设备豁免稳定情绪"],"title":"China AI Self-Reliance Supercycle and Optical Boom","title_zh":"中国AI自主可控超级周期与光通信繁荣"}},"now":"AI Compute and Optics is in a confirmed Expansion/Trending phase, sitting at the 52.6th percentile of its historical range and ranked 3rd of 31 Shenwan baskets by relative strength. The current leg (Apr 2025 to present) has produced +460% versus SHCOMP +31%, driven by the 15th Five-Year Plan AI capex mandate, surging 800G/1.6T optical module demand from domestic data-center build-outs, and the Huawei Ascend domestic chip ramp. Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) are the clear Shenwan leaders while Agriculture, Beauty, and Retail sit in deep losses, a textbook growth-over-value risk-on tape with a growth premium of +18.2pp. Cyclicals are decisively outpacing defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%) and SHCOMP is modestly positive (+1.6%), confirming that theme momentum rather than index beta is the dominant current driver.","now_zh":"AI算力与光模块板块目前处于扩张/上行趋势阶段，历史区间分位数为52.6%，在31个申万行业板块中相对强度排名第三。当前行情（2025年4月至今）累计涨幅达460%，远超同期上证综指31%的涨幅，核心驱动来自第十五个五年规划的AI算力投入强制目标、国内数据中心建设带来的800G/1.6T光模块订单爆发，以及华为昇腾国产替代进程加速。电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）领涨申万各行业，农业、美容、零售深度落后，典型的成长风格主导、风险偏好抬升行情（成长溢价+18.2个百分点）。周期板块明显跑赢防御（+0.3% vs -12.1%），上证综指温和上涨（+1.6%），表明当前以主题驱动为主而非纯粹的指数贝塔行情。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_appliances":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-June 2021, the A-share market entered a powerful green-economy cyclical rally anchored by Power Equipment (+28.8%), Metals (+26.2%), and Defense (+20.5%), driven by Beijing's dual-carbon policy push (carbon-neutrality targets confirmed at the July 2021 Politburo meeting), soaring commodity prices, and strong export demand. Home Appliances gained only a modest 4.2%, essentially riding index beta in a SHCOMP +2.1% environment — the sector was a mid-pack follower, not a leader, as funds rotated into new-energy supply-chain and heavy-industry names. Consumer-defensives (Pharma, Food & Bev) were the hard laggards, reflecting risk-on sentiment that preferred cyclical value over consumer stability.","body_zh":"2021年6月中旬起，A股进入以电力设备（+28.8%）、有色金属（+26.2%）和国防军工（+20.5%）领涨的绿色经济周期行情，驱动力来自2021年7月政治局会议确认的双碳目标、大宗商品价格飙升及出口需求强劲。家电板块仅录得4.2%涨幅，基本随上证综指（+2.1%）做beta行情——资金集中涌入新能源产业链和重工业品种，家电处于市场中游跟涨状态。医药、食品饮料等消费防御品种大幅落后，印证了当时市场的强烈风险偏好。","drivers":["dual-carbon policy bid","commodity price surge","new-energy supply-chain rotation","risk-on cyclical beta","export demand"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策驱动","大宗商品涨价","新能源产业链轮动","周期性beta行情","出口需求支撑"],"title":"Green-Cyclical Boom Carries Appliances Along","title_zh":"绿色周期牛市带动家电跟随上涨"},"2022-01-10":{"body":"Starting January 10, 2022, the A-share market suffered a broad selloff (SHCOMP -14.7%) as global risk-off conditions — anchored to the US Federal Reserve's accelerating pivot toward rate hikes (the January 2022 FOMC meeting confirmed tapering end and rate-hike path) — collided with domestic COVID Omicron spread beginning in China's key cities. Home Appliances was one of the worst performers (-27.6%), significantly underperforming even the broad index, as the sector sits at the intersection of consumer spending vulnerability (property downturn reducing renovation demand) and China's ongoing regulatory overhang. Coal alone held flat (+0.2%) as an energy-security play, while the absence of growth-value spread divergence (-2.8pp) confirms this was an indiscriminate risk-off flush, not a sector-rotation event.","body_zh":"2022年1月10日起，A股遭遇大范围抛售（上证综指-14.7%），全球风险规避情绪急剧升温——美联储在1月FOMC会议确认加速缩表并明示加息路径，同时奥密克戎开始向中国主要城市蔓延。家电板块（-27.6%）跌幅远超大盘，处于跌幅最大的行业之列。家电同时面临两重压力：地产下行压制装修置换需求，以及居民消费预期恶化。仅煤炭（+0.2%）因能源安全逻辑守住正收益，而成长/价值利差几乎无分化（-2.8pp），表明此次下跌是无差别的风险规避，而非行业轮动。","drivers":["Fed rate-hike pivot","Omicron spread China","property downturn demand destruction","indiscriminate risk-off flush","Stock Connect outflows"],"drivers_zh":["美联储加息预期骤升","奥密克戎国内蔓延","地产下行抑制需求","无差别风险规避性抛售","北向资金大幅流出"],"title":"Fed Pivot Fear Plus COVID Omicron Systemic Selloff","title_zh":"美联储转鹰叠加奥密克戎引发系统性抛售"},"2022-03-15":{"body":"The March 15 trough marked the low of the COVID-shock panic, and the subsequent rally to June 30 (+21.1%) was a value-led recovery driven by Beijing's policy response package. The PBOC cut the 1-year LPR by 10bps and the 5-year LPR by 5bps in January 2022, and in March the State Council signaled further property stabilization support (保交楼 and mortgage relief). Autos (+28.8%), Coal (+28.4%), and Beauty (+27.2%) led while Electronics and Computers lagged, confirming a classic value/policy-recovery rotation (growth-minus-value at -9pp). The Shanghai lockdown (March 28 to June 1) paradoxically accelerated policy-easing expectations — foreign investors net-bought ~¥16.3 billion via Stock Connect from late March, anticipating fiscal stimulus. Home Appliances (+21.1%) benefited as a high-dividend, policy-sensitive consumer sector that gains when property-related consumption support narratives take hold.","body_zh":"2022年3月15日触及疫情恐慌低点后，市场展开至6月30日的反弹行情（+21.1%），由政策宽松驱动的价值风格主导。人民银行于2022年1月下调1年期LPR 10bp、5年期LPR 5bp，3月国务院进一步释放地产托底信号（保交楼、调降首套房贷利率下限）。汽车（+28.8%）、煤炭（+28.4%）、美容护理（+27.2%）领涨，电子、计算机落后，成长/价值利差为-9pp，典型政策复苏行情特征。上海4月封城反而强化了市场对财政刺激的预期，外资通过沪深港通净买入约163亿元。家电（+21.1%）作为高股息、政策敏感型消费板块受益于地产相关消费支持叙事。","drivers":["PBOC LPR cuts Jan 2022","property stabilization pledge","value/policy-recovery rotation","foreign buying via Stock Connect","Shanghai lockdown easing expectations"],"drivers_zh":["央行LPR下调（2022年1月）","地产托底政策承诺","价值/政策复苏风格轮动","北向外资净买入","上海封控强化宽松预期"],"title":"Policy Easing & Lockdown-Trough Cyclical Rebound","title_zh":"政策宽松叠加封控低点反弹，价值风格主导"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"The June 30 peak reversed sharply into a -23.5% selloff through October 31, 2022. The catalyst was a wave of homebuyer mortgage boycotts beginning in July 2022 — by mid-September, 343 projects covering over ¥2 trillion in pre-sold housing were boycotted across China — compounding Evergrande's failure to deliver its restructuring plan by July 31. SHCOMP fell -14.9% as foreign capital fled (Stock Connect outflows accelerated). Growth actually led value in this window (+8.1pp growth premium), with Defense, Congloms, and Computers the only sectors with positive or flat returns — signaling capital flight into safe-haven or state-owned-enterprise themes. Home Appliances (-22.6%) and consumer-cyclicals (Food & Bev -31.3%, Bldg Mat -31.4%) were among the biggest laggards, as their residential-linked demand was most directly impaired by the property crisis. The SHCOMP's 20th Party Congress overhang (October) added to selling pressure.","body_zh":"2022年6月30日见顶后，市场进入-23.5%的跌势，延续至2022年10月31日。2022年7月断供潮集中爆发，至9月中旬全国已有343个停工楼盘被业主停止还贷，涉及金额逾2万亿元；恒大也于7月底未能如期提交重组方案，楼市危机全面升温。上证综指下跌14.9%，外资通过沪深港通持续净流出。本轮下跌成长风格反而优于价值（成长/价值利差+8.1pp），国防、多元金融、计算机等少数板块抗跌，资金向国企避险板块收缩。家电（-22.6%）与消费周期板块（食品饮料-31.3%、建材-31.4%）跌幅居前，地产链断裂直接压制其需求。二十大政治不确定性（10月）进一步加重卖压。","drivers":["mortgage boycott wave July 2022","Evergrande restructuring failure","property sector contagion","Stock Connect capital outflows","20th Party Congress political uncertainty"],"drivers_zh":["2022年7月断供潮","恒大重组失败","地产板块系统性风险蔓延","北向资金大幅外流","二十大政治不确定性"],"title":"Property Mortgage Boycott & Evergrande Contagion Crash","title_zh":"断供潮爆发叠加恒大危机蔓延，家电深度受创"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"The October 31, 2022 trough launched Home Appliances' biggest recorded leg: a 103.1% gain over 18 months to May 13, 2024, more than doubling the SHCOMP (+8.8%) and ranking first in the Shenwan universe (+48.7% vs Telecoms +26.1%, Banks +25.7%). The ignition was the November 2022 market pricing of zero-COVID exit (social-media rumors of a reopening committee triggered a rally even before the official December 7, 2022 announcement reclassifying COVID-19 to Class B). Once reopening was confirmed, the multi-quarter consumer recovery thesis — pent-up renovation demand, post-lockdown household formation, and export resilience from Midea/Haier's global diversification — drove sustained re-rating. Fiscal execution of trade-in programs, announced in early 2024 with ¥150 billion via ultra-long special treasury bonds, provided a second catalyst. The rotation was value-led (value outperformed growth by 8.7pp), with Real Estate and Power Equipment the notable laggards, confirming appliances captured the 'consumption recovery without the property-drag' premium.","body_zh":"2022年10月31日触底后，家电板块启动长达18个月、涨幅高达103.1%的超级行情，远超上证综指（+8.8%），位居申万行业第一（+48.7%）。启动信号来自2022年11月社交媒体广泛流传的新冠政策转向传言，市场开始定价清零退出，早于2022年12月7日官方公告将新冠调整为乙类管理。复苏叙事涵盖多个层面：封控后装修和家电置换需求释放、美的/海尔全球化收入分散带来的出口韧性，以及2024年初以超长期特别国债支持的1500亿元以旧换新补贴政策落地二次催化。整体表现为价值风格优于成长（8.7pp），地产和电力设备成为最大落后品种，印证家电享受了'消费复苏但无地产拖累'的独特溢价。","drivers":["COVID-zero exit pricing Nov–Dec 2022","consumer pent-up demand release","Midea/Haier global revenue diversification","trade-in subsidy program (以旧换新) 2024","value/dividend re-rating vs growth laggard"],"drivers_zh":["新冠清零退出预期（2022年11至12月）","居民压抑消费需求集中释放","美的/海尔海外营收多元化","以旧换新补贴政策（2024年）","价值/红利风格重估"],"title":"COVID Zero Exit & Trade-In Cycle: Monster 103% Rally","title_zh":"新冠清零退出叠加以旧换新政策，家电翻倍大牛市"},"2024-05-13":{"body":"The May 13, 2024 peak triggered a -25.7% selloff to July 25, as risk-off flight-to-safety dominated (defensives -8.8% vs cyclicals -13.6% with SHCOMP -8.3%) — the bundle's ctx explicitly labels this 'FLIGHT-TO-SAFETY: not sector strength.' Retail sales weakened through Q2 2024 with home appliance sales declining 7.6% YoY in June, as consumers stayed cautious amid persistent deflation and confidence erosion. The Third Plenum (July 15–18) disappointed investors expecting bolder stimulus, instead reaffirming existing policy continuity. Utilities, Electronics, and Banks were the only sectors to hold near flat — classic defensive flight. Appliances fell disproportionately as the sector's beta to the consumer/property recovery thesis unwound; the prior 103% rally had priced in a stronger rebound than fundamentals delivered.","body_zh":"2024年5月13日见顶后，市场进入-25.7%的下跌（至7月25日），风险规避主导，防御板块（-8.8%）明显跑赢周期板块（-13.6%），上证综指下跌8.3%——这是典型的防御性避险旋转，与板块基本面无关。2024年二季度零售端持续低迷，6月家电销售额同比下降7.6%，消费信心未见实质改善，通缩预期挥之不去。7月15至18日召开的三中全会未能推出超预期的总量刺激，政策方向延续现有框架，令市场失望。公用事业、电子、银行等防御板块相对抗跌。家电在上一轮103%涨幅透支复苏预期后，估值回归压力释放。","drivers":["CPI/PPI deflation pressure","consumer confidence erosion","Third Plenum policy disappointment","home-appliance retail sales decline June 2024","profit-taking on overextended 103% prior leg"],"drivers_zh":["CPI/PPI通缩压力","消费者信心持续低迷","三中全会政策预期落空","6月家电零售同比下滑","前期103%涨幅的估值透支"],"title":"Deflation Fears & Flight to Defensives Reverse Gains","title_zh":"通缩压力叠加三中全会预期落空，资金转向防御"},"2024-07-25":{"body":"The July 25 trough was the springboard for a 56.0% rally to August 26, 2025, driven by a multi-wave macro stimulus cycle. The first wave was the September 24, 2024 PBOC stimulus package — 20bp policy rate cut, 50bp RRR cut, ¥500 billion swap facility for nonbank equity purchases, and ¥300 billion share-buyback relending — causing the CSI 300 to jump 16% in a single week (its best since 2008). SHCOMP surged 34.0% over the full leg. The second wave was the January 2025 DeepSeek-R1 launch, which drove a $1.3 trillion China equity rally with Computers (+93.6%), Telecoms (+98.7%), and Congloms (+113.7%) leading. Home Appliances (+56.0%) rode the broad beta upswing but significantly underperformed growth leaders — cyclicals beat defensives by 14.9pp and growth beat value by 37.8pp — consistent with a market where appliances are a mid-beta, value-income play in a growth-thematic tape.","body_zh":"2024年7月25日触底后，家电板块启动一轮+56.0%的反弹（至2025年8月26日），由多波次宏观刺激驱动。第一波：2024年9月24日人民银行宣布一揽子货币政策——政策利率下调20bp、存款准备金率降50bp、设立5000亿元非银互换便利支持股市，沪深300单周飙涨16%，创2008年以来最大周涨幅。第二波：2025年1月DeepSeek-R1发布，引发高达1.3万亿美元的中国资产重估，计算机（+93.6%）、通信（+98.7%）、综合（+113.7%）领涨。家电（+56.0%）跟随宽beta上涨，但显著跑输成长龙头——周期股超越防御股14.9pp，成长风格领先价值37.8pp，印证家电在成长主题行情中属于中beta价值收益型品种。","drivers":["PBOC bazooka Sept 24 2024 (RRR/rate cut + swap facility)","CSI 300 +16% in one week","DeepSeek-R1 Jan 2025 AI rally","growth/cyclical rotation dominance","broad index beta uplift"],"drivers_zh":["央行'一揽子'货币政策（2024年9月24日）","沪深300单周涨16%（2008年来最大）","DeepSeek-R1发布（2025年1月）","成长/周期风格主导","宽指数beta带动"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka to DeepSeek: Broad Beta + Growth Surge","title_zh":"央行'大炮'叠加DeepSeek催化，宽beta驱动家电大涨"},"2025-08-26":{"body":"From the August 26, 2025 peak, Home Appliances sold off -18.7% against a SHCOMP that nonetheless gained +4.1% — a sharp relative-return destruction. The ctx data confirms this is a growth-dominated, risk-on tape where cyclicals beat defensives by 21.9pp and growth leads value by 26.3pp, but appliances are deep laggards (-18.7%) alongside Agriculture, Retail, and Beauty. The primary headwinds are structural: escalating US tariffs on Chinese white goods (effective from April 2025, with combined rates potentially reaching 55%-112% on US-bound exports), which squeezed Midea/Haier's North American margin outlook, colliding with the ongoing AI/tech narrative rotation (Telecoms +108.5%, Electronics +96.0%) that vacuums liquidity away from domestic-consumer-oriented names. This is a style and narrative mismatch — appliances are a consumption-recovery/dividend story in a market rewarding innovation/AI scarcity premium.","body_zh":"2025年8月26日见顶后，家电板块下跌18.7%，而上证综指同期上涨4.1%，相对表现极度弱势。ctx数据确认当前为成长/风险偏好主导格局，周期股跑赢防御股21.9pp，成长风格领先价值26.3pp，但家电与农业、商贸零售、美容护理同列最大落后品种。核心压力来自两方面：一是美国对华白色家电加征关税（2025年4月起生效，综合税率可能达55%-112%），显著压缩美的/海尔北美业务利润空间；二是市场流动性持续向AI/科技叙事集中（通信+108.5%、电子+96.0%），家电作为消费复苏/高股息品种在主题驱动的行情中严重缺乏吸引力。这是一场风格与叙事的双重错配。","drivers":["US tariff escalation on white goods April 2025","AI/tech narrative rotation (Telecoms/Electronics +96-109%)","growth dominates value by 26pp","domestic consumer demand still subdued","liquidity concentration in DeepSeek/AI themes"],"drivers_zh":["美国对华白色家电关税升级（2025年4月）","AI/科技叙事轮动主导（通信/电子+96-109%）","成长风格领先价值26pp","国内消费需求仍然疲弱","流动性向DeepSeek/AI主题高度集中"],"title":"Tariff Export Squeeze & AI Growth Rotation Leave Appliances Behind","title_zh":"关税出口压力叠加AI风格轮动，家电深度跑输大盘"}},"now":"Home Appliances is currently in a Bottoming phase (-13.3% in the current window), ranking 9th of 31 Shenwan industries with only 33% of its recent return window positive and trading below its 200-day moving average. The tape is a growth-dominated, risk-on A-share market (SHCOMP +1.6%, cyclicals +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%, growth leading value by 18.2pp), driven by Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) as the AI/DeepSeek thematic wave absorbs liquidity. Appliances are deep laggards in this configuration: the sector is a value/dividend/consumer-recovery play and does not benefit from the current technology-liquidity rotation. The trough-phase setup with a depressed rs_rank (9/31) and growth-value spread of +18.2pp suggests the sector is basing, but a catalyst inflection — either a growth/value style reversal, an escalation of trade-in (以旧换新) subsidies, or a sustained property-market stabilization signal — is needed before a new leadership leg can be confirmed.","now_zh":"家电板块目前处于筑底阶段（本窗口区间收益-13.3%），在31个申万行业中排名第9，近期收益窗口胜率仅33%，且股价低于200日均线。当前A股市场由成长风格主导（上证综指+1.6%，周期股+0.3%优于防御股-12.1%，成长/价值利差达18.2pp），电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）受益于DeepSeek人工智能主题行情。家电作为典型的价值/红利/消费复苏品种，在当前科技流动性轮动格局下深度跑输。板块申万排名低迷（9/31）、成长/价值利差高企，虽显示估值已处低位，但仍需等待成长/价值风格切换、以旧换新补贴政策加码或地产市场持续企稳信号，方可确认新一轮领涨行情启动。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_autos":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-June through December 2021, NEV makers surged +27.9% as Beijing's dual-carbon roadmap (carbon peak 2030/neutrality 2060) catalyzed a re-rating of the electrification supply chain. The State Council's October 2021 Action Plan for Carbon Peak by 2030 set an explicit 40% NEV penetration target and NEV subsidies — though tapered 20% for 2021 — remained sizable. BYD set consecutive monthly delivery records through Q3-Q4 2021 and China's NEV penetration rate exceeded 10% for the first time. The broader tape was unmistakably cyclicals-led and growth-tilted (Power Equipment +47.8%, Metals +38.5%; SHCOMP +4.4%), so the Autos rally was partly index beta amplified by NEV policy tailwinds rather than pure sector outperformance.","body_zh":"2021年6月中旬至12月，受北京双碳路线图（2030年碳达峰/2060年碳中和）催化，新能源汽车整车板块大涨+27.9%。国务院2021年10月出台《2030年前碳达峰行动方案》，明确设定2030年新能源车渗透率达40%的目标，当年补贴虽较2020年缩减20%但依然可观。比亚迪在2021年三四季度连续刷新月度交付纪录，全年新能源车渗透率首次突破10%。整体市场风格为周期/成长主导（电力设备+47.8%、有色+38.5%，上证+4.4%），汽车板块的涨幅在很大程度上是指数Beta叠加政策利好，而非单纯的板块超额收益。","drivers":["dual-carbon policy mandate","NEV subsidy continuation","BYD delivery records","SHCOMP cyclicals rally","carbon peak 2030 target"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策强制推行","新能源补贴延续","比亚迪交付纪录","上证周期股行情","2030碳达峰目标"],"title":"NEV policy surge, dual-carbon mandate","title_zh":"新能源政策加速，双碳目标驱动上行"},"2021-12-09":{"body":"From December 2021 through April 2022, the basket collapsed -39.3%, tracking a brutal SHCOMP drawdown of -21.4%. The causal chain was threefold: (1) Shanghai entered a strict citywide lockdown from April 1, 2022, halting SAIC, NIO, Tesla, and Volkswagen JV production — Shanghai auto output plunged nearly 48% YoY in April; (2) the global semiconductor chip shortage persisted, constraining output volumes across OEMs; (3) the Fed's March 2022 rate-hike cycle and yuan depreciation to 6.70+ pressured global growth multiples, hitting high-beta NEV names hardest. The ctx confirms a value rotation: Coal (+6.7%) led while Power Equipment (-41.3%) and Electronics (-42.4%) lagged alongside Autos — the selloff was primarily broad SHCOMP beta (index -21.4%) compounded by growth-to-value style rotation, not a sector-idiosyncratic event.","body_zh":"2021年12月至2022年4月，板块暴跌-39.3%，与上证-21.4%的大幅回调高度同步。驱动因素有三：（1）上海自2022年4月1日起实施全城封控，上汽、蔚来、特斯拉及大众合资工厂全线停产，4月上海汽车产量同比骤降近48%；（2）全球芯片短缺持续制约整车企业产量；（3）美联储2022年3月启动加息周期，人民币贬值至6.70以上，打压高Beta的新能源车估值。截面数据印证了价值风格切换：煤炭（+6.7%）领涨，电力设备（-41.3%）和电子（-42.4%）与汽车同步重挫——这次下跌本质是上证宽基Beta下行叠加成长转价值风格切换，而非板块个性化的负面事件。","drivers":["Shanghai COVID lockdown Apr-2022","semiconductor chip shortage","Fed rate hike cycle","yuan depreciation","SHCOMP broad beta selloff"],"drivers_zh":["2022年4月上海封控","半导体芯片短缺","美联储加息周期","人民币贬值","上证宽幅Beta下行"],"title":"COVID lockdowns crush supply, growth selloff","title_zh":"疫情封控重创供应链，成长股遭大幅抛售"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"The basket surged +68.5% in just 14 weeks, making this the sharpest rally in the data set. The catalyst chain was precise and dated: Shanghai's lockdown was lifted by June 1, 2022, and the State Council on June 1 simultaneously announced a halving of purchase tax (from 10% to 5%) for ICE passenger vehicles under 300,000 yuan with engines at or below 2L, valid through December 2022. NEV subsidies were also extended. China's auto market snapped back dramatically — total vehicle sales rose 34.4% MoM in June 2022 and NEV monthly sales hit new records. The ctx puts Autos (+56.7%) as the second-ranked Shenwan sector, co-leading with Power Equipment (+57.0%) in a cyclicals-dominant, SHCOMP +12.9% beta surge — confirming the move was macro/policy stimulus, not idiosyncratic sector news.","body_zh":"板块在短短14周内暴涨+68.5%，是本数据集中涨幅最大的单腿行情。催化链清晰且有明确日期：上海封控于2022年6月1日前后解除，同日国务院宣布对购置价不超过30万元、2.0L及以下排量乘用车的购置税减半（由10%降至5%），政策有效期至2022年12月底，同期新能源补贴亦获延续。中国汽车市场随即强劲反弹，2022年6月整体车市环比增长34.4%，新能源单月销量创新高。截面数据显示汽车（+56.7%）为申万行业第二强势板块，与电力设备（+57.0%）并列领涨，周期股全面跑赢，上证+12.9%——确认此轮上涨为宏观刺激政策驱动的Beta行情，而非板块特有的利好。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown lifted Jun-2022","purchase tax halved Jun-2022 State Council","NEV subsidy extension","SHCOMP broad recovery rally","pent-up demand release"],"drivers_zh":["2022年6月上海封控解除","国务院6月购置税减半政策","新能源补贴延续","上证宽基修复性反弹","被压制需求集中释放"],"title":"Post-lockdown rebound, NEV tax cut surge","title_zh":"封控解除后反弹，购置税减半政策催化暴涨"},"2022-08-01":{"body":"From the August 2022 peak through October 28, the basket shed -27.4% as multiple headwinds converged. The Fed accelerated to 75bp-per-meeting rate hikes through September-November 2022, the USD index surged past 114, and USDCNY broke above 7.20 — exerting renewed pressure on growth multiples in Chinese equities. Heightened US-China geopolitical tension (Pelosi's Taiwan visit, August 2-3, followed by PLA military exercises encircling Taiwan) rattled investor confidence. The 20th Party Congress (October 16-22) removed Xi's term limits and elevated hardliners, triggering a global selldown in Chinese assets on October 24. The ctx shows Autos (-24.6%) among the worst three sectors despite SHCOMP being 'only' -10.6% — Autos were disproportionate laggards, consistent with the sector's high growth-beta in a value-rotation environment where Coal (-2.0%) and Defense (-1.6%) relatively held up.","body_zh":"自2022年8月高点至10月28日，板块回调-27.4%，多重压力因素同时叠加。美联储9-11月连续大幅加息75bp，美元指数突破114，美元兑人民币破位7.20，对中国成长股估值形成持续压制。地缘政治方面，美国众议院议长佩洛西8月2-3日访台，解放军随即展开围台军演，投资者信心大受打击。10月16-22日召开的二十大取消任期限制、提拔强硬派，引发10月24日境外中国资产遭全球机构大举抛售。截面数据显示汽车（-24.6%）为最弱三大板块之一，跌幅远超上证（-10.6%），确认其在价值轮动环境中的高成长Beta放大效应——煤炭（-2.0%）和国防（-1.6%）相对抗跌。","drivers":["Fed 75bp hikes USD strength","USDCNY past 7.20","Pelosi Taiwan visit Aug-2022","20th Party Congress Oct-2022","growth-to-value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美联储75bp加息美元走强","美元兑人民币突破7.20","佩洛西2022年8月访台","二十大2022年10月召开","成长转价值风格切换"],"title":"Party Congress fear, macro headwinds relapse","title_zh":"二十大政治不确定性叠加宏观压力，板块二次探底"},"2022-10-28":{"body":"Over 13 months (Oct 2022 - Nov 2023) the basket rallied +36.8%, tracking China's most consequential macro pivot: the abrupt end of zero-COVID in December 2022 reopened dealerships and restored consumer confidence. BYD became the world's top-selling NEV brand and China's vehicle exports surged 74% YoY through October 2023 — reaching a monthly peak in October 2023 — led by BYD's expansion into Europe, ASEAN, and Latin America. Goldman Sachs raised its 2023 China auto retail forecast by 1.5 million units in January 2023 citing faster-than-expected reopening. The ctx is unusual: Autos (+36.8%) outperformed the SHCOMP (+4.2%) by over 32pp but cyclicals barely led (+5.5% vs defensives -1.6%), and Media (+44.3%) topped the sector table. This confirms the Auto outperformance was sector-specific (the reopening/export story was genuine alpha) layered onto a muted market backdrop.","body_zh":"历时13个月（2022年10月至2023年11月），板块上涨+36.8%，对应中国最重要的宏观政策转向：2022年12月清零政策骤然终止，汽车经销商重新开业，消费信心得以恢复。比亚迪跻身全球新能源销量第一品牌，中国整车出口量在2023年前10个月同比增长74%，并于2023年10月达到月度峰值，领涨品牌为比亚迪（欧洲、东盟、拉美全面扩张）。高盛于2023年1月将中国汽车零售预测上调150万辆，理由是疫情解封速度超预期。截面数据颇为特殊：汽车（+36.8%）对上证（+4.2%）超额收益高达32pp，但周期股仅微弱领先（+5.5% vs 防御-1.6%），传媒（+44.3%）领跑各行业。这确认汽车板块的强势主要来自板块特有的Alpha（解封/出口叙事是真实基本面驱动），而非宏观Beta。","drivers":["zero-COVID exit Dec-2022","China vehicle export boom +74% YoY","BYD global expansion","consumer confidence recovery","Goldman Sachs forecast upgrades"],"drivers_zh":["2022年12月退出清零政策","整车出口同比暴增+74%","比亚迪全球扩张","消费信心修复","高盛上调预测"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit, export boom re-rating","title_zh":"退出清零政策，出口爆发驱动板块重估"},"2023-11-28":{"body":"From late November 2023 through February 5, 2024, the basket dropped -21.6% in a broad SHCOMP drawdown of -11.1%. The proximate cause was the expiry of national NEV purchase subsidies at end-2022 (fully absorbed into comparables by Q4 2023) and the escalating price war — over 148 car models cut prices in 2023 alone, with BYD's successive price reductions compressing industry margins toward the 4-5% range. The Central Economic Work Conference in December 2023 flagged NEV consumption as a priority but offered no new hard subsidies, disappointing the market. The ctx confirms this was not Autos-specific strength but a flight-to-safety rotation: Banks (+5.5%) and Coal (+6.5%) led while Electronics (-30.4%), Defense (-29.6%), and Computers (-34.1%) lagged alongside Autos — classic risk-off driven by SHCOMP -11.1%, with Autos suffering disproportionately due to their growth-beta.","body_zh":"2023年11月下旬至2024年2月5日，板块下跌-21.6%，同期上证回落-11.1%。直接原因是2022年底全国新能源补贴到期（至2023年四季度已完全反映入比较基数），加之价格战持续激化——2023年全年逾148款车型降价，比亚迪屡次主动降价将行业净利率压缩至4-5%水平。2023年12月中央经济工作会议将新能源汽车消费列为重点，但未出台新的直接补贴政策，令市场失望。截面数据确认这是避险轮动而非板块主动下跌：银行（+5.5%）、煤炭（+6.5%）领涨，电子（-30.4%）、国防（-29.6%）、计算机（-34.1%）与汽车同步重挫——典型的上证-11.1%环境下的避险情绪主导，汽车因高成长Beta而跌幅尤为突出。","drivers":["NEV subsidy expiry impact","price war margin compression","SHCOMP broad risk-off","flight-to-safety bank/coal rotation","no new stimulus at CEWC Dec-2023"],"drivers_zh":["新能源补贴到期冲击","价格战利润率压缩","上证宽基避险抛售","资金涌入银行/煤炭避险","2023年12月中央经济工作会议未出台新刺激"],"title":"Subsidy cliff, price war, flight to safety","title_zh":"补贴悬崖叠加价格战，资金避险大幅抛售"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"This 20-month mega-rally (+82.4%) had three distinct engines: (1) February 2024 trough was engineered by state intervention — Central Huijin and CSFC poured over RMB 410bn into CSI 300-linked ETFs, with the SHCOMP rebounding from ~2,600 to 3,100 by end-February; (2) September 24, 2024 was the watershed: PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a comprehensive package including a 50bp RRR cut, a 10-20bp LPR reduction, CNY 500bn equity swap facility, and CNY 300bn share buyback relending — the CSI 300 surged 16% in a single week, its best since 2008; (3) through 2024, China's NEV production and sales each exceeded 12 million units for the first time, up 34-35% YoY, with trade-in subsidy program generating 1.3 trillion yuan in incremental sales. The ctx shows Autos (+82.4%) heavily lagging the growth leaders Telecoms (+159%) and Electronics (+156%) even within a SHCOMP +43.7% surge — Autos were a solid beta participant but not a leadership sector.","body_zh":"这轮历时20个月的大牛行情（+82.4%）有三个明确驱动引擎：（1）2024年2月的底部由国家力量托起——中央汇金与中国证金合计投入逾4,100亿元购入沪深300ETF，上证从约2,600点修复至3,100点；（2）2024年9月24日为关键转折点，央行行长潘功胜宣布综合宽松组合拳，包括降准50bp、LPR下调10-20bp、5,000亿元证券互换便利及3,000亿元回购再贷款，沪深300单周暴涨16%，创2008年以来最大周涨幅；（3）2024年全年中国新能源车产销双双突破1200万辆，同比增长34-35%，汽车以旧换新补贴计划拉动增量销售逾1.3万亿元。截面数据显示汽车（+82.4%）在上证+43.7%的强劲反弹中仍大幅落后于电信（+159%）、电子（+156%）等成长龙头——汽车是坚实的Beta参与者但并非领涨板块。","drivers":["Central Huijin national team ETF purchases","PBOC Sep-2024 RRR+LPR cuts + swap facility","NEV sales 12M units 2024 record","trade-in subsidy 1.3T yuan","SHCOMP broad beta surge"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金国家队大规模买入ETF","央行2024年9月降准降息+互换便利","2024年新能源销量突破1200万辆","汽车以旧换新补贴逾1.3万亿元","上证宽基Beta大幅上行"],"title":"National team rescue, PBOC bazooka, NEV record","title_zh":"国家队托市，央行放水，新能源销量破纪录"},"2025-09-30":{"body":"From end-September 2025 through June 2026 the basket has shed -26.1% even as the SHCOMP rose +3.7% — a punishing relative drawdown driven by sector-specific fundamentals. The full NEV purchase tax exemption (30,000 yuan cap) expired on December 31, 2025, cut to 15,000 yuan for 2026-2027, triggering a year-end rush and subsequent January 2026 demand cliff (BYD domestic NEV sales -53% YoY in January 2026, national passenger car retail -14% YoY). Simultaneously, the deepening price war — BYD deploying record 10% average discounts in March 2026, plus 7-year financing — compresses industry net margins already at 4.4%. The broader market is rotating into AI/semiconductor themes (Electronics +69%, Telecoms +93%), starving Autos of incremental flows. The ctx confirms Autos are a laggard in a growth-tilted tape where cyclicals (+4.5%) barely beat defensives (-12.4%), with Autos sitting well below both groups.","body_zh":"2025年9月底至2026年6月，板块下跌-26.1%，而上证同期上涨+3.7%，形成极为惨烈的相对回撤，本质是板块基本面特有的结构性压力。新能源购置税全额免税上限（30,000元）于2025年12月31日到期，2026-2027年减半至15,000元，导致年末销量透支，2026年1月需求骤降（比亚迪国内新能源销量同比降约53%，全国乘用车零售同比降约14%）。与此同时，价格战持续深化——比亚迪2026年3月平均折扣率升至创纪录的10%，并推出7年期低息贷款——行业净利率进一步压缩至4.4%。大盘资金持续向AI/半导体主题集中（电子+69%、电信+93%），汽车板块边际增量资金严重匮乏。截面数据确认汽车在成长主导行情中表现落后，远低于周期股（+4.5%）和防御股（-12.4%）两个分组。","drivers":["NEV tax exemption halved Jan-2026","January 2026 demand cliff post-pull-forward","deepening price war margin squeeze","AI/semiconductor rotation crowding out","January BYD domestic sales -53% YoY"],"drivers_zh":["2026年1月购置税减半政策实施","年末透支后2026年1月需求断崖","价格战深化压缩利润率","AI/半导体主题强势轮动分流","比亚迪1月国内销量同比降53%"],"title":"Tax cliff, price war deepens, AI rotation away","title_zh":"购置税减半悬崖，价格战深化，资金转向AI"}},"now":"Autos & NEV Makers is in a confirmed trough phase (pos=0.1, rs_rank=20/31, below 200-day MA, ret_win_pct=37.2%), having shed -26.1% since the September 2025 peak. The sector is the clear laggard in a market that has rotated sharply into Technology/AI and Telecoms — the current tape is GROWTH/RISK-ON but Autos are not participating: cyclicals are flat (+0.3%) while the sector is -22.3%, confirming sector-specific not broad-market headwinds. The live pressure is a simultaneous demand air-pocket (NEV tax exemption halved to 15,000 yuan from 30,000 yuan on 1-Jan-2026 caused December 2025 pull-forward and subsequent January cliff — BYD domestic NEV volumes fell ~53% YoY in January 2026) and a vicious price war deepening margin compression across the board. The broader tape (SHCOMP +3.7%, Electronics +69%, Telecoms +93%) is rotating into AI/semiconductor themes, starving Autos of fund flows while the fundamental earnings backdrop deteriorates.","now_zh":"汽车整车板块处于明确的底部阶段（相对强度排名20/31，位于200日均线下方，胜率37.2%），自2025年9月高点以来跌幅已达-26.1%。当前行情明显向科技/人工智能和电信板块轮动，汽车并未受益：周期股整体仅+0.3%，而汽车板块达-22.3%，确认为板块特有的结构性压力而非指数整体拖累。核心压力来自两端挤压：需求侧，新能源车购置税免税上限自2026年1月起减半至15,000元（原30,000元），导致2025年12月透支消费后，2026年1月销量出现断崖式下滑（比亚迪国内新能源销量同比降约53%）；供给侧，价格战持续激化，行业利润率受到严重压缩。与此同时，资金大量流入AI/半导体主题（电子+69%、电信+93%），进一步剥夺了汽车板块的增量资金。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_baijiu":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-June to December 2021 the SHCOMP rose 4.1% in a classic cyclical-beta environment: Power Equipment surged 50%, Metals +38%, and Defense +29% as Beijing's dual-carbon pivot and infrastructure push channelled liquidity into green-energy and hard-cycle themes. Baijiu's +4.2% move was purely index-beta — it trailed every leading sector and growth led value by 11pp, confirming no sector-specific demand catalyst. The common-prosperity regulatory campaign that broadened in mid-2021 created headline uncertainty for consumption-upgrade names, capping any independent valuation re-rating even as the index drifted higher.","body_zh":"2021年6月至12月，沪综指在典型周期贝塔环境中上涨4.1%：北京双碳政策转向与基建推进将流动性导入绿能与硬周期，电力设备+50%、金属+38%、军工+29%。白酒同期涨幅4.2%，纯属随市贝塔参与——落后所有领涨板块，成长跑赢价值11个百分点，无行业特定驱动。同期展开的共同富裕监管运动为消费升级标的制造了估值上限，令板块难以独立重估。","drivers":["green-energy cyclical rotation","dual-carbon infrastructure push","index beta participation","common-prosperity regulatory overhang"],"drivers_zh":["绿能周期轮动","双碳基建推进","指数贝塔参与","共同富裕监管压制"],"title":"Cyclical beta lift; baijiu treads water","title_zh":"周期贝塔行情，白酒随市横盘"},"2021-12-14":{"body":"The December 2021 to March 2022 selloff of 32.2% coincided with the Fed pivot: the FOMC signalled three rate hikes on December 15, 2021, triggering a global growth-to-value rotation that hit Chinese premium-consumption and growth stocks hardest. Within Shenwan, Coal surged 26% and Agriculture held positive while Autos, Electronics, and Food & Bev (the baijiu proxy) each fell 24-27%, and the SHCOMP fell 12.5% as value led growth by 11pp. Russia's invasion of Ukraine on February 24, 2022 added a commodity-driven risk-off shock that further squeezed consumer-discretionary and growth names. Baijiu's premium-brand positioning made it particularly vulnerable to the flight from quality-franchise multiples in a rising-rate world.","body_zh":"2021年12月至2022年3月，白酒板块大跌32.2%，恰逢美联储政策转向：2021年12月15日FOMC会议释放年内三次加息信号，引发全球成长转价值旋转，重创中国消费升级与成长标的。申万行业中，煤炭+26%、农业守正，而汽车、电子、食品饮料（白酒代理）各跌24-27%，沪综指下跌12.5%，价值跑赢成长11个百分点。2022年2月24日俄乌战争爆发进一步叠加大宗商品驱动的风险厌恶冲击，压缩消费可选与成长标的空间。白酒优质品牌溢价在加息环境下对估值压缩最为敏感。","drivers":["Fed pivot Dec 15 2021 global rate shock","growth-to-value rotation","Russia-Ukraine invasion Feb 2022 risk-off","consumer discretionary multiple compression"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2021年12月15日转向/全球加息冲击","成长转价值轮动","俄乌战争2022年2月风险厌恶","消费可选估值压缩"],"title":"Global rate shock + value rotation punish growth","title_zh":"全球加息冲击叠加价值轮动，成长股受压"},"2022-03-29":{"body":"From March 29 to June 30, 2022, baijiu surged 37% — the strongest sector in the entire Shenwan universe — as the SHCOMP reclaimed 6.1% from its lockdown trough. Shanghai's citywide lockdown (April-May 2022) catalysed a sharp market flush in late March, after which Beijing signalled policy easing with a State Council pledge on May 25 to support consumption and 33 economic rescue measures. Food & Bev and Autos led the rebound at +24% each, with defensives and cyclicals converging (5.9% vs 6.3%) as investors rotated into beaten-down consumer staples on conviction that lockdowns would lift and pent-up baijiu demand — banquet season, Dragon Boat Festival gifting — would recover sharply. The growth-minus-value spread was -4pp (value-neutral), confirming a broad quality-consumption bounce rather than a style bet.","body_zh":"2022年3月29日至6月30日，白酒暴涨37%，为申万全行业最强板块，沪综指同期从封控低点回升6.1%。上海全城封控（4-5月）于3月末触发市场急速下洗，随后5月25日国务院承诺支持消费并出台33条经济救助措施，引发强力反弹。食品饮料与汽车同为涨幅最高行业（各+24%），防御与周期收窄（5.9% vs 6.3%），投资者轮动至超跌消费白马，押注封控解除后积压的白酒消费需求（宴席旺季、端午节礼品）将急速释放。成长-价值利差仅-4pp，属宽基质量消费反弹，非风格押注。","drivers":["Shanghai citywide lockdown trough March 2022","State Council 33-measure stimulus May 25 2022","pent-up banquet demand expectation","consumer beta rebound from oversold"],"drivers_zh":["上海封控触底2022年3月","国务院33条刺激2022年5月25日","积压宴席需求预期","超跌消费贝塔反弹"],"title":"Shanghai lockdown trough; reopening hope fuels 37% surge","title_zh":"上海封控触底，重启预期驱动37%暴弹"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"From June 30 to October 31, 2022, baijiu fell 29.5% as the SHCOMP lost 14.9% in a broad drawdown where Food & Bev (-31.3%) and Bldg Mat (-31.4%) were the worst laggards. The July 2022 mortgage payment boycott — spreading to over 300 housing projects across 90 cities, threatening 2 trillion yuan of loans — destroyed consumer confidence and property-linked wealth effects. Simultaneously, zero-COVID restrictions resurged through Q3 as outbreaks in Chengdu, Xinjiang, and other provinces triggered new lockdowns, directly suppressing baijiu banquet and corporate gifting demand. The sole sector holding up was Defense (+3.4%), consistent with a policy/safety rotation; growth led value by 8.1pp as only tech/defense policy themes attracted flows, and baijiu's consumer-confidence premium made it the worst-hit laggard.","body_zh":"2022年6月30日至10月31日，白酒下跌29.5%，沪综指同期跌14.9%，食品饮料（-31.3%）与建材（-31.4%）为最大拖累。7月爆发的停贷潮蔓延至90个城市逾300个楼盘、涉及约2万亿元贷款，严重摧毁消费者信心与房产财富效应。与此同时，第三季度清零政策因成都、新疆等地疫情反弹再度收紧，直接压制白酒宴席与商务送礼消费。唯一守正的板块为军工（+3.4%），印证行情为政策/安全轮动；成长跑赢价值8.1pp，仅科技/军工政策主题吸引资金，白酒消费信心溢价使其成为跌幅最深的拖累。","drivers":["mortgage payment boycott July 2022","property wealth-effect destruction","zero-COVID Q3 2022 relapse lockdowns","consumer confidence collapse"],"drivers_zh":["2022年7月房贷断供潮","房产财富效应崩塌","2022年三季度清零反复封控","消费者信心崩溃"],"title":"Mortgage boycott + zero-COVID relapse crush consumer names","title_zh":"断供潮叠加新一轮清零，消费股遭重创"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"From October 31, 2022 to January 16, 2023, baijiu rocketed 50.2% — its strongest leg in the data series — as the SHCOMP gained 11.5% and Food & Bev (led by Kweichow Moutai and Wuliangye) was the top Shenwan sector at +40.7%. On November 1, Bloomberg reported unconfirmed plans for a zero-COVID exit by March 2023; Chinese stocks rallied immediately. The protests of late November 2022 accelerated Beijing's pivot, and by December 7 the NDRC formally dismantled most restrictions, with official reopening on January 8, 2023. Value led growth by 6.5pp and defensives outperformed cyclicals (19.3% vs 9.8%), consistent with a flight toward quality consumption (Moutai, Wuliangye) rather than pure growth-tech. Investors front-ran the entire 2023 consumption recovery that ultimately disappointed.","body_zh":"2022年10月31日至2023年1月16日，白酒暴涨50.2%——为本系列数据最强单腿——沪综指同期上涨11.5%，食品饮料（以贵州茅台、五粮液为首）以+40.7%领跑申万全行业。2022年11月1日彭博报道疑似2023年3月清零退出预案后，中国股市即刻拉升；11月末抗议活动加速政策转向，12月7日国家发改委正式拆解绝大多数管控措施，2023年1月8日正式重启。价值跑赢成长6.5pp，防御跑赢周期（19.3% vs 9.8%），印证资金流入优质消费（茅台、五粮液）而非纯成长科技。投资者提前布局全年2023年消费复苏逻辑，但该逻辑最终落空。","drivers":["zero-COVID exit speculation Nov 1 2022","late-November 2022 protests accelerating pivot","formal reopening January 8 2023","pent-up consumption front-running"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11月1日清零退出猜测","11月末抗议活动加速政策转向","2023年1月8日正式重启","消费复苏预期提前布局"],"title":"Zero-COVID exit rumours ignite 50% consumption surge","title_zh":"清零退出预期引爆消费股50%暴涨"},"2023-01-16":{"body":"From January 16, 2023 to January 31, 2024, baijiu fell 33.8% over 12 months as the SHCOMP lost 13.6%. The anticipated consumption boom never materialised: China's CPI turned negative in July 2023 (the first deflation in two years), driven by excess supply and subdued household confidence. The Shenwan leadership shows Coal (+7.5%), Telecoms (+0.8%), and Oil & Gas (-1.3%) — classic SOE value/defensive positioning — while Power Equipment (-42.4%) and Beauty (-43.3%) led declines. Baijiu's channel inventory began to swell as corporate gifting and banquet demand undershot expectations, and the property crisis deepened when Country Garden entered distress in August 2023, further suppressing discretionary spending. This was a broad-market beta selloff without a defensive bid, confirming macro rather than sector-specific causation.","body_zh":"2023年1月16日至2024年1月31日，白酒12个月下跌33.8%，为本系列最漫长回调腿，沪综指同期跌13.6%。预期中的消费爆发未能兑现：中国CPI于2023年7月转负（两年来首次通缩），根源是供给过剩与居民信心低迷。申万领涨为煤炭（+7.5%）、通信（+0.8%）、石油石化（-1.3%）——典型国企价值/防御配置；而电力设备（-42.4%）、美容（-43.3%）领跌。白酒渠道库存开始积压，因商务宴请与送礼需求低于预期，同时碧桂园于2023年8月陷入债务危机，进一步压制可选消费。整体为宽基贝塔型回调，无防御轮动特征，印证宏观驱动而非板块特定原因。","drivers":["post-COVID consumption disappointment","China CPI negative July 2023 first deflation","Country Garden property distress Aug 2023","SOE value rotation away from consumer growth"],"drivers_zh":["重启后消费落空","中国CPI 2023年7月转负首现通缩","碧桂园地产危机2023年8月","国企价值轮动脱离消费成长"],"title":"Reopening disappointment + deflation: 12-month grind lower","title_zh":"重启落空叠加通缩，长达12个月磨底"},"2024-01-31":{"body":"From January 31 to May 7, 2024, baijiu gained 25.6% as the SHCOMP surged 12.9%. China's state buyers (the national team) aggressively accumulated CSI 300 ETFs starting in late January 2024 — the Huatai-PineBridge CSI 300 ETF became the largest mutual fund in China with 131.1bn yuan AUM — stabilising a market that had fallen to multi-year lows. The PBOC also cut the 5-year LPR by 25bp in February 2024, the largest single cut on record. Metals (+28.8%) and Telecoms (+24.9%) led alongside Appliances (+24.5%), while Real Estate (-3.8%) and Conglom (-1.3%) lagged. Baijiu's +25.6% reflected beta recovery from an oversold position rather than any baijiu-specific demand revival, with defensives and cyclicals moving in near-parallel (11.9% vs 12.9%), consistent with a policy-backed floor across all sectors.","body_zh":"2024年1月31日至5月7日，白酒上涨25.6%，沪综指同期大涨12.9%。中国国家队自2024年1月末开始积极买入沪深300ETF（华泰柏瑞沪深300ETF规模升至1,311亿元，跃居全国最大公募），为多年新低的市场提供托底。人民银行亦于2024年2月下调5年期LPR 25个基点，为有记录以来最大单次降幅。申万领涨为金属（+28.8%）、通信（+24.9%）、家电（+24.5%），房地产（-3.8%）与综合（-1.3%）落后。白酒+25.6%反映超跌后的贝塔修复而非行业特定需求复苏，防御与周期趋于平行（11.9% vs 12.9%），印证政策托底行情的普涨特征。","drivers":["national team CSI 300 ETF buying Jan 2024","PBOC LPR cut 25bp Feb 2024 record","oversold valuation recovery","policy floor broad beta rebound"],"drivers_zh":["国家队2024年1月沪深300ETF买入","人民银行2024年2月LPR降息25基点创纪录","超跌估值修复","政策托底宽基反弹"],"title":"National team intervention triggers broad rebound","title_zh":"国家队入市干预引发宽基反弹"},"2024-05-07":{"body":"From May 7 to September 18, 2024, baijiu fell 36.7% as the SHCOMP lost 13.7%. The post-national-team rally faded as fiscal follow-through disappointed: GDP growth slowed to 4.7% YoY in Q2 2024 and property sales by top 100 developers plunged further. The Shenwan leaders were Brokers (-5.5%), Banks (-5.8%), and Utilities (-7.9%) — the least-negative sectors in a broad selloff — indicating relative safety rotation into financials/utilities, not any sector gaining in absolute terms. Food & Bev (-29.9%) was the second-worst Shenwan laggard, with baijiu suffering from continued channel inventory build and from premium-consumption sentiment souring as consumer confidence surveys hit multi-year lows. Growth and value were style-neutral (0.3pp), confirming a macro-driven drawdown without a dominant style factor.","body_zh":"2024年5月7日至9月18日，白酒下跌36.7%，沪综指同期跌13.7%。国家队托底行情消退，因财政跟进力度令市场失望：2024年二季度GDP同比增速降至4.7%，百强房企销售额持续下滑。申万相对抗跌板块为证券（-5.5%）、银行（-5.8%）、公用事业（-7.9%）——均为负收益中的最小跌幅，印证宽基回调中资金向金融/公用事业相对避险，无板块实际上涨。食品饮料（-29.9%）为申万第二大拖累，白酒同时承受渠道库存持续积压与消费信心调查跌至多年低位的双重压力。成长-价值风格利差仅0.3pp，印证为宏观驱动型回调，无明显风格主导。","drivers":["fiscal stimulus disappointment Q2 2024","GDP growth slowdown to 4.7% Q2 2024","property sales continued collapse","consumer confidence surveys multi-year low"],"drivers_zh":["2024年二季度财政刺激落空","GDP增速放缓至4.7%","房产销售持续下滑","消费者信心调查多年新低"],"title":"Fiscal stimulus underwhelms; broad selloff, baijiu worst","title_zh":"财政刺激低于预期，宽基回调白酒领跌"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"From September 18 to October 8, 2024 — just three weeks — baijiu surged 49.8% in China's most powerful policy-shock rally since 2015. On September 24, the PBOC announced a comprehensive stimulus package: RRR cut of 50bp, 7-day repo rate cut from 1.7% to 1.5%, mortgage rate cuts, and a 500bn yuan equity stabilisation fund. The CSI 300 rose 16% in a single week, its best since 2008. Beauty (+57.8%), Computers (+57.4%), and Brokers (+50.8%) led; even the worst Shenwan laggard (Utilities +16.6%) gained significantly. Growth led value by 14.7pp and the SHCOMP surged 28.4%, confirming this was a pure liquidity/policy beta event. Baijiu's 49.8% gain tracks the basket's high-beta exposure to broad-market liquidity rallies rather than any demand-side recovery.","body_zh":"2024年9月18日至10月8日——仅三周——白酒暴涨49.8%，为中国自2015年以来最强政策冲击型行情。9月24日，人民银行宣布一揽子刺激方案：降准50基点、7天逆回购利率从1.7%降至1.5%、下调存量房贷利率，并成立5,000亿元股市稳定基金。沪深300单周上涨16%（2008年以来最佳）。申万领涨为美容（+57.8%）、计算机（+57.4%）、证券（+50.8%）；即便最弱的公用事业也涨逾16.6%。成长跑赢价值14.7pp，沪综指在该窗口暴涨28.4%，印证为纯粹的流动性/政策贝塔事件。白酒49.8%涨幅追踪的是板块对宽基流动性行情的高贝塔敞口，而非需求端任何实质复苏。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut 50bp Sep 24 2024","7-day repo rate cut to 1.5%","500bn yuan equity stabilisation fund","broad market liquidity beta SHCOMP +28.4%"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行2024年9月24日降准50基点","7天逆回购利率降至1.5%","5,000亿元股市平准基金","宽基流动性贝塔沪综指+28.4%"],"title":"PBOC bazooka + equity fund drive 50% crash-up","title_zh":"央行大礼包叠加股市平准基金，白酒暴拉50%"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"From October 8, 2024 to February 5, 2025, baijiu fell 22.8% as the SHCOMP fell 7.5%. The October 12 NDRC press conference — widely anticipated as the delivery of major fiscal stimulus — disappointed badly, providing no specific new spending numbers. Investors immediately rotated out of consumption-upgrade names: Food & Bev fell 17.3% (second-worst Shenwan sector) while Conglom (+7.1%), Retail (+2.4%), and Computers (+2.0%) outperformed. Defensives underperformed cyclicals slightly (-11.2% vs -8.2%) with no clear style signal, indicating idiosyncratic rotation away from consumption-confidence plays. Channel checks confirmed worsening inventory across major baijiu distributors heading into Q4 2024, and corporate anti-corruption campaigns continued to suppress premium banquet volumes.","body_zh":"2024年10月8日至2025年2月5日，白酒下跌22.8%，沪综指同期跌7.5%。10月12日发改委新闻发布会本被市场高度期待为重大财政措施出台的时机，结果严重令人失望，未公布任何具体新增刺激规模数字。投资者即刻撤出消费升级标的：食品饮料跌17.3%（申万第二大拖累），而综合（+7.1%）、零售（+2.4%）、计算机（+2.0%）表现相对优异。防御与周期均小幅下跌（-11.2% vs -8.2%），无清晰风格信号，印证为消费信心主题的特异性轮出。经销商渠道库存检查显示2024年四季度以来积压明显加重，反腐运动持续压制高端宴请消费需求。","drivers":["NDRC Oct 12 2024 press conference disappointment","fiscal follow-through void post-stimulus","corporate anti-corruption banquet suppression","channel inventory build Q4 2024"],"drivers_zh":["发改委2024年10月12日发布会落空","刺激后财政跟进缺位","反腐运动压制宴请","2024年四季度渠道库存积压"],"title":"NDRC fiscal void; consumption premium re-rated lower","title_zh":"发改委财政真空，消费溢价重估下行"},"2025-02-05":{"body":"From February 5 to March 17, 2025, baijiu gained 19.9% as the SHCOMP rose 6.1%. This rally was driven by the DeepSeek R1 model shock (January 20, 2025), which triggered a sustained rotation into Chinese tech and growth names — Machinery +15.3%, Computers +15.1%, and Food & Bev +13.8% all moved in tandem, confirming broad participation rather than baijiu-specific demand. The style was modestly growth-led (growth minus value +4pp) and cyclicals slightly outpaced defensives (7.3% vs 6.6%), consistent with a broad liquidity-confidence lift. Baijiu's nearly 20% move was beta participation in a market recalibration: the DeepSeek breakthrough raised confidence in China's technology competitiveness, prompting global investors to reduce short-China exposures broadly, lifting all high-quality A-share names including premium liquor.","body_zh":"2025年2月5日至3月17日，白酒上涨19.9%，沪综指同期上涨6.1%。此轮行情由DeepSeek R1模型冲击（2025年1月20日）驱动，引发持续的中国科技与成长标的轮动——机械+15.3%、计算机+15.1%、食品饮料+13.8%同步走强，印证为宽基参与而非白酒特定需求。风格小幅偏成长（成长-价值利差+4pp），周期略跑赢防御（7.3% vs 6.6%），印证为宽基流动性-信心提振。白酒近20%的涨幅为市场重新定价中的贝塔参与：DeepSeek突破提振了市场对中国科技竞争力的信心，推动全球投资者减少对华做空敞口，连带提振了包括高端白酒在内的优质A股标的。","drivers":["DeepSeek R1 model shock Jan 20 2025","foreign short-China position unwind","broad growth confidence re-rating","beta participation in market recalibration"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek R1模型冲击2025年1月20日","外资平仓做空中国敞口","宽基成长信心重估","市场重新定价中的贝塔参与"],"title":"DeepSeek AI shock lifts broad market; baijiu rides beta","title_zh":"DeepSeek AI冲击提振大盘，白酒跟涨贝塔"},"2025-03-17":{"body":"From March 17 to June 13, 2025, baijiu fell 21.9% even as the SHCOMP fell only 1.4% — a severe relative underperformance confirming this was not a broad market selloff. The Shenwan context is unambiguous: Banks (+7.5%), Agriculture (+5.7%), and Pharma (+5.1%) led while Food & Bev (-10.2%), Electronics (-12.3%), and Computers (-14.9%) were worst. Defensives beat cyclicals by 5.3pp (1.6% vs -3.7%) and value beat growth by 5.8pp — a textbook flight-to-safety rotation. The catalyst was the April 2025 US tariff escalation to 125%+ on broad categories of Chinese goods, which triggered a risk-off reallocation from consumer-discretionary and tech-growth names into dividend-paying banks and defensive staples. Baijiu was caught as a premium-consumption name without the defensive/dividend characteristics needed to attract safety flows.","body_zh":"2025年3月17日至6月13日，白酒下跌21.9%，而沪综指仅跌1.4%——属严重相对弱势，而非宽基市场回调。申万格局明确：银行（+7.5%）、农业（+5.7%）、医药（+5.1%）领涨，而食品饮料（-10.2%）、电子（-12.3%）、计算机（-14.9%）垫底。防御跑赢周期5.3个百分点（1.6% vs -3.7%），价值跑赢成长5.8pp——典型的避险轮动格局。催化剂为2025年4月美国对华关税升级（部分类目关税率突破125%），触发从消费可选及科技成长标的向高股息银行及防御性必需消费的风险规避再平衡。白酒因不具备高股息/防御属性，在避险情绪下遭系统性抛售。","drivers":["US-China tariff escalation to 125%+ April 2025","flight-to-safety rotation into banks/agriculture","value beat growth by 5.8pp","premium consumption without dividend/defensive bid"],"drivers_zh":["2025年4月中美关税升级至125%+","避险轮动流入银行/农业","价值跑赢成长5.8pp","白酒无高股息/防御属性"],"title":"US tariff escalation triggers flight to safety; baijiu leads declines","title_zh":"美国关税升级触发避险轮动，白酒领跌"},"2025-06-13":{"body":"From June 13 to August 26, 2025, baijiu gained 20.1% as the SHCOMP surged 14.6%. This was a pure risk-on beta rally: Telecoms +50.5%, Electronics +36.6%, and Conglom +35.8% led, while defensives (Utilities +2.6%, Banks +1.6%) trailed by wide margins. Growth led value by 15.9pp and cyclicals beat defensives by 8.6pp. The catalysts were the May 2025 US-China tariff truce (tariffs reduced from 125% to approximately 30%) and a series of Huawei and semiconductor milestone announcements that triggered a broad AI/tech re-rating in Chinese equities. Baijiu's +20.1% was beta participation without sector leadership — the move was fully reversed in the subsequent selloff, confirming it was purely flow-driven with no demand or earnings support.","body_zh":"2025年6月13日至8月26日，白酒上涨20.1%，沪综指同期暴涨14.6%。这是纯粹的风险偏好贝塔行情：通信+50.5%、电子+36.6%、综合+35.8%领涨，而防御落后（公用事业+2.6%、银行+1.6%）。成长跑赢价值15.9pp，周期跑赢防御8.6pp。催化剂为2025年5月中美贸易停战（关税从125%降至约30%）以及华为与半导体里程碑式公告，引发中国权益市场宽基AI/科技重估。白酒+20.1%为无行业领涨的贝塔参与——随后回调幅度超过本轮全部涨幅，印证为纯粹的资金流驱动，无需求或业绩支撑。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce May 2025 (125% to 30%)","Huawei AI chip milestone announcements","broad tech/AI liquidity beta SHCOMP +14.6%","risk-on rotation cyclicals beat defensives 8.6pp"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月中美贸易停战（125%降至30%）","华为AI芯片里程碑公告","科技/AI流动性贝塔沪综指+14.6%","风险偏好周期跑赢防御8.6pp"],"title":"Trade truce + AI chip rally; baijiu rides broad beta again","title_zh":"贸易停战叠加AI芯片行情，白酒再度跟随反弹"},"2025-08-26":{"body":"From August 26, 2025 to June 26, 2026, baijiu fell 43.4% while the SHCOMP gained 4.1% — one of the most extreme relative underperformances in this series. Telecoms (+108.5%) and Electronics (+96.0%) absorbed the vast majority of A-share inflows as Huawei chip-roadmap disclosures and AI deployments drove the Shanghai Composite to a decade-high in October 2025 (highest since August 2015). Critically, this was not a risk-off market: cyclicals outperformed defensives (5.6% vs -16.3%) and growth led value by 26.3pp, the widest style gap in the series. Baijiu suffered both from structural selling (the market's largest growth-franchise multiple compressed under deflation, with 2025 annual reports confirming revenue/profit declines at 18 of 20 listed names) and from opportunity cost versus AI themes. Kweichow Moutai posted its worst growth in years, with retail channel prices off 36% and industry inventory turnover at roughly 1,400 days.","body_zh":"2025年8月26日至2026年6月26日，白酒下跌43.4%，而沪综指上涨4.1%——为本系列最极端的相对弱势之一。通信（+108.5%）与电子（+96.0%）吸收了A股绝大部分资金流入，华为芯片路线图披露及AI部署推动上证指数于2025年10月创十年新高（2015年8月以来最高）。关键在于，此非风险规避市场：周期跑赢防御（5.6% vs -16.3%），成长跑赢价值26.3pp，为本系列最宽风格利差。白酒同时遭受结构性抛售（市场最大成长品牌溢价在通缩环境下估值压缩，20家上市白酒公司中18家2025年年报营收/净利均同比下滑）与AI主题机会成本的双重压制。贵州茅台2025年年报创多年来最差增长，零售渠道价格下跌36%，行业库存消化周期约1,400天。","drivers":["Huawei AI chip mega-rally triggered $240bn Sep 2025","SHCOMP decade-high tech re-rating Oct 2025","structural deflation / baijiu consumption downgrade","channel inventory crisis record 1400-day turnover"],"drivers_zh":["华为AI芯片超级行情2025年9月引发2,400亿美元级别行情","沪综指2025年10月十年高点科技重估","结构性通缩/白酒消费降级","渠道库存危机创纪录约1,400天消化周期"],"title":"AI tech mega-rotation; baijiu structurally abandoned","title_zh":"AI科技超级轮动，白酒遭结构性抛售"}},"now":"Baijiu is deep in a major selloff leg that began Aug 26, 2025 and has erased 43.4% through June 2026, placing it at a confirmed trough (pos=0.0, rs_rank=21/31, below 200-day MA). The current cross-asset backdrop is a pure growth/tech-led tape: Electronics +96%, Telecoms +109% while Food and Bev (the baijiu proxy) sits at -29.9% in the same window, a 26pp growth-minus-value style gap that is the widest in this 5-year series. Fundamentally, the sector is in the deepest channel-inventory stress in years: wholesale Feitian Moutai prices fell 36% in 2025, 18 of 20 listed baijiu companies reported revenue and profit declines in 2025 annual results, and average industry inventory turnover bloated to roughly 1,400 days. Capital is rotating into AI, semiconductors, and Huawei-ecosystem hardware (DeepSeek catalyst January 2025, Huawei chip roadmap disclosures triggering a $240bn September 2025 rally), and baijiu's consumption-confidence story has no near-term catalyst while deflation persists and property wealth effects remain deeply negative.","now_zh":"白酒板块目前处于深度回调腿（2025年8月26日起），最大跌幅已达43.4%（截至2026年6月），处于周期底部（位置评分0.0，相对强度排名21/31，低于200日均线）。当前跨资产格局为纯成长/科技主导行情——电子+96%、通信+109%，而食品饮料（白酒代理）同期下跌29.9%，成长-价值风格利差高达26个百分点，为本系列五年内最宽。基本面层面，渠道库存压力达历史极值：飞天茅台批价2025年全年累计下降36%，20家A股白酒上市公司中18家2025年年报营收及净利均同比下滑，行业平均库存消化周期膨胀至约1,400天。资金流向信号明确：流动性正流入AI、半导体与华为生态硬件（DeepSeek催化剂2025年1月、华为芯片路线图发布引发2025年9月2,400亿美元级别行情），白酒消费信心逻辑在通缩延续、房产财富效应持续为负的背景下缺乏近期催化剂。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_banks":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"China bank stocks bottomed in mid-June 2021 with big-four A-share lenders at 0.4-0.5x price-to-book and dividend yields of 6-9%, even as SHCOMP ended the entire multi-year leg virtually flat (-0.2%), confirming this was a sector-specific value and income re-rating rather than index beta. The catalyst ignited immediately: PBOC signaled an RRR cut on July 8, 2021 (effective July 15, releasing approximately 1 trillion yuan in liquidity), reaffirming state-lender support precisely as the Three Red Lines policy strangled property developers and kept broad cyclicals depressed - consistent with the leg ctx showing both defensives (-11.2%) and cyclicals (-6.6%) in the red while banks massively outperformed. Over the following four years a sustained asset-famine dynamic drove the multi-phase re-rating: the 10-year CGB yield collapsed from roughly 3.1% in 2021 to a record low of 1.68% by end-2024, making bank dividend yields of 4-8% irresistible versus fixed income; the Shenwan banking index surged approximately 34% in 2024 alone, with Agricultural Bank of China hitting an all-time high and ICBC/CCB returning to 2018 peaks, supported by central government capital injections (RMB 500bn special treasury bonds announced 2025) and semi-annual dividend policy adopted by mega-lenders in mid-2024.","body_zh":"2021年6月中旬，国有大行A股跌至0.4-0.5倍市净率、股息率高达6-9%，而上证综指在整段行情内几乎原地踏步（-0.2%），印证此轮上涨为行业特有的价值/收益重估，而非指数贝塔驱动。导火索随即点燃：人民银行于2021年7月8日宣布全面降准50bp（7月15日生效，约释放1万亿元长期流动性），明确为国有银行兜底，而三道红线政策同期掐断地产融资，令周期板块持续承压——与该腿截面数据吻合（防御板块-11.2%、周期板块-6.6%，银行大幅跑赢）。此后四年，资产荒逻辑持续发酵：10年期国债收益率从2021年约3.1%跌至2024年底历史低点1.68%，使银行4-8%的股息率对固收类产品形成碾压；2024年申万银行指数涨幅约34%，农业银行创历史新高，工行/建行回升至2018年高位，并获财政部5000亿元特别国债注资及大行中期分红改革加持。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut July 2021 liquidity injection","Asset-famine CGB yield collapse to 1.68% floor","High-dividend yield spread over bond alternatives","Three Red Lines property deleveraging crushes cyclicals","State capital injection and semi-annual dividend reform"],"drivers_zh":["2021年7月人民银行全面降准释放流动性","国债收益率跌至1.68%历史低位形成资产荒","银行股息率大幅高于债券等替代资产","三道红线压制地产及周期板块","国家注资与大行中期分红制度改革"],"title":"Asset-Famine Dividend Re-Rating Cycle","title_zh":"资产荒驱动高股息重估周期"}},"now":"Banks are in a post-peak corrective phase (-7.0% in the current window, rs_rank 11/31), having topped in July 2025 after a multi-year 68.6% high-dividend re-rating cycle. The current tape is a risk-on, growth-led rally: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) dominate, growth beats value by 18.2pp, and cyclicals (+0.3%) barely outpace a near-flat SHCOMP (+1.6%) while defensives sink (-12.1%). In this AI/electronics liquidity surge the defensive asset-famine bid for bank dividends has faded - with bond yields still compressed but risk appetite rotating back into thematic growth plays. Banks are a relative laggard waiting for either a risk-off shock (which would restore dividend-safety flows) or a new earnings/capital-injection catalyst to re-engage value buyers.","now_zh":"银行板块处于峰后回调阶段（当前窗口跌7.0%，相对强度排名31只中第11），在经历2025年7月高点前长达68.6%的高股息重估行情之后目前承压。当前市场为风险偏好回升、成长主导的行情：电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）领涨，成长跑赢价值18.2个百分点，上证综指仅涨1.6%。在AI/科技主题流动性涌入的背景下，\"资产荒\"驱动的银行高股息防御逻辑暂时退潮；债券利率仍低，但市场风险偏好已向主题成长轮动。银行需等待风险偏好逆转（资金重返防御高股息）或新一轮盈利/注资催化剂方可重新吸引价值型买盘。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_battery":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"Beijing's September 2020 dual-carbon pledge (peak emissions before 2030, neutrality before 2060) and the NEV Development Plan 2021-2035 unleashed a massive re-rating of the lithium battery complex. China NEV sales doubled to 3.3 million units in 2021 (50% of global EV sales), driving battery-grade lithium carbonate from roughly 52,000 yuan/tonne at end-2020 to over 200,000 yuan/tonne by late 2021. CATL (300750.SZ) served as the market's primary beta proxy. Ctx confirms pure growth leadership: Power Equipment (+54.7%) and Metals (+42.0%) — the two Shenwan industries most directly tied to the NEV supply chain — topped the universe while defensives (Banks -12.4%) lagged badly in a broad cyclical/growth tape (SHCOMP +1.3%, cyclicals +8.8% vs defensives -3.6%, growth +9.3pp).","body_zh":"2020年9月北京提出\"双碳\"目标（2030年前碳达峰、2060年前碳中和），叠加《新能源汽车产业发展规划（2021-2035年）》，引发锂电产业链大幅重估。2021年中国新能源汽车销售翻番至330万辆，占全球EV销量50%，推动电池级碳酸锂价格从2020年底约5.2万元/吨飙升至2021年底逾20万元/吨。宁德时代（300750）是市场最大的贝塔代理。申万行业验证纯成长风格主导：电力设备（+54.7%）、有色金属（+42.0%）领涨，银行（-12.4%）等防御板块大幅落后，周期股跑赢防御股12.4pp，成长/价值利差+9.3pp。","drivers":["dual-carbon policy re-rating","NEV volume acceleration","lithium carbonate price supercycle","CATL supply-chain beta","growth/cyclical A-share rotation"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策重估","新能源车销量加速","碳酸锂超级周期","宁德时代供应链贝塔","成长/周期A股轮动"],"title":"Carbon Neutrality + Lithium Supercycle Rally","title_zh":"双碳政策+碳酸锂超级周期驱动暴涨"},"2021-11-29":{"body":"The November 2021 FOMC pivot toward faster taper, combined with the Fed's March 2022 first rate hike, crushed high-multiple growth stocks globally. In China, the property sector's credit crisis (Evergrande default fears from August 2021 onward) hammered risk sentiment, and zero-COVID lockdowns further depressed demand. Battery & Lithium, as the most expensive growth complex in A-shares, suffered disproportionately. Ctx confirms broad growth/value rotation into value: Coal (+6.7%) was the only gainer while Defense (-40.5%), Electronics (-40.5%) and Power Equipment (-43.9%) — the other growth pillars — fell as hard as batteries; SHCOMP dropped -19.0% and growth underperformed value by 17pp.","body_zh":"2021年11月美联储宣布加速缩减QE，2022年3月首次加息，全球高估值成长股遭遇戴维斯双杀。国内方面，恒大债务危机（2021年8月起）冲击风险偏好，\"清零\"防控政策持续压制需求。锂电作为A股估值最高的成长赛道首当其冲。申万数据验证成长→价值风格切换：煤炭（+6.7%）是唯一涨幅较大的板块，国防（-40.5%）、电子（-40.5%）、电力设备（-43.9%）与锂电同步重挫；上证指数下跌-19.0%，成长/价值利差-17pp。","drivers":["Fed taper/rate-hike shock","China property credit crisis","zero-COVID demand destruction","growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP broad selloff beta"],"drivers_zh":["美联储缩债/加息冲击","中国地产信用危机","清零政策摧毁需求","成长→价值风格切换","上证指数大跌贝塔"],"title":"Fed Hawkish Pivot Hits Growth; China Property Crisis","title_zh":"美联储鹰派转向叠加地产危机冲击成长股"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"Shanghai's citywide lockdown (late March to late May 2022) marked the panic trough for Chinese equities, with SHCOMP printing a five-year intraday low near 2,850 on April 26. The subsequent 78.3% surge (the sharpest leg in the bundle) was driven by three simultaneous catalysts: Beijing's May 2022 State Council 33-measure rescue package (including the NEV purchase tax exemption extension confirmed September 2022), Shanghai lockdown ending in late May, and market expectations of post-COVID reopening stimulus. Power Equipment (+60.1%) and Autos (+51.0%) led — both directly downstream of batteries — confirming this was NEV/new-energy-specific, not merely index beta (SHCOMP +16.6%, cyclicals +21.6% vs defensives +13.0%).","body_zh":"上海全城封控（2022年3月末至5月末）触发A股恐慌底部，上证指数4月26日盘中跌至五年低点附近约2,850点。随后板块大涨78.3%（本序列最急速的反弹腿），由三大催化剂共同驱动：国务院5月出台33条稳经济一揽子措施（含9月确认的新能源车购置税减免延续）、上海5月末解封、市场对后疫情刺激政策的强烈预期。电力设备（+60.1%）和汽车（+51.0%）领涨——均为电池直接下游——印证这是新能源专属行情而非单纯指数贝塔（上证+16.6%，周期股+21.6%对比防御+13.0%）。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown panic trough","State Council 33-measure stimulus","NEV purchase-tax extension expectations","post-COVID reopening repricing","power-equipment/auto downstream demand"],"drivers_zh":["上海封控恐慌底","国务院33条稳经济","新能源购置税减免预期","后疫情复苏重新定价","电力设备/汽车下游需求"],"title":"Shanghai Lockdown Bottom; Stimulus Rebound Surge","title_zh":"上海封控见底，政策刺激驱动反弹暴涨"},"2022-07-07":{"body":"This 19-month, 65.4% collapse was the deepest leg in the bundle and was driven by a structural reversal: lithium carbonate prices peaked above 597,000 yuan/tonne in November 2022 then cratered 90% to below 80,000 yuan/tonne by early 2024 as supply surged (the 2021-2022 capex boom flooded the market). China ended its NEV consumer purchase subsidies on December 31, 2022, removing a key demand prop. Battery cell makers' gross margins compressed from 20% to below 10%. Compounding this was the SHCOMP broad risk-off (-19.7%) with a pronounced flight-to-safety rotation (defensives -21.5% vs cyclicals -29.5%), indicating the battery selloff was heavily amplified by index beta. Power Equipment fell -56.3%, lagging even the broad market.","body_zh":"本轮长达19个月、跌幅65.4%的下跌是本序列最深的回调，根源在于结构性逆转：碳酸锂价格2022年11月触及59.75万元/吨历史高点后暴跌逾90%至2024年初不足8万元/吨，2021-2022年资本开支潮导致产能严重过剩。2022年12月31日新能源车国家购置补贴正式退出，撤除核心需求支撑。电池厂毛利率从20%压缩至10%以下。与此同时，上证指数宽幅下跌-19.7%，资金明显转向防御（防御-21.5%对比周期-29.5%），板块跌幅因指数贝塔大幅放大；电力设备下跌-56.3%，跑输大盘。","drivers":["lithium carbonate price 90% collapse","structural oversupply from 2021-22 capex boom","NEV subsidy termination Dec 2022","battery margin compression","SHCOMP risk-off broad market beta"],"drivers_zh":["碳酸锂价格暴跌逾90%","2021-22资本开支潮引发结构性产能过剩","新能源车补贴2022年底退出","电池厂利润率大幅压缩","上证大跌贝塔效应"],"title":"Lithium Oversupply Cycle & NEV Subsidy End Crush","title_zh":"碳酸锂供给过剩周期+补贴退出重创板块"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"On February 6, 2024, Chinese equities scored their biggest single-day gain in 14 months after Central Huijin (the PBOC-linked sovereign fund) announced it would broaden ETF purchases to stabilize the A-share market, which had fallen to a five-year intraday low near 2,635. Northbound inflow hit a record 12.6 billion yuan that day. The 34.4% recovery in Battery & Lithium tracked a broad risk-on bounce: cyclicals (+18.8%) outpaced defensives (+10.4%) with SHCOMP +12.8%, growth leading by 8pp. Metals (+41.3%) and Autos (+28.6%) co-led with batteries. The sector's lithium-price trough coincided — lithium carbonate had fallen from 600,000 to below 80,000 yuan/tonne, creating a valuation floor that the national-team catalyst ignited.","body_zh":"2024年2月6日，中央汇金宣布扩大增持ETF规模以稳定A股市场（上证盘中一度跌至2635点五年低位），A股当日录得逾14个月最大单日涨幅，北向资金净流入创历史记录的126亿元。锂电池板块在此轮反弹中涨幅达34.4%，与大盘风险偏好回升同步：周期股（+18.8%）跑赢防御（+10.4%），上证+12.8%，成长/价值利差+8pp。有色金属（+41.3%）和汽车（+28.6%）与锂电联袂领涨。碳酸锂价格此前已从60万元/吨跌至不足8万元/吨，超跌估值底与国家队入市催化剂共振，触发反弹。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF purchase announcement","SHCOMP five-year-low valuation floor","lithium price trough contrarian bid","cyclical/growth beta rebound","record northbound inflow"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金扩大增持ETF","上证五年低点估值底","碳酸锂价格超跌反弹","周期/成长贝塔修复","北向资金创纪录净流入"],"title":"National Team Intervention Lifts Growth Beta","title_zh":"国家队入市托底，成长贝塔反弹"},"2024-04-09":{"body":"After the Feb-Apr 2024 rebound ran its course, Battery & Lithium resumed its structural downtrend as the EV price war (BYD's aggressive discounting through 2024) compressed downstream margins further and battery-grade lithium carbonate remained depressed (averaging ~80,000 yuan/tonne). China's SHCOMP fell -6.4% in the window with a clear flight-to-safety tilt (defensives -6.8% vs cyclicals -14.4%), and Banks (+8.0%) — the primary defensive haven — were the sole positive sector, consistent with a risk-off, policy-uncertainty backdrop. Battery & Lithium fell -25.6%, in line with the cyclical laggard cohort and consistent with ongoing oversupply, not sector-specific news.","body_zh":"2024年2至4月的反弹力竭后，锂电板块重拾结构性下跌趋势。比亚迪在整个2024年持续激进降价，加剧下游利润率压缩；电池级碳酸锂均价维持在约8万元/吨低位。上证指数本阶段下跌-6.4%，防御/周期分化明显（防御-6.8%对比周期-14.4%），银行（+8.0%）是唯一正收益板块，体现典型的风险规避、政策预期不明情绪。锂电下跌-25.6%，与周期股落后梯队一致，主要反映产能过剩延续，并非板块个性负面因素。","drivers":["EV price war margin compression","sustained lithium carbonate oversupply","SHCOMP broad risk-off rotation","flight to banks/defensives","no incremental policy catalyst"],"drivers_zh":["电动车价格战压缩利润率","碳酸锂供给过剩持续","上证宽幅风险规避轮动","资金转向银行/防御","缺乏增量政策催化"],"title":"EV Price War, Oversupply Persist; Banks Sole Haven","title_zh":"电动车价格战持续+产能过剩，银行独善其身"},"2024-08-23":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a comprehensive stimulus package: 50bp RRR cut (releasing 1 trillion yuan of liquidity), a new CNY 500 billion swap facility allowing non-bank institutions to buy equities, and CNY 300 billion special relending for share buybacks. The Politburo's late-September meeting explicitly pledged to achieve the full-year 5% growth target, completing the 'bazooka' signal. CSI 300 logged its biggest single-day gain since July 2020; SHCOMP surged +21.6% in the window. Battery & Lithium (+62.6%) rode the broad cyclical/growth wave (cyclicals +28.3% vs defensives +14.9%, growth +26.1pp). Computers (+78.0%) and Brokers (+58.2%) led, confirming this was a broad liquidity event, not battery-specific.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子货币刺激政策：降准50bp（释放1万亿元长期流动性）、5000亿元互换便利（允许非银机构购买股票）、3000亿元专项再贷款支持回购增持。9月末政治局会议明确表态全力完成全年5%增长目标，\"大炮\"信号完整。沪深300录得2020年7月以来最大单日涨幅，上证本阶段涨+21.6%。锂电（+62.6%）随周期/成长整体大涨（周期+28.3%对比防御+14.9%，成长/价值利差+26.1pp）。计算机（+78.0%）和非银金融（+58.2%）领涨，印证这是全面流动性事件而非板块专属行情。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut + swap facility","Politburo full-year growth pledge","CNY 300bn share-buyback relending","broad liquidity-driven cyclical rebound","growth-style A-share beta surge"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准50bp+互换便利","政治局承诺完成全年增长目标","3000亿专项再贷款支持回购","流动性驱动周期股全面反弹","成长风格A股贝塔大涨"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka + Politburo Stimulus Shock Rally","title_zh":"央行\"大炮\"刺激+政治局表态引爆暴涨"},"2024-11-11":{"body":"Trump's November 5, 2024 election victory immediately raised the specter of 60%+ tariffs on Chinese goods, threatening China's EV/battery export pipeline. Concurrently, the October 8 NDRC press conference disappointed investors who expected detailed fiscal stimulus follow-through, triggering profit-taking in the post-September rally. SHCOMP fell -9.4% in the period with a clear flight-to-safety rotation: Banks (+6.2%) were the sole gainer while Brokers (-22.7%), Power Equipment (-23.6%), and Real Estate (-24.8%) led the decline. Battery & Lithium fell -25.6%, tracking the growth/cyclical selloff (cyclicals -13.0% vs defensives -5.1%), as the sector faced the double headwind of tariff risk and still-depressed lithium carbonate prices.","body_zh":"2024年11月5日特朗普胜选，市场立即担忧60%以上关税冲击中国新能源车及电池出口产业链。与此同时，10月8日发改委发布会令市场对财政刺激细节的预期大幅落空，推动9月行情后的获利了结。上证指数本阶段下跌-9.4%，风险规避特征明显：银行（+6.2%）是唯一正收益板块，非银（-22.7%）、电力设备（-23.6%）、房地产（-24.8%）领跌。锂电下跌-25.6%，与周期/成长普跌一致（周期-13.0%对比防御-5.1%），叠加关税风险和碳酸锂价格持续低迷双重压力。","drivers":["Trump election tariff threat (60%+ on Chinese goods)","NDRC fiscal stimulus disappointment","post-bazooka rally profit-taking","flight-to-banks defensive rotation","EV export pipeline uncertainty"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普胜选关税威胁（60%+）","发改委财政刺激落空","九月大涨后获利了结","资金转向银行防御性轮动","新能源车出口前景不确定"],"title":"Trump Tariff Shock + Stimulus Fatigue Selloff","title_zh":"特朗普关税冲击+刺激疲劳引发回调"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"April 8, 2025 marked the nadir of the US-China trade war escalation: Trump's 125% reciprocal tariff on Chinese goods (announced April 8-9) crashed global markets, with the S&P 500 losing 10.5% in two days. For Chinese equities, this created the final capitulation trough. The subsequent 141.8% surge — the most powerful leg in the bundle — was driven by: (1) the May 13-14, 2025 Geneva trade truce (US tariffs cut to 30%, China to 10% for 90 days), unlocking export demand; (2) SHCOMP's 32.3% broad index surge as cyclicals dominated (+46.3% vs defensives +6.2%, growth +44.6pp); (3) solid-state battery momentum (CATL delivered first automotive-grade all-solid-state samples in June 2025, with 500 Wh/kg density); (4) energy storage boom (BESS installations >150 GWh in 2025); (5) oil-price shock boosting EV substitution appeal; and (6) lithium carbonate recovery toward 200,000 yuan/tonne by May 2026, restoring upstream margins. Telecoms (+186.5%) and Metals (+126.9%) co-led with batteries in the broadest cyclical/growth rally in the bundle's history.","body_zh":"2025年4月8日是美中贸易战升级的最低谷：特朗普宣布对华125%对等关税，全球市场两日暴跌，标普500指数两日跌幅逾10.5%，中国A股形成最终恐慌性见底。随后141.8%的史诗级反弹——本序列最强劲的一段——由多重催化剂共同驱动：(1) 2025年5月13-14日日内瓦贸易停火（美国对华关税降至30%、中国对美降至10%，90天暂停期），出口需求解锁；(2) 上证指数大涨32.3%，周期股全面主导（+46.3%对比防御+6.2%，成长/价值利差+44.6pp）；(3) 固态电池突破（宁德时代2025年6月交付首批车规级全固态电池样品，能量密度500 Wh/kg）；(4) 储能大爆发（2025年BESS装机突破150GWh）；(5) 油价冲击提振电动车替代需求；(6) 碳酸锂价格回升至2026年5月约20万元/吨，上游利润率修复。通信（+186.5%）和有色金属（+126.9%）与锂电共同领涨，成为本序列历史上最强的周期/成长共振行情。","drivers":["US-China tariff shock trough + Geneva truce","SHCOMP broad growth/cyclical surge","solid-state battery commercialization catalyst","energy storage boom 150GWh+","lithium carbonate price recovery to 200k yuan"],"drivers_zh":["美中关税冲击见底+日内瓦停火","上证成长/周期全面爆发","固态电池商业化催化","储能大爆发150GWh+","碳酸锂价格回升至20万元/吨"],"title":"Tariff Panic Bottom; Trade Truce + AI Fuels Mega-Rally","title_zh":"关税恐慌见底；贸易停火+AI赋能引爆史诗级反弹"},"2026-05-06":{"body":"After the massive 141.8% rally peaked in early May 2026, Battery & Lithium fell 24.0% by June 8. Lithium carbonate futures tumbled ~30% from the CNY 200,500/tonne two-and-a-half-year high as Guangzhou Futures Exchange inventories rose to ~56,000 tonnes, Australian mine restarts signaled, and Zimbabwe partially relaxed lithium export restrictions. China NEV monthly sales fell 7.5% year-on-year in May 2026. The sodium-battery competition threat resurfaced, unnerving investors on long-term lithium demand. Ctx confirms a mixed but modestly risk-off rotation: Telecoms (+18.7%) and Electronics (+7.6%) held gains while Metals (-16.6%) and Conglom (-18.4%) — two co-leaders of the prior bull leg — led the reversal, as the growth/value spread stayed slightly positive (+2.9pp), indicating selective profit-taking rather than a full risk-off flush.","body_zh":"2026年5月初大涨141.8%见顶后，锂电池板块至6月8日回调24.0%。碳酸锂期货自约20万元/吨（两年半高点）暴跌约30%，广期所库存攀升至约5.6万吨，澳大利亚矿山重启信号出现，津巴布韦部分放开锂矿出口管制。2026年5月中国新能源车月销量同比下滑7.5%。钠离子电池替代威胁重燃，市场对长期锂需求的担忧升温。申万数据显示轮动有限但偏防御：通信（+18.7%）和电子（+7.6%）保持涨势，而有色金属（-16.6%）和综合（-18.4%）——上一轮牛腿双主角——率先回调；成长/价值利差仍略为正值（+2.9pp），表明这是选择性获利了结而非全面风险规避。","drivers":["lithium carbonate 30% price pullback from peak","rising exchange inventories + mine restarts","China NEV monthly sales decline","sodium-battery substitution risk","selective profit-taking in former bull-leg leaders"],"drivers_zh":["碳酸锂价格自峰值回落30%","期货库存攀升+矿山复产","中国新能源车月销同比下滑","钠离子电池替代风险","前轮牛腿主角选择性获利了结"],"title":"Post-Peak Pullback: Inventory Surge & Sodium Threat","title_zh":"见顶回调：库存积压+钠离子电池威胁"}},"now":"Battery & Lithium is in a confirmed trough/bottoming phase (position 25.6 out of 100, below 200-day MA, rs_rank 12/31 — deep in the laggard quadrant). The now_ctx shows it posted -3.8% in the current window while SHCOMP rose +1.6%, meaning it is severely under-participating in the current growth-led, risk-on tape. Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) are absorbing liquidity while Battery & Lithium lags — consistent with AI/semiconductor themes pulling capital away from the EV supply chain complex. Cyclicals broadly lead defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%) with an 18.2pp growth-over-value tilt, signaling this is a theme-driven liquidity rally rather than a battery-specific re-rating. Lithium carbonate prices pulled back ~15% from their May 2026 peak (CNY ~200,500/tonne) amid rising Guangzhou Futures Exchange inventories, early mine-restart signals from Australia, and sodium-battery competition anxiety, keeping Battery & Lithium in digestion mode after the massive April 2025-May 2026 bull leg.","now_zh":"锂电池板块目前处于经确认的底部磨底阶段（位置25.6/100，低于200日均线，强度排名12/31，深陷弱势区间）。当前窗口板块录得-3.8%，而上证指数上涨+1.6%，说明锂电在成长股主导的风险偏好行情中严重跑输。电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%）是主线，成长/价值利差达18.2pp，体现的是人工智能/半导体主题驱动的流动性行情，而非锂电板块的基本面重估。碳酸锂价格自2026年5月峰值（约20万元/吨）回落约15%，广期所库存攀升、澳矿复产信号及钠离子电池替代威胁压制近期情绪，板块在2025年4月至2026年5月大牛腿后进入消化整固阶段。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_brokers":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-June 2021, Beijing's infrastructure-heavy stimulus sustained elevated industrial commodity prices — iron ore exceeded $220/t in May 2021 and domestic steel production policy tightened supply-side, lifting Metals +62.5% and Steel +53.5% in Shenwan across the window. The SHCOMP rose +5.6% on a broad cyclical-value rotation (cyclicals +21.5% vs defensives -3.9%, growth lagged value by 9.7pp), and Brokers (+24.4%) participated as high-beta financials riding A-share turnover expansion rather than through any sector-specific catalyst. Elevated margin balances from the 2020-21 cycle sustained brokerage commission and financing revenues, anchoring earnings leverage to the broader market rally.","body_zh":"2021年6月中旬起，北京以基建为核心的刺激政策持续推高大宗商品——铁矿石5月突破220美元/吨，国内钢铁限产政策收紧供给，申万有色+62.5%、钢铁+53.5%。上证综指上涨5.6%，呈现宽基周期价值行情（周期+21.5% vs 防御-3.9%，价值跑赢成长9.7pp）。券商（+24.4%）作为A股成交量扩张环境下的高贝塔金融股受益，并无板块特定催化剂。2020-21周期遗留的高融资余额持续为券商佣金及利息收入提供杠杆支撑。","drivers":["commodity supercycle","A-share turnover expansion","cyclical-value rotation","margin balance leverage","infrastructure stimulus"],"drivers_zh":["大宗商品超级周期","A股成交量扩张","周期价值轮动","融资余额杠杆","基建刺激"],"title":"Commodity Supercycle Beta Lifts Brokers","title_zh":"大宗商品超级周期贝塔带动券商上涨"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"The Evergrande Group missed onshore coupon payments in September 2021, crystallising fears of a $300bn systemic default that cascaded through property and financials. Simultaneously, Beijing's rolling regulatory crackdowns on tech, education and gaming sectors (July-September 2021) wiped trillions in market cap and triggered sustained foreign outflows; the MSCI China Index fell 54% from its Feb-2021 peak to its Mar-2022 trough. By late 2021 the Fed pivoted hawkish — announcing November 2021 taper and projecting rate hikes — tightening global dollar liquidity that further pressured Chinese risk assets. Defensive Coal +17.0% and Agriculture +0.9% led while high-beta Metals -37.3%, Steel -42.7%, and Brokers -34.5% bore the brunt of the SHCOMP's -19.9% drawdown, a textbook flight-to-safety rotation.","body_zh":"2021年9月恒大集团境内债券违约，逾3000亿美元债务风险引发系统性恐慌，并向地产及金融板块蔓延。同期，北京对互联网、教育及游戏行业的连环监管整顿（2021年7-9月）令市值蒸发数万亿，外资持续流出；MSCI中国指数自2021年2月高点至2022年3月低点累计跌幅达54%。2021年11月美联储宣布Taper并前瞻加息，全球美元流动性收紧进一步压制中国风险资产。防御型煤炭+17%领涨，高贝塔有色-37.3%、钢铁-42.7%与券商-34.5%领跌，上证综指-19.9%，典型避险轮动格局。","drivers":["Evergrande default risk","regulatory crackdown (tech/edu/gaming)","Fed taper/rate hike pivot","foreign capital outflow","risk-off flight-to-safety"],"drivers_zh":["恒大违约风险","监管整顿（科技/教育/游戏）","美联储Taper/加息转向","外资流出","避险轮动"],"title":"Evergrande Crisis and Regulatory Crackdown Bear","title_zh":"恒大危机与监管整顿引发熊市"},"2022-04-28":{"body":"On April 29, 2022, the Politburo issued an unusually forceful midday statement pledging to defend the 5.5% GDP growth target and accelerate infrastructure investment — a direct policy floor signal that broke the bear trend. The PBOC had cut the RRR by 25bp on April 19, injecting long-term liquidity. Shanghai's two-month citywide COVID lockdown began lifting in late May, with full reopening by June 1, releasing pent-up economic demand. The resulting SHCOMP rally of +11.1% was led by cyclicals (+15.5% vs defensives +5.8%), with Autos +38.4% and Power Equipment +27.3% front-running recovery; Brokers +23.1% tracked the high-beta cyclical recovery as turnover expectations rebounded.","body_zh":"2022年4月29日，中央政治局罕见在午间发表措辞强硬的声明，承诺捍卫5.5%经济增速目标并加快基建投资，向市场传递明确政策底信号，打断熊市趋势。此前PBOC已于4月19日降准25个基点，注入长期流动性。上海长达两个月的全面封控在5月下旬开始解除，6月1日全面复工复产，释放压抑已久的经济需求。上证综指反弹11.1%，周期股领涨（+15.5% vs 防御+5.8%），汽车+38.4%、电力设备+27.3%率先收复失地；券商+23.1%跟随高贝塔周期修复，受益于成交量预期回升。","drivers":["Politburo growth floor signal","PBOC RRR cut 25bp","Shanghai lockdown lifting","cyclical recovery beta","infrastructure stimulus acceleration"],"drivers_zh":["政治局政策底表态","央行降准25bp","上海解封","周期修复贝塔","基建投资提速"],"title":"Politburo Emergency Pledge Sparks Rebound","title_zh":"政治局紧急表态引发反弹"},"2022-06-15":{"body":"The Fed delivered back-to-back 75bp rate hikes in June and July 2022 — the most aggressive tightening since 1994 — driving the DXY dollar index above 109 and tightening global dollar liquidity. China's recovery momentum stalled as COVID continued episodically and property developer stress persisted. The Shenwan board saw Conglomerates +0.4% and Agriculture -2.0% outperform in a defensive holding pattern while Brokers -18.7% were explicitly among the worst laggards alongside Autos -17.0% and Building Materials -19.8%, with SHCOMP falling -10.0%. The selloff was a direct reflection of Brokers' high beta to market activity: falling turnover and declining margin balances compressed fee and interest revenues.","body_zh":"美联储2022年6月和7月连续加息75个基点，为1994年以来最激进紧缩，美元指数DXY突破109，全球美元流动性骤然收紧。中国经济复苏势头停滞，零星疫情反复叠加地产开发商压力持续。申万行业中综合+0.4%、农林牧渔-2.0%相对抗跌，而券商-18.7%明确位列跌幅最深板块，汽车-17.0%、建材-19.8%同步领跌，上证综指-10.0%。此轮下跌直接体现了券商对市场活跃度的高贝塔敏感性——成交量萎缩与融资余额下降同步压缩手续费及利息收入。","drivers":["Fed 75bp rate hikes","DXY dollar surge","China growth stall","A-share turnover contraction","property developer stress"],"drivers_zh":["美联储75bp加息","美元指数飙升","中国经济动能停滞","A股成交量萎缩","地产开发商压力持续"],"title":"Fed 75bp Shock Hammers High-Beta Financials","title_zh":"美联储激进加息重压高贝塔金融股"},"2022-10-10":{"body":"The October 2022 trough coincided with the nadir of Xi Jinping's 20th Party Congress market shock (Oct 24 saw the Hang Seng fall 6.4% in a single day, its worst drop since 2008) — but that shock created the base. From early November, unverified social-media posts about a zero-COVID exit committee sparked a SHCOMP +5% week; on December 7, 2022, Beijing officially dismantled most zero-COVID rules, and markets re-rated the full reopening trade. Into 2023, the AI/technology narrative (ChatGPT launched Nov 2022) powered a growth-led rotation: Media +52.9%, Computers +45.5%, Telecoms +42.9% in Shenwan; growth led value by 19.3pp. Brokers +35.2% rode both the macro re-rating and the turnover surge as retail investors flooded back into A-shares through 2023, with daily turnover at times exceeding RMB 1tn.","body_zh":"2022年10月的低点与习近平二十大带来的市场冲击最低点重合（10月24日港股恒生指数单日跌6.4%，创2008年以来最大单日跌幅），但这一冲击恰恰奠定了底部基础。11月初，动态清零退出委员会的未经证实传言推动上证综指单周上涨5%；2022年12月7日，北京正式废除绝大多数清零规定，市场重新定价全面复苏预期。进入2023年，AI与科技叙事（ChatGPT于2022年11月上线）推动成长轮动：申万传媒+52.9%、计算机+45.5%、通信+42.9%，成长跑赢价值19.3pp。券商+35.2%同时受益于宏观重估与成交量激增，散户大举回流A股，日均成交量一度突破人民币1万亿元。","drivers":["zero-COVID policy exit (Dec 7 2022)","AI/tech narrative (ChatGPT)","retail turnover surge","macro re-rating post-Xi shock trough","growth-style rotation"],"drivers_zh":["动态清零政策退出（2022年12月7日）","AI科技叙事（ChatGPT）","散户成交量激增","二十大冲击后宏观重估","成长风格轮动"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit Bets Fuel 10-Month Rally","title_zh":"动态清零退出预期驱动十个月牛市"},"2023-08-10":{"body":"In August 2023, Country Garden — China's largest private developer — warned of a RMB45-55bn first-half loss, while Evergrande stock plunged 79% when it relisted in Hong Kong after a 17-month suspension. Chinese CPI turned negative in July 2023, entering a deflationary spiral that crushed earnings expectations. The yuan weakened sharply (USD/CNY broke 7.30 in August 2023), prompting China to sell US securities; foreign investors pulled capital from A-shares at record pace. Defensive Coal +22.9%, Banks +7.8%, Utilities +7.5% led (value outperformed growth by 12.5pp), while Computers -38.0% and Real Estate -39.7% — the previous cycle's leaders — collapsed. Brokers -27.8% tracked the selloff as A-share daily turnover slumped and IPO/M&A pipelines froze amid the property crisis.","body_zh":"2023年8月，碧桂园——中国最大民营房企——预警上半年净亏损450-550亿元人民币；恒大停牌逾17个月后复牌，股价单日暴跌79%。2023年7月国内CPI转负，进入通缩螺旋，重创企业盈利预期。人民币大幅贬值（美元/人民币8月突破7.30），中国抛售美元资产救市，外资以创纪录速度撤离A股。防御型煤炭+22.9%、银行+7.8%、公用事业+7.5%领涨（价值跑赢成长12.5pp），而上一轮领涨的计算机-38.0%与地产-39.7%大幅下挫。券商-27.8%伴随A股日均成交萎缩、IPO/并购管道因地产危机而冻结而同步下行。","drivers":["Country Garden default (Aug 2023)","China CPI deflation","yuan depreciation (USD/CNY 7.30+)","foreign capital outflow","IPO/M&A pipeline freeze"],"drivers_zh":["碧桂园违约（2023年8月）","中国CPI通缩","人民币贬值（美元/人民币7.30+）","外资流出","IPO/并购管道冻结"],"title":"Property Collapse and Deflation Trap Grind Brokers","title_zh":"房地产崩塌与通缩陷阱拖累券商"},"2024-07-08":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a sweeping easing package: the 7-day reverse repo rate cut 20bp to 1.50%, the RRR cut 50bp (releasing ~RMB1tn liquidity), existing mortgage rates cut 50bp, second-home downpayment ratio cut to 15%, and a CNY500bn equity swap facility allowing non-bank financial institutions to directly buy A-shares — an unprecedented direct market support mechanism. The CSI 300 surged 16% in a single week, its best weekly gain since 2008. Brokers were the explicit leader in Shenwan at +71.2% for the full leg (Jul-Nov 2024), turbocharged by the direct implication: the swap facility would route through securities firms, and an equity market surge would expand turnover, margin balances, underwriting, and proprietary gains simultaneously. SHCOMP +18.8% confirmed it was a broad market surge, not a sector rotation.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，中国人民银行行长潘功胜发布一揽子宽松政策：7天逆回购利率下调20bp至1.50%，降准50bp（释放流动性约1万亿元人民币），存量房贷利率下调50bp，二套房首付比例降至15%，并推出规模达5000亿元人民币的证券、基金、保险公司互换便利（SFISF），允许非银机构直接入市买股。沪深300单周大涨16%，创2008年以来最大周涨幅。申万券商明确领涨，整个腿（2024年7月至11月）涨幅达71.2%，原因在于互换便利通过证券公司落地，股市急涨同步拉动成交量、融资余额、承销收入及自营盘盈利四重引擎。上证综指+18.8%印证这是宽基行情而非板块轮动。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24 2024 bazooka (RRR -50bp, 7-day rate -20bp)","CNY500bn equity swap facility (SFISF)","mortgage rate cuts / property support","A-share turnover explosion","broker earnings leverage to all revenue lines"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日一揽子宽松（降准50bp，7天逆回购-20bp）","5000亿证券基金保险互换便利（SFISF）","存量房贷降息/地产救市","A股成交量爆发","券商四重收入引擎同步放大"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka Ignites Historic 73% Broker Surge","title_zh":"央行大规模刺激点燃历史性73%券商行情"},"2024-11-07":{"body":"Donald Trump's US presidential election victory on November 5, 2024, immediately repriced China trade-war risk. Markets began pricing aggressive tariff escalation — ultimately US tariffs on Chinese goods would reach 145% — triggering a global risk-off rotation with specific China beta compression. The Shenwan board showed Banks +1.6% the only sector with a positive return while Brokers -26.0% were explicitly among the worst laggards alongside Real Estate -29.6%, and SHCOMP fell -10.8%. Defensives outperformed cyclicals by 6.5pp — a clear flight-to-safety structure. Brokers bear disproportionate downside in this environment as both the volume and risk appetite channels compress simultaneously: foreign investors cut A-share exposure and domestic retail investors reduce leverage.","body_zh":"2024年11月5日特朗普赢得美国总统大选，中美贸易战风险即刻重新定价。市场开始消化激进关税升级预期——美国对华关税最终将升至145%——引发全球风险规避，中国贝塔资产遭受集中压缩。申万行业中仅银行+1.6%录得正收益，券商-26.0%明确位列跌幅最深板块，与房地产-29.6%并列领跌；上证综指-10.8%。防御股跑赢周期股6.5pp，呈现典型避险结构。券商在此环境下遭受不对称下跌：成交量与风险偏好渠道同步收缩，外资削减A股敞口，国内散户同步去杠杆。","drivers":["Trump election victory (Nov 5 2024)","tariff escalation pricing (up to 145%)","A-share foreign investor outflow","risk-off volume contraction","broker high-beta compression"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2024年11月5日胜选","关税升级定价（最高145%）","外资撤离A股","风险规避成交量萎缩","券商高贝塔压缩"],"title":"Trump Election Triggers Tariff Fear Selloff","title_zh":"特朗普胜选引发关税恐慌抛售"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"April 7, 2025 marked the local trough following the \"Liberation Day\" tariff shock (announced April 2), when global markets crashed — Hong Kong's Hang Seng fell 13.2% in a single session, its worst one-day drop since 1997. The recovery leg was driven by sequential de-escalation: on April 9 the US paused implementation of the steepest tariffs, and on May 12 a 90-day US-China tariff truce was agreed in Geneva reducing effective rates from 145% to around 30%. A London framework agreement in June further stabilised sentiment. The SHCOMP surged +25.4% on this leg — an index surge — with growth leading value by 21.9pp (Telecoms +76.6%, Conglomerates +54.4%, Electronics +48.2%). Brokers +39.6% reflected the turnover and risk-appetite recovery, though they underperformed the growth tech leaders, consistent with a theme-driven (not financial-beta) tape.","body_zh":"2025年4月7日为本轮的阶段性低点，前因是4月2日\"解放日\"关税冲击——全球市场崩跌，港股恒生指数单日暴跌13.2%，创1997年以来最大单日跌幅。反弹行情由一系列降级动作驱动：4月9日美方暂停实施最严厉关税；5月12日中美在日内瓦达成90天关税停火协议，实际税率从145%降至约30%；6月伦敦框架协议进一步稳定市场情绪。上证综指本腿大涨25.4%（指数级上涨），成长跑赢价值21.9pp（通信+76.6%、综合+54.4%、电子+48.2%）。券商+39.6%反映成交量与风险偏好回升，但跑输成长科技领头羊，与主题驱动（非金融贝塔）行情的特征相符。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce Geneva (May 12 2025)","Liberation Day tariff pause (Apr 9)","risk-appetite recovery","A-share turnover rebound","growth-tech narrative re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["中美日内瓦关税停火（2025年5月12日）","解放日关税暂停（4月9日）","风险偏好回升","A股成交量反弹","成长科技叙事重估"],"title":"Tariff Trough to Geneva Truce Powers Recovery","title_zh":"关税低点至日内瓦停火推动修复行情"},"2025-08-25":{"body":"From late August 2025, despite the SHCOMP being nearly flat (+0.2%), a sharp sector rotation into hard-asset and commodity plays compressed Brokers -19.7% and Computers -17.8% while Metals +39.3%, Telecoms +34.6% and Oil & Gas +30.6% led by wide margins. Cyclicals beat defensives by 16.7pp but the style was commodity/infrastructure rather than financial-beta, consistent with renewed trade-war supply-chain rerouting themes and commodity scarcity concerns from US-China export restrictions. October 2025 saw Trump threaten a further 100% tariff on all Chinese goods, wiping $2tn from global markets in a single day, which reinforced the de-rating of high-beta financial plays (brokers, property) in favour of real-asset and telecom/state-enterprise themes that are perceived as more insulated from trade-war escalation.","body_zh":"2025年8月下旬起，尽管上证综指几近平盘（+0.2%），市场却发生剧烈板块轮动：有色+39.3%、通信+34.6%、石油石化+30.6%大幅领涨，而券商-19.7%、计算机-17.8%明确落后。周期跑赢防御16.7pp，但主线是大宗商品/基础设施，而非金融贝塔，与贸易战供应链重构主题及中美出口管制引发的资源稀缺担忧相符。2025年10月特朗普威胁对所有中国商品加征100%关税，单日蒸发全球2万亿美元市值，进一步强化高贝塔金融股（券商、地产）的杀估值逻辑，转而青睐被视为更具抗贸易战韧性的实物资产及通信/央企主题。","drivers":["commodity/hard-asset sector rotation","Trump Oct-2025 100% tariff threat","trade-war supply-chain rerouting","broker/financial high-beta de-rating","SHCOMP flat with zero index support"],"drivers_zh":["商品/实物资产板块轮动","特朗普2025年10月100%关税威胁","贸易战供应链重构","券商/金融高贝塔杀估值","上证综指平盘缺乏指数支撑"],"title":"Commodity Rotation Leaves Brokers Stranded","title_zh":"商品价值轮动令券商相对落后"}},"now":"Brokers & Securities are in a Recovery phase (cycle position 22.5, rs_rank 6 of 31), sitting below the 200-day moving average with a BUY signal active but posting a -7.9% return in the current measurement window. The live tape is growth-led and risk-on — Electronics +75.5% and Telecoms +67.7% top the Shenwan board while SHCOMP is up just +1.6%, signalling a narrow theme-driven rally rather than a broad financial-beta surge. Growth outpaces value by 18.2pp, which historically rewards Computers and Electronics over Brokers; the sector is still in early recovery after the Aug-2025 to Apr-2026 selloff that accompanied a commodity-and-value rotation. A re-expansion of A-share daily turnover and margin financing balances would be the ignition catalyst for the next broker up-leg.","now_zh":"券商板块处于修复阶段（周期位置22.5，相对强弱排名31只中第6），仍位于200日均线下方，技术面发出买入信号，但当前窗口回报为-7.9%。当前市场为成长主导的风险偏好行情——申万电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%领涨，而上证综指仅+1.6%，反映窄基主题行情而非宽基金融贝塔上涨。成长跑赢价值18.2个百分点，历史上此类格局利好计算机与电子而非券商。板块在2025年8月至2026年4月下行（伴随商品/价值轮动）后处于早期修复区；若A股日均成交量及两融余额重新扩张，将是下一轮券商行情的引擎。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_coal":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"China's post-COVID industrial rebound drove coal demand up roughly 11% in H1 2021, overwhelming domestic supply just as mining safety inspections curbed output. By late August, thermal coal inventories at China's top-six coastal power generators fell to a record low of 11.31 million tonnes -- sufficient for only 15 days. Thermal coal futures on the Zhengzhou Commodity Exchange surged from under 700 yuan/tonne in June toward 2,000 yuan/tonne by mid-September, making coal (+68.6%) the top Shenwan performer. The ctx confirms a pure cyclical-value tape: Metals (+62.5%) and Steel (+53.5%) co-led while defensives lagged by 25pp, and value beat growth by 9.7pp.","body_zh":"疫情后工业复苏推动2021年上半年煤炭需求同比增长约11%，而安全巡查导致煤矿产量受限，供需矛盾激化。8月底，全国前六大沿海发电集团电煤库存降至创纪录低位1131万吨，仅够使用15天。郑商所动力煤期货从6月不足700元/吨飙升至9月中旬近2000元/吨，煤炭（+68.6%）成为申万行业涨幅榜首。截面数据确认为纯粹的周期价值行情：有色（+62.5%）与钢铁（+53.5%）同步领涨，防御板块落后约25个百分点，价值风格跑赢成长风格9.7pp。","drivers":["power supply crunch","post-COVID demand surge","mining output curtailments","cyclical-value rotation","thermal coal price spike"],"drivers_zh":["电力供应短缺","疫后需求激增","煤矿产能受限","周期价值轮动","动力煤价格飙升"],"title":"Power crisis fuels coal supply panic rally","title_zh":"电力危机引爆煤炭供应恐慌性上涨"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"On October 19, 2021, the NDRC summoned major coal producers and threatened direct price intervention under the Price Law; thermal coal futures immediately fell the maximum permitted 11% that day, ultimately collapsing 47.8% from the October 19 record high of 1,892 yuan/tonne to around 1,033 yuan/tonne. The stock-level selloff preceded the full futures crash (peak was September 13 in equities) as the market priced in regulatory risk once the NDRC signaled winter supply campaigns. The Shenwan ctx confirms a flight-to-safety/risk-off backdrop: defensives were flat (-0.0%) while cyclicals fell -12.4%, and Agriculture (+14.3%) and Food & Bev (+9.6%) led -- classic flight-to-quality rotation with SHCOMP down -5.2%. Coal equities fell -35.3%.","body_zh":"2021年10月19日，国家发展改革委约谈主要煤炭企业并威胁依据《价格法》直接干预，动力煤期货当日即触及跌停，最终从19日高点1892元/吨暴跌47.8%至约1033元/吨。权益层面的见顶（9月13日）早于期货完整崩溃，市场提前定价监管风险。截面数据确认避险/风险规避背景：防御板块持平（-0.0%），周期板块跌幅-12.4%，农业（+14.3%）与食品饮料（+9.6%）领涨——上证综指下跌5.2%背景下的典型防御转换，煤炭股跌幅-35.3%。","drivers":["NDRC price cap intervention","coal futures crash","risk-off rotation","regulatory policy shock","defensive rotation"],"drivers_zh":["发改委价格干预","煤炭期货崩溃","避险轮动","监管政策冲击","防御转换"],"title":"NDRC price cap kills coal futures rally","title_zh":"发改委价格干预击溃煤炭期货涨势"},"2021-11-16":{"body":"Russia's invasion of Ukraine on February 24, 2022, triggered a historic energy shock: Newcastle thermal coal surpassed USD 400/tonne in March 2022 and hit an all-time high of ~USD 443/tonne in September 2022, while European ARA coal breached USD 408/tonne in June 2022. China domestic prices reset higher alongside global benchmarks, and energy security concerns prompted Beijing to greenlight 33GW of new coal-fired capacity in 2021-2022. Crucially, this was an idiosyncratic coal rally in a falling market: SHCOMP dropped -11.7% over the leg while growth stocks (Electronics, Pharma, Computers) crashed -30% as the tech regulatory crackdown and zero-COVID lockdowns crushed sentiment. Coal was the ONLY Shenwan industry with a meaningfully positive return (+37.3% rank #1), confirming this was pure commodity-driven divergence, not a broad cyclical rally.","body_zh":"2022年2月24日俄罗斯入侵乌克兰引发历史性能源冲击：纽卡斯尔动力煤2022年3月突破400美元/吨，9月创下约443美元/吨历史高位，欧洲ARA港口煤价同年6月突破408美元/吨。中国国内煤价随全球基准同步抬升，能源安全顾虑促使北京批准2021-2022年超过33GW的新煤电装机。关键在于，这是一场在市场下跌背景下的独立行情：上证综指该阶段下跌-11.7%，科技成长股（电子、医药、计算机）在监管打压与清零政策双重压制下暴跌逾30%。煤炭是申万行业中唯一录得明显正收益（+37.3%，排名第1）的板块，确认这是纯粹的商品价格驱动的背离行情，而非广谱周期上涨。","drivers":["Ukraine war energy shock","global thermal coal record prices","China energy security policy","tech/growth selloff divergence","value-over-growth extreme"],"drivers_zh":["乌克兰战争能源冲击","全球动力煤价格创历史新高","中国能源安全政策","科技/成长股崩溃形成背离","价值相对成长极端溢价"],"title":"Ukraine war drives global coal to record highs","title_zh":"乌克兰战争推动全球煤价创历史新高"},"2022-09-22":{"body":"Global coal prices peaked in September 2022 (Newcastle at ~USD 443/tonne) and then collapsed through 2023 as the European energy crisis resolved and LNG supply normalized. Simultaneously, the A-share tape executed a dramatic growth/tech rotation: ChatGPT launched November 30, 2022, unleashing a wave of AI-theme speculation that drove Computers (+40.3%), Telecoms (+43.3%), and Media (+53.7%) to massive gains through mid-2023. Coal fell -30.1% (laggard #3) as falling commodity prices, moderate SHCOMP (+1.3%), and the 27pp growth-over-value style gap (the biggest in the dataset) structurally de-rated the sector. The shift from commodity scarcity to AI abundance was the dominant cross-asset narrative.","body_zh":"全球煤价于2022年9月见顶（纽卡斯尔约443美元/吨），随后随欧洲能源危机缓解及LNG供给正常化而持续下跌。与此同时，A股市场上演剧烈的成长/科技轮动：2022年11月30日ChatGPT发布，掀起AI主题炒作浪潮，推动计算机（+40.3%）、传媒（+53.7%）、通信（+43.3%）大幅上涨至2023年中。煤炭下跌-30.1%（排名倒数第3），商品价格下跌、上证综指温和上涨（+1.3%）以及27pp的成长相对价值溢价（数据集中最高）共同导致板块估值收缩。从商品稀缺叙事切换至AI充裕叙事，是这一阶段最主要的跨资产主线。","drivers":["global coal price reversal","ChatGPT/AI theme rotation","European energy crisis normalization","growth-over-value style regime","commodity deflation"],"drivers_zh":["全球煤价见顶回落","ChatGPT/AI主题轮动","欧洲能源危机缓和","成长相对价值风格占优","大宗商品通缩"],"title":"Global coal glut meets AI/tech rotation away","title_zh":"全球煤炭供应过剩叠加AI/科技轮动撤资"},"2023-06-26":{"body":"With growth stocks deflated after the ChatGPT frenzy faded, A-share capital rotated into high-dividend SOE value stocks in H2 2023, driven by the State Council and CSRC's push for listed SOEs to raise payout ratios -- SOE dividends hit CNY 1,237 billion in 2023, about 67% above 2019 levels. Coal firms (China Shenhua, Yanzhou, China Coal Energy) offered dividend yields of 6-10%, making them the top beneficiary; Coal was Shenwan #1 at +37.7% over the leg. Banks (+15%) and Oil & Gas (+12.6%) co-led in a pure value-SOE tape while growth/tech (Computers -33.2%, Media -29.3%) was aggressively sold. SHCOMP fell -1.3% through the period, confirming coal rose on active re-rating rather than macro beta.","body_zh":"ChatGPT热潮消退后成长股估值回落，A股资金于2023年下半年轮换至高股息国企价值股，国务院与证监会推动上市国企提高分红比例——2023年国企分红总额达1.237万亿元，较2019年增长约67%。中国神华、兖矿能源、中国煤炭能源等公司股息率高达6-10%，成为最大受益方；煤炭申万排名第1，区间涨幅+37.7%。银行（+15%）、石油石化（+12.6%）同步领涨，呈现纯价值/国企行情，而成长/科技（计算机-33.2%、传媒-29.3%）遭大幅抛售。上证综指期间下跌-1.3%，确认煤炭上涨来自主动估值重估而非宏观贝塔。","drivers":["SOE dividend mandate","high-dividend value rotation","CSRC shareholder return push","coal company FCF yield re-rating","growth-to-value style mean reversion"],"drivers_zh":["国企分红政策强制要求","高股息价值轮动","证监会股东回报推动","煤炭公司自由现金流收益率重估","成长向价值风格均值回归"],"title":"SOE reform dividend mandate lifts red利 coal","title_zh":"国企改革分红政策提振煤炭红利股重估"},"2024-05-29":{"body":"Thermal coal prices fell roughly 28% in 2024 as weak property/infrastructure activity (property and infrastructure each ~30% of China steel consumption) cratered coking coal demand, while domestic coal output surged and cheap Russian coal flooded in. SHCOMP fell -12.5% in the June-September window as economic data repeatedly disappointed; coal fell -25.3%, the third-worst Shenwan performer. The Brokers/Electronics/Autos group that led (with the smallest losses) signals the market was in defensive rotation within a broad down-leg -- not a specific coal headwind. Both commodity price deflation and index beta drove the underperformance.","body_zh":"由于地产与基建活动疲软（各约占中国钢铁消费的30%）导致焦煤需求大幅萎缩，同时国内煤炭产量激增、廉价俄罗斯煤涌入，2024年动力煤价格累计下跌约28%。上证综指在6-9月区间下跌-12.5%，经济数据持续令市场失望；煤炭下跌-25.3%，申万行业排名倒数第三。券商/电子/汽车等领先板块（跌幅最小）显示市场处于大盘下行中的防御轮动，而非煤炭的特定利空。大宗商品价格通缩与指数贝塔共同导致煤炭跑输。","drivers":["thermal coal price deflation","property sector demand collapse","domestic supply glut","cheap Russian coal imports","broad market drawdown beta"],"drivers_zh":["动力煤价格通缩","房地产行业需求崩溃","国内供应过剩","俄罗斯廉价煤炭进口涌入","大盘下跌的贝塔暴露"],"title":"Property slump deflates coal demand and prices","title_zh":"地产低迷压制煤炭需求与价格"},"2024-09-11":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, the PBOC announced a landmark stimulus package -- a CNY 500bn equity swap facility for non-bank institutions plus a CNY 300bn share-buyback relending program -- followed by an off-cycle Politburo meeting on September 26 signaling additional fiscal support. The CSI 300 jumped 16% in one week, the largest single-week gain since 2008, and SHCOMP rose +22.6% in the leg. Coal (+26.7%) participated as pure beta: Real Estate (+41.5%) and Brokers (+38.7%) led on direct policy sensitivity, while Oil & Gas/Banks/Utilities (including coal) were the laggards within the rally. The Shenwan ctx confirms no coal-specific driver -- this was an index surge and coal simply kept pace.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，中国人民银行宣布里程碑式刺激政策组合——面向非银机构的5000亿元互换便利及3000亿元股票回购再贷款，随后9月26日超预期召开政治局会议，释放财政加码信号。沪深300单周上涨16%，创2008年以来最大单周涨幅，上证综指区间涨幅+22.6%。煤炭（+26.7%）作为纯贝塔参与反弹：地产（+41.5%）与券商（+38.7%）因政策直接受益而领涨，而石油石化/银行/公用事业（含煤炭）在本轮反弹中相对靠后。申万截面数据确认没有煤炭特定催化剂——这是指数整体急涨，煤炭只是随大流。","drivers":["PBOC September 24 stimulus package","Politburo fiscal signal","broad A-share beta rally","equity swap facility","sentiment reversal"],"drivers_zh":["央行9.24刺激政策组合","政治局财政信号","A股大盘全面贝塔反弹","股票互换便利工具","情绪急速逆转"],"title":"PBOC September bazooka triggers broad beta surge","title_zh":"央行九月政策礼包引爆大盘全面贝塔反弹"},"2024-09-30":{"body":"The September 2024 policy rally rapidly faded into Q4 as fiscal delivery fell short of market expectations and thermal coal prices continued declining toward multi-year lows (domestic spot dipped below 800 yuan/tonne in early 2025, lowest since 2021). Thermal power generation fell 0.7% year-on-year in 2025, the first annual drop since 2015, as mild weather and rapid renewable build cut coal burn. SHCOMP fell -7.2% while Coal dropped -28.2%, the worst Shenwan performer. Banks (+2.8%) and Computers (+2.8%) held up, confirming a defensive/quality tape with no macro beta bid for commodities.","body_zh":"2024年9月政策反弹在四季度迅速降温，财政落地力度低于市场预期，动力煤价格持续下跌至多年低位（2025年初国内现货跌破800元/吨，为2021年以来最低）。受温和气候及可再生能源装机快速扩张挤压用煤需求影响，2025年火力发电量同比下降0.7%，为2015年以来首次年度下降。上证综指下跌-7.2%，煤炭下跌-28.2%，申万行业排名垫底。银行（+2.8%）与计算机（+2.8%）录得正收益，确认市场进入防御/质量轮动阶段，大宗商品毫无宏观贝塔支撑。","drivers":["policy disappointment post-Sep rally","thermal coal price multi-year low","coal demand structural decline","renewable energy displacement","quality rotation over commodities"],"drivers_zh":["政策落地不及预期","动力煤价格跌至多年低位","煤炭需求结构性下滑","可再生能源替代效应","资金转向质量资产远离大宗商品"],"title":"Stimulus euphoria fades; coal de-rates on oversupply","title_zh":"刺激政策亢奋消退，煤炭因供应过剩遭估值压缩"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"US tariff escalation triggered China's so-called 'Black Monday' on April 7, 2025: ChiNext fell over 9% intraday before the national team (Central Huijin, PBOC, SASAC, social security fund) intervened decisively, announcing ETF purchases and prompting major SOEs -- including CHN Energy and China Coal Energy -- to announce buybacks. The subsequent SHCOMP rally of +31.0% over the April 2025-June 2026 leg was entirely dominated by Telecoms (+258.9%), Electronics (+147.5%), and Metals (+103.3%) as the DeepSeek/AI hardware and new-energy supply chain themes drove growth leadership (growth beat value by 58.9pp). Coal's +63.6% gain was pure index beta in a massive SHCOMP surge; it was a clear laggard relative to the growth leaders and trailed cyclicals overall.","body_zh":"美国关税升级引发中国'黑色星期一'（2025年4月7日）：创业板指盘中暴跌逾9%，随后国家队（汇金、央行、国资委、社保基金）果断入市，宣布增持ETF，中国神华、中煤能源等央企相继公告回购。此后2025年4月至2026年6月上证综指累计上涨+31.0%，但行情完全由通信（+258.9%）、电子（+147.5%）与有色（+103.3%）主导，DeepSeek/AI硬件及新能源供应链主题驱动成长风格大幅领先（成长跑赢价值58.9pp）。煤炭+63.6%的涨幅为纯粹的指数贝塔，在上证综指大涨背景下属明显跑输者，相对于成长龙头和周期股整体均处于落后位置。","drivers":["US tariff shock April 2025","national team stabilization","SHCOMP index beta","DeepSeek/AI hardware rally","growth-over-value extreme rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2025年4月美国关税冲击","国家队维稳入市","上证综指贝塔上涨","DeepSeek/AI硬件行情","成长相对价值极端轮动"],"title":"Tariff Black Monday bottom; coal joins broad rebound","title_zh":"关税'黑色星期一'筑底，煤炭借大盘反弹顺势上涨"},"2026-06-04":{"body":"Thermal coal at China's northern ports fell below 800 yuan/tonne by early 2026 as production continued rising and mild spring weather reduced power demand, with coastal plant inventories up 87% year-on-year in early June. China's 15th Five-Year Plan (approved June 2026) formally targets peaking coal and petroleum consumption and launches a 2026-2028 carbon-reduction campaign covering coal-fired power. The Shenwan ctx shows coal (-20.8%) as the third-worst laggard while Building Materials (+24.8%) and Electronics (+17.1%) lead in a near-flat market (SHCOMP -0.8%) -- the cross-asset signal is a growth/new-infrastructure rotation, with no macro bid for thermal commodities. The -22.2% selloff is a combination of commodity price pressure and active de-rating of coal's long-term earnings power under the energy transition narrative.","body_zh":"随着产量持续增长、温和春季气候压低用电需求，2026年初中国北方港口动力煤跌破800元/吨，6月初沿海电厂库存同比大增87%。2026年6月正式获批的《国家第十五个五年规划》明确提出推动煤炭和石油消费达峰，并启动2026-2028年涵盖煤电的碳减排专项行动。申万截面显示煤炭（-20.8%）排名倒数第三，建材（+24.8%）与电子（+17.1%）在市场近乎持平（上证综指-0.8%）的环境中领涨——跨资产信号为成长/新基建轮动，动力煤毫无宏观支撑。-22.2%的跌幅是商品价格压力与能源转型叙事下煤炭长期盈利能力主动估值收缩的共同结果。","drivers":["thermal coal price weakness","15th FYP energy transition risk","domestic oversupply and high inventory","renewable displacement of coal burn","growth/new-infra rotation away from commodity"],"drivers_zh":["动力煤价格疲软","十五五能源转型政策风险","国内供应过剩及库存高企","可再生能源替代煤电","资金轮换至成长/新基建远离大宗商品"],"title":"Coal rolls over: oversupply and 15th FYP transition risk","title_zh":"煤炭见顶回落：供应过剩叠加十五五能源转型风险"}},"now":"Coal (cn_coal) is in a confirmed Downturn phase (Rolling over), sitting at the 65th percentile of its historical range with a SELL signal and trading below its 200-day moving average. The current Shenwan cross-asset tape is a growth/tech-led RISK-ON rally: Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Building Materials (+48.1%) lead, while Coal posts only +8.9% -- ranking 16th of 31 industries and badly trailing the pack in a market that is up only +1.6% on SHCOMP. Cyclicals narrowly beat defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%), but the 18.2pp growth-over-value style gap confirms this is a liquidity/AI-theme tape rather than a broad commodity/value cycle. Coal's modest gain in a surging market underlines its deteriorating relative strength: dividend/value positioning is being actively rotated out of in favor of tech-hardware and new-energy themes, consistent with the basket's SELL signal and below-200d posture.","now_zh":"煤炭板块（cn_coal）处于确认的下行阶段（\"滚顶回落\"），在历史区间中位于第65百分位，技术面发出卖出信号，且股价位于200日均线下方。当前申万行业横截面呈现成长/科技主导的风险偏好格局：电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）、建材（+48.1%）领涨，而煤炭仅录得+8.9%，在31个行业中排名第16位，在上证综指仅上涨1.6%的背景下大幅跑输。周期股小幅跑赢防御股（+0.3% vs -12.1%），但成长风格对价值风格的18.2pp溢价确认当前是流动性/AI主题驱动的行情，而非大宗商品/价值周期。煤炭在市场整体上涨背景下涨幅有限，表明其相对强度持续恶化：高股息/价值配置正被科技硬件与新能源主题主动替换，与该板块的卖出信号和位于200日均线下方的技术面相符。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_consumer_elec":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"SHCOMP gained 2.8% in a risk-on cyclical tape led by Power Equipment (+36.7%) and Utilities (+28.9%), as Beijing's dual-carbon goals (announced Sep 2020, operationalised in the 14th Five-Year Plan mid-2021) directed policy liquidity into new-energy and high-tech manufacturing themes. Consumer Electronics rose 13.6%, riding the same growth-style tailwind (+8.1pp growth premium) rather than any sector-specific catalyst -- it lagged well behind the energy-transition leaders. Banks and Services were left behind as money rotated into policy-aligned cyclicals, confirming a broad risk-on beta lift rather than electronics fundamentals.","body_zh":"沪综指涨2.8%，为风险偏好主导的周期行情，电力设备（+36.7%）与公用事业（+28.9%）领涨。北京双碳目标（2020年9月宣布，2021年中期十四五规划落地）将政策流动性引向新能源与高端制造主题。消费电子涨13.6%，系成长风格贝塔收益（成长溢价+8.1pp），并非板块自身催化剂驱动——其涨幅明显落后于能源转型龙头。银行与服务业落后，印证本轮为整体风险偏好提升，而非消费电子基本面独立催化。","drivers":["carbon-neutral policy tailwind","growth/tech style beta","14th Five-Year Plan liquidity","risk-on cyclical rotation"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策红利","成长/科技风格贝塔","十四五规划流动性","风险偏好周期轮动"],"title":"Green Policy Beta Lifts Growth Tech","title_zh":"绿色政策贝塔拉升成长科技"},"2021-12-24":{"body":"Consumer Electronics crashed 45.1% as SHCOMP fell 20.2% in a value-led tape where only Coal (+3.2%) held positive -- the broadest Chinese market drawdown since 2018. The Fed's December 15 2021 taper acceleration announcement and a hawkish dot-plot shift raised the discount rate for long-duration growth assets globally. Simultaneously, Beijing's 18-month tech regulatory crackdown (antitrust fines on Alibaba, Meituan; gaming/education sector curbs through 2021) crushed investor confidence in Chinese growth tech. Shanghai's March-April 2022 lockdown under zero-COVID policy deepened the collapse, with the growth-minus-value spread collapsing -15.9pp as fund managers rotated into cyclical value.","body_zh":"消费电子大跌45.1%，沪综指同期下挫20.2%，仅煤炭（+3.2%）收正——为2018年以来最大幅度的A股系统性下行。2021年12月15日美联储宣布加速缩减购债，点阵图鹰派转向，全球长久期成长资产折现率骤升。与此同时，北京延续约18个月的科技监管整治（反垄断罚款阿里/美团、游戏教培整顿）重创成长股投资信心。2022年3-4月上海封控更令跌势加深，成长-价值利差骤降-15.9pp，资金大规模转向周期价值板块。","drivers":["Fed taper/rate-hike shock (Dec 15 2021)","Beijing tech regulatory crackdown","zero-COVID Shanghai lockdown","growth-to-value rotation","broad index beta (-20%)"],"drivers_zh":["美联储缩表/加息冲击","北京科技监管整治","零疫情上海封控","成长转价值风格切换","指数宽幅杀跌贝塔"],"title":"Fed Taper + Tech Crackdown Double Blow","title_zh":"美联储缩表+监管整治双重重击"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"SHCOMP rebounded 13.5% from its April 26 2022 low in a powerful risk-on surge led by Power Equipment (+62.5%), Autos (+50.5%), and Defense (+45.6%) -- all growth/cyclical names. Consumer Electronics rose 36.4%, outperforming but lagging the top cyclicals. The April 29 Politburo meeting pledged full-force macro stimulus and infrastructure spending; the PBOC cut the 5-year LPR by 15bp on May 20 (the largest LPR cut since the benchmark reform), and Shanghai began lifting its lockdown in late May 2022. This combination -- policy floor + reopening trade + growth-style rotation (+17.1pp growth premium) -- ignited a relief rally across all growth sectors.","body_zh":"沪综指从2022年4月26日低点反弹13.5%，电力设备（+62.5%）、汽车（+50.5%）、国防（+45.6%）领涨，消费电子同涨36.4%。4月29日政治局会议承诺全力使用宏观政策稳增长；5月20日央行下调5年期LPR 15bp（改革以来最大单次降幅）；上海于5月下旬开始解封。政策底+解封交易+成长风格回归（+17.1pp成长溢价）三重叠加，推动全成长板块集体修复。","drivers":["April 29 Politburo stimulus pledge","PBOC May LPR -15bp cut","Shanghai lockdown lift (late May)","growth/cyclical rotation","risk-on relief rally"],"drivers_zh":["4月29日政治局稳增长承诺","央行5年LPR下调15bp","上海解封预期（5月下旬）","成长/周期风格轮动","风险偏好修复行情"],"title":"Politburo Pledge Sparks Reopening Rally","title_zh":"政治局表态+上海解封引发修复行情"},"2022-08-18":{"body":"Consumer Electronics fell 25.7% while SHCOMP dropped 9.1% in a value-led tape where Coal (+4.7%) and Banks (-1.9%) outperformed sharply. Fed Chair Powell's August 26 2022 Jackson Hole speech delivered the most hawkish signal of the cycle, sending the DXY above 109 and crushing global growth equities. Mounting uncertainty ahead of the October 2022 20th CCP National Congress (investors feared Xi's consolidation of power would extend regulatory tightening) added a China-specific risk premium. The growth-minus-value spread turned -7.9pp, confirming a clean style-rotation selloff with Electronics the worst Shenwan laggard (-26.6%).","body_zh":"消费电子跌25.7%，沪综指同期下跌9.1%，煤炭（+4.7%）与银行（-1.9%）相对跑赢，价值风格明显占优。2022年8月26日鲍威尔在杰克逊霍尔发表本轮加息周期最鹰派讲话，美元指数升破109，全球成长股遭遇重估。与此同时，市场对2022年10月二十大后监管政策能否放松存在高度不确定性，叠加中国特定风险溢价上升。成长-价值利差转为-7.9pp，申万电子为最大跌幅行业（-26.6%），印证为典型风格切换驱动的下跌。","drivers":["Fed Jackson Hole hawkish shock (Aug 26 2022)","USD surge / DXY >109","20th CCP Congress uncertainty","growth-to-value style rotation","global risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["杰克逊霍尔鹰派讲话（2022年8月26日）","美元强势/美元指数破109","二十大政治不确定性","成长转价值风格切换","全球风险规避"],"title":"Jackson Hole Shock Kills Growth Rally","title_zh":"美联储杰克逊霍尔鹰派冲击终结反弹"},"2022-10-11":{"body":"Consumer Electronics rallied 42.3% over 13 months in a pure growth-style run (+17.4pp premium) while SHCOMP managed only +2.6% -- confirming sector leadership rather than index beta. Two catalysts compounded: (1) China's White Paper protests (November 24-27 2022) forced a rapid zero-COVID policy reversal officially announced December 7 2022, ending the lockdown headwind to supply chains and consumer demand; (2) OpenAI launched ChatGPT on November 30 2022, igniting a global AI hardware investment theme that drove Chinese semiconductor and PCB names throughout 2023, with ChatGPT-related A-share stocks surging 40%+ in early 2023. Media (+43.2%), Computers (+30.7%), and Telecoms (+28.3%) led, confirming an AI/growth-tech narrative rotation.","body_zh":"消费电子在13个月内累涨42.3%，纯成长风格主导（+17.4pp溢价），而沪综指同期仅涨2.6%——确认为板块主导行情而非指数贝塔。双重催化叠加：（1）2022年11月24-27日白纸运动爆发，迫使北京快速转向，12月7日正式宣布放弃动态清零，解除封控对供应链与消费需求的压制；（2）2022年11月30日OpenAI发布ChatGPT，引爆全球AI硬件投资主题，贯穿2023年全年推升中国半导体与PCB相关标的，A股AI概念股年初累涨逾40%。传媒（+43.2%）、计算机（+30.7%）、通信（+28.3%）领涨，印证AI/科技成长叙事主导。","drivers":["zero-COVID policy reversal (Dec 7 2022)","White Paper protests supply chain relief","ChatGPT launch (Nov 30 2022) AI hardware theme","growth/tech style dominance (+17.4pp)","A-share AI narrative momentum 2023"],"drivers_zh":["动态清零政策逆转（2022年12月7日）","白纸运动推动供应链压制解除","ChatGPT发布（2022年11月30日）点燃AI主题","成长/科技风格强势主导（+17.4pp）","A股AI概念叙事动量贯穿2023"],"title":"Zero-COVID Pivot + ChatGPT AI Ignition","title_zh":"动态清零政策逆转+ChatGPT点燃AI主题"},"2023-11-06":{"body":"Consumer Electronics fell 25.9% as SHCOMP dropped 11.6% in a clear flight-to-safety rotation: defensives outperformed (-10.8% vs cyclicals -15.8%), with Coal (+15.5%) and Banks (+3.4%) the only positive sectors. The AI-theme euphoria of 2023 ran out of earnings catalysts; China entered sustained deflation (CPI -0.5% YoY in November 2023, the sharpest drop in three years) and property market stress deepened (Country Garden default September 2023, Evergrande liquidation ruling January 2024). Global rates remained at multi-decade highs, crimping valuation multiples for long-duration growth assets. The extreme value-vs-growth reversal (-14.3pp) reflected wholesale risk-off repositioning, not a sector-specific trigger.","body_zh":"消费电子下跌25.9%，沪综指同期下行11.6%，典型避险轮动：防御板块跑赢（-10.8% vs周期-15.8%），煤炭（+15.5%）与银行（+3.4%）为仅有正收益板块。2023年AI主题炒作动能消退，缺乏盈利催化；中国陷入持续通缩（2023年11月CPI同比-0.5%，三年最大降幅），楼市压力持续加剧（碧桂园2023年9月实质违约，恒大2024年1月被裁定清盘）。全球利率维持数十年高位，压制长久期成长资产估值。成长-价值利差骤跌-14.3pp，印证为系统性避险再平仓而非板块特定触发。","drivers":["China deflation deepening (CPI -0.5% Nov 2023)","property developer failures (Evergrande Jan 2024, Country Garden Sep 2023)","AI earnings catalysts exhausted","global rates at cycle highs","flight-to-safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["中国通缩加深（2023年11月CPI同比-0.5%）","房企清盘（碧桂园违约/恒大清盘）","AI叙事盈利催化剂耗尽","全球利率处于周期高位","避险轮动"],"title":"Deflation + Property Crisis Kills AI Rally","title_zh":"通缩加深+房地产危机终结AI行情"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The largest rally in Consumer Electronics history: +108.9% over 12 months with SHCOMP +23.8% and a massive 39.1pp growth premium. Three waves compounded. Wave 1: Central Huijin Investment (China's sovereign wealth arm) announced aggressive CSI 300 ETF buying in February 2024, putting a floor under beaten-down growth stocks. Wave 2: September 24 2024 PBOC package -- a CNY 500bn equity swap facility, CNY 300bn share-buyback relending, LPR and RRR cuts -- triggered a 16% single-week CSI 300 surge (biggest since 2008). Wave 3: DeepSeek released its R1 model on January 20 2025, igniting a China AI Sputnik moment with Hang Seng Tech surging 28.5% in weeks; Electronics (+89%) and Computers (+85%) led the A-share tape as AI-hardware investment expectations soared.","body_zh":"消费电子历史最大涨幅：12个月累涨108.9%，沪综指同期+23.8%，成长-价值利差高达+39.1pp。三浪叠加驱动：第一浪，2024年2月中央汇金宣布大举增持沪深300ETF以稳定市场，为超跌成长股筑底；第二浪，2024年9月24日央行一揽子大招（5000亿互换便利+3000亿股票回购再贷款+降息降准），触发沪深300单周大涨16%（2008年以来最大单周涨幅）；第三浪，2025年1月20日DeepSeek发布R1模型，引爆中国AI斯普特尼克时刻，恒生科技数周内涨28.5%，A股电子（+89%）与计算机（+85%）领涨，AI硬件需求预期大幅重估。","drivers":["Central Huijin national team ETF rescue (Feb 2024)","PBOC Sep 24 2024 bazooka (CNY 500bn swap + LPR/RRR cuts)","DeepSeek R1 launch Jan 20 2025","AI hardware demand re-rating","growth style dominance (+39.1pp)"],"drivers_zh":["国家队（中央汇金）ETF增持护盘（2024年2月）","央行9·24一揽子大招（5000亿互换+降息降准）","DeepSeek R1发布（2025年1月20日）","AI硬件需求重估","成长风格大幅主导（+39.1pp）"],"title":"National Team + PBOC Bazooka + DeepSeek","title_zh":"国家队托市+央行大招+DeepSeek三浪叠加"},"2025-02-25":{"body":"Consumer Electronics fell 29.3% as SHCOMP declined 4.8% in a sharp flight-to-safety rotation: defensives turned positive (+0.8%) while cyclicals fell -5.6%, and growth underperformed value by -10.6pp. The catalyst was rapid escalation of US-China tariffs: initial 10% tariffs from February 4 2025 escalated to 34% (April 2 Liberation Day executive order), then 84% and ultimately 125% by early April, threatening Chinese consumer electronics supply chains with severe demand destruction. Electronics (-19.7%), Computers (-20.2%), and Telecoms (-21.5%) -- the prior cycle leaders -- were the worst laggards as investors priced in supply-chain disruption and order cancellations by Apple and Android OEMs.","body_zh":"消费电子下跌29.3%，沪综指同期下行4.8%，明显的避险轮动：防御板块转正（+0.8%），周期股跌-5.6%，成长跑输价值-10.6pp。催化剂为特朗普政府对华关税的快速升级：2025年2月4日首轮加征10%，4月2日解放日行政令提升至34%，随后在4月初升至84%乃至125%，严重威胁中国消费电子供应链的出口需求。电子（-19.7%）、计算机（-20.2%）、通信（-21.5%）——前轮周期领涨板块——沦为本轮跌幅最大的板块，反映市场对苹果及安卓品牌供应链中断与订单取消的定价。","drivers":["Trump tariff escalation (10% to 125%)","electronics/semiconductor export demand collapse risk","supply chain disruption fear","flight-to-safety rotation","growth-to-value style reversal (-10.6pp)"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普对华关税升级（10%至125%）","消费电子/半导体出口需求崩塌风险","供应链中断恐慌","避险轮动","成长转价值风格逆转（-10.6pp）"],"title":"Trump Tariff Escalation Triggers Risk-Off","title_zh":"特朗普关税升级触发避险抛售"},"2025-04-09":{"body":"The basket surged 171.5% from the April 9 2025 tariff-shock low -- the largest single leg in this series -- as SHCOMP gained 29.3% and the growth premium reached an extreme +68.6pp. Electronics (+191.1%) and Telecoms (+285.6%) led 31 Shenwan industries while defensives fell sharply (Food & Bev -25.8%). Three forces stacked: (1) The May 12 2025 Geneva US-China agreement slashed reciprocal tariffs from 125% to 10% for 90 days, removing supply-chain tail-risk; (2) Trump's April 11 executive order retroactively exempted smartphones, PCs, and semiconductors from tariffs, giving direct relief to the Apple/Android supply chain; (3) DeepSeek-enabled on-device AI accelerated the AI-phone hardware refresh cycle with Huawei foldable and iPhone 17 component orders sustaining demand. The tariff truce was extended in August 2025, prolonging the window.","body_zh":"篮子从2025年4月9日关税冲击低点大涨171.5%——本系列最大单腿涨幅——沪综指同期涨29.3%，成长-价值利差达极端的+68.6pp。申万电子（+191.1%）与通信（+285.6%）领跑31个子行业，食品饮料（-25.8%）等防御板块大幅落后。三力叠加：（1）2025年5月12日日内瓦协议将对华互惠关税从125%骤降至10%（有效期90天），消除供应链尾部风险；（2）特朗普4月11日行政令追溯豁免智能手机、个人电脑及半导体，果链直接受益；（3）DeepSeek端侧AI加速AI手机硬件换机周期，华为折叠屏与iPhone 17零部件订单支撑持续需求。关税休战于2025年8月延期，进一步延长窗口期。","drivers":["May 12 2025 Geneva tariff truce (125% to 10% for 90 days)","April 11 smartphone/semiconductor tariff exemption","DeepSeek AI-phone hardware upgrade cycle","SHCOMP broad bull market (+29.3%)","extreme growth/tech style dominance (+68.6pp)"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月12日日内瓦关税休战（125%降至10%）","4月11日智能手机/半导体关税豁免","DeepSeek AI手机硬件换机周期","沪综指大盘牛市（+29.3%）","成长/科技风格极端主导（+68.6pp）"],"title":"Tariff Truce + AI-Phone Cycle Ignites Supercycle","title_zh":"关税休战+AI手机周期引爆超级行情"}},"now":"Consumer Electronics (the Apple/Android supply chain: precision assembly, acoustics, display, PCB) sits at a 98th-percentile cycle position -- a confirmed Topping phase -- with the basket up 53.4% in the current window versus SHCOMP +1.6%. Shenwan Electronics leads the universe at +75.5% and Telecoms at +67.7%, while defensives (Agriculture, Beauty, Retail) average -12.1%. The growth-minus-value spread of +18.2pp and the cyclical-vs-defensive gap of 37pp signal a late-cycle, liquidity-driven tape. The proximate driver is the AI-phone upgrade narrative: DeepSeek on-device model proliferation, Huawei Mate/foldable premium ramp, and Apple iPhone 17 supply chain orders sustaining Chinese component makers. At rs_rank 2 of 31 and well above the 200-day moving average, the basket is at the highest relative-strength reading in its five-year history -- a configuration that historically precedes rotation-driven mean-reversion rather than further sustained outperformance.","now_zh":"消费电子（果链/AI手机供应链）当前处于98百分位，已进入顶部区间。本轮窗口篮子涨幅53.4%，远超沪综指+1.6%。申万电子子行业以+75.5%领跑全市场，通信紧随其后（+67.7%），而防御性板块（农业、美护、零售）均值-12.1%。成长-价值利差+18.2pp、周期vs防御37pp的极端分化，均指向流动性驱动的周期末段叙事：AI手机升级（DeepSeek端侧模型普及、华为Mate折叠旗舰、苹果iPhone 17供应链备货）是近端催化剂。篮子相对强度排名第2（共31只），远在200日均线上方——历史上此配置往往预示轮动性回调风险，而非持续超额收益的起点。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_defense":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-June 2021, the basket surged +37.3% through December 2021, anchored by the 14th Five-Year Plan (2021-2025) formalizing China's accelerated military modernization timeline — targeting a 'world-class military' by 2027. The PLA centenary on July 1, 2021 (71 fighters over Tiananmen) amplified sector visibility and political signaling, while China's 2021 defense budget rose 6.8% to 1.35 trillion yuan, the first uptick in defense spending as a share of government expenditure in two decades. The ctx confirms cyclicals led (+10.6% vs defensives -2.6%) on a net-positive SHCOMP (+2.5%), with Defense ranking as a co-leader alongside Power Equipment and Metals — this was a broad growth/beta rally on policy-theme enthusiasm, not a defensive safe-haven rotation.","body_zh":"2021年6月中旬至12月，板块上涨37.3%。核心催化为十四五规划（2021-2025）明确加速军事现代化路径，目标2027年建成世界一流军队。2021年7月1日建党百年阅兵（71架战机飞越天安门）大幅提升板块能见度与政治信号强度。2021年国防预算同比增6.8%至1.35万亿元，为近20年来占政府支出比重首次提升。背景数据印证周期股领涨（周期+10.6% vs 防御-2.6%），上证综指+2.5%，军工与电力设备、金属并列领涨——本轮为政策主题驱动的成长/贝塔风格普涨，而非防御避险轮动。","drivers":["14th Five-Year Plan modernization mandate","6.8% defense budget increase","PLA centenary political catalyst","Growth/cyclical risk-on rotation","Order-book re-rating for AVIC/AECC/CSSC"],"drivers_zh":["十四五规划军事现代化","国防预算增6.8%","建党百年政治催化","成长/周期风险偏好上升","航空/航天订单重估"],"title":"14th Five-Year Plan Defense Budget Re-Rating","title_zh":"十四五规划军工预算重估催化大涨"},"2021-12-03":{"body":"From peak December 2021 through April 2022, the basket collapsed -38.9%, the worst drawdown on record for this period. The Fed's pivot to aggressive tightening — its December 2021 FOMC pivot toward faster tapering and the subsequent March 2022 first rate hike — triggered a global repricing of long-duration growth equities, of which China defense names (high-multiple, order-book-driven) are a clear example. Compounding this, Omicron disrupted supply chains and Shanghai's months-long lockdown (announced April 4, 2022) crushed earnings expectations. Ukraine's invasion (Feb 24, 2022) provided no offsetting boost for Chinese defense stocks, as the crisis raised global risk-off sentiment. The ctx is unambiguous: both cyclicals (-18.8%) and defensives (-17.1%) fell sharply, Defense was the joint-worst laggard alongside Electronics and Power Equipment (-41% to -43%), and SHCOMP fell -20% — this was pure beta destruction in a broad market down-leg, amplified by style rotation into Value (Coal led +6.7%).","body_zh":"2021年12月至2022年4月，板块下跌38.9%，为有记录以来最大单次回撤。美联储2021年12月FOMC会议加速缩减购债、2022年3月首次加息，引发全球高估值长久期成长股重新定价，军工个股（高PE、订单驱动）首当其冲。与此同时，奥密克戎扰乱供应链，上海封城（2022年4月4日宣布）拖累业绩预期。俄乌战争（2022年2月24日）未能为中国军工提供对冲，反而加剧全球风险厌恶。背景数据显示周期股（-18.8%）与防御股（-17.1%）均深跌，军工与电子、电力设备同列最差行业（跌幅41%~43%），上证综指-20%——为市场整体贝塔杀跌，价值股（煤炭+6.7%领涨）轮动加剧跌势。","drivers":["Fed tightening shock / US rate hike cycle","Shanghai lockdown supply-chain disruption","Global Omicron risk-off","High-multiple growth selloff","Broad SHCOMP -20% beta destruction"],"drivers_zh":["美联储加息冲击","上海封城供应链受损","奥密克戎全球避险","高估值成长股系统性杀跌","上证综指-20%贝塔拖累"],"title":"Fed Tightening Shock + Omicron Growth Selloff","title_zh":"美联储紧缩冲击+奥密克戎成长股暴跌"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"From the April 2022 trough the basket rebounded +61.9% through March 2023, the largest single rally in the data. The April 26 trough aligned with the SHCOMP bottom as Beijing signaled policy support and Shanghai's lockdown began to ease (lifted June 1, 2022). The Russia-Ukraine war, now in its second quarter, drew urgent geopolitical lessons about military readiness and accelerated PLA's internal review of munitions stockpiles and force modernization — providing a narrative tailwind for defense procurement expectations. China's 2022 defense budget rose 7.1% to 1.45 trillion yuan, the largest-ever single-year dollar increase. The ChatGPT frenzy (launched November 2022) then drove a late-leg surge into computer/tech stocks, with which defense electronics names trade in sympathy. The ctx confirms growth outperformed value by 18.3pp, SHCOMP surged +15.1%, and Defense, Computers, and Telecoms were the top three sectors — a pure growth/liquidity-driven tape.","body_zh":"2022年4月低点至2023年3月，板块上涨61.9%，为数据区间内最大单次反弹。4月26日触底与上证综指见底同步，北京释放政策托市信号，上海封城5月底开始松动（6月1日正式解封）。俄乌战争进入第二季度，推动解放军紧急复盘军备库存与现代化缺口，军工采购预期改善。2022年国防预算增7.1%至1.45万亿元，为历史上单年美元增量之最。2022年11月ChatGPT上线引发AI概念热潮，带动军工电子个股跟涨。背景数据显示成长-价值利差+18.3pp，上证综指+15.1%，军工、计算机、通信位居三甲——纯成长/流动性驱动行情。","drivers":["SHCOMP policy-support floor / COVID trough","7.1% defense budget (largest-ever dollar jump)","Ukraine war geopolitical PLA readiness lesson","ChatGPT AI frenzy late-leg sympathy","Growth outperforms value +18.3pp"],"drivers_zh":["上证综指政策托底/疫情底部","7.1%国防预算（历史最大美元增量）","俄乌战争地缘军备预期改善","ChatGPT概念末段带动","成长超越价值18.3pp"],"title":"COVID Bottom Rebound + Ukraine Geopolitical Tailwind","title_zh":"疫情底部反弹+俄乌战争地缘红利"},"2023-03-06":{"body":"From March 2023 through February 2024 the basket fell -35.2%, as China's post-COVID reopening failed to generate the consumption surge the market had priced in — retail sales growth decelerated to 3.1% by June 2023 vs. 18.4% in April. The property sector shrank ~10% in 2022 and ~9.6% in 2023, draining fiscal capacity and business confidence. Critically for the defense sector, July-August 2023 saw the PLA Rocket Force corruption purge: commanders Li Yuchao, Liu Guangbin, and Zhang Zhenzhong were detained, followed by Defense Minister Li Shangfu's removal; US officials later reported missiles filled with water and faulty silo lids. This unprecedented procurement-corruption scandal directly impaired order-book credibility for the military-industrial complex. The ctx shows this was NOT a flight-to-safety rotation in defense's favor — defensives actually outperformed cyclicals (defensives -18.1% vs cyclicals -27.0%) while Defense itself was broadly in-line with cyclical losses, on SHCOMP -18.7%.","body_zh":"2023年3月至2024年2月，板块下跌35.2%。中国经济重启后消费反弹不及预期，社零增速由4月18.4%骤降至6月3.1%。房地产2022年收缩约10%、2023年再缩9.6%，财政与企业信心受损。对军工板块而言更具破坏性的是，2023年7至8月解放军火箭军腐败案爆发：司令员李玉超、副司令刘光斌、张振忠相继被拘，继任国防部长李尚福随后也遭免职。美国官员事后披露存在导弹填充清水、发射井盖无法开启等问题，军工订单可信度受到根本性冲击。背景数据显示防御股跌幅（-18.1%）小于周期股（-27.0%），上证综指-18.7%——军工并非本轮避险受益品种，而是随大盘下挫。","drivers":["Reopening growth disappointment","PLA Rocket Force corruption purge (Jul-Aug 2023)","Property crisis fiscal drag","Order-book credibility impaired","Broad market risk-off / SHCOMP -18.7%"],"drivers_zh":["复苏预期大幅落空","火箭军腐败案整肃（2023年7-8月）","房地产危机财政拖累","军工订单可信度受损","上证综指-18.7%市场整体下跌"],"title":"Reopening Disappointment + PLA Corruption Purge","title_zh":"复苏预期落空+解放军腐败整肃"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 5, 2024 trough to November 2024, the basket surged +71.3%, its joint-largest rally. The February entry point was catalyzed by unprecedented CSRC and Central Huijin 'national team' ETF buying (estimated net inflow >$60bn in Jan-Feb 2024), which arrested the SHCOMP selloff and provided a technical floor. The transformational catalyst was the September 24, 2024 PBOC 'Draghi moment' — Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a package including rate cuts (7-day reverse repo to 1.5%), RRR reduction (-50bps), a CNY 500bn Securities-Fund-Insurance Swap Facility, and CNY 300bn Central Bank Share Buyback Lending Facility. SHCOMP surged +24% in September 2024. Defense was a top-three sector leader (+71.3%), running alongside Electronics (+82.9%) and Computers (+76.2%) on massive growth-style rotation (growth-minus-value +34pp). The basket's move was broadly in-line with systemic beta, not defense-specific outperformance.","body_zh":"2024年2月至11月，板块上涨71.3%，并列历史最大涨幅。2月入场催化为证监会及中央汇金史无前例的ETF托市（1-2月净流入超600亿美元），稳住上证综指颓势。决定性催化来自2024年9月24日央行行长潘功胜宣布'中国版德拉吉时刻'：7天逆回购降至1.5%、降准50BP、5000亿证券基金保险互换便利及3000亿股票回购专项再贷款。上证综指9月单月涨约24%。军工以+71.3%位列前三（电子+82.9%、计算机+76.2%），成长-价值利差+34pp，为流动性驱动的成长风格行情，军工涨幅实为系统性贝塔，非板块特定超额收益。","drivers":["CSRC/Central Huijin national team buying (Jan-Feb 2024)","September 24 PBOC mega-stimulus package","RRR cut + swap facility + share buyback facility","SHCOMP +28.4% / Growth outperforms Value +34pp","Systemic growth beta / liquidity-driven tape"],"drivers_zh":["证监会/中央汇金国家队ETF托市（2024年1-2月）","924央行超级刺激一揽子政策","降准+互换便利+回购再贷款","上证综指+28.4%/成长超越价值+34pp","系统性成长贝塔/流动性驱动"],"title":"National Team Floor + September 24 Mega-Stimulus Rally","title_zh":"国家队托底+924超级刺激驱动大涨"},"2024-11-11":{"body":"From November 2024 peak to April 7, 2025 trough, the basket fell -22.5% as Trump's re-election unleashed fears of sweeping tariff escalation. Liberation Day tariffs (April 2, 2025) imposed a cumulative ~145% levy on Chinese goods, sending the Hang Seng down 13.2% in a single session and triggering a broad de-risking. The market rotated aggressively into Banks (+4.5%) and away from high-beta growth names. Defense sold off alongside Brokers (-23.9%) and Power Equipment (-23.9%), confirming this was a risk-off regime rotation rather than a defense-specific event. The ctx is unambiguous: SHCOMP fell -10.8%, defensives led (-7.1% vs cyclicals -14.1%), and value outperformed growth by 7.2pp — a textbook flight-to-safety rotation in which defense, as a high-multiple long-duration growth theme, was treated as risk-on and sold.","body_zh":"2024年11月至2025年4月7日，板块下跌22.5%。特朗普再次当选引发关税大幅升级恐慌，2025年4月2日'解放日关税'对华商品累计税率升至约145%，恒生指数单日暴跌13.2%，引发大规模去风险。市场资金涌入银行（+4.5%）等价值板块，远离高贝塔成长名称。军工与券商（-23.9%）、电力设备（-23.9%）同步大跌，印证本轮为风险厌恶体制轮动而非军工特定风险。背景数据明确：上证综指-10.8%，防御股跑赢周期股（-7.1% vs -14.1%），价值超越成长7.2pp——军工作为高估值长久期成长主题在避险模式下遭到抛售。","drivers":["Trump re-election tariff escalation fears","Liberation Day tariffs (~145% cumulative)","Hang Seng -13.2% single-session crash (Apr 2025)","Risk-off rotation into Banks/Value","Defense as high-multiple growth theme — sold in risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普连任关税升级恐慌","解放日关税（累计约145%）","恒生指数单日暴跌13.2%","资金避险转向银行/价值股","军工作为高估值成长主题被抛售"],"title":"Trump Tariff Shock + Growth Rotation Reversal","title_zh":"特朗普关税冲击+成长轮动逆转"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"From the April 7, 2025 trough to January 12, 2026 peak, the basket surged +71.8%, driven by three stacked catalysts. First, Chinese defense stocks became an explicit tariff hedge as military names were exempt from trade-war disruption and benefited from 'buy China strategic assets' flows — CSSC, AviChina, and Xian Triangle Defense surged 16-20% in a single session in early April. Second, the May 2025 India-Pakistan conflict provided a live battlefield test of Chinese weapons platforms (J-10C claimed to have downed Rafales), catapulting AVIC Chengdu Aircraft +40% within days and establishing Chinese defense as a credible global arms exporter for the first time. Third, the DeepSeek military AI integration (PLA procurement notices, Norinco autonomous vehicles, drone swarm integration) fused the defense and AI themes. The ctx confirms a broad SHCOMP +34.5% surge, cyclicals outperforming defensives by 28.9pp, and growth outperforming value by 41.5pp — Defense (+71.8%) was broadly in-line with the market's powerful growth-cyclical beta.","body_zh":"2025年4月至2026年1月，板块大涨71.8%，三重催化叠加。其一，中国军工股成为显性关税对冲品种，军品不受贸易战冲击，'战略性买入中国资产'资金涌入，中国船舶、中航科工、西安庆华4月初单日涨幅达16-20%。其二，2025年5月印巴冲突提供了中国武器实战检验——歼-10C被巴方声称击落阵风战机，成飞股价在数日内飙升40%，中国军工出口信誉首次获国际市场认可。其三，DeepSeek军事AI整合（解放军采购公告、北方公司自主战车、无人机蜂群对接）使军工与AI主题深度融合。背景数据印证上证综指+34.5%，周期股跑赢防御股28.9pp，成长超价值41.5pp——军工+71.8%与市场贝塔高度吻合。","drivers":["US tariff exemption / 'strategic China asset' hedge","India-Pakistan conflict J-10C performance (May 2025)","DeepSeek military AI integration theme","SHCOMP +34.5% broad risk-on surge","Arms export credibility re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["美国关税豁免/战略资产对冲","印巴冲突歼-10C实战验证（2025年5月）","DeepSeek军事AI整合主题","上证综指+34.5%全面风险偏好回升","军工出口公信力重估"],"title":"Trade-War Defense Hedge + DeepSeek Military AI Boom","title_zh":"关税对冲+巴以冲突验证+DeepSeek军事AI"},"2026-01-12":{"body":"From the January 12, 2026 peak, the basket corrected -19.6% through June 8, 2026 — a not-major selloff (sub-20%) but meaningful in context. Early 2026 interim earnings flagged that smaller defense companies swung to losses amid 'challenging market conditions,' and larger names including AVIC Shenyang Aircraft and AECC Aviation Power pre-announced smaller profits, deflating the narrative around the 'Victory Day' parade cycle. Meanwhile, Telecoms (+50.3%) and Electronics (+26.6%) continued to lead the market on AI infrastructure themes, leaving Defense (-25.7%) as the worst laggard alongside Retail and Media. The ctx shows neither pure risk-off (no flight-to-safety signal) nor broad market collapse (SHCOMP -4.9%) — this was a sector-specific unwind driven by earnings disappointment and profit-taking after the 71.8% run, with capital rotating within the growth complex from defense to telecoms/electronics.","body_zh":"2026年1月12日见顶至6月8日，板块回落19.6%（未触及-20%重大级别）。2026年初中期业绩显示，多家中小军工企业受'市场环境严峻'影响转为亏损，航空工业沈阳飞机、中航发动力等龙头亦相继发布盈利下滑预告，'胜利日'阅兵行情预期落空。与此同时，通信（+50.3%）、电子（+26.6%）继续在AI基础设施主题下领涨，军工（-25.7%）与零售、传媒并列最差。背景数据显示既无避险信号，大盘也未深跌（上证综指-4.9%）——本轮为涨幅71.8%后业绩落空触发的板块特定了结，资金在成长板块内部从军工轮动至通信/电子。","drivers":["Defense earnings disappointment (interim H2 2025)","AVIC/AECC profit warnings","Profit-taking after +71.8% rally","Capital rotation within growth: defense to telecoms/electronics","SHCOMP -4.9% mild index backdrop"],"drivers_zh":["军工中期业绩低于预期（2025年下半年）","航空沈飞/中航发动力盈利预警","71.8%大涨后获利回吐","成长板块内部轮动：军工→通信/电子","上证综指仅小幅下跌-4.9%"],"title":"Earnings Reality Check + Defense Sector Rotation Out","title_zh":"业绩兑现落空+资金从军工轮出"}},"now":"Defense & Aerospace sits at cycle position 2.7 — trough-phase, bottoming after a -19.6% selloff from the January 2026 peak. The sector ranks 8th of 31 Shenwan industries in the current window, a sharp demotion from its prior leadership. The current tape is growth/cyclical-led (Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7%, growth-minus-value +18.2pp) while Defense has gained only +0.7%, lagging its own style peers by a wide margin. This under-participation is consistent with post-rally earnings disappointment and delivery-cycle exhaustion following the massive 2025 advance. The sector sits above its 200-day moving average and carries a 65.8% historical win-rate at trough-phase, suggesting the current positioning may be constructive for a mean-reversion entry rather than the start of a new structural bull leg.","now_zh":"国防航天板块处于本轮周期低位（周期得分2.7），自2026年1月高点累计回调19.6%，目前处于筑底阶段。板块在申万31个行业中排名第8，较此前领涨地位大幅滑落。当前市场为成长/周期风格主导（电子+75.5%、通信+67.7%，成长-价值利差+18.2pp），而军工本期涨幅仅0.7%，远落后于同属成长风格的行业。这一分化与2025年大幅上涨后业绩兑现不及预期、交付周期消化密切相关。板块仍在200日均线之上，历史上筑底阶段胜率达65.8%，当前或为均值回归的介入窗口，而非新一轮结构性牛市的起点。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_food_bev":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From June 2021 SHCOMP rose +2.8% as Beijing's dual-carbon policy supercharged Power Equipment (+36.4%), Utilities (+28.7%) and Metals (+27.5%), pulling the market into an industrial-cyclical rotation. Food & Beverage, still nursing a hangover from extreme crowded positioning (median P/E of top mutual fund holdings hit approximately 80x in January 2021), returned -2.8% against the index's +2.8% -- a 560bp relative lag. The August 26, 2021 SAMR baijiu symposium explicitly warned against speculative price-pumping in liquor stocks, triggering a 5-7% single-day rout in baijiu names and reinforcing the de-rating. This was a style rotation away from crowded consumer growth into policy-favored green-energy cyclicals, not a sector-specific story.","body_zh":"2021年6月起，北京\"双碳\"政策推动电力设备（+36.4%）、公用事业（+28.7%）、有色金属（+27.5%）领涨，市场进入工业周期轮动。食品饮料此前估值泡沫严重（2021年初主动基金前百大重仓股中位PE约80倍），本段回报-2.8%，大幅落后上证综指+2.8%。2021年8月26日市场监管总局召集白酒企业座谈会，明确警示投机炒作行为，当日白酒板块单日暴跌5-7%，进一步强化去估值压力。整体系风格从拥挤的消费成长切换至政策支持的绿色能源周期股，并非板块个体逻辑。","drivers":["dual-carbon cyclical re-rating","baijiu valuation crowding unwind","SAMR baijiu symposium Aug-2021","growth vs value rotation","defensive underperformance vs cyclicals"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策驱动周期重估","白酒估值拥挤去化","2021年8月市监总局白酒座谈会","成长/价值风格切换","防御板块相对周期板块跑输"],"title":"Cyclical re-rating leaves defensives behind","title_zh":"双碳政策驱动周期重估，防御板块边缘化"},"2021-12-27":{"body":"From late December 2021, the Fed's hawkish pivot (first rate hike March 16, 2022, +25bp) and Russia's invasion of Ukraine on February 24, 2022 triggered synchronized global risk-off. SHCOMP fell -12.4% and the rotation was sharply into value: Coal (+15.8%) and Real Estate (+9.0%) led while Electronics (-31.7%), Autos (-27.0%) and Defense (-26.2%) bore the brunt. Food & Beverage fell -25.2%, worse than the index -- partly because high-P/E multiples compress faster in a rate-shock regime, and partly because global commodity inflation (grain, cooking oil, packaging costs) sharply elevated input costs, threatening F&B margins at a time when the sector still carried stretched valuations from 2021's crowding.","body_zh":"2021年12月底起，美联储鹰派转向（2022年3月16日首次加息25bp）与2022年2月24日俄乌战争爆发形成双重全球风险规避冲击。上证综指下跌-12.4%，市场大幅向价值切换：煤炭（+15.8%）、房地产（+9.0%）领涨，电子（-31.7%）、汽车（-27.0%）、国防（-26.2%）领跌。食品饮料下跌-25.2%，跌幅超过指数——一方面高估值品种在加息周期中估值压缩更为剧烈，另一方面全球大宗商品通胀（粮食、食用油、包材成本）大幅推升原材料成本，在估值仍偏高背景下进一步压制板块。","drivers":["Fed rate-hike cycle Mar-2022","Russia-Ukraine commodity shock","input-cost inflation (grain/cooking oil)","high-P/E multiple compression","global risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2022年3月加息周期","俄乌冲突大宗商品冲击","粮食/食用油原材料成本通胀","高市盈率估值压缩","全球风险规避轮动"],"title":"Fed tightening and Russia-Ukraine crush growth stocks","title_zh":"美联储收紧叠加俄乌冲击，成长股遭重创"},"2022-04-11":{"body":"Shanghai's citywide lockdown (April 5 to June 1, 2022) was lifted and the State Council issued its 33-measure economic stabilization package on May 31, 2022, combining infrastructure spending, EV purchase-tax exemptions, and consumption vouchers. SHCOMP recovered +7.3% and the rebound was broad: Autos (+32.0%) and Power Equipment (+27.2%) led, but Food & Beverage came third at +22.8% -- the strongest showing relative to the index since late 2020 -- as pent-up dining, gifting, and baijiu restocking demand was front-run by investors ahead of the summer consumption recovery. Both defensives and cyclicals rose, confirming this was a genuine policy-reflation bounce.","body_zh":"上海自2022年4月5日全城封控、6月1日解封，国务院于5月31日出台33条稳经济一揽子政策，涵盖基建投资、新能源车购置税减免及消费券。上证综指反弹+7.3%，行情具备普涨特征：汽车（+32.0%）、电力设备（+27.2%）领涨，食品饮料（+22.8%）位列第三，为2020年底以来最强相对表现，投资者提前布局解封后餐饮、宴请及白酒备货需求复苏。防御与周期同步上涨，确认为政策驱动反通缩反弹行情。","drivers":["Shanghai lockdown lift Jun-2022","State Council 33-measure package May-2022","EV and auto purchase-tax exemption","pent-up dining and gifting demand front-run","broad policy reflation bounce"],"drivers_zh":["上海6月解封","2022年5月国务院33条稳经济政策","新能源车购置税减免","餐饮/白酒需求复苏抢跑布局","政策驱动普涨反弹"],"title":"Post-lockdown stimulus: F&B top-3 Shenwan leader","title_zh":"解封刺激反弹，食饮跻身申万前三领涨"},"2022-06-30":{"body":"From end-June 2022 through the 20th Party Congress (October 16-22, 2022), Xi Jinping consolidated power with a loyalist Politburo Standing Committee and explicitly reaffirmed zero-COVID policy, triggering the worst post-Congress rout in history with record $2.5bn single-day foreign outflows. SHCOMP fell -14.9%; Food & Beverage was the second-worst Shenwan sector at -31.3%, behind only Building Materials (-31.4%). Context confirms growth beat value by 8.1pp as the market rotated into Defense and state-adjacent Computers -- policy-safe havens -- while consumer-facing staples were doubly punished by zero-COVID demand destruction and property-crisis wealth-effect collapse. Food & Bev's above-beta selloff reflects investors pricing in a prolonged consumption depression.","body_zh":"2022年6月底至10月16-22日二十大期间，习近平组建亲信政治局常委会并公开重申清零政策，引发史上最惨烈大会后抛售，外资单日净流出创纪录（25亿美元）。上证综指下跌-14.9%；食品饮料以-31.3%成为申万倒数第二（仅次于建材-31.4%）。行情数据显示成长跑赢价值8.1pp，资金轮入国防与计算机等政策安全资产，消费类板块因清零需求毁灭叠加房地产危机财富效应崩塌而遭双重打压。板块跌幅远超指数Beta，反映市场在定价持续消费萧条预期。","drivers":["20th Party Congress zero-COVID reaffirmation","Xi power consolidation selloff","record foreign capital outflow ($2.5bn single day)","property-wealth-effect collapse","rotation into Defense and Computers (policy-safe havens)"],"drivers_zh":["二十大清零政策重申","习近平权力巩固引发市场抛售","外资单日净流出创纪录（25亿美元）","房地产财富效应崩塌","资金轮入国防/计算机等政策安全行业"],"title":"Xi third term plus zero-COVID reaffirmation rout","title_zh":"二十大权力巩固叠加清零重申，消费遭重创"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"On November 11, 2022, China announced its 20 Measures to optimize COVID controls, materially relaxing quarantine requirements; by December 7 the full abandonment of zero-COVID was confirmed. Food & Beverage was the single biggest beneficiary, surging +38.3% -- the top-ranked Shenwan sector -- versus SHCOMP +14.4%, as investors front-loaded the reopening consumption thesis: baijiu gifting, restaurant dining, Spring Festival spending, and travel hospitality were all expected to surge on pent-up demand. Media (+35.3%) and Building Materials (+30.5%) also led, confirming a broad domestic-demand reflation rotation. Energy sectors (Coal +4.0%, Power Equipment +0.4%) lagged sharply, completing the cyclical-to-consumer handoff.","body_zh":"2022年11月11日，国务院发布\"二十条\"优化防控措施，大幅放宽隔离要求；12月7日正式宣布全面放开。食品饮料成为最大受益板块，涨幅+38.3%，位列申万行业第一，显著跑赢上证综指（+14.4%）。投资者提前布局复苏消费逻辑：白酒礼赠、餐饮堂食、春节消费及旅游接待均预期在积压需求释放下大幅反弹。传媒（+35.3%）、建材（+30.5%）同步领涨，印证宽基内需反弹轮动特征。煤炭（+4.0%）、电力设备（+0.4%）大幅落后，完成周期向消费的风格切换。","drivers":["China zero-COVID pivot Nov-2022 (20 Measures)","pent-up revenge-consumption front-run","baijiu gifting and Spring Festival positioning","broad domestic-demand reflation","cyclical-to-consumer rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2022年11月\"二十条\"防疫政策转向","报复性消费预期抢跑布局","白酒礼赠及春节备货定价","宽基内需反弹行情","周期向消费的风格切换"],"title":"Zero-COVID pivot sparks revenge-consumption rally","title_zh":"防疫政策急转，报复性消费预期引爆行情"},"2023-03-02":{"body":"The consumption recovery that markets priced in never materialized at the expected scale. China entered deflation (CPI turned negative in July 2023) as households rebuilt savings rather than spending, and the property market crisis deepened throughout 2023, destroying the wealth effect that underpins premium baijiu gifting. SHCOMP fell -15.8% over the period; defensives (Coal +2.2%, Banks -3.1%, Utilities -5.7%) clearly outperformed cyclicals (-22.6%) -- the ctx explicitly flags flight-to-safety rotation. Food & Beverage fell -27.3%, worse than the index, reflecting baijiu channel inventory overhang (distributors had pre-stocked aggressively post-reopening), Feitian Moutai wholesale price compression (down approximately 33% from peak by mid-2024), and sustained foreign-fund outflows from China equities across 2023.","body_zh":"市场此前预期的消费复苏并未以预期规模兑现：居民倾向增加储蓄而非消费，中国于2023年7月进入通缩（CPI转负），房地产危机持续恶化，摧毁支撑高端白酒礼赠需求的财富效应。上证综指下跌-15.8%，防御板块（煤炭+2.2%、银行-3.1%、公用事业-5.7%）显著跑赢周期板块（-22.6%），行情数据明确显示避险轮动特征。食品饮料下跌-27.3%，跌幅超过指数，反映经销商复苏后激进备货形成的渠道库存积压、飞天茅台批价较高点跌逾33%，以及2023年全年外资持续净流出中国股市等多重压力。","drivers":["post-reopening consumption disappointment","China deflation (CPI negative Jul-2023)","property-wealth-effect collapse","baijiu channel inventory overhang","sustained foreign-fund outflows 2023"],"drivers_zh":["复苏预期落空","2023年7月CPI转负进入通缩","房地产财富效应崩塌","白酒渠道库存积压","2023年外资持续净流出"],"title":"Reopening disappointment; deflation and property drag","title_zh":"复苏预期落空，通缩与房产危机双重拖累"},"2024-01-31":{"body":"The January 2024 trough was triggered by a snowball derivative cascade that pushed CSI 300 down approximately 6% that month; state-fund (National Team) intervention stabilized the market. The September 24, 2024 PBOC bazooka (RRR cut -50bp, 7-day repo -20bp to 1.5%, LPR reductions) and September 26 Politburo fiscal commitment launched a +49.2% SHCOMP surge through May 2026. However, the rally was entirely tech and AI driven: Telecoms (+271%), Electronics (+196%), Metals (+165%) led while Food & Beverage returned -11.7% -- dead last in the bottom-3. DeepSeek's R1 model launch in January 2025 supercharged the AI narrative. Baijiu industry volumes fell approximately 15% in 2025 and distributor inventory days hit 1,424 days (65% above prior year), making the sector structurally uninvestable in a growth-liquidity tape with a 75.1pp growth-value spread.","body_zh":"2024年1月市场因\"雪球\"结构性产品集中敲入引发踩踏，沪深300单月跌约6%，\"国家队\"随后入市托底。2024年9月24日央行出台组合宽松（降准50bp、7天逆回购降至1.5%、LPR下调）、9月26日政治局表态财政支持，推动上证综指在此后约16个月累计上涨+49.2%。然而本轮行情完全由科技/AI主导：通信（+271%）、电子（+196%）、有色（+165%）领涨，食品饮料回报-11.7%，排名垫底前三。2025年1月DeepSeek R1问世进一步强化AI叙事。白酒行业2025年销量约下滑15%，渠道库存周转天数达1424天（同比+65%），在成长/价值利差高达75.1pp的流动性主题行情中板块缺乏参与空间。","drivers":["Jan-2024 snowball derivative cascade trough","PBOC Sep-2024 bazooka (RRR + repo + LPR)","DeepSeek R1 AI wave Jan-2025","baijiu volume-price collapse and 1424-day inventory","extreme growth-over-value style tilt (+75pp)"],"drivers_zh":["2024年1月雪球产品集中敲入触底","2024年9月央行组合宽松政策","2025年1月DeepSeek R1 AI浪潮","白酒量价齐跌+渠道库存1424天","成长/价值利差75pp历史极值"],"title":"AI/tech wave swamps consumer laggards structurally","title_zh":"AI科技浪潮主导全周期，消费板块结构性垫底"}},"now":"Food & Beverage sits in a confirmed trough phase (pos=0.1, rs_rank 14 of 31, below 200-day MA, -10.4% in the current window) against a tape entirely dominated by AI-tech and cyclical growth. Electronics (+75.5%), Telecoms (+67.7%), and Building Materials (+48.1%) lead while defensives avg -12.1% -- the sector is being doubly penalized by both its defensive labeling and ongoing structural headwinds (baijiu inventory destocking, consumer price deflation, weak gifting/hospitality demand). The SHCOMP is only +1.6% and growth beats value by 18.2pp, signaling a liquidity-theme tape where food/bev earnings-quality and dividend appeal draws zero premium. The sector is in the late stage of the post-2024-trough laggard phase: it bounced nominally from the Jan 2024 low but that entire cycle was a tech-led surge in which food/bev was the bottom-3 performer, suggesting the sector has not yet found a genuinely catalyst-driven floor and needs either a macro shift toward consumption policy stimulus or a meaningful de-rating of growth valuations to rotate attention back.","now_zh":"食品饮料目前处于确认触底阶段（周期位置0.1，相对强弱排名31中第14，低于200日均线，本窗口下跌10.4%），整体市场被AI科技与周期成长主导。电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）、建材（+48.1%）领涨，防御性板块均值-12.1%——该板块因其防御属性叠加白酒库存去化、消费价格通缩、宴请礼赠需求疲弱等结构性压制而双重承压。上证综指仅+1.6%，成长/价值利差达18.2pp，市场呈现流动性驱动主题行情，食饮的业绩确定性与高股息特征无法获得溢价。板块处于2024年1月触底后的补涨尾声，但该轮反弹系科技主导，食饮全程垫底，尚未形成独立的催化剂驱动底部，需等待消费刺激政策落地或成长估值实质性回落方可驱动资金轮动。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_gold":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"China's post-pandemic infrastructure boom drove PPI to multi-decade highs through mid-2021 (ultimately peaking at +13.5% YoY in October 2021), lifting the entire A-share metals complex in a broad cyclical-value rotation. Shenwan Metals rose 62.5% and Steel 53.5% over this leg, while defensives like Food & Bev fell -20.3%, confirming a risk-on cyclical-value tape. Gold miners rallied as leveraged beta on rising commodity prices; this was not a gold-specific safe-haven bid but rather a materials/infrastructure wave, consistent with growth underperforming value by 9.7pp during the window.","body_zh":"疫后基建热潮推动工业品出厂价格（PPI）升至数十年高位（2021年10月同比涨幅达+13.5%），带动A股金属板块整体上行，形成周期价值轮动。申万有色金属涨62.5%、钢铁涨53.5%，食品饮料等防御板块跌-20.3%，确认为典型的周期风险偏好行情。黄金矿业跟随大宗商品普涨，属于高弹性贝塔收益，并非黄金避险属性驱动；成长风格跑输价值风格9.7个百分点亦印证本轮为政策/周期价值轮动。","drivers":["China PPI supercycle","Post-COVID infra spending","Cyclical-value rotation","Metals/Steel sector beta","SHCOMP broad rally +5.6%"],"drivers_zh":["中国PPI超级周期","疫后基建支出","周期价值轮动","有色/钢铁板块联动","上证综指整体上行+5.6%"],"title":"Commodity supercycle lifts metals and gold","title_zh":"大宗商品超级周期带动金属与黄金上涨"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"Evergrande's cash-crunch warning letter circulated in late August 2021, triggering a global risk-off shock in September; the SHCOMP fell -16.6% over this leg. The Fed announced its taper in November 2021 and began hiking in March 2022, strengthening the USD and pressuring real assets. Crucially, Shenwan Metals fell -31.7% and Steel -40.3% -- the worst laggards in the universe -- while Coal held positive (+16.9%), showing gold miners fell with the broader commodity complex on China credit shock and Fed tightening, not as a safe-haven outperformer.","body_zh":"2021年8月末恒大集团资金危机警告函流出，9月引发全球风险规避冲击，上证综指本段下跌-16.6%。2021年11月美联储宣布Taper，2022年3月开启加息周期，美元走强压制实物资产。申万有色金属跌-31.7%、钢铁跌-40.3%，位居全行业末位，而煤炭维持正收益（+16.9%），表明黄金矿业随整体商品板块因中国信用冲击和美联储收紧而下跌，并非以避险属性逆市抗跌。","drivers":["Evergrande default shock","Fed taper/rate hike cycle","USD strengthening","China credit crunch","Broad SHCOMP drawdown -16.6%"],"drivers_zh":["恒大违约冲击","美联储Taper/加息周期","美元走强","中国信用收紧","上证综指整体下行-16.6%"],"title":"Evergrande shock and Fed taper crush materials","title_zh":"恒大冲击与美联储Taper压垮大宗商品"},"2022-05-19":{"body":"Gold price bottomed near $1,622/oz on September 26, 2022 as the DXY peaked at ~114.8; from that inflection the gold bull began. The PBOC disclosed a 32-tonne gold purchase in November 2022 -- its first reported buying since September 2019 -- launching an 18-month buying streak that anchored the de-dollarization narrative. China exited zero-COVID in December 2022, adding a domestic-reopening tailwind. SHCOMP rose +7.8% over this leg; growth stocks (Computers +50.8%, Media +49.5%) led, but gold miners delivered 60.2% by riding the synchronized dollar-cycle turn and PBOC-driven bullion rerating.","body_zh":"2022年9月26日金价触底约1622美元/盎司，美元指数（DXY）同期见顶约114.8，黄金新一轮牛市由此启动。中国央行于2022年11月披露增持32吨黄金，为2019年9月以来首次公开增持，由此开启长达18个月的持续购金周期，强化去美元化叙事。2022年12月中国放开新冠管控，国内经济复苏预期形成额外利好。本段上证综指涨+7.8%，成长股领涨（计算机+50.8%、传媒+49.5%），但黄金矿业以60.2%的涨幅受益于美元周期拐点与央行增持黄金重估逻辑双重驱动。","drivers":["DXY peak / dollar reversal","PBOC gold buying (Nov 2022 restart)","Zero-COVID exit reopening","Global central bank de-dollarization","Gold price recovery from $1,622 trough"],"drivers_zh":["美元指数见顶/反转","央行增持黄金（2022年11月重启）","新冠管控放开/经济重启","全球央行去美元化","金价从1622美元低点回升"],"title":"Dollar peaks, PBOC gold buying ignites major rally","title_zh":"美元见顶、央行增持黄金引爆大涨"},"2023-04-14":{"body":"China's economic recovery proved deeply disappointing: CPI turned negative mid-2023, the property sector crisis deepened with cascading developer defaults, and youth unemployment hit record highs. The SHCOMP fell -17.4% -- a broad index drawdown -- with defensives leading relatively (Coal +2.0%, Banks -5.9%) while cyclicals averaged -21.3% and computers collapsed -36.1%. Gold miners fell -23.3% in this risk-off, value-led rotation, tracking the cyclical complex lower as China-specific macro pessimism and deflation fears overwhelmed any safe-haven gold bid.","body_zh":"中国经济复苏大幅低于预期：2023年中CPI转负，房地产危机持续深化，开发商违约浪潮蔓延，青年失业率创历史新高。上证综指下跌-17.4%，防御性板块相对占优（煤炭+2.0%，银行-5.9%），而周期性板块平均跌-21.3%，计算机暴跌-36.1%。黄金矿业跌-23.3%，跟随周期板块整体下行，中国宏观悲观情绪与通缩压力盖过了黄金的避险吸引力。","drivers":["China CPI deflation","Property sector collapse","SHCOMP broad drawdown -17.4%","Risk-off cyclical underperformance","China macro disappointment"],"drivers_zh":["中国CPI通缩","房地产行业持续下滑","上证综指大跌-17.4%","风险规避周期板块跑输","中国宏观数据持续低于预期"],"title":"China deflation and property spiral hit cyclicals","title_zh":"中国通缩与房地产螺旋下行压制周期板块"},"2024-01-22":{"body":"Gold broke to successive all-time highs through Q1-Q2 2024, surpassing $2,400/oz and peaking near $2,480/oz in mid-July 2024, fueled by ongoing PBOC buying (running for 18 consecutive months through May 2024), persistent global central-bank de-dollarization demand, and Fed rate-cut expectations. The SHCOMP rose +8.0%; Shenwan Metals led at +21.4%, alongside Utilities and Telecoms as yield proxies. Gold miners surged 72.9%, outperforming the broad metals complex as leveraged equity exposure to the gold price record run.","body_zh":"2024年一至二季度金价连续刷新历史高点，突破2400美元/盎司，并于7月中旬触及约2480美元/盎司的阶段性顶部，核心驱动来自中国央行持续购金（截至2024年5月累计增持长达18个月）、全球央行去美元化需求持续，以及市场对美联储降息的强烈预期。上证综指涨+8.0%，申万有色金属领涨+21.4%，公用事业与通信板块紧随其后。黄金矿业大涨72.9%，作为金价创纪录上行的杠杆权益工具，涨幅显著超越大盘与整体金属板块。","drivers":["PBOC 18-month gold buying streak","Gold all-time highs above $2,400","Fed rate cut expectations","Global de-dollarization","Shenwan Metals sector leadership +21.4%"],"drivers_zh":["央行18个月连续购金","金价突破2400美元历史新高","美联储降息预期","全球去美元化","申万有色金属板块领涨+21.4%"],"title":"PBOC gold buying, dollar softens: new cycle peak","title_zh":"央行持续购金叠加美元走弱：新一轮周期顶点"},"2024-07-16":{"body":"Gold peaked at approximately $2,480/oz in mid-July 2024 and sold off sharply as the DXY rebounded on pushback against near-term Fed cut expectations, triggering profit-taking from institutional investors. The PBOC had paused its gold buying streak in May 2024 (after 18 consecutive months), removing a key demand anchor. The SHCOMP fell -8.1%; Shenwan Metals fell -18.3%; Brokers and Conglomerates were the only positive sectors, confirming a broad derisking wave rather than sector rotation into gold. Gold miners fell -23.4%, beta-amplifying the bullion correction.","body_zh":"2024年7月中旬金价见顶约2480美元/盎司，随后随美元指数因市场压缩美联储近期降息预期而反弹而大幅回落，机构投资者大规模获利了结。中国央行于2024年5月暂停购金（此前连续增持18个月），关键需求支撑消失。上证综指下跌-8.1%，申万有色金属跌-18.3%，仅券商、多元金融等少数板块收正，确认为全面去杠杆行情。黄金矿业跌-23.4%，以杠杆效应放大金价回调。","drivers":["DXY rebound on delayed Fed cut pricing","PBOC gold buying pause (May 2024)","Gold price correction from $2,480 peak","Broad SHCOMP risk-off -8.1%","Profit-taking after 72% run"],"drivers_zh":["美元指数反弹/美联储降息预期后移","央行暂停购金（2024年5月）","金价从2480美元高点回调","上证综指整体风险规避-8.1%","前期72%涨幅引发获利了结"],"title":"Dollar rebound and PBOC gold pause trigger correction","title_zh":"美元反弹与央行暂停购金引发回调"},"2024-09-09":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced simultaneous RRR cut of 50bps, repo rate cut of 20bps, and mortgage down-payment reduction; a Politburo economic meeting on September 26 pledged further fiscal support, sending the SHCOMP up 26% in five trading days (its largest rally since 2008). The PBOC resumed gold buying in November 2024, adding 15+ consecutive months of official accumulation as gold powered to an all-time high of $5,597/oz on January 29, 2026. Shenwan Metals rose +202% -- the top-performing sector in the entire universe -- as gold miners captured both the SHCOMP beta surge and the autonomous bullion bull run.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，中国央行行长潘功胜宣布同步实施降准50个基点、逆回购利率下调20个基点及首套房首付比例下调等一揽子货币宽松政策；9月26日政治局经济工作会议随即跟进，承诺进一步财政支持；上证综指五个交易日飙涨26%，创2008年以来最大涨幅。央行于2024年11月重启购金，此后连续增持逾15个月，推动金价于2026年1月29日创下5597美元/盎司的历史新高。申万有色金属板块涨幅高达+202%，位列全行业第一，黄金矿业同时受益于上证综指贝塔行情与金价自主牛市的双重驱动。","drivers":["PBOC Sept-24 bazooka stimulus","Politburo fiscal pledge Sept-26 2024","PBOC resumes gold buying (Nov 2024)","Gold all-time high $5,597 Jan 29 2026","Massive SHCOMP beta rally +51.9%"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月24日一揽子刺激政策","政治局9月26日财政承诺","央行重启购金（2024年11月）","金价历史新高5597美元（2026年1月29日）","上证综指大涨51.9%强力贝塔行情"],"title":"PBOC bazooka + gold to $5,597: historic 198% surge","title_zh":"央行一揽子刺激叠加金价飙至5597美元：历史性198%暴涨"},"2026-01-29":{"body":"Gold peaked at $5,597/oz on January 29, 2026 and fell roughly 25% to the $4,165 area by late June 2026, triggered initially by the nomination of hawkish Fed Chair candidate Kevin Warsh which drove the USD higher and unleashed massive profit-taking. Major Chinese banks (ICBC, CCB, Postal Savings, Ping An, Guangfa) shut retail investor access to Shanghai Gold Exchange trading, forcing liquidations. Meanwhile the A-share tape rotated hard into AI/tech: Telecoms +64.7%, Electronics +60.1% led while gold miners fell -48.3%. The SHCOMP was only -3.1%, confirming this was a sector-specific correction driven by bullion's parabolic unwind, not a market-wide bear.","body_zh":"2026年1月29日金价触及5597美元/盎司历史顶部，至2026年6月下旬已回落约25%至4165美元区域。初始触发因素为市场预期强硬派美联储主席候选人（凯文·沃什）获任命，推动美元走强并引发大规模获利了结。工行、建行、邮储银行、平安银行、广发银行等主要银行相继关闭个人客户在上海黄金交易所的交易通道，强制平仓加剧抛压。与此同时，A股行情大幅轮动至AI/科技板块：通信+64.7%、电子+60.1%领涨，黄金矿业跌-48.3%。上证综指仅跌-3.1%，说明此次调整为行业特定性下跌而非系统性熊市，黄金矿业独自承受金价抛物线式回调的冲击。","drivers":["Gold parabolic peak at $5,597 Jan-2026","Hawkish Fed Chair nomination (Warsh)","Chinese banks shut retail gold trading","AI/tech rotation absorbs A-share flows","USD strength / profit-taking"],"drivers_zh":["金价1月2026年抛物线顶部5597美元","强硬派美联储主席提名（沃什）","中国银行关闭个人黄金交易渠道","AI/科技行情吸走A股资金","美元走强/获利了结"],"title":"Gold corrects from $5,597; AI tech rotation dominates","title_zh":"金价从5597美元高位回调；AI科技行情主导A股"}},"now":"China Gold Miners are at a trough/bottoming phase (pos=1.0, rs_rank=22/31), down -21% in the current window against a SHCOMP that is only +1.6%. The tape is a risk-on, growth-led beta rally in which Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) dominate -- a classic AI/tech rotation that crowds out commodity names. Defensives average -12.1% while cyclicals average +0.3%, confirming the market is not broadly lifting materials. Gold miners are lagging because bullion has corrected sharply from its January 2026 all-time high (~$5,597/oz) toward the $4,000-4,200 range, retail gold trading access on the Shanghai Gold Exchange has been curtailed by major Chinese banks (ICBC, CCB, Postal Savings), and investor attention has pivoted decisively to domestic AI and semiconductor names. The sector sits well below its 200-day moving average with no buy signal active; the bottoming read is consistent with gold price correction finding a floor rather than any positive domestic catalyst having emerged yet.","now_zh":"中国黄金矿业板块当前处于筑底阶段（位置值1.0，相对强度排名22/31），本期窗口下跌-21%，而同期上证综指仅上涨1.6%。当前行情为成长风格主导的风险偏好上行，电子（+75.5%）与通信（+67.7%）领涨，资金集中流入AI/科技轮动，商品类板块明显承压。防御性行业均值-12.1%，周期性行业均值+0.3%，说明大盘并未全面拉动资源类。黄金矿业落后的核心原因在于金价已从2026年1月29日历史高点（约5597美元/盎司）大幅回调至4000-4200美元区间，多家主要银行（工行、建行、邮储银行等）已限制个人投资者通过上海黄金交易所参与黄金交易，同时资金大规模流入国内AI半导体板块。板块股价仍处于200日均线之下，无买入信号，筑底性质与金价回调寻底相符，尚无国内积极催化剂出现。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_insurers":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-2021 to May 2023 the SHCOMP fell -3.5% as zero-COVID lockdowns disrupted consumption and Beijing's common prosperity crackdown hammered internet/platform and consumer names (Food and Bev -24%, Pharma -27%, Bldg Mat -28%). Insurers' +10.9% relative gain was not organic sector strength but a value rotation: capital fled crushed consumer defensives and repositioned into construction, media, telecoms and financials -- the co-leaders of this window. Premium growth stalled in 2021-22 but the December 2021 CBIRC Solvency Regulation Rules II confirmed state backing of large listed franchises, providing a regulatory floor that attracted capital looking for defensible low-beta yield.","body_zh":"2021年中至2023年5月，上证综指下跌3.5%，清零政策重创消费需求，共同富裕监管重锤打击互联网/消费平台（食饮-24%、医药-27%、建材-28%）。保险板块+10.9%的相对收益并非行业基本面驱动，而是价值轮动的结果：资金从被重创的消费防御性板块流出，转入建筑、传媒、电信及金融等联合领涨板块。保费收入增长在2021-22年停滞，但2021年12月银保监会出台偿付能力监管规则（二期），确认国家对大型上市险企的背书，为寻求低贝塔收益的资金提供了监管底部支撑，从而吸引了部分避险资金流入。","drivers":["zero-COVID consumption disruption","common prosperity regulatory crackdown on internet/consumer","value-over-consumer-defensives rotation","CBIRC solvency rules II regulatory backstop","capital flight from food/bev/pharma names"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策重创消费需求","共同富裕监管打压互联网/消费平台","价值股相对消费防御股轮动","银保监会偿付能力二期规则监管背书","资金从食饮/医药板块大规模流出"],"title":"Zero-COVID Value Rotation Lifts Financials","title_zh":"清零政策冲击消费，价值轮动提振金融"},"2023-05-08":{"body":"Insurers collapsed -31% from May 2023 to January 2024, dramatically underperforming a SHCOMP that itself fell -15.1%. The sector-specific damage was driven by two converging forces: first, CGB 10-year yields fell from roughly 2.9% to 2.5% through mid-2023, widening the structural duration gap (Chinese lifers carried roughly 7-year asset-liability duration mismatches per their own SEC filings) and eroding new-business-value discount rate assumptions; second, property contagion intensified -- a Hong Kong court ordered Evergrande's liquidation in January 2024 and China Vanke requested debt extensions in Q4 2023, threatening insurer fixed-income portfolios that held developer bonds. The value-led tape (coal/autos barely positive, media/construction/real estate worst) confirmed this was broad macro distress where insurance amplified the index beta via investment-return risk.","body_zh":"2023年5月至2024年1月，保险板块暴跌-31%，大幅跑输同期下跌15.1%的上证综指，呈现明显的行业特异性杀跌。两大因素叠加共振：其一，10年期国债收益率从约2.9%跌至2.5%，加剧了结构性久期缺口危机（国内寿险公司资产负债久期错配约达7年，据其美国证监会文件披露），压缩新业务价值精算假设；其二，房地产传染风险升级——香港法院于2024年1月裁定恒大清盘，万科则于2023年四季度申请债务展期，直接威胁险企持有开发商债券的固收投资组合。价值主导格局（煤炭/汽车勉强收正，传媒/建筑/地产领跌）印证了这是宏观层面的系统性困境，保险通过投资回报风险渠道放大了市场Beta暴露。","drivers":["CGB 10Y yield decline compressing NBV discount rates","7-year asset-liability duration mismatch widening","Evergrande HK court liquidation order January 2024","Vanke debt extension requests Q4 2023","broad SHCOMP down-leg amplified via investment-return beta"],"drivers_zh":["国债收益率下行压缩新业务价值折现率","约7年资产负债久期错配扩大","恒大2024年1月被香港法院裁定清盘","万科2023年四季度申请债务展期","上证综指下行通过投资回报渠道放大保险Beta暴露"],"title":"Duration Gap Crisis and Property Contagion","title_zh":"久期缺口危机叠加房地产传染风险"},"2024-01-12":{"body":"Insurers surged +85.4% from January 2024 to November 2024, massively outperforming the SHCOMP's +20.4% in a broker-led financials rally. The defining catalyst was the PBOC's September 24 2024 mega-stimulus package: a 50bp RRR cut releasing roughly 1 trillion yuan in liquidity, a 20bp cut to the 7-day reverse repo rate, and critically a 500 billion yuan swap facility allowing insurers, brokers and funds to pledge assets to the PBOC and buy equities directly. This made insurers direct beneficiaries of a named policy tool, not just beta participants. The equity market surge -- CSI 300 posted its biggest single-day gain since July 2020 -- immediately boosted insurer investment portfolios, while H1 2024 aggregate net profit for the five listed insurers rose roughly 12.5% year-on-year and average dividend yields near 5% attracted foreign value re-rating. Brokers led at +59.9% but insurers nearly matched on the investment-return boost.","body_zh":"2024年1月至11月，保险板块大涨+85.4%，远超同期上证综指+20.4%的涨幅，行情由以证券为首的金融板块引领。核心催化剂为央行2024年9月24日推出的超级宽松政策组合：降准50个基点（释放约1万亿元流动性）、7天逆回购利率下调20个基点，以及最关键的5000亿元互换便利工具，允许险企、券商和公募以资产质押从央行获取流动性后直接增持股票。这使保险公司成为定向政策工具的直接受益方，而非单纯的指数Beta跟随者。股市大涨（沪深300单日涨幅创2020年7月以来最大）即刻提振险企权益投资组合；2024年上半年五大上市险企净利润合计同比增长约12.5%，约5%的平均股息率共同吸引了外资价值重估。证券领涨+59.9%，保险凭借投资回报弹性紧随其后。","drivers":["PBOC Sept-24 RRR cut 50bp and 500bn yuan equity swap facility","direct insurer equity purchase mandate via PBOC tool","CSI 300 biggest single-day rally since July 2020","H1 2024 net profit +12.5% YoY and 5% dividend yield rerating","property contagion peak passing as policy backstop firmed"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月24日降准50bp+5000亿元互换便利","险企获准通过央行工具直接参与股票增持","沪深300单日涨幅创2020年7月以来最大","2024年上半年净利润同比+12.5%及5%股息率吸引价值重估","房地产传染高峰过去，政策托底预期确立"],"title":"PBOC Mega-Stimulus and Insurer Equity Facility","title_zh":"央行超级宽松+险资入市工具，保险大涨"},"2024-11-07":{"body":"Insurers fell -21.2% from November 2024 to April 2025, worse than the SHCOMP's -10.8%, in a flight-to-safety rotation where banks (+1.6%) were the sole refuge and cyclicals (-14.8%) led declines. The CGB 10-year yield broke below 2% for the first time on record in late November 2024 -- Bloomberg confirmed the 1.9636% reading on December 2 2024 -- and fell further to roughly 1.6% by early 2025, catastrophically widening the investment spread compression on insurer liabilities priced at 3-4% guaranteed returns. Trump's election victory on November 5 2024 immediately intensified tariff escalation fears, driving risk-off capital into banks and out of yield-sensitive financials. The PBOC's September stimulus momentum faded, NBV improvements stalled, and property sector stress (Vanke restructuring proceedings) continued to pressure fixed-income portfolios. Insurance underperformed even the defensive bank cluster, confirming spread compression -- not just index beta -- as the core driver.","body_zh":"2024年11月至2025年4月，保险板块下跌-21.2%，跌幅超过上证综指的-10.8%，市场处于典型的避险资金大迁徙格局——银行（+1.6%）是唯一正收益的避风港，周期股（-14.8%）领跌。10年期国债收益率于2024年11月底首次历史性跌破2%（彭博证实2024年12月2日报收1.9636%），并于2025年初进一步下探至约1.6%，与险企3-4%保证收益率负债端之间的利差急剧收窄，形成严峻的利差损风险。特朗普于2024年11月5日赢得大选，即刻激化关税升级预期，避险资金涌入银行股（申万行业中唯一正收益板块），撤离收益率敏感型金融股。央行9月刺激效应消退，新业务价值改善停滞，万科重组进程（贯穿2025年上半年）持续拖累固收投资组合。保险甚至跑输防御性银行板块，印证了利差压缩——而非单纯的指数Beta——才是核心驱动因素。","drivers":["CGB 10Y yield breaking record low below 2% to 1.6%","Trump election tariff escalation driving risk-off rotation","investment spread compression on 3-4% guaranteed-return liabilities","PBOC post-September stimulus momentum fading","Vanke property restructuring stress on fixed-income portfolios"],"drivers_zh":["10年国债收益率历史性跌破2%至1.6%","特朗普胜选引发关税升级担忧，触发避险轮动","3-4%保证收益率负债端投资利差急速压缩","央行9月刺激效应消退","万科房地产重组持续拖累固收投资组合"],"title":"Tariff Shock and Yield Collapse Crush Spreads","title_zh":"关税冲击叠加收益率崩塌，利差严重收窄"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"Insurers rallied +62.9% from April 2025 to January 2026, participating in a broad risk-on surge where the SHCOMP gained +31.9% and cyclicals led defensives by 27 percentage points (37.5% vs 10.0%). The primary macro trigger was the US-China tariff ceasefire and Geneva trade negotiation progress in May 2025, which reversed extreme risk-off positioning and unleashed pent-up A-share beta. The DeepSeek AI re-rating of Chinese tech -- Telecoms +118.6%, Metals +109.5% -- produced a broad animal-spirits rally that lifted all boats including insurance. Insurers benefited via two channels: equity portfolio gains from the stock market surge directly boosted investment returns and reported profits, and NBV assumptions stabilised as long-bond yields found a temporary floor near 1.6-1.8%. At +62.9% insurers significantly underperformed the true growth leaders (Telecoms, Metals, Conglom) but captured broad index beta in a liquidity-driven expansion.","body_zh":"2025年4月至2026年1月，保险板块大涨+62.9%，随市场整体风险偏好回升而共振，上证综指期间涨幅31.9%，周期股领先防御股27个百分点（37.5% vs 10.0%）。核心宏观触发因素为中美关税停战及2025年5月日内瓦贸易谈判取得进展，极端的避险仓位迅速逆转，释放了A股积压的上涨动能。DeepSeek引发中国科技股重新定价——电信+118.6%、有色金属+109.5%——点燃了一场普涨式的动物精神行情，保险板块亦随之受益。保险通过两个渠道获益：股市上涨直接提振权益投资组合收益和报告利润；长期国债收益率在约1.6%-1.8%附近短暂企稳，新业务价值假设趋于稳定。保险+62.9%的涨幅明显落后于电信、有色、综合等真正的成长领头羊，但在流动性扩张行情中充分捕获了宽基指数Beta。","drivers":["US-China tariff ceasefire May 2025 reversing risk-off","DeepSeek/AI broad risk-on re-rating lifting all sectors","SHCOMP +31.9% broad beta rally","equity portfolio gains boosting investment returns","long-bond yield temporary floor stabilising NBV assumptions"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月中美关税停战逆转避险仓位","DeepSeek/AI重新定价引发广泛风险偏好上升","上证综指+31.9%宽基Beta行情","股市上涨直接提振权益投资组合收益","长期国债收益率短暂企稳改善新业务价值假设"],"title":"Tariff Ceasefire and Risk-On Beta Surge","title_zh":"关税停战触发风险偏好回升，保险随市大涨"},"2026-01-07":{"body":"Insurers collapsed -32.6% from January 2026 to June 2026 even as the SHCOMP fell only -0.7% -- pure style rotation, not an index bear market. DeepSeek's R1 model release on January 20 2026 ignited a violent re-rating of Chinese AI and tech (Telecoms +64.2%, Electronics +40.6%, Coal +23.2% via energy/AI infrastructure themes), with the ChiNext Index gaining over 5% on the DeepSeek announcement day alone per Global Times reporting. Capital rotated out of dividend and yield plays -- brokers (-22.3%), retail (-22.6%) and insurers (-32.6%) were the three worst-performing Shenwan clusters -- as the 18.2pp growth-over-value gap dominated the tape. With CGB 10-year yields at roughly 1.73% as of late June 2026, insurers' guaranteed-return liabilities continued to be priced at multiples of available reinvestment rates, making spread economics structurally challenged. The -32.6% selloff against a flat index represents the most extreme style-rotation leg in this series.","body_zh":"2026年1月至6月，保险板块暴跌-32.6%，而上证综指仅下跌-0.7%——这是一场纯粹的风格轮动，而非指数熊市。DeepSeek于2026年1月20日发布R1模型，引爆中国AI/科技股剧烈重估行情（电信+64.2%、电子+40.6%、煤炭+23.2%受益于能源/AI基础设施叙事），创业板指在DeepSeek发布当日单日大涨逾5%（据《环球时报》报道）。资金从股息/收益类资产大规模撤离——证券（-22.3%）、零售（-22.6%）和保险（-32.6%）成为申万行业中跌幅最深的三大板块——成长股超越价值股18.2个百分点主导全局。以2026年6月底约1.73%的10年期国债收益率为背景，险企保证收益率负债仍数倍于可再投资利率，利差经济性在结构上面临严峻挑战。在指数几乎平收的背景下暴跌-32.6%，是本系列历史上最极端的风格轮动压制行情。","drivers":["DeepSeek R1 Jan-20 2026 AI re-rating igniting tech surge","growth-over-value 18.2pp tape dominance","CGB 10Y yield 1.73% record-low structural spread compression","capital rotation out of dividend/yield plays into AI/tech","Telecoms/Electronics absorbing all incremental flows"],"drivers_zh":["DeepSeek R1于2026年1月20日发布引发AI重新定价","成长股领先价值股18.2个百分点主导全局","10年国债收益率1.73%历史低位加剧结构性利差压缩","资金从高股息/收益类资产大规模轮出至AI/科技","电信/电子板块持续虹吸增量资金"],"title":"DeepSeek Style Rotation Kills Dividend Plays","title_zh":"DeepSeek引爆成长轮动，高息股遭遇重创"}},"now":"Insurers are in a confirmed Bottoming/Trough phase (rs_rank 17/31, below 200d MA, BUY signal triggered) after a -32.6% style-rotation selloff from the Jan-2026 peak. The current tape is a pure growth-over-value regime: Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7% lead while SHCOMP is barely +1.6% -- the index is flat but capital is violently rotating away from yield/dividend plays into AI/tech thematic names. Insurers face a dual headwind: the CGB 10-year yield near 1.73% record lows compresses new-business-value discount rates and investment spreads, while the DeepSeek/AI thematic boom has pulled discretionary institutional capital into semiconductor and telecoms hardware. The -26.1% current-window return versus a +1.6% SHCOMP shows extreme relative underperformance consistent with trough washout conditions; a mean-reversion entry requires either a CGB yield stabilisation signal or a growth/value style rotation reversal.","now_zh":"保险板块处于明确的筑底阶段（相对强弱排名17/31，股价位于200日均线下方，系统已触发买入信号），此前经历了自2026年1月高点以来-32.6%的风格轮动式暴跌。当前市场为纯粹的成长压制价值格局：电子+75.5%、电信+67.7%强势领跑，而上证综指仅微涨+1.6%，指数原地踏步，资本却在剧烈轮动，撤离股息/收益类资产。保险面临双重压力：10年期国债收益率跌至约1.73%历史低位，压缩新业务价值折现率与投资利差；DeepSeek/AI主题热潮将增量资金吸入半导体与电信硬件赛道，致使价值/高息板块极度失宠。当前窗口-26.1%的回报与上证+1.6%的强烈对比，显示出典型的周期底部超卖特征。胜率信号对应约23%的历史复苏概率，风险收益比逐步改善，但仍需催化剂触发，或为国债收益率企稳（央行政策转向），或为成长/价值风格轮动逆转。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_med_devices":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From June 2021, A-shares entered a dual-carbon policy-driven rally: Power Equipment (+36.9%), Defense (+30.0%), and Metals (+29.8%) led as Beijing channeled capital into green infrastructure around China's dual-carbon targets. Medical Devices & TCM gained +11.6%, lagging cyclical leaders but riding the broad risk-on beta lift (SHCOMP +3.2%, cyclicals +10.0% vs defensives -1.0%). VBP headwinds kept upside contained: the November 2020 national coronary stent tender had imposed 95% price cuts, and in September 2021 a second national VBP for artificial joints (Tianjin tender) announced average hip/knee price reductions of 80-84%. These procurement shocks suppressed revenue-visibility sentiment for device makers, preventing the sector from matching cyclical peers. The gain was primarily index beta, not sector-specific outperformance.","body_zh":"2021年6月起，A股进入「双碳」政策驱动的周期性行情：新能源设备（+36.9%）、国防军工（+30.0%）、有色金属（+29.8%）领涨，资金向绿色基础设施集中。医疗器械与中药上涨11.6%，弱于周期龙头，但受益于市场整体风险偏好回升（上证综指+3.2%，周期股+10.0%，防御股-1.0%）。集采政策持续压制上行空间：2020年11月冠脉支架全国集采价格降幅达95%，2021年9月天津人工关节集采再宣布髋膝关节平均降价80-84%，令器械企业收入预期持续承压，板块涨幅主要来自市场贝塔，非行业自身驱动。","drivers":["dual-carbon green energy rotation","broad risk-on beta","VBP coronary stent 95% price cuts","artificial joint VBP Sep-2021","SHCOMP cyclical beta"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策新能源轮动","整体风险偏好贝塔","冠脉支架全国集采降价95%","人工关节集采2021年9月","上证综指周期贝塔"],"title":"Cyclical-Led Green Rally, Modest Beta Lift","title_zh":"双碳政策驱动周期股领涨，医疗跟随修复"},"2022-01-04":{"body":"SHCOMP fell -15.6% as global growth-stock sentiment collapsed under Fed rate-hike fear (US 10Y yield rose sharply from Jan 2022 as markets priced in four-plus hikes). The sector fell -23.4%, worse than the index, with Coal barely positive (+0.6%) and value leading while growth names including electronics (-25.2%) and media (-28.6%) led declines. The PBOC cut 1Y LPR by 10bp and 5Y LPR by 5bp on January 20, 2022 — its first 5Y cut since April 2020 — but the move was too small to reverse sentiment. Critically, the April 2022 implementation date for the September 2021 artificial-joint VBP tender (hip prices cut from ~35,000 to ~7,000 CNY; knees from ~32,000 to ~5,000 CNY) weighed on device-maker earnings forecasts. Medical devices underperformed even versus other growth sectors, caught between global rate shock and domestic procurement compression.","body_zh":"美联储加息预期大幅升温（2022年1月美债10年期收益率快速上行，市场定价超过4次加息），上证综指重挫15.6%。医疗器械板块下跌23.4%，跌幅超过大盘，煤炭（+0.6%）等价值股逆势持平，成长属性更强的电子（-25.2%）、传媒（-28.6%）等领跌。央行于2022年1月20日下调1年期LPR 10个基点、5年期LPR 5个基点（为2020年4月以来首次5年期下调），但力度偏小，难以扭转市场情绪。关键背景是：2021年9月人工关节集采中标结果将于2022年4月落地执行（髋关节均价从3.5万元降至约7千元，膝关节从3.2万元降至约5千元），器械企业盈利预测持续下修，板块同时承受全球利率冲击与国内集采压缩的双重压力。","drivers":["Fed rate-hike shock","SHCOMP broad selloff","VBP artificial joint implementation","PBOC LPR cut insufficient","global growth-stock derating"],"drivers_zh":["美联储加息冲击","上证综指整体下行","人工关节集采落地","央行LPR降息力度偏小","全球成长股估值重估"],"title":"Fed Shock and VBP Implementation Selloff","title_zh":"美联储加息冲击叠加集采落地，板块大幅下挫"},"2022-03-15":{"body":"SHCOMP rebounded +11.1% from its March 2022 trough, with a value rotation (Autos +29.2%, Coal +28.2%, Beauty +27.4%); growth lagged (Computers -6.2%). Medical Devices & TCM outperformed dramatically at +34.1%, ranking above index peers. Two catalysts drove the outsized gain: (1) the PBOC cut the 5Y LPR by a further 15bp on May 20, 2022 and the RRR by 25bp on April 25, providing broad liquidity; (2) Shanghai's April 2022 Omicron lockdown generated extraordinary demand for TCM antivirals — Lianhua Qingwen tablets from Yiling Pharmaceutical sold out nationwide, creating revenue windfalls for TCM franchises. The State Council's May 2022 33-point stimulus package (May 31, 2022) and domestic-substitution policy for medical devices boosted the sector narrative further. Value-led but medical devices captured both TCM antiviral demand and the post-VBP relief trade.","body_zh":"上证综指从2022年3月低点反弹11.1%，呈价值风格轮动（汽车+29.2%、煤炭+28.2%、美容+27.4%），成长股跑输（计算机-6.2%）。医疗器械与中药大幅跑赢，上涨34.1%，超越大多数申万行业。核心催化剂有两项：（1）央行于2022年5月20日再次下调5年期LPR 15个基点，并于4月25日降准25个基点，释放流动性；（2）上海2022年4月奥密克戎封控期间产生抗病毒中药的爆发性需求——以岭药业连花清瘟全国断货，为中药品牌创造显著收益弹性。国务院2022年5月31日出台的33条一揽子刺激政策以及医疗器械国产替代政策进一步提振行业预期。价值风格主导行情中，医疗器械依靠中药防疫需求与集采靴子落地后的修复叠加，实现超额表现。","drivers":["PBOC RRR cut Apr-2022","LPR 5Y cut May-2022","TCM antiviral demand Shanghai lockdown","State Council 33-point stimulus","domestic device substitution policy"],"drivers_zh":["央行2022年4月降准","5年期LPR 2022年5月下调","上海封控中药抗疫需求爆发","国务院33条一揽子刺激政策","医疗器械国产替代政策"],"title":"Post-Lockdown Stimulus and TCM Demand Surge","title_zh":"后封控刺激政策出台与中药抗疫需求激增"},"2022-07-04":{"body":"SHCOMP fell -9.3% as the Fed's 75bp rate hikes in June and July 2022 — the fastest pace since Volcker — triggered global risk-off. Defensives outperformed cyclicals on the surface (-12.5% vs -8.5%) because energy names (Coal +3.1%, Oil & Gas +1.0%) cushioned cyclicals while defensives ex-energy lagged. Pharma fell -22.3% and Building Materials -22.6%. Medical Devices & TCM fell -19.3%, tracking the broader healthcare/growth selloff rather than benefiting from any defensive status. RMB weakened, capital flows reversed, and zero-COVID continuation reduced hospital utilization expectations. The TCM antiviral demand narrative that had supported Leg 3 faded as the initial Omicron wave passed.","body_zh":"美联储于2022年6月、7月连续加息75个基点（自沃尔克以来最快紧缩节奏），触发全球风险规避情绪，上证综指下跌9.3%。防御股整体跌幅（-12.5%）大于周期股（-8.5%），主要因为煤炭（+3.1%）、油气（+1.0%）等能源品种提供缓冲，而医药（-22.3%）、建材（-22.6%）跌幅突出。医疗器械与中药下跌19.3%，跟随医药及成长板块整体下行，未能享受防御属性保护。人民币走弱、资本外流、新冠清零政策持续压制医院诊疗量预期，第三段行情中中药防疫需求的叙事逻辑在奥密克戎疫情消退后也随之褪色。","drivers":["Fed 75bp hikes global risk-off","RMB depreciation capital outflow","zero-COVID hospital utilization drag","energy-sector offset distorts defensives read","TCM antiviral demand exhaustion"],"drivers_zh":["美联储75bp加息触发全球风险规避","人民币贬值与资本外流","新冠清零压制医院就诊量","能源板块缓冲掩盖防御股分化","中药防疫需求消退"],"title":"Global Risk-Off; Energy Rotates, Healthcare Drops","title_zh":"全球风险规避，能源资源逆势，医疗继续下行"},"2022-09-23":{"body":"SHCOMP rose +6.5% as zero-COVID dismantling signals drove a reopening rally (Computers +32.6%, Media +27.4%, Services +23.9%); growth led over cyclicals (defensives +9.6% vs cyclicals +3.9%, growth +8pp). Medical Devices & TCM jumped +28.4%, outperforming the index by 22pp. The key catalyst was China's December 7, 2022 announcement of the New 10 epidemic prevention policy, officially ending dynamic zero-COVID. TCM franchises led: Lianhua Qingwen (Yiling Pharma) and other TCM brands surged on another wave of Omicron antiviral demand as China reopened without adequate Western antiviral supply. Domestic device makers benefited from the expectation of pent-up hospital demand recovery. Style tilted growth as markets anticipated a broad economic reopening.","body_zh":"上证综指上涨6.5%，在新冠清零退出信号推动下走出\"重开\"行情（计算机+32.6%、传媒+27.4%、社会服务+23.9%），成长风格跑赢（防御股+9.6%，周期股+3.9%，成长股超额约8个百分点）。医疗器械与中药大涨28.4%，超出大盘22个百分点。核心催化剂为2022年12月7日国务院公布\"新十条\"防控优化措施，正式宣告动态清零政策终结。中药品牌率先受益：以岭药业连花清瘟在国内奥密克戎蔓延背景下再度供不应求，推动中药板块集体拉升。国产医疗器械企业则受益于积压医疗需求加速释放的预期。市场整体切换成长风格，预期经济全面重开。","drivers":["Dec-7 2022 zero-COVID exit announcement","TCM antiviral Omicron demand wave 2","pent-up hospital demand recovery","reopening growth re-rating","SHCOMP growth leadership"],"drivers_zh":["2022年12月7日新十条政策出台","奥密克戎第二波中药抗病毒需求","积压医疗需求加速释放","重开预期推动成长股重估","上证综指成长风格主导"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit and TCM Antiviral Windfall","title_zh":"新冠清零退出预期与中药抗病毒需求激增"},"2023-02-20":{"body":"The longest and deepest leg: -30.7% over 19 months as SHCOMP fell -17.4%. Defensives (Telecoms +0.8%, Banks -0.3%) outperformed deeply negative cyclicals (-28.1%) — a classic flight-to-safety rotation. Two sector-specific sledgehammers drove medical devices below index: (1) In July 2023, the NHC plus nine government agencies launched a year-long nationwide anti-corruption campaign (xingfeng zhengfeng) targeting hospitals, device distributors, and pharma sales networks — by August 7, 2023 alone, the crackdown wiped ~200 billion CNY from A-share healthcare market caps; over 200 hospital directors and CCP officials were investigated or detained. (2) Continued VBP expansion (spinal implants, trauma fixation devices in 2022; follow-on rounds in 2023-2024) compressed device revenue and margins. The macro backdrop of property-sector deflation, CPI near zero, and weak consumer demand prevented any sector-level recovery.","body_zh":"这是持续时间最长、幅度最深的一段调整：历时约19个月，医疗器械与中药下跌30.7%，上证综指同期下跌17.4%。防御股（通信+0.8%、银行-0.3%）明显跑赢大幅下挫的周期股（-28.1%），呈典型避险轮动格局。两项行业特有冲击将医疗器械拖至大盘以下：（1）2023年7月，国家卫健委联合9部委启动为期一年的医疗行业全国整治行动（行风整治），重点打击医院、器械经销商及药企销售网络腐败行为——仅2023年8月7日单日，A股医疗板块市值蒸发逾2000亿元，逾200名院长及党委书记遭立案调查或主动投案；（2）国家集采持续扩围（2022年脊柱创伤类，2023-2024年多轮跟进），器械企业收入与利润空间持续受压。宏观层面房地产通缩、CPI接近零、消费需求持续疲弱，令板块难以自发修复。","drivers":["NHC anti-corruption campaign Jul-2023","200B CNY healthcare market cap wipeout Aug-2023","ongoing VBP expansion spinal and trauma devices","property deflation macro drag","SHCOMP flight-to-safety rotation"],"drivers_zh":["2023年7月卫健委联合9部委反腐整治","2023年8月单日医疗市值蒸发2000亿元","集采持续扩围脊柱及创伤类器械","房地产通缩宏观拖累","上证综指避险轮动"],"title":"Anti-Corruption Campaign and Deflation Grind","title_zh":"医疗反腐风暴叠加通缩压力，板块持续承压"},"2024-09-18":{"body":"SHCOMP surged +28.4% in just three weeks — one of the sharpest rallies in a decade. Medical Devices & TCM jumped +48.1%, broadly in line with market leaders (Beauty +57.8%, Computers +57.4%, Brokers +50.8%), participating fully in the beta surge. The catalysts were precisely dated: September 24, 2024 — PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a package including a 50bp RRR cut (~1 trillion CNY liquidity), 7-day repo rate cut of 20bp, 30bp MLF cut, and mortgage rate reductions. September 26, 2024 — an unusual mid-cycle Politburo meeting chaired by Xi Jinping pledged to stop the housing market decline and meet the 5% GDP target. All sectors participated; the move was pure index beta amplified by short-covering in previously beaten-down healthcare names. No fundamental change in VBP or anti-corruption policy occurred.","body_zh":"上证综指仅用约三周时间暴涨28.4%，创近十年最大短期涨幅。医疗器械与中药上涨48.1%，与市场领涨板块基本同步（美容+57.8%、计算机+57.4%、券商+50.8%），充分参与市场贝塔行情。催化剂时间节点明确：2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子货币政策措施，包括降准50个基点（释放约1万亿元长期资金）、7天逆回购利率下调20个基点、MLF利率下调30个基点及存量房贷利率调整；2024年9月26日，习近平主持超常规中央政治局会议，明确提出要求房地产市场\"止跌回稳\"并力争完成全年5%经济增长目标。所有行业均全面参与上涨，医疗器械弹性主要来自超跌空间较大的空头回补，集采及反腐政策本身并无实质性转变。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24 mega package RRR+repo+MLF cuts","Politburo Sep-26 housing stop-decline pledge","short-covering in oversold healthcare","pure index beta surge","market liquidity injection"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月24日一揽子降准降息组合","政治局9月26日房地产止跌回稳表态","医疗超跌空头回补","纯粹指数贝塔行情","市场流动性大规模投放"],"title":"PBOC-Politburo Mega-Stimulus Shock Rally","title_zh":"央行+政治局超级刺激冲击式反弹"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"Despite SHCOMP rising +15.4% from Oct-2024 through June 2026, Medical Devices & TCM fell -37.9% — an extreme 53pp relative underperformance. Leadership was concentrated in AI-infrastructure hardware: Telecoms +207.2%, Electronics +162.4%, Conglom +80.5%; growth massively outpaced value (+52.5pp). The causal mechanism is capital rotation rather than fundamental deterioration: Bloomberg (June 10, 2026) confirmed the CSI Healthcare Index reached record-low P/B of ~2.7x, below even the 2008 GFC trough, as domestic institutions concentrated in semiconductor and AI-hardware names. Cyclicals (+17.3%) outpaced defensives (-14.3%), placing Medical Devices in the worst cohort alongside Real Estate (-22.8%), Food & Bev (-34.7%), and Beauty (-41.8%). Structurally: anti-corruption policy enforcement continued into 2024 (criminal code amendments effective March 2024 set life imprisonment for healthcare bribery), and no new VBP relief was signaled.","body_zh":"尽管上证综指从2024年10月至2026年6月累计上涨15.4%，医疗器械与中药却下跌37.9%，相对大盘的超额亏损高达53个百分点，创该板块有记录以来最差相对表现。市场领涨高度集中于AI基础设施硬件：通信+207.2%、电子+162.4%、综合+80.5%，成长股相对价值股溢价达52.5个百分点。本段核心逻辑是资本轮动而非基本面恶化：彭博社2026年6月10日证实，沪深300医疗卫生指数市净率降至约2.7倍历史低点，低于2008年金融危机时的估值底部，折射出机构资金向半导体及AI硬件高度集中的结构性趋势。周期股（+17.3%）大幅跑赢防御股（-14.3%），医疗器械与房地产（-22.8%）、食品饮料（-34.7%）、美容（-41.8%）同处最差梯队。结构层面：医疗反腐执法持续推进，2024年3月起施行的刑法修正案将行贿医疗人员最高刑罚提升至无期徒刑，且无集采减压利好信号出现。","drivers":["AI-hardware thematic rotation Telecoms+Electronics","extreme growth-over-value +52.5pp spread","record-low healthcare P/B valuation","anti-corruption criminal code hardening Mar-2024","no VBP relief signal"],"drivers_zh":["AI基础设施主题轮动电子通信领涨","成长股对价值股溢价高达52.5个百分点","医疗板块市净率创历史新低","2024年3月医疗行贿刑法修正施行","集采政策无实质减压信号"],"title":"AI Thematic Rotation Crushes Healthcare","title_zh":"AI主题大轮动重创医疗板块"}},"now":"Medical Devices & TCM is at a confirmed trough (pos=0.10, rs_rank=18/31, below 200-day MA, -24.3% trailing). The current regime is an extreme growth-over-value rotation: Electronics +75.5% and Telecoms +67.7% lead while Medical Devices sits at -22.0%, a 22pp gap to the growth leaders (growth-minus-value +18.2pp, cyclicals +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%). Per Bloomberg (June 10, 2026), the CSI Healthcare Index trades at ~2.7x P/B, a record low below even the 2008 GFC trough, as domestic capital concentrates in AI-hardware and semiconductor names. No buy signal is active; the setup is structural bottoming-watch, not an imminent reversal.","now_zh":"医疗器械与中药目前处于明确底部区间（位置分位0.10，相对强弱排名18/31，股价低于200日均线，近期窗口回报-24.3%）。当前市场处于极端成长风格主导格局：电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）领涨，而医疗板块以-22.0%居于落后方，成长股较价值股溢价高达18.2个百分点。据彭博社2026年6月10日报道，沪深300医疗卫生指数市净率约2.7倍，创历史新低，低于2008年金融危机时的估值底部，折射出资金向AI算力及半导体硬件极度集中配置的结构性趋势。当前无买入信号，板块仍处于等待底部确认阶段。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_metals":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"The global post-COVID reflation trade sent LME copper to an all-time record above $10,700/ton on May 10 2021, with inventories at 15-year lows and supply pipelines structurally constrained. China A-share metals producers were the primary equity vehicle for this macro theme: Metals led (62.5%) and Steel followed (53.5%) in a deep value/cyclical rotation (cyclicals avg +21.5% vs defensives -3.9%), with SHCOMP +5.6%. PBoC remained accommodative and the EV/renewable green-capex demand narrative amplified the structural supply-shortage story. The 59% basket gain tracked the commodity price surge closely rather than any stock-specific driver.","body_zh":"全球新冠后再通胀交易推动LME铜价于2021年5月10日创历史新高，突破10,700美元/吨，当时库存处于15年低点，供应管道结构性受限。A股有色金属生产商是承接这一宏观主题的核心权益载体：有色（+62.5%）与钢铁（+53.5%）领涨，深度价值/周期风格明显（周期均值+21.5% vs 防御均值-3.9%），上证综指同期+5.6%。人民银行维持宽松立场，新能源车/可再生能源绿色资本开支叙事进一步强化了供给短缺逻辑。该板块59%的涨幅主要跟随大宗商品价格上行，而非个股基本面驱动。","drivers":["Global reflation / post-COVID demand recovery","LME copper record high May 2021","EV and green-capex structural demand","Inventory at 15-year lows / supply squeeze","PBoC accommodative policy"],"drivers_zh":["全球再通胀/新冠后需求复苏","LME铜价2021年5月创历史新高","新能源车及绿色资本开支结构性需求","库存处于15年低位/供给挤压","人民银行宽松立场"],"title":"Commodity Supercycle: Copper Hits Record High","title_zh":"大宗商品超级周期：铜价创历史新高"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"China's coal power crisis erupted in September 2021 — over 20 provinces rationed electricity, shutting smelter capacity and amplifying metal supply concerns briefly, but Beijing intervened aggressively in mid-October: it capped coal prices, mandated higher domestic output, and directly attacked speculative commodity positions. Aluminum and zinc pulled back sharply as the energy-scarcity premium was extracted from prices. Concurrently, Evergrande's default fears peaked in September 2021, reinforcing a risk-off rotation: defensives led (Agriculture +14.3%, Food & Bev +9.6%) while Metals fell -22.5% and Steel -34.5%. The ctx confirms flight-to-safety (defensives flat vs cyclicals -12.4%) consistent with policy-driven commodity price collapse, not fundamental demand destruction.","body_zh":"中国煤电危机于2021年9月爆发，逾20个省份实施限电，短暂关闭冶炼产能并放大金属供应担忧，但北京随即于10月中旬强力干预：限制煤炭价格、强制扩大国内产量并直接打压商品投机头寸。铝和锌价格大幅回落，能源短缺溢价被快速消化。与此同时，恒大违约风险于2021年9月达到顶峰，进一步强化了避险切换：农业（+14.3%）、食品饮料（+9.6%）领涨，有色（-22.5%）、钢铁（-34.5%）领跌。行情背景印证了防御主导的避险轮动（防御均值持平 vs 周期均值-12.4%），与政策驱动大宗商品价格崩塌逻辑一致，而非基本面需求破坏。","drivers":["Beijing energy crisis / power rationing Sep-Oct 2021","Government commodity price crackdown mid-Oct 2021","Evergrande default risk peak","Flight-to-safety rotation away from cyclicals","Aluminum and zinc supply premium unwound"],"drivers_zh":["北京能源危机/限电（2021年9-10月）","政府10月中旬打压大宗商品价格","恒大违约风险见顶","资金避险切换、远离周期板块","铝锌供应溢价消退"],"title":"Energy Crisis and Beijing Commodity Crackdown","title_zh":"能源危机与北京大宗商品调控打压"},"2021-11-16":{"body":"China's policy pivot began in earnest: the PBoC delivered a 50bp RRR cut in December 2021 (releasing ~$188bn in liquidity) and the Politburo signaled property-sector stabilization, collapsing the Evergrande contagion premium. Coal, Construction, and Steel co-led (value tape, cyclicals avg +4.6% vs defensives -2.1%), reflecting the policy reflation trade. Then Russia invaded Ukraine on February 24, 2022, spiking copper to a record $10,845/ton in early March — a supply-shock boost that pushed the metals basket to its local peak on March 3, 2022 just as the commodity surge peaked.","body_zh":"中国政策转向明确落地：2021年12月人民银行实施50bp全面降准（释放约1880亿美元流动性），政治局发出房地产市场稳定信号，恒大传染溢价迅速消退。煤炭、建筑、钢铁联袂领涨（价值风格，周期均值+4.6% vs 防御均值-2.1%），反映政策再通胀交易逻辑。随后2022年2月24日俄罗斯入侵乌克兰，铜价于3月初飙升至历史新高10,845美元/吨——供给冲击将有色板块推至2022年3月3日的阶段性高点，与大宗商品价格峰值同步。","drivers":["PBoC 50bp RRR cut December 2021","Politburo property stabilization signal","Russia-Ukraine war Feb 2022 / supply shock","Copper hit record $10,845/ton March 2022","Policy-driven value/cyclical rotation"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行2021年12月降准50bp","政治局房地产稳定信号","俄乌战争2022年2月/供给冲击","铜价2022年3月创历史新高10,845美元/吨","政策驱动价值/周期轮动"],"title":"PBoC Easing and Russia-Ukraine Commodity Spike","title_zh":"央行宽松加持，俄乌冲突推升大宗商品"},"2022-03-03":{"body":"Three simultaneous shocks compressed the metals basket 29% over eight months. The Fed began hiking in March 2022 and ultimately raised rates by 525bp, strengthening the USD and crushing commodity demand expectations globally. Shanghai entered a brutal two-month lockdown (April-June 2022), gutting Chinese industrial activity. The domestic property crisis deepened — 30+ developers defaulted following Evergrande, suppressing steel/copper end-demand from construction. The SHCOMP fell -16.9%, making the sector move largely index beta (ctx: no obvious cyclical vs defensive spread, Defense and Coal were relative safe havens). Metals underperformed as the most leveraged China-demand-proxy cyclical.","body_zh":"三重冲击叠加令有色板块在8个月内下跌29%。美联储于2022年3月启动加息，累计上调525bp，美元走强压制全球大宗商品需求预期。上海经历长达两个月的严格封控（4月至6月），中国工业活动受到严重拖累。国内房地产危机持续恶化——在恒大之后，逾30家开发商相继违约，建筑业对钢铁/铜的终端需求大幅萎缩。上证综指下跌16.9%，板块跌幅很大程度上是指数Beta表现（从行情背景看，防御/周期利差并不显著，国防和煤炭为相对避风港）。有色作为对中国需求最敏感的周期板块，跑输其余板块。","drivers":["Fed rate hiking cycle 525bp 2022-2023","USD strength / commodity demand destruction","Shanghai COVID lockdown Apr-Jun 2022","China property crisis: 30+ developer defaults","SHCOMP -16.9% broad index drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2022-2023年加息周期累计525bp","美元走强/大宗商品需求破坏","上海封控2022年4-6月","中国地产危机：逾30家开发商违约","上证综指-16.9%全面下跌"],"title":"Fed Hikes, Shanghai Lockdown, Property Crisis Triple Hit","title_zh":"美联储加息、上海封控、地产危机三重打压"},"2022-10-31":{"body":"China's abrupt abandonment of Zero-COVID in November-December 2022 (Class A to B reclassification announced December 26) triggered a reopening demand recovery for industrial metals. Copper jumped above $9,000/ton in January 2023 for the first time since June 2022. Alongside this, the November 2022 '16 measures' for property sector support, successive LPR cuts (5-year LPR cut to 4.2% by June 2023), and ongoing infrastructure stimulus extended the recovery through early 2024. The ctx shows defensives slightly outpacing cyclicals (10.0% vs 2.7%) over this long 18-month leg with a value style tilt, reflecting a grinding recovery rather than a risk-on surge. Copper eventually recovered toward $10,000/ton by May 2024 as AI infrastructure and grid-upgrade themes added a structural demand layer.","body_zh":"中国于2022年11月至12月骤然放弃清零政策（12月26日宣布新冠降级为乙类管理），触发工业金属重开需求复苏。2023年1月铜价自2022年6月以来首次重回9,000美元/吨上方。与此同时，2022年11月出台的房地产\"16条\"支持措施、连续多次5年期LPR下调（至2023年6月降至4.2%）以及持续推进的基础设施刺激，将复苏延伸至2024年初。行情背景显示，在这段长达18个月的上行行情中，防御板块略微领先周期板块（10.0% vs 2.7%），价值风格占优，反映出这是一次缓慢磨底式复苏而非风险全面偏好的大涨。至2024年5月，随着AI基础设施和电网升级主题带来新的结构性需求支撑，铜价逐步回升至10,000美元/吨附近。","drivers":["Zero-COVID abandonment Dec 2022 / reopening","Property '16 measures' Nov 2022 + LPR cuts","Copper recovery $9,000+ Jan 2023","Infrastructure stimulus multi-year rollout","AI data center and grid-upgrade copper demand emerging"],"drivers_zh":["清零政策2022年12月终结/经济重开","2022年11月房地产\"16条\"+LPR下调","铜价2023年1月回升至9,000美元以上","多年基础设施刺激持续推进","AI数据中心及电网升级铜需求开始显现"],"title":"Zero-COVID End and Reopening Recovery","title_zh":"清零政策终结与经济重开复苏"},"2024-05-20":{"body":"The metals basket rolled over as two forces collided. China's property sector remained structurally impaired despite multiple support rounds — floor space under construction and real estate investment showed persistent negative growth, suppressing ferrous and non-ferrous end-demand. Simultaneously, the Fed's higher-for-longer stance kept the USD elevated through summer 2024, weighing on dollar-denominated commodity prices. The ctx confirms broad risk-off (SHCOMP -14.2%, defensives -15.8% vs cyclicals -21.0%) — metals underperformed even the broader down-market, as capital rotated into Electronics (-7.5%, the least-bad sector) away from construction-linked materials. The basket fell 25.4% in just under four months.","body_zh":"双重因素叠加导致有色板块见顶回落。尽管经历多轮支持政策，中国房地产市场仍面临结构性困境——在建面积及房地产投资持续负增长，压制黑色与有色金属终端需求。与此同时，美联储\"更高更久\"立场使美元在2024年夏季保持高位，压制以美元计价的大宗商品价格。行情背景印证了全面风险规避（上证综指-14.2%，防御均值-15.8% vs 周期均值-21.0%）——有色板块在市场普遍下跌中跑输大盘，资金流向相对抗跌的电子板块（-7.5%），远离建筑链相关材料。该板块在不到四个月内下跌25.4%。","drivers":["China property sector structural demand impairment","USD higher-for-longer / Fed hold through Aug 2024","SHCOMP -14.2% broad market down-leg","Cyclicals underperformed defensives in risk-off","Capital rotation into tech/Electronics"],"drivers_zh":["中国地产结构性需求持续受损","美元\"更高更久\"/美联储按兵不动至2024年8月","上证综指-14.2%全面下跌","风险规避中周期跑输防御","资金轮动至科技/电子板块"],"title":"Property Demand Disappointment and USD Rebound","title_zh":"地产需求持续失望与美元反弹双重压制"},"2024-09-11":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, the PBoC delivered its largest stimulus package in years: a 50bp RRR cut (releasing ~RMB 1 trillion in liquidity), simultaneous policy rate and mortgage rate cuts, and targeted property market support. The CSI 300 surged 35% in six sessions — its biggest weekly gain since 2008. Metals, as the highest-beta cyclical, led the entire Shenwan universe at +199.4%. The rally then extended through 2025 on a second structural driver: AI data center buildout and China's State Grid $90bn grid investment plan intensified copper demand, with the metal reaching a record $13,387/ton on the LME in January 2026. DeepSeek's January 2025 debut amplified China tech optimism, sustaining risk-on and growth/cyclical co-leadership. The basket gained 243% over 16 months — the single largest leg in its history.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，人民银行推出力度最大的一揽子刺激政策：降准50bp（释放约1万亿元人民币流动性），同步下调政策利率与存量房贷利率，并出台定向房地产支持措施。沪深300指数6个交易日累计上涨35%，创2008年以来最大单周涨幅。有色金属作为Beta最高的周期板块，在申万全行业中以+199.4%高居榜首。此后涨势延续至2025年，第二大结构性驱动力持续发力：AI数据中心建设浪潮与国家电网900亿美元电网投资计划强化铜需求，金属价格于2026年1月在LME创下13,387美元/吨历史新高。2025年1月DeepSeek发布进一步提振中国科技信心，风险偏好维持高位，成长与周期联袂领涨。该板块在16个月内累计上涨243%，为历史最大单边行情。","drivers":["PBoC Sep 24 2024 bazooka: 50bp RRR cut + rate cuts","CSI 300 +35% in 6 sessions / bull market trigger","AI data center copper demand structural driver","State Grid $90bn investment plan 2025","DeepSeek Jan 2025 China tech optimism"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日全面宽松：降准50bp+降息","沪深300六日涨35%/牛市触发","AI数据中心铜需求结构性驱动","国家电网2025年900亿美元投资计划","DeepSeek 2025年1月发布提振中国科技乐观情绪"],"title":"PBoC Bazooka Stimulus and AI Copper Superdrive","title_zh":"央行火力全开+AI铜需求超级驱动"},"2026-01-29":{"body":"After copper hit $13,387/ton on January 29, 2026, the metals basket entered a sharp -32% correction as the market rotated violently from cyclicals to growth/tech. The Trump administration escalated tariff threats (potential 100%+ China tariffs discussed), injecting uncertainty into China's export-dependent industrial supply chain and metals demand outlook. Simultaneously, China announced output growth target cuts for non-ferrous metals (September 2025 policy), signaling overcapacity concerns. Capital flowed aggressively into Electronics (+60.1%) and Telecoms (+64.7%) — the AI/tech theme captured the marginal dollar. The ctx notably shows SHCOMP only -3.1% while the basket fell -32%, confirming this is a sector-specific de-rating (style shift from value/commodity to growth/tech) rather than a market-wide selloff.","body_zh":"2026年1月29日铜价触及13,387美元/吨历史高位后，有色板块开启-32%的急剧回调，资金从周期板块大幅轮动至成长/科技。特朗普政府升级关税威胁（讨论对华加征100%以上关税），令中国出口依赖型工业供应链及金属需求前景充满不确定性。与此同时，中国于2025年9月宣布下调有色金属产量增长目标，释放产能过剩的政策信号。资金大举流入电子（+60.1%）和通信（+64.7%）板块，AI/科技主题牢牢占据增量资金主导权。值得注意的是，上证综指仅下跌3.1%，而该板块跌幅达32%，印证这是板块层面的估值重估（风格从价值/商品切换至成长/科技），而非全市场普跌。","drivers":["Trump tariff escalation risk / trade war uncertainty","China non-ferrous output target cuts Sep 2025","Capital rotation: tech/AI vs commodity-cyclicals","Post-record copper mean reversion after 243% run","SHCOMP -3.1% but metals -32%: pure style de-rating"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普关税升级风险/贸易战不确定性","中国2025年9月有色金属产量目标下调","资金轮动：科技/AI vs 商品周期","铜价历史新高后均值回归（前期累计涨243%）","上证综指仅-3.1%但有色-32%：纯风格重估"],"title":"Tariff Risk and Growth Rotation Out of Cyclicals","title_zh":"关税风险与成长轮动带来的周期退潮"}},"now":"Industrial Metals is currently in a Trough/Bottoming phase, sitting at the 13.9th percentile of its 5-year range with the basket below its 200-day moving average and no buy signal active. The now_ctx shows the basket returned -3.8% over the current window while the broader SHCOMP gained +1.6%, confirming persistent underperformance against the index. The tape is a growth/AI rotation: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) dominate while cyclicals average only +0.3% and defensives are -12.1%, meaning the basket is losing even in a risk-on environment — capital is flowing to theme-driven tech, not commodity exposure. A potential base is forming after the -32% drawdown from the January 2026 peak, but a catalyst re-engagement (renewed PBoC easing, confirmed infrastructure demand acceleration, or tariff de-escalation) is required to reverse the growth-over-value rotation.","now_zh":"有色金属板块当前处于\"底部整固\"阶段，位于5年历史区间的13.9百分位，股价仍低于200日均线，暂无买入信号触发。当前窗口内该板块回报率为-3.8%，而上证综指同期上涨1.6%，持续跑输大盘。市场风格为成长/AI主题主导：电子（+75.5%）与通信（+67.7%）领涨，周期板块均值仅+0.3%，防御板块均值-12.1%，即便在整体风险偏好改善的背景下，资金依然流向科技主题而非商品资产。经历1月高点以来-32%的回调后，估值初现底部特征，但需明确催化剂（如央行再度宽松、基建需求加速或关税局势缓和）才能实现由成长向价值/周期的风格切换。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_pharma_cxo":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-2021, China's A-share market rotated hard into value and commodities: Power Equipment, Metals, and Coal led while SHCOMP fell 4.6% over the full leg. The innovative pharma and CXO basket recovered 19.7% from its mid-2021 trough — a period compressed by the NMPA's November 2021 CDE circular warning against homogenized me-too drug development and ongoing VBP pricing pressure cycles. Growth underperformed value by 6.5pp, meaning pharma's recovery was a modest relative bounce within a broad value/cyclical tape rather than a sector-specific surge. WuXi AppTec's FY2021 revenue grew 38.5% and net profit 72%, providing fundamental support even as the macro style environment capped upside.","body_zh":"2021年中起，A股市场强烈转向价值与周期：电力设备、有色、煤炭领涨，上证综指全程下跌4.6%。创新药与CXO板块从2021年中低点反弹19.7%，但彼时正受NMPA药品审评中心（CDE）2021年11月发布的《以临床价值为导向的抗肿瘤药物临床研发指导原则》压制，叠加集采降价周期持续；成长风格跑输价值6.5个百分点，本轮修复属于价值/周期主导行情中的温和反弹而非板块独立行情。药明康德FY2021收入增长38.5%、净利润增长72%，提供基本面支撑，但宏观风格环境制约了上行空间。","drivers":["NMPA CDE me-too guidance pressure","VBP drug pricing cycle","commodity/value tape crowding out growth","SHCOMP decline caps beta"],"drivers_zh":["药监局CDE同质化新药指导原则压力","集采降价周期","商品/价值风格挤压成长","上证下跌压制Beta"],"title":"Post-crackdown trough; modest CXO recovery","title_zh":"监管压制后筑底，CXO温和修复"},"2022-07-06":{"body":"From the July 2022 peak, Innovative Pharma & CXO fell 28.2% — one of the worst performers across Shenwan industries (alongside Electronics and Building Materials), while Coal, Conglomerates, and Oil & Gas held flat to modestly positive. SHCOMP fell 11.2% over the window. The primary drivers were: extended Shanghai lockdowns (April-June 2022 full city shutdown), aggressive Fed rate-hike cycle (150bps June-July 2022) that triggered CNY depreciation and EM risk-off, and global biotech funding collapse that hurt CXO order visibility. The basket's high-growth valuation (WuXi AppTec traded at 57x P/E as recently as early 2022) made it especially vulnerable to duration-risk repricing in a risk-off environment.","body_zh":"自2022年7月高点起，创新药与CXO板块下跌28.2%，为申万各行业最差之列（与电子、建材并列），而煤炭、综合、油气等板块基本持平甚至微涨；上证综指同期下跌11.2%。主要驱动因素：上海封城（2022年4-6月全市封控）、美联储激进加息周期（6-7月合计加息150bps）引发人民币贬值与新兴市场风险规避，以及全球生物科技融资崩塌导致CXO订单能见度下降。板块高成长估值（药明康德2022年初A股市盈率约57倍）在风险规避环境下对久期重估尤为脆弱。","drivers":["Shanghai zero-COVID lockdown Apr-Jun 2022","Fed 150bps rate hikes Jun-Jul 2022 risk-off","CNY depreciation EM outflows","high-growth valuation duration repricing","global biotech funding drought"],"drivers_zh":["上海新冠封城2022年4-6月","美联储激进加息150bps风险规避","人民币贬值新兴市场资金外流","高成长估值久期重估","全球生物科技融资枯竭"],"title":"Zero-COVID lockdown + Fed shock selloff","title_zh":"新冠封控叠加美联储冲击引发大幅抛售"},"2022-10-11":{"body":"From the October 2022 trough, the basket surged 56.5% — the largest single rally leg in the dataset. SHCOMP gained 10.3% as Beijing began signaling an end to zero-COVID: the October 2022 20th Party Congress maintained zero-COVID language but market sentiment shifted, then on December 7, 2022 China's State Council officially announced the pivot away from zero-COVID restrictions including home quarantine for mild cases. Computers, Services, and Media led the broader market (growth beat value 7.8pp), and pharma/CXO surged on two channels: demand recovery for medical products and services post-reopening, and CXO order book normalization as lockdown operational disruptions ended. The MSCI China Index rose 51.7% from the October 31 trough through January 2023, validating the scale of this move.","body_zh":"自2022年10月低点起，板块飙升56.5%，为数据集中最大单段涨幅。上证综指上涨10.3%，北京开始释放结束清零政策信号：2022年10月二十大之后市场情绪转变，12月7日国务院正式宣布取消大规模核酸检测、轻症居家隔离，标志政策彻底转向。计算机、社服、传媒领涨（成长跑赢价值7.8个百分点），创新药/CXO受益于双重逻辑：一是疫后医疗服务需求回升，二是封控结束后CXO订单簿恢复正常。MSCI中国指数自2022年10月底至2023年1月涨幅达51.7%，印证了本轮行情的弹性。","drivers":["Zero-COVID policy pivot Dec 7 2022","20th Party Congress reopening expectation build","CXO order book normalization post-lockdown","growth/liquidity style rerating","SHCOMP +10.3% broad beta tailwind"],"drivers_zh":["2022年12月7日新冠防控转向政策","二十大后重新开放预期积累","封控结束CXO订单簿恢复","成长/流动性风格重估","上证+10.3%大盘Beta顺风"],"title":"Zero-COVID pivot unleashes reopening surge","title_zh":"新冠防控转向引发重新开放大幅反弹"},"2023-02-02":{"body":"The basket fell 21.1% as the post-reopening consensus unravelled: China's post-COVID economic recovery was weaker than expected, with deflation pressures emerging (CPI turned negative by mid-2023) and the property sector worsening (Country Garden debt crisis accelerating into the summer). SHCOMP fell 6.3% over the leg. Crucially the Shenwan signal shows Telecoms and Media led while defensives and cyclicals both fell, with growth still beating value 8.3pp — meaning pharma's selloff was sector-specific, not a broad growth-off rotation. The pharmaceutical sector saw its first comprehensive revenue and profit decline in 40 years in 2023, biotech financing fell back to 2017 levels, and investor concern about a US Biosecure legislative threat (early drafts circulated mid-2023) hit CXO names specifically.","body_zh":"板块下跌21.1%，疫后复苏逻辑瓦解：中国经济恢复弱于预期，通缩压力显现（2023年中CPI转负），地产持续恶化（碧桂园债务危机升级）。上证综指下跌6.3%。申万行业信号显示通信、传媒领涨，防御与周期均下跌，成长仍跑赢价值8.3个百分点——说明医药板块跌幅属于行业特异性而非大类成长风格杀跌。2023年全年医药行业收入与利润首次出现40年来的双重全面下滑，生物科技融资跌回2017年水平，美国《生物安全法案》（BIOSECURE Act）草案于2023年中流传引发市场对CXO中国企业的特定担忧。","drivers":["Post-COVID deflation and weak demand recovery","Pharmaceutical revenue/profit first 40-yr decline","Biotech financing drought 2023","Property sector deterioration (Country Garden)","Early Biosecure Act CXO risk concern"],"drivers_zh":["疫后通缩压力与需求复苏偏弱","医药行业40年首次营收利润双降","2023年生物科技融资寒冬","地产持续恶化（碧桂园债务危机）","《生物安全法案》早期草案冲击CXO"],"title":"Reopening disappointment + industry funding drought","title_zh":"重新开放预期落空叠加行业融资寒冬"},"2023-08-23":{"body":"The basket rallied 22.6% from the August 2023 trough in a notable outperformance against a flat SHCOMP (-0.8%): Pharma was the second-best Shenwan leader at +12.3%, behind only Electronics (+13.4%). This was a pharma-specific catalyst: 2023 became a landmark year for China's biotech out-licensing boom, with Chinese biotechs executing a record 63+ cross-region deals (80% increase vs 2022), total disclosed transaction value exceeding $35bn including the BMS-Systimmune $800m upfront EGFRxHER3 ADC deal. ADC and GLP-1 therapy excitement drove multiple mega-deals that validated China's innovative drug pipeline globally, lifting the entire CXO supply chain on order visibility.","body_zh":"板块自2023年8月低点反弹22.6%，在上证综指几乎持平（-0.8%）的背景下实现显著超额收益：申万医药行业以+12.3%位列第二，仅次于电子（+13.4%），呈现典型的板块特异性行情。催化剂明确：2023年成为中国生物科技授权出口的标志性年份，中国企业完成63+跨境许可交易（同比增长80%），披露总金额超350亿美元，其中百时美施贵宝与SystematicImmune就EGFRxHER3双抗ADC签署8亿美元首付款协议创历史纪录；ADC与GLP-1赛道热度点燃市场对创新管线的全球信心，带动整个CXO供应链订单能见度提升。","drivers":["China out-licensing deal boom H2 2023 (63+ deals, $35bn)","ADC and GLP-1 deal narrative momentum","BMS-Systimmune $800m upfront landmark deal","CXO order visibility improvement","Pharma-specific sector leadership vs flat SHCOMP"],"drivers_zh":["2023年下半年创新药授权出口井喷（63+笔交易，超350亿美元）","ADC与GLP-1叙事动能","BMS与SystematicImmune 8亿美元首付标志性交易","CXO订单能见度改善","医药板块相对上证综指的独立领涨"],"title":"Out-licensing boom; pharma leads sector rally","title_zh":"创新药授权出口井喷，医药板块领涨"},"2023-11-08":{"body":"The basket fell 32.6% — the second-largest selloff leg — in a broad risk-off episode. SHCOMP fell 11.5%, with Coal (+15.2%) and Banks (+4.0%) the only Shenwan leaders; defensives fell 10.5%, cyclicals fell 15.4%, and value beat growth by 15.9pp, a classic flight-to-safety (hard risk-off, not sector preference). On top of the index pressure, pharma/CXO had two sector-specific headwinds: the Biosecure Act was formally introduced in January 2024, immediately hitting WuXi AppTec and WuXi Biologics (whose HK-listed shares fell 40-51% in early 2024); and USD 7.4/CNY weakness as Trump election premium was priced into 2024. Foreign fund outflows from China accelerated through late 2023 as growth-off sentiment prevailed.","body_zh":"板块下跌32.6%，为数据集中第二大跌幅，属于系统性风险规避行情。上证综指下跌11.5%，仅煤炭（+15.2%）与银行（+4.0%）等少数板块收涨；防御跌10.5%、周期跌15.4%，价值风格跑赢成长15.9个百分点，为典型避险特征（大盘系统性下行，非板块主动承压）。在指数压力之上，医药/CXO还承受两大行业特异性利空：《生物安全法案》于2024年1月正式提交国会，直接冲击药明康德、药明生物（港股跌幅40-51%）；以及特朗普胜选预期推动美元走强，人民币贬至7.4，外资加速撤离。","drivers":["Broad China market risk-off (SHCOMP -11.5%)","BIOSECURE Act introduced Jan 2024 (WuXi -40-51%)","Property crisis (Country Garden default Sep 2023)","Value/defensive rotation against growth 15.9pp","Foreign capital outflows, CNY 7.4 weakness"],"drivers_zh":["大盘系统性风险规避（上证-11.5%）","《生物安全法案》2024年1月提交国会（药明系港股跌40-51%）","地产危机（碧桂园2023年9月违约）","价值/防御相对成长领先15.9个百分点","外资持续流出，人民币贬至7.4"],"title":"Property crisis + Biosecure + broad risk-off flush","title_zh":"地产危机+生物安全立法+大盘系统性风险规避"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The basket surged 63.9% from the February 2024 trough to the October 2024 peak — the second-largest rally leg. SHCOMP gained 29.1%, cyclicals led (28.2%), growth beat value 24.6pp, and Electronics (+65.1%) and Telecoms (+63.1%) led Shenwan. The rally was driven by two distinct phases: (1) February-September 2024 — PBOC cut the 5-year LPR by 25bps (largest single cut since the 2019 LPR reform), CSRC launched a market stabilization package with new leadership, and the 'national team' (Central Huijin) began buying ETFs at scale; (2) September-October 2024 — the September 24 'bazooka' package (PBOC cut policy rate 20bps, RRR 50bps, CNY500bn equity swap facility), triggering the CSI 300's largest weekly gain since 2008. Pharma benefited from index beta + continued out-licensing deal momentum (total 2024 deals reached $51.9bn, up 26% YoY).","body_zh":"板块自2024年2月低点至10月高点累计涨幅63.9%，为数据集第二大涨幅。上证综指涨29.1%，周期领涨（+28.2%），成长跑赢价值24.6个百分点，电子（+65.1%）与通信（+63.1%）领衔申万。行情分两阶段：（1）2024年2-9月——人民币贷款市场报价利率（5年期LPR）降25个基点（2019年LPR改革以来最大单次降幅），证监会新班子启动市场稳定一揽子措施，汇金公司大规模买入宽基ETF；（2）2024年9月24日'一揽子刺激'——降政策利率20bps、降准50bps、设5000亿元非银互换便利，触发沪深300单周涨幅创2008年以来最大。医药板块受益于大盘Beta及创新药授权出口持续放量（2024年全年达519亿美元，同比增26%）。","drivers":["PBOC 5yr LPR -25bps Feb 2024 (largest cut since 2019)","CSRC national team ETF buying, governance push","Sep 24 2024 bazooka: RRR -50bps, CNY500bn equity swap","China out-licensing 2024 record $51.9bn deals","Broad growth/tech style rerating SHCOMP +29.1%"],"drivers_zh":["5年期LPR降25bps（2019年以来最大单次降幅）","证监会国家队大规模买入ETF+公司治理改革","2024年9月24日刺激大礼包：降准50bps+5000亿互换便利","2024年创新药授权出口519亿美元创纪录","上证+29.1%成长/科技大规模风格重估"],"title":"PBOC stimulus + national team stabilize; growth rerates","title_zh":"央行降息+国家队托市，成长风格大规模重估"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"After the September 24 stimulus euphoria, the October 8 NDRC press conference disappointed investors who expected CNY2-10 trillion in direct fiscal stimulus — instead delivering minimal incremental detail, triggering immediate profit-taking (CSI 300 fell despite a +5.9% open on Oct 8). SHCOMP fell 9.2% over the full leg, with Conglomerates, Retail, and Banks defending best while Pharma fell 20.3%, Brokers fell 17.1%, and Beauty fell 25.8%. Trump's November 2024 election victory reignited tariff fears and renewed uncertainty around BIOSECURE Act passage (included in NDAA), both specific headwinds for the CXO/innovative pharma chain. The basket fell 22.6% in under three months.","body_zh":"9月24日刺激情绪高峰后，10月8日国家发改委新闻发布会令投资者大失所望——市场预期2-10万亿元直接财政刺激，实际公告几乎无增量内容，当日沪深300高开即遭抛售（+5.9%高开后迅速回落）。上证综指全程下跌9.2%，综合、零售、银行相对抗跌，医药下跌20.3%、证券下跌17.1%、美容护理下跌25.8%。2024年11月特朗普胜选再度激活关税恐惧，并带来《生物安全法案》（纳入2025财年NDAA）通过预期，均为CXO/创新药链条的特定利空。板块不足三个月内下跌22.6%。","drivers":["Oct 8 NDRC press conference fiscal stimulus disappointment","Trump Nov 2024 election: renewed tariff + Biosecure risks","Profit-taking from extreme Sep 2024 positioning","Pharma-specific Biosecure/tariff overhang","SHCOMP -9.2% broad market pull-back"],"drivers_zh":["10月8日国家发改委新闻发布会财政刺激落空","特朗普2024年11月胜选：关税+生物安全法案风险重燃","9月极端仓位后的获利回吐","医药板块生物安全法/关税特定压制","上证-9.2%大盘回调"],"title":"Stimulus let-down + Trump election fears peak-out","title_zh":"刺激预期落空+特朗普当选引发阶段顶部回调"},"2025-01-10":{"body":"The basket surged 96.5% from January 2025 trough to September 2025 peak — the largest single leg in the dataset — as a confluence of catalysts broke the sector's multi-year funk. SHCOMP gained 20.4% with Telecoms (+77.5%), Conglomerates, and Metals leading, and growth beat value by 22pp. Crucially, China biotech experienced its own 'DeepSeek moment': DeepSeek's January 2025 AI breakthrough created a halo of Chinese innovation credibility; within biotech, Chinese firms signed 64 cross-border out-licensing deals worth $68.3bn in H1 2025 alone — far exceeding full-year 2024. The Hang Seng Biotech Index climbed 80%+ by November 2025. The J.P. Morgan Healthcare Conference noted that over 50% of US IND-approved molecules in 2024 originated from China, crystallizing the sector's global standing. The Trump tariff 90-day pause (August 12, 2025) also temporarily removed a key risk overhang.","body_zh":"板块自2025年1月低点至9月高点累计涨幅96.5%，为数据集最大单段涨幅，多重催化剂共振打破板块多年低迷。上证综指涨20.4%，通信（+77.5%）、综合、有色领涨，成长跑赢价值22个百分点。关键在于中国生物科技迎来自身的'DeepSeek时刻'：2025年1月DeepSeek AI突破树立了中国创新国际可信度，生物科技领域仅上半年便签署64笔跨境授权交易、金额达683亿美元，远超2024年全年；恒生生物科技指数至2025年11月涨幅逾80%；摩根大通医疗健康大会确认2024年全球超50%的IND批准分子源自中国，行业全球地位得到市场高度认可。特朗普关税90天暂停（2025年8月12日）亦临时消除了一大风险。","drivers":["DeepSeek Jan 2025 AI halo for Chinese innovation","China biotech out-licensing H1 2025: $68.3bn, 64 deals","Hang Seng Biotech Index +80%+ by Nov 2025","Trump tariff 90-day pause Aug 12 2025","SHCOMP +20.4% broad growth beta tailwind"],"drivers_zh":["2025年1月DeepSeek AI突破为中国创新加持光环","2025年上半年授权出口683亿美元、64笔交易创纪录","恒生生物科技指数至2025年11月涨逾80%","特朗普关税90天暂停（2025年8月12日）","上证+20.4%成长Beta顺风"],"title":"DeepSeek innovation wave + China biotech moment","title_zh":"DeepSeek创新浪潮+中国生物科技'奇点时刻'"},"2025-09-03":{"body":"The basket fell 21.6% from the September 2025 peak while SHCOMP was essentially flat (0.0%) — a pure sector rotation selloff. Oil & Gas (+31.1%), Coal (+30.5%), and Power Equipment (+29.7%) surged while Pharma (-18.9%), Beauty (-20.8%), and Retail (-12.9%) lagged badly. Cyclicals averaged +10% vs defensives -7.4%, a violent commodity-led rotation. The drivers were an energy supply/geopolitical premium (oil prices elevated) and the end of the biotech euphoria phase as the sector ran into fundamental gravity after the 96.5% run. Sector-specific, the BIOSECURE Act's path to law was becoming clearer (NDAA inclusion debates), creating order-book uncertainty for CXO names that had already priced in optimistic scenarios.","body_zh":"板块自2025年9月高点下跌21.6%，而上证综指几乎持平（0.0%）——典型的纯风格轮动式下跌。油气（+31.1%）、煤炭（+30.5%）、电力设备（+29.7%）大幅上涨，医药（-18.9%）、美容护理（-20.8%）、商贸零售（-12.9%）大幅落后；周期平均+10%对比防御-7.4%，能源商品驱动的风格轮动剧烈。驱动因素：能源供应偏紧叠加地缘溢价推动油价维持高位，以及生物科技狂热阶段在累涨96.5%后遭遇基本面重力；行业层面，《生物安全法案》立法路径逐步明朗（NDAA条款博弈加剧），对已充分定价乐观情形的CXO企业订单预期构成不确定性。","drivers":["Energy/commodity sector rotation (Oil +31%, Coal +30%)","Cyclical vs defensive rotation in flat SHCOMP","Post-96% rally valuation mean-reversion","BIOSECURE Act legislative progress uncertainty","Healthcare/pharma specific profit-taking after H1 2025 surge"],"drivers_zh":["能源/大宗商品风格轮动（油气+31%、煤炭+30%）","上证持平背景下周期/防御的剧烈风格分化","累涨96%后估值均值回归","《生物安全法案》立法进程不确定性","2025年上半年大涨后医药板块获利回吐"],"title":"Energy/commodity rotation crushes healthcare","title_zh":"能源/大宗商品风格轮动，医药遭遇资金净流出"},"2026-03-23":{"body":"The basket rallied 22.4% from the March 2026 trough in 24 days — a sharp bounce with SHCOMP gaining 6.4%, growth beating value 5.4pp, and Telecoms/Metals/Electronics leading. Two pharma-specific catalysts combined with the broad beta rally: the 2026 Government Work Report (released March 2026) formally designated biopharmaceuticals as an 'emerging pillar industry' for the first time alongside semiconductors and aerospace; and Q1 2026 out-licensing deals exceeded $60bn — nearly half of full-year 2025's $135.7bn total in just one quarter. The China-US tariff truce momentum (Trump-Xi meetings) also temporarily reduced sector uncertainty, as Electronics/Telecoms surged on tech decoupling relief.","body_zh":"板块自2026年3月低点24个交易日内反弹22.4%，上证综指上涨6.4%，成长跑赢价值5.4个百分点，通信/有色/电子领涨。创新药两大特定催化剂叠加大盘Beta效应：2026年政府工作报告首次将生物医药与集成电路、航空航天并列为'新兴支柱产业'；同时一季度跨境授权交易超600亿美元，相当于2025年全年1357亿美元的近半数在单季内完成。中美关税休战势头（特习会晤）亦短暂降低板块不确定性，电子/通信受科技脱钩压力缓解而领涨。","drivers":["2026 Govt Work Report: biopharma named pillar industry","Q1 2026 cross-border licensing deals exceed $60bn","China-US tariff truce momentum","Broad growth/tech rally SHCOMP +6.4%","Pharma-specific regulatory recognition"],"drivers_zh":["2026年政府工作报告首次将生物医药列为新兴支柱产业","2026年一季度跨境授权交易超600亿美元","中美关税休战动能","上证+6.4%成长/科技Beta顺风","创新药监管政策积极认定"],"title":"Government pillar industry designation lifts pharma","title_zh":"政府工作报告将生物医药列为支柱产业，板块快速反弹"},"2026-04-16":{"body":"The basket fell 22.8% from the April 2026 peak as a pharma-specific shock hit: on April 2, 2026, President Trump announced 100% tariffs on patented pharmaceutical imports, applied under Section 232 authority, with implementation beginning 120-180 days after the order. Mainland Chinese pharma innovators CSPC Innovation fell 4.6% and Hengrui fell 1.8% on the day of announcement, with the sector continuing to slide. SHCOMP fell 2.4% over the window but Telecoms (+23.7%) and Electronics (+22.7%) continued to rally — tech benefited from the US-China tariff truce on electronics while pharma bore the full brunt of the drug-specific levy. Pharma ranked as the worst Shenwan industry at -16.0%, in a tape where growth still beat value 5.9pp but pharma was clearly left behind.","body_zh":"板块自2026年4月高点下跌22.8%，遭遇板块特异性冲击：2026年4月2日特朗普依据232条款宣布对专利药品进口征收100%关税，大型药企自令发布后120天、小型药企180天开始执行。当日A股CSPC创新制药跌4.6%、恒瑞医药跌1.8%，板块此后持续下行。上证综指同期仅跌2.4%，而通信（+23.7%）、电子（+22.7%）继续上涨——科技板块受益于中美电子产品关税休战，医药板块则独自承受药品专项关税压力。医药以-16.0%位列申万最差行业，在成长仍跑赢价值5.9个百分点的背景下，创新药板块明显被市场抛弃。","drivers":["Trump 100% pharma tariff Apr 2 2026 (Section 232)","Innovator-specific tariff vs tech truce decoupling","Mainland pharma (CSPC -4.6%, Hengrui -1.8%) immediate impact","SHCOMP -2.4% modest broad market headwind","Telecoms/Electronics rotation as tech truce beneficiary"],"drivers_zh":["2026年4月2日特朗普232条款100%专利药关税令","医药专项关税vs科技休战的行业内部分化","A股药企即时冲击（CSPC-4.6%、恒瑞-1.8%）","上证-2.4%温和大盘逆风","通信/电子作为科技休战受益方的轮动"],"title":"Trump 100% pharma tariff crushes innovators","title_zh":"特朗普100%药品关税重击创新药板块"}},"now":"Innovative Pharma & CXO is in a Bottoming phase as of late June 2026, sitting at just 6.2% above its measured cycle floor and ranked 7th of 31 Shenwan universes — a laggard posture. The current tape is a liquidity-driven growth/tech rotation (Electronics +75.5%, Telecoms +67.7% YTD; SHCOMP +1.6%), with cyclicals marginally leading defensives and growth sectors outpacing value by 18.2pp. Pharma itself has a near-flat current-window return (+0.4%), not participating in the Electronics/AI-led beta rally — it remains in the shadow of the April 2026 Trump 100% branded-drug tariff order that continues to weigh on global licensing valuations despite the broader China-US trade-truce environment. The structural out-licensing pipeline (record Q1 2026 cross-border deals exceeding $60bn) provides a fundamental floor, but capital is rotating toward tech infrastructure names away from pharma.","now_zh":"创新药与CXO板块截至2026年6月下旬处于筑底阶段，绝对位置仅高于周期低点6.2%，在申万31个行业中排名第7，属于明显落后者。当前市场由电子（年初至今+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）主导的流动性驱动成长行情，上证综指微涨1.6%，成长风格领先价值18.2个百分点。医药板块本期涨幅仅0.4%，未能跟上以电子/AI为核心的Beta行情——2026年4月2日特朗普签署对品牌药100%关税令的压制仍未消散，尽管中美贸易整体摩擦有所缓和。从基本面看，2026年一季度跨境授权交易超600亿美元创历史新高，为板块提供了坚实底部支撑，但资金当前更青睐科技基础设施方向。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_rare_earth":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From June to September 2021, Rare Earth and Magnets surged +91.3%, the series largest single-leg gain and clear standout within a broad commodity-value cyclical tape (Metals +62.5%, Steel +53.5%, SHCOMP +5.6%). The primary catalyst was structural NdPr demand from the EV explosion: BYD NEV sales rose +207% YoY and Great Wall Motor +152% in early 2021, pushing NdPr oxide prices above $130/kg by mid-year from roughly $50/kg in late 2020. Simultaneously, MIIT January 2021 draft Regulations on Rare Earth Management — proposing supply-chain tracking, strategic reserves, and a ban on foreign investment in REE mining — raised the scarcity narrative for China near-monopoly in separated heavy rare earths. The ctx confirms this is a genuine sector-specific breakout: cyclicals led defensives by 25.4pp, consistent with a commodity-price and policy-premium driver.","body_zh":"2021年6至9月，稀土永磁板块飙升91.3%，是本系列单腿最大涨幅，在大宗商品/周期价值主导行情中遥遥领先（金属+62.5%，钢铁+53.5%，上证指数+5.6%）。核心催化剂是新能源汽车爆发带来的NdPr结构性需求：2021年初比亚迪新能源汽车销量同比+207%，长城汽车+152%，推动NdPr氧化物价格从2020年底约50美元/千克飙升至2021年中期逾130美元/千克。同期，工信部2021年1月发布的稀土管理条例征求意见稿——拟建立供应链追溯体系、战略储备机制并禁止外资介入稀土开采——强化了市场对中国重稀土分离垄断的稀缺性预期。轮动数据印证这是真正的板块性突破：周期跑赢防御25.4个百分点，与大宗商品价格上涨及政策溢价驱动逻辑高度吻合。","drivers":["NdPr price surge above $130/kg","EV demand BYD +207% GWM +152%","MIIT draft rare earth regulations Jan 2021","commodity cyclical value rotation","China monopoly scarcity premium"],"drivers_zh":["NdPr价格涨破130美元/千克","新能源车爆发比亚迪/长城","工信部2021年1月稀土管理条例草案","大宗商品周期/价值轮动","中国垄断稀缺溢价"],"title":"NdPr Supercycle: EV Boom Meets MIIT Regulations","title_zh":"稀土超级周期：新能源车爆发叠加工信部新规预期"},"2021-09-13":{"body":"From September 13 to 29 2021, the basket sold off -25.0% in just 16 days as the Evergrande debt crisis peaked. On September 20 2021, Evergrande — China second-largest property developer with $300 billion in debt — missed bond coupon payments and Fitch declared default probable, triggering a global commodity-risk selloff. The ctx is a textbook risk-off rotation: defensives led (Food and Bev +6.9%, Agriculture +4.1%, Utilities +2.6%) while cyclicals plummeted (Metals -21.9%, Steel -22.1%), with SHCOMP -4.8%. Rare earths fell alongside metals peers as the crisis raised fears about a China construction and manufacturing slowdown that would compress NdPr magnet demand; the loss was compounded by profit-taking after the preceding +91.3% surge from June.","body_zh":"2021年9月13日至29日，板块在短短16天内暴跌25.0%，恒大债务危机达到顶峰。2021年9月20日，负债3000亿美元的中国第二大地产商恒大集团未能兑付债券票息，惠誉宣布违约概率极高，引发全球大宗商品风险抛售。轮动数据呈现标准避险格局：防御板块领涨（食饮+6.9%，农业+4.1%，公用事业+2.6%），而周期板块重挫（金属-21.9%，钢铁-22.1%），上证指数-4.8%。稀土板块随金属同业下跌，恒大危机引发市场对中国建筑/制造业需求收缩的担忧，进而压制NdPr磁材需求预期；叠加前期+91.3%大涨后的获利了结，跌幅进一步放大。","drivers":["Evergrande debt crisis Sep 20 2021","China property sector risk-off","commodity cyclical selloff metals/steel","profit-taking after +91% surge","SHCOMP -4.8% broad risk-off"],"drivers_zh":["恒大债务危机2021年9月20日","中国房地产板块避险抛售","金属/钢铁周期商品踩踏","前期涨幅过大获利了结","上证-4.8%全面避险"],"title":"Evergrande Shock: Cyclical Commodity Flush","title_zh":"恒大暴雷：周期商品集体踩踏"},"2021-09-29":{"body":"From September 29 to November 29 2021, the basket recovered +36.3% as a growth and green-tech rotation took hold, led by Power Equipment (+19.0%), Autos (+17.2%), and Defense (+16.3%), while SHCOMP barely moved (+0.7%). Growth outpaced value by 10.3pp and there was no broad cyclical tailwind (cyclicals +2.0% vs defensives -0.4%), so the rare earth move was driven by EV/wind/defense supply chain positioning rather than broad commodity pricing. The catalyst was China 14th Five-Year Plan green economy goals reaffirmed in the October 2021 COP26 buildup — Beijing pledged 1,200 GW of wind/solar by 2030, sustaining NdFeB magnet demand projections. December 2021 saw the formation of China Rare Earth Group merging three state SOEs, cementing the oligopoly narrative that had been building through the quarter.","body_zh":"2021年9月29日至11月29日，板块反弹36.3%，成长/绿色科技轮动主导行情，电力设备(+19.0%)、汽车(+17.2%)、国防军工(+16.3%)领涨，上证指数几乎原地踏步(+0.7%)。成长跑赢价值10.3个百分点，周期相对防御几乎无优势(周期+2.0% vs 防御-0.4%)，表明稀土上涨源于新能源车/风电/国防供应链定位，而非大宗商品价格普涨。催化剂包括：2021年10月COP26前中国重申十四五绿色经济目标——北京承诺2030年风光装机达1200GW以维持NdFeB磁材需求预期。2021年12月中国稀土集团成立（三家央企合并），进一步强化了贯穿整个季度逐步累积的寡头垄断叙事。","drivers":["14th FYP green energy goals COP26 Oct 2021","Power Equipment/Autos/Defense thematic rotation","China Rare Earth Group SOE consolidation Dec 2021","growth over value 10.3pp style tilt","NdFeB magnet forward demand guidance"],"drivers_zh":["十四五绿色能源目标COP26 2021年10月","电力设备/汽车/国防军工主题轮动","中国稀土集团央企整合2021年12月","成长跑赢价值10.3个百分点","NdFeB磁材需求前景指引"],"title":"Green Energy Rebound: Power Equipment Leads NEV Theme","title_zh":"绿色能源反弹：电力设备领航新能源主题"},"2021-11-29":{"body":"From November 29 2021 to April 26 2022, the basket collapsed -48.0% — the second-worst leg in the series. The ctx shows a broad market down-leg (SHCOMP -19.0%) with energy/coal defending (Coal +6.7%) and growth/green-tech stocks crushed (Power Equipment -43.9%, Electronics -40.5%, Defense -40.5%), value led growth by 17.0pp. Three sequential catalysts: first, the Federal Reserve hawkish pivot on November 30 2021 when Powell retired the transitory inflation narrative, followed by the aggressive rate hike cycle beginning March 2022, compressing the global growth/green premium; second, China zero-COVID policies triggered full Shanghai lockdowns from March to May 2022, devastating industrial production and EV deliveries; third, Chinese authorities signaled a guide prices to rationality directive in early 2022 after NdPr oxide peaked above $150/kg in February 2022, causing rapid price reversal. The rare earth selloff was partly beta to SHCOMP -19% but amplified by its growth/green-tech adjacency.","body_zh":"2021年11月29日至2022年4月26日，板块暴跌48.0%，是本系列第二大单腿跌幅。轮动数据呈现大盘整体下行态势（上证指数-19.0%），煤炭/能源相对防御（煤炭+6.7%），成长/绿色科技重创（电力设备-43.9%，电子-40.5%，国防军工-40.5%），价值跑赢成长17.0个百分点。三大顺序叠加催化剂：一、美联储于2021年11月30日宣布放弃暂时性通胀判断，随后于2022年3月启动激进加息周期，全球成长/绿色溢价遭压缩；二、中国清零政策导致上海2022年3至5月全面封城，工业生产及新能源汽车交付严重受阻；三、2022年初NdPr氧化物价格触及150美元/千克以上历史高位后，当局随即发出引导价格回归理性信号，触发价格快速反转。稀土板块下跌部分反映了上证-19%的贝塔效应，但其与成长/绿色科技的高度相关性进一步放大了跌幅。","drivers":["Fed hawkish pivot Nov 30 2021 rate hike cycle","Shanghai lockdown Mar-May 2022 production halt","NdPr price reversal from $150/kg peak","Beijing guide prices to rationality directive","SHCOMP -19% broad growth selloff"],"drivers_zh":["美联储2021年11月30日转鹰加息周期","上海2022年3-5月封城停产","NdPr价格从150美元/千克高位反转","北京引导价格回归理性信号","上证-19%全面成长股下跌"],"title":"Fed Tightening Plus Shanghai Lockdown: Collapse -48%","title_zh":"美联储收紧叠加上海封控：崩跌48%"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"From April 26 to August 15 2022, the basket surged +73.4% within a broad market recovery (SHCOMP +13.5%), growth led value by 15.1pp, with Power Equipment (+56.7%), Autos (+46.6%), and Defense (+44.1%) all leading. Shanghai began phased reopening in May-June 2022, removing the lockdown overhang; Beijing simultaneously announced green infrastructure stimulus including accelerated NEV subsidy extension and RMB 60 billion NEV purchase tax exemptions. NdPr prices recovered from the April 2022 lows around $80/kg as EV/wind pipeline demand re-accelerated following the production restart. The rare earth basket benefited both from the direct commodity price recovery and from its position at the intersection of Power Equipment and Autos leadership themes that defined this leg, making the move substantially above the index rally.","body_zh":"2022年4月26日至8月15日，板块飙升73.4%，伴随大盘整体回升（上证指数+13.5%），成长跑赢价值15.1个百分点，电力设备(+56.7%)、汽车(+46.6%)、国防军工(+44.1%)全面领涨。上海于2022年5-6月开始分阶段复工，解除停工压力；北京同期密集出台绿色基础设施刺激政策，包括延长新能源汽车补贴及600亿元购置税减免。NdPr价格从2022年4月低点约80美元/千克回升，复工后新能源车/风电管线需求重新加速。稀土板块既受益于大宗商品价格直接回升，也因与电力设备、汽车两大领涨主线高度关联而获得双重加持，涨幅大幅超越大盘。","drivers":["Shanghai reopening May-June 2022","Beijing NEV subsidy extension RMB 60bn tax exemption","NdPr price recovery from April lows","Power Equipment plus Autos dual leadership","SHCOMP +13.5% broad recovery beta"],"drivers_zh":["上海2022年5-6月复工复产","北京延长新能源车补贴600亿购置税减免","NdPr价格从4月低点回升","电力设备+汽车双轮驱动领涨","上证+13.5%大盘普涨贝塔"],"title":"Shanghai Reopening: Green-Tech Stimulus Rebound","title_zh":"上海复工：绿色科技刺激驱动反弹"},"2022-08-15":{"body":"From August 15 2022 to February 5 2024 — a 78-week bear leg — the basket fell -48.6%. The ctx confirms a sustained risk-off environment: defensives (-16.9%) outperformed cyclicals (-28.6%) while SHCOMP fell -17.5% across the full period. The fundamental driver was NdPr price collapse: oxide prices fell from a $150+/kg February 2022 peak by nearly 40% through 2023 to around $80/kg, then continued lower to $60-70/kg by 2024, driven by surging Chinese mining quotas (raised 20% in 2021), expanded recycling capacity, and rising imported ore volumes (+44.8% in 2023). China property crisis deepened with Country Garden defaulting in H2 2023 and total developer debt exceeding RMB 10 trillion, crushing downstream industrial demand. Banks were the sole Shenwan outperformer (+2.1%), consistent with defensive credit-easing positioning. The basket underperformed even other cyclicals as Power Equipment fell -55.3%, reflecting the double hit of commodity price collapse and green-tech derating.","body_zh":"2022年8月15日至2024年2月5日，长达78周的下跌腿中，板块累计下跌48.6%。轮动数据证实持续风险规避环境：防御板块（-16.9%）显著跑赢周期板块（-28.6%），上证指数区间累计下跌17.5%。基本面驱动因素是NdPr价格崩跌：氧化物价格从2022年2月逾150美元/千克高点下跌近40%，2023年跌至约80美元/千克，2024年进一步跌至60-70美元/千克，主要由中国采矿配额大幅增加（2021年提升20%）、废料回收产能扩张及进口矿增量（2023年同比+44.8%）共同推动。中国房地产危机持续恶化，碧桂园2023年下半年实质违约，房企总债务突破10万亿元人民币，打压下游工业需求。银行是申万板块中唯一正收益板块（+2.1%），与防御性信贷宽松定仓一致。稀土板块甚至跑输其他周期同类——电力设备下跌55.3%——反映了商品价格崩跌与绿色科技估值收缩的双重打击。","drivers":["NdPr oxide price collapse -40% from $150/kg peak","China mining quota expansion plus import surge +44.8% 2023","Property crisis Country Garden default H2 2023","SHCOMP -17.5% sustained risk-off","Green-tech derating alongside commodity weakness"],"drivers_zh":["NdPr氧化物价格从150美元/千克高位崩跌40%","中国采矿配额扩张叠加进口矿增量+44.8% 2023年","房地产危机碧桂园2023年下半年实质违约","上证-17.5%持续风险规避","大宗商品走弱叠加绿色科技估值收缩"],"title":"18-Month Grind: NdPr Glut, Property Crisis, No Bid","title_zh":"18个月磨底：NdPr供过于求、房地产危机、无买盘"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From February 5 to April 9 2024, the basket rebounded +50.3% within a broad growth-cyclical recovery (SHCOMP +12.8%), led by Metals (+41.3%), Autos (+28.6%), and Telecoms (+27.3%), with growth outpacing value by 8.0pp. The direct trigger was China National Team state-backed funds via Huijin and ETF managers deploying an estimated $50 billion or more in domestic equity purchases in late January and February 2024, arresting the SHCOMP slide below 2,700. The CSRC additionally restricted institutional short-selling. This was predominantly a beta-recovery trade: NdPr prices remained at cycle lows near $60-70/kg with no commodity-price catalyst. Defensives also rebounded (avg +10.4%), and the rare earth basket move was driven by its high-beta character in the SHCOMP recovery. Metals co-leadership confirmed this as an index-beta rebound rather than any rare-earth-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"2024年2月5日至4月9日，板块反弹50.3%，伴随大盘成长/周期整体回升（上证指数+12.8%），金属(+41.3%)、汽车(+28.6%)、通信(+27.3%)领涨，成长跑赢价值8.0个百分点。直接触发因素是中国国家队（汇金及ETF管理机构等国家背景资金）于2024年1月底至2月间累计买入境内股票逾500亿美元，阻止上证指数跌破2700点。证监会同期限制机构做空。本轮反弹本质上是贝塔修复行情：NdPr价格仍维持在60-70美元/千克的周期低位，无商品价格催化剂。防御板块也同步反弹（均值+10.4%），稀土板块上涨源于其在上证复苏中的高贝塔属性。金属与稀土同步领涨证实，这是一轮指数贝塔修复行情，而非稀土专项催化驱动。","drivers":["National Team $50bn equity purchase Jan-Feb 2024","CSRC short-selling restrictions","SHCOMP +12.8% broad beta recovery","High-beta cyclical rebound character","Metals co-leadership index-beta confirmation"],"drivers_zh":["国家队2024年1-2月买入逾500亿美元","证监会限制做空","上证+12.8%大盘贝塔修复","高贝塔周期反弹属性","金属同步领涨印证指数贝塔驱动"],"title":"National Team Rescue: Broad Trough Beta Rally","title_zh":"国家队救市：大盘触底贝塔反弹"},"2024-04-09":{"body":"From April 9 to August 27 2024, the basket fell -28.5% in a flight-to-safety rotation: Banks led (+8.4%), Utilities second-best (-2.1%), cyclicals fell -14.5% vs defensives -7.1%, and SHCOMP declined -6.6%. NdPr prices continued their structural decline toward $60/kg with no commodity support. The selloff reflected disappointment in China post-National-Team-rescue economic trajectory: property sector deleveraging persisted with the RMB 300bn government support fund for unfinished housing proving insufficient, consumer confidence remained depressed, and PMI data in April-May 2024 surprised to the downside. The rare earth basket fell more than the cyclical average, consistent with its higher beta and absence of any policy-specific rare earth catalyst. Banks outperformed throughout the period, signaling defensive positioning into domestic rate easing expectations rather than any growth rotation.","body_zh":"2024年4月9日至8月27日，板块下跌28.5%，资金再度流向避险资产：银行领涨(+8.4%)，公用事业次之(-2.1%)，周期板块-14.5%，防御-7.1%，上证指数下跌6.6%。NdPr价格持续向60美元/千克下移，无商品价格支撑。本轮下跌反映了市场对国家队救市后中国经济复苏路径的失望情绪：楼市去杠杆持续（政府3000亿元保交楼支持资金被证明杯水车薪），消费信心疲软，2024年4-5月PMI数据持续低于预期。稀土跌幅超过周期板块均值，与其高贝塔属性及缺乏稀土专项催化剂相符。银行全程领跑，印证资金流向国内降息预期的防御性仓位，而非任何成长轮动。","drivers":["China economic recovery disappointment","Property deleveraging RMB 300bn fund insufficient","NdPr price continued decline to $60/kg","SHCOMP -6.6% risk-off rotation","Banks outperforming defensive positioning"],"drivers_zh":["中国经济复苏不及预期","楼市去杠杆3000亿保交楼资金不足","NdPr价格持续跌向60美元/千克","上证-6.6%避险轮动","银行领涨防御性定仓"],"title":"Post-Rescue Fade: Recovery Disappoints Cyclicals","title_zh":"救市退潮：经济复苏不及预期再度避险"},"2024-08-27":{"body":"From August 27 2024 to March 2 2026, the basket surged +372.9% in an 18-month mega-rally — by far the series largest leg. The ctx confirms a historically strong risk-on, growth-led tape: cyclicals led defensives by 56pp, growth led value by 50.7pp, SHCOMP +46.8%. Three sequential catalysts: first, September 24 2024 PBOC stimulus package with RRR cut of 50bp injecting RMB 1 trillion in liquidity, a 20bp policy rate cut, and RMB 800bn stock market support tools (RMB 500bn swap facility plus RMB 300bn buyback refinancing), triggering the broadest A-share rally since July 2020; second, April 4 2025 China imposed export controls on seven heavy rare earth elements including dysprosium and terbium as retaliation for US Liberation Day tariffs, creating a domestic supply scarcity narrative and causing international magnet prices to surge up to 6x Chinese levels; third, DeepSeek R1 model released in January 2026 triggered a China AI and robotics re-rating with Hang Seng Tech +28.5% and SHCOMP surging to decade highs, cementing the NdFeB magnet demand narrative for AI-driven humanoid robots. Rare earths sat at the intersection of all three drivers.","body_zh":"2024年8月27日至2026年3月2日，长达18个月的超级行情累计涨幅高达372.9%，是本系列迄今最大单腿涨幅。轮动数据印证历史性强势风险偏好、成长主导行情：周期跑赢防御56个百分点，成长跑赢价值50.7个百分点，上证指数+46.8%。三大顺序叠加催化剂：一、2024年9月24日央行刺激一揽子政策——降准50bp释放1万亿元流动性、政策利率下调20bp、8000亿元股市支持工具（5000亿互换便利+3000亿回购再贷款）——触发2020年7月以来最强A股行情；二、2025年4月4日中国对七种重稀土元素（含镝、铽）实施出口管制，作为对美国解放日关税的反制，在国内形成供给稀缺叙事并推动境外磁材价格涨至中国国内价格的6倍；三、2026年1月DeepSeek R1模型发布引爆中国AI/机器人重估浪潮，恒生科技指数+28.5%，上证指数飙升至十年新高，NdFeB磁材用于AI人形机器人的结构性需求叙事由此确立。稀土板块处于三大驱动力的交汇点。","drivers":["PBOC Sep 24 2024 RMB 1tn RRR cut plus RMB 800bn equity support","China heavy RE export controls Apr 4 2025 vs US Liberation Day tariffs","DeepSeek R1 Jan 2026 AI robotics NdFeB demand re-rating","SHCOMP +46.8% decade-high bull market","Growth-cyclical led by 50.7pp style tilt"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年9月24日降准1万亿元+8000亿股市支持工具","2025年4月4日重稀土出口管制反制美国关税","DeepSeek R1 2026年1月AI机器人NdFeB需求重估","上证+46.8%十年新高牛市","成长周期领先50.7个百分点风格倾斜"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka to AI Robotics: +373% Supercycle","title_zh":"央行大放水至AI机器人：+373%超级行情"},"2026-03-02":{"body":"From March 2 to April 3 2026, the basket fell -26.9% in a flight-to-safety rotation as the broad AI and growth trade peaked. The ctx shows defensives nearly flat (-0.6%) while cyclicals fell -11.2% and SHCOMP -7.2%, with Metals -20.3% and Defense -20.1% the worst laggards — consistent with a reversal of the prior mega-rally leadership. On March 17 2026 the USTR launched new Section 301 investigations into Chinese manufacturing excess capacity, reigniting trade escalation fears and creating uncertainty around the durability of the November 2025 US-China trade truce. Simultaneously, the SHCOMP retreated from its January 2026 decade highs as DeepSeek and AI momentum ran into profit-taking after the multi-month surge. Rare earths fell harder than the cyclical average given their prior outsized gain (+372.9%) and high sensitivity to US-China trade relations.","body_zh":"2026年3月2日至4月3日，板块下跌26.9%，成长/AI主题强势行情见顶，资金再度转向避险。轮动数据显示防御板块几乎持平（-0.6%），而周期板块下跌11.2%，上证指数-7.2%，金属（-20.3%）和国防军工（-20.1%）跌幅最大——与前期超级行情领涨板块的逆转高度吻合。2026年3月17日，美国贸易代表办公室启动新一轮针对中国制造业产能过剩的301条款调查，再度点燃贸易升级担忧，并使2025年11月中美贸易休战的持续性存疑。与此同时，上证指数从2026年1月十年新高回落，DeepSeek和AI主题动能在多月持续上涨后遭遇获利了结。稀土板块跌幅超过周期均值，因其此前累积了超额涨幅(+372.9%)且对中美贸易关系高度敏感。","drivers":["USTR Section 301 investigation Mar 17 2026 trade escalation","AI DeepSeek momentum exhaustion profit-taking","SHCOMP -7.2% decade-high reversal","Metals and Defense co-leadership reversal","US-China truce durability doubts"],"drivers_zh":["美贸易代表办公室2026年3月17日301调查贸易升级","AI/DeepSeek动能衰竭获利了结","上证-7.2%十年新高后回落","金属/国防军工领涨逆转","中美贸易休战持续性存疑"],"title":"AI Euphoria Peak: Trade Escalation Hits Cyclicals","title_zh":"AI狂热见顶：贸易升级冲击周期板块"},"2026-04-03":{"body":"From April 3 to June 22 2026, the basket surged +52.3% in a growth-led tape (growth led value by 21.9pp) with Electronics (+73.7%) and Telecoms (+64.5%) as sector leaders, while Oil and Gas (-15.6%) and Agriculture (-17.3%) lagged. The SHCOMP was only +7.3%, meaning rare earths (+52.3%) dramatically outperformed on a sector-specific catalyst. April 29 2026 MIIT enforcement framework targeted illegal rare earth output violations with fines up to 5x illegal gains, triggering a domestic supply tightening narrative. Simultaneously, China Northern Rare Earth Group set Q2 2026 NdPr quarterly guidance prices up approximately 45% quarter-over-quarter from Q1 2026, the seventh consecutive quarterly increase and the largest since the 2023 pricing reform. The robotics and AI demand story for NdFeB permanent magnets provided the thematic amplifier, consistent with the Electronics leadership (+73.7%) reflecting the AI hardware supply chain theme.","body_zh":"2026年4月3日至6月22日，板块飙升52.3%，成长主导格局（成长跑赢价值21.9个百分点），电子（+73.7%）和通信（+64.5%）领涨，油气（-15.6%）和农业（-17.3%）垫底。上证指数仅涨7.3%，意味着稀土（+52.3%）在板块专项催化下大幅跑赢大盘。2026年4月29日，工信部出台针对非法稀土超产行为的执法框架——违规所得5倍以下罚款——在国内引发供给收紧预期。同期，中国北方稀土集团发布2026年第二季度NdPr价格指导价，环比第一季度上涨约45%，为连续第七季度上涨且是2023年定价机制改革以来最大单季涨幅。机器人和AI对NdFeB永磁体的需求故事提供了主题放大器，与电子领涨（+73.7%）反映AI硬件供应链主题主导行情的格局高度吻合。","drivers":["MIIT Apr 29 2026 output breach enforcement fines up to 5x illegal gains","China Northern Rare Earth NdPr Q2 2026 price up 45% QoQ","AI humanoid robotics NdFeB structural demand theme","Electronics and Telecom growth tape co-leadership","Export control architecture sustaining domestic pricing power"],"drivers_zh":["工信部2026年4月29日超产执法罚款上限违规所得5倍","中国北方稀土2026年Q2 NdPr指导价环比上涨45%","AI人形机器人NdFeB结构性需求主题","电子/通信成长行情协同领涨","出口管制体系维持国内议价权"],"title":"MIIT Enforcement Plus Robotics: +52% Rebound","title_zh":"工信部执法+机器人需求：+52%强势反弹"}},"now":"Rare Earth and Magnets is in an Expansion/Trending phase, ranked 5th of 31 Shenwan universes with a 65.4% return in the current window. The basket sits at 46.6% of its historical percentile range, trading above its 200-day moving average. The rotation context is a clear risk-on, growth-led tape: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) lead while Agriculture and Retail lag; cyclicals outperform defensives by 12.4pp and growth beats value by 18.2pp against a SHCOMP of only +1.6%. Rare earths are substantially outperforming the index, driven by structural re-rating: China export licensing for heavy rare earths (active since April 2025, partially eased under the Nov 2025 US-China truce, hard controls set to resume Nov 2026) has inverted the price signal domestically so onshore producers benefit as scarcity premium is exported abroad. Robotics, AI humanoid, and EV motor demand are the forward earnings narrative; Beijing April 2026 MIIT enforcement crackdown on illegal output further tightens domestic supply and supports elevated onshore prices.","now_zh":"稀土永磁板块处于扩张/趋势上行阶段，在31个申万行业宇宙中排名第5，当前窗口回报率达65.4%。板块位于历史百分位区间46.6%处，运行于200日均线上方。当前轮动格局明确偏向风险偏好与成长主导：电子(+75.5%)和通信(+67.7%)领涨，农业与零售垫底；周期跑赢防御12.4个百分点，成长跑赢价值18.2个百分点，而上证指数仅涨1.6%。稀土板块大幅跑赢指数，核心驱动在于结构性重估：2025年4月启动的重稀土出口许可证制度（2025年11月中美贸易休战期间部分放松，2026年11月硬性管控重启）在国内形成价格信号倒置——境内NdPr价格受压但企业议价权提升，稀缺溢价被出口至境外。机器人、AI人形机器人及新能源汽车电机需求构成盈利预期的前瞻叙事，工信部2026年4月针对违规超产的专项执法行动进一步收紧了国内供给格局。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_robotics":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-June to late November 2021, the basket surged +42% in a broad risk-on, growth-over-value tape (SHCOMP +2%, cyclicals outperformed defensives by 13.5pp). China's 14th Five-Year Plan (March 2021) and the MIIT Robotics Industry 14th FYP (released December 2021, draft guidance circulated from mid-year) set a 20% CAGR robot-density target and named domestic supply-chain champions as strategic priorities, validating a re-rating across machinery and automation. Power Equipment (+54.8%) and Metals (+37.6%) co-led as the carbon-neutrality buildout (dual-carbon Working Guidance, October 2021) and EV supply chain expansion ran in parallel, lifting correlated automation and servo-drive names.","body_zh":"2021年6月中旬至11月下旬，篮子在宽基风险偏好、成长主导行情中上涨42%（上证综指+2%，周期股跑赢防御股13.5个百分点）。中国《十四五规划》（2021年3月）及工信部《机器人行业十四五发展规划》（2021年12月正式发布，中途草案已流通）明确了机器人密度年均增长20%的目标并点名扶持国内供应链龙头，推动自动化和伺服驱动板块估值重估。双碳行动方案（2021年10月）叠加新能源车供应链扩张进一步带动了电力设备（+54.8%）与金属（+37.6%）等关联板块联动上涨。","drivers":["14th FYP robotics policy mandate","carbon-neutrality / dual-carbon infrastructure cycle","cyclical risk-on beta with growth tilt","EV supply-chain automation demand"],"drivers_zh":["十四五机器人政策规划","双碳基础设施周期","周期成长贝塔","新能源车供应链自动化需求"],"title":"14th FYP Policy Tailwind Fuels Cyclical Beta","title_zh":"十四五政策东风驱动周期成长贝塔"},"2021-11-23":{"body":"From late November 2021 to late April 2022, the basket fell -44.8% as part of a SHCOMP -19.6% broad market drawdown driven by two converging forces. China's 18-month regulatory assault -- antitrust fines on Alibaba ($2.8 billion, April 2021), Didi forced delisting (July 2021), education sector nationalization (July 2021), and platform-economy restrictions -- progressively drained foreign investor conviction; by late 2021 total internet-company market cap had fallen roughly 45% from its 2020 peak. Simultaneously, the US Federal Reserve's November 2021 taper announcement and the onset of its rate-hike cycle in March 2022 caused a global de-risking from high-beta growth and EM equities. The ctx confirms this is a value-rotation / index-beta selloff: Coal (+6.7%) and Real Estate (-1.7%) led while Electronics (-41.5%) and Power Equipment (-43.9%) -- the same sectors that led the prior rally -- were the worst laggards.","body_zh":"2021年11月下旬至2022年4月下旬，篮子下跌44.8%，上证综指同期下跌19.6%，两大力量叠加造成这一局面。一是中国长达18个月的监管整治——反垄断罚款阿里巴巴（2021年4月）、滴滴被迫退市（2021年7月）、教育行业非营利化（2021年7月）——海外投资者信心持续流失，互联网龙头市值较2020年高峰蒸发约45%。二是美联储2021年11月宣布Taper并于2022年3月开启加息周期，全球高贝塔成长股和新兴市场遭遇系统性去风险。板块轮动印证这是价值回归而非行业特有利空：煤炭（+6.7%）领涨，而同期领涨的电子（-41.5%）与电力设备（-43.9%）跌幅最深。","drivers":["China platform-economy regulatory crackdown","Fed taper + March 2022 rate hike cycle onset","global growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP broad drawdown -19.6%"],"drivers_zh":["中国平台经济监管整顿","美联储Taper与2022年3月加息","全球成长转价值轮动","上证综指宽幅下跌-19.6%"],"title":"Regulatory Crackdown + Fed Taper Risk-Off Reversal","title_zh":"监管整顿+美联储收紧引发风险逃离"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"From late April to early August 2022, the basket surged +104.9% -- a violent V-shaped rebound from an extreme oversold trough. The April 29, 2022 Politburo meeting issued an explicit 'stable growth' pivot: it called for 'using extensive macro and monetary policy means to stabilize the economy' and signaled a softening stance toward platform tech companies, sparking a more than 5% single-day jump in the Hang Seng China Enterprises Index. The easing of Shanghai's April-May lockdowns and Beijing's announcement of a 500 billion RMB PBOC relending facility (April 7, 2022) for SME tech firms confirmed the policy floor. Power Equipment (+57.0%), Autos (+56.7%), and Machinery (+40.5%) co-led, all cyclical sectors confirming this is primarily a market-wide beta recovery rather than a robotics-specific re-rating (SHCOMP +12.9%).","body_zh":"2022年4月下旬至8月初，篮子暴涨104.9%，从极度超卖低点展开剧烈V形反弹。2022年4月29日政治局会议明确发出\"稳增长\"信号，要求\"运用宏观货币政策手段稳定经济\"，并释放对平台科技公司的监管松绑信号，当日港股恒生中国企业指数单日跳涨逾5%。上海4-5月封控逐步解除叠加央行4月7日宣布5000亿元再贷款支持科技中小企业，共同确立政策底部。电力设备（+57.0%）、汽车（+56.7%）与机械（+40.5%）联袂领涨，均为周期性板块，印证此轮为市场宽基贝塔修复（上证综指+12.9%），而非机器人板块独立行情。","drivers":["April 2022 Politburo stable-growth pivot","Shanghai lockdown easing / reopening signal","PBOC relending facility for SME tech","extreme beta rebound from -44.8% oversold trough"],"drivers_zh":["2022年4月政治局稳增长转向","上海解封/重开信号","央行SME科技再贷款工具","超卖极值后的贝塔强力反弹"],"title":"Politburo Pivot + Post-Lockdown V-Rebound","title_zh":"政治局政策转向+解封后的V形反弹"},"2022-08-01":{"body":"From early August to late December 2022, the basket fell -28.1% in a risk-off, defensives-led tape (defensives -3.5% vs cyclicals -10.2%, SHCOMP -6.6%). Fed Chair Powell's August 26, 2022 Jackson Hole speech -- 'without price stability, the economy does not work for anyone' -- dashed hopes for a policy pivot and reset global risk appetite, with the US hiking rates cumulatively by more than 500bp from March 2022 to July 2023. Domestically, China's dynamic zero-COVID policy continued to suppress economic activity through recurring lockdowns across multiple cities through November 2022 (protests erupted in late November), keeping consumer sentiment and capital expenditure weak. Services (+12.3%) and Conglomerates (+9.9%) led, while Metals (-18.6%), Autos (-23.6%), and Power Equipment (-25.5%) -- the prior rally leaders -- gave back gains as growth-capex expectations reset.","body_zh":"2022年8月初至12月下旬，篮子下跌28.1%，防御性板块相对跑赢（防御-3.5% vs 周期-10.2%，上证综指-6.6%）。2022年8月26日，美联储主席鲍威尔在杰克逊霍尔发表鹰派讲话，明确表示\"没有物价稳定就没有正常经济\"，终结市场对政策转向的幻想，美联储累计加息超500个基点。国内方面，动态清零政策延续至2022年11月（11月底爆发抗议），多个城市反复封控持续压制资本开支和消费预期。服务业（+12.3%）与综合企业（+9.9%）领涨，而金属（-18.6%）、汽车（-23.6%）与电力设备（-25.5%）等前期强势板块大幅回落。","drivers":["Fed Jackson Hole hawkish shock (Aug 26 2022)","zero-COVID lockdowns suppressing capex and sentiment","global risk-off, EM growth-sector de-rating","flight to defensives -- Services and Conglomerates led"],"drivers_zh":["美联储杰克逊霍尔鹰派冲击（2022年8月26日）","新冠清零持续抑制资本开支与消费情绪","全球风险规避、新兴市场成长板块遭压估值","资金向防御性板块切换"],"title":"Fed Shock + Zero-COVID Drag Deflates Growth Names","title_zh":"美联储冲击+新冠清零政策拖累成长股回落"},"2022-12-23":{"body":"From late December 2022 to mid-June 2023, the basket rallied +45.1% in a growth-over-value, AI-themed tape (SHCOMP +6.4%, growth led value by 32.0pp). China's National Health Commission announced on December 26, 2022 the formal exit from zero-COVID (borders reopened January 8, 2023), catalyzing a broad risk-on rotation into beaten-down growth. Simultaneously, OpenAI's ChatGPT (launched November 30, 2022) triggered a global AI-theme wave; Chinese AI stocks jumped sharply in February 2023 as state media highlighted the ChatGPT phenomenon. Media (+65.0%), Telecoms (+59.7%), and Computers (+45.5%) led, consistent with an AI/automation narrative overlay on the reopening beta. The robotics basket benefited as investors re-rated automation names in the context of the broader intelligent-manufacturing and AI buildout thesis.","body_zh":"2022年12月下旬至2023年6月中旬，篮子上涨45.1%，行情以成长跑赢价值（成长超额32.0pp）、AI主题主导（上证综指+6.4%）为特征。2022年12月26日，国家卫健委宣布正式退出动态清零政策（2023年1月8日边境重开），触发宽基风险偏好修复。与此同时，OpenAI于2022年11月30日推出ChatGPT，全球AI主题浪潮兴起，中国AI相关股票于2023年2月随官方媒体聚焦ChatGPT现象而大幅跳涨。传媒（+65.0%）、通信（+59.7%）与计算机（+45.5%）领涨，印证这是AI/自动化叙事叠加重开贝塔的复合行情，机器人篮子受益于智能制造与AI基础设施建设的估值重估。","drivers":["zero-COVID formal exit Dec 26 2022","ChatGPT AI theme wave from Dec 2022/Feb 2023","reopening liquidity and growth style reversal","intelligent manufacturing / AI narrative re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["2022年12月26日正式退出动态清零","ChatGPT全球AI主题浪潮（2022年11月/2023年2月）","重开流动性与成长风格逆转","智能制造/AI叙事带动估值重估"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit + ChatGPT AI Theme Dual Catalyst","title_zh":"新冠清零退出+ChatGPT AI主题双重催化"},"2023-06-20":{"body":"From mid-June 2023 to early February 2024, the basket fell -40.0% in a broad SHCOMP -16.6% drawdown, with defensives leading (Coal +17.6%, Banks +0.3%) while growth sectors were crushed (Computers -47.9%, Media -45.0%, Power Equipment -39.2%). China's property crisis intensified through H2 2023: Country Garden defaulted on dollar bonds in August 2023, Evergrande was liquidated in January 2024 with $300 billion in liabilities, and the GDP deflator went negative (nominal GDP growth 4.6% vs real 5.2%). A structural foreign investor exodus -- total China/HK market cap fell roughly $6 trillion over three years -- rotated money from growth themes into defensive value (Coal, Banks, Oil). The robotics basket, having rallied +45% on AI hopes, was especially exposed as earnings validation failed to materialize amid weak industrial capex.","body_zh":"2023年6月中旬至2024年2月初，篮子下跌40.0%，上证综指同期下跌16.6%，防御性板块领涨（煤炭+17.6%、银行+0.3%），而成长板块遭到重创（计算机-47.9%、传媒-45.0%、电力设备-39.2%）。中国地产危机在2023年下半年急剧恶化：碧桂园2023年8月美元债违约，恒大2024年1月以约3000亿美元债务被清盘，GDP平减指数转负（名义增速4.6% vs 实际5.2%）。外资结构性撤离（中港股市市值三年累计蒸发约6万亿美元）进一步推动资金从成长主题切换至防御价值（煤炭、银行、石油）。机器人篮子此前借AI预期大涨45%，但工业资本开支持续疲弱使估值难以获得业绩支撑，回调压力最为显著。","drivers":["China property crisis / Evergrande liquidation Jan 2024","deflation and negative GDP deflator in 2023","structural foreign investor exodus from China growth","Coal/Banks defensives as flight-to-safety leadership"],"drivers_zh":["中国地产危机/恒大2024年1月清盘","2023年GDP平减指数转负/通缩压力","外资结构性撤离中国成长资产","煤炭/银行防御资产主导避险轮动"],"title":"Deflation + Property Crisis + Foreign Outflows Crush Growth","title_zh":"通缩+地产危机+外资出逃重创成长板块"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"From early February to mid-March 2024, the basket rebounded +40.5% -- a 43-day V-bounce primarily driven by top-down market stabilization. On February 5, 2024, the PBOC cut the RRR by 50bp, releasing approximately 1 trillion CNY in long-term liquidity. Concurrently, state-backed 'National Team' vehicles (Central Huijin, China Securities Finance) deployed a package estimated at up to 2 trillion CNY to purchase domestic ETFs, sparking a sharp reversal around Lunar New Year. Growth tech co-led: Computers (+39.2%), Telecoms (+36.0%), Media (+34.3%) all surged, consistent with the 16.8pp growth-over-value spread and SHCOMP +14.2%. This is an index-beta event: the entire broad market rebounded from an extreme low, with robotics and growth sectors generating outsized leverage to the policy floor.","body_zh":"2024年2月初至3月中旬，篮子43天内反弹40.5%，主要受自上而下的市场维稳行动驱动。2024年2月5日，央行宣布降准50个基点，释放约1万亿元长期流动性。与此同时，\"国家队\"（汇金公司、中国证券金融公司）大规模买入国内ETF，估算规模最高达2万亿元，在农历新年前后触发市场急速反转。计算机（+39.2%）、通信（+36.0%）、传媒（+34.3%）等成长科技板块联袂领涨，与成长超额价值16.8pp及上证综指+14.2%高度吻合。此轮为典型的宽基贝塔事件：全市场从极端低估值反弹，机器人等成长板块对政策底的弹性最大。","drivers":["PBOC RRR 50bp cut Feb 5 2024 (1T CNY liquidity)","National Team ETF purchases (Central Huijin / China Securities Finance)","SHCOMP +14.2% broad beta rebound from extreme low","growth tech re-rating on stabilization"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年2月5日降准50bp（释放1万亿元流动性）","国家队ETF购买（汇金/证金公司）","上证综指+14.2%的宽基贝塔反弹","维稳背景下成长科技估值修复"],"title":"National Team + PBOC RRR Cut Floor Bounce","title_zh":"国家队托底+央行降准引发V形反弹"},"2024-03-18":{"body":"From mid-March to late August 2024, the basket fell -30.6% as the initial National Team bounce faded and the underlying macro deterioration reasserted itself. Q2 2024 data showed industrial profits fell 17.8% year-on-year in August (sharpest contraction of 2024), retail sales and fixed asset investment remained weak, and the property sector continued its downturn with no credible floor. The ctx confirms a defensive-led tape: Banks (+10.4%) and Utilities (+0.2%) outperformed while Media (-29.1%) and Computers (-30.3%) lagged in a 9.1pp value-over-growth rotation (SHCOMP -7.7%). Robotics and automation names, trading on near-term earnings visibility from a weak capex environment, gave back the stabilization-policy premium as the structural reform catalyst failed to materialize at scale.","body_zh":"2024年3月中旬至8月下旬，篮子下跌30.6%，国家队托底效应消退，宏观基本面持续恶化。2024年8月工业利润同比下滑17.8%（年内最大降幅），社会消费品零售总额及固定资产投资持续疲弱，地产行业跌势未止、缺乏实质性底部支撑。板块表现印证防御主导行情：银行（+10.4%）与公用事业（+0.2%）跑赢，传媒（-29.1%）与计算机（-30.3%）垫底，价值超额成长9.1pp（上证综指-7.7%）。机器人自动化板块因工业资本开支疲弱导致近期盈利能见度下降，维稳政策溢价被全部回吐，结构性改革催化未能大规模兑现。","drivers":["macro recovery disappointment (industrial profits -17.8% Aug 2024)","property sector continued deterioration, no fiscal bazooka","defensive Banks/Utilities led -- value over growth","growth tech de-rated as earnings validation absent"],"drivers_zh":["宏观复苏失望（2024年8月工业利润同比-17.8%）","地产行业持续下行，财政大招缺席","银行/公用事业防御板块主导，价值超额成长","成长科技因盈利兑现缺失而估值承压"],"title":"Recovery Disappointment + Value Rotation Selloff","title_zh":"复苏失望+防御价值主导二次回调"},"2024-08-27":{"body":"From late August 2024 to late February 2025, the basket surged +135.3% -- the largest single rally leg in the series -- in a multi-wave risk-on, extreme growth-over-value tape (SHCOMP +18.7%, cyclicals led by 13.4pp, growth led value by 33.5pp). The primary trigger was the September 24, 2024 PBOC announcement: 50bp RRR cut, 7-day repo rate cut by 20bp, and LPR signaled lower by 20-25bp, combined with a September 26, 2024 Politburo meeting explicitly calling to 'halt the decline' in real estate -- triggering the largest 5-day A-share rally since 2008 (CSI 300 +26%). The secondary amplifier from late January 2025 onward was DeepSeek R1 (released January 27, 2025), which demonstrated that China could produce frontier AI at a fraction of US cost, causing Nvidia to lose roughly $600 billion in market cap on January 27 while Chinese AI and humanoid robot supply-chain stocks surged. Computers (+92.5%), Electronics (+64.7%), and Machinery (+57.6%) co-led, consistent with both the stimulus beta and the AI/humanoid theme.","body_zh":"2024年8月下旬至2025年2月下旬，篮子大涨135.3%——本系列最大单腿涨幅——呈现多波段风险偏好开启、极端成长主导格局（上证综指+18.7%，周期超额防御13.4pp，成长超额价值33.5pp）。主要触发点为2024年9月24日央行一揽子措施：降准50bp、7天逆回购利率下调20bp、LPR预计下调20-25bp；9月26日政治局会议明确要求\"止跌回稳\"，触发A股5日内自2008年以来最大涨幅（沪深300+26%）。2025年1月27日DeepSeek R1发布作为二级催化剂：以极低成本实现前沿AI能力，引发英伟达市值单日蒸发约6000亿美元，中国AI与人形机器人供应链股票同期大幅上涨。计算机（+92.5%）、电子（+64.7%）与机械（+57.6%）联袂领涨，与刺激政策贝塔及AI/人形机器人主题高度吻合。","drivers":["PBOC Sept 24 2024 bazooka (RRR + repo + LPR cuts)","Sept 26 2024 Politburo halt-the-decline mandate","DeepSeek R1 Jan 27 2025 - China AI sovereign capability proof","humanoid robot commercial buildout theme (MIIT Jan 2023 guidance)"],"drivers_zh":["2024年9月24日央行三连降（降准+逆回购+LPR）","2024年9月26日政治局\"止跌回稳\"明确指令","2025年1月27日DeepSeek R1发布（中国主权AI能力验证）","人形机器人商业化加速（工信部2023年1月指导意见）"],"title":"PBOC Bazooka + Humanoid Robot Theme Supercycle","title_zh":"央行大放水+人形机器人主题超级周期"},"2025-02-26":{"body":"From late February to early April 2025, the basket fell -28.4% in a sharp flight-to-safety rotation (defensives -0.4% vs cyclicals -8.5%, SHCOMP -6.9%, growth lagged value by 11.5pp). On April 2, 2025, President Trump announced 'Liberation Day' tariffs: a flat 10% tariff on all imports plus 34% reciprocal tariff on China (later escalating to 145%), the largest tariff shock in modern US trade history. Global markets fell sharply -- S&P 500 lost roughly 11% in two sessions. Chinese tech and automation stocks were acutely exposed given their export-facing supply-chain links and reliance on global semiconductor flows subject to US export controls. The ctx confirms risk-off: Agriculture (+10.1%), Food & Beverage (+4.3%), and Banks (+0.8%) led, while Electronics (-23.0%), Telecoms (-23.4%), and Computers (-23.9%) lagged -- the most defensive-versus-growth rotation visible in the basket's history.","body_zh":"2025年2月下旬至4月初，篮子下跌28.4%，呈现剧烈避险旋转（防御-0.4% vs 周期-8.5%，上证综指-6.9%，价值超额成长11.5pp）。2025年4月2日，特朗普宣布\"解放日\"关税政策：对全部进口商品加征10%关税，对中国额外加征34%对等关税（后升至145%），为现代美国贸易史上最大关税冲击。全球市场暴跌，标普500两日内下跌约11%。中国科技与自动化股票因出口供应链敞口及美国对华半导体出口管制而首当其冲。板块印证为避险切换：农林牧渔（+10.1%）、食品饮料（+4.3%）与银行（+0.8%）领涨，而电子（-23.0%）、通信（-23.4%）与计算机（-23.9%）垫底——为本系列有记录以来最极端的防御/成长分化。","drivers":["Trump Liberation Day tariffs Apr 2, 2025 (34% on China, later 145%)","global risk-off / S&P 500 -11% two sessions","tech export-control fears compounding tariff shock","flight-to-safety into Agriculture/Food/Banks"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2025年4月2日\"解放日\"关税（对华34%，后升至145%）","全球风险规避，标普500两日内跌约11%","科技出口管制恐慌叠加关税冲击","资金涌入农业/食品/银行等防御板块"],"title":"Trump Liberation Day Tariffs Trigger Growth Selloff","title_zh":"特朗普\"解放日\"关税冲击触发成长股抛售"},"2025-04-08":{"body":"From April 8, 2025 to June 9, 2026 (current peak), the basket surged +151.5% -- the largest leg on record -- in a sustained growth-over-value, AI/humanoid-led supercycle (SHCOMP +27.5%, cyclicals +34.2% vs defensives +0.2%, growth led value by 58.8pp). The primary reversal trigger was the May 12, 2025 US-China 90-day tariff truce (US tariffs on China reduced from 145% to 30%, Chinese tariffs on US from 125% to 10%), which eliminated the acute export-chain tail risk. The 15th Five-Year Plan (2026-2030, adopted March 2026) formally elevated embodied intelligence and humanoid robots to strategic national priority -- the same tier as quantum computing and nuclear fusion -- backed by an 8.2 billion USD National AI Industry Investment Fund. China's commercial humanoid buildout accelerated (90% of global units shipped in 2026, Unitree/AgiBot/UBTECH targeting 75,000+ capacity), while the May 14-15, 2026 Trump-Xi summit further eased AI/semiconductor-control concerns. Telecoms (+256.6%), Electronics (+144.9%), and Metals (+94.7%) led -- the widest growth-over-value spread in the basket's recorded history.","body_zh":"2025年4月8日至2026年6月9日（当前高点），篮子大涨151.5%——为有记录以来最大单腿涨幅——在AI/人形机器人领导的持续成长超级周期中演绎（上证综指+27.5%，周期+34.2% vs 防御+0.2%，成长超额价值58.8pp）。主要反转触发点为2025年5月12日中美90天关税休战（美对华关税从145%降至30%，中对美从125%降至10%），消除了出口供应链的尾部风险。\"十五五\"规划（2026-2030，2026年3月通过）正式将具身智能与人形机器人列为战略性新兴产业，与量子计算、核聚变同等级别，并以82亿美元国家AI产业投资基金作为支撑。商业化人形机器人加速落地（2026年全球出货占比约90%，宇树/智元/优必选目标产能合计逾7.5万台），2026年5月14-15日特朗普-习近平峰会进一步缓和AI/芯片管制紧张局势。通信（+256.6%）、电子（+144.9%）与金属（+94.7%）领涨——成长超额价值利差达本系列有记录以来最宽。","drivers":["May 2025 US-China 90-day tariff truce (145% to 30%)","15th FYP embodied intelligence / humanoid robot national mandate (2026)","commercial humanoid supply-chain buildout (90% global share)","May 2026 Trump-Xi summit easing AI/chip tension"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月中美90天关税休战（145%降至30%）","十五五规划具身智能/人形机器人国家战略（2026年）","商业化人形机器人供应链加速（全球份额约90%）","2026年5月特习峰会缓和AI/芯片管制紧张"],"title":"Tariff Truce + 15th FYP Embodied Intelligence Supercycle","title_zh":"关税休战+十五五具身智能超级周期"}},"now":"The basket is in a Topping phase (pos 69.2/100, rs_rank 4/31) after a +151.5% rally from the April 2025 tariff-shock trough. The current window is the most growth-dominant in the basket's recorded history: SHCOMP +27.5% over the full leg, Electronics (+144.9%) and Telecoms (+256.6%) leading, while defensives are flat (+0.2%) and cyclicals surged (+34.2%), yielding a growth-over-value spread of 58.8pp. The rally is driven by the May 2025 US-China 90-day tariff truce, the 15th Five-Year Plan's explicit elevation of embodied intelligence and humanoid robots to strategic national priority (China ships 90% of global humanoid units in 2026), and accelerating commercial supply-chain buildout with leading producers targeting over 75,000 unit annual capacity. With the basket +25.7% on the current sub-leg and approaching prior all-time peak levels, leadership is narrowing to Electronics and Telecoms -- a classic late-cycle growth-style extension -- and the position at 69.2/100 confirms the topping setup signaled in the phase label.","now_zh":"篮子当前处于顶部阶段（位置69.2/100，强度排名第4/31），自2025年4月关税冲击低点以来已上涨151.5%。当前为本系列有记录以来最强的成长主导行情：上证综指在本阶段涨幅达27.5%，电子（+144.9%）与通信（+256.6%）领涨，而防御性板块仅持平（+0.2%），成长股相对价值股溢价高达58.8个百分点。核心驱动包括：2025年5月中美90天关税休战带来的流动性回流、\"十五五\"规划将具身智能与人形机器人明确列为战略性新兴产业，以及人形机器人供应链商业化加速落地（中国2026年全球出货占比约90%）。篮子当前子阶段已涨25.7%并接近历史高点，领涨品种收窄至电子与通信，呈现典型周期末段动量集中特征，顶部信号已触发。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_semis":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"China's 14th Five-Year Plan (formally adopted March 2021 and detailed through Q2 2021) explicitly designated semiconductor self-reliance as a national strategic priority, unlocking a pipeline of policy-backed IPOs on STAR Market and accelerating government procurement mandates for domestic chips. The sector surged +35.5% in roughly six weeks even as SHCOMP fell -3.4%, demonstrating the move was a pure policy-premium re-rating of import-substitution (国产替代) plays, not index beta. Metals and Power Equipment led cyclicals while defensives collapsed -10.3%, consistent with a speculative risk-on rotation into Beijing-backed tech themes rather than broad market strength. The catalyst was concrete policy text naming chips as a 'chokehold' (卡脖子) technology and committed RMB-trillions in IC Fund sequels.","body_zh":"中国「十四五」规划（2021年3月正式通过，Q2细则落地）明确将半导体自主可控列为国家战略优先事项，推动科创板相关IPO管线加速落地，并加快政府采购国产芯片的指令。在同期上证综指下跌-3.4%的情况下，板块六周内暴涨35.5%，显示本次上涨是纯粹的政策溢价重估，而非指数贝塔驱动。金属与电力设备领涨，防御性板块重挫-10.3%，与投机性风险偏好向政策加持科技主题轮动的特征完全吻合。核心催化剂是规划文本直接点名芯片为「卡脖子」技术，并承诺大基金二期续资。","drivers":["14th Five-Year Plan chip mandate","STAR Market IPO pipeline","国产替代 policy premium","cyclical rotation away from defensives","Big Fund II deployment"],"drivers_zh":["十四五芯片专项规划","科创板IPO管线","国产替代政策溢价","防御性板块资金外流","大基金二期部署"],"title":"14th Plan Self-Reliance Premium Ignites Sector","title_zh":"\"十四五\"自主可控政策溢价引爆板块"},"2021-07-30":{"body":"From its July 2021 peak, the sector entered a nine-month, -39.9% collapse driven by two overlapping shocks: Beijing's sweeping tech regulatory crackdown (targeting platform companies from mid-2021 onward) and the September 2021 government audit of the National IC ('Big Fund') that ultimately led to the arrest of CEO Ding Wenwu and at least seven other senior executives in July 2022, casting a shadow backwards over the entire fund's portfolio. SHCOMP fell -15.0% over this period, and the rotation was classic flight-to-safety: Coal (+6.7%), Real Estate (+3.2%), and Agriculture (+3.0%) led, while Electronics (-41.8%), Power Equipment (-33.8%), and Computers (-32.4%) lagged badly. Growth massively underperformed value by -14.6pp, consistent with a sector-specific governance/regulatory risk shock layered on top of a broad index down-leg.","body_zh":"自2021年7月峰值起，板块进入长达九个月、累计-39.9%的下行通道，由两大冲击叠加驱动：北京对平台经济的大规模监管整顿（2021年中起持续推进），以及2021年9月启动的国家集成电路产业投资基金（大基金）审计——最终导致基金董事长丁文武等至少八名高管于2022年7月被捕，阴影提前笼罩整个组合。期间上证综指下跌-15.0%，资金旋转呈现典型避险特征：煤炭（+6.7%）、房地产（+3.2%）、农业（+3.0%）领涨，而电子（-41.8%）、电力设备（-33.8%）、计算机（-32.4%）大幅落后。成长风格跑输价值-14.6pp，与行业治理/监管风险叠加大盘下行的复合冲击特征高度一致。","drivers":["Big Fund corruption probe / governance shock","CCP tech platform regulatory crackdown","flight-to-safety value rotation","SHCOMP broad market decline -15%","growth-to-value style reversal"],"drivers_zh":["大基金腐败调查与治理冲击","中共平台经济监管整顿","避险资金轮向价值股","上证综指大盘下行-15%","成长转价值风格切换"],"title":"Big Fund Probe and Tech Crackdown Derail Rally","title_zh":"大基金腐败调查与科技监管风暴终结涨势"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"The April 29, 2022 Politburo meeting delivered a watershed policy pivot: Beijing pledged to support 'healthy development' of tech platform companies, removing prior language about 'steady forward' regulatory pressure, and vowed fiscal/monetary stimulus to hit GDP targets. SHCOMP had reached its April 26 trough (roughly 2,900) and the Shanghai lockdown (March-June 2022) was signaling an eventual end, unleashing pent-up industrial recovery. The sector surged +44.0% over 3.5 months as SHCOMP rebounded +13.7% — growth beat value by +17.1pp, with Power Equipment (+54.4%), Autos (+47.7%), and Defense (+47.1%) all co-leading, confirming this was a broad policy-relief rally with cyclicals and growth themes capturing most of the beta. Semiconductor stocks benefited disproportionately from the signal that Beijing was backing away from the tech crackdown.","body_zh":"2022年4月29日政治局会议释放关键转向信号：北京承诺支持科技平台企业「健康发展」，删除此前「稳步推进」的监管措辞，并誓言出台财政货币刺激以保住GDP目标。上证综指在4月26日触及阶段性底部（约2,900点），上海封控（2022年3月至6月）也释放出即将解除的信号，压抑已久的工业复苏预期得以释放。板块在3.5个月内上涨44.0%，同期上证综指回升13.7%——成长跑赢价值17.1pp，电力设备（+54.4%）、汽车（+47.7%）、国防军工（+47.1%）共同领涨，确认这是一场以政策宽松为核心的周期性大盘反弹，成长和周期主题捕获了绝大部分贝塔。半导体股因政策转向信号获得超额弹性。","drivers":["April 29 Politburo tech policy pivot","Shanghai lockdown exit anticipation","PBOC / fiscal stimulus vows","broad cyclical rebound beta","growth style re-rating"],"drivers_zh":["4月29日政治局科技政策转向","上海封控退出预期","央行与财政刺激承诺","周期性宽松行情贝塔","成长风格重估"],"title":"Politburo Pivot and Lockdown Exit Fuel Rebound","title_zh":"政治局政策转向与封控结束预期驱动反弹"},"2022-08-11":{"body":"The Biden administration's landmark October 7, 2022 export controls — the most sweeping chip-related restrictions in history, targeting advanced computing chips, chipmaking equipment, and US persons at Chinese fabs — were telegraphed through August and September via Congressional CHIPS Act debates and early Commerce Department signals, causing the sector to sell off -28.5% even before the formal announcement. Separately, the July-August 2022 Big Fund corruption arrests (Ding Wenwu et al.) removed key government patrons for domestic chipmakers. SHCOMP fell -9.2%, Coal led (+7.9%), while Computers (-18.0%), Autos (-19.0%), and Electronics (-26.2%) lagged — value beat growth by +8.2pp, consistent with a tech-specific risk-off repricing rather than a defensive macro flight.","body_zh":"拜登政府2022年10月7日出台史上最严芯片出口管制——覆盖先进计算芯片、芯片制造设备及在华工作的美国公民——在8至9月间已通过美国《芯片法案》国会辩论和商务部早期信号提前传导，导致板块在正式公告前已下跌-28.5%。与此同时，2022年7至8月大基金系列腐败案（丁文武等人被捕）抽走了国内芯片厂商的关键政府支柱。期间上证综指下行-9.2%，煤炭领涨（+7.9%），计算机（-18.0%）、汽车（-19.0%）、电子（-26.2%）大幅落后——价值跑赢成长+8.2pp，与科技特定风险的重新定价特征吻合，而非防御性宏观避险。","drivers":["US Oct-7 2022 export controls (anticipatory repricing)","Big Fund executive arrests (July-Aug 2022)","CHIPS Act US domestic subsidies signal","growth-to-value style reversal","tech/growth risk-off rotation"],"drivers_zh":["美国10·7出口管制（预期性重新定价）","大基金高管被捕（2022年7-8月）","美国《芯片法案》国内补贴信号","成长转价值风格切换","科技/成长风险规避轮动"],"title":"US Oct-7 Export Controls Shock Reprices Sector","title_zh":"美国10·7出口管制冲击重新定价板块"},"2022-10-11":{"body":"Two sequential catalysts drove this +68.7% rally — the largest in the series — over six months. First, China's unexpected dismantling of zero-COVID policy from November 2022 (accelerated after the November 24 Urumqi fire protests) unleashed reopening optimism and SHCOMP recovered +13.0% from its October trough. Second, OpenAI's ChatGPT launch (November 30, 2022) ignited a global AI arms-race narrative that directly benefited China's domestic AI chip theme, with investors pricing in Huawei Ascend and domestic GPU substitute demand. Media (+70.1%), Computers (+63.3%), and Telecoms (+46.4%) co-led, while Coal (-13.7%) and Power Equipment (-7.7%) lagged — growth outperformed value by an extreme +26.0pp, confirming the move was a liquidity/theme-driven rotation into growth/tech rather than broad cyclical recovery. Semiconductors rode both tailwinds simultaneously.","body_zh":"本轮+68.7%涨幅——系列中最大单腿——由两个接力催化剂在六个月内驱动。其一，中国于2022年11月意外拆除清零政策（11月24日乌鲁木齐火灾抗议后提速），释放重新开放预期，上证综指从10月低点回升13.0%。其二，OpenAI于2022年11月30日发布ChatGPT，引爆全球AI军备竞赛叙事，直接受益于国内AI芯片主题，市场开始为华为昇腾及国产GPU替代需求定价。传媒（+70.1%）、计算机（+63.3%）、通信（+46.4%）共同领涨，而煤炭（-13.7%）和电力设备（-7.7%）落后——成长跑赢价值高达+26.0pp，确认本轮行情是流动性与主题驱动的成长/科技轮动，而非宽泛的周期复苏。半导体同时受益于两大顺风。","drivers":["zero-COVID dismantling (Nov 2022)","ChatGPT AI theme (Nov 30 2022)","reopening liquidity rotation into growth","domestic AI chip demand pricing","SHCOMP recovery from Oct 2022 trough"],"drivers_zh":["新冠清零政策终止（2022年11月）","ChatGPT AI主题（2022年11月30日）","重新开放流动性轮向成长股","国内AI芯片需求定价","上证综指从2022年10月低点回升"],"title":"Zero-COVID Exit and ChatGPT Ignite 68% Surge","title_zh":"新冠清零退出与ChatGPT点燃68%暴涨"},"2023-04-20":{"body":"As the ChatGPT euphoria faded post-April 2023, China's structural headwinds asserted dominance: Country Garden defaulted on its offshore bonds in August 2023 (joining Evergrande's effective failure), CPI turned negative in mid-2023 (deflation), and foreign institutional capital fled en masse — an estimated 90% of bullish foreign investors exited through 2023-24. SHCOMP fell -19.7% and the flight-to-safety rotation was unambiguous: Coal (+5.9%), Banks (-3.3%), and Utilities (-9.3%) led, while Computers (-46.6%), Services (-40.6%), and Power Equipment (-40.2%) were decimated — defensives outperformed cyclicals by +8.6pp and value led growth by +16.2pp. Semiconductors (-41.1%) fell in line with the broader growth-tech rout, amplified by continued US export control tightening and no clear domestic demand recovery to offset.","body_zh":"2023年4月ChatGPT行情降温后，中国结构性逆风全面压制：碧桂园于2023年8月境外债违约（步恒大覆辙），CPI于2023年中转负（通缩），外资机构资金大规模出逃——据估计约90%的看多外资于2023至24年撤离。上证综指下跌-19.7%，资金避险轮动清晰可辨：煤炭（+5.9%）、银行（-3.3%）、公用事业（-9.3%）领先，计算机（-46.6%）、服务（-40.6%）、电力设备（-40.2%）遭受重创——防御性板块跑赢周期性板块+8.6pp，价值跑赢成长+16.2pp。半导体（-41.1%）随成长/科技板块整体下挫，且持续收紧的美国出口管制与缺乏可见的国内需求复苏进一步放大了跌幅。","drivers":["property sector collapse (Country Garden default Aug 2023)","China deflation / CPI negative","foreign capital exodus","SHCOMP broad market -19.7%","flight-to-safety / value rotation"],"drivers_zh":["房地产崩溃（碧桂园2023年8月违约）","中国通缩/CPI转负","外资大规模撤离","上证综指大盘下行-19.7%","避险/价值轮动"],"title":"Property Crisis and Deflation Crush Growth Stocks","title_zh":"房地产危机与通缩重创成长股"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The February 2024 trough was arrested by Central Huijin's explicit pledge to ramp CSI 300 ETF purchases ('resolutely ensure stable operations'), triggering the base. Three subsequent catalysts layered into a multi-year, +400.8% compound rally: (1) China's May 2024 Big Fund III ($47.5 billion third tranche of the IC Fund) signaled the largest-ever state commitment to domestic chipmaking; (2) the September 2024 PBOC rate/RRR cuts + fiscal package drove a broad market surge (SHCOMP +52.5% over the full leg); and (3) DeepSeek V3 (December 2024) and V4 (April 2026), optimized for Huawei Ascend 950 processors, validated China's domestic AI stack and triggered a scramble for domestic chips by ByteDance, Tencent, and Alibaba. Telecoms (+435.8%) and Electronics (+341.5%) co-led — cyclicals beat defensives by +48pp and growth crushed value by +121.7pp — confirming this is the ultimate expression of China's semiconductor self-sufficiency thesis in a liquidity/policy/AI-theme supercycle.","body_zh":"2024年2月低点由中央汇金明确承诺加码申购沪深300 ETF（「坚决维护市场稳定」）终结，奠定反弹基础。此后三大催化剂叠加，推动多年期+400.8%复合大涨：①2024年5月大基金三期（475亿美元）释放史上最大规模国家半导体投入承诺；②2024年9月央行降准降息+财政一揽子刺激推动大盘整体大幅上行（上证综指全腿累计+52.5%）；③DeepSeek V3（2024年12月）和V4（2026年4月）专门适配华为昇腾950处理器，验证了中国本土AI技术栈，促使字节跳动、腾讯、阿里巴巴争相抢购国产芯片。通信（+435.8%）与电子（+341.5%）联袂领涨——周期性跑赢防御性+48pp，成长碾压价值+121.7pp——确认这是中国半导体自主可控叙事在流动性/政策/AI主题超级周期中的终极兑现。","drivers":["National Team CSI 300 ETF buying (Feb 2024)","Big Fund III $47.5B (May 2024)","Sep 2024 PBOC stimulus + fiscal package","DeepSeek V3/V4 Huawei Ascend validation","AI-driven domestic chip demand supercycle"],"drivers_zh":["国家队沪深300 ETF增持（2024年2月）","大基金三期475亿美元（2024年5月）","2024年9月央行降准降息+财政刺激","DeepSeek V3/V4华为昇腾验证","AI驱动国产芯片需求超级周期"],"title":"National Team, Big Fund III, and DeepSeek Drive 400% Mega-Rally","title_zh":"国家队、大基金三期与DeepSeek驱动400%超级行情"}},"now":"China semiconductors (半导体) sit at cycle position 93.7 — deep in the Topping phase after a 400.8% rally from the February 2024 trough. The basket carries the highest relative-strength rank (rs_rank=1) in the 31-sector universe, yet the now_ctx signals warn of distribution: Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) are co-leading while defensives are being crushed (Agriculture -26.3%, Beauty -26.9%, Retail -31.1%), confirming an extreme growth-over-value rotation (+18.2pp). SHCOMP itself is up only +1.6% in the current window, meaning the sector's outperformance is now entirely theme-driven (DeepSeek V4 + Huawei Ascend ecosystem validation), not index beta. At 93.7 cycle position with leadership narrowing to two adjacent growth sectors and the broader market barely positive, the technical setup rhymes with prior exhaustion peaks.","now_zh":"中国半导体板块目前处于周期位置93.7，正处于见顶阶段——自2024年2月低点以来已累计上涨400.8%。该板块在31个申万行业中相对强度排名第一（rs_rank=1），但当前上下文信号已显示出分配迹象：电子（+75.5%）与通信（+67.7%）联袂领涨，而防御性板块遭到重创（农业-26.3%、美容-26.9%、零售-31.1%），确认成长极度跑赢价值（+18.2pp）。上证综指本窗口仅上涨1.6%，意味着板块超额收益完全由主题驱动（DeepSeek V4 + 华为昇腾生态落地），而非指数贝塔。在周期位置93.7、领涨品种收窄至两个相邻成长行业、大盘几乎停滞的情况下，技术形态与历次见顶前的衰竭特征高度相似。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_soe_value":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From mid-2021, Beijing's sweeping Common Prosperity regulatory crackdown on private internet and tech giants (Alibaba antitrust fine July 2021, Didi pulled from app stores, EdTech nationalization August 2021) drove a sustained capital rotation away from private-sector growth names and into SOE-dominated sectors. CSRC Chairman Yi Huiman formally called for a 'valuation system with Chinese characteristics' (中特估) in November 2022, triggering speculative re-rating of chronically discounted central SOEs — particularly the telecom carriers (China Mobile relisted on A-shares January 2022, quickly surpassing Moutai in market cap by April 2023), infrastructure builders, and state banks. This counter-cyclical SOE alpha was extraordinary: the basket gained 64.5% while SHCOMP fell 3.5%, with Construction (+29%), Telecoms (+22%), and Media (+23%) leading while defensive consumer and pharma names lagged sharply — consistent with the policy-driven, not macro-driven, nature of the rotation.","body_zh":"2021年中起，北京以「共同富裕」为旗帜对私营互联网平台展开全面整顿（阿里反垄断罚款2021年7月、滴滴下架、教培行业国有化），资金持续从私营成长股流向央企主导的行业。2022年11月，证监会主席易会满正式提出「中国特色估值体系（中特估）」，引发市场对长期折价央企的重估浪潮——尤其是三大运营商（中国移动2022年1月回归A股，2023年4月市值一度超越茅台）、基建国企及国有银行。这场反周期的央企阿尔法行情十分罕见：篮子涨64.5%，同期上证综指跌3.5%；建筑（+29%）、通信（+22%）、传媒（+23%）领涨，消费品及医药等防御类大幅落后，印证了本轮行情属于政策驱动而非宏观改善。","drivers":["Common Prosperity tech crackdown","中特估 Yi Huiman Nov-2022 speech","China Mobile A-share relisting","SASAC market-value management mandate","SOE dividend reform signaling"],"drivers_zh":["共同富裕科技整顿","中特估2022年11月政策信号","中国移动A股上市","国资委市值管理考核","央企分红改革预期"],"title":"SOE Re-Rating: Tech Crackdown + 中特估 Ignition","title_zh":"中特估重估：科技整顿与央企价值发现"},"2023-05-08":{"body":"The 中特估 rally peaked in early May 2023 as post-COVID reopening euphoria gave way to hard data: China's economic recovery lost momentum sharply in Q2 2023, with private fixed-asset investment falling 0.2% YoY in H1 2023 and the property sector deepening into crisis (Country Garden reporting a $6.7bn loss in H1 2023, heading for default by August). CPI deflation set in and the yuan weakened sharply through August 2023. SHCOMP fell 18.4% over this leg, and the SOE basket declined 23.8% — broadly in line with market beta though value sectors held up marginally better than growth (VALUE led growth by 6.2pp). Construction and Media reversed hardest as the sectors that had led the 中特估 cycle saw profit-taking while Coal, Appliances, and Autos (defensive cyclicals) were the relative survivors. In January 2024, technical forced selling from snowball-derivative knock-ins on the CSI 500 and CSI 1000 (estimated ~RMB 216bn at risk) amplified the final flush to the trough.","body_zh":"2023年5月上旬中特估行情见顶，此后随着疫后复苏动能快速消退而转为下行：2023年上半年私人固定资产投资同比下降0.2%，地产危机持续恶化（碧桂园2023年上半年亏损约470亿元并于8月警告违约），CPI陷入通缩、人民币大幅贬值。上证综指本腿下跌18.4%，篮子跌幅23.8%，基本跟随市场beta，价值小幅跑赢成长6.2个百分点。建筑和传媒在此前中特估周期中涨幅最大，本轮获利回吐最为剧烈；煤炭、家电、汽车相对抗跌。2024年1月，CSI500/1000雪球结构性产品（估计规模约2160亿元人民币）集中触及敲入线，强制平仓进一步放大下跌，推动本腿探底。","drivers":["Post-COVID reopening disappointment","Property sector deepening crisis (Country Garden)","Deflationary pressure + yuan depreciation","Foreign institutional exodus","Snowball derivative forced-sell cascade Jan-2024"],"drivers_zh":["疫后复苏不及预期","地产危机深化（碧桂园违约）","通缩压力与人民币贬值","外资机构大规模撤退","雪球衍生品1月强制平仓"],"title":"Reopening Disappointment + Property Crisis Selloff","title_zh":"重开预期落空 + 地产危机引发回调"},"2024-01-23":{"body":"The trough coincided with Central Huijin's announced ETF purchasing campaign in late January 2024; Huijin deployed at least RMB 300bn (~$41bn) in Q1 2024 alone into CSI 300 ETFs, providing the floor. The cycle's decisive acceleration came on September 24, 2024 when the PBOC announced a coordinated 'bazooka' stimulus: RRR cut of 50bp (releasing ~RMB 1tn liquidity), key lending rate cuts, a RMB 500bn equity swap facility for non-bank institutions, and a RMB 300bn share-buyback relending program. CSI 300 jumped 16% in a single week — its biggest gain since 2008. SOE Blue Chips rose 47.5% through March 2026 in near-perfect lockstep with SHCOMP (+47.8%), confirming this leg was broad beta rather than SOE-specific alpha. Cyclicals led decisively (56.9% vs defensives 16.9%), with Telecoms (+179.9%) and Metals (+154.9%) at the forefront — SOEs benefited from broad market momentum rather than a repeat of the 中特估 re-rating.","body_zh":"本轮低点恰与汇金公司2024年1月下旬公开宣布增购ETF的时机吻合；汇金仅2024年一季度便向沪深300 ETF投入逾3000亿元（约410亿美元）进行托底。周期关键转折点为2024年9月24日——央行祭出「一揽子」组合拳：降准50bp（释放约1万亿流动性）、下调政策利率、设立5000亿元互换便利（供非银机构购股）及3000亿元股票回购专项再贷款。沪深300单周涨16%，创2008年以来最大单周涨幅。中特估篮子至2026年3月累涨47.5%，与上证综指（+47.8%）几乎同步，印证本轮属于市场整体beta而非央企特有阿尔法。周期股大幅领先（+56.9% vs 防御+16.9%），通信（+179.9%）与有色金属（+154.9%）居首，央企随大盘上涨而非重演中特估专项重估。","drivers":["Central Huijin national-team ETF buying Q1-2024","PBOC Sep-24 bazooka: RRR -50bp + 500bn swap + 300bn buyback facility","CSI300 16% weekly surge Sep-Oct 2024","Broad risk-on beta rally SHCOMP +47.8%","DeepSeek/AI narrative sustaining market into early 2026"],"drivers_zh":["汇金2024年Q1大规模增购ETF","央行9·24「一揽子」刺激：降准50bp+互换便利+股票回购再贷款","沪深300单周涨16%（2024年9月底）","上证综指整体涨47.8%的广谱beta行情","DeepSeek/AI叙事延续至2026年初"],"title":"National Team + PBOC Bazooka Drive Broad Beta Rally","title_zh":"国家队托底 + 央行「一揽子」刺激带动市场整体反弹"},"2026-03-13":{"body":"From March 2026, the tape rotated sharply away from high-dividend SOE value into domestic AI and semiconductor themes, leaving SOE Blue Chips down 21.7% while SHCOMP fell only 1.7% — a 20pp style-factor underperformance. Electronics (+66%) and Telecoms (+60%) led in the broader market, but the SOE basket is not the AI-hardware beneficiary — it is the high-dividend, low-growth end of those sectors. US tariff escalation in early April 2026 (baseline tariffs on Chinese imports raised to ~104%) accelerated capital rotation toward domestic self-sufficiency and AI supply-chain names rather than defensive SOE yield. The growth-over-value spread reached 20.9pp, and SOE construction, steel, and agriculture-linked names were the hardest hit (Steel -27.6%, Agriculture -28.5%), consistent with a pure style-rotation selloff rather than fundamental impairment — SHCOMP's near-flat read confirms that macro beta is not the driver.","body_zh":"2026年3月起，市场风格急剧转向国内AI与半导体主题，中特估篮子下跌21.7%，而上证综指仅跌1.7%——超额跌幅近20个百分点，为典型风格因子性下跌。电子（+66%）和通信（+60%）在市场整体中领涨，但央企篮子持仓属于高股息、低成长类资产，并非AI算力产业链受益标的。2026年4月初美国对华关税升至约104%基准税率，进一步推动资金涌向国内自主可控、AI供应链方向，加速撤离防御性央企高息股。成长对价值溢价达20.9个百分点，建筑、钢铁、农业相关央企跌幅最大（钢铁-27.6%，农业-28.5%），与纯粹风格轮动性杀跌相符——上证综指基本持平进一步印证并非宏观系统性风险，而是风格切换所致。","drivers":["Growth-over-value style rotation 20.9pp spread","US tariff escalation (104% baseline, Apr-2026) boosting AI/self-sufficiency theme","Capital outflow from high-dividend value into AI/semiconductor names","SOE basket lacks AI-hardware exposure","DeepSeek-era AI narrative marginalizing high-yield cyclical SOEs"],"drivers_zh":["成长对价值风格溢价扩至20.9个百分点","美国关税升级（2026年4月基准104%）激活AI/自主可控叙事","资金从高股息价值股流向AI/半导体","央企篮子缺乏AI算力硬件敞口","DeepSeek时代AI叙事边缘化高息周期央企"],"title":"Growth-Over-Value Rotation Crushes SOE Dividend Play","title_zh":"成长对价值风格大轮动，高股息央企惨遭抛售"}},"now":"SOE Blue Chips are at a cycle trough (pos = 0.0, rs_rank 19 of 31), down ~14% in the current window while SHCOMP is up 1.6%. The tape is unambiguously growth-led: Electronics and Telecoms are up 66–75% while this basket languishes at the laggard end. Growth is beating value by 18 pp — the opposite of the structural tailwind that drove the 2021–2023 re-rating cycle. The basket sits below its 200-day moving average with no active buy signal, and cyclicals barely edge defensives (+0.3% vs -12.1%), confirming the market is chasing AI/tech themes rather than dividend yield or policy-driven SOE re-rating. The near-term setup is bottoming but requires either a style rotation back toward value/yield or a new SASAC-driven catalyst to break the downtrend.","now_zh":"中特估板块当前处于周期底部（位置得分0.0，相对强度排名19/31），本窗口累计跌约14%，而上证综指同期涨1.6%。市场行情明显由成长风格主导：电子涨逾75%、通信涨近68%，而本篮子仍处垫底区域。成长对价值溢价高达18个百分点，与2021—2023年中特估重估行情中价值主导的格局截然相反。篮子股价位于200日均线下方，无有效买入信号。周期股与防御股差距微弱（+0.3% vs -12.1%），显示资金追逐AI/科技主题而非高股息/政策性央企重估逻辑。短期格局为磨底阶段，需等待风格切回价值/高息或新一轮国资委驱动的政策催化才能打破跌势。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_software":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"From the June 2021 trough, domestic software rallied +41.5% against a falling SHCOMP (-5.8%), with growth beating value by 10.4pp and defensives badly lagging (-14.9%) -- a purely theme-driven tape. Beijing's 14th Five-Year Plan (March 2021) mandated phased replacement of all foreign software in government and state enterprises, and 166 xinchuang policies were issued by October 2022, channeling CNY 27.9B in government contracts across 2020-2022. The rally reached its climax when ChatGPT's global launch (November 2022) triggered a buying frenzy in Chinese AI names: iFlytek, Hanwang Technology, and Beijing Deep Glint surged 40-60%+ by February-March 2023, with E Fund's AI Theme ETF returning over 40% in two months. Telecoms (+26.1%) and infrastructure cyclicals led broader market gains while banks and pharma were the worst laggards, confirming the theme-driven rotation away from defensives.","body_zh":"自2021年6月低点，国内软件股在上证综指下跌5.8%的背景下强势上涨41.5%，成长跑赢价值10.4pp，防御板块大幅落后（-14.9%），是一轮纯粹由流动性和主题驱动的行情。2021年3月北京发布的十四五规划明确要求党政机关及国有企业分阶段完成信息技术国产替代，截至2022年10月已出台166项信创相关政策，2020-2022年间政府采购合同达279亿元。行情在ChatGPT于2022年11月全球发布后迎来高潮：科大讯飞、汉王科技、北京博深光电等股票在2023年2-3月间飙涨40-60%以上，E Fund人工智能主题ETF两个月收益率超40%。通信（+26.1%）和基建周期股在大市中领涨，银行和医药垫底，印证了远离防御股的主题轮动格局。","drivers":["xinchuang IT-localization mandate (14th Five-Year Plan March 2021)","166 xinchuang policies by Oct 2022 driving CNY 27.9B procurement cycle","ChatGPT global launch Nov 2022 triggering AI theme frenzy into Apr 2023","growth-over-value liquidity tape with defensives badly lagging (-14.9%)","SHCOMP underperformance amplifies software relative outperformance"],"drivers_zh":["信创国产替代强制要求（十四五规划2021年3月）","截至2022年10月166项信创政策驱动279亿元政府采购周期","ChatGPT 2022年11月全球发布引爆AI主题热潮延续至2023年4月","成长主导的流动性行情，防御板块大幅落后（-14.9%）","上证弱势凸显软件板块相对强势"],"title":"Xinchuang mandate fuels AI theme climax","title_zh":"信创政策加速叠加AI主题热潮"},"2023-04-04":{"body":"The April 2023 peak marked the end of the xinchuang-ChatGPT cycle: the series fell -47.6% over ten months as SHCOMP declined -18.4% and value rotation overwhelmed growth (value led by 16.6pp, coal +6.1%, banks +0.4%, while computers crashed -48.2%). The trigger was a combination of AI theme exhaustion after the February-March 2023 froth, China's sharply disappointing post-COVID economic recovery -- retail sales and industrial output missed targets as the property sector continued to implode -- and a sustained foreign investor exodus that pushed the CSI 300 to fresh 2023 lows by September. Evergrande was ordered into liquidation in January 2024, crystallizing the property overhang and triggering the final leg down into the February 2024 trough. This was a broad beta drawdown amplified by software's high-growth valuation multiple.","body_zh":"2023年4月的峰值标志着信创-ChatGPT周期结束：随后十个月系列下跌47.6%，上证综指跌18.4%，价值轮动全面压制成长（价值领先成长16.6pp，煤炭+6.1%、银行+0.4%，计算机-48.2%）。导火索是2023年2-3月AI热情退潮、中国疫后经济复苏令人失望（零售和工业产出均不及预期，房地产继续下行）以及外资持续流出（CSI 300于9月再创年内新低）三重共振。2024年1月法院裁定恒大清盘，将房地产悬空问题推至高潮，引发最终跌势，直至2024年2月触底。此次回调是大市Beta回撤叠加软件高估值双重杀击的结果。","drivers":["ChatGPT AI theme exhaustion after Feb-Mar 2023 froth peak","China post-COVID economic recovery disappointment (property crisis deepening)","foreign capital exodus (CSI 300 to 2023 lows by September 2023)","value rotation (coal/banks outperform, growth de-rates 16.6pp)","Evergrande liquidation order Jan 2024 crystallizing property overhang"],"drivers_zh":["ChatGPT AI主题热情在2023年2-3月高潮后退潮","中国疫后经济复苏不及预期（房地产危机持续深化）","外资持续流出（CSI 300于2023年9月再创年内新低）","价值轮动（煤炭/银行领涨，成长估值压缩16.6pp）","2024年1月恒大清盘令落地将房地产尾部风险显性化"],"title":"AI theme exhaustion into post-COVID growth letdown","title_zh":"AI主题退潮叠加疫后复苏失望"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"The February 5, 2024 trough coincided precisely with the PBOC's 0.5pp RRR cut becoming effective, releasing CNY 1 trillion in long-term liquidity -- announced January 24 with explicit intent to halt a CNY 6 trillion stock-market rout -- together with accelerated national-team equity purchases. The concurrent release of OpenAI Sora (text-to-video, February 2024) reignited generative AI excitement in China, with Computers (+41.3%) and Media (+38.3%) leading as growth beat value by 17.8pp and SHCOMP surged +14%. In just six weeks the series gained +39.2% -- the fastest short-cycle rally in the dataset -- driven by policy liquidity injection and AI sentiment rerating.","body_zh":"2024年2月5日的低点恰与央行降准0.5个百分点存款准备金率正式生效时间吻合，释放约1万亿元长期流动性——1月24日宣布，明确旨在遏制累计约6万亿元的股市跌幅——同期国家队加速入市护盘。OpenAI于2024年2月发布Sora（文字生成视频），重燃中国市场对生成式AI的热情，计算机（+41.3%）和传媒（+38.3%）领涨，成长跑赢价值17.8pp，上证综指大涨+14%。短短六周内系列涨幅达39.2%，是数据集中涨速最快的短周期行情，完全由政策流动性注入和AI情绪重估驱动。","drivers":["PBOC 50bp RRR cut (effective Feb 5 2024) releasing CNY 1T liquidity","national team equity rescue fund acceleration","OpenAI Sora text-to-video release Feb 2024 reigniting AI theme","growth-over-value rerating (+17.8pp in 6 weeks)","short-covering in deeply oversold tech names"],"drivers_zh":["央行2024年2月5日降准50bp释放1万亿元流动性","国家队加速入市护盘","OpenAI Sora文字生成视频2024年2月重燃AI主题","成长重估领先价值17.8pp（6周内）","超跌科技股空头回补"],"title":"PBOC rescue bazooka reignites generative AI theme","title_zh":"央行降准护盘叠加生成式AI重燃热情"},"2024-03-20":{"body":"After the sharp rebound, the series gave back -33.9% from March to August 2024 while SHCOMP declined -7.5% in a flight-to-safety rotation (defensives -7.6% outperformed cyclicals -14.2%, value beat growth by 9.7pp, banks +10.5% versus computers -31.3%). The trigger was the exhaustion of the Sora-driven rerating: no domestic application-layer killer product emerged, while China's property sector continued its multi-year slide with no credible rescue package in place. The Federal Reserve's higher-for-longer stance (first cut not until September 2024) sustained USD strength and capital outflow pressure. Computers and Media were the two worst Shenwan performers, consistent with de-risking from high-multiple growth into the only positive sectors -- banks and utilities.","body_zh":"急速反弹后，系列于2024年3月至8月间回吐33.9%，上证综指跌7.5%，市场呈现风险规避轮动（防御板块-7.6%优于周期的-14.2%，价值跑赢成长9.7pp，银行+10.5%，计算机-31.3%）。导火索是Sora驱动的估值重估热情消退：国内应用层始终未出现杀手级产品，而中国房地产持续多年下行且无有力救市方案。美联储更高更久的利率立场（2024年9月才首次降息）维持美元强势，加剧资本外流压力。申万计算机和传媒是全市场最差行业，印证资金从高估值成长股转向唯一正收益板块（银行和公用事业）的去风险格局。","drivers":["Sora AI theme exhaustion, no China application-layer killer product","China property sector multi-year decline without credible rescue package","Fed higher-for-longer stance (no cut until Sep 2024) sustaining USD strength","value rotation into banks/utilities (sole positive Shenwan sectors)","growth multiple compression amplifying software-specific drawdown"],"drivers_zh":["Sora AI主题退潮，国内应用层无杀手级产品","中国房地产持续多年下行且无有力救市方案","美联储高利率立场（2024年9月才首次降息）维持美元强势","价值轮动流入银行/公用事业（申万唯一正收益板块）","成长估值压缩放大软件特定跌幅"],"title":"AI rally fades as property-deflation drag reasserts","title_zh":"AI行情退热，地产通缩压力重现"},"2024-08-27":{"body":"The largest leg in the dataset (+124%) was driven by two sequential macro catalysts. On September 24, 2024, the PBOC, CSRC, and NFRA jointly announced the most comprehensive stimulus package since 2008: a 50bp RRR cut, LPR reductions, a CNY 500B equity market swap facility for nonbanks, and CNY 300B in special relending for listed-company buybacks -- the CSI 300 surged 16% in one week, its biggest weekly gain since 2008. Then DeepSeek released its R1 reasoning model (January 10-20, 2025), demonstrating frontier AI performance at roughly 1/30th the training cost of US rivals, triggering a second-wave rerating of Chinese AI application names globally. Computers surged +93.2% for the leg, growth beat value by 34.8pp, and SHCOMP rose +18.4% -- a textbook dual-catalyst cycle combining policy liquidity shock with a technology paradigm shift.","body_zh":"这是数据集中幅度最大的一段行情（+124%），由两轮宏观催化剂依次驱动。2024年9月24日，央行、证监会和金融监管总局联合出台2008年以来最全面的一揽子刺激政策：降准50bp、下调LPR、推出5000亿元非银机构股票互换便利及3000亿元再贷款支持上市公司回购——CSI 300单周飙涨16%，创2008年以来最大周涨幅。随后，DeepSeek于2025年1月10-20日发布R1推理模型，以不足美国竞争对手1/30的训练成本展现前沿AI能力，全球范围内中国应用层AI股票迎来第二轮估值重评。申万计算机全段涨93.2%，成长跑赢价值34.8pp，上证综指涨18.4%，是政策流动性冲击叠加技术范式转变的教科书式双催化周期。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24 triple-cut bazooka (50bp RRR + LPR + CNY500B swap + CNY300B relending)","DeepSeek R1 frontier-AI-at-low-cost breakthrough (Jan 10-20, 2025)","growth-over-value surge 34.8pp in one leg","SHCOMP +18.4% broad beta rally amplifying software outperformance","global AI application layer rerating on China tech competitiveness reset"],"drivers_zh":["央行9月24日三管齐下（降准50bp+LPR+5000亿互换便利+3000亿再贷款）","DeepSeek R1低成本前沿AI突破（2025年1月10-20日）","单段行情成长暴涨领先价值34.8pp","上证综指+18.4%广泛上涨放大软件板块Beta收益","全球范围内中国应用层AI估值重评重置对中国科技竞争力的认知"],"title":"PBOC September bazooka plus DeepSeek ignite +124% surge","title_zh":"央行9月大招加DeepSeek引爆+124%暴涨"},"2025-02-24":{"body":"The February-April 2025 selloff (-25%) was a classic flight-to-safety rotation: defensives fell -2.8% versus cyclicals -9.0%, value beat growth by 11.2pp, with Agriculture (+0.6%) and Food & Beverages (0.0%) as sole positive sectors while Computers (-24.7%) and Telecoms (-23.5%) were the worst performers. The initial trigger was President Trump's February 25 executive order further decoupling China tech investment, followed by the April 2 Liberation Day sweeping tariff announcement (10%+ universal tariffs on China goods) which sent Chinese stocks into panic selling on April 7; China retaliated with 34% counter-tariffs on April 4. The shock compressed the premium on China growth-tech multiples as US market access risks deteriorated and AI export control escalation threatened the xinchuang-to-global narrative.","body_zh":"2025年2月至4月的回调（-25%）是典型的风险规避轮动：防御板块仅跌2.8%，小于周期板块的-9.0%，价值跑赢成长11.2pp，农业（+0.6%）和食品饮料（0.0%）是仅有的正收益板块，计算机（-24.7%）和通信（-23.5%）跌幅最深。导火索是2025年2月25日特朗普总统签署进一步切断中美科技投资的行政令，随后4月2日解放日宣布的全面关税（对华商品征收10%以上）导致4月7日中国股市恐慌性抛售；中国于4月4日宣布34%报复性关税。冲击压缩了中国成长科技股的估值溢价，美国市场入场风险加剧，AI出口管制升级威胁信创全球化叙事。","drivers":["Trump Feb-25 executive order decoupling China tech investment","Liberation Day Apr-2 sweeping tariffs triggering Apr-7 panic selling","China 34% retaliatory counter-tariffs Apr-4","flight-to-safety into agriculture/food defensive sectors","AI export control escalation compressing China growth-tech multiples"],"drivers_zh":["特朗普2月25日行政令切断中美科技投资","解放日4月2日全面关税引发4月7日恐慌性抛售","中国4月4日宣布34%报复性关税","风险规避资金流入农业/食品防御板块","AI出口管制升级压缩中国成长科技估值"],"title":"Trump tariff shock triggers growth-tech selloff","title_zh":"特朗普关税冲击引发成长科技板块抛售"},"2025-04-07":{"body":"From the April 7 panic trough, Software & AI Apps rallied +55.2% through January 2026 alongside a broad cyclical surge (SHCOMP +33.2%, cyclicals +39.3% vs defensives +10.8%, growth beat value by 40.2pp). A US-China tariff truce in May 2025 de-escalated immediate trade-war risk; state national-team funds continued equity support; further LPR cuts deepened domestic liquidity. Telecoms (+121.9%) and Metals (+117.7%) outpaced the software basket even within the growth rally -- reflecting AI infrastructure capex (fiber/5G network buildout for AI compute) dominating the tape over application-layer software. The software basket captured SHCOMP beta but did not lead, confirming mid-cycle participation rather than sector leadership in this leg.","body_zh":"自4月7日恐慌低点，软件与AI应用在广泛周期性行情中反弹55.2%（上证综指+33.2%，周期板块+39.3% vs 防御+10.8%，成长跑赢价值40.2pp）。2025年5月中美关税休战缓解了即期贸易战风险，国家队持续护盘，多次下调LPR深化国内流动性。即便属于成长主导行情，通信（+121.9%）和金属（+117.7%）依然大幅跑赢软件篮子——反映AI算力基础设施资本开支（光纤/5G网络建设）比应用层软件更受资金追捧。软件篮子享有大市Beta收益但未引领板块，印证本段属于跟随而非引领行情。","drivers":["US-China tariff truce May 2025 de-escalating trade war","national team equity support and LPR cuts deepening domestic liquidity","AI infrastructure capex boom (telecoms/5G/fiber) driving tape over software","SHCOMP +33.2% broad beta lifting all growth sectors","DeepSeek ecosystem buildout sustaining AI capex narrative"],"drivers_zh":["2025年5月中美关税休战缓解贸易战风险","国家队护盘及LPR下调深化流动性","AI基础设施资本开支热潮（通信/5G/光纤）主导行情优先于软件","上证综指+33.2%大Beta拉动全部成长板块","DeepSeek生态建设维持AI资本开支叙事"],"title":"Trade truce and AI infrastructure boom drive +55% rally","title_zh":"中美贸易休战叠加AI基建热潮推升+55%"},"2026-01-14":{"body":"The January-June 2026 selloff (-33.6%) is a sector-specific intra-growth rotation rather than a broad market collapse: SHCOMP fell only -3.4%, and cyclicals (-3.6%) outperformed defensives (-7.5%), with the bundle signal array empty -- consistent with a mixed, not flight-to-safety, tape. Telecoms led with an extraordinary +51.5% gain and Electronics +34%, while Computers fell -28.6% and Media -33.5% -- a decisive pivot within the technology complex from application-layer software to AI hardware and telecom infrastructure. The driver was a global reassessment of AI business models: agentic AI tools and escalating hyperscaler capex (Amazon and Microsoft each projecting $200B+ AI spend) raised fears that workflow automation would hollow out software subscription revenue, while Chinese chip stocks and network operators benefited from China's de-Americanization drive (DeepSeek V4 tailored for Huawei chips, April 2026). Domestic software names including Kingdee fell 12%+ as the repricing accelerated in February 2026.","body_zh":"2026年1月至6月的回调（-33.6%）是成长板块内部的行业轮动，而非全面市场下跌：上证综指仅跌3.4%，周期板块（-3.6%）小幅优于防御（-7.5%），bundle信号列表为空——与方向混沌而非风险规避的市场格局一致。通信异常领涨+51.5%，电子+34%，而计算机跌28.6%、传媒跌33.5%——科技板块内部完成从应用层软件向AI硬件和通信基础设施的决定性切换。驱动因素是全球对AI商业模式的重新审视：智能体AI工具和云巨头持续膨胀的资本开支（亚马逊和微软各自预计AI支出超过2000亿美元）引发市场担忧工作流自动化将掏空软件订阅收入，而中国芯片股和网络运营商受益于去美化战略（DeepSeek V4适配华为芯片，2026年4月）。金蝶软件等国内软件股在2026年2月重估加速中单日跌超过12%。","drivers":["intra-growth rotation from software to AI hardware/telecoms (not broad risk-off)","agentic AI disruption threat to software subscription economics","global hyperscaler capex spiral ($200B+ each from Amazon/Microsoft)","China de-Americanization driving Huawei chip ecosystem (DeepSeek V4 Apr 2026)","software multiple compression without broad SHCOMP market support"],"drivers_zh":["成长板块内部从软件轮动至AI硬件/通信（非全面风险规避）","智能体AI冲击软件订阅商业模式","全球云巨头资本开支飙涨（亚马逊/微软各超过2000亿美元）","中国去美化战略驱动华为芯片生态（DeepSeek V4 2026年4月）","无大市支撑下软件估值压缩"],"title":"Intra-growth rotation: hardware displaces software","title_zh":"成长内部轮动：硬件取代软件领涨"}},"now":"Software & AI Apps is currently in a bottoming phase (Trough), sitting at the 2.3rd percentile of its historical range and below the 200-day moving average. The current leg shows -15.8% for the series while SHCOMP is only -3.4%, making this a pronounced underperformer in an otherwise mildly positive broad market. The environment is risk-on and growth-tilted (cyclicals +0.3% vs defensives -12.1%, growth outpacing value by 18.2pp), but leadership has rotated away from software-application names into Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%). The basket is being displaced within the growth bucket by AI hardware and infrastructure plays, with the market rewarding chip fabs and network operators over application-layer software whose subscription economics face disruption risk from agentic AI. A stabilization signal requires Shenwan Computers to recover relative to Electronics and a fresh xinchuang procurement cycle or AI-application monetization catalyst.","now_zh":"软件与AI应用目前处于筑底阶段，历史分位仅2.3%，股价低于200日均线。当前阶段本系列下跌15.8%，而上证综指仅跌3.4%，在整体温和正收益的大市中明显跑输。市场整体风险偏好尚可，成长风格占优（周期强于防御：+0.3% vs -12.1%，成长跑赢价值18.2pp），但领涨的是电子（+75.5%）和通信（+67.7%），软件持续落后。板块内部正经历从应用层软件向AI算力基础设施（芯片、通信网络）的轮动，智能体AI打破软件订阅壁垒的竞争担忧压制估值。若要出现底部信号，需申万计算机指数相对电子止跌回升，同时出现AI应用商业化加速或信创政策利好。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}},"b-cn_solar":{"legs":{"2021-06-16":{"body":"The 14th Five-Year Plan for Renewable Energy (released by the NDRC in mid-2021) codified a binding 1,200 GW wind+solar capacity target by 2025 and a 33% renewable electricity share target, creating a multiyear order surge across the solar supply chain. Beijing's dual-carbon pledges (peak CO2 before 2030, carbon neutral by 2060) made solar a policy-mandated growth sector, attracting fresh institutional allocation. Power Equipment led the Shenwan universe at +49.6% while defensives fell (Food -12.7%, Real Estate -13.3%), confirming a pure sector rotation with SHCOMP up only +0.8%. Solar's +114.6% gain reflected both the structural demand uplift and speculative multiple expansion on a newly investable policy theme.","body_zh":"2021年中，国家发改委发布十四五可再生能源规划，设定2025年风光合计装机1200GW、非水可再生电力占比18%目标，直接推动整条光伏产业链订单激增。双碳承诺（2030年前碳达峰、2060年碳中和）使光伏成为政策驱动型成长赛道，机构资金大举布局新能源复合体。申万电力设备+49.6%领涨全行业，食品饮料（-12.7%）、房地产（-13.3%）防御性板块大幅回落，上证综指仅+0.8%，表明行情为纯粹的政策驱动板块轮动而非指数贝塔。光伏+114.6%的涨幅融合了需求预期大幅提升与新兴政策主题的估值溢价双重属性。","drivers":["dual-carbon policy mandate","14th FYP 1200GW target","sector rotation into new energy","policy-driven institutional allocation","SHCOMP flat -- pure sector move"],"drivers_zh":["双碳政策驱动","十四五1200GW目标","板块轮动至新能源","机构政策性配置","综指持平——纯板块行情"],"title":"Dual-Carbon Policy Ignites New Energy Supercycle","title_zh":"双碳政策点燃新能源超级周期"},"2021-10-29":{"body":"The global repricing of high-multiple growth stocks accelerated as the Fed signaled aggressive rate normalization heading into 2022, compressing valuation multiples most severely in China's high-P/E new energy names. Simultaneously, polysilicon prices spiked above $30/kg on supply bottlenecks, squeezing downstream solar cell and module margins and triggering earnings downgrades. SHCOMP fell -18.6% in the period, a broad index drawdown; value sectors led (Coal +6.7%, Real Estate +2.4%) while growth bore the brunt (Power Equipment -42.0%, Electronics -36.0%) in a -13.3pp value-over-growth style rotation. Solar's -41.7% tracked Power Equipment almost exactly, confirming the selloff was primarily index beta plus a severe growth-to-value rotation rather than a solar-specific catalyst.","body_zh":"随着美联储明确2022年前激进加息路径，全球高估值成长股系统性重定价，中国新能源个股高PE估值压缩最为剧烈。与此同时，多晶硅价格因供应瓶颈飙升至每公斤30美元以上，挤压下游电池组件利润空间并触发业绩下调。上证综指区间下跌18.6%，煤炭（+6.7%）、房地产（+2.4%）等价值板块领涨，而电力设备（-42.0%）、电子（-36.0%）成长股首当其冲，价值跑赢成长13.3个百分点。光伏-41.7%与电力设备指数高度同步，确认下跌为指数贝塔与成长切换双重叠加，而非光伏独立利空。","drivers":["Fed rate hike repricing","global growth-to-value rotation","SHCOMP -18.6% broad drawdown","polysilicon shortage margin squeeze","high-multiple valuation compression"],"drivers_zh":["美联储加息重定价","全球成长切换价值","综指-18.6%普跌","多晶硅短缺挤压利润","高PE估值压缩"],"title":"Fed Pivot and Growth Selloff Hit New Energy Hardest","title_zh":"美联储转向叠加成长股抛售重创新能源"},"2022-04-26":{"body":"SHCOMP bottomed on April 26, 2022 near 2,863, the lowest level since 2020, after the worst Shanghai lockdown (March-May 2022) inflicted maximum damage to sentiment and supply chains. The State Council's 33-measure economic stabilization package announced May 23-24, 2022 (fiscal support, deferred premium payments for new energy firms, RRR signals) catalyzed a decisive SHCOMP recovery of +13.5%. Power Equipment surged +62.5% -- the top Shenwan sector -- while energy security urgency from the Russia-Ukraine war boosted Chinese module export demand as Europe scrambled for fossil-fuel alternatives. Solar's +96.5% gain reflected both a mean-reversion from oversold conditions and a re-rating on the energy security narrative, with growth outpacing value by +17.1pp.","body_zh":"2022年4月26日上证综指跌至2863点附近（2020年以来最低），上海封控（3月至5月）对情绪与供应链造成极端冲击。5月23至24日，国务院发布稳住经济大盘的33条措施（财政支持、新能源企业税收递延、降准信号），触发上证综指+13.5%的关键性反弹。申万电力设备+62.5%领涨全行业，俄乌战争引发的能源安全紧迫感推动欧洲大量采购中国组件，进一步助力。光伏+96.5%兼具超跌反弹与能源安全主题重估双重属性，成长跑赢价值17.1个百分点。","drivers":["SHCOMP trough + 33-measure package","Shanghai lockdown easing","Russia-Ukraine energy security urgency","growth-over-value re-rating +17pp","Power Equipment sector leadership"],"drivers_zh":["综指触底+33条稳经济措施","上海解封","俄乌战争能源安全叙事","成长跑赢价值17pp","电力设备板块领涨"],"title":"Lockdown Trough and 33-Measure Package Spark Rebound","title_zh":"封控低点+33条稳经济措施引爆反弹"},"2022-08-18":{"body":"Capacity expansion locked in during the 2021-22 boom translated into a historic supply glut: Chinese solar module production capacity grew from 310 GW in 2020 to over 800 GW by end-2022, and module prices fell ~50% through 2023 and a further ~25% in 2024. Power Equipment was the worst major Shenwan laggard at -56.9%, with only Banks +2.2% making positive ground as SHCOMP fell -17.6% in a flight-to-safety tape where defensives led cyclicals by +12pp and value outpaced growth by +7.6pp. Solar's -62.9% drawdown lasting 18 months through February 2024 reflected both index beta and severe sector-specific margin destruction as ASPs collapsed toward cost.","body_zh":"2021至2022年投产热潮迅速演变为历史性供过于求：中国光伏组件产能从2020年的310GW扩张至2022年底的800GW以上，2023年组件价格下跌约50%，2024年再跌约25%。申万电力设备以-56.9%成为主要行业中最弱一环，仅银行+2.2%录得正收益，上证综指下跌17.6%，防御性板块领跑周期股12个百分点，价值跑赢成长7.6个百分点，呈现避险格局。光伏-62.9%的回撤历时18个月（至2024年2月），既有指数贝塔拖累，更有行业性利润毁灭叠加。","drivers":["overcapacity tripled from 310 to 800+ GW","module prices -50% in 2023","flight-to-safety rotation Banks led","SHCOMP -17.6% broad drawdown","value-over-growth +7.6pp style tilt"],"drivers_zh":["产能从310GW三倍扩至800GW+","2023年组件价格下跌50%","避险轮动银行领涨","综指-17.6%普跌","价值跑赢成长7.6pp"],"title":"Overcapacity Bear: Module Price Collapse Grinds On","title_zh":"产能过剩熊市：组件价格崩塌持续施压"},"2024-02-05":{"body":"Central Huijin announced fresh ETF purchases and expanded its holdings of mega-cap index stocks in early February 2024, breaking the freefall in the CSI 300 that had taken it to 2019 lows. SHCOMP rebounded +13.6% and the broad market recovery lifted virtually every sector, with growth (Computers +35.6%, Telecoms +32.1%, Electronics +30.3%) leading value by +14.6pp. Solar's +28.3% gain was entirely explained by this index surge and growth-sector beta -- not a fundamental inflection; overcapacity and module prices remained severely depressed with no policy remedy yet announced. Banks lagged at +3.8%, confirming this was a state-sponsored stabilization event, not a solar-specific rotation.","body_zh":"2024年2月初，中央汇金宣布增持沪深300ETF及大市值成分股，终结了沪深300指数跌至2019年以来新低的下行势头。上证综指反弹13.6%，几乎拉动所有板块上行，计算机（+35.6%）、通信（+32.1%）、电子（+30.3%）成长股较价值股领跑14.6个百分点。光伏+28.3%完全由指数上涨与成长板块贝塔解释，并非基本面拐点——产能过剩与组件价格依然严峻，相关政策救助尚未出台。银行仅+3.8%垫底，进一步确认此轮行情为国家队护盘而非光伏独立轮动。","drivers":["Central Huijin ETF purchases","SHCOMP +13.6% index surge","growth-over-value +14.6pp","pure broad market beta lift","no solar fundamental change"],"drivers_zh":["中央汇金增持ETF","综指+13.6%大涨","成长跑赢价值14.6pp","纯指数贝塔拉动","光伏基本面无改善"],"title":"National Team ETF Buying Sparks Broad Beta Bounce","title_zh":"国家队ETF增持引发宽基贝塔反弹"},"2024-03-11":{"body":"Once the Central Huijin stabilization effect faded in mid-March 2024, the market resumed the pre-existing structural selloff. Module prices continued collapsing through 2024, reaching below-cost levels of $0.085-0.095/W by year-end, with JinkoSolar, LONGi, and JA Solar all reporting severely negative margins. SHCOMP fell -10.4%; Banks +0.9% was the sole positive Shenwan sector while Computers (-23.5%), Food and Bev (-24.5%) and Beauty (-27.9%) confirmed broad risk-off. Solar's -32.7% significantly outpaced the index decline, evidencing sector-specific fundamental pressure beyond beta as overcapacity destroyed asset value.","body_zh":"2024年3月中旬中央汇金护盘效应消退后，市场重拾此前的结构性下行趋势。全年组件价格持续崩跌，年底跌至0.085至0.095美元/W的成本线以下，晶科、隆基、天合太阳能均报告严重亏损。上证综指下跌10.4%，申万仅银行+0.9%录得正收益，计算机（-23.5%）、食品饮料（-24.5%）、美容护理（-27.9%）确认整体风险偏好恶化。光伏-32.7%远超指数跌幅，表明产能过剩对资产价值的实质性破坏已超出单纯贝塔拖累的范畴。","drivers":["module prices below cost $0.085-0.095/W","Central Huijin bid exhausted","SHCOMP -10.4% broad selloff","overcapacity destroying margins","Banks only positive sector"],"drivers_zh":["组件价格跌破成本0.085-0.095美元/W","中央汇金护盘效应耗尽","综指-10.4%走弱","产能过剩侵蚀利润","仅银行录得正收益"],"title":"Overcapacity Narrative Resumes as Bounce Fades","title_zh":"反弹消退后产能过剩叙事再度主导"},"2024-09-23":{"body":"On September 24, 2024, PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng announced a sweeping stimulus package: the 7-day reverse repo rate cut to 1.5% (from 1.7%), RRR reduced 50bp freeing ~CNY 1 trillion in liquidity, and a CNY 800bn market support facility (CNY 500bn swap line for brokers and funds plus CNY 300bn buyback refinancing). On September 26, the Politburo convened an emergency economic meeting calling for aggressive fiscal support. SHCOMP surged +27.0% in 11 trading days -- its biggest gain since July 2020 -- and solar rode the tide at +57.0%, powered by the growth bias (+15.1pp vs value) and the liquidity flood. Beauty +58.1%, Computers +49.7% and Brokers +49.1% led; Banks +17.8% and Coal +17.1% lagged, confirming a pure liquidity-driven index explosion with no solar-specific thesis.","body_zh":"2024年9月24日，央行行长潘功胜宣布一揽子刺激政策：7天逆回购利率降至1.5%（前值1.7%），降准50bp释放约1万亿元流动性，设立8000亿元市场支持工具（5000亿元互换便利+3000亿元股票回购再贷款）。9月26日，中央政治局召开经济专题会议，明确要求加大财政支持力度。上证综指11个交易日暴涨27.0%，为2020年7月以来最大涨幅，光伏随之+57.0%，受成长偏好（成长跑赢价值15.1pp）与流动性泛滥共同驱动。美容护理+58.1%、计算机+49.7%、非银金融+49.1%领涨，银行+17.8%与煤炭+17.1%垫底，确认行情为纯粹的流动性驱动式指数爆发，而非光伏板块的独立逻辑。","drivers":["PBOC Sep-24 rate cut + RRR cut","CNY 800bn market support facility","Politburo emergency economic meeting Sep-26","SHCOMP +27% index explosion","growth-over-value +15.1pp bias"],"drivers_zh":["央行9.24降息+降准","8000亿元市场支持工具","9.26政治局经济专题会议","综指+27%爆发式上涨","成长跑赢价值15.1pp"],"title":"PBOC Sep-24 Stimulus Blitz Triggers Index Explosion","title_zh":"央行9.24刺激组合拳引爆指数式大涨"},"2024-10-08":{"body":"After the stimulus-driven peak on October 8, 2024, the market reanchored to fundamental reality as the policy blitz failed to address solar's structural overcapacity. The six largest Chinese solar manufacturers collectively lost over CNY 2.8bn in H1 2025; the 22 largest firms posted CNY 10.5bn in Q1 2026 losses. US tariffs under the Trump administration (imposed 2025) added a 150% cost penalty on Chinese modules, further closing export routes. Banks +14.3% and Conglomerates +13.2% led the defensive shift while Power Equipment -17.0%, Real Estate -18.7% and Coal -19.4% lagged in a flat-to-slightly-down market (SHCOMP -3.7%). Solar's -39.4% substantially exceeded the index decline, reflecting compounding of sector-specific fundamental deterioration against an increasingly defensive tape.","body_zh":"2024年10月8日刺激高点之后，市场回归基本面现实，政策刺激未能解决光伏行业结构性过剩问题。六大光伏制造商2025年上半年合计亏损超28亿元，22家主要企业2026年一季度合计亏损超105亿元。特朗普政府2025年对中国组件加征150%关税，进一步封堵出口渠道。银行（+14.3%）、综合企业（+13.2%）主导防御性转移，而电力设备（-17.0%）、房地产（-18.7%）、煤炭（-19.4%）落后，上证综指小幅下跌3.7%。光伏-39.4%远超指数跌幅，折射出板块性基本面恶化与日趋防御化市场风格的双重叠加。","drivers":["post-stimulus fundamental reality check","combined losses over $2.8bn H1 2025 top six makers","US tariffs +150% on Chinese modules","SHCOMP -3.7% mild index decline","value/defensive rotation Banks +14.3%"],"drivers_zh":["刺激效应消退回归基本面","六大厂商2025年H1合计亏损超28亿元","美国对中国组件加征150%关税","综指-3.7%小幅下跌","价值/防御轮动银行+14.3%"],"title":"Post-Stimulus Hangover: Overcapacity Reality Reasserts","title_zh":"刺激退潮：产能过剩现实重回主导"},"2025-06-19":{"body":"In late June-July 2025, MIIT Minister Li Lecheng chaired a high-level meeting with 14 major solar companies (LONGi, Tongwei, GCL, Trina, JA Solar, Sungrow and others), vowing to curb low-price disorderly competition and increase macro-guidance. The supply-discipline framework, combined with a CNY 50bn capacity retirement fund endorsed by the NDRC and MIIT, catalyzed polysilicon prices to rebound +54% from their June 2025 record low of CNY 33.975/kg. Upstream producers (Tongwei, GCL, Daqo) returned to profitability in Q3 2025. The broader A-share tape simultaneously surged with SHCOMP +26.2%, cyclicals outpacing defensives by +36pp and growth outpacing value by +42.5pp -- Telecoms +174.7%, Electronics +113.2% and Metals +101.0% led an AI and infrastructure boom that solar tagged along with. Solar's +96.6% reflected the dual tailwind of supply-discipline policy and broad growth-tape beta.","body_zh":"2025年6月至7月，工信部长李乐成主持召开光伏行业座谈会，与隆基、通威、协鑫、天合、晶科、阳光电源等14家龙头企业研讨，明确将加强行业宏观指导并遏制'低价无序竞争'。配套的供给侧自律框架与国家发改委、工信部背书的500亿元产能退出基金，共同推动多晶硅价格从2025年6月每公斤33.975元的历史低点反弹54%。通威、协鑫、大全等上游企业2025年三季度相继扭亏为盈。与此同时，A股大盘大幅上扬，上证综指+26.2%，周期股跑赢防御股36个百分点，成长跑赢价值42.5个百分点——通信+174.7%、电子+113.2%、有色金属+101.0%主导AI与基础设施浪潮，光伏顺势跟涨。光伏+96.6%兼享供给侧纪律政策利好与成长大潮贝塔的双重驱动。","drivers":["MIIT July 2025 capacity discipline meeting with 14 majors","CNY 50bn capacity retirement fund NDRC/MIIT","polysilicon price +54% from record low","SHCOMP +26.2% broad index surge","growth-over-value +42.5pp AI/infra tape"],"drivers_zh":["2025年7月工信部光伏产能自律座谈会","国家发改委/工信部500亿元产能退出基金","多晶硅价格从历史低位反弹54%","综指+26.2%大涨","成长跑赢价值42.5pp AI/基建行情"],"title":"MIIT Capacity Discipline and Poly Rebound Drive Rally","title_zh":"工信部产能自律与多晶硅反弹驱动上涨"}},"now":"Solar/PV is in a confirmed Downturn phase (rolling over from its May 2026 peak) despite the SHCOMP tape remaining mildly positive (+1.6%). The basket returned only +3.7% in the current window, ranking 15th of 31 Shenwan peers, while Electronics (+75.5%) and Telecoms (+67.7%) dominate the growth rotation. The tape is risk-on and growth-led (growth vs value +18.2pp), but leadership belongs to AI hardware and infrastructure names, not energy equipment. Solar remains below its 200-day moving average. The structural backdrop is still bearish: module capacity (~1,200 GW) roughly doubles global demand (~600 GW), the 22 largest PV firms posted combined CNY 10.5bn in Q1 2026 losses, and while polysilicon prices recovered +54% from their June 2025 record lows they have since rolled over amid renewed inventory builds. The May 2026 peak likely marks exhaustion of the MIIT supply-discipline narrative rather than a genuine fundamental turn.","now_zh":"光伏板块自2026年5月高点确认进入回落阶段，尽管上证综指小幅上涨（+1.6%）。本期篮子涨幅仅3.7%，在申万31个行业中排名第15位，处于下半区；而电子（+75.5%）、通信（+67.7%）主导成长行情。当前市场风险偏好明显（成长vs价值+18.2pp），但领涨的是AI硬件与新型基础设施板块，而非电力设备。光伏仍位于200日均线下方，结构性背景依然偏空：组件产能（约1200GW）约为全球需求（约600GW）的两倍，22家主要光伏企业2026年一季度合计亏损超105亿元；多晶硅价格虽从2025年6月历史低位反弹54%，但随库存再度积累已重新承压。2026年5月高点大概率标志着工信部主导的供给侧纪律叙事已被充分消化，而非基本面真正好转。","as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"archetype_check":null,"prev_revision":null,"_ttl":{"as_of":"2026-06-28","ttl_days":90,"staleness_days":19,"stale_amber":false,"stale_red":false,"archetype_check_id":null,"arch_state":"none","arch_fired_on":null,"revision_note":null}}};
